window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Oh no Finally, I can get a divorce","paragraphs":["\"Sign here. After the divorce, you won't face any legal repercussions. I'll give you another 200 million, plus I'll separate your studio and gift it to you, along with that apartment downtown...\" A deep, attractive voice tinged with coldness rang out.","Ji Fei couldn't help but cover her mouth to stifle a laugh. Her beautiful almond-shaped eyes sparkled, one filled with the digits 200,00 and the other with 0,000!","She lowered her head to carefully examine the divorce agreement, counting the zeros.","Sitting across the desk was a tall man with refined, noble features and obsidian eyes that gleamed coldly. He observed Ji Fei as she bowed her head, covered her mouth, and trembled.","His heart grew colder.","If he had known it would come to this, Qin Xian wouldn't have tolerated it for so long.","Ji Fei was both pitiful and detestable. Her parents had been lifelong friends of the Qin Family but passed away before she came of age. Due to their dying wish, the Qin Family took in Ji Fei, only for her to betray their kindness by scheming to become his wife.","Afterwards, she couldn't live peacefully, stalking him repeatedly and stirring up trouble out of thin air, turning his life into chaos.","Now she had even stolen company secrets and given them to a rival firm, causing them to lose a major project and incurring the wrath of the entire company.","Even if only to appease the Board of Directors, he had to divorce her now.","\"I've already been more than fair to you. I hope you know when to quit.\"","If not for the sake of her deceased parents, Qin Xian wouldn't have left her any way out.","He had expected Ji Fei to threaten suicide and refuse the divorce, but to his surprise, she picked up the pen with a trembling hand.","Qin Xian let out a small sigh of relief when he saw this. It seemed Ji Fei knew she had gone too far this time and wasn't going to resist anymore.","Finally, they could get divorced.","[Oh ho! Finally, we can get divorced!]","Qin Xian: ?","Was that Ji Fei's voice?","Qin Xian had rarely heard Ji Fei's voice so jubilant and excited. For a moment, he couldn't be sure, so he looked up at her, only to see Ji Fei's face contorted as she prepared to sign.","Was that expression one of anger or... joy?","Wait, Ji Fei hadn't opened her mouth to speak.","[Great, 200 million! 200 million! How many houses could I buy with that? How many cute puppies could I raise? As expected of my ex-husband, so generous!]","Qin Xian's handsome, deep-set brows twitched.","He was certain Ji Fei hadn't spoken, but he had definitely heard her voice.","What was going on?","Qin Xian was always cautious and composed. He glanced at Secretary Jin beside him.","Secretary Jin was staring intently at the divorce agreement under Ji Fei's hand.","When she noticed his gaze, Secretary Jin immediately put on a look of 'sympathy,' as if lamenting that things had come to this point.","Qin Xian had no time to ponder Secretary Jin's unusual expression. The key point was that Secretary Jin couldn't hear those voices!","\"Miss Ji, you've really caused big trouble for Mr. Qin this time. I hope after you leave, you can start a new life properly and not... sigh!\" Secretary Jin forced down the corners of her mouth, offering heartfelt advice while inwardly counting down, waiting for Ji Fei to start making a scene.","After all, this stupid Ji Fei would explode at the slightest provocation. Once she started causing trouble, that generous compensation might be withdrawn, leaving her with nothing.","Secretary Jin felt that Ji Fei didn't deserve even a shred of kind treatment from such a good man as Qin Xian.","However, Ji Fei just glanced up at her, then signed her name at lightning speed as if rushing to be reborn.","[So annoying. Even though I took the blame, I can get divorced smoothly and receive such a big compensation. I won't bother settling scores with the real culprit.]","Qin Xian froze as he took the divorce agreement Ji Fei tossed over. A storm raged in the depths of his eyes.","What? Took the blame? Real culprit?!","Qin Xian hadn't yet recovered from the shock of suddenly hearing those voices when he was struck by this new information.","Wasn't it that Ji Fei, dissatisfied with his coldness towards her, deliberately stirred up trouble to get his attention, resulting in disaster?","Everyone had seen that during that period, only she had entered the CEO's Office.","Someone had even photographed her meeting privately with the vice president of a rival company.","The evidence seemed conclusive.","Although she had initially denied it when confronted, screaming and throwing a fit, in the end...","In the end, it was as if she had shouted in anger: Since you don't believe me, just assume it was me then, what can you do to me!","He thought Ji Fei had been caught and was furious from embarrassment.","Now it seemed there was an element of giving up in despair and acting out of spite.","\"Mr. Qin, it's time to sign.\" Beside him, Secretary Jin grew anxious as Qin Xian held the pen without moving. Her usually calm and gentle voice became slightly strained.","Hearing her voice, Qin Xian suddenly felt that Secretary Jin seemed to be overstepping her bounds.","Recalling the earlier 'real culprit,' he couldn't help but feel some misgivings.","Secretary Jin was his college classmate. They had known each other for many years, and he knew her well and trusted her completely. How could she possibly betray the company by doing something like this?","By now, Secretary Jin was impatiently handing him the pen.","She knew that although Qin Xian appeared cold, he actually had a strong sense of responsibility and was especially protective of his family. He had a soft heart, otherwise he wouldn't have been entangled with this stupid woman Ji Fei for so long.","Previously, several near-divorces had fallen through due to Ji Fei's tactics of crying, making a scene, and threatening suicide. Now that they had finally gotten Ji Fei to sign, surely there couldn't be a problem on Qin Xian's side.","[Tsk tsk tsk, she can't wait, huh? I bet this Secretary Jin is feeling guilty too, afraid all her efforts will be wasted.]","Qin Xian's eyes changed.","With a twist of his wrist holding the pen, his long fingers pressed the black fountain pen onto the desk.","This action startled both Ji Fei and Secretary Jin.","They saw Qin Xian's deep, dark eyes now fixed on Ji Fei, who hadn't had time to hide her expression of watching the drama unfold.","\"I'll ask you one last time, did you really do this?\"","He had always been cautious. If what he heard was true, not only would an innocent person have been wronged, but the company might be left with an immeasurable hidden danger. So he had to verify.","Secretary Jin's face instantly became unnatural, though she didn't panic. After all, Ji Fei couldn't prove her innocence.","Ji Fei felt uneasy under Qin Xian's intense gaze.","[What does he mean, asking this now? Is he having second thoughts about giving me the 200 million?! He can't be regretting it, right? Can't you sign first and then ask questions?!]","Qin Xian's heart skipped a beat, but he just stared straight at Ji Fei, as if determined to get an answer.","Ji Fei's eyes darted around as she couldn't help but complain inwardly.","[Of course I didn't do it. It's not my fault everyone's blind!]","[Clearly Secretary Jin also went in and out of the office after me, but those people in the CEO's Office Staff automatically ignored that. When asked about suspicious individuals entering and exiting, they didn't even need to check the security footage before dragging me out as a scapegoat.]","[This is what you call a subconscious blind spot.]","Qin Xian was suddenly shocked!","It wasn't just Ji Fei who had entered and exited his office back then?!","At the time, with both witness testimony and physical evidence pointing to Ji Fei, they had pushed her out as the culprit without even verifying the security footage!","He had also subconsciously believed Ji Fei was the type of person who would do such a reckless thing, so...","Just as he was about to speak, he heard Ji Fei say coldly, \"I have nothing to say. Hurry up and sign.\"","Qin Xian's expression gradually turned cold. He didn't understand why Ji Fei wouldn't speak up when she knew the truth.","Could it be that she was afraid he wouldn't believe her?","Thinking of this, Qin Xian abruptly stood up.","Secretary Jin looked at Qin Xian in surprise, only to see him cast a glance her way.","That scrutinizing look made Secretary Jin's heart tremble.","Before Secretary Jin could react, Qin Xian strode towards the door with his long legs.","Passing by the confused Ji Fei, he said in a deep voice, \"Come with me!\"","\"Huh... what for?\" Ji Fei was completely bewildered.","They saw Qin Xian open the door and say to the busy assistants outside, \"Retrieve the security footage from the evening of the 11th! My wife isn't quite convinced. Let her see if she was really the only one who went in and out that night!\"","Secretary Jin, who had followed closely behind, heard this and her face changed drastically. \"Mr. Qin!\"","Ji Fei: ??","[This is so unfair! When did I say I wasn't convinced? It's written all over my face that I'm totally convinced!]"]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: Two Vent Holes Below the Eyebrows","paragraphs":["The employees of Qin Corporation had long harbored resentment towards Ji Fei's antics, especially those in the CEO's Office Staff.","Demanding surveillance footage was essentially pointing a finger at them, accusing them of lying about her, wasn't it? They had all witnessed it with their own eyes; who would dare to speak ill of the CEO's wife otherwise?","However, with a single command from Qin Xian, the surveillance footage was swiftly displayed on the large screen.","At increased playback speed, they clearly saw Ji Fei's figure enter and stay for half an hour, apparently not finding who she was looking for, then exit with a gloomy expression.","Everyone present couldn't help but sneer inwardly, thinking Ji Fei was stubborn and wouldn't give up until she hit a dead end. Now, let's see how she could still deny it.","Only Secretary Jin's forehead was beaded with sweat.","Until her own figure appeared on the surveillance footage.","Secretary Jin's pupils contracted, and she carefully glanced at Qin Xian.","Among those who had been glaring at Ji Fei, some were stunned upon seeing that scene, while others remained unresponsive.","The video stopped playing.","Qin Xian's face was almost covered with a layer of frost.","It was true after all!","Qin Xian turned to those who had confidently claimed that only Ji Fei had entered and exited his office, and coldly questioned, \"Only my wife?\"","However, these people hadn't yet fully processed the situation.","A senior assistant spoke up directly: \"Mr. Qin, isn't there no problem? Only your wife...\"","Others nodded in agreement.","[This is what you call having two nostrils under your eyebrows, only good for blinking and not for seeing.]","Hearing Ji Fei's sarcastic remark, Qin Xian's expression worsened.","Suddenly, a male voice said: \"Strictly speaking, two people went in and out. One was Mrs. Qin, and the other was... Secretary Jin!\"","[There's actually one person who isn't blind!]","Everyone looked towards the source of the voice and saw a young man standing at the back. He was a new assistant who had been promoted recently.","Qin Xian, with his excellent memory, remembered that when Ji Fei was initially accused, this person had been out on business and wasn't present.","At this moment, the others seemed to finally catch on, but upon further thought, they found it laughable.","\"What nonsense are you talking about? Secretary Jin frequently goes in and out of the office.\"","\"You're new here and don't understand. Secretary Jin is Mr. Qin's right-hand person!\"","\"Are you suggesting that Secretary Jin would betray the company?\"","Their tone was so exaggerated, as if this idea was utterly preposterous.","Qin Xian suddenly let out a cold snort, and the scene instantly fell silent.","Ji Fei, however, felt like laughing. [If they knew the truth, their expressions would definitely be hilarious.]","Ji Fei curiously looked at Secretary Jin, who was unconditionally trusted by everyone.","Secretary Jin, whose real name was Jin Yue, had a neat high ponytail, but her slightly curled hair strands seemed meticulously designed to appear casually elegant. Her professional suit and pencil skirt accentuated her figure's advantages to the fullest. Although she wore light makeup, it was so exquisite that not a single flaw could be found.","However, her expression at this moment was extremely unnatural.","[It's not their fault though. After all, their attitudes towards Secretary Jin and me completely follow Qin Xian's template.]","Qin Xian's heart skipped a beat.","Indeed, it was his fault!","\"Does Secretary Jin have anything to confess?\"","\"Mr. Qin, are you suspecting me?\" Although nervous, Secretary Jin quickly regained her composure and spoke in a tone of disbelief.","\"I did go in, but Mr. Qin, don't you remember? Every night, I go to your office to prepare for the next day's meetings.\"","[So it was even more convenient to strike when I was alone in there. It seems this was planned for a long time. Impressive!]","[But... after listening to all this, do they all have to work overtime at night? I didn't expect Qin Xian to be such a capitalist exploiting his employees. After the divorce, I should send him a copy of the labor law!]","So after listening to all that, this is what you're focused on?! This is about your innocence!","And... our employees get triple pay for overtime!","Qin Xian's train of thought was almost derailed by Ji Fei's comments. He quickly gathered his thoughts.","\"Anyone who entered and exited should be investigated. No exceptions!\"","Secretary Jin immediately put on a hurt and wronged expression. She truly hadn't expected Qin Xian to suddenly treat her the same as everyone else. That stupid woman had already admitted it!","Was her position in Qin Xian's heart really on par with this woman? She had been by his side for ten years, handling big and small matters without a single mistake.","The other assistants also showed displeasure, probably thinking the CEO was being overly rigorous.","Secretary Jin versus Ji Fei, how could anyone think Ji Fei wouldn't be the one to make a mistake?!","Treating Secretary Jin like this, aren't they afraid of disheartening a trusted confidant?","Moreover, although the CEO didn't seem to notice, they could all see it.","Actually, Secretary Jin had always secretly loved the CEO, and her devotion to Mr. Qin was absolute. Even though she could have competed with Ji Fei, she endured Ji Fei's bullying without fighting back. How could she possibly sabotage Qin Corporation?","Just as the atmosphere became tense, a sneer came from the doorway.","Ji Fei looked over curiously.","Several people walked in with an imposing aura.","The CEO's Office Staff all stepped back, making room.","Based on her memory, Ji Fei recognized the balding man leading the group as Director Tang from the Board of Directors.","The one who had just sneered was a young man with dyed yellow hair who had jumped out from behind Director Tang.","He was Director Tang's son, Tang Jun.","He looked like a typical second-generation rich kid who fooled around in the company without doing any real work.","At this moment, Tang Jun walked directly to Secretary Jin's side and gave Qin Xian an unfriendly look.","\"Qin Xian, have you lost your mind? We agreed at the Board of Directors meeting that you'd divorce this troublemaker, but what are you doing now?\"","\"Is there still any question about that incident that's worth you making such a fuss and checking surveillance footage? And what's even more ridiculous is that I just heard you're suspecting your loyal Secretary Jin and want her to be investigated too? Have you gone crazy?\"","Director Tang made a half-hearted attempt to chide Tang Jun.","\"How dare you speak to Mr. Qin like that! Mr. Qin's thoroughness is a virtue. It's not that he suspects Secretary Jin; I think it's probably because his wife refuses to admit guilt that we're having this scene.\"","Tang Jun immediately glared fiercely at Ji Fei.","\"You woman, even at a time like this, you're still trying to drag others down with you. It's simply...\"","Before Tang Jun could finish his insult, Qin Xian stepped forward, his face stern, shielding Ji Fei. He was about to speak when—","[Which sewer cover was stolen to let this thing out?]","Qin Xian's words got stuck in his throat.","[Tang Jun, is it? How dare you talk back to the big boss of the corporation? Let me see what gives you the guts to be so arrogant!]","The corporation's · Qin Xian · big boss was taken aback.","See what?","[Oh, I see. Director Tang has the highest position on the Board of Directors and is somewhat at odds with Qin Xian. If it weren't for Tang Jun being so useless and Qin Xian being so excellent, when Qin's Father stepped down, Director Tang would have really considered pushing his own son to take over. No wonder Tang Jun can't quite figure out his place in front of Qin Xian.]","Qin Xian was truly shocked this time.","Ji Fei had previously known nothing about the relationships within their corporation, yet she suddenly...","And it was something she just 'saw' now?","Moreover, earlier, she shouldn't have known that Secretary Jin had entered the office after her...","Indeed, she must have some kind of 'condition', right?","[Ah! Oh my god, ahhh!]","Qin Xian was startled by Ji Fei's sudden scream. While one part of his mind wondered 'what else has she seen?', he half-heartedly listened to Tang Jun's defense of Secretary Jin.","[No wonder he's so against me and protective of Secretary Jin.]","[So this Tang Jun is Secretary Jin's devoted admirer!]","[Haha! How can someone be so devoted? It's killing me with laughter!]","Qin Xian was shocked!","Tang Jun likes Secretary Jin?","Devoted admirer?","So... how devoted?","[Good morning, good afternoon, good night messages every day. Reminders to bring an umbrella when it rains, to wear more clothes when it's cold. She never replies! Yet he's persisted for two years! That's dedication!]","Qin Xian: If only he put that dedication into his work...","[Once, just because of a casual comment from Secretary Jin about liking something, he searched all over Paris to buy it. He ended up with a fever and fainted. When Secretary Jin received the gift, she only said \"drink more hot water,\" and he cried his heart out! Such sincere devotion!]","Qin Xian: If only he showed such sincerity towards his work!","[He once played guitar and sang under her apartment in the middle of the night. The neighbors called the police for disturbing the peace, and he was taken to the station for a lecture. Secretary Jin didn't even come to bail him out! He had to find his own way out! Afterwards, he even apologized for possibly disturbing her sleep! I must say, the fact that he could consider this shows frighteningly meticulous thinking!]","Qin Xian: So who's the one making frequent mistakes at work? Is work ultimately unable to retain his meticulous mind?!","[There's even more!]","Qin Xian: There's more?!","[\"After falling in love with Secretary Jin, he never sought out other women, keeping himself pure. He would only look at Secretary Jin's photo and in the middle of the night under the covers... he would pleasure himself. This kind of adult gossip shouldn't be shared! I'm not interested in others' privacy!\"]","Qin Xian: ...Ugh!","At this moment, Tang Jun, who was righteously speaking in front of them, was unaware that Ji Fei had completely exposed his private matters.","He only felt that the way the two people in front of him looked at him was becoming increasingly peculiar.","What did those gazes mean, mixed with a hint of sympathy and disappointment?","[\"Haha, so it was all Director Tang's misdeeds!\"]","Qin Xian: ?? What does this have to do with Director Tang again?","Huh? Wait, what was he supposed to be dealing with just now?","Qin Xian's mind was in chaos, but ultimately his attention was drawn away by Ji Fei's emotionally charged inner thoughts.","Gossip is a temptation that even the most serious person can't resist."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Is She Falling for the Handsome Man's Trick","paragraphs":["[At first, Director Tang's desire for power remained unquenched, which is why he arranged for Tang Jun to test Secretary Jin, to see if she could be poached. Little did he know he'd end up sacrificing his son. If he knew his son had turned into such a sycophant, he'd... Haha!]","[Now he's strongly supporting his son in this matter, probably still thinking his son is winning people over, so he's here to back him up.]","[He lost his son and is now helping the other side count their money!]","Director Tang, who had been standing behind his son as solid as a mountain, suddenly shuddered as he caught Qin Xian's penetrating gaze.","Director Tang instantly became smug, puffing out his chest and sucking in his stomach.","It seemed that Qin Xian was indeed in the wrong about this matter. Look at him, unable to save face after being berated by his precious son.","Perhaps they could use this opportunity to poach Secretary Jin!","Let's see who'll dare call his son a good-for-nothing, spoiled rich kid after this!","\"Hey! Qin Xian, are you going to let this woman bully Secretary Jin?!\" Tang Jun, seeing that Qin Xian hadn't reacted and his expression kept changing, couldn't help but shout angrily. \"Don't forget, only Ji Fei has met that company's Vice President Li! There are photos and videos as proof!\"","Qin Xian, who had accidentally overindulged in the drama, quickly coughed and adopted a serious tone, turning to Ji Fei.","\"Why did you meet him?\"","The last time he asked Ji Fei, she had been hysterical and hadn't given a proper answer.","This time, Qin Xian felt that even if Ji Fei still didn't cooperate, at least he could find out the truth through other means.","Ji Fei blinked, feeling that things were getting complicated. She hadn't expected Qin Xian to truly intend to investigate thoroughly.","In terms of character, Qin Xian was indeed quite good. He was trying hard not to wrongly accuse anyone.","But this wasn't what Ji Fei wanted. She wanted a divorce!","Just as she was about to speak, she suddenly met Qin Xian's gaze. His sharp eyebrows and phoenix eyes, deep-set features, were like a perfectly proportioned model. His looks were no less than any big celebrity, especially when he looked at her intently. For a moment, it was as if he could captivate one's soul, leaving Ji Fei stunned for a second.","Without those two hundred million, Qin Xian's face was still quite deceptive. At least Ji Fei had been fooled for a moment.","However, at this moment, his handsome face was full of gravity, his whole demeanor exuding an air of seriousness that left no room for jest.","That gaze, which seemed to see through to her inner thoughts, startled Ji Fei, causing her to blurt out involuntarily.","\"It was work arranged by my agent.\"","As soon as she said it, Ji Fei regretted it so much she wanted to bang her head against the wall.","Had she fallen for the handsome man trick?","Why did she answer honestly? This was going to complicate things even further!","Before anyone could react, Tang Jun sneered, \"That's a pretty stupid excuse. Has your agent gone mad, arranging work for you with a rival company?\"","Qin Corporation had its own entertainment division, with a studio specifically serving Ji Fei. As an agent employed by Qin Corporation, it was impossible to accept work from a rival company.","Unless it was deliberate.","Tang Jun didn't give Ji Fei a chance to speak again, immediately having someone contact Ji Fei's agent, Sister Wei.","The call was quickly answered, and the situation was explained.","Sister Wei immediately responded, \"What? I never made such an arrangement! Mrs. Qin, you can't falsely accuse me like this! I'm just a small fry, I really can't bear such a heavy responsibility.\"","A mere agent would certainly not dare to wrongly accuse the CEO's wife.","No one noticed the stiffness in her tone; they only felt that everything had been confirmed.","Secretary Jin's lips curled into a secret smile.","Tang Jun said smugly, \"Next time you lie, don't say something that can be so easily exposed.\"","Then he mouthed to Ji Fei: \"Idiot.\"","This time, Ji Fei was truly annoyed.","She had originally thought it was just ordinary framing, and that small fries like Sister Wei had also been set up. She hadn't expected the plot to be so extensive, even involving Sister Wei.","Qin Xian had also thought of this point and was considering having someone investigate Sister Wei later when he heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[I want to see how much money they paid her to frame me.]","Qin Xian: ...","Could she see whatever information she wanted?","[What!]","[Is my innocence only worth a 2,000 yuan red envelope?]","[This is impossible, absolutely impossible!]","[I must have missed a zero!]","Qin Xian was also stunned, his head full of question marks. Just... 2,000 yuan?","[Wuwuwu, it really is 2,000 yuan... Eh? Wait, ah?! I see...]","What what?","After waiting for a long time, Ji Fei kept exclaiming.","Qin Xian's originally cool temperament was about to be driven to irritation by Ji Fei.","Just say it! If you don't say it, how can I prove your innocence?","Fortunately, Ji Fei still unconsciously recognized the situation.","[No wonder she didn't want money. It turns out that agent Sister Wei is Secretary Jin's sister-in-law. They're actually family, of course they'd present a united front.]","[So Secretary Jin had planted a chess piece by my side long ago?! They even pretended not to know each other before. Impressive, impressive!]","Qin Xian: Why are you praising her!","Upon hearing the truth, Qin Xian was suddenly quite shocked.","So Secretary Jin had made so many arrangements behind his back so early on!","At this moment, a subordinate was carefully asking if they could hang up the call with Sister Wei, since everything that needed to be said had been said.","Qin Xian's tone changed as he spoke into the phone, \"Since the stories don't match up, I will arrange for people to carefully gather evidence. If agent Wei has no physical evidence, then we will thoroughly investigate your network of connections.\"","Instantly, everyone present looked at Qin Xian in shock.","Everyone: Things have come to this point, and he's still nitpicking?","Ji Fei: Damn! How can Qin Xian stumble upon the truth so accurately by accident?","And no one noticed Secretary Jin's panic and the sharp intake of breath on the other end of the phone.","\"What do you mean by that?\" Tang Jun continued to charge forward for love.","Qin Xian calmly said, \"When stories don't match up, even the police wouldn't be biased in their investigation. Ji Fei's network of connections is simple, I know all of it, and before this, it was impossible for her to have any connection with the other party. But I'm not sure about this agent.\"","\"Mr. Qin... how could I possibly have any connection with a rival company?\" The agent said anxiously.","Indeed, there wasn't any, but as long as they investigated, they would discover her relationship with Secretary Jin.","And this relationship was unknown to others, which would suggest intentional concealment, and since it was involved in this incident, it would be hard to explain.","Qin Xian directly said coldly, \"Wait for further notice.\"","He hung up without giving the agent a chance to argue.","The next second, his cold gaze swept towards Secretary Jin.","Secretary Jin, who was already panicking, was suddenly startled and took a step back.","Tang Jun immediately stepped forward to protect her, angrily saying, \"I see you're determined to defend this woman today. I now suspect you're planning to make Secretary Jin take the fall for her!\"","\"But unfortunately, Secretary Jin has never had any contact with people from rival companies! Those two days, she was either at the company or at home!\"","Secretary Jin also calmed down a bit, looking at Qin Xian with a grievance in her heart, but her tone was firm and unwavering.","\"If Mr. Qin doesn't trust me, I'm willing to accept any investigation!\"","According to general investigation procedures, they would definitely need to investigate Secretary Jin's recent whereabouts and all her electronic devices.","From Tang Jun's statement earlier, it could be confirmed that Secretary Jin had not met anyone from the other company.","But for Secretary Jin to dare to say this, it meant she hadn't left any evidence.","Could it be that no clues were left on her electronic devices either?","Qin Xian was frowning in thought.","[I was wondering why she was so confident, so this is how it was designed!]","Qin Xian immediately pricked up his ears, realizing he didn't need to think anymore.","[I didn't expect it to be so perfectly planned.]","Qin Xian: Stop marveling and just say it!","[The email was sent on the morning of the 12th, but if they check her computer, even if they use technology to recover all deleted records, they won't find anything.]","Qin Xian's heart tightened. How was this possible!","[Because she actually used that idiot Tang Jun's computer to send it. Tang Jun trusts her completely, never guards against her in the office, and even his computer password is her birthday.]","[This way, even if she's suspected, nothing can be found on her computer.]","[Even in the worst-case scenario, if the rival company betrays her, the investigation would only lead to Tang Jun.]","Qin Xian's expression had completely changed, his unfriendly gaze sweeping from Secretary Jin to Tang Jun.","[However, she left one flaw. Probably because she was too confident in her position in the company.]","Qin Xian immediately focused on listening, wondering what the flaw was.","But Ji Fei didn't continue her train of thought.","[\"Forget it. I know these secrets but can't speak them out. In the end, apart from Sister Wei possibly uncovering a few issues through investigation, it's of little consequence to Secretary Jin. Let's just end this pointless charade quickly.\"]","Qin Xian's eyes flickered slightly as he inwardly scoffed.","Indeed, it was a farce!","\"Call the IT department up here. We need to examine Secretary Jin's electronic devices.\""]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Qin Xian, do you still want to protect Ji Fei","paragraphs":["Secretary Jin hadn't expected Qin Xian to actually embarrass her on the spot, and her face turned green. She pressed her lips tightly together, her expression as aggrieved as could be. She gazed at Qin Xian with resentful eyes, as if he were a heartless man.","Tang Jun, even more enraged, rushed to defend the damsel in distress, \"You're really going to be this ruthless? This is simply an insult to Secretary Jin's character!\"","However, faced with Qin Xian's genuinely cold demeanor and icy gaze, Tang Jun's anger subsided quickly, and he said, \"If nothing is found, you must apologize to Secretary Jin.\"","Though the others didn't speak up, their expressions showed their indignation.","This incident had already caught the attention of the entire company, and many from the leadership had arrived.","After all, high-level talent like Secretary Jin was very important.","They also thought Qin Xian had gone mad. Everyone in their circle knew that Qin Xian could do without Ji Fei, the Mrs. Qin who only caused trouble and had no value, but he absolutely couldn't do without Secretary Jin.","However, Ji Fei suspected they had gathered more or less to watch the drama unfold.","Just look at those gossipy little glances.","After all, one was Qin Xian's wife in name, and the other was Secretary Jin, who had managed to stay so close to the usually aloof Qin Xian for so long.","People had probably even placed bets on this battle.","Ji Fei, who usually only watched the drama, never expected to become part of it.","Really, the joke was on her!","Ji Fei could only glare at Qin Xian with resentful eyes.","While Qin Xian only provided his back, straight as a pine tree, for Ji Fei's resentful attacks.","Although his ears were nearly deafened by Ji Fei's constant muttering.","Was she always like this?","Soon, the investigation results came out.","Unsurprisingly, there was no evidence of wrongdoing.","Tang Jun immediately became smug, \"Qin Xian, do you still want to cover for Ji Fei?\"","Qin Xian felt the gaze on his back becoming fiery.","\"Mr. Qin, now you must believe me, right?\" Secretary Jin's eyes were brimming with tears, as if she might cry at any moment.","Qin Xian lowered his head to glance at his phone before looking up at Secretary Jin.","In an instant, his cold gaze gave Secretary Jin an inexplicable sense of foreboding.","Everyone thought the matter was settled, but they saw Qin Xian stop talking to Secretary Jin and turn directly to look at the large screen behind him.","Confused, they followed his gaze and saw that a surveillance video had suddenly appeared on the screen.","The moment the image appeared, many people recognized it as the entrance to Tang Jun's office, and the video showed Secretary Jin entering Tang Jun's office.","Everyone was puzzled. It felt like a sudden plot twist.","Among those present, only Secretary Jin's face changed dramatically, her body chilled, her pupils shaking.","Tang Jun pointed at the screen and shouted angrily, \"Qin Xian, what are you up to? You're checking surveillance footage of Secretary Jin delivering documents?\"","Qin Xian ignored him and just coldly watched the screen.","At this point, the cunning Director Tang's expression became peculiar when he saw the time on the surveillance footage.","When he saw his son leave the office alone, leaving Secretary Jin behind, his face turned ashen in an instant.","Soon after, Secretary Jin left, and Tang Jun returned happily with a fruit platter, but not seeing anyone, he lost his temper.","As everyone was still confused, the screen switched to a recording of computer operations.","Surprisingly, the computer desktop was filled with beautiful photos of Secretary Jin.","The crowd's gaze towards Tang Jun became strange, and Director Tang felt like he was about to cough up blood.","Tang Jun, embarrassed and angry, jumped up and shouted, \"Qin Xian, you even sent someone to mess with my computer?!\"","Indeed, a technician had cracked Tang Jun's computer password, attempting to recover all deleted email correspondence.","Tang Jun had just finished shouting when he felt Secretary Jin sway beside him.","Tang Jun immediately became concerned for the beauty, still not realizing the problem at hand.","Meanwhile, Director Tang's face could barely contain his fury.","Many people in the room seemed to realize a possibility, and the atmosphere instantly froze. It was so quiet you could hear a pin drop, as if you could hear different people's heartbeats.","Until the recovered emails containing confidential documents were displayed, with the sending time prominently enlarged on the screen.","When compared with the time in the surveillance footage, who couldn't see the truth?","Well, there was still someone!","Tang Jun stared at the screen for a moment, then immediately berated Qin Xian, \"You must have gone crazy, actually fabricating such a video to slander and cover for Ji Fei...\"","Before he could finish his tirade, his father slapped him on the back of the head.","Tang Jun fell forward, crashing to the ground.","\"Dad!\"","\"Shut your mouth!\" Director Tang said, then quickly turned to Qin Xian and the other leaders, saying, \"As you can see, my son has nothing to do with this. He was used! He's just an idiot!\"","At this point, he had no choice but to admit his son was a fool.","If he didn't distance himself, in case they suspected Tang Jun and Secretary Jin were working together, he wouldn't be able to explain it away no matter how hard he tried.","\"Secretary Jin, how vicious your heart is! Using my son and framing Mrs. Qin! Mr. Qin, how has he wronged you that you would betray him like this!\"","Director Tang wished he could dig up some gossip about love and hatred to divert everyone's attention.","At this moment, all eyes turned to Secretary Jin.","There was shock, disbelief, resentment, and fury.","Especially the CEO's Office Staff, who were all trembling with anger, their eyes red. They had just confidently vouched for Secretary Jin and accused Mrs. Qin.","Now they were so ashamed and angry that they wanted to dig a hole and bury themselves.","Given Mr. Qin's personality, he would surely fire them all. They had truly been ruined by Secretary Jin!","But now they didn't dare say a word, only trying to minimize their presence as much as possible.","At this point, Secretary Jin's face was completely drained of color, her breathing rapid, her whole body shaking.","She looked at Qin Xian in despair, still unwilling to give up without a struggle.","\"Qin Xian, I didn't...\"","\"Agent Wei is your sister-in-law. You conspired with her to frame Ji Fei, didn't you?\"","Qin Xian's words were like the final straw that broke the camel's back.","The whole room was in an uproar.","\"How did you... Did you already...\" Secretary Jin's spirit was completely crushed.","Everyone else also looked at Qin Xian in shock, as no one could have imagined things would turn out this way.","Ji Fei's brain had stopped working since the video first appeared.","It was one thing for her to see all the truth herself, but how could Qin Xian be so incredibly perceptive?","When her agent was mentioned, Ji Fei finally reacted.","[Could it be that Qin Xian already knew Agent Wei's identity, so he suspected Secretary Jin? But how did he think of Tang Jun?]","Director Tang was also deeply frustrated, wondering how the investigation had led to his son.","Qin Xian glanced at the dazed Ji Fei. He couldn't very well say in public that all the truth came from Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","\"Let's set aside the matter of the agent for now. Once you became a suspect, it was natural to review all surveillance footage of your independent activities and investigate all electronic devices you might have accessed.\"","Secretary Jin hadn't deleted those surveillance videos that could become evidence, which was the flaw Ji Fei had mentioned."]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: White Moonlight Divorce is Inevitable","paragraphs":["Such a watertight investigation, treating her as the sole criminal, searching for evidence of her guilt.","Secretary Jin had always felt that even if her comings and goings from the office were revealed, Qin Xian would investigate out of thoroughness, but not to such an extreme degree. That's why she hadn't deleted the security footage in a suspicious attempt to cover her tracks.","She truly hadn't expected Qin Xian to be so cold and ruthless in dealing with matters related to her.","Secretary Jin collapsed pathetically on the ground, devastated by this realization.","But the person even more devastated was Tang Jun.","\"You really did this? Why? Why?\" Tang Jun's eyes were red, his emotions extremely agitated as he grabbed Secretary Jin's arm, frantically questioning her.","Director Tang felt his son was making a fool of himself and quickly pulled Tang Jun back. \"What else could it be but jealousy? She wanted to push out Mrs. Qin and take her place.\"","Tang Jun, however, was like he'd been struck by lightning. \"You like Qin Xian? No, impossible!\"","Director Tang wanted to facepalm. How blind could his son be, not to see what everyone else had noticed?","Ji Fei felt the same way.","[Tang Jun is truly blind, isn't he? He likes Secretary Jin so much, yet he had no idea she was in love with Qin Xian!]","Ji Fei had just finished this inner monologue when she looked up to see a flash of astonishment in Qin Xian's otherwise calm expression.","[Good heavens, don't tell me Qin Xian never realized Secretary Jin was in love with him! What kind of oblivious man is he?]","Qin Xian's ears were already burning with embarrassment from Ji Fei's thoughts, his handsome face gradually becoming unnatural.","What was going on? Wasn't this supposed to be about enemies bribing Secretary Jin to steal trade secrets and framing Ji Fei?","Secretary Jin liked him? How was that possible? Wasn't she...","\"No, no, it's not like that! I had no selfish motives!\" Secretary Jin suddenly cried out in panic.","She nervously looked at Qin Xian and said, \"I admit I did these things, but it's absolutely not what everyone thinks! I did it to help Yu Zhi!\"","In an instant, the entire room fell silent.","Yu Zhi, that was...","Qin Xian's expression changed slightly. \"What did you say?\"","Secretary Jin hurriedly explained, \"Yu Zhi is coming back to the country.\"","Qin Xian's pupils trembled slightly, and he uncomfortably glanced at Ji Fei.","Ji Fei: [Yu Zhi, I know her. Qin Xian's first love, the girlfriend who ruthlessly abandoned him years ago. They were once the golden couple, talented and beautiful, the most well-matched pair in their wealthy circle.]","Qin Xian: ...You know about that too...","Ji Fei: [But what does this have to do with Secretary Jin?]","Qin Xian looked at Secretary Jin seriously. Yes, what did this have to do with what she had done?","Secretary Jin, as if grasping at a lifeline, blurted out, \"Yu Zhi and I are best friends. When she left you back then, it was because she had no choice. I didn't want you two to miss out on your destiny because of a misunderstanding. I knew you wouldn't divorce easily, so I was willing to be the villain, hoping to give you and Yu Zhi a chance.\"","After saying this, Secretary Jin lowered her head, looking distressed, as if she had been forced into this difficult position.","Secretary Jin was indeed Yu Zhi's best friend. It was because of this connection that they had become familiar. Otherwise, when she was hired into the company, they wouldn't have felt comfortable letting her take the position of secretary, giving her the utmost trust.","During their innocent college days, Secretary Jin had witnessed their entire relationship, occasionally even helping to bring them together. So when he heard people speculating that Secretary Jin liked him, Qin Xian had thought it impossible.","The people present were all somewhat surprised, feeling as if there had been an unexpected twist. But few believed her, after all, no one was blind – Secretary Jin's heart and eyes were full of nothing but Qin Xian.","However, it was the first time they had heard that Secretary Jin was the best friend of Qin Xian's first love.","She had never revealed even a hint of this before. Everyone could now see what her intentions had been.","Wait, there was an even bigger piece of gossip.","Qin Xian's first love was coming back? Their breakup had been a misunderstanding?","Everyone's eyes furtively darted to Qin Xian, expecting him to ask questions, but Mrs. Qin, Ji Fei, was right there.","Everyone got excited – drama was brewing!","[What 'no choice,' what 'misunderstanding,' I think...]","Qin Xian quickly interrupted. He didn't want Ji Fei prying into his past.","\"For your own selfish desires, you've caused our company such great losses and even implicated and framed others. No reason can excuse you from being held accountable,\" Qin Xian coldly declared.","[Right, right, right. Moreover, the reason is clearly made up.] Ji Fei's attention was immediately diverted. After all, it's a common problem for young people to have difficulty concentrating. [But why suddenly make up this reason? Let me see!]","Qin Xian had intended to discuss the handling of the matter, but hearing this, he also became somewhat curious.","[Oh! She had always been hinting, directly and indirectly, at her special relationship with Qin Xian, trying to provoke me into making a fuss. She wanted to slowly drive me away, then win over Qin Xian. But she didn't expect Yu Zhi to return to the country. She knows she's no match for the first love, so she wanted to buy herself some time to become Mrs. Qin before Yu Zhi's return.]","[No wonder she was in such a hurry to frame me, not caring about how many flaws her trap had.]","[Now that she's been exposed, she can only use Yu Zhi as an excuse, pretending that she did everything for someone else's sake and just got confused for a moment. This way, Qin Xian might go easy on her. But if Qin Xian finds out she likes him, and that everything was done for her own selfish desires, Qin Xian definitely won't let her off, and she'll never have another chance.]","[Haha, she's really grasping at straws now. Even if Qin Xian were that stupid, he wouldn't believe this excuse, right?]","Qin Xian, who had almost believed it a little: ...","Thinking back on various past incidents, every time Ji Fei came to see him calmly, it wouldn't be long before she and Secretary Jin would start quarreling. Yet Secretary Jin always played the role of the wronged and helpless victim, making Ji Fei seem increasingly crazy.","Qin Xian had always thought it was Ji Fei's problem, but now, thinking about it, he felt incredibly guilty.","He also grew increasingly disgusted with Secretary Jin.","He had no interest in questioning her further and coldly said, \"Call the police to handle this.\"","Secretary Jin suddenly looked up, as if all the strength had been drained from her body in an instant. In disbelief, she said, \"Qin Xian, I did it for...\"","\"Whatever you have to say, tell it to the police.\"","Qin Xian's cold decisiveness made everyone's hearts tighten. In the end, he had chosen the most severe way to handle it.","\"Qin Xian!\" Secretary Jin broke down in a frenzy, trying to grab Qin Xian, but he avoided her. She pointed at Ji Fei in fury and frustration, \"When it comes to her, you're willing to divorce and give her a way out. Why are you so harsh with me? Even if I don't have any merit, I've put in effort. I've followed you for ten years, and this is how you treat me?\"","Only then did Qin Xian look at her. \"Because you're not my wife.\"","This single sentence seemed to hide many layers of meaning, piercing like a sharp sword through the chest.","Secretary Jin was dumbfounded.","Soon after, the relevant personnel were taken away by the police, and Ji Fei was also compelled to make a trip to the police station.","During this time, Tang Jun actually tried to take responsibility onto himself, because he believed Secretary Jin's lie about helping her best friend. He continued to act like a lovesick puppy, angering Director Tang so much that he fainted.","Fortunately, the evidence was conclusive, and Tang Jun couldn't take the blame even if he wanted to.","The last time they saw Secretary Jin, she was frantically shouting at Ji Fei, \"When Yu Zhi comes back, Qin Xian will definitely divorce you. Don't celebrate too early!\"","What a villainous line! Yet Ji Fei's mind was full of anticipation: [Really?! Then hurry up!]","...","Spoiler warning","...","(Don't worry, the male lead is clean in body and mind, not toxic. The female lead will never be wronged, and the story remains lighthearted and funny till the end.)"]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: System for Reading Minds of Spectators","paragraphs":["Ji Fei had transmigrated three days ago.","The cause was that her soul had been mistakenly taken by a Messenger from the Underworld. Having no parents, her body was quickly disposed of, making resurrection impossible.","To make up for this work error, she was gifted a transmigration package.","And so, Ji Fei arrived. She inherited the original body's memories and assumed its identity.","The original Ji Fei was a delicate young lady with no means to support herself. When her parents died in an accident, worried that their orphaned daughter would be bullied by relatives, they entrusted her to their close friends, the Qin Family.","The Qin Family pitied her and raised her as their own daughter.","However, the original Ji Fei, having experienced misfortune, became complicated and sensitive. She never opened up to the Qin Family, remaining gloomy and peculiar. She did, however, fall in love with Qin Xian at first sight. Worried that she would have no reason to stay with the Qin Family after graduating from university, she made a move on Qin Xian.","She got him drunk, slept with him, and they were caught. Qin Xian despised her but had to take responsibility when she threatened suicide. They were forced to get married.","Feeling wronged by this incident, she shut herself in her room for days, eventually dying suddenly from heart failure.","This is how Ji Fei came to transmigrate.","Her face and name were instantly replaced in this world.","Ji Fei had no desire to become a resentful wife locked away. Although Qin Xian was handsome and wealthy, she could look but not touch. What was the point of that? Ji Fei didn't want to live as a married single.","In her past life, she had never even held hands with a man. In this life, she was determined to make up for it.","It was perfect that he didn't like her. She thought about divorcing such a rich man, making a big score, and never having to worry about money again.","However, the Messenger from the Underworld told her that unless Qin Xian initiated the divorce, Ji Fei couldn't divorce on behalf of the original body. This was what they called fate. The original Ji Fei would never have divorced Qin Xian, even in death.","Ji Fei protested.","So the Messenger from the Underworld gave her an additional compensation gift: the Gossip System.","The Gossip System was a cheat code that could dig up secrets people had been hiding since birth. It perfectly satisfied Ji Fei's gossip cravings.","Later, she thought that given the Qin Family's character, as long as she didn't mess things up, life wouldn't be bad. Rich, leisurely, with a husband who never came home - it could be considered a good life. If she really couldn't stand it anymore and cheated on Qin Xian, well, that would be his fault for not fulfilling his husbandly duties.","But she didn't expect the opportunity to come so quickly.","This framing incident had turned into grounds for divorce.","What a coincidence! She could divorce right away!","But now...","It was already night when they left the police station. Qin Xian took Ji Fei into the car, intending to go home first.","The car was terrifyingly quiet.","Ji Fei leaned dejectedly against the window.","She blamed herself for not acting hysterical enough to disgust him. She had missed out on two billion yuan, an amount she wouldn't have dared to dream of winning in the lottery in her past life!","Qin Xian couldn't hear anything else, only \"Two billion!\" \"Two billion!\" ...constantly cycling in Ji Fei's mind.","Was she really that short on money?","Qin Xian picked up his phone, and soon after, Ji Fei's phone buzzed with a notification.","Ji Fei listlessly opened it.","Three million yuan deposited!","Ji Fei's breath suddenly quickened, her eyes widened in shock, and she mechanically turned to look at Qin Xian.","[Could it be... he transferred it to the wrong person!]","Qin Xian was looking at her. Seeing her turn towards him, his long, thick eyelashes lowered slightly, casting a shadow under his phoenix eyes, making him appear somewhat sincere.","He spoke solemnly, \"I'm sorry for wrongly accusing you earlier. I apologize, and this is compensation.\"","Qin Xian was truly sorry, but he didn't know how else to make amends. He didn't really know Ji Fei well, as they had spent so little time together. He had no idea what she liked, but hearing her constantly muttering about money, he decided to just transfer money directly.","\"Oh,\" Ji Fei replied, outwardly calm as if her heart had been hurt and she no longer cared about anything.","However, in reality:","[Holy crap! Three million! Kill me now! Is it even legal to transfer three million to a phone account?!]","[Stay calm! For the princess who just missed out on two billion, three million is nothing, haha!]","[Being wrongly accused once and getting three million in compensation, Qin Xian, you're actually quite nice!]","[Feel free to accuse me a few more times, I don't mind at all!]","The corner of Qin Xian's mouth twitched. He hadn't expected Ji Fei's inner thoughts to be like this. She was so two-faced. Indeed, one shouldn't judge people by appearances; only today did he truly get to know Ji Fei as a person.","Qin Xian glanced at her again. He saw her desperately trying to suppress a smile, her eyes big and round, sparkling with light, adding a lively charm to her already beautiful features.","With her jade-like nose and cherry lips, her hair like clouds framing her face, the flowing neon lights from outside the window danced on her porcelain-white skin, making her look like a sprite melding into the bustling night.","Although Qin Xian didn't like her, he had to admit that Ji Fei possessed a stunning beauty that could captivate anyone. He hadn't noticed before, probably because her expression was always gloomy, as if everyone owed her something. Now she seemed naturally spirited, as if her entire being had suddenly brightened up.","Why would a person change so drastically all of a sudden?","Qin Xian couldn't help but think of strange possibilities.","She seemed to know the ins and outs of many things, even those she shouldn't have access to.","Perhaps it was due to the sudden appearance of this peculiar ability. Knowing too much made everything seem clear, so she started living more freely and casually.","For now, this was the only explanation Qin Xian could come up with.","But thinking back to this incident, Qin Xian couldn't help but ask, \"Why didn't you defend yourself more after it happened...\"","Ji Fei thought for a moment, then had an idea and tried to provoke him, \"You've wanted to divorce me for a long time anyway. This was just an excuse. Whether it's true or false doesn't matter.\"","Qin Xian frowned, displeased, \"Truth and falsehood are very important! And... I've never planned to find an excuse to divorce you.\"","Although their marriage had started in a mess, he hadn't intended to keep things in a stalemate forever.","Ji Fei was a bit surprised, but in her heart, she responded: [Ex-husband bro, you're a good person!]","Qin Xian's face turned green.","They weren't even divorced yet! How could she call him \"ex-husband bro\"!","Or did she think they would definitely get divorced?","Before Qin Xian could think further, Ji Fei's inner voice provided the answer.","[But forced love isn't sweet, why waste time? After all, your true love will be returning to the country soon! Isn't it better if I clear out in advance?]","[Secretary Jin already said that she had her reasons for breaking up with you, that there was a misunderstanding between you two. This looks like the setup for a reunion, and I don't want to stay and be the third wheel.]","[I don't want to end up in a melodrama, becoming the victim of adultery. That would be so ugly. I'm doing this for your own good.]","Qin Xian's breath caught.","He and that person were long over. He had moved on, so how could he possibly maintain a relationship with an ex while having a wife? He wasn't that kind of person.","That's why he hadn't even thought about asking Secretary Jin for the truth.","If he could reveal that he could hear her thoughts without seeming rash, Qin Xian really wanted to argue with her.","Perhaps feeling a bit resentful, without waiting for Ji Fei's outward response, Qin Xian said directly, \"Don't overthink things. As long as you live your life properly, we won't get divorced!\" In the future, Qin Xian would definitely prove to her that he wasn't the kind of person she thought he was!","Ji Fei glanced at Qin Xian and replied perfunctorily, \"Oh.\"","But in her heart, she strongly disagreed.","[When you're caught in an ambiguous push-and-pull with your true love, I'll throw these words right back in your face!]","Qin Xian took a sharp breath. Why wouldn't she believe his words?","[Ah, no, that's not right.]","Qin Xian: Did she believe him?","[It's better if ex-husband bro is more determined now. If I behave well for a while, when ex-husband bro comes to me for an amicable divorce for the sake of his true love, he might feel guilty and give me a bigger divorce settlement.]","Qin Xian's face darkened.","[These days, it's like I'm investing money with ex-husband bro. Just thinking about it makes me giddy. I'm such a financial whiz! Once we divorce, it'll all become my seed money for independent living! Then I can get a house, a little puppy... hehe.]","Qin Xian felt short of breath.","You just can't forget about that little puppy, can you? Or do you already have candidates lined up? Is that why you're so quick to accept the idea of divorcing me?","Calm down, calm down. This time it was my fault. I shouldn't think of Ji Fei like this.","[A young wolf wouldn't be bad either... as long as he has six-pack abs!]","Qin Xian: ...I have... eight-pack abs...","[I'm just waiting for Qin Xian to bring up the divorce.]","Qin Xian clenched his fists out of sight.","He couldn't tell if Ji Fei truly wanted a divorce or if she was just hurt by this incident and had given up on herself.","After all, if Ji Fei really wanted a divorce, she could have proposed it herself.","The fact that she didn't take the initiative probably meant she still didn't want to divorce him.","It definitely wasn't because she wanted to accumulate more alimony!!!","The car slowly drove into the estate.","Other people's cars were parked in the square; there were visitors.","As soon as the two of them stepped through the main entrance, they heard voices coming from the living room.","\"Mom, Dad, this is the child Qin Yan and I are planning to adopt. His name is Li Ziqiao.\"","Qin Xian immediately understood that his older sister and brother-in-law had arrived.","Before he could even process the news about adopting a child, he felt the woman beside him, who had been leisurely strolling, suddenly quicken her pace.","[Oh my, there's more drama to feast on! The upper-class circle really is full of drama. This makes me a tiny bit reluctant to get divorced.]","[Divorcing is like leaving a melon patch full of juicy gossip!]","Watching Ji Fei take two steps at a time, her eyes gleaming with eager anticipation.","Qin Xian: ...This definitely isn't the reason she's not initiating the divorce!","Also, what new drama is unfolding now?","Wait for me!"]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Has the whole family read minds","paragraphs":["As soon as Ji Fei and Qin Xian appeared, the strange atmosphere in the room was broken, and everyone turned to look at them.","The butler stepped forward to take the coats from the young master and his wife.","\"You're back,\" Qin's Mother said, immediately standing up nervously from the sofa upon seeing the two enter. She approached and gently took Ji Fei's hand, carefully observing their expressions.","Qin's Father also looked over anxiously, but maintained an air of authority as the family patriarch, remaining outwardly stoic.","This morning when Ji Fei was taken away, Qin's Mother had worriedly questioned Qin Xian.","Qin Xian had only coldly told his mother not to interfere this time.","Qin's Father had just sighed, letting his son handle everything. After all, Ji Fei had made a major mistake this time, and if their son didn't address it, he truly wouldn't be able to command respect.","The worst-case scenario they had imagined was divorce.","They hadn't wanted their eldest daughter's family to visit today, but their daughter seemed to have suffered some grievance of her own. She had called in a panic, wanting to come home as soon as possible to discuss something, so they had no choice but to let them come.","Who knew their daughter and son-in-law would also bring them such explosive news.","Ji Fei followed the interaction pattern from her memories, nodding indifferently, appearing aloof and self-absorbed, as if she didn't understand social graces.","Qin Xian didn't mention anything else either, first greeting his elder sister's family.","Ji Fei curiously glanced over.","On one long sofa sat four people.","An older woman with somewhat harsh features was hugging an 8 or 9-year-old boy, clearly doting on him. The boy clutched a Rubik's cube in his hands, looking around uneasily. He seemed rather frail.","Next to them sat a slender man wearing gold-rimmed glasses. Though his face wore a smile, he appeared cold and distant.","Beside the man was a woman with a somewhat forced smile, but her features looked quite warm and gentle.","Qin's Father and Mother didn't want to inquire about Qin Xian and Ji Fei's situation in front of everyone, intending to deal with their eldest daughter's family's matter first.","But then they heard an elderly, imperious voice say, \"So the second son's couple has divorced? Why come back together if you've divorced?\"","The atmosphere instantly chilled.","\"Mom!\" Qin Yan immediately spoke up to stop her. But raised as a proper young lady, her voice lacked any force.","She looked worriedly towards Ji Fei.","Her husband Li Zhi, however, remained silent, as if the matter didn't concern him, allowing his mother to speak such inappropriate words.","Qin Xian frowned slightly, but maintained his manners as he replied, \"We haven't divorced, so naturally we came home together.\"","At this, Qin's Father and Mother looked over in delighted surprise. Finally some good news.","Li's Mother asked doubtfully, \"The upper-class circles are all saying she made a mistake...\"","Qin Xian's expression turned displeased. He was about to explain when Ji Fei suddenly spoke up beside him, \"When did the Li family enter upper-class circles? You're even privy to insider gossip now?\"","The Li family had been ordinary, with Li Zhi only considered a young talent for his success in studying medicine. In recent years, they had managed to save up a bit of capital by partnering to open a private hospital with help from the Qin family, but were far from reaching the level of high society.","But some people don't like hearing the truth. Li's Mother's face turned ashen, her voice trembling as she spoke.","\"What did you say?! How dare you insult our Li family!\"","Ji Fei put on an innocent face and waved her hand, saying, \"You've gotten oversensitive in your old age. What did I say wrong? How was that insulting your Li family?\"","[I am insulting you, I am insulting you. Putting on airs like a wolf with a fox tail. Who do you think you are?]","Hearing her curse so directly in her mind, Qin Xian immediately decided not to speak up.","Since Li's Mother had been impolite first, Qin Xian naturally wouldn't let his wife suffer for the sake of superficial harmony.","He even pulled Ji Fei to sit down and talk slowly - standing for so long must be tiring.","But as soon as they sat, from Qin Xian's angle he saw the shocked expressions on Qin's Father and Mother's faces across from them.","That expression...","Qin's Father and Mother were dumbfounded. Had they hallucinated? That arrogant statement was in Ji Fei's voice, but it seemed she hadn't opened her mouth!","Qin Xian's eyes changed subtly. He immediately looked towards his elder sister Qin Yan, only to see her also staring at Ji Fei with a bewildered expression.","Meanwhile, the battle between Ji Fei and Li's Mother continued.","Li's Mother was now fuming with rage, the wrinkles on her face becoming somewhat fierce. \"As expected of someone with no manners!\"","This statement instantly darkened the faces of the Qin family members present.","Let alone the fact that the original Ji family had been their family's longtime friends, Ji Fei had been raised in their household for several years and was now married into the Qin family, considered one of them. How could they allow this old woman to lecture them?","Qin's Mother was about to retort, but Ji Fei beat her to it.","\"Indeed, I was never taught how to accommodate those beneath me.\" After saying this, Ji Fei deliberately looked Li's Mother up and down, disgust written all over her face.","[You're the one with manners, always insulting me to my face, constantly cursing me to become a neglected wife so you can introduce your relatives' daughters to Qin Xian. You ugly old witch, your thoughts are as beautiful as your face.]","Although Ji Fei would occasionally act erratically when it came to matters concerning Qin Xian in the past, she had never behaved this way towards others. Usually she was just difficult to get along with, mainly ignoring and not engaging with people.","This was the first time she had vented her anger on the spot. So not only were the Li family members stunned, but even the Qin family was shocked.","Of course, what stunned the Qin family even more was that they had heard Ji Fei's 'inner thoughts'.","Qin's Father and Mother looked at each other in astonishment, realizing they weren't the only ones. Then they looked at Qin Xian, who shook his head at them meaningfully, confirming that it wasn't just their imagination.","So that's how it was - apparently every time Li's Mother came to their house, she was this nasty to their daughter-in-law. How utterly shameless.","Qin's Father and Mother, who had initially thought Ji Fei might be going too far in speaking to an elder this way, now completely took their daughter-in-law's side.","Hmph, don't even think about cursing our son and daughter-in-law to divorce!","Just then, Qin Yan, unable to contain her shock, blurted out in amazement, \"Ji Fei, you...\"","\"Elder Sister!\" Qin Xian suddenly interjected, his piercing gaze seeming to prevent something.","But to the others, it appeared that Ji Fei had insulted Li's Mother, Qin Yan wanted to stop her, and Qin Xian had warned her off.","Qin Yan's mind was in utter chaos, and she immediately didn't dare mention the strange occurrence.","Li Zhi, who had been silent until now, became somewhat angry, as Ji Fei's comment about 'accommodating those beneath her' had stung him.","Supporting his mother, who was on the verge of fainting from anger and could only stammer \"you, you, you\", he looked at Qin Yan with displeasure.","A cold light flashed across his icy glasses, silently instructing her. After all, this kind of shrew-like squabbling scene didn't require his intervention - it would be embarrassing.","Qin Yan felt torn, but in the end could only say to her mother-in-law, \"Mom, don't be angry. Ji Fei is still young and naive... she doesn't mean any harm.\"","The 24-year-old Ji Fei almost laughed at Qin Yan's attempt at peacemaking.","But Li Zhi was dissatisfied with Qin Yan's performance. His gaze turned sharp as he looked at her, already showing signs of reproach.","Qin Yan instinctively felt anxious and lowered her eyes to avoid his gaze.","Qin's Father and Mother couldn't bear to watch anymore, not wanting their daughter to be in a difficult position. Qin's Mother took the initiative to speak, \"Alright, Mother-in-law Li, don't take offense at the younger generation. My daughter-in-law is in a bad mood today and spoke too bluntly.\"","The way she said it showed extreme favoritism, essentially mocking Li's Mother again. But unlike with Ji Fei, now that Qin's Mother had spoken this way, no matter how angry they were, the Li family couldn't argue with her.","They could only mutter under their breath.","\"Hmph, we came to share good news today, but some people just had to ruin the mood.\"","But no one paid attention to her, choosing instead to ignore her and let her stew in her own awkwardness.","Qin's Mother turned to speak kindly to Ji Fei, \"You've come back so late, have you eaten yet, Feifei?\"","Ji Fei got goosebumps at being called \"Feifei,\" as she had never experienced such an intimate nickname without actual kinship. However...","[Qin's Mother is really nice.]","When Qin's Mother heard this, she immediately became excited. After all, Ji Fei rarely showed closeness to them, always seeming to maintain a distance. She hadn't expected Ji Fei to think of her this way.","She must be a shy child, not good at expressing herself.","When Ji Fei shook her head to indicate she hadn't eaten yet, Qin's Mother immediately asked, \"What would you like to eat?\"","Ji Fei replied, \"Anything is fine.\"","Qin's Mother called out directly, \"Nanny Zhang, please prepare three dishes and a soup for Feifei, just make the dishes she usually likes. Thank you for your trouble.\" After saying this, she affectionately held Ji Fei's hand and said, \"That Qin Xian, bringing you back so late without feeding you first. You must be starving.\"","Qin Xian, standing nearby, twitched his mouth and said, \"Mom, I was with her, and I didn't eat either.\"","Qin's Mother, upon hearing this, casually added, \"Bring a portion for the second young master as well.\"","Qin Xian: ...","Ji Fei wanted to laugh, but seeing the glance Qin Xian shot her way, she didn't dare.","Suddenly, a plate of cut fruit appeared beside her hand.","\"Have some fruit to tide you over,\" Qin's Father said in a steady voice, naturally pushing forward the fruit plate meant for guests.","Ji Fei expressed her thanks. [Qin's Father is also very attentive to the younger generation. They really are a gentle couple.]","Qin's Father straightened his posture.","Qin Yan, hearing Ji Fei's thoughts and observing her parents' interesting behavior, felt her gloomy mood lift a little. But soon she found herself struggling to breathe under two disapproving gazes.","She knew that her mother-in-law and husband were displeased with her uselessness, feeling she had been neglected by her own family. But she knew her family didn't mean it that way.","Noticing his elder sister's predicament, Qin Xian's eyes flickered slightly.","He glanced at the child who had been shy and preoccupied with fiddling with a Rubik's cube the entire time. The child looked somewhat insecure and withdrawn, but judging by the nearly completed cube, not unintelligent.","He and his third brother used to enjoy playing with Rubik's cubes when they were young too.","Recalling what Ji Fei had said earlier about having some gossip, he spoke up directly: \"Who's this child?\""]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Shine Amazing","paragraphs":["Finally getting to the point, Li Zhi suppressed his displeasure and spoke in a flat tone, \"His name is Li Ziqiao. Qin Yan and I plan to adopt him. From now on, he will be our son. Ziqiao, these are your second uncle and aunt, greet them.\"","Li Ziqiao was about to stand up and speak timidly when Qin's Father interrupted.","Qin's Father, with a somewhat unpleasant expression, said, \"Hold on, this matter hasn't been clarified yet. Don't rush to greet anyone.\"","Li Ziqiao's face paled, and he could only sit down with his head lowered.","Qin's Mother, being soft-hearted and feeling sorry for the child, said, \"Why don't we let Ziqiao go play outside for now?\"","Whatever needed to be said shouldn't be said in front of the child.","\"It's fine,\" Li Zhi seemed unconcerned about the child's emotions.","Qin's Father, who had been holding back his anger, spoke directly, \"Then let me be frank. Yan Yan is only thirty years old, not yet at an age where she can't have children, right? You didn't even give us a heads up and just brought the child back to inform us. Is this how the Li family conducts business?\"","Li's Mother said, \"In-law, you can't blame us for this. Ever since Yan Yan's difficult first pregnancy that injured her body, doctors have said it would be difficult for her to conceive again. We can't just wait and waste time...\"","Nine years ago, Qin Yan had a stillbirth and couldn't get pregnant afterward.","But the Qin family felt that with medical advancements and Qin Yan still being so young, there was always a chance. They didn't expect the Li family to directly bring a child today.","At this point, Qin Yan's eyes immediately turned red.","[Are they in such a hurry because Li Zhi is about to die and the Li family is about to lose their lineage?] Ji Fei thought sarcastically while eating fruit.","The frustrated Qin family members almost couldn't hold back when they heard this. Even Qin Yan's sorrowful mood was momentarily suspended.","Qin Xian coughed and pressed his hand on Ji Fei's arm, saying, \"We're about to eat, don't eat too much fruit.\"","Then he spoke to Li Zhi, \"Why such a rush? Even if you've given up hope and insist on adoption, shouldn't it be a child of a different age?\"","Ji Fei obediently put down her fruit fork, but upon hearing Qin Xian's question, she immediately praised in her mind, [Wow, Watson, you've discovered the blind spot!]","Qin Xian paused. Was there really an issue?","Qin's Father and Mother were also stunned. What? What?","Qin Yan's body shuddered, and she looked at Ji Fei in astonishment.","Before Li Zhi could speak, Qin Xian asked sharply, \"What's so special about this child that made your Li family choose him?\"","Li's Mother and Li Zhi's faces stiffened. Li's Mother immediately forced a laugh and said, \"It's just that he's exactly nine years old, and he looks a bit like my son and Yan Yan. We thought it might be some kind of fate, so...\"","These words struck a chord, making Qin's Father and Mother involuntarily look closely at Li Ziqiao. Indeed, he did resemble Li Zhi and Qin Yan a bit.","However, when Qin Yan heard this, her face became even more troubled, with tears threatening to spill from her eyes.","Meanwhile, Li Ziqiao, for some reason, lowered his head even more, looking extremely guilty.","[Bravo! Absolutely brilliant! The child Li Zhi wants to adopt is actually his own son. Since Qin Yan didn't give birth, doesn't that mean it's an illegitimate child from outside? Now they're forcing Qin Yan to raise him, how dare they say such things? Their faces are thicker than city walls!]","The Qin family: !!!!!","These words hit like a thunderbolt, stunning the Qin family. They looked at the people on the opposite sofa in disbelief.","Naturally, Qin Yan was even more incredulous as she looked at Ji Fei, completely unable to understand how Ji Fei knew this.","[And they even made Qin Yan help conceal the child's background, saying the child must be adopted, and if the truth comes out, the Qin family would surely make a fuss. They told Qin Yan not to cause trouble, saying it would make both families unhappy, and if she had to blame someone, she should blame herself for not being able to have children. They can't let their family line die out. My goodness, does your family have an imperial throne to inherit?]","[Qin Yan actually hesitated. Good heavens, did Li Zhi catch her committing murder or arson? How can she endure such humiliation?]","The Qin family was shocked, shocked, and shocked again! Their eyes were about to pop out as they looked at Qin Yan.","Qin Yan was like a balloon that had been pricked. Once a small hole appeared, all her grievances poured out at once, and she nearly burst into tears, covering her face.","Qin Xian's face turned ashen, finally understanding what Ji Fei meant by \"juicy gossip.\"","The Li family still didn't understand why the atmosphere among the Qin family members had changed so suddenly.","Qin Xian spoke coldly, \"Then what about this child's birth parents? Who are they? Have you investigated thoroughly? If you haven't, I will. To become a member of our family, their background must be clear.\"","Upon hearing this, Li's Mother and Li Zhi's faces immediately changed.","Their reaction also made Qin's Father and Mother, who had been shocked by Ji Fei's internal monologue, come to their senses.","Ji Fei's inner thoughts were true!","They were so angry they almost jumped up to hit someone.","\"This child is mine,\" Li Zhi, knowing Qin Xian's character, didn't struggle and directly admitted it.","When Qin's Father heard that Li Zhi showed no shame at all, he suddenly slammed his hand on the marble tabletop, startling even the butler who had just come to help serve the meal.","After all, Qin's Father rarely got so angry since his retirement.","The elderly butler put down the tray, already considering whether to fetch a weapon for Qin's Father to beat someone.","Li Zhi's face paled, but he still forced himself to say, \"Regarding this child, I haven't wronged Qin Yan. He was left behind by my ex-girlfriend without my knowledge.\"","Li's Mother quickly added, \"That's right, in-laws, please don't be angry. We only just found out about this child's existence. Everyone knows how our two families' marriage came about. Now that Yan Yan can't have children, it just so happens that we have a descendant of the Li family out there, so we thought of adopting the child back. The child's birth mother has disappeared, and this absolutely won't shake Yan Yan's position in our Li family.\"","Qin's Mother immediately flushed with anger, \"So you're saying my daughter should be grateful for this opportunity to help your son raise his illegitimate child with his ex-girlfriend? You've certainly thought this through!\"","\"Oh my, if you think about it this way, Yan Yan doesn't have to bear the pressure of having children, and she gets a ready-made son. Once we go through the legal procedures, he'll be no different from a biological child,\" Li's Mother continued.","Qin's Mother was so angry she didn't know what to say, feeling that this was too much of an insult.","So this was the humiliation her daughter had endured. They blamed themselves for raising their eldest daughter to be too gentle, probably not knowing how to handle such a situation, which is why she instinctively wanted to come home.","Thinking of this, Qin's Mother didn't care if it was cruel to the child anymore and directly said, \"Then let our Qin family be clear: we do not agree.\"","Qin's Father also maintained a stern face, indicating his support for Qin's Mother's statement.","Qin Xian remained silent, but when he turned his head, he saw that Ji Fei was already eating heartily from her rice bowl.","He was immediately speechless. Was she really that hungry?","However, seeing her eat with such relish while still listening intently, he suddenly felt hungry too and picked up his 'conveniently placed' bowl and chopsticks.","Mm, eating a full meal helps one deal with situations calmly.","The tense atmosphere on the other side meant they didn't notice these two who were ignoring the mood.","Li's Mother's face soured a bit. Li Zhi hated feeling pressured by his in-laws the most, but he didn't dare to talk back. He could only pick on the softest target, saying in an unfriendly tone, \"Qin Yan, say something. Didn't you not object before?\"","\"That's right, are you going to drive out my only grandson?\" Li's Mother also started with emotional blackmail.","\"Enough!\" Qin's Father exploded with anger, \"Qin Yan, what do you think? Rest assured, whatever decision you make, we will always have your back. No one can bully you!\"","Li's Mother and Li Zhi's faces immediately darkened further.","\"Dad, I...\" Qin Yan panicked and glanced down at Li Ziqiao.","Although she had taken care of the child for two days and he was very well-behaved, and Li Zhi seemed to show no affection for the child, which gave her some comfort, she still felt deeply uncomfortable inside. If it were any other child, she thought she could be a foster mother, but this child...","Li Ziqiao, Qiao Qiao... Qiao Meng, that woman's name.","\"Qin Yan!\" Li Zhi's tone was threatening.","Qin Yan panicked even more and spoke pleadingly, \"I really don't know. Mom, Dad, what do you think?\"","Qin's Father and Mother immediately looked disappointed. In the past, Qin Yan was just good-tempered, but how did she become so weak and indecisive after marriage?","Qin Xian put down his chopsticks and sighed, thinking he might as well make a decision for his spineless sister. This child absolutely cannot be raised here.","But then he heard Ji Fei's inner roar: [Damn it! What's there not to know? They're literally shitting on your head, and you're still hesitating? If you don't divorce in this situation, what are you waiting for, New Year's?]"]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Have you exploded something","paragraphs":["The three members of the Qin family jolted simultaneously, as if their vital energy channels had suddenly been unblocked.","Qin Yan's face, however, turned pale.","The worst she had imagined was not adopting the child, but she hadn't expected divorce to be mentioned. Her initial reaction was to reject the idea.","The Qin family actually knew that Qin Yan wouldn't divorce. Although gentle, she had a stubborn streak deep down and wouldn't listen to persuasion. Otherwise, given Li Zhi's indifferent attitude towards Qin Yan on a daily basis, they would have made them divorce a hundred times already.","But after Ji Fei's comment, the Qin family couldn't help but feel a stirring of excitement.","They really wanted to advise separation, really wanted to advise separation, really wanted to advise separation!","The three exchanged glances.","Qin Xian took the lead, \"Now that the child has appeared, it proves that what happened back then was a mistake. I suggest we go straight for divorce.\"","Li's Mother and Li Zhi trembled, looking at Qin Xian with shocked expressions. For a moment, they couldn't react, after all, in wealthy families, who didn't have a few illegitimate children?","They then looked at Qin's parents and found that they didn't seem to have any objection to the idea.","But at this moment, Qin Yan disappointingly spoke up: \"This... this doesn't count as Li Zhi wronging me.\"","The three Qin family members looked at Qin Yan with exasperation.","Ji Fei almost spat out her mouthful of food.","Qin Yan knew she had let her family down and lowered her head. In this posture, she looked remarkably similar to Li Ziqiao beside her.","Li Zhi immediately sneered and said, \"Indeed, if we were to argue about who wronged whom, we wouldn't know where to begin.\"","Although he said this quietly, everyone could hear it. In an instant, the Qin family members held their breath, falling silent, especially Qin Yan, whose face turned ashen. It was as if she no longer wanted to dwell on the issue of adopting the child. It was like someone had grabbed them by the throat.","Ji Fei caught the scent of gossip.","[After all, she's the eldest daughter of the Qin family. She married down, so why is she living such a miserable life? And how can this Li Zhi be so righteous about having an illegitimate child? Let me investigate.]","Qin Xian reacted, wanting to interrupt Ji Fei's thoughts to avoid poking at his sister's wounds, but it was too late.","[So Qin Yan and Li Zhi were senior and junior at university. Because Li Zhi broke up with Qiao Meng, he drowned his sorrows in alcohol at a university event, where Qin Yan, who was also at the event, took care of him, and then... well, you know. Huh? Why does this plot seem familiar?]","Qin Xian wanted to facepalm in embarrassment. What have you done? Have you completely forgotten?","[As a result, the next day Qiao Meng came looking for him and saw the two together. Heartbroken, she left for a distant place. When Li Zhi sobered up, he was furious, believing that Qin Yan, who had always had a crush on him, had taken advantage of his unconscious state to possess him, ruining his love with Qiao Meng and preventing him from winning her back.]","[Soon after, Qin Yan became pregnant, and the Qin family had no choice but to approach Li Zhi to ask his intentions. Only then did Li Zhi take responsibility and marry Qin Yan. So Qin Yan has always felt she wronged Li Zhi? Later, they lost the child, and Qin Yan considered divorce to give Li Zhi his freedom, but Li Zhi refused, saying he didn't want to be seen as a scumbag who divorces when they can't have children, as it would be bad for his professional reputation. He even explicitly stated that everything was Qin Yan's fault, so she had no right to initiate a divorce.]","Due to Ji Fei's recap, the Qin family members all fell silent.","Seeing their silence, Li's Mother and Li Zhi felt even more emboldened.","Li Zhi's tone became even colder and more arrogant as he addressed Qin Yan: \"Think it through carefully!\"","It seemed like he was giving Qin Yan the freedom to choose, but it only made Qin Yan look more resigned. Just as she was about to speak, she heard a sarcastic inner voice from across the table.","[Damn, this guy is a master at mooching off others! I've seen many shameless people, but this is the first time I've seen someone so utterly shameless.]","This time, the Qin family didn't feel as united in their resentment. The Qin family helping the Li family did have a bit of a sugar daddy feel to it, but they had offered it willingly, so it couldn't be called shameless. After all, once married, they were one family.","However, Ji Fei's support for their family still warmed their hearts.","But Qin Yan felt a bit uncomfortable hearing Ji Fei insult Li Zhi like this. She instinctively wanted to refute, but Ji Fei's criticism continued relentlessly.","[Drunken mistakes are just an excuse. If a man isn't conscious, he can't get it up. Mistaken identity and memory loss are all lies. In fact, the subconscious knows who it is at the time, it's just that self-control is lowered, and they want to use someone else as a tool to indulge themselves. After sobering up, they don't want to admit it, so they blame others!]","[Didn't Qin Xian have experience of being tricked? Doesn't he know how to compare his sister's situation? Or does he not know the truth about that night?]","Qin Xian: ? Wait, did you just reveal something???","Qin's parents: !!!! Did they hear something they shouldn't have?","Qin Yan, however, was stunned, all color draining from her face, leaving her as pale as paper.","That was the biggest mistake she had made in her life. At the time, when the drunk Li Zhi pounced on her, she had initially struggled, but Li Zhi had said: \"I want to hold you, I'm so sad.\"","Those soft words had softened Qin Yan's heart, and she had gone along with it.","She thought that since Li Zhi had his eyes open, looking at her, and had reacted to her, he must have wanted to be with her.","Who knew that after Li Zhi sobered up, he would say he had no consciousness at all, questioning whether she had taken the initiative, making Qin Yan believe that she had been the despicable one who had seduced him in the heat of the moment.","Such private matters were certainly not discussed in detail, so naturally, there was no way to distinguish truth from falsehood.","So, was it all a lie? Was Li Zhi the initiator that night?","[And he says Qin Yan ruined his love with Qiao Meng? That she used the child to tie him down? I'm laughing my head off. Wasn't it because he couldn't compete for the top hospital internship opportunity at that time, his future prospects were affected, and he realized that some things indeed relied on connections and background? Wasn't it after his mother's constant nagging that he weighed the pros and cons and chose not to chase after Qiao Meng, but to marry Qin Yan instead? He's really having his cake and eating it too! Did the Qin family threaten him? Did Qin Yan morally blackmail him? No, right?]","The Qin family: Of course not!","After all, their daughter had also been willing, and she had to bear the consequences of her own mistakes.","Back then, if Li Zhi had said even one word of refusal, they would have taken the child and left!","But Li Zhi agreed to marry, and they thought he was being responsible. Who knew he would always be so cold towards Qin Yan afterwards. So he had always been blaming Qin Yan and the Qin family.","But now, according to Ji Fei's words, Li Zhi had wanted to marry Qin Yan purely for his own benefit!","At this moment, Qin Yan was greatly shocked, looking at Li Zhi in disbelief.","After all, Li Zhi had always presented himself as noble and ambitious, truly capable and excellent, giving the impression that he disdained their family's help and could rely on himself. This was a complete reversal of her impression, so much so that she felt Ji Fei was maliciously speculating.","But Ji Fei's criticism continued.","[If he was really tied down by the child issue, couldn't he have divorced after losing the child? He gave a bunch of reasons, all high-sounding, but it's nothing more than not wanting to give up the resources provided by the Qin family, wanting to continue living off them. He doesn't want to eat kneeling down, he wants to stand while eating their food, and after eating, he still wants to complain that the food doesn't taste good. Tsk tsk tsk.]","It was as if someone had carved a new crevice in Qin Yan's mind, leaving her a bit dazed.","In fact, some of her close girlfriends had speculated about Li Zhi like this before, but Qin Yan had angrily refuted them.","[Living off others is one thing, but to go so far as to ask his wife to adopt his illegitimate child, I really wonder what's going on in Qin Yan's head?]","By this point, the Qin family members were also silently looking at Qin Yan, feeling utterly helpless.","[Huh? He actually told Qin Yan that if it weren't for her, he and his ex-girlfriend would have reconciled, and their child wouldn't have become illegitimate. So she has no right to refuse that child.]","[I think Qin Yan has been beaten down and negatively reinforced for so many years that she's become foolish. People should spend less time reflecting on themselves and more time blaming others! Is she really rushing to be the biggest fool now?]","Qin Yan's eyes reddened from being scolded.","She asked herself.","Is it really all her fault?"]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Grass Grass Grass Grass","paragraphs":["[The Qin family doesn't seem to know how to guard against such things. Aren't wealthy families supposed to be more shrewd? How could they all be so naive, letting themselves be manipulated by an upstart?]","The Qin Family: Wah, we're being criticized.","[I'm especially disappointed in Qin Xian. Isn't a CEO supposed to be strategically minded? He seemed quite astute before!]","Qin Xian: ...How could he investigate those deep-seated thoughts? Only Ji Fei could uncover them with her system.","He had always felt that Li Zhi wasn't much, but his elder sister liked him. Although they weren't a loving couple, Li Zhi hadn't done anything to mistreat his sister, except for this incident today. He never interfered in his siblings' lives, at most offering a few words of advice. Who knew there were so many landmines buried underneath?","Ji Fei was thoroughly enjoying the drama unfolding, so much that she lost her appetite and finally put down her bowl and chopsticks.","[This is too infuriating. Let me be 'tactless' for once. Although I can't directly reveal the secrets I've uncovered, I can still stir things up. Watch me find a way to sabotage this ill-fated union.]","Qin Xian looked at the 'troublemaker' lost in thought, his mouth twitching slightly.","Forget it, he'd better handle this himself.","Qin Xian composed himself and said directly: \"Sister, our family's stance remains unchanged. We hope you'll get a divorce. If you don't, we can't bear this shame and will choose to cut ties with the Li family in all future matters.\"","The Qin family quickly understood that Qin Xian was setting a trap, to see if Li Zhi was truly after power and status.","Even though Qin Xian fully believed Ji Fei's words, the others still had some reservations, after all, Li Zhi's original intentions were impossible to verify now. This was also Qin Xian's way of helping Ji Fei prove her point to everyone.","And to help his elder sister see clearly.","\"What do you mean by that?!\" Li's Mother immediately became anxious and quickly looked towards Qin's parents.","Qin's Father said directly: \"In our Qin family, Qin Xian is now in charge. Whatever he decides goes.\"","Li Zhi's expression changed several times, his face quickly filling with indignant embarrassment, as if he had been insulted. This made the Qin family members think that Ji Fei's speculation might be wrong. But soon, everyone felt something was off.","Because Li Zhi still hadn't spoken.","Only Li's Mother was extremely anxious, tugging at Qin Yan and saying: \"Did you hear what your brother said? He's not treating you like family at all! Besides, you're forcing our family line to end! If you're so capable, why don't you give birth to a child yourself? Then we wouldn't be in this situation!\"","These words were offensive. Qin's Mother immediately darkened her face and stepped forward to pull her daughter back to sit beside her.","\"Now we're telling your son to find a new wife. He can have as many children as he wants, no one's stopping him. He can even find this child's birth mother if he wants. What's the matter? Are you so unwilling to divorce my daughter?\"","Li's Mother hurriedly pulled her son. Li Zhi looked at Qin Xian, frowning and about to speak.","Qin Xian sneered and said: \"If you're worried about your reputation, rest assured. If you really divorce, we'll say our family couldn't accept an illegitimate child, so we forced my sister to divorce. It won't affect you at all. Our family has helped your Li family considerably over the years. You surely don't think my sister owes you anything, do you?\"","With one sentence, he blocked all false excuses. Li Zhi's face turned ashen.","[Ooh, ooh, ooh! Killing blow! The Qin family has finally stood up! Looks like I don't need to make an appearance after all.]","Hearing Ji Fei's cheerful voice, the corners of Qin Xian's mouth slowly curled upwards.","The Qin family naturally didn't want an innocent child to be homeless, but they also couldn't bear to see their precious daughter sad and miserable every day.","One cold husband was enough. Look at what had become of Qin Yan now. Add a child to that, and she'd surely develop health issues from holding everything in.","So divorce was the best option.","A flash of ruthlessness passed through Li Zhi's eyes, and his tone carried a hint of threat as he spoke: \"Qin Yan, since your family speaks this way, I'll take it as your intention as well?\"","In the past, whenever Li Zhi was the slightest bit displeased, Qin Yan would immediately try to appease him.","By now, she should have been pleading with the Qin family to preserve Li Zhi's dignity and the Li family's interests.","But this time, Qin Yan finally remained silent. She hadn't yet recovered from the shock Ji Fei had given her.","Li Zhi's aloof expression wavered for a moment.","Li's Mother immediately cried out: \"No, they can't divorce! Yan Yan, you can't have children anymore, who else would want you!\"","\"Hmph! Our Qin family's eldest daughter, there are plenty who'd want to marry her!\" Qin's Father said coldly.","\"But... she can't have children... other families would surely look down on her too. Marrying her would only be with ulterior motives.\"","\"Then she won't marry. We'll keep her in our Qin family and dote on her,\" Qin's Mother said. \"If she wants children, we can adopt orphans. As long as my daughter is happy!\"","[If you ask me, is the inability to have children really just one person's fault? Maybe Li Zhi's genes aren't good enough for Qin Yan. After the divorce, if she finds someone better and her mood improves, she might be able to have as many children as she wants!]","It must be said, Ji Fei provided a new perspective.","This made the Qin family members look forward to life after the divorce.","Even Qin Yan, still immersed in shock, had her thoughts diverted.","If she changed partners, would she be able to have her own children?","[Oh right, I can check for Qin Yan! I might be even more accurate than doctors.]","The Qin family members: We can do that?!","[Hmm, let me see. Oh, her body is indeed not in good condition, conception would be difficult, but not impossible.]","The Qin family members were disappointed. It was about the same as what the doctors had said.","But nine years had passed. The doctors probably just didn't want to rule out the possibility entirely.","However, Ji Fei suddenly became agitated.","[Damn, no wonder she couldn't have children! The responsibility must be shared equally!]","The Qin family members: ???","[Nine years... This Li Zhi fellow only comes home for a few days each month. They probably don't even share a bed more than a few times a year. The chances were already low, how could they possibly conceive? If she did get pregnant, he'd probably suspect her of cheating!]","Bombshell news!","The Qin family members all looked at Qin Yan in shock.","Qin Yan's face turned red immediately. How could this be known?","Faced with such matters, she was naturally shy. How could a woman speak of such things? Besides, she had always thought it was her body's problem, so she hadn't considered other possibilities.","The Qin family members were furious. How dare Li Zhi blame Qin Yan for not being able to have children when he hadn't even tried!","But they couldn't bring this up to question him, and they unanimously felt there was no need to question anymore.","This marriage must end! It's too abusive!","If Qin Yan remained obstinate, they would force the divorce.","But Ji Fei's thoughts had wandered again.","[Strange? Even if he doesn't like Qin Yan and doesn't want to share a bed with her, where does he go when he's not at home? Does he stay at the hospital? Is he really so busy that he can't come home? Isn't he the hospital director now? It can't be what I'm thinking, can it?]","The Qin family members felt a twinge in their hearts, vaguely sensing something was amiss: What could it be?!","Ji Fei didn't have any preconceived notions about Li Zhi's lofty image. Thinking of this, her gossip-loving instincts made her wonder if this guy might be keeping a mistress outside.","Bold hypothesis, careful verification. Can't make accusations without proof.","[Holy shit!]","[Holy shit shit shit shit!]","Profanity - looks like the problem is very serious.","The Qin family members' hearts were in their throats, holding their breath as they waited for Ji Fei to drop the bombshell.","Even Qin Yan's mind went blank, her emotions frozen.","[On the 18th floor of the high-end apartment next to the hospital... For these nine years... Li Zhi and Qiao Meng have been living there as husband and wife!]"]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: I want to divorce you","paragraphs":["Qin Yan's body swayed, her vision darkened, and she nearly fainted.","Qin's Mother supported Qin Yan with an almost distorted expression.","Qin's Father's forehead veins were pulsing, resembling a dethroned lion king, once again emanating a bloodthirsty aura, staring intently at the prey invading his territory. With a single gesture, the Steward nearby received the hint and turned to leave.","Meanwhile, the new lion king, Qin Xian, had already lowered his head to take out his phone and send instructions.","The Li family had not yet realized the gravity of the situation.","Li Zhi, seeing that the Qin family was determined to muddy the waters, couldn't help but stare at Qin Yan, pressuring her: \"Just because of such a small matter, you want to make a fuss with me? When did you become so petty!\"","Qin Yan slowly raised her head, her eyes filled with desperate bloodshot, causing Li Zhi's heart to skip a beat.","\"Why?\"","Qin Yan felt nothing but absurdity. She thought he had failed to win back his true love and chose to marry her as a second option due to his responsibility towards the child.","But now she was told that they had been together all along.","So why didn't they divorce? Why did they drag her along? And even blame all the wrongdoing on her! How could he be so righteous about it?","\"What do you mean 'why'? Fine, if you really can't accept it, we won't adopt this child. I'll send the child back tomorrow.\"","Tonight, Qin Yan's strange behavior made Li Zhi feel like he was losing control. After some thought, he decided to take a step back first.","Qin Yan looked at Li Zhi, still with his condescending attitude, and truly couldn't help but feel waves of nausea. The illusion of that once-admired senior finally faded away, leaving only a nauseating true face.","Ji Fei was also disgusted. She didn't know that Qin Yan and the others had heard the truth, but having stumbled upon such big news while the parties involved were still in the dark, she really couldn't hold back from exposing it.","But she couldn't speak directly, so she had to take an indirect approach.","\"Send away the child? You said earlier that the child's mother had disappeared, but it seems you're very well-informed about her whereabouts! Could it be that you've been maintaining a relationship all along? It looks like our family needs to investigate whether you and Qiao Meng have been in contact all these years, whether you've met. We can't let my elder sister wear a green hat and raise your child for you!\"","Li Zhi was startled, his pupils trembling almost imperceptibly, his tone finally becoming a bit chaotic, \"Are you slandering me? My mother was right when she said you have no manners!\"","Qin Xian immediately said: \"Shut up.\"","Those two words, though not loud, shot like ice arrows, severely wounding Li Zhi's nerves, causing him to freeze for a moment.","If it weren't for the fact that they couldn't reveal their ability to hear Ji Fei's thoughts, they would have exposed this hypocrite on the spot.","Ji Fei let out a sneer, wagging her finger at Li Zhi, then her long, fair finger suddenly pointed at the silent little boy, \"Look at your son's expression before you refute me.\"","Children aren't as good at lying as adults, and Ji Fei's hypothesis hit the truth, causing the child's expression to become panicked.","Before Li Zhi could react, Qin's Mother quickly chimed in: \"Little one, tell us, have you seen your father before? Good children shouldn't lie.\"","Li Ziqiao finally couldn't hold back anymore, pulling on Li Zhi's sleeve, he said: \"Dad, let's go back, Mom, she...\"","Li Zhi's breath hitched, and in his panic, he reflexively pulled his sleeve away, but the movement was too big, and he accidentally hit Li Ziqiao's face.","Li Ziqiao fell off the sofa from the hit, shocking everyone present.","On his fair, tender cheek, a very obvious handprint appeared.","The scene instantly became chaotic.","Ji Fei was startled even more, quickly getting up to pull the child to her side, she hadn't meant to implicate the child.","The child had already started crying. Qin Yan's heart softened, seeing that Ji Fei didn't know how to comfort children, she could only take the child into her arms and pat him gently.","Li Ziqiao felt even more upset in his heart. He felt that this aunt was really very gentle and kind, but his parents insisted on bullying her. His conscience really couldn't bear it.","Finally, mustering up his courage, he said: \"Mom and Dad have been living together all along, only occasionally separating. They said I'm an illegitimate child, and only by tricking auntie into adopting me could I be seen in public. I don't understand, I really don't understand, but I know all of this is wrong!\"","After this sentence, you could hear a pin drop.","After he finished speaking, he clutched Qin Yan's sleeve, chokingly apologizing in a small voice for almost becoming an accomplice in deceiving her.","Upon hearing this, Qin Yan finally broke down in tears.","Li's Mother hurriedly grabbed her son, completely bewildered. \"Son, did you really...\"","Li Zhi's face had completely changed by now. He dared to do it, but he didn't dare to have it exposed in front of the Qin family.","Still stubbornly insisting: \"Nonsense, I never thought the child would be taught to be like this, actually lying to frame me. He just wants me to be with his mother, that's why he's playing these little tricks. Qin Yan, you don't suspect me too, do you?\"","Li Ziqiao looked at his father, who was full of lies, in disbelief.","If it weren't for Ji Fei's gossip skills, the Qin family might have been fooled by Li Zhi's righteous act.","But now, Li Zhi was like a clown jumping around.","Li Zhi wouldn't easily admit it. In his view, everything was just Ji Fei's lucky guess. His public image had always been good, and he had been very careful for these nine years, never leaving any evidence.","The Qin family was the same. If they really knew something, they would have dealt with him long ago.","And how much credibility did a child's words have?","Moreover, Qiao Meng was about to be arranged to go abroad. Even if the Qin family became suspicious later, they wouldn't be able to find her.","Li Zhi was frantically thinking of countermeasures.","Suddenly, Qin Yan stood up unexpectedly, grabbed the half-eaten fruit platter from the table, and smashed it over Li Zhi's head.","The fruit platter was quite heavy. With a loud bang, it scared Li's Mother and Li Ziqiao, who both cried out.","Li Zhi's head was instantly bloodied, with fruit and broken pieces of the dish scattered all over him. His refined glasses were also knocked off. He held his forehead, staring in shock at the usually gentle woman who had suddenly erupted.","\"Have you gone mad!\" Li Zhi felt a mix of shame and anger at being challenged by someone he considered beneath him.","\"Li Zhi, I have never wronged you, it's you who has wronged me! It's you and Qiao Meng who have treated me like a fool! It's you who have no conscience!\"","Finally, Qin Yan shouted at the top of her lungs. Along with her shout, years of suppressed grievances also burst out. Everything seemed to suddenly become clear.","Li Zhi was truly panicking now. He knew he couldn't suppress Qin Yan anymore, and could only stammer: \"You... you're wrongly accusing me, I...\"","Before Li Zhi could finish, Qin Xian suddenly threw his phone onto the table. A video call had been initiated.","A shout came from the phone, \"Let go of me, who are you people! This is trespassing!\"","On the screen was a room, and Qiao Meng, dressed in home clothes, was being forcibly seated in a chair.","\"It's Mom!\" Li Ziqiao became anxious.","Li Zhi's face also changed dramatically, and then they heard other voices from the phone.","\"Mr. Qin, we found it. There are Mr. Li's work documents and traces of his life here, as well as some photos. It's a place where a family of three lives...\" The person inside reported in a businesslike manner.","At this, Li Zhi was completely stunned. Before he could react, a whip suddenly lashed out.","It struck Li Zhi's face directly, leaving a bloody mark. Li Zhi let out a miserable cry and stumbled back several steps, but the whip followed, continuously making cracking sounds.","It was a riding crop, brought by the Steward for Qin's Father.","Years of cheating, and even attempting to make Qin Yan raise their illegitimate child – his own daughter suffering such insult – even a well-mannered man like Qin's Father was enraged to the point of wanting to kill.","Li Zhi fell to the ground in a mess, facing the furious Qin's Father. He was in a daze, not even thinking of running away.","Li's Mother cried out and threw herself forward to save her son. Li Ziqiao also rushed over, \"Don't hit my dad, don't hit my dad, please, don't hit him!\"","Seeing the child shielding his father from the whip, Qin's Father finally stopped.","By now, Li Zhi was covered in unsightly whip marks, the pain making his whole body twitch.","\"Divorce, Li Zhi, I want to divorce you!\" Qin Yan's voice finally came, as if torn from her throat."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: Surprisingly, it's a Reversed Melon","paragraphs":["\"Collect all evidence of Li Zhi's infidelity,\" Qin Xian ordered directly into the phone.","With this command, it was clear that legal action was imminent, and the outcome would likely be Li Zhi leaving the marriage with nothing, years of effort gone in an instant.","Li Zhi, finally snapping back to reality, shouted, \"You can't do this! Qin Yan, you started all of this in the first place, how can you blame me now? Even though I'm with Qiao Meng, I still gave you status. What more do you want?\"","Such a shameless statement left the Qin family members stunned with anger.","\"Did I beg you to give me status?\" Qin Yan, now thoroughly disgusted, asked incredulously.","Li Zhi choked, then said, \"Your family's power and influence pressured me! In that situation, if I didn't marry you, could I have continued my career in the medical field?\"","Qin Yan was nearly in tears from anger. \"Li Zhi, your hypocrisy is sickening.\"","Li Zhi was stunned; Qin Yan had never spoken to him like this before.","[Qin Yan has finally woken up! She's right, Li Zhi is nothing but an ungrateful coward!]","Hearing this, Qin Yan, who was on the verge of tears, suddenly lifted her chin defiantly and glared at Li Zhi.","\"You're just a freeloader!\"","Li Zhi, hearing the label he despised most, exclaimed, \"Qin Yan, what did you say?\"","\"I said you're a freeloader. You and your mistress are both parasites. You have no shame!\"","\"Qin Yan, you bitch! Who are you talking about? You're the one who stole my man, stole everything from me! You're the shameless one!\" Qiao Meng, finally understanding what was happening, started cursing from the other end of the video call.","Qin Yan owed her, and she would never forget the disgusting sight of her boyfriend sleeping with Qin Yan.","They had only broken up impulsively after an argument, and Qin Yan had immediately jumped into Li Zhi's bed. All of this had shocked Qiao Meng at the time.","Later, when she found out she was pregnant and overcame her resentment, planning to get back with Li Zhi, she heard he had been forced to marry.","She wanted to abort the child but couldn't bring herself to do it, until...","\"Then why haven't you taken him back all these years? Your man won't divorce for the sake of power and status, you're just a kept mistress. What right do you have to shout and scream?\" Qin Yan, as if a switch had been flipped, sharply countered every accusation.","\"It's because your family used their influence to bully us, threatening Li Zhi's future. Otherwise, I wouldn't have suffered in silence. Even if he didn't marry me, he would always love me and stay with me, leaving you, you slut, to sleep alone. That's his revenge on you.\"","Ji Fei, hearing this, couldn't help but comment, [It seems this Li Zhi is quite the master manipulator. This mistress has been thoroughly fooled as well.]","Qin Yan sneered, \"I may be stupid, but Qiao Meng, you're a fool too. Li Zhi, you know very well whether my family threatened you or not! Even now, you're still pretending to be the victim? Trying to claim the moral high ground over me! The truth is, you chose to use my family's connections for your own career, abandoning your so-called true love! Don't throw all your dirty water on me, I won't take it!\"","Coming from Qin Yan, these words were like trampling repeatedly on Li Zhi's pride, as if exposing the most hidden and shameful thoughts in his heart. Li Zhi's face contorted uncontrollably.","Qiao Meng immediately said, \"Stop slandering Li Zhi.\"","Qin Yan suddenly found it laughable and said, \"Fine, since you all think that way, let our Qin family make it a reality. After we divorce, we'll show you what real threats and bullying look like!\"","This threat from the Qin family's daughter was no joke.","Li Zhi immediately blurted out, \"Qin Yan, how did you become like this?\"","\"Hah~ Panicking now, aren't you? Which means you know the Qin family never actually intended to go after you before!\" Qin Yan's mind had finally cleared, becoming sharp and quick.","Li Zhi was left with no rebuttal.","Li's Mother, seeing Qin Yan's demeanor, finally realized this was no longer the daughter-in-law who used to cling to her son. Quickly, with tears in her eyes, she tried to grab Qin Yan's hand.","\"Yan Yan, I will never accept her. Li Zhi was just confused. Please give Li Zhi another chance. I'm begging you! Look how badly Li Zhi has been beaten, isn't that enough?\"","But she was blocked by Qin's Mother, who protected Qin Yan like a mother hen.","Li's Mother could only pull Li Zhi, forcing him to apologize and make promises. \"Say something quick! Apologize now! Do you want to watch our Li family be destroyed?\"","Li Zhi, pressed down by his mother, almost knelt. His eyes gradually became panicked. After what seemed like an intense internal struggle, he finally spoke, \"I won't divorce. Yan Yan, I was wrong. I was just resentful and unwilling to accept it, but actually, I do care about you. I...\"","\"Li Zhi!\" Qiao Meng, hearing this, went crazy.","At this point, was there still a need to maintain this facade? Could it be that what Qin Yan said was true, that she had been deceived by Li Zhi all along?","\"Shut up!\" Before Qiao Meng could say more, Li Zhi shouted at her.","[Able to bend and stretch, knowing when to compromise - it's truly nauseating.] Ji Fei couldn't help but curse.","Qin Xian also snorted coldly, shattering the illusion: \"The evidence of infidelity is irrefutable. Li Zhi, you have no choice. So there's no need to act anymore.\"","Li Zhi immediately looked anxiously towards Qin Yan, only to see disgust in her eyes.","The moment Qin Yan turned away, refusing to look at him, Li Zhi realized this problem could not be resolved.","Meanwhile, Qiao Meng, because of Li Zhi's shout, finally began to lose control. \"Li Zhi, don't forget, the child...\"","Li Zhi suddenly jolted as if electrocuted and shouted in horror, \"I told you to shut up! Do you not want the child in your belly anymore? Do you want to die?\"","Child? Qiao Meng was pregnant? This revelation disgusted all the Qin family members.","Even Li Ziqiao seemed to have just learned about this, appearing dumbfounded.","Perhaps due to the overly fierce tone, Qiao Meng immediately wilted.","Li Zhi's expression changed several times before he finally seemed to resign himself. He stood up, covered in injuries, grabbing his wailing mother with one hand and Li Ziqiao's arm with the other.","\"I've wronged Yan Yan in this matter. I'm willing to divorce. You can take whatever revenge you want on me, but I hope you won't implicate others.\"","In this moment, he seemed like a different person - decisive and quick to turn away, no longer entangling himself in the situation.","[Running away so fast, is he afraid we'll beat him up again?] Ji Fei couldn't help but wonder suspiciously.","Ji Fei felt that Li Zhi's change of face was too quick. She had thought such a shameless person would have put up more of a fight.","The Qin family didn't think much of it. At this point, they just wanted the Li family to disappear as quickly as possible, not wanting to remain in the same space with them any longer.","The three members of the Li family left with unsteady steps, only Li Ziqiao secretly looking back at everyone.","Qin Yan, grieving in her mother's arms, suddenly lifted her gaze for some unknown reason and met Li Ziqiao's eyes. For a moment, something seemed to click in her heart.","Noticing Li Ziqiao's behavior, Li Zhi suddenly yanked him forcefully.","Li Ziqiao stumbled, and as he looked up, he met Li Zhi's fierce expression.","Li Ziqiao's heart immediately contracted in fear.","Li Zhi withdrew his resentful gaze and silently gritted his teeth. With his back to the Qin family, the corner of his mouth curled into a cruel smile.","How dare you humiliate me like this, Qin Yan, Qin family. You'll regret it!","A twisted excitement flashed across Li Zhi's face.","Seeing the villains about to exit, Ji Fei couldn't help but comment: [If they hadn't been so abusive, they wouldn't have brought this on themselves. It's just karma.]","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei, a complex look flashing in his eyes.","[But it's a pity about that child. He's probably going to get beaten when they get home. It makes my conscience ache a bit. How could such a scumbag and a horrible woman produce such a child? It's truly a case of a good bamboo shoot coming from rotten bamboo. But it's strange, why would they let their own child recognize an enemy as his mother? For revenge? Are they really willing to go that far? What are they thinking...]","Qin Xian, listening to Ji Fei's rambling thoughts, felt there was no need to overthink it.","What else could it be but to ensure the child would be eligible to inherit shares from the Qin family and everything from the Li family?","If, at some point, Qin Yan truly couldn't have children, adoption would be the only option. If it wasn't his own flesh and blood, Li Zhi certainly wouldn't agree.","Add to that Qiao Meng's pregnancy, and sacrificing one child seemed reasonable.","After all, the child was old enough to know about the relationship between his birth mother and father. In the end, Qin Yan would be the only outsider in that family.","Just thinking about such a scenario was terrifying. Fortunately, there was Ji Fei.","Just as Qin Xian was thinking, he suddenly felt Ji Fei beside him shoot off like an arrow released from a bow, whooshing towards the Li family trio who were about to reach the main door.","[Ahhhhhhhhhhh!]","That scream-like inner voice startled the Qin family members so much they nearly lost their balance.","They watched as Ji Fei grabbed Li Ziqiao's arm and then delivered a kick to Li Zhi's back, as if she was snatching someone away.","Li Ziqiao was pulled backward and would have fallen if Qin Xian hadn't been right behind to catch him.","Li Zhi, however, was in a worse state. Caught off guard by the sudden kick while his mind was still pondering future arrangements for Li Ziqiao, he couldn't react in time and fell forward onto the ground, taking Li's Mother with him.","His nose made intimate contact with the marble floor, and a cry of pain echoed throughout the entire estate.","But no one cared about them; the Qin family members were all listening to Ji Fei's internal roar.","[System, are you sick in the head? Giving me gossip with a twist? We nearly had a disaster!]","[Are you saying I should have asked for more details? The information clearly stated that Li Zhi was going to adopt his biological son. Of course I could only think of an illegitimate child!]","[This scumbag actually dared to switch the children born to two women at the same time! And nine years later, he even had Qin Yan adopt one of them. How deranged does one have to be to do something so disgusting?!]","[I really didn't expect that Li Ziqiao was actually Qin Yan's biological son all along!!!!!!!!!]"]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Is he... all right","paragraphs":["A series of roars swept through the Qin family members in the hall like a violent storm.","The shocking information left everyone's minds blank, their gazes fixed on the nine-year-old boy.","Everyone's minds were simultaneously rumbling: How is this possible! How could this be!","Qin Yan's brain almost stopped functioning. She dared not think that her child had not actually died? That he had been raised by Li Zhi alongside Qiao Meng all this time?","Was that her child?","Li Ziqiao didn't notice the way others were looking at him. Horrified by the terrible state of his father and grandmother, he anxiously tried to go to them, but was instantly grabbed by the arm by Qin Xian.","Qin Xian was the first to come to his senses, looking down intently at that young face.","Ji Fei said this was his own nephew?","Years ago when Qin Yan suddenly went into premature labor, by the time the whole family rushed over, they only saw a stillborn baby.","That was at the private hospital they had supported Li Zhi in establishing.","Everything... had room for manipulation.","Qin Xian's brows furrowed tightly, his expression terrifyingly deep.","Ji Fei, having rudely kicked someone, stood steady. Her mind was in chaos when she saw Li Zhi, whom she had kicked down, supporting his bloodied face. Already in too much pain to care about his image, he roared in mad fury: \"You!\"","But suddenly seeing Li Ziqiao held by Qin Xian behind Ji Fei, and Qin Xian turning his head to look at him with eyes that seemed to see a dead man.","Li Zhi felt all the blood in his body flow backwards.","Ji Fei, steeling herself, found an excuse: \"I felt something was off before. Li Ziqiao looks too much like the Qin family. And just now in the video, I saw your mistress. The mother and son don't look alike at all.\"","Li Zhi was so flustered he began to stutter, \"You... what nonsense are you spouting!\"","It's her again! Her and her wild speculations.","Ji Fei also knew that what she said sounded too absurd and might upset the Qin family.","After all, such matters couldn't be casually discussed, especially for a woman who had lost a child before and might never be able to have her own child again. Even false hope could be a fatal blow.","But there was no choice. No matter how outrageous, it had to be said. This was too big of an issue; she couldn't let that scumbag take away the innocent child. Who knows what he might do to the child?","Ji Fei could only turn to Qin Xian with a pleading look, \"Um, don't you think he looks like...\"","\"Yes, he looks very much like my elder sister. I don't believe this is a coincidence.\"","A steady voice rang out. Ji Fei looked up in surprise, meeting Qin Xian's firm black eyes.","There wasn't a trace of doubt in that gaze, as if he unconditionally believed her and stood on her side. It stunned Ji Fei.","[Is he... alright?]","Qin Xian's mouth twitched. He turned to Li Zhi and said, \"Our Qin family has doubts about this child's identity. We will verify it.\"","Li Zhi stared in disbelief at everything unfolding. Just a moment ago, he was fantasizing about how to take revenge on the Qin family, and now there was an unexpected turn of events, completely unforeseen.","\"Have you all gone mad? Li Ziqiao is mine and Qiao Meng's child. Qin Yan's child back then...\"","It was only at this moment that he realized he was utterly incapable of bearing the consequences if this matter was exposed. He was so terrified that he even forgot to breathe, let alone loudly protest.","Especially after meeting Qin Xian's icy gaze, the rest of his words completely failed to come out. He understood that even if he defended himself convincingly, it wouldn't change Qin Xian's decision.","The outcome was already determined!","And his silence had indirectly verified everything.","Li Ziqiao was still young. He seemed to understand something but couldn't quite make sense of it. Instinctively, he tried to break free from Qin Xian to find his father.","Even though his father had always been cold towards him, even though his mother had never been kind to him, weren't they... still his parents?","Suddenly, a warm embrace accompanied by a hoarse sob enveloped him.","Li Ziqiao looked up to see that gentle aunt holding his shoulders, her face full of shock. Those beautiful eyes were brimming with tears, yet she strained to keep them wide open, trying to see him clearly.","As if infected by her emotion, Li Ziqiao suddenly felt a painful ache in his heart.","\"Aun... Aunty...\"","Qin Yan looked at Li Ziqiao as if something was on the tip of her tongue. With trembling hands, she gently caressed Li Ziqiao's cheeks.","That instinctive blood connection made her so distressed that she couldn't utter a word, only making unconscious sounds, \"Ah... ah... wuwu...\"","It was nine years of separation between life and death.","Finally, she fainted on the spot, supported hastily by the panicking child.","Qin's Mother also rushed over, hugging Li Ziqiao and examining him closely. \"He looks like us, he looks like us! He's my eldest grandson, it's my eldest grandson!\"","Nephews often resemble their uncles. With this reminder, Qin's Mother finally stopped making excuses about mere kind features. This child clearly had a seven or eight-tenths resemblance to Qin Xian and Qin Zhao when they were young.","Qin's Father, trembling with anger, walked up to Li Zhi and silently dragged him outside. The butler held back the dazed Li's Mother.","Half an hour later, Qin Xian calmly called for an ambulance.","Under the cover of night, the entire Qin family mobilized and went to another hospital invested in by the Qin family.","Qiao Meng was also forcibly brought along.","It wasn't until this moment that Qiao Meng saw Li Zhi, unconscious with multiple fractures, and Li Ziqiao being protectively surrounded by the entire Qin family.","The paternity test results came out quickly.","Holding the test report, Qin Yan tightly embraced Li Ziqiao, crying as if she would shed all the tears of a lifetime.","Li Ziqiao stared blankly at the disheveled Qiao Meng. He opened his mouth, but the word \"Mom\" ultimately didn't come out. He could only ask hoarsely, \"Why?\"","Qiao Meng, having nothing left to lose, cursed hatefully, \"This is what you mother and son owe us! You little bastard, we should have killed you back then, to let you pay for my son's life!\"","She wasn't his mother. She was the demon who had stolen him from his birth mother for nine years.","Li Ziqiao finally broke down in tears, his feelings of filial affection completely shattered.","This tragic life drama left even Ji Fei without the mood to spectate. She could only look at Qiao Meng's situation.","Usually, for Ji Fei to want to spectate, she needed to know people's names and appearances.","If she had known Qiao Meng before, there might not have been such a dramatic turn of events.","[When Qiao Meng gave birth to a stillborn child, she went crazy and fought with Li Zhi. They both believed it was all Qin Yan's fault that they had to go through this. So when Qin Yan's child was born, Qiao Meng made Li Zhi give her the child as compensation.]","Ji Fei's comment: Crazy woman.","[Li Zhi agreed, also out of a need to protect his pathetic self-esteem, as if this would somehow allow him to hold his head high.]","Ji Fei's comment: Worse than a dog.","[But how could Qiao Meng possibly take good care of her rival's child? So Li Ziqiao was raised by this scummy couple to be insecure, sensitive, and frail.]","Ji Fei's comment: Poor child.","[Until Qiao Meng got pregnant again, they only wanted to love their own child wholeheartedly. Keeping Li Ziqiao around was too much of an eyesore, so they came up with this vicious plan. Before the Qin family's people arrived, Qiao Meng was still fantasizing, mocking Qin Yan for being blind enough not to recognize her own son right in front of her, imagining how she would forever resent raising her rival's child, while Li Ziqiao would always stand on her and Li Zhi's side. When the time was right, everything would be given to their biological son.]","With two loud slaps, the usually elegant Qin's Mother, disregarding all decorum, slapped Qiao Meng's face like a madwoman. The slaps left Qiao Meng's cheeks swollen and her lips bleeding.","Qiao Meng, who had been raving just moments ago, was stunned for a moment when she saw the Qin family actually lay hands on her. When she looked up again, she saw Qin's Father staring at her coldly. Even without saying a word, the aura he emanated was terrifying enough.","\"I'm pregnant, you... you can't hurt me!\" Qiao Meng finally cowered.","Qin Xian stepped forward and said coldly, \"We won't harm your child, but you will pay the price for everything you've done.\"","If the Qin family didn't abide by the law, these beasts might not even be alive now.","But sometimes, being alive is more terrifying. Especially for these hypocritical beasts."]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Eight Pack Abs","paragraphs":["It was too late, so everything had to be dealt with later.","Li Ziqiao was renamed Qin Xi on the spot by Qin's Father and went to stay at the Qin family home along with Qin Yan.","Upon arriving home, Qin Xi was already drowsy. Despite all the emotions, he was still a growing child and was too exhausted to stay awake.","Qin Yan stayed by her child's side, unwilling to leave even for a moment.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mother also came to see their grandson, their faces full of love.","Finally, Qin Xian arrived as well.","\"Where's Fei?\" Qin's Mother asked.","Qin Xian replied, \"She's resting in her room.\"","The Qin family members immediately focused their attention, except for the soundly sleeping little Qin Xi.","\"What exactly is going on? Can we really hear Fei's thoughts?\" Qin's Father asked.","Qin Xian briefly explained what had happened at the company earlier that day.","\"Currently, only a few of us can hear them.\"","\"Can we not hear them now?\" Qin's Mother asked, puzzled.","\"It's a distance issue, just like normal conversation. If you're too far away, you can't hear,\" Qin Xian explained.","\"We owe her so much this time. She saved me and little Xi. How did she know all of that?\" Qin Yan was still in a daze. Everything had happened so quickly and felt so unreal, like a dream.","If Ji Fei hadn't revealed the truth, she and Qin Xi might never have recognized each other for their entire lives. The thought alone was terrifying.","\"I think it must have happened recently. She gained some kind of superpower that allows her to access information about everything. Us being able to hear her thoughts is probably an unintended side effect. I suggest we maintain the status quo for now. When our third brother and fourth sister return, we'll see if they can hear her thoughts too.\"","No one had any way to deal with such supernatural occurrences, so they could only stick to their current approach for the time being.","\"I feel like Fei has changed,\" Qin Yan remarked thoughtfully.","When she got married, Ji Fei had just been brought back to the Qin family, so the two of them hadn't spent much time together. She only remembered that Ji Fei seemed somewhat introverted. After that, there was the accidental marriage, and she kept hearing her mother complain about Qin Xian and Ji Fei becoming an incompatible couple.","\"Actually, Fei was always this quirky and clever as a child,\" Qin's Mother suddenly recalled. \"After her parents passed away and she was bullied by those relatives in the family, she probably developed some psychological trauma, which is why her personality changed so drastically. Now she seems more like her childhood self again.\"","\"Anyway, Fei not only helped you clear up the troubles around you but also saved your elder sister and nephew,\" Qin's Father said, patting Qin Xian's shoulder. \"You need to repay her properly.\"","Remembering the day's events, Qin's Mother smiled and said, \"Fei just puts on a tough front. She actually has a kind heart. You should be more understanding of her in daily life.\"","Qin Yan also expressed her concern, \"Since you agreed to the marriage, don't let her live like I did.\"","They were hoping that Qin Xian would realize Ji Fei's good qualities and that their marital relationship would improve. If it really couldn't work out, they hoped the couple would part on good terms rather than ending up resenting each other.","After all, they still weren't even sharing a room.","Qin Xian didn't think too much about it, only recalling Ji Fei's money-loving demeanor. \"I'll transfer some money to her.\"","The three Qin family members: ...","Was it possible that what she wanted was him, not money? How could money compare to love?","As if sensing the looks in their eyes, Qin Xian said, \"She likes money. When I transferred money to her for today's events, she was very happy.\"","The three remained unconvinced, thinking Qin Xian's emotional intelligence was lacking.","But the next second, they saw Qin Xian suddenly furrow his brow and say, \"Never mind, she's not good with money. I'll help her invest it.\"","The three were puzzled but still pleased. From their perspective, it seemed Qin Xian was willing to put in effort for Ji Fei.","In reality, Qin Xian had suddenly remembered Ji Fei's wild thoughts.","His mouth twitched. If they really divorced, he wouldn't be able to avoid giving her money. If they didn't divorce, he wasn't generous enough to give his wife capital to go find a young lover.","But no matter how much he tried to prevent it, the enemy within was hard to guard against.","When Qin Xian returned to his room, he planned to talk to Ji Fei about helping her invest.","However, before he could knock on the door, he heard screaming thoughts from inside the room.","Thoughts and normal speech had some differences, and after hearing them for a while, one could distinguish between the two.","[Ahhhh! I've struck it rich! Why did Dad Qin, Mom Qin, and Qin Yan all transfer money to me?!]","[Oh, oh, oh, it turns out they're thanking me for accidentally exposing everything.]","[They're all such good people! I'm a good person too. Good deeds really do pay off.]","[Adding to what I had before, it's a total of... ten million! I actually got ten million in one day! Woohoo! Even if I divorce Qin Xian and leave with nothing, I won't be afraid anymore... Young studs, hunky guys, six-pack abs, hehe, oh my.]","Inside the room, Ji Fei was rolling around on the bed, clutching her phone and sending thank-you messages one by one, when she heard a dull knock on the door.","Ji Fei opened the door curiously and saw Qin Xian's tall figure blocking the doorway, his expression a bit strange.","He lowered his gaze to look at her, his dark eyes and long lashes creating an inexplicable sense of pressure as his gaze descended.","\"What's wrong?\" Ji Fei's heart rate involuntarily increased.","This wasn't Ji Fei's fault; who could remain calm when being stared at by such a cold and noble hunk?","[What's he doing here? Ah, I know, he's here to give me a thank-you fee too. My capital is increasing again! Yeah!]","Qin Xian: ...","\"Give me all the money you have.\"","Ji Fei: ?","\"I'll arrange investments for you, to make money from money, guaranteed profits.\"","Ji Fei: !","\"Come find me when you've thought it over.\"","With that, Qin Xian returned to his own room.","In her previous life, Ji Fei had been a wage slave, and to be honest, it was exhausting. In this life, she just wanted to lie flat and do nothing.","After transmigrating, the first thing she did was check the original body's account, and when she saw the balance, Ji Fei cried.","There wasn't even a penny!","Although the original body worked in the entertainment industry, it was more of a hobby. Because she had no talent, only a pretty face, she mostly did advertisements.","These ads were usually obtained through connections, so the money that actually reached the original body wasn't much.","The Qin family elders used to give the original body pocket money, but after marriage, all of her expenses were covered by Qin Xian.","Although Qin Xian's relationship with the original body was strained, he never restricted her spending. The supplementary card was always available, so the original body never cared about money issues.","But Ji Fei was different. Using a man's card made her feel insecure! Money was safer in her own name.","Now, all Ji Fei had were the various transfers she had received today.","Living off savings wasn't her style either, so she was quite tempted by Qin Xian's suggestion.","After all, as a mere wage slave, she certainly couldn't compare to a genius who could successfully run a large corporation at such a young age when it came to investments.","Having thought it through, Ji Fei went to knock on Qin Xian's door.","After knocking for a while with no response, Ji Fei began to grumble inwardly.","[What's going on? Didn't he tell me to come find him?]","At this point, Ji Fei was in the hallway, and her thoughts traveled quite far, reaching the three people in Qin Yan's room nearby. They all curiously peeked through a crack in the door.","What was happening? Had Qin Xian finally come to his senses and decided to let Ji Fei into his room to share a bed?","The three Qin family members were very excited.","Just as Ji Fei was about to give up in annoyance, the door opened.","In an instant, a light mist mixed with pheromones rushed out, completely suppressing Ji Fei's anger.","Qin Xian was wearing a bathrobe, his hair still wet. He held a white towel in one hand, wiping his hair, while the other hand maintained the door-opening position.","His ink-like eyebrows and eyes seemed even more profound, with a slight blush on his cheeks from the steam, though not as red as his lips.","The wet man looked less stern and cold than usual, with an added touch of softness and casualness.","Because of his slightly forward-leaning posture, the hastily donned bathrobe collar opened even wider, revealing everything.","The warm white light reflected off the water droplets remaining on his chest, creating a shimmering effect that highlighted his perfect muscle lines even more.","Ji Fei's almond eyes widened, almost forgetting why she had come, her previous irritation completely gone.","[One, two, three...]","Qin Xian was looking at Ji Fei curiously when he heard her gulp and think, [Damn, those shoulders, those abs, what an incredible body! I'm going to faint!!!]","Qin Xian's face heated up for a moment, but then he straightened his posture, took a deep breath, and didn't bother to tighten his robe, maintaining a nonchalant attitude.","Hmph, see that? Eight-pack abs!"]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Qin Xian Actually Still Is...","paragraphs":["When the Qin family heard that embarrassing inner thought, they couldn't help but feel awkward, but they were still very much looking forward to what would happen next.","Could it be that tonight...","\"I was just taking a shower, so I was late opening the door.\"","\"Oh, no problem.\" [Nice! Well done!]","Ji Fei maintained a calm demeanor, forcefully tearing her gaze away from the beautiful sight.","The corner of Qin Xian's mouth twitched. \"Have you made up your mind?\"","The Qin family listened intently, on edge.","\"Yes, I have 10 million here. I want you to invest it for me.\"","The Qin family: ...","Qin Xian nodded.","\"But I want to know, how can you be sure it's a guaranteed profit? All investments carry risks,\" Ji Fei said seriously.","Qin Xian replied, \"If there's a loss, it's on me. I'll ensure your principal is completely safe.\"","\"Huh?\" Ji Fei was at a loss faced with such a windfall.","Qin Xian said directly, \"Thank you for helping the family out again. Consider this my gesture of gratitude.\"","Ji Fei immediately accepted it well, feeling she had indeed been a big help, so there was no need for modesty.","\"Then I'll transfer it to you later... Oh, wait, let's make it 9 million instead.\"","Qin Xian was just wondering about this when he heard Ji Fei's inner thought: [Keep 1 million on hand, just in case.]","\"For the investment, can I choose the type that pays dividends monthly?\" Ji Fei asked again.","[This way, I'll have a fixed income every month and can relax.]","Qin Xian frowned slightly, \"If you need money, just use the card directly.\"","\"I know, but can't I feel the joy of harvesting every month?\" Ji Fei smiled.","[Yeah right, that card is under your name. The thing CEOs are best at is freezing cards to teach lessons. I don't want to offend you one day and have my card frozen, ending up penniless.]","Ji Fei's display of such insecurity made Qin Xian's eyes flash.","\"Alright, I understand. I remember the final payment for your last job has been credited. It should be transferred to you tomorrow, probably around 1 million as well. So let's keep the investment at 10 million.\"","\"What? Really? Aren't I just a small-time celebrity who can only get by with endorsements? How can the fee be so high?\" Ji Fei was shocked, as she didn't remember it being that much. Could it be that her original self wasn't paying attention and remembered wrong?","\"This time it's higher than usual,\" Qin Xian lied calmly, and Ji Fei completely believed him. Her mind was filled with the echoes of her happy laughter.","The eavesdropping trio looked at each other, feeling sorry for Ji Fei, thinking it was because Qin Xian hadn't given her a sense of security that she had so many concerns.","Never mind, they thought. In the future, they'd just have to give Ji Fei more red envelopes to make the child feel more secure.","Qin Xian suddenly felt a chill down his spine, sensing some hidden trouble. After some thought, he spoke up, \"If you have any extra money in the future, you can continue to give it to me, and I'll help you invest it continuously.\"","[Qin Xian, you really... except for not being able to give me a married life, you're perfect!]","Qin Xian: ...","Unable to give a married life? The eavesdropping trio gossiped among themselves.","[If only I could sleep with him once.]","Qin Xian's ears started to burn, and his previously expressionless gaze could no longer focus on Ji Fei's face.","The eavesdropping trio secretly cheered her on. After all, Qin Xian could hear her, so maybe Ji Fei's direct approach could break the ice!","[Speaking of which, has such a perfect man ever been taken advantage of by a woman... At least I haven't!]","Qin Xian: Did you just reveal something again?!","The eavesdropping trio all had helpless looks on their faces. When the incident happened back then, they weren't sure either. It was just that so many people knew about it, they had no choice but to make Qin Xian take responsibility.","[Holy crap! Is it true?]","The eavesdropping trio: What's wrong? Why so surprised all of a sudden?","Qin Xian: Why do I have such an ominous feeling?","[Qin Xian is actually still a virgin, hahahahaha!]","Qin Xian: !!!!","The eavesdropping trio: What virgin? Our son (little brother) has had girlfriends, been married, mingled in high society, and is still a 28-year-old virgin after all that.","[Hehehehehe!]","Qin Xian's gaze wandered, his face starting to heat up uncontrollably. He could only glare at her.","What's so funny about this!","This is too much! Not only was Ji Fei laughing exaggeratedly in her mind, but her face was also about to contort from trying to hold back her laughter!","And... Qin Xian's sharp eyes suddenly swept towards the rooms far down the corridor. He seemed to hear a few muffled laughs?","The eavesdropping trio immediately moved away from the door crack.","It was their fault for eavesdropping. This was family privacy, and they didn't want to hear it. It was all accidental.","After looking up at the sky and down at the ground for a few seconds, the three still couldn't resist joining in the excitement. As soon as they looked over, they saw Qin Xian pulling Ji Fei into the room amidst a chorus of \"hehehe\" laughter.","The eavesdropping trio: ? Is something happening?","They quickly squeezed towards the door crack, but the door was closed, making it difficult to hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","At this moment, Ji Fei's inner monologue had paused, with only the sound of her startled heartbeat remaining.","She looked at Qin Xian in bewilderment as he suddenly pulled her into the room. \"What are you doing?\"","No longer hearing those annoying laughs, Qin Xian finally regained some composure. He shot Ji Fei a somewhat reproachful glance.","Quickly finding an excuse, he said, \"Writing up an investment agreement for you.\"","Although Ji Fei found it somewhat puzzling, she was satisfied with Qin Xian's efficiency in quickly settling the investment matter.","But Qin Xian was not satisfied. Although he had prevented Ji Fei from exposing his secret, he couldn't stop someone from constantly muttering in his ear.","And he was powerless to stop it, only able to redden his ear tips as he hurried to draft the agreement.","[For someone with Qin Xian's background and social circle to still be a virgin at this age, it's really hard to believe.]","[Even if he's been very self-disciplined, was his first love this pure too?]","[Could it be... he's not able to...?]","[That doesn't make sense, he has an eight-pack!]","With a slap, the printed agreement hit the table, stopping Ji Fei from continuing her shameless thoughts.","Ji Fei stared at the completed agreement, not noticing Qin Xian's iron-grey face.","She happily took the agreement back to her room and slept until the sun was high in the sky, woken by the notification of the final payment being credited to her account.","Indeed, there was 1 million.","As soon as she went downstairs, she saw Qin's Mother and Qin Yan accompanying Qin Xi and talking. Hearing movement, they all looked up.","\"Awake?\" Qin's Mother smiled kindly.","Ji Fei felt a bit embarrassed, as her original self rarely slept in. \"I was a bit tired yesterday, so I woke up late.\"","Qin's Mother and Qin Yan had complex expressions. Originally, when Ji Fei slept in, they could fantasize freely.","But at breakfast, when Qin's Mother carefully hinted about preparing some blood-nourishing food for Ji Fei, Qin Xian's face darkened as he said it wasn't necessary.","They then knew nothing had happened, so they were quite disappointed that Ji Fei sleeping in had nothing to do with Qin Xian.","Seeing everyone's expressions, Ji Fei thought to herself: [I guess sleeping in is really improper?]","Qin's Mother came back to her senses and smiled, \"You can sleep as long as you want. If you're tired, just sleep more. You young people naturally have different schedules from us.\"","Qin Yan also smiled and said, \"I used to wake up very late when I was at home too.\"","Qin Xi, who was sitting nearby, looked curiously at Qin Yan upon hearing this. After all, when he woke up this morning, he saw his mother already by his side, seemingly having been awake for a while.","Seeing her son looking at her, Qin Yan suddenly felt a bit embarrassed and said softly, \"I don't do that anymore.\"","It was just a comforting remark for Ji Fei, who naturally could feel their good intentions.","After coming downstairs, Qin's Mother asked the housekeeper to prepare some light food for Ji Fei to tide her over, as they would be having lunch together soon.","\"Today, the old man and Qin Xian won't be back for lunch, so it'll just be us accompanying little Xi,\" Qin's Mother said with a smile.","Qin Xian rarely came back for lunch anyway, especially since yesterday's incident with Secretary Jin still needed follow-up handling.","As for Qin's Father, it was rare for him to go out, so naturally, he wanted to personally handle the Li family's matters.","Ji Fei went directly to sit on the sofa.","\"Hello, Aunt,\" Qin Xi greeted obediently, his eyes still showing some uneasiness.","It was evident that Qin Xi was still not used to his new family members. Although he wore a smile, it was hard to shake off the nervous feeling.","After all, these were relatives he hadn't seen for nine years, and it would take time to adjust.","Qin's Mother and Qin Yan also noticed Qin Xi's discomfort but couldn't think of a better approach. They could only carefully show their care and draw closer, while inevitably feeling resentment towards Li Zhi and Qiao Meng, as well as regret over various what-ifs from the past.","In this situation, the atmosphere easily became awkward.","Ji Fei's eyes rolled as she had an idea.","[I found out that Qin Xi likes to play with Rubik's cubes, Lego, and models, but except for Rubik's cubes, he has only tried the others in stores. Qiao Meng said they were expensive, so she didn't buy them for him. How could she really think they were expensive? She just didn't want to waste a single penny on Qin Xi.]","Qin's Mother and Qin Yan's expressions instantly froze. They had just asked Qin Xi what he liked, and he only mentioned Rubik's Cubes.","It was probably out of habitual obedience, avoiding mentioning anything 'expensive'.","This made the two women feel even more heartbroken.","Before Ji Fei could come up with an excuse, Qin's Mother and Qin Yan seamlessly brought up how Qin Xian and their third brother Qin Zhao loved Lego and model kits, mentioning that they had a whole warehouse full of them at home.","\"Would Xiao Xi like to play with them? Do you want...\"","\"I do, I like them,\" Qin Xi immediately responded.","It wasn't just because he genuinely liked them, but more so because it was a reason that made him seem more like the Qin family members, giving him more confidence in this place.","Of course, what Qin's Mother and Qin Yan said was true. There were indeed many in the warehouse, but they wanted to make up tenfold for the nine years of lost family bonds. So not only could Qin Xi choose from the warehouse, they also had new items continuously delivered.","When Qin's Father and Qin Xian returned in the evening, the butler led them to an empty room on the first floor with a smile. Inside was a massive Lego set covering a huge area. The three women and the boy were sitting on the floor, engrossed in play.","The scene warmed the hearts of the father and son who had been tired from a long day.","After dinner, Qin's Father and Qin Xian joined the game.","A week later, many things were settled.","Qin's Father took decisive action - divorce, police reports, lawsuits, everything was arranged.","The Li Family's private hospital went bankrupt, and Li Zhi was left with enormous debts, forcing him to declare bankruptcy.","The Li family ended up on the streets. Li's Mother had come to make a scene a few times, but as they were no longer in-laws, she couldn't even get past the gates of the property.","Qin's Father wouldn't give anyone from the Li Family a chance to see Qin Yan and Qin Xi again.","Li Zhi and Qiao Meng were to be imprisoned, but because Qiao Meng was pregnant, Li Zhi showed a rare moment of backbone and took all the blame, allowing Qiao Meng to be released without charges.","But Qiao Meng wasn't moved. Whether it was because she had no hope for the future or because she felt Li Zhi had deceived her initially, Li's Mother let her guard down for a moment, and Qiao Meng miscarried and then vanished without a trace.","In the end, when disaster strikes, it's every man for himself. Upon learning of the situation, Li Zhi went mad in prison, extending his sentence.","In ten days, the Li Family disappeared from the city.","Following this, arrangements were made for Qin Xi to transfer schools and start anew. But before that, the Qin family arranged a family recognition banquet for Qin Xi.","Looking at the guest list for the banquet, Ji Fei expressed her regret.","[I know the names but can't match them to faces. Otherwise, we could've checked in advance if there was any gossip. Usually, there's plenty of juicy gossip in these wealthy circles.]","The Qin family members discussing the list on the sofa immediately had their attention diverted. After all, who could resist listening to gossip?","They had been privy to quite a bit of gossip around Ji Fei recently. They even caught wind of the butler's secret crush on the housekeeper, and had been quietly shipping them every day.","\"By the way, will that kid Qin Zhao make it? Wasn't he said to be filming in some remote mountains with no signal?\" Qin's Father asked.","The Qin family's third son, Qin Zhao, was an actor and currently a top celebrity in the entertainment industry.","Qin Xian spoke up, \"Third brother contacted me. He just got out and said he'd definitely come back. He also mentioned having something important to say.\"","At these words, the Qin family members fell silent, their expressions somewhat peculiar.","Ji Fei looked around curiously, unable to resist activating her gossip system.","[I see, Qin Zhao wants to change his betrothal. I seem to have some impression of this.]","[Originally, he was engaged to the Chu Family Eldest Daughter, but Qin Zhao has always liked the Chu Family Youngest Daughter.]","[It seems the eldest daughter has a bad reputation, while everyone praises the younger daughter.]","Hearing this, the Qin family members weren't surprised. Over the years, Qin Zhao had made his feelings quite obvious. The family didn't oppose their children choosing to love freely, but they were worried that Qin Zhao's impulsive temperament might make the situation awkward.","Since Ji Fei had confirmed that Qin Zhao's return was indeed about changing his engagement, they decided to wait for his return to discuss an appropriate way to handle it together.","As everyone was pondering this, they heard Ji Fei sigh.","[Love is truly unpredictable. When Qin Zhao was a child, he almost died. It was actually the Chu Family Eldest Daughter who saved his life, yet he fell in love with her younger sister instead of her.]","The Qin family members: ...","Wait, what did they just hear?","Wasn't it the Chu Family Youngest Daughter who saved Qin Zhao when he was young?!!!!!!!"]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: Twins","paragraphs":["On the day of the banquet.","Qin Xian returned early to make preparations.","In the room specially reserved for the whole family to get ready, Qin Xian saw Ji Fei after she had finished her makeup and styling.","Today's Ji Fei was particularly different. In the past, she liked heavy makeup and would adorn herself with all sorts of glamorous accessories, as striking as the most eye-catching rose in a garden, as if she wouldn't be satisfied until she saw amazement in his eyes.","But today, Ji Fei was simple and elegant, wearing a light and graceful pale yellow long dress with a pearl necklace. Her waterfall-like long hair was styled with just a slight curl, the overall look light and lively.","Seeing him approach, she lifted her dress and quickly walked over.","\"Mom just instructed us to go out together to greet the guests.\"","Qin Xian nodded, noticing Ji Fei looking him up and down, about to question her.","[Hmm, he's already very handsome, probably doesn't need any styling.]","Qin Xian's expression became slightly unnatural. He never intended to do any styling anyway, unlike his third brother.","Qin Xian concealed his embarrassment and said, \"Let's go.\"","As they were about to leave, they encountered Qin Yan bringing Qin Xi in for styling.","Both Qin Yan and Qin Xi were amazed by Ji Fei's appearance.","Qin Yan smiled, \"Look how beautiful your second aunt is.\"","Qin Xi obediently nodded, \"Mm, beautiful.\"","Ji Fei felt a bit embarrassed being praised, and to avoid awkwardness, she decided to shift the focus. Looking down at Qin Xi, she asked, \"Am I more beautiful, or is your mom more beautiful?\"","Qin Xi indeed blushed, \"Mom is the most beautiful.\"","Qin Yan was touched and stroked her son's head. Perhaps due to their blood relation, the distance between mother and son had quickly decreased in recent days, and they were now as close as if the previous nine years of separation had never happened.","As for Li Zhi and Qiao Meng, it was their fault for giving too little love, so Qin Xi had accepted the change quickly and now only occasionally thought of them.","\"By the way, Rong Rong's sketching trip is a rare opportunity, so she definitely can't come back,\" Qin Yan said helplessly. \"She apologized to me via video call earlier and sent a gift for Xiao Xi.\"","Qin Rong, the fourth daughter of the family, is currently in university and is now sketching on the other side of the world.","Qin Xian indicated that he understood.","Then Qin Xian led Ji Fei to the main entrance to wait for guests.","As guests arrived successively, Ji Fei noticed that many gazes lingered on her, with more malice than goodwill.","Most were scrutinizing, examining, and hostile looks.","After all, the previous incident with Qin Corporation had caused quite a stir. Not only did they hold a large meeting to officially clarify matters, but they also dismissed a batch of employees, especially Ji Fei's agent who was directly blacklisted and asked for compensation.","This was seen as Qin Xian fully supporting his wife, with whom he had a seemingly loveless marriage.","At the time, many observers thought they would surely divorce, and quite a few young ladies from wealthy families were waiting to marry this generation's most excellent and promising heir, even if it meant being his second wife.","Various marriage alliance plans were probably in these guests' minds.","[Too bad the queen hasn't abdicated, your plans have come to nothing, haha!]","Qin Xian's eyebrows twitched slightly as he listened to Ji Fei's gloating and arrogant inner thoughts while outwardly maintaining his composure as he greeted and entertained guests.","Soon, the Chu family arrived.","However, instead of the expected four people, only three showed up.","Behind the middle-aged couple was a woman with a plain expression. While others arrived with a hint of a smile, she seemed uninterested in her surroundings, exuding an out-of-place cold aura.","Her dress was primarily black, with straight long black hair. She wore no accessories at all, completely unadorned, not at all like a young lady from a wealthy family.","\"Ah, Qin Xian, long time no see. You've become even more outstanding,\" Mr. Chu stepped forward and warmly greeted Qin Xian.","Mrs. Chu also smiled and chimed in, like many snobbish ladies, focusing their enthusiasm solely on Qin Xian while completely ignoring Ji Fei.","Ji Fei didn't mind and curiously observed them.","After facial recognition, it became easier to gossip.","Her gaze swept to the woman behind them. The woman met her gaze and nodded politely.","\"Are you Chu Xinyue or Chu Xueqi?\" Ji Fei asked straightforwardly.","Although she remembered seeing this face before in her memories, she wasn't familiar enough to distinguish between them.","After all... they were twin sisters.","Perhaps it was the first time someone had asked so directly without any pretense. Chu Xinyue was taken aback, and Mr. and Mrs. Chu beside her also looked over in surprise.","\"I'm Chu Xinyue.\"","\"Oh, the Chu family's eldest daughter. Where's the second daughter? Didn't she come with you?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","A hint of gloom flashed in Chu Xinyue's eyes, and her voice lowered, \"Someone is bringing her.\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu seemed to notice something off in Chu Xinyue's tone and immediately gave her a displeased glance. Then they smiled, as if showing off, \"Our Xueqi is filming. She definitely wouldn't have made it if she came with us, so...\"","Before they could finish, a sports car drove in.","The guests' cars were all parked outside; only the Qin family's own cars were allowed to drive in.","As the car door opened, a pair of long legs stepped out, followed by a fashionably dressed man who looked like he was walking on a runway.","Taking off his sunglasses, he revealed a face that was about 60-70% similar to Qin Xian's, with a bit less dignity and more arrogance.","Probably to look good on camera, his figure was slimmer than Qin Xian's, but he was still a perfect clothes hanger. It could only be said that the Qin family had good genes.","Due to the charm of a top celebrity, many young guests gathered around gossiping.","\"Wow! It's Qin Zhao. I just finished watching his drama. He's so handsome!\"","\"I've become his fan. I'll ask for a photo with him later.\"","\"Too bad he's taken, otherwise...\"","\"Sigh, I just heard that the one who came with her parents is Qin Zhao's nominal fiancée, Chu Xinyue. So, who do you think is in the passenger seat...\"","There was no need to guess further, as Qin Zhao had already gentlemanly opened the passenger door. Not only that, but he also bent down into the car to help a woman out.","The woman also had long black hair and a face identical to Chu Xinyue's, but she was wearing a pure white long dress, with a delicate and gentle expression.","\"Thank you, Brother Chao.\"","\"Be careful, I've got you.\"","There were quite a few guests coming and going, and in high society, there were hardly any secrets. So everyone started whispering with a look of anticipation for drama.","The Chu couple immediately noticed that their younger daughter seemed unwell and rushed over worriedly, treating her like their precious treasure.","\"Darling, what's wrong? Are you hurt?\" Mrs. Chu asked concernedly.","\"It's nothing, I just twisted my ankle a bit while filming. It's not serious, really. Brother Chao is just being overly cautious,\" Chu Xueqi explained shyly.","\"Oh my, I told you not to work too hard on set. What if you really got hurt? Let me help...\" Before Mr. Chu could finish, Mrs. Chu elbowed him.","Qin Zhao didn't notice and continued supporting Chu Xueqi, saying, \"Let's go inside first. Xueqi can't stand for long.\"","Then the group escorted Chu Xueqi over.","Meanwhile, Chu Xinyue was left standing there like an invisible person, neither going forward to show concern for her sister nor looking at her fiancé's overly intimate behavior with her sister.","She seemed to be used to it.","Ji Fei looked back and forth curiously until the group came over.","The Chu couple's faces flashed with a hint of discomfort when they finally noticed Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao frowned, and suddenly the woman he was supporting seemed to be frightened and tried to push away his support.","\"Sister, you're here. Please don't misunderstand. Brother Chao only picked me up because I was injured. There's nothing else going on. Please... please... don't be angry.\" As she spoke, she shrank back, seemingly very afraid of Chu Xinyue.","This changed everyone's perception. They had heard rumors that Chu Xinyue often bullied her sister, and now it seemed to be true, judging by how scared Chu Xueqi appeared.","Qin Zhao held onto Chu Xueqi's arm, not letting her retreat, as if deliberately showing his stance in front of Chu Xinyue. He warned in a low voice, \"Don't scare her. This is the Qin family's house. If you dare to bully Xueqi, I won't show you any courtesy.\"","Chu Xinyue didn't even look at Qin Zhao, only a bitter, mocking smile tugged at the corner of her mouth.","\"Xinyue, your sister is injured, and you don't even care to show concern. Who are you putting on that cold face for?\" Mrs. Chu said disapprovingly.","\"Alright, stop making a scene at someone else's home. It's embarrassing. Let's all go in,\" Mr. Chu said in a deep voice.","Qin Zhao stopped paying attention to Chu Xinyue, nodded to his second brother, and was about to lead everyone inside. He didn't notice his second brother's disapproving expression.","Just as he was about to step forward, he heard a distinctive voice that stood out from the rest. Judging by the tone, it seemed to be his second sister-in-law, whom he didn't particularly like.","That Ji Fei who had tricked his second brother.","[Oh crap, did I just go temporarily blind? It happened right in front of me, but how come I didn't see anything?]","[Angry, scary, cold face, throwing a tantrum? Are they talking about Chu Xinyue? It seems Chu Xinyue didn't even exchange a single glance with them from start to finish, did she?]","[Are they just slapping labels on her without reason?]","[Little one, do you have a lot of question marks?]","Qin Zhao: ...No, I have a lot of question marks!","Is this Ji Fei talking?!","How come I didn't see her mouth move?!","And what nonsense is she spouting?!"]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Green Tea Rank","paragraphs":["Qin Xian heard Ji Fei's stream of complaints and saw Qin Zhao stop in his tracks, looking back with an expression as if he'd seen a ghost. Qin Xian immediately understood the situation.","Before Qin Zhao could speak, Qin Xian said, \"Ah Chao, stay and help your second brother entertain the guests.\"","Qin Xian's tone was deep, and although it wasn't an order, it instinctively diverted attention.","\"I'll help Xueqi inside first, she has difficulty moving...\" Before Qin Zhao could finish, that noisy voice appeared again.","[This guy must be an idiot, right? Her parents and sister are all there, why does he need to help her? Even if he were her boyfriend, it wouldn't be necessary. Especially given how awkward the situation is now.]","[Qin Xian is clearly reminding him that this behavior is inappropriate. Does his brain go on vacation when facing the girl he likes?]","[It must, otherwise he wouldn't have been so blind as to mindlessly antagonize Chu Xinyue earlier.]","Qin Zhao was stunned by the barrage of criticism, feeling a rush of shame and anger. He turned to Ji Fei and angrily said, \"You...\"","\"Huh?\" Ji Fei was confused.","Ji Fei thought Qin Zhao was greeting her, albeit in an unfriendly tone.","However, based on her memory, Ji Fei indeed didn't get along well with the hot-tempered third brother.","Qin Zhao had always admired his second brother since childhood. Because of Qin Xian's marriage, Qin Zhao harbored a lot of ill will towards Ji Fei, who was close to his age. So even though they both worked in the entertainment industry, Qin Zhao had no desire to look out for Ji Fei, and wouldn't even call her \"second sister-in-law\" in public or private.","It was only due to his upbringing that Qin Zhao hadn't openly confronted Ji Fei.","Qin Zhao hadn't expected Ji Fei to dare speak about him like that.","\"Brother Chao?\" Chu Xueqi, not understanding the situation, saw Qin Zhao lingering. From her angle, she couldn't see that Qin Zhao was glaring at Ji Fei, and thought he was looking at Chu Xinyue beside her.","Chu Xueqi immediately bit her lower lip in a hurt manner and pushed Qin Zhao, saying, \"Brother Chao, you should stay with my sister. I'll be fine on my own.\"","Chu Xinyue had actually been very quiet all this time, but at this moment she finally couldn't help but speak up, \"It was the second young master Qin who asked the third young master Qin to stay and entertain guests. Why are you bringing me into this?\"","Chu Xueqi was instantly choked up, looking at Chu Xinyue in shock, her eyes immediately reddening as if deeply hurt.","\"What kind of attitude is that!\"","\"Do you only feel better when you're bullying your sister? We shouldn't have brought you out!\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu seemed to react reflexively, their tempers flaring up.","Qin Zhao, however, was stunned. He didn't notice the crying girl beside him and turned his head to meet those cold, clear eyes.","Wait, did she just call him \"third young master Qin\"? Hadn't she always called him Qin Zhao?","Qin Zhao felt an inexplicable sense of discomfort rising within him, only to be interrupted by a certain voice.","[Oh my, my temper! Even though I'm not close to Chu Xinyue, I really can't stand by and watch this anymore.]","\"Just now, my husband only asked Qin Zhao to stay, right? He didn't mention Chu Xinyue. Why did you bring her up? Do you have any suggestions?\" Ji Fei asked, not in an accusatory tone, but rather with a sincere attitude of 'I don't understand, please explain'.","They say sincerity is the ultimate weapon, don't they?","With Ji Fei's question, everyone present fell silent. The atmosphere suddenly became strange, and many people realized what was happening.","That's right, how did this suddenly come up?","Asking Qin Zhao to stay and entertain guests couldn't possibly mean asking Chu Xinyue to stay as well, so how did it become Qin Zhao accompanying Chu Xinyue in Chu Xueqi's words?","The Chu family, feeling a surge of anger, instinctively felt that Ji Fei was being unkind to Chu Xueqi and wanted to refute something.","But then Qin Xian suddenly said, \"I think everyone has misunderstood something. I indeed only mentioned my third brother.\"","He then glanced at the eager Ji Fei. That \"my husband\" she just said certainly sounded better than \"ex-husband brother\".","The unexpected tacit understanding between the two immediately made Chu Xueqi blush. For a moment, she was at a loss for words and could only look helplessly towards Qin Zhao with an innocent face.","Qin Zhao was also stunned.","\"Besides, your sister was just correcting your statement earlier. How did it turn into her bullying you? What grievance did you suffer?\" Ji Fei's gaze swept from Chu Xueqi to the Chu family. \"Having your father publicly reprimand your sister puts us, the host family, in a difficult position. If there's any conflict, shall we help resolve it?\"","Chu Xueqi, who had always sailed smoothly through life, seemed to have stumbled invisibly. She was dumbfounded.","The Chu family was also stunned, wondering how things had turned out this way. They looked at Qin Xian in bewilderment.","Qin Xian asked expressionlessly, \"Have we been remiss in our hospitality?\"","The Chu family's expressions became awkward. They instinctively wanted to vent their anger at Chu Xinyue, but remembering what had just happened, they couldn't.","The next moment, Ji Fei smiled cheerfully at Chu Xueqi and said in a very friendly manner, \"Also, you said something incorrect earlier. What do you mean by letting Qin Zhao accompany Chu Xinyue and that you'll be fine on your own? You can't say things like that carelessly.\"","Everyone was stunned. From these words, it seemed as if Ji Fei was representing the Qin family in acknowledging Qin Zhao and Chu Xueqi as a couple, telling Chu Xueqi not to say such self-deprecating things?","Chu Xueqi also momentarily forgot about the previous conflict and looked at Ji Fei with some expectation.","Ji Fei immediately said earnestly, \"Your parents are right there, how can you not see them? If not them, you still have your own sister! They certainly won't leave you alone!\"","Alone... alone... Chu Xueqi had just said she would be fine on her own.","This... was a bit too...","The expressions of the onlookers changed several times.","Someone in the crowd finally couldn't help but say, \"Isn't this green tea behavior?\"","\"I... I'm not!\" Chu Xueqi finally became anxious, her eyes immediately filling with tears. Just as she was about to say something, Ji Fei patted her on the shoulder.","This also stopped her tears.","Ji Fei said approvingly, \"Very good, you've realized you're not alone.\"","Chu Xueqi's face immediately cycled through various colors.","[Hahaha, this little green tea's level is too low, right? Her words don't even have logic. It's too easy to catch her loopholes. But it's also possible that everyone around her has been blindly pampering her, so she thinks she can get whatever she wants just by saying anything. But sorry, I'm an expert at identifying green tea behavior!]","Qin Zhao looked at everything in astonishment, wondering what had just happened.","Ji Fei felt free to make a fuss, while Qin Xian was responsible for wrapping things up.","Just as Chu Xueqi was about to perform a big cry to salvage everything, Qin Xian directly bowed and made a gesture of invitation, ending it all.","The Chu family felt as if they had a bellyful of inexplicable anger, and in a daze, they were passively led into the hall with Chu Xueqi.","Chu Xinyue, who was the last to leave, looked at them before leaving. There was a glimmer of light in her eyes, and a vague sense of being moved spilled from her gaze.","It seemed like the first time she had encountered such a situation, and she didn't know how to react.","After everyone had left, Qin Zhao finally came to his senses. \"What were you two doing just now? Xueqi is so innocent, she definitely didn't mean it. It was just a slip of the tongue. Why did you have to embarrass her like that?\"","In Qin Zhao's view, they liked each other, but because of the engagement with Chu Xinyue, they were like true love being obstructed. It was understandable for Chu Xueqi to occasionally feel insecure and make mistakes in her behavior.","\"So Chu Xinyue, who did nothing, deserves to be embarrassed?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","Qin Zhao was choked. \"Chu Xinyue often makes Xueqi cry. It's not a big deal for her to be embarrassed once!\"","Ji Fei looked at Qin Zhao in surprise, then turned to Qin Xian.","[Is he really your brother?]","Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, Qin Xian felt a bit angry. He was indeed his brother.","Qin Xian looked at Qin Zhao with dissatisfaction. \"Ah Chao, our parents didn't teach us to judge people unfairly. You can be biased and favor someone, but you should understand the principle of judging things on their own merits.\"","Although Qin Zhao was in his twenties, he instinctively felt a tremor in his heart when faced with his second brother's reprimand. He obediently listened to the lecture, but his eyes revealed dissatisfaction.","[I think he's hard to understand. Does the Qin family really have a naive gene? Three parts tears for green tea, and he cries when she acts. Were those acting awards he won bought by the Qin family? How can he not see that the green tea is acting?]","\"Hey, you...\" Qin Zhao finally couldn't hold back and wanted to speak.","[It's over. He likes green tea so much, if he marries a green tea in the future, won't the Qin family become a theater every day? Although we're not afraid, it would be annoying to death. I don't want to be sisters-in-law with someone like this. Maybe I should find a way to divorce Qin Xian earlier.]","The words got stuck in Qin Zhao's throat, and he looked at his brother in astonishment.","How could this shameless woman who was desperate to marry his brother even consider divorce?","Wait, what exactly did he hear?","Qin Xian's mouth twitched as he coughed, interrupting Ji Fei's wild thoughts.","\"Leave this to me and Qin Zhao. You can go in,\" Qin Xian said.","Ji Fei nodded immediately.","[Great, time to go in and watch the drama unfold.]","Watching Ji Fei's cheerful silhouette, Qin Zhao pressed his temples with trembling fingers, looking at Qin Xian with eyes full of questions.","Qin Xian didn't beat around the bush. Taking advantage of the current lack of customers, he briefly disclosed Ji Fei's situation.","Qin Zhao stood dumbfounded for a while before speaking, \"Should we get a therapist for our whole family? No, we should invite a spiritual master...\"","Qin Xian's cold gaze deterred Qin Zhao's idea.","Qin Zhao pouted and asked curiously, \"So she really knows everything?\"","Qin Xian: \"For now, she can know whatever she wants to know.\"","\"Huh, is she the most formidable paparazzi in the entertainment industry?\" Qin Zhao still maintained a skeptical attitude.","Qin Xian's gaze flickered, \"Are you planning to talk about changing the marriage arrangement today?\"","Qin Zhao was stunned and said, \"Uh, yeah, but don't worry. It won't disrupt my little nephew's family reunion party. I've told the Chu family to stay until the end so we can discuss it privately between our two families.\"","Qin Xian nodded to show he understood.","Qin Zhao asked cautiously, \"Everyone's okay with it, right?\"","\"Are you sure you want Chu Xueqi, not Chu Xinyue?\" Qin Xian asked.","Chu Xinyue's gaze flashed through Qin Zhao's mind, causing him discomfort. But he said, \"Of course. Xueqi is too fragile and needs my protection. Chu Xinyue... she's jealous of her sister and treats Xueqi poorly. I don't like that about her.\"","After speaking, Qin Zhao saw Qin Xian's expressionless face and inexplicably felt a lack of confidence.","\"You don't know how much Xueqi has suffered because of those twins' faces. I...\"","Qin Xian interrupted directly, \"You're responsible for your own life. It's good that you've decided.\"","Qin Zhao choked, feeling slightly resentful.","Turning his head, through the floor-to-ceiling glass of the reception room, he saw Chu Xinyue in a black dress standing alone in the corner beyond the bustling crowd, looking down at the wine glass in her hand, lost in thought.","Suddenly, Chu Xinyue looked up towards the outside.","Qin Zhao instinctively averted his gaze.","They were about to break off the engagement, so why was his heart inexplicably racing?"]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: He made a mistake, he deserves it","paragraphs":["Qin Zhao's thoughts were a bit chaotic. After perfunctorily accompanying his Second Brother to greet guests for a while, he slipped away.","Qin Xian didn't bother with him, after all, keeping him there was just to discuss Ji Fei's matter.","On the other side, Chu Xinyue watched as her parents constantly praised Chu Xueqi in their social circle, completely ignoring her. She had long since become numb to it.","However, there was an uncomfortable gaze lingering on her.","She looked around, but there were too many people to identify who it was. She could only leave her spot and go to the restroom for a brief reprieve.","The restroom for guests arranged by the Qin Family was at the end of the corridor, with separate facilities for men and women.","Just as Chu Xinyue was about to enter the women's restroom, a powerful force from behind violently pushed her in.","\"Ah!\" Chu Xinyue cried out in shock, but her mouth was quickly covered.","Soon after, Chu Xinyue found herself pinned against the restroom wall by a man.","Only then did she clearly see who it was – a young master from one of the wealthy families. She had seen him a few times but couldn't say she knew him.","Chu Xinyue glared at him angrily.","The man, provoked by her gaze, reached out to tear at her dress.","\"You bitch, still playing coy with me? I'll show you today, I don't care whose fiancée you are, I'm still going to...\"","Chu Xinyue heard the sound of her dress tearing. She never imagined she'd find herself in such a situation. Her mind went blank, unable to cry out, her eyes reddening with urgency, only able to struggle desperately.","Feeling the man's breath on her neck, Chu Xinyue began to cry.","In her moment of despair, the door was suddenly flung open with a bang.","\"Damn it, you're asking for death!\"","In an instant, Chu Xinyue felt the pressure on her ease. She collapsed to the ground in disarray, helplessly looking up.","She saw Qin Zhao gripping the man's neck, his face full of rage. With one punch, the man spun around.","When Qin Zhao turned to meet Chu Xinyue's gaze and saw her torn dress exposing her pale thighs, he quickly averted his eyes. \"Fix yourself up,\" he said, tossing his jacket towards her.","He then dragged the man out of the restroom.","Qin Zhao was furious, his fists clenching and unclenching. An inexplicable anger surged within him.","Still rational enough not to make a scene, he dragged the man directly to a deserted backyard and threw him to the ground, kicking him several times.","When the man came to his senses, he quickly shouted, \"Qin Zhao, are you crazy? You're actually protecting her? Aren't you involved with her sister? You don't even acknowledge her as your fiancée. What, are you here to catch us in the act?\"","Qin Zhao's face darkened instantly. \"Regardless of who she is to me, this can't happen in our Qin Family. She wasn't willing, and you were trying to force her!\"","\"Damn it, you don't know shit! That was just a lovers' quarrel between us, marital fun!\"","Qin Zhao was momentarily stunned.","\"What... what did you say?\"","The man got up from the ground, sneering, \"I'm not the one cuckolding you. That slut actively seduced me into bed. We dated for three months, then she dumped me. How could I not come looking for an explanation?\"","Qin Zhao's expression changed drastically. Instinctively, he raised his hand to grip the man's throat. \"Say that again!\"","The man also became angry. \"What the hell, you didn't want her, so others can't have her? What's with this jealousy act!\"","Qin Zhao's eyes bulged with rage. He was about to strike when he was suddenly stopped by the butler who appeared out of nowhere.","\"Oh my, young master, how can you hit a guest? Let's talk this out calmly.\"","The butler quickly separated the two, seeming to realize that Qin Zhao was truly angry. He hastily led the troublemaking man away.","\"Young master, please go back to entertain the guests. Everyone has arrived, and the Second Young Master is looking for you.\"","Qin Zhao stood there dazed, his emotions tumultuous. When he came to his senses and looked back, he saw Chu Xinyue standing there, clutching his clothes, her face pale and lost in thought.","Qin Zhao, with a gloomy face, was about to walk past her and leave.","Suddenly, Chu Xinyue spoke up: \"It wasn't me!\"","Qin Zhao looked over to see Chu Xinyue seemingly gathering her courage, looking at him as if facing certain death, and said, \"It's Chu Xueqi, it must be her again, it's her causing trouble again...\"","\"Chu Xinyue!\" Qin Zhao shouted.","Chu Xinyue was startled. When she saw the look in Qin Zhao's eyes, it was like a bucket of cold water had been poured over her.","Qin Zhao sneered, \"Let's forget about those previous times, but for such an outrageous thing, you still want to pin it on Xueqi!\"","The color gradually drained from Chu Xinyue's face, the light fading from her eyes. She wanted to say that the previous incidents weren't her doing either, but... she couldn't.","Qin Zhao laughed coldly, \"To think that Xueqi has always felt guilty towards you because of our relationship, and out of respect for our engagement, we've never officially dated. Now I feel it's completely undeserved.\"","\"Chu Xinyue, I don't care whether you like me or not, but ever since Xueqi risked her life to save me when we were children, she's been the only one in my heart. So... let's break off our engagement. The only person I want to marry is Chu Xueqi.\"","The light in Chu Xinyue's eyes completely disappeared, and the clothes she was holding slipped to the ground.","Although she had long known this day would come, it still cut her to the core.","\"So you knew I liked you,\" Chu Xinyue suddenly said.","Qin Zhao no longer looked at Chu Xinyue.","Chu Xinyue gave a bitter laugh and said, \"Don't worry, it won't happen again. I agree to break off the engagement.\"","Indeed, apart from her grandmother, everyone in this world – be it her father, mother, or that little boy who said he would marry her and protect her forever – would only believe in and choose Chu Xueqi.","Hearing Chu Xinyue's response, Qin Zhao felt a strange twinge in his heart, but he still couldn't help saying, \"It's good that you're willing to cooperate. I'm warning you, if you ever try to harm Xueqi again, I won't consider...\"","[Tsk tsk tsk, this is heading towards a disaster!]","A sudden voice interrupted Qin Zhao's words.","Qin Zhao, still not used to hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, instinctively looked in the direction of the voice.","He saw Ji Fei and Qin Xian standing in the corridor behind Chu Xinyue.","The two seemed to have come together to look for someone.","Before Qin Zhao could speak, Qin Xian frowned and said, \"What happened? Why are you making a scene here? Didn't we agree to handle this matter later?\"","Qin Xian and Ji Fei had arrived late and only heard Qin Zhao yelling at Chu Xinyue about breaking off the engagement. They didn't know what had happened earlier.","Qin Zhao frowned slightly but still didn't mention the incident in the restroom, as it was too damaging to one's reputation.","\"Nothing,\" Qin Zhao said defiantly.","Qin Xian's gaze swept over, naturally noticing that Chu Xinyue's dress was damaged. Though not indecent, it was unseemly.","He lowered his head and softly said to Ji Fei, \"Take her upstairs to change clothes.\"","Ji Fei had noticed too and nodded.","As she was about to lead Chu Xinyue away, she saw Chu Xinyue's numb expression and couldn't help but glare at Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao felt provoked and wanted to ask her what she was looking at.","Then he heard: [He just said that from the moment Chu Xueqi saved him, she's been the only one in his heart. Should I find a way to tell this fool that he's got the wrong savior? It was Chu Xinyue who saved him back then, not Chu Xueqi.]","[Seeing how stubborn he is, I'm not sure I want to tell him. He got it wrong, he deserves it.]","Hearing this, Qin Zhao's mind went blank for a moment, followed by a sense of anger at having his cherished memories mocked. He was about to yell at Ji Fei, having already drawn in a breath.","Just then, he heard Qin Xian coldly say, \"Qin Zhao, shut up.\"","Qin Zhao froze, looking at Qin Xian in disbelief.","Ji Fei, not understanding the situation, still led away Chu Xinyue, who no longer cared about anything else.","After the two left, Qin Zhao finally couldn't hold back. He angrily pointed in the direction Ji Fei had gone and said, \"Second Brother! Did you hear...\"","Qin Xian frowned slightly, \"You said you want to marry Chu Xueqi. If the person who saved you as a child was Chu Xinyue and not Chu Xueqi, would your decision be the same?\"","Qin Zhao widened his eyes in disbelief, thinking he must have misheard. But even hallucinations shouldn't produce such absurd words.","\"Second Brother, Ji Fei has gone mad, and you're going mad with her?\"","Qin Xian just looked at him silently, not saying a word.","Seeing that Qin Xian's expression didn't seem to be joking, Qin Zhao couldn't hold back anymore.","\"I was there. How could I not know who saved me? Besides, the Chu couple and Xueqi, and even Chu Xinyue, all know it was Xueqi who saved me! Even Chu Xinyue has never denied it! How could this be wrong?!\" Qin Zhao found it utterly absurd.","It was precisely because they knew Qin Zhao would react this way that the Qin Family hadn't immediately informed him about the mistake in identifying his lifesaver.","The Qin Family completely believed Ji Fei's account. It must have been the truth.","However, the incident was too far in the past to verify, unless the person involved refuted everything themselves.","So they planned to get through today's banquet first, and when Qin Zhao brought up the matter of the engagement, they would raise this issue and let Qin Zhao make his own decision.","In Qin Xian's view, regardless of how much weight this false impression held in his brother's mind, he shouldn't choose his life partner based on a misconception.","They just hadn't expected it to come to light so soon.","Qin Zhao's emotions were about to explode, and he suddenly blurted out, \"Could it be that Chu Xinyue is dissatisfied again and trying to claim the credit for saving me back then? Does she think I'll choose her this way? Ha! Impossible!\"","\"Don't flatter yourself. It's just a secret your sister-in-law knows. As for whether it's a mistake, we can ask for clarification in person later, but you need to think about who you'd choose if it turns out to be wrong,\" Qin Xian said directly.","\"I love Xueqi for her pure and kind nature. Even without the life-saving grace, I would... I would still choose Xueqi!\"","Qin Xian frowned. He wasn't sure about Chu Xinyue's character, but Chu Xueqi was definitely not a kind-hearted person.","It was so frustrating that his brother was so blind! Suddenly, he felt that Ji Fei's words made sense, \"If he's wrong, he deserves it.\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Start Eating Melon","paragraphs":["When Chu Xinyue came out after changing her clothes, Ji Fei wanted to say something but didn't know how to begin.","Having just learned about Chu Xinyue's experiences through the Gossip System, Ji Fei felt a lump in her throat.","Ji Fei had grown up without a family and thought her life was miserable, but she never imagined that Chu Xinyue, who had both parents and came from a wealthy family, would live a life even more painful than her own as an orphan.","Though they were twins, just because Chu Xueqi was born weak and sickly, the Chu couple had to take their child abroad for treatment and recovery.","Chu Xinyue was also brought along, but the couple had limited energy and devoted all their attention to Chu Xueqi, who was often in critical condition.","Several times they completely forgot about Chu Xinyue, and although she was cared for by servants, it inevitably led to various problems, big and small.","At that time, the family matriarch was Chu's Grandma. When she heard that her eldest granddaughter was being neglected like this, she immediately decided to bring the child back and raise her personally.","So Chu Xinyue left her parents at a young age and was raised by Chu's Grandma, naturally becoming distant from her parents.","Chu Xueqi, on the other hand, received abundant love from childhood, even to the point of being spoiled. With her sister rarely around, she grew accustomed to having everything to herself.","When her health improved and she was brought back home, she couldn't tolerate someone who looked like her clone taking away what belonged to her.","And so began Chu Xinyue's tragic life.","It seemed that since that family of three returned, Chu Xinyue had never truly smiled at home. The fact that she didn't become depressed was a testament to her inner strength, as she immersed herself in study and research.","The two of them went downstairs together.","Ji Fei couldn't help but ask, \"Are you really determined to break off the engagement with Qin Zhao?\"","According to the gossip provided by the system, Chu Xinyue had had Qin Zhao in her eyes and heart since she was five years old.","Although Ji Fei couldn't understand what was so great about that arrogant guy.","But this time, Chu Xinyue nodded without hesitation.","She had given up.","Ji Fei thought for a moment and said, \"That's good. He doesn't deserve you. You're so outstanding, you'll be happier if you break away from these awful people.\"","Chu Xinyue was startled and looked at Ji Fei in surprise. She hadn't expected Ji Fei to hit the nail on the head.","Not just Qin Zhao, but her father, mother, and sister - she had completely given up on all of them. She planned to find an opportunity to sever ties with her family and have no further contact.","In this life, she only wished for her own life to no longer be disrupted by Chu Xueqi.","\"Thank you, I will,\" Chu Xinyue said with a faint smile.","Arriving at the banquet hall, it was just the Chu family's turn to congratulate Qin Yan.","However, that family of three seemed to have forgotten they had another daughter.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu supported Chu Xueqi on either side.","\"Congratulations on finding little Xi. Our elder niece has finally found happiness after suffering. Congratulations, congratulations.\"","\"Sister Yan, little Xi, congratulations to you both. When I heard about this from Brother Qin earlier, I was so upset I cried. Thankfully, heaven has eyes and blessed good people like Sister Yan.\"","\"Oh, and Xueqi brought a gift...\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu tried their best to put Chu Xueqi in the spotlight, but because of the lie about the life-saving benefactor, the Qin family felt somewhat uncomfortable facing them.","\"Oh? Where's Xinyue?\" Qin's Mother asked.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu were taken aback, as if they had just realized Chu Xinyue wasn't there.","\"This girl, she's so ill-mannered. Who knows where she's run off to,\" Mrs. Chu said impatiently, feeling that Chu Xinyue had embarrassed them and reluctant to mention this ungrateful daughter.","Chu Xueqi looked at Qin Zhao in the distance. Since Qin Zhao had returned earlier, he had been wearing a gloomy expression. Chu Xueqi knew him well enough to understand that his mood was very bad at the moment.","She suspected that Chu Xinyue might have shamelessly clung to Qin Zhao, causing a conflict, and now didn't dare to show her face.","Thinking of this, Chu Xueqi couldn't help but feel smug inside. She curled her lips slightly, but her tone was concerned as she said, \"Should I go look for my sister? She must be upset. I'll go find her and bring her back.\"","Her obedient manner made the absent Chu Xinyue seem unreasonable by comparison.","\"Our Xueqi is so good. Don't worry about your sister, she's always throwing tantrums and sulking. Your foot injury hasn't healed yet, don't move around,\" Mr. Chu said lovingly, patting Chu Xueqi's head.","But the next second, a voice rang out.","\"Oh my, I just took you to change clothes, how did it...\" Ji Fei's voice trailed off, causing everyone to look over.","They saw Ji Fei, the hostess, standing beside Chu Xinyue.","Chu Xinyue's modest black dress had been replaced by a sky-blue cocktail dress that perfectly complemented her snow-white skin.","Chu Xinyue looked expressionlessly at her family members who had just been criticizing her.","The atmosphere suddenly became awkward.","It was then that Qin Xian spoke up, \"A guest's dress got wet by accident, so I asked my wife to help her take care of it.\"","\"Why didn't you say so earlier?\" Qin's Mother asked.","Qin Xian glanced at the three members of the Chu family and said, \"I couldn't get a word in.\"","This statement immediately made the three Chu family members blush with embarrassment.","After all, they had been the ones talking non-stop earlier, directly accusing Chu Xinyue without giving anyone else a chance to speak.","Feeling the curious and mocking gazes around her, Chu Xueqi wished she could dig a hole and bury herself.","Why had everything gone so wrong since coming to the Qin Family?","It was all Chu Xinyue's fault.","Chu Xueqi glared at Chu Xinyue as she approached, and could only try to save face by saying, \"Sister, so you were just changing clothes. I thought you were angry with me.\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu also blamed this embarrassment on Chu Xinyue, thinking it was her fault for changing clothes.","But this time, when Chu Xinyue returned, she coldly stared at Chu Xueqi, the anger in her eyes seeming about to burst into flames.","Chu Xueqi's heart trembled. After some thought, she wondered if Qin Zhao had discussed the engagement with Chu Xinyue, which was why Chu Xinyue was so angry now.","Chu Xueqi could barely suppress the smile at the corners of her mouth, only subtly flashing a smug expression at Chu Xinyue.","If it weren't someone else's party, Chu Xinyue probably wouldn't have held back anymore.","What had happened in the bathroom just now, Chu Xinyue was certain it had something to do with Chu Xueqi. She didn't know when she had been forced to take the blame for Chu Xueqi again.","Chu Xinyue suppressed her anger and sat down without a word.","The Chu family ignored her and continued socializing.","Qin Zhao, who had been distracted earlier, only came to his senses when he saw Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao's expression kept changing, his mind in complete chaos.","It's impossible, the person who saved me as a child was clearly...","\"Hey, what are Mr. and Mrs. Chu's first names?\"","Qin Zhao turned his head to see Ji Fei quietly asking Qin Xian.","After Qin Xian answered, their whole family, except for Qin Xi, sat up straight. Although they were still making small talk on the surface, their eyes couldn't hide their burning curiosity. Their bodies even unconsciously leaned towards Ji Fei's direction.","What were they doing?","[I see, I was wondering how they could have mistaken the life-saving benefactor. So it was that family of three working together to deceive people.]","The Qin family members also speculated that this was the case, but it didn't make sense. How could Chu Xinyue not know?","Qin Zhao's expression changed several times as he secretly glared angrily at Ji Fei. He wanted to see how Ji Fei would spread rumors."]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Changing Partners for Love","paragraphs":["[Thinking about it this way, this was the first time Chu Xueqi had taken something that belonged to Chu Xinyue.]","Qin Zhao's expression changed slightly as he secretly glanced at Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao and Chu Xinyue were classmates in China. The summer camp where the incident occurred happened to be in the country where Chu Xueqi was receiving medical treatment.","Although Qin Zhao was only about ten years old at the time, he was already engaged to Chu Xinyue due to an agreement between their grandmothers. Naturally, he was supposed to meet the Chu family members.","That was the first time Qin Zhao saw Chu Xueqi, who lived in a hospital room but was as exquisite as a little princess.","[Because it was the first time Chu Xueqi had seen such a handsome boy like Qin Zhao, and she heard he was her sister's fiancé, someone who exclusively belonged to her sister. So she threw a tantrum, insisting on staying with Qin Zhao.]","[Jealousy truly changes people! Even though she had already received her parents' perfect love and all their attention compared to Chu Xinyue, she still wanted to snatch what belonged to Chu Xinyue. Because Chu Xueqi felt that if Chu Xinyue didn't exist, those things would have been hers in the first place.]","Qin Zhao's breath caught as he listened.","No, Xueqi wasn't that kind of person, she wasn't...","At that time, Chu Xueqi was indeed crying and making a fuss in the hospital room. He only thought that the sick little girl was pitiful and hoped someone would play with her. Moreover, looking at that face identical to Chu Xinyue's, Qin Zhao felt sympathy.","But now that Ji Fei put it this way... Chu Xueqi had her parents' perfect love and all their attention... What did Chu Xinyue have at that time?","She had him... her fiancé.","Thinking about this, Qin Zhao felt as if he had been hit over the head, his mind buzzing.","[The activity was originally meant for Qin Zhao and Chu Xinyue to attend together. But because the hospitalized Chu Xueqi made such a fuss, wanting to go play with Qin Zhao herself and not allowing her sister to go, and since it wasn't possible to join the activity at the last minute anyway, the Chu parents eventually made Chu Xinyue give up her participation. They had Chu Xueqi, who had the same face, replace her and asked Qin Zhao to take care of her.]","Qin Zhao's expression darkened. At the time, he thought it wasn't a big deal and didn't consider Chu Xinyue's feelings. He immediately agreed to the Chu parents' request to take care of Chu Xueqi.","He took it for granted that Chu Xinyue would definitely let her sister go, and that she should let her.","He couldn't even remember what expression Chu Xinyue had at that time.","The Qin family had heard that the older sister had voluntarily given her sick younger sister the chance to go play. They had even praised the sisters' close relationship.","Who would have thought it was the result of the parents' forceful demand and the younger sister pushing out the older sister?","If that's the case, when Qin Zhao got into trouble, shouldn't it have been Chu Xueqi by his side? How did the one who saved him become Chu Xinyue?","Qin Zhao couldn't figure it out.","He still remembered that their campsite was in a dense forest. The staff led them through the forest, teaching them about plants and some wilderness survival skills.","But he was very mischievous at the time and took Chu Xueqi off on their own.","As a result, he accidentally fell down a steep slope and was seriously injured. He only remembered Chu Xueqi crying loudly at the top of the slope.","In his hazy state, when he was about to die from blood loss, he saw Chu Xueqi again.","Chu Xueqi found him crying, forcibly carrying him out of the ravine on her back before they encountered the rescue team.","It was clearly Chu Xueqi who saved his life.","[I guess the Chu parents were quite helpless too. Qin Zhao couldn't really take care of others. It would have been fine with Chu Xinyue who was healthy - jumping around wouldn't have been a problem. But with Chu Xueqi, forget it. After Qin Zhao got into trouble, Chu Xueqi ran back crying and fainted due to her weak constitution. The Chu parents, who were waiting outside, rushed her to the hospital in a panic. They had no idea Qin Zhao was in trouble.]","Qin Zhao's pupils constricted.","[The Chu couple was originally waiting outside the campsite with Chu Xinyue, but after receiving their younger daughter, they completely forgot that their older daughter hadn't gotten in the car yet and left directly. Chu Xinyue was left behind at the campsite.]","[Qin Zhao was lucky. In this world, apart from the Qin family, probably only Chu Xinyue remembered him wholeheartedly. Seeing that her sister had come out, she knew Qin Zhao must have come out too, so she went in to look for him. At that time, the activity hadn't ended yet, and no one knew Qin Zhao was in trouble. If it wasn't for Chu Xinyue going back in, by the time people realized something was wrong, Qin Zhao might have already died from blood loss...]","Qin Zhao felt as if an arrow had pierced his heart.","Even the eavesdropping Qin family members felt a chill of fear in retrospect. Their gazes all secretly swept over to Chu Xinyue nearby with gratitude.","This made the guests chatting with them start to speculate whether the third young master's marriage arrangement was really going to change.","Ji Fei was thoroughly enjoying the drama unfolding before her eyes, eagerly continuing to watch.","[When the rescue team learned that Qin Zhao was missing, they took action immediately. Originally, Chu Xinyue wasn't supposed to participate, but she secretly followed along. It was because she recognized some items that belonged to Qin Zhao that she discovered the unconscious Qin Zhao in the ravine and carried him out on her back. Shocked, frightened, and exhausted beyond her limits, Chu Xinyue immediately developed a high fever and was sent to the hospital along with him.]","Now all the Qin family members were filled with questions.","So why... did it become Chu Xueqi?","[A little girl who went through so much forgot this experience after her fever broke. Qin Zhao thought the person he saw was Chu Xueqi, and when he woke up, the first person he asked about was Chu Xueqi. The Chu family had a spark of inspiration, and the lie began. In the end, even Chu Xinyue believed it was her sister who saved him and fell ill again from exhaustion, thinking her own fever was just from being scared. As for the camp staff, they just thought the little girl who had fainted had recovered and came back worried about her friend. Everything fit together seamlessly, leaving no room for doubt. It's just... too damn melodramatic, isn't it?]","Qin Zhao's body had already stiffened. Ji Fei's words sounded so real that all of his memories seemed on the verge of collapse.","But he didn't want to believe that so many years of his life had been based on a lie. Why did the Chu parents have to do this?! At that time, their relationship wasn't as strained as it is now.","The Qin family members were also puzzled. Their family values probably would never allow them to understand the behavior of the Chu parents.","Ji Fei cursed in her mind for a while before finally saying:","[So it turns out they wanted to switch the engagement partners even back then. It wasn't just because of their younger daughter's childish and selfish desire to take things, but because they thought Chu Xinyue was healthy and could handle marrying anyone, while Chu Xueqi was in poor health and naturally needed to marry into a good family that wouldn't mistreat her, could support her medical needs, and wouldn't look down on her.]","The Qin family members suddenly understood. After all, among the children of wealthy and prominent families, those who didn't prioritize family alliances in marriages were extremely rare, like their family.","The Chu family only had two daughters, destined for business marriages.","Back then, the Chu grandmother had pestered the Qin grandmother for several years before finally securing the engagement.","Originally, their family didn't have the habit of arranging early engagements.","[When they heard that the engagement partner Grandmother Chu had arranged for Chu Xinyue was Qin Zhao, they were extremely dissatisfied. They felt that the grandmother was biased, only thinking about the older granddaughter and not the younger one. Grandmother Chu immediately retorted: \"Anyway, you only think about the younger one and not the older one. If I don't consider the older one's future while I'm still alive, when will you irresponsible parents ever think about her?\"]","[Oh, Grandmother, well said!]","The Qin family members sighed inwardly. The Qin grandmother had passed away long ago. The Chu family had always wanted to change partners, but were always suppressed by Grandmother Chu. Naturally, they wouldn't break the agreement either, until Grandmother Chu passed away recently, and the Chu family's intentions became increasingly obvious. As for their Qin Zhao...","The Qin family members secretly glanced at Qin Zhao, seeing his face had turned black as ink, not knowing if he believed it or not.","After all, Qin Zhao was as stubborn as a mule.","Indeed, Qin Zhao still didn't want to believe it.","What did all of Ji Fei's speculation amount to?","Was there any evidence? Did whatever Ji Fei say become the truth? She certainly had a vivid imagination.","The truth that Chu Xueqi saved him was clearly more reasonable and logical.","Qin Zhao glared fiercely at Ji Fei, inexplicably angry to the point where he wanted to lose control and yell at her.","But suddenly, Qin Xian blocked his line of sight.","Qin Zhao looked at Qin Xian, feeling both wronged and angry.","Qin Xian frowned slightly, really not wanting to deal with his stupid brother, but when he heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts earlier, he indeed discovered a piece of evidence that wasn't quite evidence.","After thinking for a moment, Qin Xian took advantage of the surrounding noise and said in a low voice, \"When you were ten years old, you were quite a bit bigger than Qin Xi is now, right?\"","Qin Zhao looked at his second brother, perplexed by the sudden change of topic.","Qin Xian's gaze deepened, \"There probably weren't many girls who could carry you on their back.\"","A healthy Chu Xinyue.","A frail Chu Xueqi.","Who could have possibly carried him out of the ravine on their back?","The color drained from Qin Zhao's face inch by inch.","Perhaps it was human potential, the miracle of life, or maybe...","The faces of Chu Xinyue and Chu Xueqi kept flashing through Qin Zhao's mind.","Chu Xinyue's hand was broken by a falling cabinet, and she was sweating profusely, yet she didn't make a sound.","Chu Xueqi twisted her ankle slightly and her eyes were swollen from crying.","When Chu Xinyue was moving lab equipment, a male classmate offered to help, but she refused. Her thin figure managed to carry it all.","When Chu Xueqi had to carry a child while acting, she could only endure for three seconds. Afterward, she would call him to complain about how tired she was, asking him to use his connections to change her role.","...","The banquet was drawing to a close amidst the gossip.","Someone invited the Chu family to leave together to discuss business matters. Mr. Chu smiled and said, \"We have an appointment with the Qin family today, so we really don't have time.\"","Hearing this, everyone wished they could stay and join in the excitement, to see how this engagement would turn out.","But since the families wanted to talk privately, it wouldn't be right to insist on staying.","Those preparing to leave were reluctant to go.","But just then, someone burst into the reception room.","\"Chu Xinyue, Chu Xinyue! I heard you're breaking off your engagement! Well, I'm here to propose to your family today. I'll marry you, after all, you're already mine! I'll take responsibility for you!\"","Chu Xinyue and Qin Zhao both looked up to see the man who had harassed Chu Xinyue in the bathroom earlier. He was now drunk and making another appearance."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Release of Engagement","paragraphs":["The person who burst in was Wu Tian, a notorious playboy from a wealthy family.","Besides a relatively handsome face, he was utterly worthless - just a rich troublemaker who had committed numerous illegal acts and was a regular at the police station.","No scandal he caused would surprise anyone anymore.","But today was the Qin family's event, and Wu Tian's disruption was a slap in their face.","Wu Tian's uncle and aunt, who had come representing the Wu family, immediately stepped forward to restrain him.","\"We agreed to bring you, but not to cause trouble!\"","\"We're so sorry, our nephew is drunk. We'll take him away right now.\"","But Wu Tian shoved his aunt and uncle aside. He was already furious from his earlier conflict with Qin Zhao and being snubbed by that woman Chu Xinyue. Then he suddenly received some news that enraged him further, causing him to down several bottles of alcohol. The more he drank, the angrier he got, until he impulsively charged back in.","Wu Tian went straight up to the Chu family, grinning maliciously at the shocked Mr. and Mrs. Chu: \"Uncle, Auntie, since you want to change the engagement, why don't we take advantage of everyone being here today and settle my engagement to Chu Xinyue as well?\"","He then turned to glare viciously at Chu Xinyue, like a poisonous snake.","Chu Xinyue's mind went blank for a moment. She didn't look at Wu Tian, but turned to gaze at Chu Xueqi, who was shrinking behind her parents.","Chu Xueqi's face was pale, her eyes darting around nervously. When she noticed Chu Xinyue looking at her, she immediately averted her gaze guiltily.","Meanwhile, as Wu Tian reached out to grab Chu Xinyue's wrist, a large hand shot out and firmly grasped his arm.","Wu Tian, emboldened by alcohol, was even more belligerent than before. He glared angrily at the person stopping him. \"Damn you, Qin Zhao, I'm just picking up what you don't want anymore. I'm not even complaining about it, you should be grateful to me!\"","\"You're out of your damn mind!\" Qin Zhao said as he prepared to punch Wu Tian.","He had already been bottling up a mess of confused emotions, feeling like a caged beast, and now this guy shows up asking for a beating. So Qin Zhao's fist flew without hesitation, knocking Wu Tian to the ground.","Qin Zhao was about to hit him again when Chu Xinyue grabbed his wrist. He turned back angrily, only to see Chu Xinyue's expression cold and detached, as if she didn't want him interfering.","Her face was covered in frost as she stared blankly at Wu Tian.","Qin Zhao suddenly felt like he had been punched in the chest.","Although they were angry at Wu Tian's behavior, the Wu family couldn't allow others to beat their child.","\"What do you think you're doing? Wu Tian is drunk, how dare you hit him? Is this how the Qin family treats their guests?\" Wu Tian's aunt shouted angrily.","\"We treat our guests well, but you're causing trouble in our home. Is this how the Wu family behaves as guests?\" Qin Zhao's mother stepped forward, refusing to back down. \"And you even insulted us.\"","Wu Tian's aunt's face flushed red as she retorted, \"Mrs. Qin, that's nonsense. Let's be frank - aren't you planning to break off the engagement with Chu Xinyue? So this is a matter between my nephew and Chu Xinyue. Your third son is the one butting in. Besides, my nephew was only proposing, he didn't do anything wrong!\"","Qin Zhao's mother sneered, \"Your nephew seems awfully hasty then.\"","Wu Tian's aunt was at a loss for words. After all, the engagement between the Qin and Chu families hadn't been officially broken yet. Wu Tian jumping in to say those crude things could be seen as trying to cuckold Qin Zhao, which was indeed a slap in the Qin family's face.","\"Oh my, we're all friends here. There's no need for the older generation to fall out over the youngsters. Let's all calm down. It's all my daughter's fault,\" Mr. Chu hurriedly stepped in as peacemaker.","\"It's Xinyue's fault for getting involved with Young Master Wu while still engaged. But looking at it another way, this could be a double blessing. Why don't we all sit down and discuss it calmly?\" Mrs. Chu also tried to mediate, her expression changing from bewilderment to a smile.","The Chu family's fortunes had declined recently, and they couldn't afford to offend either the Qin or Wu families.","They had hoped to smoothly switch the engagement today, but unexpectedly the Wu family had jumped in wanting to ally with them through marriage.","It was like manna from heaven. It also made up for what happened to Chu Xinyue. This way people wouldn't keep saying they favored their younger daughter by stealing the older daughter's engagement for her.","The guests who had been reluctant to leave were actually hoping to see some drama between two women fighting over one man.","But there was an unexpected twist.","\"Looks like good fortune is coming. Since we're all here today, we can be witnesses for your three families. Don't forget to invite us to the wedding banquet later!\"","\"That's right, it turns out everyone has their own happiness. You young people really know how to stir things up. But these are all matches made in heaven.\"","The infamous Chu Xinyue paired with Wu Tian, while the well-regarded Qin Zhao matched with Chu Xueqi - it seemed like a perfect happy ending for all. The guests were just excited to witness it all unfold.","If the three families really did join in marriage, it could affect future business alignments.","Getting this inside information early could prove useful.","Qin Xian watched everything unfold from the sidelines, while beside him, Ji Fei's mind was about to explode.","[Holy crap! This is some major gossip!]","That comment immediately distracted the Qin family members, but they still needed to address their third son's major life decision.","Mr. and Mrs. Qin exchanged a glance, then went along with the flow of conversation. Though they were protective of their own, they didn't want to make the situation more awkward.","Now that things had developed this way, with all the guests staying to watch the drama unfold, it was best to resolve everything on the spot to avoid rumors and negative impacts later.","Mr. Qin coughed and said, \"Since everyone has heard about it, we won't hide anything. The engagement was an agreement made by the older generation. Nowadays young people believe in freedom of love. We Qins won't interfere with our children's decisions.\"","Mrs. Qin also chimed in, \"We only hope that the children can take responsibility for their own lives and not make decisions they'll regret.\"","After speaking, Mr. and Mrs. Qin both gave Qin Zhao a meaningful look.","After all, they had just learned about how the Chu family had deceived them. They were extremely displeased with Chu Xueqi and her parents, as this incident meant they had been constantly lying to Qin Zhao, stealing credit that belonged to someone else.","However, marriage and love were personal decisions.","Anyway, Qin Zhao now knew everything he needed to know. Whether he believed it or not was up to him.","They just felt sorry for Xinyue. How did she end up involved with Wu Tian?","Oh well, they had handed the stage over to Qin Zhao now. They immediately pricked up their ears to hear what new gossip Ji Fei would reveal next.","But all they heard for a while was [Huh! Oh! Gosh! Damn! Is that true? That's terrifying!]","The Qin family members thought: Come on, don't just exclaim, tell us what's so terrifying!","Even with all this suspense, Qin Zhao's attention wasn't diverted. His thoughts were in complete chaos.","Meanwhile, Mr. and Mrs. Chu enthusiastically stepped forward, saying, \"The Qin family is so open-minded. Qin Zhao, why don't you say something?\"","As they spoke, they pushed Chu Xueqi towards Qin Zhao, completely oblivious to how unnatural their daughter's expression was.","Qin Zhao's mouth twitched. He wanted to ask who had really saved him back then.","But... did it matter? Saving his life didn't equate to love.","Perhaps taking credit was just because of how much she loved him.","But why was it so hard for him to speak up?","His hesitation caused an eerie silence to fall over the scene. The onlookers began to whisper among themselves.","Was there a twist coming?","Wow, how exciting!","At this moment, the anxious Chu Xueqi, unable to wait for Qin Zhao to speak, urgently tugged at his sleeve. \"Brother Qin...\"","Qin Zhao was startled. He glanced at Chu Xueqi, the woman he had cherished for years, then turned to look at Chu Xinyue, a woman who seemed both familiar yet distant in reality.","Meanwhile, the Qin family members, who were eavesdropping on thoughts and ready to get the inside scoop, hadn't noticed Qin Zhao's odd behavior.","Instead, it was Ji Fei who became distracted.","[Huh, what's Qin Zhao doing? He can't seriously be considering who to choose, can he?]","The Qin family members hadn't quite processed this when they heard Ji Fei start cursing.","[What the hell, how shameless! Why does he think that just because he wants to choose, they'll definitely be willing to be chosen by him? Chu Xinyue isn't Chu Xueqi, she doesn't want to participate in their little play!]","[He's so full of himself. Do his family members know about this?]","The Qin family: ...Well, now we do.","Qin Zhao: ??? Suddenly being scolded.","But... wasn't he the one who had to make the decision now?","Although he shouldn't be hesitating, he...","\"Isn't an engagement between two people? Shouldn't you ask for my opinion as well?\" Chu Xinyue suddenly spoke up.","All eyes instantly turned to Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao also stared blankly, wondering if she... was unwilling to let go?","A sense of inexplicable joy, which he himself hadn't even noticed, welled up in his heart.","The Chu couple immediately became impatient.","\"Xinyue, stop fooling around. We'll help you settle things with the Wu family. One shouldn't be too greedy in life.\"","\"We know you always like to go against your sister, but this concerns their lifelong happiness. The Qin family has already said to let the children decide for themselves. Qin Zhao absolutely refuses to marry you. Are you going to stubbornly cling on despite that? Even if you do, it's useless!\"","The Chu couple's words to Chu Xinyue were truly harsh.","However, the current Chu Xinyue was like an impenetrable fortress, no longer affected in the slightest by their words.","Chu Xinyue turned to look at Qin Zhao, her gaze calm, causing Qin Zhao's heart to tremble as their eyes met.","\"Today, I officially announce the termination of our engagement,\" Chu Xinyue said, and then, surprisingly, she smiled with relief and added, \"Qin Zhao, I don't want you anymore.\"","Upon hearing these words, Qin Zhao felt as if a piece of his heart had been hollowed out, leaving him stunned.","This should have been the scene he had long awaited, yet why did it feel like he was trapped in a nightmare?","While everyone present was somewhat surprised, they didn't think much of it. They assumed that Chu Xinyue must have truly gotten together with Wu Tian, hence her willingness to break off the engagement so readily.","The Chu couple and Chu Xueqi, on the other hand, breathed sighs of relief.","[The Chu family is so hypocritical. They clearly knew Chu Xinyue's true feelings yet they're putting on an act here. They've repeatedly forced Chu Xinyue to go to Grandmother Chu to break off the engagement, but Chu Xinyue always stubbornly refused. Usually, she would let Chu Xueqi take whatever she wanted, but the one thing she didn't want to give up was Qin Zhao. Now she's even given that up. It seems she's truly let go of everything.]","[Qin Zhao, you fool. You've picked up a sesame seed but lost a watermelon. You'll have plenty to cry about later.]","Hearing these inner thoughts, the Qin family members were quite surprised. So Chu Xinyue actually liked their third son?","Qin Zhao's lips trembled. Yes, Chu Xinyue liked him, but now she had completely given up.","It made sense, she had a backup now, right? But the image of Chu Xinyue's expression when she said 'it wasn't me' flashed through his mind.","Suddenly, someone patted his body.","Qin Zhao snapped back to reality to see the Chu family looking at him expectantly, seemingly waiting for him to announce his engagement to Chu Xueqi.","But Qin Zhao didn't speak. He felt that something was off, and waves of regret surged within him.","Meanwhile, Wu Tian eagerly approached, as if his mood had improved. He came up to Chu Xinyue and said, \"You've finally come to your senses. From now on, you're my fiancée.\"","Qin Zhao's eyes flickered, his fists unconsciously clenching as he looked at Chu Xinyue.","But Chu Xinyue's gaze no longer lingered on him. She looked at Wu Tian as if she were looking at an idiot and let out a cold laugh.","\"Who are you? Do I know you? Open your dog eyes and look clearly. I, Chu Xinyue, have never met you in private. You've been constantly spreading rumors about our relationship in public. I have the right to sue you!\"","These words were like a thunderclap on a clear day, shocking everyone present.","[Oh ho, it's time for a face-slapping! Pass the popcorn!]","The Qin family members, who had been confused until now, instinctively made a judgment upon hearing Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","Yes, Chu Xinyue was telling the truth.","Huh?","What did this mean? Were all those things Wu Tian said lies?","The scene in the backyard flashed through Qin Zhao's mind once again.","Chu Xinyue's desperate eyes at that time.","In an instant, Qin Zhao felt his palms become sweaty."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: This Face is Not Just Mine","paragraphs":["\"Is this... a lovers' quarrel?\"","\"But Chu Xinyue's expression doesn't seem like she's lying!\"","\"Even if Wu Tian isn't a great person, he's still the young master of the Wu family. Why would he need to make up lies?\"","\"Chu Xinyue even said she's going to sue him. How could that be fake?\"","The crowd buzzed with discussion, truly bewildered by the situation.","Wu Tian hadn't expected Chu Xinyue to deny everything on the spot. His eyes turned bloodshot with anger.","\"You dare to deny it! Damn it, no wonder you said you were afraid of the Qin family finding out that their fiancée was with me, so you kept it hidden and didn't dare to go public. So this is what you were waiting for! You think you can pretend we were never together? Keep dreaming! Chu Xinyue, I'm giving you face now, so you'd better save yours. Otherwise, I'll reveal everything, and then you'll really lose face! I know all about those things you've been hiding!\"","Chu Xinyue's expression remained unperturbed. She only smiled more mockingly, \"Then go ahead and say it. I want to see who'll really end up losing face!\"","As she finished speaking, her gaze swept over Chu Xueqi, who indeed began to look flustered.","\"You!\" Wu Tian exploded with rage.","Mr. Chu, seeing that they were about to start a fight and worried that some unsavory words might be spoken, quickly pulled Chu Xinyue back.","\"What are you making a fuss about! Stop being temperamental! You might not care about your reputation, but our Chu family does!\"","Mrs. Chu also stepped forward, pulling Chu Xinyue, and said, \"If you ruin this joyous occasion with your behavior, who will want you in the future? Apologize to Wu Tian properly.\"","She then turned to Wu Tian's aunt and uncle with an apologetic smile, \"Our daughter has a bit of a temper. She'll mature after getting married. Please bear with her.\"","Wu Tian's aunt and uncle actually didn't like this girl with a bad reputation at all, but they had no choice. Wu Tian was a good-for-nothing with an even worse reputation. Comparing the two, it was six of one and half a dozen of the other. With matching social status, it naturally became a good marriage alliance.","\"Your eldest daughter seems quite spirited, but it's alright. After they're married, the young couple will gradually smooth things out.\"","Before the elders from both sides could exchange hypocritical smiles, Chu Xinyue interrupted.","\"What's this? Are we trading women without regard for personal wishes now?\" Chu Xinyue mocked directly, then swiftly shook off her parents' hands as if throwing off two shackles.","The people around were stunned by Chu Xinyue's sudden harsh words.","[Well done! If you don't speak harshly, these people act like they can't understand human language and will just decide other people's lives on their own!]","The Qin family, listening to this, also felt that the Chu couple was being a bit too much. Chu Xinyue clearly didn't want this, and for parents to act this way was truly disheartening.","But the Chu family didn't see it that way. Mr. Chu, coming to his senses, angrily said, \"How dare you speak like that! You've become more and more unruly! Is this how you talk to your parents?\"","Mrs. Chu's tone suddenly changed to one of betrayal and heartache, \"You're being foolish and impulsive! We're making decisions to help you! You're so ungrateful! You've already been involved with Wu Tian, whether you've broken up or not, there were feelings there. Now that he wants to marry you, how can you refuse? Listen to us and sit down to finalize this engagement properly!\"","Chu Xinyue coldly laughed, \"I'm an adult. You have no right to decide my affairs!\"","Chu Xinyue rarely spoke to them in such a cold tone. Although she was usually somewhat cold-hearted, she would try her best to go along with their wishes.","So the current Chu Xinyue was like a complete rebel! Too defiant! It left her parents dumbfounded.","\"What's gotten into you! We are your parents!\" Mr. Chu exclaimed in shock.","Chu Xinyue's expression finally changed a bit, sneering, \"Are you really? I thought you were only Chu Xueqi's parents!\"","This statement immediately made the Chu parents flush red.","\"Shut up!\"","\"You ungrateful child, what nonsense are you spouting!\"","[Oh my, they're furious now. Why get so angry if it's not true? I really suspect that the Chu couple actually knows how biased and ridiculous they are, but just won't allow Chu Xinyue to say it out loud. How disgusting.]","The Qin family also felt that the Chu parents now looked like something that shouldn't have been revealed had been exposed, making them jump in anger.","But Chu Xinyue would no longer back down for the sake of filial piety.","\"I clearly said I don't know this person, but you don't believe me. You insist on pushing me to him, not caring if it ruins my life. What? You'd rather believe an outsider's words than your own daughter's! And you still claim to be my parents?\"","\"Who told you to lie all the time? Is it our fault for not believing you?\" Mr. Chu berated.","[That's right, Wu Tian is such an honest person, more worthy of your trust.]","Ji Fei's sarcastic comment almost made Mr. and Mrs. Qin lose their composure, and even the quietly observing Qin Yan nearly spat out her drink.","This caused others to look over at them.","Qin Xian could only calmly cover up, saying, \"Well, we'll have to see who's more trustworthy between Miss Chu and Mr. Wu.\"","Everyone was taken aback, recalling Wu Tian's illustrious track record, and then comparing it to Chu Xinyue's...","Umm...","Mr. Chu's face immediately froze.","Qin Xian still held considerable sway; once he spoke up, everyone began to doubt the situation.","Wu Tian felt extremely provoked. Seeing Chu Xinyue's expression, he laughed bitterly, throwing caution to the wind. He viciously said to Chu Xinyue, \"You forced me to do this!\"","Without further ado, he rushed to the multimedia player not far from the reception area.","The electronic device that had been displaying photos of Qin Xi and Qin Yan was connected to a phone.","In the next second, a series of intimate photos that almost needed censoring were projected onto the big screen.","Most of them were taken on a hotel bed.","The dreamy gaze, the ambiguous atmosphere, the alluring expression, as seductive and charming as a vixen.","It was completely unimaginable that they could be of the now expressionless Chu Xinyue.","The final photo settled on an image of a man and woman kissing.","That beautiful face with half-closed eyes.","The crowd gasped in shock. This was solid evidence. It seemed Wu Tian and Chu Xinyue really had been together.","\"Hmph, I've practically slept you raw! And you still deny it?\" Wu Tian snarled, his expression twisted.","But Chu Xinyue laughed, laughed uncontrollably.","Qin Zhao stared at the photos, his face ashen, anger surging to his brain.","Because he had immediately determined that the person capable of making such an expression couldn't possibly be Chu Xinyue.","But if not Chu Xinyue, who could it be?","In that second, Qin Zhao didn't dare to think further.","As a result, Ji Fei's inner thoughts came pouring in, crushing all his objections.","[I never expected this! Chu Xueqi is quite the wild one in private. I doubted her acting skills before, but I was presumptuous. Seeing how well she plays the innocent flower in public, without a trace of her playful side showing, she's a true acting queen!]","[Chu Xueqi is really something. Just because Qin Zhao was in seclusion for filming, she couldn't bear the loneliness and found someone to play with. She probably thought she'd found someone equally promiscuous, enjoy a brief fling, and then part ways gracefully, each keeping the other's secret. Who knew she'd end up entangled with such a scoundrel? I bet she never imagined it would come to this.]","[Look at her, she's gone pale. But judging by her parents' expressions, they were completely unaware! Oh my, I wonder if Wu Tian will reveal an even bigger secret later. If he does, the evidence will be clear as day.]","Ji Fei continued to revel in the drama unfolding before her. The Qin family, hearing bits and pieces of these inner thoughts, were scratching their heads in confusion. What else could there be?","Only Qin Zhao's world was crumbling.","Because he had indeed been out of contact with Chu Xueqi for over three months while in seclusion.","If it really was Xueqi, it would mean she had been using Chu Xinyue's name to fool around outside, letting Chu Xinyue take the blame.","How evil would one have to be to do such a thing?","At this moment, Qin Zhao's worldview seemed to be turning upside down.","Everything he had always believed in and trusted... was it all... a lie?","\"All of this,\" Chu Xinyue said slowly after she finished laughing, \"is fake.\"","\"Fake? Don't tell me you're saying these photos are photoshopped. Chu Xinyue, you really are...\"","\"The photos are real, the person is fake.\" Chu Xinyue's gaze finally fixed on Chu Xueqi as she said, \"That face isn't my exclusive property. Mr. Wu, next time you sleep with someone, you'd better make sure you can tell them apart. Just because someone says they're a certain person doesn't mean you should believe it!\"","Wu Tian stood there, dumbfounded.","Everyone fell silent.","Wasn't this implying that the adorable little princess, who had been so well-protected by her family and kept as pure as untouched snow, was the woman in the photograph?","It wasn't just everyone else; even Wu Tian, upon a quick glance, immediately questioned it.","Meanwhile, the Chu couple was absolutely beside themselves."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: I Can't Carry It Anymore And I Don't Want to Carry It Anymore","paragraphs":["\"You insolent girl, what are you insinuating? This is madness!\" Mr. Chu roared in anger. He lunged forward, raising his hand to slap her.","But Chu Xinyue dodged to the side, causing Mr. Chu to nearly fall over from the force of his swing.","When the staggering Mr. Chu regained his balance, he pointed at Chu Xinyue with a trembling hand, shaking with rage.","\"She's your sister! How could you bring trouble upon yourself and then sling mud at your own sister?\" Mrs. Chu exclaimed in disbelief, tightly embracing Chu Xueqi as if fearing Chu Xinyue might harm her precious daughter.","[Tsk tsk tsk, such favoritism, it's far too blatant. When those indecent photos first appeared, the Chu couple only looked at Chu Xinyue with disgust, secretly blaming her for not listening to her parents and bringing trouble upon herself. But now that it's said to be Chu Xueqi, the parents' reaction... hmm, this is how real parents should react, isn't it? If they didn't have the same face, one might doubt whether Chu Xinyue was truly their biological child.]","Hearing Ji Fei's inner thoughts, the Qin Family also shook their heads. The Chu couple's differential treatment was far too obvious.","It was as if they treated one like the apple of their eye and the other like dirt beneath their feet. How could there be such parents?","Chu Xinyue had long since become numb to such situations and merely watched her parents' outburst with an expressionless face.","[Judging by Chu Xinyue's expression, she's clearly used to this. It seems the Chu couple often behaves this way. They've decided not to use their brains and instead save them as a family heirloom for Chu Xueqi. I can only scoff. How could someone favored by their parents possibly be harmed? It's always the one neglected by their parents who ends up getting hurt.]","The Qin Family secretly nodded in agreement with Ji Fei's words.","Qin Zhao, meanwhile, recalled various past incidents.","Many times, he had witnessed the same scene.","Chu Xinyue standing to the side with a cold expression, Chu Xueqi crying with red eyes, looking wronged, and the Chu couple shielding Chu Xueqi while angrily berating Chu Xinyue for being mean and vicious to her sister.","It seemed he had never seen the Chu couple take Chu Xinyue's side.","How could someone favored by their parents ever need to compromise?","But in the past, Qin Zhao had only thought that Chu Xinyue was jealous and resentful because that bit of favoritism hadn't fallen on her, and that's why she targeted Chu Xueqi.","Qin Zhao felt dazed, as if all his past memories were no longer real.","Chu Xinyue looked at Chu Xueqi and said coldly, \"Chu Xueqi, tell me who's in those photos?\"","Chu Xueqi cowered helplessly in her mother's arms, trembling all over, yet determinedly putting on a pitiful expression. \"Sister, what are you talking about?\"","\"You truly are beyond redemption,\" Chu Xinyue said with a cold laugh.","Hearing Chu Xinyue speak this way about their precious daughter, the Chu couple gasped in anger, continuously cursing about family disgrace and unfilial behavior.","Wu Tian angrily stepped forward and said, \"Chu Xinyue, I see you won't believe it until you see the coffin. Fine then, I'll make you face reality!\"","He sneered and tapped his phone one last time.","The intimate photos on the projection disappeared, replaced by various pictures of hospital visits. The images kept changing until finally settling on an abortion consent form.","Name: Chu Xinyue.","\"You were pregnant with my child! But you had an abortion behind my back! Chu Xinyue, you owe me, so you can't escape today!\"","At this, even Chu Xinyue's eyes widened in disbelief. She then turned to look at Chu Xueqi incredulously.","Chu Xueqi was already trembling all over, clearly showing the fear of having a secret exposed, but she quickly composed herself.","Qin Zhao's face, however, turned a new shade of pale.","He stared intently at that form, his world shaken regardless of who he imagined had gotten pregnant and had an abortion.","[Finally, it's all come to light.]","Ji Fei almost laughed out loud.","The Qin Family also understood. This was the big news Ji Fei had mentioned, and indeed... it counted as evidence. Now it just depended on... whether certain people dared to verify it.","The murmurs of discussion throughout the venue drowned out Chu Xueqi's momentary look of guilt.","\"Ah, I think I know about this. She was my senior in university. There were rumors back then that she had messy relationships with men. Photos of her going for an abortion even circulated on the campus website.\"","Hearing this, everyone's hearts immediately swayed.","\"So it seems it's true? I can't believe she's still denying it so stubbornly!\"","\"If you ask me, what's wrong with marrying Wu Tian? She almost had his child already.\"","\"Didn't they say she had messy relationships? Maybe there was more than one man involved!\"","Wu Tian thought he had won and smugly tried to grab Chu Xinyue's arm.","Chu Xinyue stepped back and turned to look at the person who claimed to be her junior, saying, \"You should know that if the posts were slanderous, our school's forum would have deleted them. Why didn't you mention that those posts were long since removed and the poster was banned?\"","The young master was immediately at a loss for words, lowering his head in embarrassment.","[What else could it be? He pursued you, you rejected him, and men are just like that. If they can't have you, they want to find a chance to destroy you. He was the most active in jumping around in the comments of those posts, nothing but a clown.]","Ji Fei criticized. The Qin Family looked over in that direction, making note of which family he was from. People with such poor character should be avoided in the future.","Qin Zhao instinctively looked over as well, memorizing that face, a flash of ruthlessness in his eyes.","The young master suddenly felt as if he were being pricked by thorns.","Chu Xinyue, however, couldn't be bothered with such a person. She calmly said to Wu Tian, \"I'll say it again, how can you prove it's me? Using the same face and reporting my name is a simple trick, isn't it?\"","\"Even now, you still won't admit it?\" Wu Tian laughed in anger.","But those angrier than Wu Tian were the Chu couple.","\"You've even been pregnant, done such a filthy thing, and you're still trying to push it onto your sister?!\" Mr. Chu was beside himself with fury.","\"What a sin! How did I give birth to such a shameless daughter! Chu Xinyue, if you continue to be so obstinate, we'll disown you as our daughter!\" Mrs. Chu warned, heartbroken and indignant.","As if such threats could force their rebellious daughter to back down and stop this madness.","Chu Xinyue let out a derisive laugh and said, \"I've long since not wanted to be your daughter.\"","This statement left the Chu couple frozen in place.","\"You... what did you say?!\"","\"How dare you! This is utterly outrageous, completely lawless.\"","Chu Xinyue finally allowed resentment to creep into her voice. \"What's so good about being your daughter? You can't even tell who's in the photos. And why are you so surprised? Haven't you ever had suspicions? Others might not know, but how many times has she done things under my name since we were young? Is one more instance really so strange?\"","The Chu couple were both taken aback. Thanks to Chu Xinyue's reminder, they seemed to finally recover their memories, and their expressions became peculiar.","They were afraid Chu Xinyue might accidentally reveal something, so they tried to change the subject.","But this time, Chu Xinyue didn't give them the chance.","\"When Grandmother was critically ill, I went to the Buddhist temple to pray for her. I climbed the mountain gate on my knees, bowing nine times. But then the media widely reported that it was Chu Xueqi who did this. In fact, at that time, my sister hadn't even visited Grandmother's hospital room once. She was only hospitalized because she ate too much ice cream at home and got sick.\"","The onlookers were shocked. What was going on? Wasn't this touching story about Chu Xueqi?","At the time, it was widely reported that the frail younger sister had prayed for her grandmother's health and fainted from kneeling, ending up in the hospital. Everyone praised her filial piety, which helped establish her reputation in high society circles after she returned to the country.","Meanwhile, the elder sister who had been raised by their grandmother remained silent, leaving people perplexed.","When they met the Chu couple, they often brought up this topic, and the Chu couple had never denied it.","Qin Zhao also remembered. At that time, he had specifically gone to see Chu Xueqi. She had smiled with a pale face, saying it was just what she should do.","That was an important moment when his heart was moved.","And now he was being told that it was actually Chu Xinyue who had done it?","\"At that time, you told me that since the media had misunderstood, there was no need to argue. It was all about filial piety and sincerity, and making a fuss for the sake of fame would only cause trouble.\" Chu Xinyue said self-mockingly, \"I really wanted to ask, was that truly what you thought, or did you just want to use my hard work to add glory to my sister? You clearly couldn't bear to let her suffer even a little, yet you wanted her to have a good reputation?\"","The Chu couple's faces turned ashen, and Chu Xueqi's eyes widened in disbelief that Chu Xinyue would bring up old grievances like this.","\"What... what nonsense are you talking about? It was all for your grandmother. What does it matter which sister did it? Your sister's health is poor. If she were well, wouldn't she have done it? You only went because you're in good health,\" Mr. Chu immediately retorted, flushed with anger and shame.","\"So you're also this calculating, doing all this just to show off and pray for your grandmother's blessing?\" Mrs. Chu immediately raised her voice.","[Damn, how can they twist logic like this? Whether it's for show or sincere, it's all Chu Xinyue's achievement. How can they let others take credit for her work? It's a wonder Chu Xinyue can endure this. It's probably because Grandmother Chu's health declined later on, otherwise they wouldn't have let Chu Xinyue suffer such mistreatment in the Chu family!]","This was the first time Qin Zhao and the onlookers clearly saw how the Chu family used twisted logic to show favoritism, and many people began to agree with Ji Fei's thoughts.","Isn't this ridiculous? It's fine if no one praises or reports on the things I've worked hard for, but they can't just let others steal the credit.","However, Mr. and Mrs. Chu were self-righteous, thinking Chu Xinyue was being too petty.","Chu Xinyue then said, \"So you admit that Chu Xueqi has been impersonating me?\"","Everyone came to their senses, wondering if this could be considered a prior offense.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu said, \"That wasn't Xueqi's intention at all, it was an accident...\"","\"What about the car accident then? She broke a child's leg, causing a minor disability. Even though the other party was willing to settle, she was afraid it would become a scandal after her debut. During the investigation, she pretended to be me and gave my name. Afterward, Chu Xueqi put on an act of being mentally confused to shut me up, making me feel sorry for her, thinking she only gave my name out of fear. Now that I think about it, she was faking it. And you didn't say anything, just told me not to let it slip outside. You said you'd take care of the child's situation, but you forgot about it, and so did Chu Xueqi. The child's parents came directly to me, and in the end, I was the one who resolved it.\"","The crowd was in an uproar again. This was one of the negative rumors about Chu Xinyue, but it turns out it was also a case of impersonation?","Qin Zhao's expression changed instantly.","Because of that incident, he had publicly criticized Chu Xinyue. While the accident might have been unintentional, failing to provide proper compensation afterward was a matter of character.","That was the key point when he started to despise Chu Xinyue.","At that time, Chu Xinyue seemed to want to say something, but he was pulled away by Chu Xueqi. He only saw Chu Xinyue's eyes turn red for a moment before leaving.","Qin Zhao gritted his teeth. Was this... also fake?","\"No... Sister, why are you...\" Chu Xueqi finally panicked and started crying.","Seeing Chu Xueqi like this, Mr. and Mrs. Chu worried their daughter couldn't handle it and immediately wanted to force Chu Xinyue to retract her words.","But Chu Xinyue directly said, \"Do I need to provide evidence? That day I attended an academic conference.\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu were stunned, shocked at Chu Xinyue's disregard for consequences.","Chu Xueqi also didn't expect Chu Xinyue to go this far. Hadn't she always kept quiet before? No matter how much Chu Xueqi bullied her, Chu Xinyue always took the blame, because for Chu Xinyue, the most important thing was her parents' approval and her sister's dependence.","But now it seemed like Chu Xinyue didn't care about any of that anymore. Was she determined to expose everything, regardless of what happened to Chu Xueqi?","Before Chu Xueqi could panic further,","Chu Xinyue let out a breath, as if trying to rid herself of all the shackles on her body.","\"Representing the Chu family in disaster relief and charity work, it was me who went, but your name was credited.\"","\"The Century Music Competition, you worked hard to get the qualification to participate, but right before the competition, knowing your skills weren't up to par, you deliberately injured yourself, forcing me to go in your place.\"","\"When you offended the Chu family's business partner, knowing you had caused trouble, you also gave my name. The Chu family relatives all blamed me for causing huge losses to the family, stripping me of my right to inherit shares.\"","\"After I distanced myself from you all, you still occasionally went to school impersonating me, messing up my relationships with friends, mentors, and classmates, also ruining my reputation at school.\"","\"...\"","After Chu Xinyue finished listing all these incidents in one breath, she saw Chu Xueqi's tear-stained face, knowing she was trying to use tears to salvage the situation again. She couldn't help but ask, \"What have I ever done to wrong you, for you to treat me like this? You come to steal my honors, I take the blame for your mistakes, but do I have to take the blame for this kind of thing too? I'm sorry, I can't bear it anymore! And I don't want to bear it anymore!\""]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Self-confirmation, Termination of Relationship","paragraphs":["After finishing her speech, Chu Xinyue took a deep breath and said, \"I take responsibility for my words, and I can provide any evidence needed. I won't admit to things I haven't done, and I won't let anyone take credit for what I have done.\"","Everyone was stunned, as the information was truly shocking.","It could be said that the good and bad impressions of the two sisters in their circle were due to the accumulation of those incidents. If they were all false, then the reputations of both would have to be swapped.","\"But why did you do this? Don't you know how bad your reputation has become out there?\" Someone in the crowd couldn't understand and couldn't help but ask.","Chu Xinyue smiled, but it was a very bitter smile. Indeed, she didn't know how she had come to this point either.","Perhaps the alluring image of a happy family of four was too tempting, or perhaps she was too lonely, losing herself in a series of concessions, playing the role of a tragic figure.","That wasn't who she was supposed to be.","To find herself again, she decided to cut ties.","\"Who knows? Maybe I was just stupid,\" she said.","At this moment, the murmuring voices and mocking gazes of those around them all fell upon the family of three.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu seemed not to understand why everyone was looking at them like this.","Although those incidents were, strictly speaking, a bit unfair to Chu Xinyue, was it right for her to be so petty and reveal everything, not only ruining Chu Xueqi's reputation but also causing their entire Chu family to be ridiculed?","This was simply an unfilial daughter disregarding the interests of the whole family!","\"We're all family, what... what are you doing?\" Mr. Chu said through gritted teeth.","\"Can't you see how upset your sister is? She didn't do those things on purpose. Are you dredging up old accounts now to complain to everyone about how unfair we were to you?\" Mrs. Chu said, \"In any family with multiple children, there's no such thing as absolute fairness.\"","\"Is that so? In the past, I always deceived myself like this too,\" Chu Xinyue said mockingly.","[Ah, poor child, this must be what they call being blinded by family love! If the family hadn't been so excessive, exploiting her so heavily, Chu Xinyue would probably have continued like this for that bit of illusory familial affection. Fortunately, she's awakened.]","The Qin family nodded along. From the incidents that had just been revealed, it was clear that the young lady was truly excellent and kind-hearted. She couldn't be dragged down any further.","It was just a pity that they also had someone in their family who was blind to the truth, missing out on a good match.","The Qin family silently cast their gaze towards Qin Zhao.","At this moment, Qin Zhao was just staring blankly at Chu Xinyue. Seeing his soul-less appearance, he was indeed pitiful.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mother exchanged a glance, feeling that now was an appropriate time to say certain things.","So Qin's Mother spoke up, \"Mrs. Chu, what you're saying isn't right. We have four children in our family, and even if we can't achieve absolute fairness, relative fairness is still possible. We've never seen anyone favor one child so completely like you do.\"","The Chu family panicked, not expecting the Qin family to suddenly speak up. They still had a marriage agreement to settle.","\"No, it's just that this girl has always been too proud, so...\"","Chu Xueqi also panicked, crying while looking towards Qin Zhao, \"Brother Zhao, do you also think I'm a bad person? I'm not, I can explain all those things. I really didn't know my sister cared so much. I know it's all my fault, it's all because of me, but I didn't do it on purpose.\"","\"Then let me ask you, was it really you who saved me back then?\" Qin Zhao spoke up before Qin's Mother could continue.","With this question, the Chu family was momentarily stunned. How did the conversation suddenly turn to this incident?","The onlookers were amused, after all, the initial reason for changing the marriage agreement was because of this life-saving grace.","Chu Xinyue, who had been cold and indifferent until now, looked at the Chu family in shock.","This was something even she didn't know about.","Because of that life-saving grace, Chu Xinyue couldn't even defend her own engagement. She had never been someone afraid to face her own feelings, yet because of this, she found herself at an impasse.","Now they were telling her that once again, Chu Xueqi had stolen her accomplishment. How tragic.","\"It was... you... you all?\" Chu Xinyue finally felt heartache again, \"I forgot because I had a fever at the time, so you lied to me? Just so your younger daughter could claim this act of kindness? You even did something like this!\"","The Chu family's expressions changed rapidly. It was truly difficult to find an excuse when such a thing was exposed. Were they supposed to openly say that they wanted to give their elder daughter's fiancé to their younger daughter because they cared more for the younger one?","Even they felt it was unspeakable, which was why they had kept it from Chu Xinyue in the first place.","They no longer dared to quibble over the facts, as too many things had been revealed. If the Qin family decided to investigate, they couldn't say with certainty that the incident from years ago was foolproof. They had never imagined it would be investigated, so they hadn't even considered erasing the evidence.","So they didn't dare say a word.","\"No, it was me, not my sister. Brother Zhao, you have to believe me...\" Chu Xueqi was truly panicking now, seeing the look in Qin Zhao's eyes, she knew he didn't believe her anymore. She could only say, \"I... I don't remember, I was sick! And I asked you before, you said the one you liked was me, that it had nothing to do with the life-saving grace!\"","A flash of crimson appeared in Qin Zhao's eyes, and when he spoke again, his tone was colder than Chu Xueqi had ever heard, \"Then was the person I liked the real you? Or the you that you pretended to be?\"","Chu Xueqi's face turned pale, tears falling endlessly as if they cost nothing.","But Qin Zhao would no longer be moved by her pitiful appearance. Instead, he turned to look at Chu Xinyue.","Chu Xinyue, however, averted her gaze.","It was all over now. Even knowing the truth about what happened back then meant nothing to Chu Xinyue. It only made her more disappointed in those three people.","Seeing Chu Xinyue avoid his gaze, Qin Zhao felt as if something had pierced his heart.","It seemed he had truly lost something very important.","\"What exactly is going on now?! Can someone give me an answer? Who was the person who followed me for three months and got rid of my child?\" Wu Tian's mind was exploding with anger as he pointed at the Chu family, \"Your Chu family must give me an explanation. Whether it's the elder sister or the younger sister, I can't just be played like this!\"","Before the Chu family could recover, Chu Xinyue looked at Wu Tian and said, \"I've said so much already, can't you figure it out?\"","Wu Tian's gaze shifted from Chu Xinyue to Chu Xueqi, and he suddenly raised his hand as if to grab Chu Xueqi, \"Was it you? Was it?! It was from May to July this year, almost every night we were together. If it wasn't you, where were you on all those nights?\"","Chu Xueqi was so frightened she immediately hid behind her parents, \"It wasn't me, it definitely wasn't me! I was at home, I was always obediently at home!\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu's faces turned pale, their eyes constantly shifting. Finally, they exchanged a glance, then glanced at Chu Xinyue, secretly gritting their teeth.","\"Let's not talk about past events. This matter definitely wasn't Xueqi's doing. She was at home during all those times, we can testify to that,\" Mr. Chu suddenly spoke up.","Mrs. Chu nodded, adding, \"And during that period, Xinyue wasn't at home. We don't know where she went.\"","With these words, Wu Tian looked suspiciously at Chu Xinyue again.","Everyone else was confused too. After all, they could never have imagined that parents would go to such lengths to frame one daughter for the sake of another.","Chu Xinyue's gaze towards her parents was so cold it could almost freeze someone to death.","\"For her sake, you're willing to give false testimony?\" Chu Xinyue asked incredulously.","\"What false testimony? If you have any complaints, direct them at us. Do you only feel satisfied if you ruin your sister's reputation?\" Mr. Chu warned, \"Your reputation is already bad, do you want to drag your sister down with you?\"","\"And whose fault is it that my reputation is bad?\" Chu Xinyue laughed bitterly.","Mr. Chu was at a loss for words. But he still looked at Chu Xinyue with resentment, because in his view, if Chu Xinyue hadn't made a fuss and had just agreed to the engagement, the other party wouldn't have brought out such embarrassing evidence. She had truly disgraced their Chu family completely.","If they let Chu Xueqi admit to everything now, wouldn't that completely ruin Xueqi's reputation?","And all of this was caused by Chu Xinyue, so she should bear the consequences.","\"We indeed handled those previous matters inappropriately, but your sister is innocent. We protected her too well, she really doesn't understand anything. Besides, your sister has been in poor health since childhood, and that's because you absorbed her nutrients before birth. You owe her in the first place,\" Mrs. Chu also hinted maliciously.","Chu Xinyue smiled and said, \"I understand now. You knew I was in the mountains doing research during that time and couldn't prove my innocence, so you planned to provide a false alibi for Chu Xueqi. You thought this would pin her misdeeds on me? So you've already confirmed that it was her who was with Wu Tian.\"","\"She did all these things using my name. Why she did it, you don't care. And after it all came to light, you want me to take the blame for her?\"","Faced with Chu Xinyue's questioning, Mr. and Mrs. Chu's eyes flickered uneasily.","In the past, Chu Xinyue could find excuses to deceive herself, and the whole family could maintain a facade of peace.","But this time, her parents had given up all pretense. Without any disguise or excuses, they clearly chose to protect Chu Xueqi and betray her.","It was all too cruel.","Chu Xinyue felt like a person walking alone in a heavy snowstorm, isolated and helpless.","Meanwhile, Chu Xueqi was still well-protected by her parents, only revealing her resentful eyes and ungrateful face.","[As the saying goes, when parents lack virtue, siblings don't get along. No wonder Chu Xueqi can hurt others so righteously; it's all because of these bizarre parents.]","[They really want to save all the good things for their younger daughter, even if it means snatching them from their elder daughter! Is it because they didn't raise her that they have no feelings for her, so they can take from her freely without fear of hurting her? Do they think Chu Xinyue is so strong that it doesn't matter how they treat her? Why do parents like Mr. and Mrs. Chu exist, who are so biased and partial beyond reason?]","Hearing Ji Fei's confusion, Qin Xian wasn't particularly surprised.","From an economic perspective, this was a sunk cost problem.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu had invested too much time and energy in Chu Xueqi, while Chu Xinyue was like a distant relative to them. Naturally, there was a difference in their affection.","Perhaps at the very beginning, they were aware that they had wronged Chu Xinyue, but human nature instinctively avoids acknowledging one's own mistakes.","They were unwilling to face the fact that they had shortchanged Chu Xinyue, so they increasingly mistreated her to prove themselves right, even finding faults in Chu Xinyue to cover up their own guilt.","This led to a pathological situation where they turned a blind eye to Chu Xinyue's grievances while magnifying Chu Xueqi's discontent.","At this point, it was even more impossible for them to turn back. If they did, wouldn't it mean admitting they had failed as parents?","Sure enough, the next moment, Mr. Chu said, \"Xinyue, stop making trouble. You've been disrespectful to your parents and hurt your sister at home. Have we said anything about it? We've let it slide as you throwing tantrums before, but that's enough now.\"","Mrs. Chu stepped forward and grabbed Chu Xinyue's wrist, her tone becoming more severe, \"This time, you can't act willfully anymore, or we really won't forgive you! Be a good girl and listen. If you have any complaints, we'll discuss them when we get home. We'll compensate you for whatever you deserve.\"","They were well aware of how much Chu Xinyue cared about them. They thought that after saying this much, Chu Xinyue would surely know her place.","But Chu Xinyue suddenly mumbled, repeating, \"Disrespectful to parents?\"","Ji Fei couldn't help but think sarcastically, [Yes, yes, she was disrespectful to her parents because when her sister falsely accused her, she dared to argue back once, and that's disrespecting them.]","\"Hurt my sister?\"","[Oh yes, indeed, she hurt her sister because she didn't give everything she owned to her sister. When her sister cried, wasn't that hurting her delicate feelings?]","The Qin family listened with amusement.","Qin Zhao, however, kept recalling past events, his heart pierced again and again.","\"Acting willfully?\" Chu Xinyue looked deeply at Mr. and Mrs. Chu and said, \"I don't want your forgiveness or compensation. I just want to clear my name.\"","Mr. and Mrs. Chu were stunned, looking anxiously at Chu Xinyue, about to find a way to silence her again.","Then they heard Chu Xinyue say to Wu Tian, \"I'm willing to go to any hospital with you for an examination to see if I've ever been pregnant!\"","With these words, the whole scene exploded.","To be honest, it would take immense courage to withstand such shame. After all, she was the eldest daughter of the prestigious Chu family. How could she prove her innocence like this? How would she face people in the future? Would anyone in their circle dare to marry such a sharp-tongued girl?","However, it was indeed irrefutable evidence.","[Of course it's irrefutable evidence. She's still a pure and innocent maiden.]","The Qin family had also thought that as long as she was willing to go this far, no matter how the Chu family tried to quibble, everything would fall apart on its own. It could only be said that the Chu family was too foolish; they never imagined that Chu Xinyue would go to such lengths to prove her innocence. But for someone pushed to the edge of a cliff, how could she care about this bit of face?","She only wanted to clear her name.","\"I dare to do it. Do you?\" Chu Xinyue had already turned to look at Chu Xueqi.","Chu Xueqi was completely dumbfounded. She never thought Chu Xinyue would go this far.","Wu Tian was now staring at Chu Xueqi like a venomous snake, because Chu Xinyue's willingness to do this had thoroughly proven her innocence.","\"You've gone mad! You've gone mad! Do you know what you're saying? We won't allow you to degrade yourself like this!\" Mr. Chu was frantic.","Mrs. Chu was crying, \"Daughter, how did you become like this? You... you're simply...\"","If they had to choose to protect one, they would protect Chu Xueqi no matter what! So Chu Xinyue had no lingering attachment to them either.","Seeing their expressions becoming increasingly disgusted, unable to suppress the hatred welling up, she finally spoke.","\"Since I'm so despicable in your eyes, from this moment on, I declare that I'm severing ties with you three. From now on, I'm leaving the Chu family! I'll have no more connection with you!\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Finally Self-Destruct","paragraphs":["Silence. An eerie silence fell over the entire scene. One bombshell after another had left them all stunned.","Canceling the engagement, leaving the Chu Family.","This was the rhythm of abandoning everything!","They had only ever heard of illegitimate children desperately trying to squeeze into their social circles, never of a young lady giving up her status to leave those circles.","How much determination must it have taken to say such words?","But looking at the Chu Family's actions, if Chu Xinyue didn't leave now, who knows how she would continue to be used.","\"You... you... you... rebellious girl!\" Mr. Chu seemed at a loss for words to curse with.","Mrs. Chu cried out, \"Chu Xinyue, is this how you repay us for giving birth to you and raising you?\"","\"You gave birth to me, but you didn't raise me. If I had a choice, I'd rather not have been born to you at all. Better that than being used as a tool, having my bones broken to feed Chu Xueqi.\"","The Chu couple stared at Chu Xinyue, their eyes nearly popping out of their heads.","\"Sister, please stop this, okay? Even if you're angry, you shouldn't say such things. Aren't you afraid of breaking our parents' hearts?\" Chu Xueqi suddenly rushed forward, grabbing Chu Xinyue's wrist tightly. The force was so great that Chu Xinyue frowned.","\"Sister, if you don't want to marry Wu Tian, then don't. You two can break up and that's that. There's really no need to make such a scene.\" Chu Xueqi stared at her intently, her face as pale as death, clinging to Chu Xinyue like a drowning person to a lifeline, her voice choked with sobs.","\"I was wrong before. I did indeed take your place for various reasons, so I don't blame you for wanting to push this matter onto me this time. I know you like Brother Zhao, and you don't want to cancel the engagement, so you want to get revenge on me. But it's okay, I don't mind. Let's go home, alright? We can talk about this at home.\"","[Indeed, someone who can bully their own sister for so long must have a strong mentality. Even in this situation, she's still struggling desperately. Does she think Chu Xinyue will change her mind for her sake in the end? Chu Xinyue must have coddled them a lot in the past for them to have such a delusion.]","\"Chu Xueqi, are you incapable of understanding human speech?\" Chu Xinyue spoke coldly, shaking off Chu Xueqi's grip. \"I've already proven myself. What about you?\"","Chu Xueqi's face twisted almost beyond recognition, a flash of madness in her eyes. \"As a daughter of the Chu Family, how could I provide such proof? Sister! Do you want to anger our parents to death? Or are you trying to humiliate me with this method? I'm pure and innocent, I don't even know him. If you keep pushing me, I'll kill myself right now!\"","With that, Chu Xueqi unexpectedly rushed towards the nearby buffet table, grabbing the scissors used for cutting crab shells. She held them to her own throat, crying and shouting, \"Is dying to prove my innocence enough for you?\"","This scene frightened everyone.","The Chu couple panicked, crying out for her to stop.","\"This is all your fault! Look what you've done! You're going to cause your sister's death!\" Mrs. Chu beat Chu Xinyue.","Mr. Chu also turned to vent his anger on Chu Xinyue, \"Are you satisfied now? Is this the result you wanted? Apologize to your sister right now! You were the one with Wu Tian, why won't you admit it? Do you really want to watch your sister die?\"","Chu Xinyue stared blankly at Chu Xueqi, her expression indescribable, finally settling into something between laughter and tears.","It was always like this. Even though she was the one who suffered harm and grievances, as long as Chu Xueqi cried and made a scene, everything could be swept under the rug. She would even be painted as the villain, as if she were the one in the wrong.","Why did she have to endure all of this? Would she never be able to escape?","In this moment, Chu Xinyue truly felt suffocated. So suffocated that she didn't want to say a single word.","Everyone assumed she was also shocked by her sister's behavior.","The crowd retreated in a commotion.","The Qin Family's expressions were unpleasant. But in the next second, their expressions changed to shock.","Before anyone could react, a figure flashed behind Chu Xueqi. A tray swung from left to right with a loud bang.","Chu Xueqi's head was struck with such force that it left an afterimage. She staggered and fell, the scissors flying from her hand.","Everyone gaped at the woman who had suddenly appeared.","The Qin Family: When did Ji Fei go over there?","Ji Fei put down the violently shaking tray. [Thankfully, I saw through her scheming thoughts in advance. She wanted to use suicide to shift the blame and morally blackmail Chu Xinyue at the same time. Dream on! It's rare for little sister to step out and live her own life, I won't let this selfish demon ruin it.]","In this situation, if Chu Xueqi had hurt herself even slightly, Chu Xinyue would have been condemned for life, even if she was innocent in this matter. People outside would only spread rumors that she was overbearing and drove her sister to suicide.","The Qin Family's expressions were grim. If something had happened at their family banquet, it would have been impossible to explain, even if they were in the right. Fortunately, there was Ji Fei.","Qin Xian's face was dark. With a wave of his hand, the family's bodyguards rushed in. Before anyone could react, they restrained Chu Xueqi, who was still on the ground, dazed.","\"What are you doing!\" The Chu couple panicked.","Qin Xian spoke coldly, \"Your daughter has suicidal tendencies and is mentally unstable. For her safety, we have the obligation to restrict her behavior until you leave the Qin residence, to prevent her from accidentally harming other guests.\"","The others finally breathed a sigh of relief, praising Ji Fei's swift action and Qin Xian's decisive arrangement. They were only here to watch the drama unfold, not to experience a bloody incident.","People really couldn't be judged by appearances. Chu Xueqi was clearly sick in the head.","The Chu couple's faces couldn't have looked worse as they watched their daughter being treated like a mental patient.","\"We're all family, you...\"","\"Chu Xinyue has already broken off the engagement with my brother. Our two families are not one family,\" Qin Xian deliberately didn't mention the matter between Chu Xueqi and Qin Zhao, which represented the Qin Family's stance.","The Chu couple nearly lost their balance at this.","They had desperately refused to acknowledge it earlier because they were afraid Chu Xueqi would be entangled with that good-for-nothing and lose Qin Zhao as a golden son-in-law.","But now the situation seemed beyond salvaging.","\"Brother Zhao, Brother Zhao, save me!\" Chu Xueqi, having regained her senses, struggled in pain and helplessness, crying out.","But Qin Zhao didn't look at her. Instead, he was looking at Chu Xinyue standing to the side.","Because Chu Xinyue was acting strangely. She was staring motionlessly at the scissors that had fallen near her feet, the atmosphere around her terrifyingly oppressive.","Wu Tian rushed over and grabbed Chu Xueqi's chin. \"Was it you who was with me?\"","\"Let go of our daughter!\" Mr. Chu rushed forward and pushed Wu Tian away, shouting angrily, \"Wu Family, aren't you going to control your son?\"","\"Heh, no matter how bad our Wu Tian might be, he wouldn't pretend to be someone else to deceive others, and then attempt suicide when exposed. So we don't need to control him. It's your Chu Family who needs to control your child, isn't it?\"","The Chu couple's faces instantly turned red.","Wu Tian laughed, \"I, Wu Tian, can't be played for a fool like this. You won't admit it? I have even more explosive photos here. I'll release them now. I don't believe that every inch of you twins is identical!\"","These words shocked everyone. They had even taken that kind of photos and were going to release them? How could anyone live with that afterwards?","As Wu Tian was about to take out his phone, Chu Xueqi finally lost control and shouted, \"You're lying, you never took any...\"","Meanwhile, Chu Xinyue showed no reaction at all. The contrast was stark.","At this, everyone's burning gazes turned towards Chu Xueqi.","Chu Xueqi realized what she had done, and all expression drained from her face.","The Chu couple's faces were ashen.","\"That's right, I don't have any. I was bluffing you, Chu Xueqi. Now, let's see how you try to weasel out of this.\" Wu Tian grinned viciously, then turned to Chu Xinyue and said, \"I'm sorry. I was also deceived by your lying sister before, which is why I gave you trouble. I apologize. But you can't blame me, who told you to look exactly alike.\"","Chu Xinyue's lips trembled slightly, but she didn't respond. There was no joy at having her name cleared either.","[Chu Xinyue... seems a bit depressed. She's been traumatized.]","Qin Zhao was alarmed. Depressed? Had Chu Xinyue already been tormented to the point of illness by the Chu Family?","\"It wasn't me, it wasn't me!\" Chu Xueqi began to shout and scream. \"Brother Zhao, don't look at her, look at me! I've been wronged, I haven't betrayed you.\"","\"Mom, Dad, prove it for me! Prove that it was my sister, not me!\"","Even if the Chu couple were biased and protective, they knew at this point that the situation was beyond salvaging.","But Chu Xueqi refused to accept this sudden turn of events.","Her reputation was ruined, completely destroyed.","She finally revealed her true colors, shouting at Chu Xinyue, \"Chu Xinyue, hurry up and admit it was you! In the past, no matter what I took from you, didn't you always just meekly accept it?\"","Chu Xinyue looked at Chu Xueqi and said, \"Why should I?\"","\"Why? Because you owe me! It's because of you that I'm so weak and sickly. You don't know the pain of living in a hospital room since childhood, taking medicine, having surgeries, fighting death every day. It's all your fault! If I were healthy, I could have lived better than you. So everything I can't have should be suffered by you instead. You were born to be trampled under my feet, to sacrifice everything for me.\"","With these words, everyone present fell silent.","They looked at Chu Xinyue with sympathy and swept disapproving glances over Chu Xueqi.","But ultimately, their gazes settled on Mr. and Mrs. Chu. When Mrs. Chu had mentioned it earlier, everyone thought it was just an excuse to persuade Chu Xinyue, to make her feel a bit guilty and back down.","They never expected that even Chu Xueqi would have such an absurd notion.","At this moment, they could almost imagine the parents unintentionally complaining at the bedside of their sick little girl, telling her that the reason for her suffering was because her twin sister had absorbed more nutrients.","They had blamed their misfortunes on another innocent child, giving the sick one a target for her resentment.","As the saying goes, when parents lack virtue, their children won't get along.","At this point, Mr. and Mrs. Chu were looking at Chu Xueqi in shock.","They felt that reality was one thing, but in their hearts, Chu Xueqi was pure and lovable. Even if she made childish mistakes, it was just due to her illness since childhood and different environment. They couldn't blame her.","But Chu Xueqi's sudden outburst revealed her true face, exposing her evil heart, shattering Mr. and Mrs. Chu's illusions.","\"Huh, no wonder you always seemed to speak up for me in the past, but actually added fuel to the fire, or made up lies to ruin my reputation, framed me, and hurt me. So you hate me, you blame all your misfortunes on me,\" Chu Xinyue murmured.","It wasn't just about competing for their parents' love; Chu Xueqi truly hated her, wanted to torment her, destroy her.","She might not even love Qin Zhao at all, but only wanted to snatch away the person Chu Xinyue liked.","The color drained from Chu Xueqi's face, and she trembled with fear, but still refused to back down.","\"It is your fault! You have the same face as me, that's heaven's will. Because you owe me, it's made easier for you to repay me this way!\" Chu Xueqi said, staring at that identical face in a daze. \"It doesn't matter if you don't admit it now, there will be more chances in the future. You can't escape me...\"","[Psycho!]","Ji Fei's inner voice represented what everyone was thinking at that moment.","They wondered how the Chu family had raised such a twisted person.","But in the next second, they heard Chu Xinyue say in a trembling voice, \"No, you won't impersonate me again.\"","It seemed she had developed a trauma from being tormented like this.","Chu Xinyue suddenly picked up the scissors from the ground and was about to slash her own face.","Everyone cried out in alarm.","A figure flashed quickly, reaching out to block the scissors.","Everyone watched in shock as Qin Zhao saved Chu Xinyue. If not for him, Chu Xinyue would have at least a scar on her face from the scissors.","It wasn't that Qin Zhao was particularly fast, but when Chu Xinyue made her move, Ji Fei saw the information and cried out, allowing Qin Zhao to act first.","Chu Xinyue hadn't expected to be stopped. She stared blankly at Qin Zhao, noticing that his palm seemed to be bleeding where he had grabbed the scissors.","Chu Xinyue said coldly, \"Let go! I don't want to clean up her messes anymore. I don't want her to steal my things or take the blame for her anymore. I've had enough. I want to completely separate myself from her!\""]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: He... Has Been Blocked","paragraphs":["[\"Oh my goodness, sister! You should be ruining the face of that troublemaker, not your own!\"]","Ji Fei exclaimed passionately. The Qin family couldn't help but think that the one who should be hurt was the person who caused harm, not Chu Xinyue herself.","However, they also couldn't allow Chu Xinyue to actually harm someone. Such a pure and kind person had just cleared her name; she shouldn't be forced into creating such a blemish on her record.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu stared at Chu Xinyue in a daze, their expressions bewildered, barely able to stand. It seemed their hearts could hardly bear the numerous twists and turns of the day.","Chu Xueqi, on the other hand, was glaring at Chu Xinyue and Qin Zhao standing together, her eyes bloodshot.","Chu Xinyue was still in a standoff with Qin Zhao. She had no other options left. No matter how she changed her appearance, Chu Xueqi always found a way to make herself look the same. She truly had run out of ideas.","Qin Zhao, seeing Chu Xinyue's nearly broken expression, felt a sharp pain in his chest.","\"You've already firmly decided to leave everything behind, so why are you hurting yourself for people who don't matter?\" Qin Zhao said. \"Didn't you want to leave them so you could take good care of yourself? What are you doing now?\"","[\"Wow, the third brother is finally talking sense. Has he snapped out of his naive phase and regained his intelligence?\"]","Ignoring Ji Fei's sarcastic comment, Qin Zhao looked towards his family members for help. He knew that whatever he said now, Chu Xinyue wouldn't listen, especially since he had just been standing against her.","Ji Fei stepped forward, patting Chu Xinyue's shoulder. \"You've already done so well. Don't punish yourself for someone else's mistakes.\"","\"That's right, young lady. It's not worth it,\" Qin's Mother quickly came forward to persuade her. Qin Yan also came to help hold Chu Xinyue back. \"Little Xi just told me how beautiful you are. That beauty belongs to you.\"","\"I believe everyone here can now tell you apart. We won't have situations like before happening again,\" Qin's Father said in a deep voice.","Seeing the Qin family surrounding her, Chu Xinyue could feel genuine warmth, and her eyes immediately reddened.","Others finally couldn't bear to watch anymore and started to persuade her as well.","\"We can tell you apart now. It's very clear. Even if there are any more incidents about real or fake identities in the future, we'll all be careful to distinguish between you two. We were ignorant before, but we're not fools anymore.\"","Qin Zhao took the opportunity to snatch away the scissors and throw them aside.","Chu Xinyue took a deep breath and said, \"Thank you. I was being impulsive.\"","In truth, Chu Xinyue was just a bit depressed, and only lost control under extreme stress. Once she calmed down, she wouldn't do such foolish things again.","Chu Xinyue looked at the three people and said, \"Everything that needed to be said has been said. It's over.\"","\"Daughter, you...\" Mrs. Chu called out anxiously.","Chu Xinyue coldly replied, \"I told you, I'm not your daughter anymore.\"","\"Alright, that's enough,\" Mr. Chu frowned.","Seeing them still acting as if she was just being a 'disobedient daughter' made Chu Xinyue feel nauseated. No matter what she said to them, they never seemed to understand.","They thought severing ties was just angry talk, but they didn't understand that Chu Xinyue's feelings for them had been worn away by years of favoritism. It wasn't just a momentary outburst.","\"Don't contact me anymore. I don't want to see you. If you insist on forcing me to be your daughter, then go ahead and sue me. I'll pay whatever alimony the court decides, but nothing more than that.\"","Speaking in such detail showed that she had thought this through very carefully.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu looked at Chu Xinyue in disbelief, finally realizing that she truly intended to do this. At this moment, they panicked, no longer able to be complacent, feeling as if all strength had left their bodies.","Hadn't Chu Xinyue always been able to endure any dissatisfaction and bear any grievance before?","Today, they had only asked her to save her sister and endure a little more hardship. How had it escalated to her cutting all ties with them just because she refused?","But Chu Xinyue wasn't giving them any more chances to remain confused. She bowed to the Qin family and said, \"I'm sorry for ruining your banquet. I apologize.\"","\"The banquet was about to end anyway. You didn't ruin anything,\" Qin Zhao quickly said.","Chu Xinyue glanced at Qin Zhao and only said, \"I'll take my leave.\"","\"I'll see you off!\" Qin Zhao blurted out almost instinctively.","Chu Xinyue coldly replied, \"There's no need.\"","With that, she turned and left. Only Qin Zhao seemed frozen in place.","People automatically made way for her. It was her path to a new life.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu's calls began to ring out continuously, but whether their tones were angry or sorrowful, they didn't make Chu Xinyue look back. She just disappeared from everyone's sight.","When Mr. and Mrs. Chu turned around, they found that Chu Xueqi had fainted.","But it no longer aroused any sympathy from anyone.","Mr. and Mrs. Chu left in a sorry state, taking Chu Xueqi with them. Wu Tian still followed, pestering them.","Wu's uncle and aunt apologized to the Qin family. After all, this incident was indeed caused by Wu Tian, creating a misunderstanding that put everyone in an awkward position.","\"Sigh, we're victims too. I really don't know how the Chu family could be so blind.\"","\"Let's pretend we didn't hear that. Who knows, you might still become in-laws.\"","The two hostesses exchanged hypocritical pleasantries.","Wu's aunt said awkwardly, \"We absolutely can't let that kind of woman into our family. I don't know if Wu Tian really likes her or if he's just unwilling to give up. Your children are much better... that... your fourth daughter.\"","Qin's Mother's face immediately darkened. She was about to retort when she heard Ji Fei muttering nearby.","[\"How can you not know why your Wu Tian won't let go? Isn't it because Wu Tian has difficulty getting women pregnant? At first, he indeed wanted to get back at her for rejecting him, and also wanted to make things difficult for Qin Zhao because of Chu Xinyue. But after the conflict, for him to have the guts to come back and make such a scene, it's because he discovered that Chu Xueqi had been pregnant with his child. Of course he's going to cling to the woman who gives him a chance to be a father.\"]","Qin's Mother's expression immediately became subtle, caught between wanting to mock them and maintaining her composure. It was quite difficult.","But behind her:","Qin Yan: \"Ahem.\"","Qin Zhao: \"Hmph!\"","Qin Xian didn't react, but looked at Ji Fei with some exasperation. What kind of dirty gossip was she reading?","The Wu family: ?","\"Congratulations in advance on your families' union,\" Qin's Father said coldly.","The Wu family couldn't stay any longer and had to leave with the other guests.","This banquet had been incredibly worthwhile for everyone who attended. After they left, various pieces of news exploded within their circle. Those who didn't have time to attend or didn't receive an invitation were extremely regretful.","They couldn't even imagine how thrilling it would have been to witness the drama in person!","That night, the entire upper-class circle was destined for a sleepless night.","After the house was cleared, the family sat together and had a quiet late-night snack. After all, it's hard to eat your fill at a banquet.","However, everyone's gaze kept sweeping towards Qin Zhao from time to time.","Unable to bear these glances any longer, Qin Zhao said, \"If you have something to say, just say it.\"","\"Sigh, are you still going to date Chu Xueqi?\" Qin Yan asked curiously.","Qin Zhao's face darkened as he replied, \"Am I crazy? Those were all false appearances. The one I liked was never Chu Xueqi to begin with.\"","\"So you like Xinyue now?\" Qin's Mother asked gossip-hungry.","Qin Zhao choked, unable to open his mouth.","[\"Of course he likes her. He's regretting it to death.\"]","Qin Zhao immediately looked towards Ji Fei, both embarrassed and anxious.","Ji Fei, sitting to the side, was busy enjoying her meal, completely oblivious to others' gazes.","\"Ahem, even if you like her, it's useless. She doesn't want you anymore,\" Qin Xian said, cutting to the heart of the matter.","Qin Zhao's breath caught in his throat.","Finally, Qin's Father patted Qin Zhao's shoulder. His fatherly love was silent as he shook his head and went upstairs with his wife, who had finished eating, to rest.","Qin Yan hugged Qin Xi, who had finally finished eating, and went to sleep.","Seeing that Ji Fei had almost finished her fruit, Qin Xian spoke up, \"Ji Fei, let's go upstairs. I have something to discuss with you.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"About your studio.\"","[\"Money-making stuff!\"]","In the end, only Qin Zhao was left in the once-lively dining room.","Qin Zhao leaned back on the sofa, lost in thought, when suddenly his phone rang.","He answered to find it was his little sister.","After connecting, his sister's surprised voice came through, \"Third brother, what's going on? Are the rumors in our circle true? Did you break off your engagement with Sister Xinyue? And you got the wrong person, so Sister Xueqi is actually the bad one? No wonder I've always preferred Sister Xinyue.\"","Qin Zhao didn't want to rub salt in his wounds and was about to hang up, feeling irritated. But then he heard Qin Rong say, \"It's such a pity. I always thought Sister Xinyue would be my third sister-in-law. After all, she's the woman you've known the longest and spent the most time with.\"","Qin Zhao was stunned. \"Is... that so?\" He couldn't seem to remember.","\"That's right, you two grew up together as childhood sweethearts. You didn't like to play with me, only with Sister Xinyue. I remember when we played games as kids, you made me be your daughter and her be your wife. You even swore that when you grew up, you'd marry Sister Xinyue and give her a complete family. You even kissed her cheek then! Grandma and Grandma Chu saw it, which is when they thought of arranging your marriage.\"","Qin Zhao was stunned.","Then he smiled bitterly.","So, the marriage arrangement had started because of him. It was a promise unique to them. He had made such a promise to her - a complete family. Such an important promise, how could he have forgotten? He really was a jerk!","\"Brother, are you crying?\" Qin Rong's surprised voice came through.","Qin Zhao covered his face with one hand and said hoarsely, \"You have such a good memory. Tell me more about our childhood.\"","\"Huh? Actually, I don't remember much. We weren't in the same grade after all,\" Qin Rong murmured softly. \"I just remember that after you started school, you didn't play with Sister Xinyue much anymore, or with me. You said boys should play with boys.\"","\"There was one time you got angry because people in your class found out about your engagement and teased you. You said it made you feel very ashamed.\"","\"After that... I don't think I saw Sister Xinyue come to our house to play much.\"","\"Then, suddenly, it seemed like you only cared about Chu Xueqi.\"","Qin Zhao gritted his teeth. That was because of the life-saving debt.","He naturally remembered what happened as they grew up. Because of the engagement, his family would remind him to visit the Chu family.","But in reality, back then, it was just a verbal agreement between the elders, without even an engagement ceremony. So in Qin Zhao's mind, the bond between them as fiancés was very weak. They hadn't even dated. It was just a title.","So he always felt justified in admiring others, thinking he wasn't being unfaithful to Chu Xinyue. He mostly went there to visit the sickly Chu Xueqi.","But every time he interacted with them, Chu's parents would constantly praise Chu Xueqi and complain about Chu Xinyue, while Chu Xinyue would just quietly listen and watch from the side.","He had indeed wronged Chu Xinyue many times back then. But whenever he questioned Chu Xinyue for Chu Xueqi's sake, Chu Xinyue never really defended herself.","She must have failed to defend herself to her parents before he arrived, and then seeing him doting on Chu Xueqi, she lost any will to explain, only showing indifference.","Qin Zhao couldn't help but wonder, if only Chu Xinyue had tried to explain herself to him a few more times, would he have come to his senses and tried to verify things, to believe her just once? At least initially, he surely would have.","But without a single explanation, his misunderstandings of her kept accumulating, eventually turning into unconditional trust in Chu Xueqi.","Gradually, it was as if he had been brainwashed. He couldn't blame Chu Xinyue for her behavior in that living environment; it was he who failed to notice Chu Xinyue's situation.","Indeed, he had been foolish, losing such a treasure.","He was wrong, he had awakened, and he... didn't want to let go anymore. Did he still have a chance?","Qin Zhao couldn't wait. He urgently wanted to contact Chu Xinyue, even regretting not insisting on sending her home just now. He should have been thick-skinned to the end.","No one answered the phone.","So he sent a message.","\"Do you have a place to stay?\"","\"Let me know if you need any help.\"","\"I still owe you a life-saving debt that I haven't repaid. Can you let me know that you're safe now?\"","There was no response. When he tried calling again, suddenly the call wouldn't go through. When he tried sending another message, he saw a red exclamation mark.","He... had been blocked.","...","Spoiler Warning","...","(Spoiler alert! Because too many readers misunderstood and left low ratings in the review section to warn new readers, I have no choice but to give a spoiler in this early chapter about the issue everyone is concerned about. No matter what the following plot is, [they don't end up together, they don't end up together, they don't end up together], important things are said three times. Writing a book is not easy, please don't jump to conclusions too quickly, X_X)"]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Live with less money and more ease","paragraphs":["Due to her previous agent being blacklisted, Ji Fei could now only stay at home unemployed.","Although Ji Fei had decided to give up and enjoy life, continuing like this was becoming unbearably boring.","Qin Xi went to school, and Qin Yan was arranged by Qin's Father to re-engage with matters related to the company hospital.","Qin's Mom had various old girlfriends to have afternoon tea with, leaving only Ji Fei without friends, work, or anything to do.","After much consideration, she decided not to waste her superior looks and return to the entertainment industry to have some fun.","This way, she could not only get up-close access to celebrity gossip, but also be surrounded by handsome men and beautiful women to prepare for her next romance. Moreover, she could easily earn big money to accumulate a divorce fund in case Qin Xian kicked her out for his first love in the future.","The idea seemed wonderful, so she mentioned it to Qin Xian.","Qin Xian said he would help her set up a new studio, but Ji Fei didn't expect that he would actually make her interview agents herself.","Those who came to interview for a has-been like her were not particularly impressive agents.","This was bad enough, but in the cesspool of the entertainment industry, people with good character were a minority.","Even if they hid it well, they were like naked emperors in front of Ji Fei.","So during the interviews, she remained silent after each one.","Later, Ji Fei worried that Qin Xian would lose patience, but he didn't say a word, even as it became clear that no more agents were coming to apply.","Qin Xian then directly packed Ji Fei off to Qin Zhao Studio.","When she was received there, Ji Fei was completely dumbfounded.","Inside the office, there were only two people.","Qin Zhao was lounging on a nearby sofa, looking down at his phone. When she entered, he raised his head slightly in acknowledgment.","To be fair, since the last incident, this guy's attitude towards her had improved considerably.","[Love's bitterness really can make people grow up.]","Qin Zhao's movements stiffened. Hold it in!","Sitting at the conference table was his agent.","\"Hello, Ms. Ji. I'm Gao Hao, Mr. Qin's agent. Mr. Qin has already given instructions. From now on, I'll be guiding your activities in the entertainment industry. This is your contract. Once you sign it, you'll be the second artist in our studio.\"","Gao Hao was a middle-aged man wearing glasses, smiling amiably. He looked kind-faced, but in the entertainment industry, that usually meant he was a wolf in sheep's clothing.","Ji Fei looked at Gao Hao, then at Qin Zhao in the distance, who was emanating an aura of a resentful husband.","\"You agreed? Didn't you absolutely refuse before?\" Ji Fei asked bluntly.","[I don't want this guy to reluctantly accept me and then act all awkward later.]","Who's acting awkward!","Qin Zhao gritted his teeth, feeling a bit uncomfortable as he said, \"That was then, this is now. Since you're my second sister-in-law, having you here will put my second brother more at ease.\"","\"Oh? Is that so?\"","[Ugh, I'm getting goosebumps all over. Did he take the wrong medication or something?]","Qin Zhao: ...","He was starting to doubt his second brother's original intention in pushing her into his studio.","Was it really not just to annoy him to death?","Gao Hao looked awkwardly from side to side. Mr. Qin had indeed mentioned this before, but Qin Zhao had rejected it in front of Ji Fei, even threatening to leave if she joined.","Clearly, the relationship between uncle and sister-in-law was extremely poor.","So Gao Hao didn't understand why this top star suddenly agreed to accept his sister-in-law into his own studio.","In fact, Qin Zhao was doing this to thank Ji Fei. If it weren't for her, he didn't know what foolish things he might have done regarding the Chu Xinyue situation.","But his relationship with Ji Fei had been so bad before that he couldn't suddenly become friendly.","So when his second brother asked again, he agreed. It would be better for Ji Fei to have his protection, since she couldn't openly reveal her identity in the entertainment industry.","Ji Fei was still skeptical. \"Although you're the boss of this studio, I won't just do everything you say. I want to decide what work I take on myself. Is that okay?\"","Gao Hao immediately smiled and said, \"Don't worry about that, you can look at the contract first.\"","Only then did Ji Fei lower her head to look at the contract. After scanning it once, she was shocked.","She could freely choose all her work, take time off whenever she wanted, and most importantly, the profit-sharing arrangement.","Her previous studio had at least put on a show of an 80-20 split.","Here, they were letting Ji Fei receive all the income, equivalent to being affiliated without any service fees, completely free of charge.","\"Don't you... need to be paid?\" Ji Fei asked in surprise.","Gao Hao smiled and said, \"Our salaries are naturally paid by Mr. Qin.\"","Gao Hao didn't find it strange, just considering it as a brother-in-law showing respect to his sister-in-law.","Ji Fei also realized this and looked at Qin Zhao in astonishment.","Qin Zhao thought Ji Fei shouldn't have anything more to say now, so he continued looking down at his phone.","But then he heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts: [He really has been traumatized by losing his love, he doesn't care about anything anymore!]","Qin Zhao took a deep breath, \"Are you going to sign it or not?!\"","Of course, she had to take advantage of such a good deal, so she quickly signed.","Ji Fei maintained a calm exterior, but inside she was singing joyfully.","Not a single note was on beat, but she was still singing enthusiastically, even improvising.","For an all-round top star skilled in singing, dancing, and acting, this was torture to the ears.","Gao Hao smiled as he took the contract and said, \"What kind of work would Ms. Ji like to do? I've checked, and you mainly did print ads before.\"","Ji Fei said, \"Oh, forget about my previous experience. Now I just want work that's low-effort, high-paying, and not tiring.\"","Gao Hao almost couldn't maintain his smile.","Qin Zhao's expression was also hard to describe.","\"Why are you looking at me like that? Isn't this every working person's ultimate dream? Given the choice, wouldn't you want this too?\"","Gao Hao was stunned, realizing she had a point.","Qin Zhao, born with a silver spoon in his mouth, naturally couldn't understand this, but he couldn't be bothered to argue with Ji Fei.","\"Fine, low-effort, high-paying, and not tiring. Find her work according to these standards,\" Qin Zhao said. \"Oh, and exclude the singer route as an option.\"","Ji Fei: ?","Gao Hao, having seen it all, immediately put on his professional smile and said, \"Alright, no problem.\"","Seeing that things were more or less settled, Qin Zhao had lost his spirit and looked somewhat dejected as he said, \"I'll be going then. I'll leave the rest to you, Brother Gao.\"","Then he asked Ji Fei, \"Any problems?\"","Ji Fei shook her head.","[Tsk tsk tsk, look at that widower face, he's probably still heartbroken because he can't contact Chu Xinyue.]","Qin Zhao gave Ji Fei a listless glance, truly too tired to argue. It was as if all his energy had been drained that night.","[Should I tell him that Chu Xinyue is preparing to apply to go abroad? Nah, there's no use crying over spilt milk. Late-coming deep affection is cheaper than grass. I guess the drama of chasing after a wife isn't something that can be easily staged.]","Qin Zhao's face darkened, his breathing becoming rapid.","She's actually leaving?","These days, not only could he not contact Chu Xinyue, but he couldn't even find her when he went to her school.","He didn't know anyone in Chu Xinyue's social circle, so he was truly at a loss, only able to stare at her various social media accounts all day, looking for any new updates.","But Chu Xinyue wasn't the type to post updates often.","It seemed that unless she contacted him first, she would disappear from his world, not even giving him a chance to regret.","No matter how much he realized his mistake now, she wouldn't even look back at him.","It was already so difficult in the same city, if she went abroad... that would really be...","Qin Zhao's face turned terrifying, and he immediately turned to leave.","This time, even if he had to stand guard outside their school laboratory door day and night without rest, he would see her. He still had so much to say, he didn't want to leave any regrets.","Seeing Qin Zhao about to leave, Gao Hao suddenly remembered something and said, \"Then about tonight's industry wine tasting event, you...\"","Qin Zhao paused, as if remembering something, his face turning cold, \"Cancel it.\"","Gao Hao wasn't surprised. Recently, Qin Zhao had cancelled almost all activities, running off to universities to look for someone. As his agent, he naturally knew what had happened.","For him, there were pros and cons. The good thing was that he finally didn't have to deal with the troublemaker Chu Xueqi anymore. Even though he wasn't her agent, he often had to clean up her messes, and she would use the softest voice to push him into the deepest pit, leaving him with no way to reason.","The new Ms. Ji, although her identity was also not simple, seemed much easier to deal with than Chu Xueqi.","The bad thing was that the money tree wasn't making money, struggling in the quagmire of love. For someone as sentimental as Qin Zhao, who knew how long it would take to recover, leaving his agent quite helpless.","As for the wine tasting event just mentioned, he knew Qin Zhao wouldn't attend, because it was originally an invitation accepted to help introduce Chu Xueqi to industry connections. Now, Qin Zhao naturally wouldn't go to such unnecessary trouble.","Gao Hao had just thought about taking advantage of this event, so he spoke up: \"I think it would be good for Teacher Ji to participate in this event. Although there's no money involved, it's paving the way for the future. Strictly speaking, Teacher Ji is a newcomer to our studio and needs to be recognized by industry insiders. This way, people will be more likely to offer her work. Otherwise, if we only rely on actively seeking opportunities ourselves, our choices will be much more limited. I originally wanted you to take Ji Fei along, but since you don't want to go, I can take her myself. However, the event is out of town, so we might need to stay overnight.\"","Qin Zhao looked at Ji Fei and said, \"It's up to you. Just let Second Brother know. I'm busy and have things to do. If you want to go, let Brother Gao accompany you.\"","Ji Fei gave an OK hand gesture.","Qin Zhao turned and walked towards the exit.","Ji Fei curiously asked Gao Hao, \"Where is the location?\"","Gao Hao smiled and said, \"Yunmu Hotel.\"","\"That sounds familiar.\"","\"Of course! It's a very famous hotel!\"","[It's not that kind of familiar. Oh, I remember now. Chu Xinyue shared a research sponsorship event on her social media, and the location was this hotel.]","A loud bang startled Ji Fei and Gao Hao, causing them to turn and look.","They saw Qin Zhao with one foot out the door and the other still inside, as if he couldn't get out in time before the door closed on him.","This was so out of character for his top-tier image.","Ji Fei: Pfft!","Gao Hao: *Trying to hold it in*","\"Ahem, what's wrong, Zhao?\" Gao Hao asked, puzzled.","\"Uh... there's something I forgot to take,\" Qin Zhao said, rubbing the red mark on his forehead from the impact, seeming a bit absent-minded as he walked towards the sofa, his eyes constantly glancing at Ji Fei.","Social media? Ji Fei could actually see Chu Xinyue's social media posts?!","When did they add each other as contacts?","His older sister and second brother didn't have Chu Xinyue's contact information. His younger sister did, but she blocked Chu Xinyue after saying a few words on his behalf.","How on earth did Ji Fei manage this?!","It felt like a shortcut was right beside him, but he had been blind to it.","They had exchanged contact information when Ji Fei lent Chu Xinyue a dress earlier. Since Ji Fei never initiated a conversation with Chu Xinyue, Chu Xinyue forgot to block her.","The event link was also shared as required, and Chu Xinyue didn't expect anyone to see it.","Meanwhile, Gao Hao continued discussing the hotel with Ji Fei, \"It's an all-in-one package for dining, entertainment, and accommodation. Teacher Ji, just treat it as a vacation. It won't be tiring.\"","[Let me see. Sure enough, Chu Xinyue and her classmates and teachers have already left to seek sponsorship. They'll probably be staying at the hotel tonight too. I could arrange to meet up with her to hang out. I quite like her. It's fortunate that Qin Zhao isn't going, otherwise, it would definitely be impossible to meet up with Chu Xinyue.]","[Sigh, it's not that your sister-in-law won't help, it's just that you two are destined to be apart!]","Qin Zhao: ..."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Snacking Everywhere","paragraphs":["After briefly informing Qin Xian, she boarded the van prepared by the studio.","The manager Brother Gao, new assistant Xiao Tao, and the styling team - a large group of people arrived at Yunmu Hotel in the neighboring city.","Brother Gao had arranged such a grand entourage for her, a relatively unknown celebrity. People who didn't know better might think the Qin Dynasty had arrived.","Some acquaintances came over to greet them, and upon seeing a beautiful, radiant woman emerge, they were immediately stunned.","Those with keen ears in the industry knew that Qin Zhao had broken up with Chu Xueqi, but they didn't expect him to have his team escort another woman so soon. This was big news.","Those with sharp eyes found Ji Fei somewhat familiar, after all, she had been on various magazines and most billboards related to Qin Corporation. This made her relationship with Qin Zhao even more intriguing.","\"Brother Gao is here. What's keeping Mr. Qin busy? We haven't seen him around lately. And this is...?\"","\"This is our studio's newly signed artist, Ji Fei. Please take care of her in the future, everyone.\"","\"Brother Gao, give us a hint. Is she and Mr. Qin...?\"","\"She's not a lover or girlfriend or anything like that. Her identity is not simple, she's from their upper circles, coming in to dabble in the industry.\"","To avoid trouble, Gao Hao naturally clarified, and those with the means would certainly discover her identity.","At the appreciation event, all the social niceties were handled by Gao Hao. Ji Fei only needed to follow behind, raise her glass politely, smile, and remember people's faces and names.","This kind of protection naturally made people view Ji Fei's status much higher.","So the whole event was Gao Hao skillfully navigating social interactions, while Ji Fei happily observed from the sidelines, enjoying herself immensely.","However, at such occasions, there were more behind-the-scenes people than artists, so the gossip was limited.","As time went on, Ji Fei didn't have much left to see.","Just as she was getting bored, she turned her head and was so startled she almost dropped her wine glass.","She saw Chu Xueqi suddenly appear, walking quickly in their direction.","She could somewhat understand why Chu Xinyue had wanted to destroy her own face before. Because when that face appeared, it really made people momentarily confused about who was who. Even this brief moment of confusion must have made Chu Xinyue feel sick.","But why was she here?","Chu Xueqi was heading towards Gao Hao. She had seen him from afar and thought Qin Zhao might be there too, but she didn't expect to see Ji Fei by Gao Hao's side instead.","She paused for a moment, but didn't dare to offend Ji Fei. Instead, she anxiously asked Gao Hao, \"Brother Gao, is Brother Zhao here?\"","Gao Hao was impatient but still maintained a professional smile: \"No, he's not.\"","But Chu Xueqi didn't believe it. \"Is he here but refusing to see me?\"","Although Chu Xueqi wasn't speaking very loudly, this commotion still caused many people around to look on with interest.","This annoyed Gao Hao greatly. If the media caught wind of this, it would surely become a trending topic. The previous rumors about the two had already given him enough of a headache.","As a manager, he couldn't allow his artist to face such trouble.","Knowing that Chu Xueqi wouldn't listen to reason, Gao Hao could only use delaying tactics. \"Miss Chu, why don't we step outside to talk?\"","\"Alright, you take me to see Brother Zhao.\"","Gao Hao's face stiffened. He turned to look at Ji Fei.","Ji Fei was also at a loss. Chu Xinyue's luck was really bad. If the two sisters met, she was afraid Chu Xueqi might go crazy and cause trouble.","Seeing Gao Hao look over, Ji Fei said, \"I'm tired. I'm planning to go out for a walk. Xiao Tao can come with me.\"","Gao Hao nodded, and they quickly left the venue, leaving behind a group of people eager for gossip but unable to satisfy their curiosity.","Yunmu Hotel was divided into three buildings: one for dining and entertainment, one for accommodation, and one for meetings and other activities.","As soon as Ji Fei parted ways with Gao Hao and the others, she first returned to her hotel room to change clothes, while simultaneously sending a message to contact Xinyue.","\"Xinyue, I'm at Yunmu Hotel for an event. I think I just saw you, are you here too?\"","There was no response.","Ji Fei didn't know if the other party hadn't seen the message or didn't want to respond. After all, she was Qin Zhao's sister-in-law, and perhaps Xinyue wanted to cut off all connections.","But Ji Fei still kindly reminded her, \"By the way, I also saw Chu Xueqi at the event just now. I hope you two don't run into each other.\"","Still no response. Ji Fei could only do this much.","She dragged Xiao Tao along to the dining and entertainment area.","However, as soon as they reached the lobby on the first floor, they saw many people stopping to watch some commotion.","How could they miss this?","Ji Fei and Xiao Tao immediately hit the brakes and crowded forward to look inside.","Good heavens! They saw a man kneeling and hugging a woman's legs. Both looked to be in their twenties.","The man shouted, \"Xiao Ya, I love you, I can't live without you. If you leave me, I'll die!\"","The woman, with reddened eyes, said, \"Ah Zhi, there are so many people watching, don't do this!\"","\"Xiao Ya, I was wrong, I really know I was wrong. It's all because I love you too much, care about you too much. I only lashed out in a moment of impulse. How could you be so close to that man!\"","\"Don't talk nonsense, you know very well that was my professor! You always jump to conclusions without distinguishing... forget it, I don't want to say anymore. We've already broken up, I...\"","\"I don't want to break up. Give me a chance to change, I'm begging you.\" The man's tone rose excitedly.","The woman could only say with frustration, \"This isn't the first time you've gotten jealous and hit the men around me. You've made me owe apologies to so many people. My friend says you have a psychological problem that can't be fixed. She advised me to break up with you before, but I gave you chances. Yet you raised your hand again this time. I'm thoroughly disappointed in you.\"","\"Those people must have ulterior motives. You're not a man, you don't know what they're thinking. I know, I'm protecting you!\"","\"You're impossible to reason with! I should have listened to her advice and never seen you again.\"","\"I was wrong, I was wrong. I'll do whatever you say if you can forgive me. I hit the wrong person, I'll punish myself!\" With that, the man started slapping his own face.","The surrounding crowd whispered among themselves.","The woman endured for a while, but couldn't bear it anymore. She quickly grabbed his hands, still looking concerned.","\"Stop hitting yourself. Our problem isn't that simple!\"","\"I know, you're still hung up on that accident. I've told you, there's nothing between me and her! I've completely cut off contact with her.\"","\"But my friend said she saw you together again. She said you lied to me and told me not to go back to you.\"","The man's face twisted. \"Nonsense! Tell her to show proof! Didn't you say your friend's love life isn't going well? She's clearly jealous of our relationship.\"","\"She wouldn't do that. She's a good person, and very accomplished. You shouldn't talk about her like that. She's just looking out for me! Many times when we fought, she took me in and comforted me!\"","\"Looking out for you? Is sowing discord looking out for you? I may be a bit impulsive, but everything I do is out of jealousy and love for you. Can you deny that? Did she even deny my feelings for you? She just can't stand to see you happy!\"","\"No... that's not it!\" Although she said no, her eyes clearly wavered.","\"We've been together for so many years. Would you rather believe an outsider than me? Even if I have some small flaws, I truly love you! We used to be fine before. Ever since you started hanging out with her, you've changed. You used to be so obedient, but now you pick at everything I do. It must be her whispering in your ear, brainwashing you.\"","\"No... what she says makes sense. You control me too much. I have no freedom. I can't even decide what to wear. Other people have advised me too. I was just too close to the situation to see clearly.\" The woman said with a conflicted expression.","\"Those are all small things. I just want to take care of you! And there's something you don't know. Actually, your friend has feelings for me!\"","The woman was shocked. \"What? Impossible, she clearly...\"","\"Every time I come to see you, she stares at me. She's always trying to persuade you to break up with me. If that's not a secret crush, what is it? She just wants to break us up. But I'm not interested in her, and I won't give her the chance!\"","The woman was completely stunned, seemingly struck by this possibility.","\"She... she's so beautiful, like a big celebrity. Why wouldn't you be interested...\"","\"I love you! Even if a heavenly beauty stripped naked in front of me, I wouldn't be interested!\"","\"I... I'll go ask her. If it's true, I'll forgive you and give you another chance. If it's false... let's just end this. I don't want to be hurt by you anymore!\" After struggling for a moment, the woman pushed the man away and ran off.","The man, having knelt for too long, found his legs numb and couldn't chase after her.","\"What are you looking at? Get lost, all of you!\" The man, seemingly just realizing how many people had witnessed his embarrassing scene, shouted angrily.","Ji Fei and Xiao Tao dispersed along with the crowd of onlookers. As they walked, they gossiped about what they had just seen.","\"Sister Fei, do you think they'll make up?\" Xiao Tao asked curiously.","\"They will,\" Ji Fei guessed. Since she didn't know their names, she couldn't use her system to verify the truth, so she just enjoyed the drama casually.","\"Huh? So you think what that man said was true?\" Xiao Tao asked, puzzled. \"But I feel like that man isn't a good person.\"","\"Whether it's true or false, I don't know. But judging by that woman's attitude just now, reconciliation is only a matter of time,\" Ji Fei said. \"If what the man said is true, then there's nothing more to say. But if he's lying, I can only feel sorry for this woman's friend.\"","Xiao Tao chimed in, \"That's right. She was just trying to help, but the man imagined her as some evil woman who had a secret crush on him and was trying to sabotage their relationship.\"","\"That's not even the worst part,\" Ji Fei said.","Xiao Tao looked at her questioningly while munching on a crepe.","Ji Fei, with a candied haw stick in her mouth, mumbled, \"The scariest thing is that the woman redirected all the blame onto her friend. This will cause the man to hate only the friend for meddling. If they make up later, the friend will be in an impossible situation! This is what we call a 'scapegoat friend.' Xiao Tao, in the future when making friends, stay away from people like this.\"","Xiao Tao nodded quickly, indicating that she would definitely be more careful in choosing friends.","But the next second, Xiao Tao exclaimed, \"That woman!\"","Ji Fei turned her head and saw the woman who had been called Xiao Ya earlier entering a nearby café.","The café had large glass windows facing the pedestrian walkway outside.","However, Ji Fei didn't pay attention to that woman. Instead, her eyes widened like saucers as she stared at the two rows of elegant seats inside.","...","In the café located in the entertainment district, four scholarly-looking individuals were sitting together, drinking coffee and discussing business.","\"Our project is too advanced. Domestic investors are quite conservative. It'll be difficult to succeed this time. We might have to try foreign venture capital after we go abroad.\"","\"Although we need to collaborate with foreign research institutions, the professor still hopes to keep the leadership in our own hands. That's why we're trying so hard to find investors domestically.\"","\"Should we think of another way?\"","\"Xinyue, aren't you from the Chu family...\"","Someone was about to say something but was suddenly interrupted.","The other three at the table looked awkwardly at Chu Xinyue.","\"I'm sorry, I spoke too hastily,\" the person who had spoken quickly apologized.","Chu Xinyue, sitting on the other side, just smiled faintly and said, \"It's nothing. Let's think of other options.\"","At this moment, Chu Xinyue had a neat, short haircut, as short as a boy's sporty style. She wore decorative black-framed glasses and a simple white shirt. Even sitting in such a crowded place, no one would associate her with the rising starlet Chu Xueqi.","As they were talking, suddenly a pleasant male voice came from the booth behind them.","\"May I join your discussion? I'm very interested in your research project and have the intention to invest.\"","Chu Xinyue's body stiffened, while the others looked up in confusion.","They saw a tall man wearing a hat, sunglasses, and a black mask. He had one hand on the back of the booth's sofa and the other hooked under his mask, revealing attractive lips as he slowly spoke, \"May I sit down?\"","Everyone reacted, their eyes widening, glancing repeatedly at Chu Xinyue.","They, as Chu Xinyue's classmates for many years, knew a bit about her engagement to the big star Qin Zhao. They had even seen him from afar several times.","Occasionally, they would be curious about the hot search topics, which seemed to suggest that this fiancé was closer to Chu Xinyue's twin sister.","Not long ago, when Chu Xinyue returned and decided to go abroad with the team for research, the professor asked about her personal affairs, and she said everything had been settled.","That's when they learned that Chu Xinyue had broken off her engagement and cut ties with her family.","They guessed that it must be because her fiancé had gotten involved with her sister. After all, they were busy researchers who rarely saw each other, while those in the entertainment industry could meet every day.","They felt sorry for Chu Xinyue. After knowing her for so many years, even if they weren't sensitive, they knew she had someone in her heart, which was why she rejected all other pursuits.","But Chu Xinyue didn't seem to need their consolation, so they could only try not to mention it.","However, how could this ex-fiancé, a top-tier celebrity, appear here in disguise?","What did he just say? He wanted to invest in their project?","Obviously, he came for Chu Xinyue, right?","Could it be... he wants to reconcile?","Even these usually calm scientific researchers couldn't help but feel a spark of gossip ignite within them at this moment.","The female researcher sitting next to Chu Xinyue simply stood up and moved to the opposite seat. The three of them held their coffee cups, not daring to make a sound.","When Qin Zhao saw Chu Xinyue's new look, his heart nearly leaped out of his chest. It wasn't his preferred style, but Qin Zhao had never been so certain before.","He realized how much he missed her.","He realized how much his heart fluttered for her.","\"Xinyue, I...\" Qin Zhao began nervously.","\"Mr. Qin may be a celebrity, but the investment we need is substantial. It seems Mr. Qin doesn't have that capability,\" Chu Xinyue suddenly spoke, without even looking at him.","Chu Xinyue wouldn't impulsively reject him out of spite, after all, this concerned their entire team. Regardless of Qin Zhao's intentions, they needed investment. If Qin Zhao wanted to invest, it was a business matter.","Qin Zhao was taken aback for a moment, then quickly said, \"Don't worry, your research is so meaningful, my second brother would be interested too. I'm not here to invest as a celebrity, but to negotiate on behalf of Qin Corporation.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone became excited. They hadn't considered Qin Corporation because it seemed unrelated to their research.","\"If Mr. Qin is truly interested in investing, please go directly to our professor. There's no need to discuss it with us,\" Chu Xinyue said expressionlessly, then turned to the person opposite her, \"Senior, please take Mr. Qin to find the professor.\"","Qin Zhao immediately became anxious, \"No, I want to talk to you.\"","Chu Xinyue's face darkened, and she finally looked at Qin Zhao, her eyes clearly showing impatience that pained Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao's eyes involuntarily reddened; he couldn't bear Chu Xinyue looking at him like this.","\"Can't I talk to you? I have so much to say to you.\"","\"Using money and power to force me? I see you've learned this trick too.\"","Qin Zhao's face immediately fell. After a few seconds, unable to withstand Chu Xinyue's gaze and not wanting to anger her further, he thought that as long as he could invest, he would have chances to know her whereabouts in the future.","\"Alright, I understand. I'll go see your professor,\" Qin Zhao said dejectedly, standing up straight. \"Don't worry, I'll take care of the investment!\"","Chu Xinyue was momentarily surprised. Given Qin Zhao's temperament towards her over the years, it was unexpected for him to yield to this extent. For a moment, she felt disoriented, as if seeing the Qin Zhao from their childhood who, after angering her, would hang his head and say he'd do whatever she wanted.","Chu Xinyue came back to her senses, noticed the fluctuation in her heart, and quickly lowered her head to drink her coffee.","Qin Zhao looked at Chu Xinyue reluctantly, but finally had no choice but to lift his head and leave.","However, the moment he looked up, he let out a short, startled cry, staring in shock at something beyond the glass wall.","Everyone was startled by his reaction and also turned their attention outside, equally surprised by what they saw.","Two girls carrying shopping bags were standing by the glass wall, the prettier one staring intently at them.","Her eyes were full of curiosity, wide open.","\"Is that... Mr. Qin's fan?\" someone asked.","Chu Xinyue looked at Ji Fei, who was staring back at her, in astonishment.","\"...That's his second sister-in-law.\""]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Hey, You're Really Good at Reading People~","paragraphs":["Ji Fei instructed Xiao Tao to take the purchases back, but she herself squeezed into the crowd for some fun.","At the elegant seating area, opposite to them were three researchers eagerly waiting for the gossip.","And on their bench sat Chu Xinyue, Ji Fei, and Qin Zhao.","Ji Fei rather impolitely took the middle seat, which was exactly what Chu Xinyue had wanted.","“Hello, everyone,” Ji Fei greeted with warmth. “Got tired from shopping and was about to have a coffee, but what a surprise run-in. Even more unexpected is that you're here too.”","Ji Fei grinned at Qin Zhao, her words full of implications.","[The thrilling wife chase, ohoho!]","Qin Zhao’s face hardened.","Yet, thanks to Ji Fei’s interruption, he was given a reprieve just when he was about to be dismissed. For this, he was grateful to Ji Fei.","Chu Xinyue, however, still held a favorable attitude towards Ji Fei.","“So, didn’t you two come together?” Chu Xinyue asked, puzzled.","Understanding her confusion, Ji Fei clarified, “I sent you a message. You probably didn't see it. I am here as a new artist from Qin Zhao’s studio for this industry event. As for why Qin Zhao is here, that's his story. He refused to accompany his sister-in-law to this event, but he’s here nonetheless.”","With a tone of complaint in her voice, Ji Fei's words made the three sitting opposite exchange glances.","Seeing Qin Zhao remain helpless without a word of defense, the three grew even more curious. Wasn't this an admission that he was here for Chu Xinyue?","Ignoring the latter half of the conversation, Chu Xinyue reached into her bag for her phone at the mention of a message from Ji Fei.","“Sorry, I have been in silent mode because of the meeting. I forgot to turn the volume back on.”","As she was speaking, Chu Xinyue's face suddenly changed. Ji Fei nonchalantly sipped her coffee, unsurprised by Chu Xinyue's reaction.","Even with a limited view, Qin Zhao, who had been stealing glances at Chu Xinyue, was the first to notice.","“What’s wrong?”","Chu Xinyue looked at Ji Fei with a slight frown.","Ji Fei gave a light laugh, then turned to whisper to Qin Zhao, “Oh, nothing really, only that we ran into Chu Xueqi at the event. I reminded Xinyue to be careful.”","Although she tried to keep her voice down, everyone was able to hear her. The atmosphere became eerily quiet.","Qin Zhao’s face paled, his look of concern quickly shifting towards Chu Xinyue, “I didn’t know she was here. I have already blocked her everywhere.”","However, Chu Xinyue pulled her gaze back impassively, “Your problems with her don't concern me.”","Ji Fei, ever the seeker of excitement, interjected, “She came to see you, but was temporarily hoodwinked by Gao Hao. Maybe you should go and sort things out?”","Annoyed, Qin Zhao cast Ji Fei a look, then immediately texted Gao Hao, \"No need for me. Gao Hao knows I will never see her again; he will find a way to send her away.\"","[Well, it’s about time he started acting like a man!]","Casting a secret glance at Chu Xinyue, Qin Zhao found her expression unwavering, his heart sank.","Ji Fei, on the other hand, took an interest in asking about their meeting details.","Upon learning about Qin Zhao’s actions, she looked visibly surprised.","[Who would have thought that Qin Zhao, who has always been an annoyance, also dabbles in investments? Is he going to risk it all for his unrequited love?]","When Chu Xinyue noticed Ji Fei's apparent knowledge of the situation, she suddenly stated, \"Our project won't be able to profit in the short term, it has nothing to do with the direction of Qin Corporation. Qin Xian manages Qin Corporation, if Mr. Qin is genuinely interested, we can speak with Mr. Qin directly. We don't need to bother Qin Zhao.\"","Ji Fei instantly felt compassion for the poor soul next to her.","Qin Zhao's face was wrought with anger.","[Indeed, Chu Xinyue's cold response was not meant to torment Zhao. She's not playing the cat-and-mouse game of her running and him chasing. She's really let go and doesn't want to be troubled anymore.\"","Qin Zhao was already hurt, and Ji Fei's thoughts were like daggers piercing his body.","But Qin Zhao was determined, subtly pulling at Ji Fei's dress, desperately trying to communicate through eye contact.]","[What's wrong? Is your eye twitching?]","Qin Zhao said, \"I have a favor to ask, I'll endure!\"","“If my older brother were to listen to your report, it would have to follow the company's procedure. But if I listen first and validate the situation, I can internal refer it, which would save a lot of time. After all, I'm on the Board of Directors and aren't you guys in a hurry?”","Chu Xinyue looked uncertainly at Ji Fei, the only person who could confirm this. \"Is this true?”","What Ji Fei hadn't expected was that the drama would commence with her. Gossiping is risky, especially when it could potentially backfire.","“Your phone seems to be vibrating. Perhaps someone is trying to reach you.\" Qin Zhao suddenly interrupted, with an urgent tone.","Ji Fei was surprised, as she didn't feel anything. Wait? There really is a vibration.","Seeing the message, Ji Fei's eyes lit up.","Transfer message: 500,000!","Note: Don't interfere!","Ji Fei put down the phone, with a serious face, “I don't know...”","Qin Zhao sighed with relief only to hear suppressed laughter from Ji Fei.","[Heaven does give pies! I don’t know anything anyway! Qin Xian and I are only a couple on paper. If I knew anything about their internal procedures that would be weird. Qin Zhao is really a big fool.]","Qin Zhao suddenly understood and his breath hitched. Finally, he realized that he had unwittingly accepted that Ji Fei and his brother had a harmonious marital relationship.","In fact, what he said was true, he was just fearful of Ji Fei meddling in the situation, eagerly connecting dots and making efforts with their current attitude towards Ji Fei, who would likely make an exception for her recommendation and internally push the proposal, which is why he tried to stop her.","Far away in the corporation office, the diligent and studious Qin Xian, who was earning money for the family, felt his ears heating up for no apparent reason.","Hearing this, Chu Xinyue had no choice but to let it go.","She wasn't curious about why Qin Zhao was persistently bothering her now. She just didn't want to have any more contact with him, but it seemed to be hard.","Just as hard as it was for her to approach him before.","Qin Zhao feared that Chu Xinyue would ask him to talk to the professor, so he immediately asked the three people across from him.","\"I don't need to meet the professor, I'm sure I won't understand what he's saying. Just give me a rough idea of your prospects and future plans. I understand you're going abroad? How much funding will that require?\"","Qin Zhao was most concerned about going abroad.","Hearing the words ‘going abroad’, Chu Xinyue visibly relaxed. Clearly, she believed that no matter how hard things are now, she would soon be gone.","The three opposite them honestly gave some details.","Hearing the vital information, Qin Zhao expressed his anxiety: \"So, all of you, the professor and your entire research team, are going abroad for a research project that will last at least five years?\"","[It's more than five years! Chu Xinyue is prepared to permanently settle abroad and never return.]","Qin Zhao took a strangled breath.","[Worth the wait, waiting for your return.]","As the off-key singing accompanied Ji Fei's words, Qin Zhao felt a chill envelop him.","Probably detecting Qin Zhao's distressing aura,","One of the females in the trio could not bear it and added, \"The three of us had always been determined to go. Chu Xinyue was initially hesitant, but now she's decided. Another one yet to decide.\"","Qin Zhao's eyes flickered, the sorrow in his eyes more evident.","It was his fault!","What the female teammate meant was that Chu Xinyue might have decided to go abroad after her quarrel with him, so there is a high chance to woo her back.","After all, feelers and healers often punctuated their romance in their team.","Chu Xinyue knew what her well-meaning teammates intended but could only give a helpless hint with her eyes.","Catching a glimpse of Qin Zhao's distressed expression,","She was slightly taken aback; she didn't expect Qin Zhao to show such an expression.","But Qin Zhao quickly recovered; he's not someone who gives up easily.","He abruptly turned back to look at Chu Xinyue, his eyes ablaze, as if he had a lot to say.","Chu Xinyue was momentarily stunned, it seemed this was the shining Qin Zhao she knew.","Qin Zhao then asked some specific questions, actually looking to bring the foreign research team back home.","However, as the conversation progressed, he found the hope increasingly bleak and had to think of other methods.","While talking, someone suddenly walked over, accompanied by a surprised female voice.","\"Ah? You are...you are!\"","The voice seemed to recognize Qin Zhao, he'd removed his sunglasses and mask for politeness, leaving only the cap on.","At this moment, Qin Zhao instinctively wanted to pull down the brim of his cap, but he saw the researcher across the table hastily getting up to sit the newcomer down.","\"Don't shout, you'll give us away, we're discussing important matters!\"","\"But, this is Qin Zhao...how...\"","\"Hello.\" Qin Zhao greeted politely.","Just as Ji Fei had finished her last sweet, she looked up and nearly choked on the chocolate still melting in her mouth.","She blinked her eyes in disbelief. What a coincidence?","\"Little Ya, you went to get a document, why did it take you so long?\"","\"Why is your face wet and your eyes red, what's wrong?\"","The worried inquiries of her companions failed to catch Cao Ya's attention.","Naturally, Ji Fei, sitting to one side, said nothing.","On the other hand, Chu Xinyue, sitting next to Ji Fei, caught this unsettling atmosphere and looked at Ji Fei in a strange way."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Dirty Stuff Alert","paragraphs":["\"My face was dirty so I came back to clean up in the bathroom here, so...\" Cao Ya gave a vague explanation while still astonished at seeing a top-notch celebrity here.","Chu Xinyue was paying attention to the details. Seeing the redness in the corners of Cao Ya's eyes indicating she had been crying, she immediately voiced her worries upon remembering past incidents: \"Ya, tell the truth. Did that man chase after you again?\"","At these words, the three other researchers on the scene looked worriedly at Cao Ya.","The two men among them furrowed their brows, seemingly recalling an unpleasant past.","Hearing Chu Xinyue's question, a shudder ran through Cao Ya. \"Xinyue, you...\"","[Yuk! I am going to puke after seeing the dirty things.]","Only Qin Zhao, who could hear Ji Fei's thoughts, was baffled by this sudden outlandish phrase.","As soon as Cao Ya started speaking, Chu Xinyue and the other three showed disapproval on their faces.","The two other men didn't dare to say a word. After all, they were once suspected and beaten up. They wouldn't risk speaking out to avoid further trouble.","The only female companion voiced her concerns. \"Ya, did he run after you and play out another exaggerated drama? You can't be fooled again. You can't be softhearted towards this kind of man.\"","\"But...\" Cao Ya mumbled, \"We have many years of feelings for each other. It's really hard to let go. Maybe he will really change this time. His expression was different than before.\"","With a frown, Chu Xinyue replied. \"Ya, you should know that he has violent tendencies and is troubled by a deep suspicion. At first, he treated others arbitrariously, but he might lash out at you later. If you really want to give up the chance to go abroad for him, then really...\"","Before Chu Xinyue could finish, her hand was suddenly held down by Ji Fei, interrupting her.","Chu Xinyue was taken aback. Before she could look at Ji Fei, she could feel the strong discontent from Cao Ya's intense gaze.","\"Xinyue, why do you have to speak of Zhi like that, wishing for me to regard him as a devil? I'm the one who's known him since childhood. I understand him more than anyone. It's really not good for you to say this.\"","Cao Ya targeted Xinyue even though two people tried to convince her. Qin Zhao instantly put his guard up, he didn't need to hear Ji Fei’s thoughts.","\"What are you saying? Xinyue has good intentions. If you disagree with her views, you should still show basic courtesy.”","Qin Zhao's family were all defensive, especially now, considering how precious they were of Chu Xinyue.","Whoever dared to be disrespectful wouldn't be shown any consideration by Qin Zhao.","It was quite frightening how someone who was just speaking politely a moment ago had suddenly turned hostile.","Especially for Cao Ya, who didn't know Qin Zhao, she was so frightened she started to tremble, staring at Qin Zhao in astonishment.","“No, I had no ill intentions.”","“But neither did Xinyue!”","Cao Ya’s face flashed with an expression of confusion and distress. Her silence almost seemed to say: Who knows?","“You... Why are you defending her? You don't even know the whole story.\" Cao Ya even sounded aggrieved.","But her words left an ill feeling.","Qin Zhao really wanted to retort 'I’d rather stand for her than you! What’s the big deal?'","“I can do as I wish. You, this person...”","“Qin Zhao!”","Just as Qin Zhao was about to retort, he was interrupted by Chu Xinyue. Even though her tone was somewhat stern, something changed when she called him by his full name, from Mr. Qin to Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao felt like his bones were melting, he felt a wave of electricity pass through his body. He so wanted Chu Xinyue to call out his name again; it had been a while since last she did.","Qin Zhao looked at her eagerly, his face expressing, \"if you call me, I'll listen; I'm a good boy.\"","This made Ji Fei, who was sitting in the middle, feel a sudden chill run down her spine, causing her to retract her neck a little.","Chu Xinyue only shouted in desperation — after all, it wasn't good for outsiders like Qin Zhao to chide Cao Ya, a member of their team.","\"Ya, our team is about to go overseas soon. I hope you'll think carefully about your own affairs.\" Chu Xinyue has given her advice countless times already and was beginning to feel tired. If it wasn't for the potential hazard Cao Ya might pose, and the pitiful, woeful crying each time, Chu Xinyue wouldn't have bothered to meddle so much.","Now that she's being complained at, enough was enough.","Cao Ya blinked rapidly, but her gaze towards Chu Xinyue was still filled with suspicion, even though Chu Xinyue was about to go abroad.","\"Forget it, let's not talk about my personal issues. I'm sorry if I've caused any unhappiness among all of you.\" said Cao Ya quietly.","The atmosphere eased a bit after that. Everyone started to talk about other stuff, veering away from the previous topic.","Only then did Cao Ya dared to ask out of curiosity, \"So, Mr. Qin is here to invest? Why would a celebrity think of investing?\"","Qin Zhao didn't particularly like this person, but he was ready to offer some high-sounding justification considering Chu Xinyue was here.","However, before he could, Ji Fei, who hadn't uttered a word the whole time, suddenly said, \"Oh, that's because he's Chu Xinyue's ex-fiancé.\"","Her comment instantly made the room eerily silent.","Everyone else had been careful to avoid such phrasing. They were taken aback by Ji Fei's candidness.","Chu Xinyue looked at Ji Fei, stunned.","Qin Zhao frowned.","Firstly, he didn't like the word \"ex\".","Secondly, what was Ji Fei trying to do, saying things that would obviously upset Chu Xinyue?","He couldn't figure out what Ji Fei was playing at, but decided to use money to keep her calm.","In response to this, he heard Ji Fei mumble gleefully, [\"How about that, surprised aren't you? Chu Xinyue's ex-fiancé is Qin Zhao, do you understand what that implies?\" ]","Qin Zhao finally realized, Ji Fei was doing this...to target Cao Ya?","\"Ex-? Fiancé? Of Chu Xinyue?!\" Cao Ya's mouth dropped open in shock. She was completely clueless.","Back when Cao Ya appeared in Chu Xinyue's social circle, Qin Zhao had completely lost contact with Chu Xinyue. Their companions tried not to mention the relationship out of respect, and so by some strange turn of events, Cao Ya was kept in the dark even now.","At this moment, Cao Ya's gaze darted disbelievingly between the two. She instinctively denied it, pointing at Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, \"Aren't you two together?\"","Qin Zhao immediately wore an expression of revulsion.","Ji Fei truthfully said, \"I am Chu Xinyue's would-have-been sister-in-law, his secondary sister-in-law.\"","Cao Ya's expression became even funnier. Not only was there an ex-fiancé in the picture, but family members also came to see Chu Xinyue.","Were they here to persuade her?","Chu Xinyue uncomfortably said, \"We're already unrelated. He happened to be passing by, heard our conversation and wanted to discuss investing in the project.\"","Qin Zhao looked at Chu Xinyue with a stifled sorrow, not daring to say anything else outright.","But then Ji Fei spoke up again, \"Yes, yes, yes, Qin Zhao can't hold on to Xinyue's heart. He's been dumped and is pathetically trying to encounter her coincidentally.\"","Everyone looked at Ji Fei in shock once again. Even though it was true, she hadn't been so direct about it just now!","Qin Zhao: Eh... Even though he didn't find it disgraceful, what was she up to? It felt like she was deliberately showing off something.","Ji Fei, with a radiant smile and ignoring Cao Ya's increasingly pale face, turned to look at the shell-shocked Chu Xinyue, \"Ah, such an excellent female researcher, and so pretty too. I wonder what kind of extraordinary men will be able to catch your eye in the future. Definitely someone more handsome than Qin Zhao, richer than Qin Zhao, more capable than Qin Zhao, and with a better background than him.\"","Qin Zhao suddenly felt like he's been shot with many arrows.","Hey hey hey? What's going on here?","The trio of researchers couldn't help but burst into laughter.","\"Xinyue is indeed outstanding. She ignores the many who pursue her.\"","Upon hearing this, Qin Zhao instantly became nervous.","Chu Xinyue looked at Ji Fei in a mix of helplessness and bewilderment.","But Ji Fei had already turned to look at Cao Ya, whose face was alternating between red and green as if she wanted to disappear into the ground, \"So what your ex-boyfriend just said must be wrong. Xinyue didn't even have a thing for my celebrity stepbrother. She wouldn't secretly harbor feelings for him.\"","This one sentence hit everyone like a bolt from the blue. It stunned everyone so much that they wondered if they had misheard.","\"Huh?\" The research trio asked in unison.","Who's suspecting who of having a secret crush?","Cao Ya was trembling all over from shame, her eyes filled with tears.","Chu Xinyue looked at Cao Ya in disbelief.","And Qin Zhao's face completely darkened.","[\"That trashy boyfriend of yours doesn't even deserve to be in the same frame as Xinyue. He still dares to fantasize that Chu Xinyue has feelings for him. You, with your pig head, even nearly believed him and doubted Chu Xinyue’s kindness towards you. Indeed, those with a love brain wouldn't even be eaten by zombies.\"]"]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Where's my knife","paragraphs":["Ji Fei initially thought of the drama as mere entertainment, but little did she know, the drama was unfolding right beside her.","Chu Xinyue, known to Ji Fei, was resolute and brave, battling depression alone and breaking free from all shackles to finally embark on a new life.","Yet, to others, she appeared entirely different.","Reflecting on the conversation between those two, Ji Fei was utterly disgusted.","In her mind, Ji Fei sarcastically replayed everything she had just witnessed from start to finish.","Others couldn’t hear her thoughts, but Qin Zhao’s aura grew increasingly oppressive next to her, his gaze towards Cao Ya sharp enough to throw daggers.","Nothing infuriated him more than other men fantasizing about his beloved.","Had the other not been a woman, Qin Zhao would have thrown a punch long ago.","\"Could it be... a misunderstanding?\" the female researcher asked incredulously. \"How could Kang Zhi think this way?\"","She wasn’t defending Cao Ya or doubting Ji Fei; she simply found it unbelievable and absurd.","\"Zhi... he’s just talking nonsense, I know it!\" Cao Ya said, her face flushing with urgency, her rational side still aware of right and wrong.","Yet, Ji Fei feigned surprise: \"Oh, so you knew? Now I understand. Earlier, when you were arguing with your ex-boyfriend in the lobby, you were just stalling him with delaying tactics. You seemed half-convinced by his words, even saying you’d come back to ask Xinyue. I thought you really misunderstood Xinyue and was just trying to help clarify things. Good to know you didn’t believe it. Hahaha.\"","Ji Fei’s face was plastered with a fake smile, tactlessly revealing someone’s embarrassment without caring about making the atmosphere even more awkward.","Everyone was stunned, staring at Cao Ya in disbelief.","Now, recalling Cao Ya’s attitude towards Chu Xinyue upon her return, everything clicked, and their expressions grew even uglier.","More absurd than Kang Zhi’s rumors was Cao Ya’s doubt.","Cao Ya never expected Ji Fei to speak like that, staring blankly at her, then her expression turned extremely aggrieved, as if she was being targeted on purpose.","Chu Xinyue’s complexion was already terrible, \"You think I would with your ex-boyfriend...\"","Chu Xinyue was too disgusted to continue.","Cao Ya, head bowed, didn’t dare meet Chu Xinyue’s eyes, her voice quivering with grievance, \"I didn’t, I was just brushing him off.\"","\"Ha!\" Chu Xinyue was too angry to speak.","A male researcher couldn’t hold back, \"Brushing him off? Shouldn’t you be firmly denying it on Xinyue’s behalf? Just like how she always firmly supports you whenever you ask for help. If it weren’t for your constant requests for help every time you argue with your boyfriend, she wouldn’t even know who he is.\"","\"I’ve heard of a toad lusting after a swan’s flesh, but never of a toad fantasizing about a swan throwing herself at him! Cao Ya, your ex might still be delusional,\" another male researcher finally couldn’t resist mocking.","Feeling bullied by everyone, Cao Ya’s tears welled up in her eyes, making her look pitiful.","\"At that time, Zhi was very certain, I was just...\"","Qin Zhao could no longer hold back, and with a sneer said, \"Certain? The person I can't even beg on my knees is secretly in love with your ex-boyfriend? Where does he get his confidence from?!\"","Ji Fei: ? Is he smuggling in some personal bias?","Chu Xinyue, who had just been disgusted, stiffened upon hearing this, her angry thoughts seemingly washed away by a flood, leaving only panic behind.","This was the first time Qin Zhao openly revealed his feelings for Chu Xinyue.","Yet the person in question hadn't even reacted, continuing angrily, \"Why not call him over, let me see just how outstanding this man is, so I can learn a thing or two!\"","Looking at the chilling Qin Zhao and his fists clenched on the table, the trio of researchers shuddered.","No one doubted that once the man was summoned, the fist of justice would not hesitate to 'blossom' the shameless man's head.","\"And you, do you even know how to write the words 'ungrateful wretch'?!\"","Cao Ya, thin-skinned, was almost breathless being directly mocked by such a man like Qin Zhao.","\"I didn't think that way, I was just panicked and didn't react on the spot. It wasn't intentional, we could have handled it privately, why...\"","She wasn't introspective, but rather blamed Ji Fei internally, wondering how such an embarrassing matter could be brought up in public!","Moreover, she had already noticed Qin Zhao's presence. Even if he didn't want her to misunderstand Chu Xinyue, he should have been more considerate of her feelings.","How was she supposed to face people in the future?","Feeling Cao Ya's resentful gaze.","Ji Fei smiled elegantly, she hadn't even started to make a big deal yet. It was just leaving some face for the girl.","In this world, good people should get good returns. One shouldn't let the ungrateful ruin kindness.","Since Qin Zhao had already become a protector, Ji Fei naturally stepped back and started idly watching the drama.","But she was immediately disgusted.","She was looking at Cao Ya's gossip.","\"This girl really can, turns out every time she has a disagreement with her ex-boyfriend, the ones she complains to aren't just their research group, but also various friends far away. She just transfers all the negative energy given by that scumbag to others, and after releasing all her negative emotions, she goes back and lovingly reunites with the scumbag. Having her as a friend, must have been karma from a past life.\"","\"Damn! She was in the restroom for so long just now, actually, she was secretly contacting other friends, bringing up her suspicions about Chu Xinyue for discussion. It just so happened that a distant friend could only hear what came from Cao Ya's mouth, took it as the truth, and concluded that Chu Xinyue was trying to break them up and steal her boyfriend, calling her a scheming bitch! Cao Ya even replied with a 'Really?' with an innocent emoji. I'm disgusted!\"","\"The other person even praised Cao Ya, thinking that someone of Chu Xinyue's caliber being unable to win her man proves Cao Ya's charm. Cao Ya even replied with an 'awkward shy' emoji. My God! She actually believes it? Where does this vanity come from! How low must one be to harbor such delusional fantasies!\"","\"She even had the nerve to say that as long as Cao Ya doesn't break up with her scum boyfriend, she'd forever be the official wife and all else would be mere mistresses! Mistresses? Chu Xinyue a mistress? And Cao Ya actually replied with a ‘teary-eyed face’ expression. Damn, where is my blade?\"","Suddenly, a loud bang resonated, startling everyone present.","Ji Fei too came to her senses, seeing Qin Zhao's murderous look. He could not control his anger any longer and slammed the table with his fist.","Right now, he was glaring fiercely at the incessantly explaining Cao Ya.","Cao Ya felt an onslaught of hostility. She was so frightened that she froze, her face pale as a sheet, tears falling incessantly.","\"You!\" Qin Zhao was so furious he was on the verge of erupting.","\"Qin Zhao!\" Chu Xinyue suddenly interrupted.","Just like a dog being hit by a leash, Qin Zhao halted his anger, wanting to say something but he was speechless, only casting a wronged look at Chu Xinyue.","\"She...she's humiliating you!\"","Chu Xinyue was taken aback, she didn't stop him for this...","\"You're causing too much of a scene, do you want to be caught on camera?\"","Indeed, they had attracted a lot of attention.","Ji Fei also patted Qin Zhao, signaling him to calm down. Although she didn't know what was wrong with Qin Zhao, she guessed he must have cared too much.","But she fully agreed with the term 'humiliation'.","Indeed, some people just don't deserve any respect."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: What a sucker","paragraphs":["Ji Fei smiled and said, \"Qin Zhao just lost his temper a bit. I was there at the time, and I believe you were startled and that's why you couldn't react.\"","Cao Ya choked, her tears stopped, she didn't expect Ji Fei to speak for her.","Didn't she start all this? Was it a pang of conscience?","But the next second she heard Ji Fei say, \"After all, anyone with a brain and eyes knows that Chu Xinyue would never fancy that kind of guy. Chu Xinyue doesn't have strange tastes. She wouldn't even fancy celebrities, let alone ugly men. And she's not masochistic, she would definitely avoid a violent man. So you surely know that Chu Xinyue doesn't fancy your ex-boyfriend.\"","\"Although as the saying goes, 'same feather flock together', I believe you and your ex are fundamentally different. Just because your ex fantasizes about other men stealing his girlfriend, doesn’t mean you enjoy imagining other women stealing your boyfriend. If your boyfriend is sick, you certainly are not.\"","Cao Ya was shocked, and finally, her emotions collapsed, and she started crying.","\"Hey, why are you crying? Aren't I speaking on your behalf? Or does your head have too much 'water' in it and it's overflowing? After all, it should be Chu Xinyue who cries. She was innocently helping, but out of nowhere, she was being slandered. Isn't that innocent?\" Ji Fei continued to twist the knife.","The three researchers were all stunned, the two men couldn't hold back their laughter.","\"Miss Ji, you are really... straightforward,\" the female researcher awkwardly tried to mediate, or else they would attract onlookers.","Ji Fei shrugged innocently.","\"You need to be straightforward to clear up any confusion. If there is still a thorn in your heart, it's not good. For someone that you are familiar with, it's hard to speak up, but for a stranger like me, it doesn't matter.\"","One should not be indirect with this kind of person, dealing with it privately is even more unacceptable. She had to publicly point out Cao Ya's self-centered fantasies, let Cao Ya face her ridiculous thoughts directly. Don't turn around and find various excuses to imagine, insisting on creating an imaginary enemy to highlight their love.","Somehow, she felt that Cao Ya would do such a thing.","\"Chu Xinyue, in case of any misunderstandings, why don't you reiterate your stance again.\"","Chu Xinyue frowned at the pitiful crying Cao Ya and slowly said, \"To avoid any misunderstandings, anything about you and him, please do not mention again in my presence. I only feel one way towards your ex-boyfriend, and that is disgust. So you can be assured.\"","Chu Xinyue's words were like a slap to Cao Ya's face.","Cao Ya suddenly hit rock bottom, anger surged, all because Kang Zhi had a slight misunderstanding and she had some doubts, was it really necessary to press her like this?","Chu Xinyue stood high and mighty, so was she just a weed to be scolded and humiliated like that?","\"Xinyue, this is just a misunderstanding, we could have cleared this up, why be so pressing? And let outsiders mock me like this, aren't we friends?\"","\"From now on, it's not the same anymore. I won't be friends with those who offend me.\" Chu Xinyue spoke without hesitation. From the moment her life began anew, she had made all her decisions with loving herself as the top priority. She wouldn't compromise for anyone anymore.","Cao Ya's face froze directly, and in the end, she ran away crying.","She probably didn't expect to end their friendship so abruptly.","Everyone else was quite awkward.","\"Although Cao Ya went too far, we are still a team, how are we going to get along in the future?\" someone complained.","\"Is her position in your research project irreplaceable?\" Qin Zhao asked.","\"Not really, she's basically just our assistant.\"","\"Then get rid of her,\" Qin Zhao said coldly. \"Keeping such people around will only bring trouble to you.\"","\"This...\" Everyone was hesitant, after all, they had been together for a quite long time.","Qin Zhao had made up his mind. As an investor, couldn't he decide on someone insignificant like this?","He wouldn't tolerate this kind of person disturbing Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao had found the right way to influence as a wealthy investor.","He was determined to talk to their professor to clarify the situation optimally hinting to keep the research project domestically.","Under Qin Zhao's urging, others got in touch with the professor, only to find out he had already retired to his hotel room for the day.","Out of respect, Qin Zhao decided to visit the professor in the morning.","As it was getting late, they all walked to another building.","On their way, they ran into Cao Ya, who had been arguing with Kang Zhi.","From afar, they couldn't hear the words of their quarrel, but they heard Cao Ya yell, \"Because of your big mouth, Xinyue and I had a fallout! How will I stay in the team now! They are right, you are just an obsessing maniac, trying to monopolize me, leaving me all alone! We break up, for good this time!\"","After her words, Cao Ya ran off crying, ignoring the presence of the others.","When Kang Zhi chased after her, he bumped into them directly.","His eyes, filled with red veins, swept over them viciously, pausing for a moment particularly on Chu Xinyue.","Qin Zhao was immediately provoked by that gaze. Just as he was about to rush forward, Kang Zhi turned around and ran, not giving Qin Zhao a chance.","\"Keep an eye out during this period. I think this guy is dangerous,\" Qin Zhao warned.","\"Actually, without Cao Ya, we wouldn't have a chance to contact him at all,\" someone quipped.","\"Let's go.\" Chu Xinyue was not interested in others' affairs anymore and led the way into the elevator.","When everyone had entered, the person who had pressed the elevator button asked, \"Which floor are you staying?\"","Qin Zhao promptly replied, \"Seventeenth floor!\"","Others exclaimed in surprise, \"Such a coincidence?\"","Chu Xinyue frowned at Qin Zhao, a feeling of rejection growing in her eyes.","Qin Zhao felt guilty, of course, it was a coincidence as he had investigated beforehand. Yet, he nodded firmly, \"Yeah, this is the only floor left with rooms.\"","When others asked Ji Fei, just as she was thinking of her response, Qin Zhao replied, \"Same.\"","Qin Zhao had a little plan in mind, if Ji Fei too stayed on the same floor, maybe Chu Xinyue's dislike towards him would reduce somewhat.","Everyone was astonished, such a coincidence?","Ji Fei: ?","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow at Qin Zhao.","Probably fearing that Ji Fei would not cooperate and refute on the spot, Qin Zhao immediately took out his cellphone and pretended, \"Second Sister-in-law, Gao Ge just told me, there was a small issue with your room, so it's been temporarily moved to the 17th floor.\"","After that, he shoved his cellphone screen in front of Ji Fei's face.","It was the money transfer screen.","Five hundred thousand!","Ding! Transaction successful!","Anyway, Second Brother had said, Ji Fei loves money, this weakness should make her cooperate.","Actually, what Qin Xian said was that Ji Fei loved money. To show his thanks, he just needed to give her a red packet.","As expected, they heard Ji Fei say: \"What a coincidence, haha, I'm also staying on the 17th floor, didn't expect you guys to be here too. We're all familiar faces, let's have supper together later?\"","Qin Zhao had just breathed a sigh of relief, but then he heard Ji Fei's mischievous laughter.","【What a big sucker, haha! I had planned to say I was staying on the 17th floor from the get-go. Observing this wife-chasing drama up close, I wouldn't be able to sleep anyway if I went home! Does this count as me taking advantage and pretending to be innocent, haha.】","Qin Zhao gasped dramatically, swallowing a mouthful of blood. How could he forget Ji Fei's nature that loved to join in the fun?!","The elevator doors slowly closed, but a person burst out of the corner of the hall. They missed the elevator and could only stand there dumbly as the elevator stopped at the 17th floor."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Alas, I Bet It's Hopeless","paragraphs":["To avoid exposing himself, Qin Zhao put on an act, trying to increase his affability by starting a casual atmosphere with the two male researchers, suggesting they play cards and have a late-night snack together.","Chu Xinyue naturally wouldn't indulge him, turning to go back to her room alone.","The others exchanged glances, knowing full well that Qin Zhao was just finding an excuse to spend more time with Chu Xinyue.","With the lead actress gone, everyone was ready to head back to their own rooms.","Unexpectedly, Qin Zhao actually intended to treat everyone to a late-night snack.","The trio of researchers was quite surprised and initially planned to politely decline.","Qin Zhao said, \"I should have treated you guys sooner.\"","[Years ago, I failed to fulfill my duties as an engaged man and treat my fiancée's friends to a meal... sigh, hindsight is always 20/20.] Ji Fei, who had nowhere else to go at the moment, couldn't help but make a sarcastic remark after sensing his thoughts.","Qin Zhao's smile stiffened, affected by her inner voice.","The trio also felt quite awkward, as Chu Xinyue had just returned to her room, clearly signaling her unwillingness to get personally involved with Qin Zhao. Although they thought the two made a good match, they still had boundaries and didn't want to put Chu Xinyue in an overly difficult position and anger her.","One can be kind, but shouldn't force moral burdens on others.","Seeing their hesitation, Qin Zhao quickly changed his excuse, saying, \"I actually wanted to get to know the members of your team better, so I can provide more detailed guidance for the investment later.\"","Although it was quite possibly an excuse, since he said it, refusing further would offend the investor.","So they were swept up by the atmosphere and ended up having a late-night snack in one of the male researchers' rooms.","Qin Zhao ordered a lavish spread for everyone, instantly eliminating any sense of distance. They even asked for autographs and photos, because even if they weren't Qin Zhao's fans, he was still a top star, and posting his photos on their social media would surely bring floods of likes and praise.","Soon after, Qin Zhao contacted Brother Gao, asking him to arrange two rooms on this floor.","Qin Zhao cunningly chose the room directly across from Chu Xinyue's.","In the end, Brother Gao and Xiao Tao came over to help cover up the lie.","However, seeing Brother Gao pull Qin Zhao aside for a private whisper, it was likely about Chu Xueqi's matter, but it was evident that Qin Zhao no longer wanted to hear anything about her.","With Qin Zhao's attitude, Gao Hao naturally felt free to take action, signaling to the outside world and cutting off all resources previously provided to Chu Xueqi.","On Ji Fei's side, she was happily eating barbecue with Xiao Tao when Qin Zhao approached and said in a low voice, \"Come with me to bring some food to Xinyue later.\"","So he didn't dare go alone and wanted to use Ji Fei as a buffer?","Ji Fei refused.","She never intended to help bring Qin Zhao and Chu Xinyue together.","Qin Zhao gritted his teeth, \"But I just transferred one million yuan to you, the money's still hot.\"","Ji Fei righteously stated, \"One matter at a time, this is a separate fee.\"","Qin Zhao was stunned, incredulous at this principled (money-grubbing) person who had just taken his money without a hint of shame.","In the end, he had no choice but to transfer more money.","He couldn't help but complain, \"I feel like I'm forming a conditioned response.\"","Paying people whenever he needed help.","Ji Fei smiled and accepted the money.","[So the prodigal son has indeed returned for the money! But is he stupid? Anyone else here would be a better buffer than me when accompanying him to deliver the food. They'd easily agree, but he chose me instead, giving me the best seat to watch the show. This is the first time I've encountered someone paying others to eat popcorn and enjoy the drama. Haha, I'm really starting to like this third brother more and more.]","Hearing her inner voice, Qin Zhao felt numb. That's right, why did he insist on choosing Ji Fei? Could it be that deep down, he considered Ji Fei as part of his family?","Just thinking about this possibility made him break out in an uncomfortable cold sweat.","Forget it, as long as someone accompanied him, it was fine.","After selecting some food for Chu Xinyue, Ji Fei suggested, \"The grilled eggplant is quite good.\"","\"She doesn't eat eggplant,\" Qin Zhao replied.","Ji Fei was surprised, \"You still remember her preferences.\"","\"Yeah.\" Qin Zhao didn't think it was a big deal.","Ji Fei couldn't help but feel a bit astonished. After all, with how distant their relationship had been, she thought Qin Zhao would only remember everything related to Chu Xueqi.","The two arrived at Chu Xinyue's room and Qin Zhao knocked on the door.","Soon after, Chu Xinyue's cool voice came from inside, \"Who is it?\"","Qin Zhao said, \"It's me and Sister-in-law Ji, bringing you some late-night snacks.\"","It fell silent for a moment inside, clearly indicating Chu Xinyue's hesitation. After a while, she opened the door.","But as soon as the door opened, Chu Xinyue looked towards Ji Fei, her voice noticeably warmer, \"Thank you, but I don't eat late-night snacks, so there's no need to waste them.\"","From the way Chu Xinyue stood at the doorway, it was evident she had no intention of inviting them inside.","Ji Fei instantly understood that Chu Xinyue was truly on high alert.","Before Qin Zhao could get anxious, Chu Xinyue suddenly spoke up, \"By the way, Sister Ji.\"","Ji Fei was taken aback, feeling that Chu Xinyue's way of addressing her had become much more intimate.","Chu Xinyue said very sincerely, \"Thank you for the matter with Cao Ya. I'll remember this favor, and if there's ever anything I can help with in the future, feel free to let me know.\"","She finished with a serene, sincere smile, truly expressing her gratitude to Ji Fei.","If Ji Fei hadn't seen through and exposed Cao Ya and Kang Zhi's true nature, Chu Xinyue would still be in the dark. She had wanted to thank Ji Fei for a while, but Qin Zhao's presence had prevented her from doing so. She could only take this opportunity to express her thanks.","Ji Fei waved her hand dismissively, \"It was just a trivial matter. It just shows you were lucky enough for me to accidentally witness their true selves. Otherwise, if you kept helping them, that violent man would have eventually targeted you.\"","Chu Xinyue frowned, having had the same premonition. \"I only pitied her because she seemed unfortunate. I didn't expect... I was wrong.\"","\"As the ancient wisdom goes, 'The most pitiable person must have the most deplorable side.'\" Ji Fei sighed.","Recalling the information Ji Fei's inner voice had conveyed, Qin Zhao couldn't help but grind his teeth and say, \"Someone like Cao Ya is just wicked and stupid, wasting your kindness. You didn't do anything wrong.\"","\"Actually, I did do something wrong,\" Ji Fei said, picking up a piece of barbecue from the plate and munching on it as she spoke.","Qin Zhao exclaimed, \"Hey!\"","Chu Xinyue looked towards Ji Fei.","Ji Fei continued, \"When you first advised her to break up, and she agreed but then got back together, you should have realized she wasn't the type to listen to advice. At that point, you should have permanently avoided getting involved in her romantic issues instead of repeatedly trying to persuade her. Some people do need guidance and help, but others don't. For those types of people, you need to let go of the desire to help and respect their fate, otherwise you'll eventually end up harming your own life because of their karma.\"","Chu Xinyue listened, stunned for a moment, before nodding, \"You make a very valid point.\"","Qin Zhao was also quite surprised, even a little appreciative, as he looked at his sister-in-law who had suddenly transformed. Could it be that because of her unique ability to see through others' lives, Ji Fei had truly achieved enlightenment?","No, that couldn't be right. An enlightened person wouldn't be so greedy for money.","As he was thinking this, Ji Fei flashed a brilliant smile and said, \"Like me, I basically never advise anyone to break up or stay together!\"","The implication in her words made Chu Xinyue pause briefly before laughing, \"Right, I'll learn from Sister Ji from now on.\"","Ji Fei smiled, waved her hand, and headed back.","Chu Xinyue, without looking at Qin Zhao in front of her, said softly, \"It's fine, I need to rest now.\" She moved to close the door.","\"Wait!\" Qin Zhao panicked and reached out his hand.","A dull thud was heard as his hand got caught in the door.","Chu Xinyue was startled and quickly released the door handle.","But before Chu Xinyue could close the door again, Qin Zhao had already propped it open with his hand, not giving her another chance to shut it.","\"Xinyue, I have something to tell you!\" Qin Zhao's tone was urgent as he lowered his gaze, deeply staring at her.","Chu Xinyue felt as though she was being pressed down by an invisible pressure, completely enveloped by Qin Zhao's overwhelming aura, making her physically uncomfortable.","She frowned, and when she met his gaze, her eyes were cold and indifferent, causing a pang of pain in Qin Zhao's heart, but he stubbornly refused to back down.","[Tsk tsk tsk, the persistent pestering tactic won't work on Chu Xinyue. Silly fool.]","Qin Zhao was taken aback, how could he still hear Ji Fei's inner voice when she had already left?","Out of the corner of his eye, he noticed that the door to the neighboring room was wide open, with more than one shadowy figure visible through the crack.","Clearly, a group of people had gathered there to watch the drama unfold.","But now he had already lost his face, and couldn't miss the opportunity to talk to Chu Xinyue any longer.","Qin Zhao was about to open his mouth when he heard Ji Fei mocking again.","[Alas, I bet there's no chance.]","Qin Zhao: No, he hasn't even started yet! Don't be so pessimistic!","[It's not enough to just put on a humble attitude to make the past hurt go away. Chu Xinyue is now waiting for Qin Zhao to say what he has to say and put an end to everything. If he doesn't say it well this time, Qin Zhao will be completely finished.]","Qin Zhao was instantly aghast, staring at Chu Xinyue's icy cold face in astonishment. Although he had guessed that it wouldn't be too smooth, he didn't expect there to be almost no hope at all!","It was simply like a death row inmate's last plea before sentencing, and he was so nervous that his throat started to tighten.","But he had to say it, he still owed Chu Xinyue three sentences."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Men Shed Tears Lightly","paragraphs":["Thinking of this, Qin Zhao's gaze became resolute.","As if sensing the change in his eyes, Chu Xinyue also grew calm.","\"What do you want to say?\" she asked.","Qin Zhao said in a deep voice, \"Thank you.\"","Chu Xinyue was taken aback, probably not expecting this to be Qin Zhao's first words.","Qin Zhao continued, \"Thank you for coming to find me back then, for carrying me out. You saved my life. Thank you!\"","Chu Xinyue was stunned for a moment, her defensive attitude lessening. \"I accept your gratitude. Actually, I don't have that memory, so I don't feel like you owe me anything. It's all in the past.\"","But he didn't want it to be in the past!","Qin Zhao's heart ached, but he still spoke, \"My life can't be repaid with just a simple verbal thanks! So if my investment in your project makes you uncomfortable, just think of it as my way of repaying the debt of saving my life. Accept it without any burden.\"","Chu Xinyue paused. In truth, she wouldn't let personal emotions hinder the project's progress. Even if it might cause her discomfort, she would find her own way to deal with it. But with Qin Zhao putting it this way, Chu Xinyue found herself more accepting.","Finally, Chu Xinyue nodded. Repaying the debt of saving a life was reasonable and fair.","Qin Zhao breathed a sigh of relief, \"I also want to say I'm sorry.\"","Chu Xinyue's expression changed slightly, resisting, \"You don't owe me an apology. From your perspective, you didn't do anything wrong.\"","Pain flashed in Qin Zhao's eyes, \"I know you don't care for my apology. I don't deserve forgiveness for the hurt I caused you when I was deceived. What I really want to apologize for is breaking the promise I made when we were young, for not always standing firmly by your side, believing in you. I broke my word. I'm sorry, Xinyue.\"","Chu Xinyue's eyes finally flickered. She took a deep breath, about to speak.","But then she heard Qin Zhao say, \"One last thing. I like you. Can you give me another chance? This time, I won't break my promise.\"","Chu Xinyue froze, taking a deep breath as she looked at Qin Zhao, only to meet a pair of eyes brimming with tears.","Chu Xinyue's composure crumbled instantly. As far as she could remember, she had never seen Qin Zhao cry. Never.","\"You... you've got it wrong,\" Chu Xinyue's voice was unsteady at first, but gradually became firm and calm.","\"It's only because you've discovered you were deceived that you think you should like me. I know you're remorseful now, but please don't deceive yourself to make up for your regret, and don't drag me into your deception.\"","\"No, I'm sincere...\" Qin Zhao said anxiously.","Chu Xinyue admitted to herself that she was shocked by Qin Zhao's confession. It was something she had fantasized about long, long ago, but not anymore.","\"What difference does sincerity make?\" Chu Xinyue smiled faintly. \"I'll answer you. I don't love you anymore, so I won't give you a chance. Qin Zhao, you're very excellent and charming. You'll meet a better partner. I'll cherish our childhood friendship and bless you from across the ocean. This is my sincere thought.\"","\"Don't cling to this anymore. I've let go, you should too.\"","Watching Chu Xinyue turn and close the door, Qin Zhao stood dejectedly at the doorway.","Ji Fei closed the door, and turning around, she saw that everyone's expressions were not good.","Well, they had come to watch some drama, but it felt like they had been force-fed bitter gourd instead.","\"I've never seen Qin Zhao like this. It's over, he probably won't recover for a long time,\" Gao Hao began to worry about the future of their studio.","\"That's just how Xinyue is. Once she makes up her mind, she won't change it,\" the female researcher said.","Everyone sighed. After waiting awkwardly for a while, making sure Qin Zhao had returned to his own room, they all came out.","The female researcher shared a room with Chu Xinyue. She swiped the card and entered, only to see Chu Xinyue sitting by the floor-to-ceiling window, lost in thought.","\"Actually, you still have feelings for him. Having liked him for so many years, it's impossible to suddenly...\"","Chu Xinyue turned and smiled, saying nothing.","The female researcher quickly waved her hands, \"Never mind, never mind. After going abroad, with how great a girl Xinyue is, there will definitely be a bunch of handsome guys pursuing her. She'll eventually meet someone she likes more.\"","On the other side, Gao Hao was about to check on Qin Zhao. Ji Fei was originally going to take Xiao Tao back to rest, but was stopped by Gao Hao.","\"Teacher Ji, he's family after all. Shouldn't we check on him? I've never dealt with a heartbroken Qin Zhao before, I'm nervous,\" Gao Hao said awkwardly. \"Will he drink excessively? Will he take drugs recklessly? Will he do something stupid...\"","\"Isn't your imagination running a bit wild?\" Who knew Gao Hao was this kind of person?","Ji Fei thought for a moment. Well, he was an old client after all. Might as well check on him. In case he did something stupid... she could help call an ambulance.","Gao Hao had a key card. He knocked first, and when there was no response, he swiped the card to enter.","After Gao Hao went in to make sure there was nothing inappropriate to see, Ji Fei walked in.","As soon as she entered, she saw Qin Zhao holding his phone, constantly tapping on something.","\"Ah Zhao, what are you...\" Gao Hao cautiously approached and saw that Qin Zhao was researching Chu Xinyue's team's research project, the country they were going to, information about the research institution, and so on. \"Uh...\"","[Oh, looks like he hasn't given up.]","Qin Zhao ignored the other voices, as if he was stubbornly holding onto something, frantically searching for all kinds of information. His expression was calm and composed, as if nothing could defeat him.","[Sigh, Chu Xinyue has made up her mind. Unless some extraordinary measures are taken, there's no hope in this lifetime. Indeed, there's no medicine for regret in this world. Some relationships, once missed, are missed forever.]","Qin Zhao froze. One drop, two drops... blurred his phone screen.","Gao Hao widened his eyes in horror and turned to leave, \"Since you're fine, we'll be going now.\" He didn't dare to watch his boss cry!","Ji Fei was also surprised. Wasn't he fine just a moment ago? Why did he suddenly start crying?","My goodness, seeing such a big man cry was really shocking!","As Gao Hao pushed Ji Fei out the door, they could already hear Qin Zhao sobbing.","The two exchanged a glance at the door, and Gao Hao could only say awkwardly, \"This floor is full. I'm staying on the floor below. If there's any noise from here during the night, please keep an eye out.\"","At a time like this, Ji Fei naturally nodded in agreement.","Just as she was about to rest after returning, she received a message from Qin Xian.","\"Have you reached the hotel room?\"","\"Yes, your brother is staying here too. He came to pursue Chu Xinyue, but was firmly rejected.\"","Usually, Ji Fei wouldn't say much to Qin Xian, but such big news was hard not to share.","\"Oh, he probably won't give up.\"","\"But he cried!!!!\"","\"...\"","Feeling the deafening silence from Qin Xian's side, Ji Fei felt satisfied.","\"Gao Hao is worried about him and asked me to keep an ear out for any disturbances tonight.\"","\"No need to mind him. Nothing serious will happen. You should focus on resting.\"","What a brother!","Ji Fei laughed, then rounded up today's earnings and transferred them to Qin Xian before going to wash up and sleep.","However, she was drowsily woken up by Xiao Tao pushing her.","\"Teacher Ji, there's some noise next door.\"","Looking at the energetic Xiao Tao who hadn't slept at all, Ji Fei thought youth was indeed good, being able to stay up so late. The knocking from next door was faint; only Ji Fei had woken up. It would only be audible if the knocking continued for a while.","Ji Fei was puzzled. In the middle of the night, it couldn't be Gao Hao coming to find someone again, could it?","Ji Fei put on her robe, yawning, and was about to open the door when she heard the door next door opening at the same time.","\"Brother Zhao, I've missed you so much!\"","Ji Fei shuddered awake immediately. Only one person called Qin Zhao that way.","Her gossip radar activated, she stopped opening the door and instead peeked through the crack.","Sure enough, she saw Chu Xueqi standing at the door, while Qin Zhao, who had opened the door, was clearly shocked.","\"How are you here? Please leave!\"","Qin Zhao warned in a low voice. He certainly didn't want Chu Xinyue to see him with Chu Xueqi again in such a terrible situation.","Ji Fei couldn't see clearly, but she could hear Chu Xueqi sobbing, \"Brother Zhao, although I lied to you about many things, I really do like you. We've loved each other for so many years, how can you say you don't love me just like that?\"","This question hit right on Qin Zhao's sore spot.","Chu Xinyue doubted him, and now Chu Xueqi didn't believe him either. Did he need to cut open his heart to prove it?","Qin Zhao took a deep breath, \"Don't talk about love. I feel sick just looking at you now. You deceived me for so long, I only feel disgust towards you. If you don't leave, I'll call security.\"","Chu Xueqi fell silent, then asked, \"Have you been drinking?\"","\"It's none of your business!\"","\"You don't love me, you love my sister?\"","\"That's right!\"","Suddenly, Chu Xueqi yanked off the coat wrapped around her body, revealing a nearly see-through nightgown clinging to her alluring curves.","\"Then I'll be a substitute for my sister. I only want you for one night, Qin Zhao. Hold me.\"","It must be said, Chu Xueqi was truly skilled at impersonating Chu Xinyue. In an instant, even her tone of voice was a perfect imitation.","Her act of pretending to be Chu Xinyue instantly ignited Qin Zhao's fury.","Faced with Chu Xueqi lunging towards him for an embrace, he directly kicked her away.","\"Get out!\"","\"Ah!\"","In truth, Qin Zhao really wasn't one to lay hands on women, unless pushed beyond his limits.","This time, she had truly forced him to the edge.","And in such a situation, it was inevitable that a commotion would arise.","In an instant, the two nearby doors opened. It happened to be the researchers, but upon seeing something they shouldn't have, they immediately retreated back inside.","On Chu Xinyue's side, it was the female researcher who opened the door. Startled by the sight of the half-naked Chu Xueqi, Chu Xinyue's face froze, and she immediately moved to close the door.","\"Sister, why do you have to fight me for a man? You're so shameless!\" Chu Xueqi immediately began to cry out. \"Are you planning to seduce Qin Zhao tonight and get into his bed?\"","Qin Zhao was absolutely furious and was about to step forward.","Suddenly, a startled exclamation rang out.","Of course, only Qin Zhao could hear this exclamation. Frightened, he halted his steps and turned his head to look. He saw that Ji Fei, who had been secretly observing until now, had suddenly jumped out and was staring at him and Chu Xueqi in shock.","As he was trying to make sense of the situation, he heard her thoughts:","[Oh my God! An infectious disease! Chu Xueqi was infected with a contagious disease over at Wu Tian's place. She's been with Qin Zhao for so long, could he have... Oh no, how should I bring this up? Thank goodness Xinyue hasn't...]","Qin Zhao was so shocked that he could no longer process that this was merely Ji Fei's inner thoughts. Seeing Ji Fei's suspicious gaze and Chu Xinyue opposite him, his mind went blank and he shouted:","\"I've never touched her! I'm still a virgin, damn it!\"","In an instant, the hallway fell into dead silence!"]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Shocking Top Star Caught Sneaking Out at Midnight","paragraphs":["Everyone in the hallway, whether they had opened their doors or were secretly eavesdropping, was stunned for a long moment.","No one thought much about this sudden, out-of-context statement. They assumed a woman had thrown herself at Qin Zhao, and he was afraid Chu Xinyue would misunderstand, so he said that.","But for someone like Qin Zhao, with his charming looks and all the right conditions for being a playboy, to still be a virgin...","They couldn't believe it even if you killed them!","Even Chu Xinyue had assumed he and Chu Xueqi were already together.","After all, they had spent so much time alone together, and sometimes her parents would even hint at it in front of her, suggesting she should accept it.","So this current situation seemed highly implausible.","On this side, Qin Zhao realized what he had just revealed and his face turned bright red. He was so embarrassed he wished he could disappear on the spot. But when he saw Chu Xinyue's obvious look of disbelief, he became anxious.","Now it wasn't just a matter of his reputation, but potentially a serious health issue in the future!","No longer caring about losing face, he completely ignored Chu Xueqi, who was lying on the ground with an ashen face, and rushed towards Chu Xinyue.","But because he ran in such a panic, he stumbled and ended up sliding on his knees right in front of Chu Xinyue's door.","Chu Xinyue reflexively bent down to help him up, but Qin Zhao grabbed her hands before she could stand up straight.","He stared intensely into her eyes with a sincere expression.","\"Our engagement hasn't been called off yet, how could I possibly touch her! I promise I'm pure and clean, I absolutely haven't done anything, I swear... you have to believe me!\"","Everyone watched in astonishment: Well, he... he spoke so sincerely, even kneeling down to say it, it must be true.","It's just that their impression of the superstar Qin Zhao was now completely shattered.","[Holy crap, it's actually true! Is this guy really so principled? You can't judge a book by its cover! Even though he lives in the most glamorous and decadent world of showbiz, he hasn't been tempted. If you told his fans he was a virgin, they probably wouldn't believe it.]","[Ahem... I secretly took a picture, hopefully no one will notice. I couldn't help it, the scene was too funny!]","Ji Fei finally let out a tsunami of laughter in her inner thoughts. [Hahahahaha...]","Qin Zhao was disturbed by those inner voices, feeling embarrassed, annoyed, and helpless. After all, he couldn't afford to be distracted at such a crucial moment. His gaze towards Chu Xinyue became even more intense, as if trying to increase his credibility through sheer willpower.","Chu Xinyue, on the other hand, seemed as if her soul had been snatched away. She was completely dumbfounded. When she came to her senses, a wave of heat rushed to her face, and she desperately tried to pull her hands away.","A man grabbing you and emphatically declaring his virginity - the scene was just too explosive. Chu Xinyue, who had finally managed to put an end to their ill-fated relationship, completely lost her composure. She yanked her hands back and slammed the door shut.","Chu Xinyue's unusually flustered voice came through the air, \"It... it's none of my business!\"","It was practically a panicked retreat.","Qin Zhao quickly knocked on the door, \"But what I said is true, you have to believe me!\"","\"Qin Zhao!\" Chu Xueqi suddenly roared, her eyes almost bloodshot as she glared at him.","\"Do you only have eyes for that bitch Chu Xinyue now? Were all those years of care just a lie? How could you be so heartless!\"","Qin Zhao paused and finally turned to look at Chu Xueqi. The genuine emotion in his eyes instantly turned cold.","\"Why did you come to find me tonight?\" Qin Zhao now seriously doubted Chu Xueqi's intentions for coming tonight.","Chu Xueqi froze, a hint of something unusual flashing across her face.","[I see, how vicious!] Ji Fei, who had stayed behind to watch the drama unfold, took the opportunity to look into this juicy gossip.","[It turns out that Chu Xueqi had been avoiding Wu Tian, but recently she was informed by Wu Tian that he had contracted a disease. Chu Xueqi was so scared that she went for a check-up and found out she was infected too.]","[She blamed it all on Qin Zhao, thinking it was because he never wanted to touch her, and she had to maintain her innocent image and couldn't seduce him actively. She could only go outside to satisfy her needs when she couldn't hold back anymore. She felt that if it wasn't for Qin Zhao, she wouldn't have fallen to such a state, and now she was even being abandoned by him. So she planned to drag Qin Zhao down with her. Tsk tsk tsk!]","Qin Zhao's face had already turned ice-cold. Before Chu Xueqi could make any more excuses, Qin Zhao took out his phone and called Brother Gao to come up and handle the situation.","Chu Xueqi immediately became anxious and said, \"Do you really not care about our past at all? Even if I'm willing to be a substitute for your sister?\"","\"Heh! You're not worthy.\" Qin Zhao said coldly.","\"But your sister doesn't want you now. With her personality, she won't turn back. At least my face can still comfort you!\" Chu Xueqi said frantically.","Qin Zhao coldly replied, \"In this life, except for that time when I was near death and mistook you for her, you two have always been completely different in my eyes. You're debasing yourself, don't drag others down with you.\"","Being scolded like this, Chu Xueqi's expression became distorted.","Qin Zhao continued, \"Chu Xueqi, I'm warning you. With that face of yours, just be yourself. Don't think about impersonating Xinyue again. If I find out one more time, I guarantee you'll regret it!\"","Chu Xueqi's whole body began to tremble uncontrollably. It wasn't fear, it was hatred.","She hated it so much! Indeed, Chu Xinyue was born to be her nemesis. As long as she existed, Chu Xueqi couldn't live a good life.","By the time Qin Zhao finished speaking, Gao Hao had already rushed up with his assistant, looking disheveled.","Gao Hao had already given her face earlier in the day, and now he was somewhat angry. What if someone had taken pictures?","\"Miss Chu, if you don't cooperate, we'll have to ask the hotel security to come and handle this. Do you want to trend on social media?\"","Chu Xueqi calmed down and actually allowed the assistant to take her away without crying or making a scene. However, the look she gave as she turned back before leaving made it clear she was leaving with hatred.","Qin Zhao thought for a moment and still whispered in Gao Hao's ear about the infectious disease.","Gao Hao was shocked and looked at Qin Zhao in disbelief, \"You!\"","That expression immediately made Qin Zhao angry, \"I never touched her!\"","Why wouldn't anyone believe him?","Ji Fei watched from the side. Seeing Qin Zhao emphasizing again, she thought that Brother Gao must be worried that Qin Zhao had fallen for Chu Xueqi's trap tonight, so he was checking.","Brother Gao breathed a sigh of relief and then went down to deal with Chu Xueqi.","Qin Zhao saw that only Ji Fei was left in the hallway. Remembering the chaotic situation earlier, he couldn't help but approach her and ask, \"Did you take a picture or something just now?\"","Ji Fei immediately denied it, \"No, I didn't.\"","Qin Zhao said irritably, \"I'll transfer you money, you delete it.\"","Ji Fei immediately put on a regretful expression.","Qin Zhao asked puzzled, \"What's wrong?\"","Ji Fei looked like she was about to cry, \"You should have said that earlier, I've already sent it to the group.\"","Qin Zhao: Group?!!!!","\"What group?\"","\"Uh... the Qin family group.\"","Qin Zhao was about to breathe a sigh of relief, but then he realized that if his family saw that scene, he could dig a castle with his toes from embarrassment!","Qin Zhao quickly took out his phone to check, but there was no such family group.","\"It's... a temporary small group.\"","Well, before going to bed, except for Qin Xian who had contacted her, Qin's Father, Qin's Mom, and Qin Yan had all expressed concern about her staying out alone and asked about her situation.","Ji Fei found it troublesome to reply to each one individually, so she simply created a group and then released the gossip she hadn't been able to share with Qin Xian.","Everyone's responses were quite intense, and Ji Fei was very satisfied, stating that she would immediately tell them if she had any first-hand information.","Wasn't this just perfect! Who could sleep after such explosive news without sharing it?","Qin Zhao looked at Ji Fei, who awkwardly showed her phone, \"It's been too long, I can't recall the message. Everyone has seen it. I didn't expect everyone to like staying up late...\"","There wasn't much content on the interface, and at the top was what Ji Fei had posted.","\"Shocking! Top star actually slides on his knees in front of his ex-fiancée's door in the middle of the night to loudly prove he is a ~\"","The video was sent out.","Below were the responses from everyone:","Qin's Father: !!!!","Qin's Mom: !!!!","Qin Yan: !!!!","The screen reflected Qin Zhao's handsome face, now twisted and distorted."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Bro, I'm Bullied by Your Wife","paragraphs":["To Ji Fei's surprise, she discovered she had a talent for viral marketing.","Ji Fei felt guilty, \"I didn't mean to do it on purpose. We're all family here, and everyone is just concerned about you and Xinyue's situation. Besides, think about it - if you and Xinyue ever have a chance in the future, this video might become a beautiful memory.\"","Qin Zhao: Thanks a lot for that!","[Even though I'm sure they'll break up, I'll just deceive him for now to avoid his anger being directed at me.]","Qin Zhao: ...You! Your apology isn't even sincere!","\"By the way, about Chu Xueqi...\" Ji Fei quickly changed the subject when she saw Qin Zhao's expression change.","[How should I explain this? It's a matter of life and death, I can't not say anything, but how do I explain where I got this information?]","Qin Zhao gave Ji Fei an irritated look, but decided to help her out, \"Something's wrong with Chu Xueqi. Brother Gao just told me... he's worried she might do something extreme. Stay far away from her if you see her in the future.\"","Qin Zhao managed to keep both sides in the dark; neither Brother Gao nor Ji Fei would suspect anything.","Ji Fei was surprised, not expecting that someone already knew. This put her mind at ease.","Ji Fei said with a smile, \"Luckily you still... ahem... dodged a bullet.\"","Qin Zhao's face turned green.","\"Go to sleep already!\" Out of sight, out of mind.","Ji Fei shrugged.","[Why are you so angry? Is being a virgin something to be ashamed of? Your family has two virgin men! Your brother is still one even now, and he doesn't feel ashamed. I get it now, it must be a family trait.]","Qin Zhao looked at Ji Fei in shock: ??","What did he just hear? Did she just reveal herself? So that incident from back then was really fake?","No, no, no, the key point is that his second brother is the same as him!!!!","He seemed to understand those exclamation marks in the group chat... they weren't just for him!","At least he had his brother for company. This was the only consolation of the night.","Far away at the Qin Family Estate, Qin Xian, who had just finished dealing with business matters, suddenly felt something was off.","Then he seemed to hear whispers coming from somewhere in the supposedly quiet Qin Family Estate.","Why isn't everyone asleep at this late hour?","Puzzled, Qin Xian checked his phone's memo pad before going to bed, only to find a video forwarded by his mother.","He opened it curiously to take a look.","Qin Xian: ...","When Qin Zhao returned to his room exhausted, he received a call from Qin Xian.","Calling so late at night, Qin Zhao strongly suspected that someone else had also seen the video.","But while he might feel embarrassed in front of others, facing his brother who was in the same situation, hah! His brother had been a virgin longer than him and even had a wife.","A strange sense of competitiveness made Qin Zhao straighten his back as he answered the phone.","Qin Xian had originally intended to call and check on his brother, who had been crying and kneeling in the video, but instead he heard his brother's tattling.","\"You saw the video?\"","\"...Yes.\"","\"Brother, I was bullied by your wife.\"","\"...I think you sound quite spirited right now.\"","\"Brother, you've changed. Are you still my real brother?\"","\"...\" Why did his brother become so unserious after going out with Ji Fei?","\"Yes, you are my real brother. Sister-in-law just said we're a family of two virgins, it's a family trait.\"","\"...\" His hand itched to hit his brother. \"I'm hanging up.\"","\"Ah, wait, brother, I have something important to tell you.\" Qin Zhao stopped seeking psychological balance and quickly brought up the investment matter.","\"I heard Ji Fei mention it. How about this, I'll come pick you up tomorrow and handle this matter while I'm at it.\"","\"Ah, it's fine if you just agree, you don't need to come in person. I can handle it.\"","\"This is a field that Qin Corporation hasn't ventured into before.\"","Qin Zhao became anxious, \"You really don't need to come, don't steal my thunder. I want to use this to impress Xinyue.\"","Qin Xian was silent for a moment, \"Don't coerce the other party.\"","\"What do you take me for! Of course I won't!\"","\"So you really won't give up?\"","Qin Zhao fell silent for a moment, \"I don't want to give up, really... I don't. I like her so much. Why am I only realizing now that I've actually liked her so much for so long?\"","Qin Xian was at a loss for words hearing the tearful voice. He waited for a while until the other party calmed down.","\"By the way, about Chu Xueqi...\" Qin Zhao explained the situation, then said darkly, \"She wanted to harm me. I want to make it impossible for her to gain a foothold in high society.\"","Qin Xian hadn't expected such a malicious incident. He immediately exuded a chilling aura, \"Mm, leave it to me to handle.\"","Early the next morning, Qin Zhao thick-skinned approached the professor as if nothing had happened, and arranged to meet at the hotel's breakfast buffet downstairs.","Naturally, the research group members would all go together. Only Cao Ya was absent, which puzzled the professor a bit. Actually, Cao Ya had a sister in town, and unable to face the others last night, she had left the hotel to stay with her sister.","The professor didn't think much of it. Hearing about the investment, his face lit up with joy, excited to see hope as he introduced the project to Qin Zhao.","Qin Zhao gave high praise and stated that once they prepared the report materials, he would take them to Qin Corporation to officially sign the contract.","Everyone was a bit incredulous, feeling that it all seemed too easy. Except for the professor, the others couldn't help but look towards Chu Xinyue.","They all understood in their hearts that this was all because of Chu Xinyue.","Chu Xinyue actually felt somewhat uncomfortable, but seeing that the professor could fulfill his lifelong wish and make scientific research contributions to the country, she still felt comforted.","She couldn't help but look up, only to see sunlight falling on someone's shoulders through the glass window.","When their eyes met, Chu Xinyue smiled faintly, \"Thank you.\"","Qin Zhao was taken aback, not feeling happy about Chu Xinyue's good attitude.","After everything that happened yesterday, Chu Xinyue could have avoided him, rejected him, or even felt awkward - all of these would have indicated some kind of reaction towards him.","What he feared most was her indifference, which was like an invisible fist shattering his fantasies.","He understood in his heart that although Ji Fei's words were unpleasant, she always spoke the truth. There was almost no possibility of them being together now.","But he could only avoid facing it. Even if he could look at her for just one more moment, it would be good.","Meanwhile, Xiao Tao, who was enthusiastically enjoying the buffet at the hotel, happened to see them. Having developed a habit of gossiping, she immediately sent a message to Ji Fei, who was still sleeping in.","\"I see Professor Qin and Miss Chu.\"","Ji Fei woke up, looked at the message, and jolted awake, hurriedly asking: \"Which Chu?\"","\"The beautiful researcher sister.\"","Ji Fei thought to herself that she must have been stupid to think it was Chu Xueqi. After realizing this, she felt the urge to witness the scene in person.","She got up and quickly got ready. \"Save me a seat, I'll be there soon.\"","\"But it looks like they're almost finished eating.\"","Ji Fei didn't reply. Xiao Tao could only hold onto her phone, keeping an eye on the situation over there.","Having settled the investment issue, the excited professor wanted to hurry back to prepare the report, so everyone decided not to stay at the hotel any longer.","They were about to leave after finishing breakfast.","Xiao Tao had no choice but to send a message to Ji Fei.","But soon, Ji Fei called her.","\"Quick, stop them! There's danger!\" Her voice came through the phone, almost shouting while running.","Xiao Tao was stunned for a moment, then quickly rushed out to find them, but the hotel had multiple exits, and she had no idea which way they had gone.","At the same time, Ji Fei had just come down from the elevator. Her face had turned pale, and she saw a group of people walking towards the elevator from afar.","Ji Fei was about to breathe a sigh of relief when she suddenly saw a dark figure rapidly approaching from behind them.","Ji Fei couldn't make out who it was, so she could only shout, \"Xinyue, watch out behind you!\"","Everyone was startled and reflexively turned to look.","Only Qin Zhao reacted first, taking two quick steps forward to shield Xinyue's back!"]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: This... is really hard to evaluate.","paragraphs":["Unable to turn around in time to assess the situation, Qin Zhao could only use his tall frame to shield Chu Xinyue in the critical moment.","The knife that was meant to strike Chu Xinyue's head directly slashed Qin Zhao's shoulder instead.","In an instant, blood stained his white shirt red.","By the time Chu Xinyue turned her head to look, Qin Zhao was already swaying unsteadily.","Chu Xinyue's pupils constricted. \"Qin Zhao!\"","Screams erupted throughout the hall.","Two male researchers who had regained their senses quickly rushed forward to restrain the man who was still wielding the knife.","\"It's you, Kang Zhi! Have you gone mad?\" A female researcher supported the shocked professor as they continuously backed away.","\"Shameless bitch, I'll kill you! Let's see how you dare to gossip after this!\" The person wearing a black hoodie raised his head, glaring furiously in Chu Xinyue's direction. This man was none other than Cao Ya's ex-boyfriend.","His eyes bulging with rage, he roared as he tried to charge forward. \"If it wasn't for you, you whore, Xiao Ya wouldn't have abandoned me to go abroad. It's all because you couldn't stand to see us happy!\"","However, several security guards quickly swarmed in from behind, surrounding Kang Zhi. Xiao Tao followed behind the guards, having alerted them.","Kang Zhi frantically swung his knife like a madman, trying to break through the encirclement, but was gradually driven away from the crowd by the security guards.","Qin Zhao, having lost strength due to blood loss, had already collapsed on the ground.","Chu Xinyue was completely flustered. In her daze, she seemed to see the blood-covered boy who had fallen down the hillside years ago.","Her face turned pale with anxiety, and she could only hurriedly press on Qin Zhao's shoulder to help stop the bleeding. Her voice trembling, she said, \"An ambulance, quickly call an ambulance...\"","The hotel manager ran over, his forehead beaded with sweat. Seeing someone injured, he quickly took out his walkie-talkie to contact someone.","\"Our hotel has its own medical department, very professional. They'll be here right away. Don't worry, we can definitely handle this.\" While saying this, he still called for an ambulance, just in case.","Everyone gathered around, concerned.","\"Fortunately, it's not a major artery.\"","\"Only the muscle is injured, the wound isn't deep. Don't panic.\"","But Chu Xinyue's hands were still trembling constantly, which Qin Zhao could naturally feel as she pressed on his wound.","At this moment, his lips had lost their color. He smiled weakly, \"Don't be afraid, I'm fine.\"","\"You...\" Chu Xinyue bit her lip, not knowing what to say, but her eyes reddened. \"It's all my fault. If I hadn't meddled in others' affairs...\"","The onlookers felt distressed hearing this. Such a wretched incident was truly unfortunate for whoever encountered it.","Qin Zhao could only pat her with his other hand, clumsily trying to comfort her. \"It has nothing to do with you. It's their fault.\"","At this time, Ji Fei also came over with a furrowed brow.","Seeing her approach, Qin Zhao immediately said, \"Second Sister-in-law, thanks to you. Thank you.\"","This time, he was genuinely and sincerely grateful to Ji Fei. If it hadn't been for Ji Fei's timely warning, that knife would have truly taken Chu Xinyue's life.","Just thinking about that possibility, Qin Zhao didn't know how he would have gone on living the next second.","Qin Zhao had never been so clearly aware as he was in that life-or-death moment... that Chu Xinyue had become an existence more important to him than his own life.","Chu Xinyue came to her senses and also looked gratefully towards Ji Fei. Others also expressed their admiration.","Ji Fei, however, frowned deeply, her gaze wandering, without responding.","Qin Zhao thought she was frightened and was about to say something about how he was fine, when he heard Ji Fei's puzzled inner thoughts.","[Strange, how come it's Kang Zhi?]","Qin Zhao: ?","[What I saw was information about Chu Xueqi lying in wait in the hall, planning to use a syringe to infect Xinyue with the disease. That's why I ran down to stop it.]","Qin Zhao: !","It was when Ji Fei had just woken up and thought about how Gao Hao knew about Chu Xueqi's contagious disease. She was quite curious about what would happen to Chu Xueqi next, so she used the system to check.","[If Kang Zhi rushing over was unexpected, then Chu Xueqi should still be lurking in some dark corner, ready to strike at any moment!]","Qin Zhao's expression changed drastically, and he instinctively gripped Chu Xinyue beside him tightly.","Chu Xinyue thought there was a problem with his wound and didn't resist, asking worriedly, \"What's wrong?\"","But Qin Zhao was already anxiously looking around.","The next second, shouts came from the distant corridor.","That corridor was the direction in which Kang Zhi had fled. Because there was a woman's voice among the shouts, everyone's faces changed upon hearing it.","Had someone else been injured by mistake?","Just then, people from the medical department arrived to treat Qin Zhao's wound. The anxious lobby manager immediately led a doctor towards the corridor.","Two male researchers, also very curious, followed to see what was happening.","In such a potentially life-threatening situation, Ji Fei still didn't dare to approach, and she needed to be on guard for the possible appearance of Chu Xueqi at all times.","And Qin Zhao, who was dizzy from blood loss, forced himself to stay alert, even more vigilant of the surroundings than Ji Fei.","But after a short while, the manager returned with the two male researchers, his face ashen.","Their panicked gazes fell on Qin Zhao and Chu Xinyue.","By this time, Qin Zhao's wound had already undergone hemostasis treatment.","\"What happened?\" Qin Zhao asked, \"Did he escape?\"","The manager said, \"The person has been caught, but someone else was injured.\"","As he spoke, the manager looked towards Chu Xinyue and said, \"Miss, if I'm not mistaken, you must be related to Miss Chu Xueqi?\"","Although they shouldn't pry into client privacy, they did have identical faces after all.","Chu Xinyue instinctively frowned with distaste upon hearing such words.","Qin Zhao: \"Did you see Chu Xueqi?\"","Ji Fei was also quite surprised and couldn't help but use the system to check.","[Oh my goodness! This... is really... hard to judge.]","Qin Zhao became even more confused.","The male researcher finally couldn't contain his shock and said, \"Chu Xueqi was slashed by Kang Zhi. When I got there, I heard Kang Zhi still shouting... Apparently, in his frenzied state, he saw Chu Xueqi's face and mistook her for you, Xinyue, so...\"","[What do you call this? In the past, Chu Xueqi used Chu Xinyue's identity as she pleased, regardless of what harm it might cause Chu Xinyue. Now she's been mistaken for Chu Xinyue and encountered this accident...]","Everyone was stunned hearing this.","The manager quickly said, \"Miss Chu Xueqi is seriously injured and will definitely need to be taken to the hospital by ambulance. So, Miss Chu Xinyue, could we ask you to go with her?\"","Chu Xinyue's face was as cold as water. After thinking for a moment, she still stood up, intending to go with the manager.","\"Don't get involved. You're not part of the Chu family anymore. Don't let them entangle you,\" Qin Zhao said, not wanting Chu Xinyue to come into contact with such dangerous people.","Moreover, it was hard to say how the Chu parents would treat Chu Xinyue when they learned the reason why Chu Xueqi was attacked.","Qin Zhao held onto Chu Xinyue and gave the manager a string of numbers. \"Contact Chu's parents directly.\"","The manager looked hesitant but still dialed the number under Qin Zhao's stern gaze.","Chu Xinyue let out a silent sigh. She indeed didn't want to have any more entanglements with that family.","After contacting Chu's parents, the manager was about to leave when Qin Zhao suddenly spoke up, \"Tell your medical staff to be careful. Chu Xueqi has an infectious disease.\"","Qin Zhao named the infectious disease, and instantly the entire hall fell silent.","Such explosive news, announced so publicly? Completely disregarding someone's privacy?","Qin Zhao sneered. Considering what Chu Xueqi was planning to do, he couldn't care less about her privacy. It would also prevent that crazy woman from harming other medical staff."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: The Old Master Is Going to Cut off Future Troubles This Time","paragraphs":["Chu Xinyue was stunned. \"How is that possible?\"","\"It was transmitted by Wu Tian,\" Qin Zhao said, then immediately changed his expression and continued, \"I just found out myself, but everything I said last night was true. If you don't believe me, I can go get tested.\"","Chu Xinyue was left speechless, her shock at the revelation quickly overshadowed by Qin Zhao's words.","At that moment, the manager seemed to recall something. His face changed dramatically as he hurriedly left.","The researcher nearby also belatedly realized, \"Wait, so that syringe she was holding earlier, with the blood-like liquid inside, was she planning to... Could it be that last night she was also planning to...\"","Everyone turned to look at Qin Zhao in horror.","[She was trying to harm Qin Zhao last night, but now the target has become Xinyue. What a madwoman,] Ji Fei mused.","Qin Zhao snorted coldly, \"Who knows? In any case, we should all be on guard whenever she appears from now on.\"","Chu Xinyue felt dazed, unable to imagine how things had taken such a turn.","Because it was a malicious assault case, they all had to stay and cooperate with the police investigation before they could leave the city.","Qin Zhao, due to the severity of his wound, needed stitches and was sent directly to the hospital, accompanied by Gao Hao.","When Ji Fei came out of the police station, she saw a tall man wearing a gray coat over a black suit, standing in front of a black business van. He stood ramrod straight, his deep-set eyes beneath thick long lashes fixed intently on the police station entrance, seriously waiting for someone.","Although Ji Fei had no particular feelings for Qin Xian, she had to admit that the moment he appeared, it gave people a sense of security, as if everything would be alright.","Ji Fei walked over with light steps. Qin Xian didn't wait in place but actively approached her. With his long legs, he reached Ji Fei in just a few strides. He lowered his head, scanning her up and down for a few seconds before asking, \"Are you hurt?\"","Ji Fei waved her hand, \"I'm fine. Why are you here? Didn't Brother Gao arrange for a lawyer to handle this? Qin Zhao should be able to transfer back once his wound is stitched up. Didn't he tell you?\"","Seeing that Ji Fei seemed to be in good spirits, Qin Xian knew she hadn't been frightened. \"Couldn't reach him. He's asleep from the anesthesia.\"","\"So we're going to the hospital now?\" Ji Fei asked.","Qin Xian nodded.","Ji Fei called Xiao Tao to come along, but just then, Chu Xinyue walked over quickly and said to Qin Xian, \"I'm sorry, Qin Zhao was injured because of me...\"","\"I've been briefed on what happened. It has nothing to do with you. As a man, protecting a woman is part of his upbringing. Miss Chu, you don't need to worry too much about it. Regarding the investment, it won't have any impact,\" Qin Xian said in a businesslike manner.","Ji Fei looked at Qin Xian in surprise. He hadn't framed it as a life-saving debt, which meant he didn't want to put any emotional burden on Chu Xinyue that might force her to yield, given that she had rejected Qin Zhao.","Chu Xinyue also understood his meaning and lowered her gaze.","Qin Xian thought of his unfortunate brother and spoke again, \"We're going to the hospital to pick up Qin Zhao. Would you like to come along and see him?\"","After all, his brother had risked his life, so he hoped this might cheer him up a little.","This time, Chu Xinyue didn't hesitate and was about to nod when her phone rang.","It was an unknown number, but the moment she answered, she recognized the shouting voice as Mr. Chu's.","She had long since blocked all contact methods from the Chu family, so this must have been a call from someone else's phone.","\"Chu Xinyue, you unfilial daughter! Running away from home in a fit of anger was bad enough, but now you've even implicated your sister in such a terrible ordeal! You knew very well that your sister's health was poor, yet you still got involved with such people and let your sister take the blow for you! Even if you hold grudges, do you want your sister to die?! Get over here right now! Come and see what kind of sin you've committed!\"","\"Xinyue, hurry to the hospital! Your sister was stabbed many times by that madwoman, and... *sobs*... Come to the hospital quickly to see your sister!\"","The Chu couple's words came out in a rush, as if they were afraid Chu Xinyue would hang up.","The urgency and anguish in their voices made even Chu Xinyue furrow her brow for a moment.","Could Chu Xueqi's injuries be fatal?","Although she had hardened her heart against the Chu family, Chu Xinyue had never thought about getting revenge. Now, if Chu Xueqi died because of her, she felt like she would be haunted by Chu Xueqi for the rest of her life.","That feeling was like a nightmare.","Chu Xinyue almost lost her balance and was steadied by Ji Fei.","Unexpectedly, Ji Fei snatched the phone, hung up, and then turned it off.","\"Sister Ji Fei?\" Chu Xinyue stared blankly at Ji Fei.","Ji Fei made up an excuse, \"I'm sure everything's fine. If it wasn't, the police at the station would have told us first thing. The Chu couple probably just want to vent their anger on you. So I suggest you go back with your team, focus on preparing your investment report, and don't respond to anyone trying to contact you. You've already cut ties with them, so from now on, treat it as if they're dead to you.\"","[You absolutely can't go there. How many times have your parents deceived you? They're just waiting for you to show up so they can use you!]","Chu Xinyue thought for a moment and then said, \"But Qin Zhao...\"","Qin Xian, hearing Ji Fei's inner thoughts, frowned. If something really had happened, his brother would surely get worked up again. So he spoke up, \"We'll let him know for you. You're welcome to come visit him anytime after we get back.\"","In the end, Chu Xinyue left with her team, keeping her phone turned off.","When Qin Xian brought Ji Fei to Qin Zhao's hospital room, Qin Zhao had just woken up. Not seeing Chu Xinyue, his face immediately fell, his mood visibly low.","Gao Hao couldn't bear to see Qin Zhao like this and couldn't help but complain, \"Qin Zhao got injured saving her, and she won't even come to visit?\"","Qin Zhao instantly reacted with a cold voice, \"Brother Gao, don't say that. I know why she didn't come. She must be afraid that I'll use this favor to manipulate her feelings. How could I ever do such a thing! No, I need to contact her and make this clear.\"","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow. These brothers sure think alike.","But when Qin Zhao picked up his phone, he remembered he had been blocked and looked disappointed.","Qin Xian stepped forward and patted Qin Zhao's head, \"She was going to come originally.\"","Qin Zhao's eyes immediately lit up.","[That's right, even if she doesn't accept you, she still has that much sense of duty.]","Qin Zhao felt like he'd been struck by an arrow.","If you can't say anything nice, don't say anything at all!","Qin Xian: ...","\"Then why didn't she come?\" Gao Hao asked curiously.","\"Because Mr. and Mrs. Chu are in this hospital,\" Qin Xian mentioned, and Qin Zhao exploded.","\"Are they blaming Xinyue for this incident and giving her a hard time again?!\"","[It's worse than just giving her a hard time! They want to use Xinyue as a spare parts donor!]","Qin Zhao's face changed dramatically, startling Gao Hao across from him. What was going on?","Qin Xian frowned slightly as he heard Ji Fei's unceasing internal complaints.","[Chu Xueqi was stabbed three times. The reason they're so desperate to get Chu Xinyue there is that two of the stabs damaged her kidneys. Chu Xueqi's organs have been weak since childhood, and now both kidneys are injured. Although it's not life-threatening organ failure, they definitely won't last many years. So those two have made up their minds to use this opportunity to make her donate a healthy kidney for Chu Xueqi to use.]","[Not only that, but they've also consulted about skin grafting. The last stab wound was on Chu Xueqi's face, disfiguring her. She needs skin grafts to repair it, but Chu Xueqi's body can't handle the strain. So they're thinking of transplanting skin from Chu Xinyue to use on Chu Xueqi. Since they're twins, there's basically no risk of rejection, making it the most suitable option.]","[What terrible parents! It's as if they think that everything on the child they gave birth to should be fairly distributed between the two as a matter of course. It's sickening!]","As Ji Fei was ranting internally, she suddenly saw Qin Zhao jump up from the hospital bed.","\"Ah Zhao!\" Gao Hao exclaimed in shock.","Qin Xian frowned slightly, \"Don't make a fuss. I'll handle this.\"","But Qin Zhao was already overcome with anger, his eyes bloodshot, \"I'm only injured in the arm, it's not like I can't move. Damn it! This time I'm going to put an end to this once and for all!\"","With that, he rushed out of the hospital room."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: People are alive parents, not living Yan Wang","paragraphs":["Ji Fei inwardly mocked Qin Zhao's hot temper, thinking that if he was this angry just knowing the Chu couple was looking for Chu Xinyue, he'd probably explode if he knew their outrageous intentions.","Following along to watch the drama unfold, they quickly arrived at Chu Xueqi's hospital room.","As expected, she wasn't even in the intensive care unit, yet they had lied to Chu Xinyue on the phone, making it sound as if Chu Xueqi was on the brink of death. They didn't seem to worry about jinxing their precious daughter.","At this moment, Mr. and Mrs. Chu were anxiously fuming because they couldn't reach Chu Xinyue, constantly cursing under their breath.","\"That ungrateful daughter is so heartless! Her sister is in this state because of her, and she won't even come to visit!\"","\"What should we do? Has Xinyue completely abandoned us? If she's this cold-hearted, even if we find her, she probably won't agree to the transplant for Xueqi.\"","\"This happened because of her, so refusing would be unconscionable. If that's the case, I'll go to her school and see how they can accept someone with such low moral character!\"","[Truly witnessing the diversity of species here. To not only have such thoughts but to voice them so righteously, it's clear they don't see anything wrong with their behavior! If Qin Zhao hears this, the consequences might be even worse than if Chu Xinyue did.]","Sure enough, Qin Zhao was furious. He charged over without warning, using his uninjured hand to grab Mr. Chu's collar and slam him against the wall.","\"Ah!\" Mr. Chu let out a painful cry.","Gao Hao, startled, quickly looked around to see if anyone had noticed. It was the first time he had seen Qin Zhao so enraged, so he gave up on trying to stop him and opted to keep watch instead.","After the initial shock of pain, Mr. Chu recognized who it was and was completely stunned, probably never imagining that one day he'd be treated this way by someone younger.","\"Qin Zhao, it's you. What are you doing?!\"","\"Qin Zhao, let go of your uncle, how can you—\" Mrs. Chu, snapping out of her daze, became frantic. She tried to pull Qin Zhao away but found she couldn't budge him; he was like an enraged bull.","Mrs. Chu could only turn to others for help, noticing that Qin Zhao's older brother and sister-in-law were standing not far away.","\"Qin Xian, Ji Fei, quickly...\"","Ji Fei blinked and calmly turned to sit on a nearby bench. She was a bit tired from rushing over, so she might as well sit down and enjoy the show.","Mrs. Chu was shocked and fixed her pleading gaze on Qin Xian. Surely the Qin family heir wouldn't be so...","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei sitting beside him, then sat down as well. He addressed Qin Zhao, \"Be careful not to aggravate your injury. Mom and Dad will worry when we get back.\"","As he finished speaking, he noticed Ji Fei had already started secretly recording a video.","Qin Xian: ...Perhaps their parents' concern would be outweighed by their eagerness to see the drama unfold.","Mrs. Chu opened and closed her mouth, unable to utter a word. She could only clutch her head, nearly fainting from the shock.","Mr. Chu was furious, but being pinned against the wall by the much taller Qin Zhao, his feet barely touching the ground, he couldn't struggle free. His face turned red with anger, veins bulging in his neck.","\"We are your elders! Have you gone mad?!\"","\"I think you're the ones who've gone mad. You don't deserve to be parents. It's fortunate that Xinyue cut ties with your family, or you'd have tormented her to death by now!\"","The Chu couple stared at Qin Zhao in disbelief. It hadn't been that long since they'd last seen him, yet he was now acting this way for Chu Xinyue.","\"You... what nonsense are you spouting! Weren't you injured too? How can you say none of this is because of Chu Xinyue? As an older sister, not only did she fail to protect her younger sister, but she also got her into trouble. If it weren't for her, would Xueqi's face and kidneys be damaged? Even if she's unwilling to help, she should at least make up for her mistakes!\"","\"Is it because she guessed something and is deliberately avoiding us, refusing to save her sister?! How can she be so heartless!\"","Faced with such parents, Qin Zhao seemed to finally understand the suffocating feeling Chu Xinyue had endured for over twenty years.","Qin Zhao's hands trembled with rage, his eyes bulging, looking as if he might start throwing punches at any moment.","Ji Fei couldn't help but mock them, \"From what you're saying, it sounds like you want a piece of skin and a kidney. I'm curious, why can't Chu Xueqi use her own skin for her disfigurement? As for the kidney problem, can't you wait for a donor? It's not like she's going to die immediately, so why does it have to come from Chu Xinyue? Do you hate her so much that you can't stand to see her well?\"","\"What nonsense are you talking about! We're her parents, how could we not want her to be well? Xueqi has a weak constitution and can't withstand repeated procedures. Twins are the most stable and suitable for transplants.\"","\"This is unavoidable. Family members should help each other.\"","Qin Zhao's blood boiled as he snarled, \"Help each other? Then tell me, what has Chu Xueqi ever done to help Chu Xinyue since she was born?\"","The Chu couple suddenly looked as if they were being choked, probably wracking their brains but unable to come up with a single instance.","Qin Zhao sneered, \"It's always been Chu Xinyue one-sidedly helping Chu Xueqi, hasn't it? Last time, Chu Xueqi's true, vile nature was exposed, yet you still treat her like a treasure, mistreating Xinyue so badly for her sake!\"","Qin Zhao found it unbelievable. He and the Chu couple had been equally deceived by Chu Xueqi's façade, and now when he thought back on it, he felt disgusted. He couldn't believe the Chu couple showed no remorse whatsoever.","\"If they don't continue to dote on Chu Xueqi, wouldn't that mean all those years of their lives were wasted?\" Qin Xian rarely spoke so caustically, but his words struck right at the heart of the matter.","Ji Fei nodded in agreement.","[Getting older people to admit they're wrong is harder than prying open their coffin lids.]","A flicker of wavering and guilt flashed across Mr. Chu's face, but he quickly stiffened his neck and said, \"After all, this is a matter for our family...\"","[Here we go again, the same old trick. When they can't win with reason, they appeal to emotions and attitudes.]","Amused by Ji Fei's comment, Qin Xian suddenly spoke up. \"Family? So... have you been tested for compatibility?\"","This time, everyone was stunned. It was as if lightning had struck their brains.","\"Besides her twin sister, wouldn't you two as parents be the most likely to be compatible?\" Qin Xian said calmly.","The Chu couple's minds seemed to short-circuit, unable to process this for a moment.","Ji Fei was instantly disgusted.","\"Oh my, darling, how can you suspect Uncle and Auntie like that? Even if their hearts are skewed to outer space, these are still their daughters. When their daughter is in trouble, as parents, their first thought would surely be to help themselves, not burden their children. It's impossible that they'd expect one daughter to fill in for the other.\"","Qin Xian was startled by the sudden \"darling\" but reflexively played along, \"Is that so?\"","\"Of course! They must have failed the compatibility test and had no choice but to turn to Chu Xinyue for help. It couldn't possibly be that they could potentially help but instead want a young woman in the prime of her life, who hasn't even fallen in love, gotten married, or had children yet, to be left with two huge scars, losing her freedom to dress as she likes and her health and vitality, forced to live cautiously from then on.\"","\"Hmm, you make a good point.\"","\"Exactly! They're living parents, not King Yama incarnate. Even tigers don't eat their own cubs!\""]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Their Well-Behaved Little Sister Was Rooted by a Wild Boar","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's sarcasm was at its peak, her mocking tone filling the entire corridor. Each word lashed out like a whip, striking the couple.","Compared to directly insulting them, this indirect humiliation felt twice as painful.","The color drained from both their faces.","They seemed on the verge of fainting from anger.","Then Ji Fei added, \"Isn't that right, uncle and auntie? It's such a pity your tissue typing failed.\"","Gao Hao was ready to give this lady a thumbs up. It felt so satisfying to hear.","This time, Mrs. Chu couldn't stand it anymore. She collapsed to the ground, trembling all over, her eyes bloodshot, unable to meet anyone's gaze. Yet she still couldn't admit they were wrong.","\"No... we're old, so...\" In truth, they hadn't even considered it. They had just taken it for granted... assuming it was natural for Chu Xinyue to sacrifice herself.","\"Hmph, you... have no shame,\" Qin Zhao said coldly, releasing Mr. Chu and letting him slump pathetically against the wall.","Being scolded like this by someone younger was no different from a slap in the face - it was an utter humiliation.","Mr. Chu finally fell to the ground, completely disgraced. Yet he still shouted, \"It's none of your business to criticize our Chu Family's affairs! Get out, all of you get out!\"","Ji Fei: \"Oh my, not only do I want to criticize, I also plan to spread the word about your family's conduct in our social circles, so everyone can see what kind of people you are!\"","\"No! What are you trying to do?!\" Mrs. Chu immediately shrieked.","\"Oh? Weren't you so righteous before? Didn't you think you were doing the right thing? Why are you so afraid of people knowing now?\" Gao Hao couldn't help but join in with the sarcasm. \"You wanted the school to see Chu Xinyue's character earlier, why don't you take a good look at your own character first?\"","Mrs. Chu froze completely.","Ji Fei and Gao Hao exchanged glances, giving each other a thumbs up.","Qin Xian, stuck in the middle: ...He had helped too, you know.","Mr. Chu: \"You've all gone mad! What does this have to do with any of you?! Chu Xinyue has already broken off the engagement with your Qin family!\"","Qin Zhao said coldly: \"The broken engagement is because I'm not worthy, I deserve it. But listen well! I, young master Qin, will see Chu Xinyue's matters through to the end!\"","Qin Zhao looked down at the couple, saying fiercely: \"There's something you don't know yet. Your precious daughter was infected by Wu Tian. She was slashed today because she tried to harm Xinyue with a syringe. She deliberately appeared there with malicious intent, and then suffered the consequences. Doesn't she love pretending to be Chu Xinyue? She got what she deserved!\"","Upon hearing this, the Chu couple was stunned.","What disease? How was it transmitted?","\"No! Impossible...\" Mrs. Chu screamed.","Suddenly, they remembered that earlier, the doctors and nurses seemed to have strange attitudes, as if they were hiding something. And the police also said they had important questions for Chu Xueqi, unrelated to the slashing incident.","If what Qin Zhao said was true, then Chu Xueqi was intentionally spreading a disease, which was a crime.","\"If you still think Chu Xinyue should save Chu Xueqi after knowing this, then you're worse than animals.\"","The Chu couple's faces flushed red, their expressions constantly changing, clearly shaken by this revelation.","Qin Zhao didn't care about their reactions. He came to make his stance clear and issue a warning.","\"Remember my words. From now on, stay far away with your precious daughter. Never appear in my and Chu Xinyue's world again. Don't see her, don't contact her. If I find out you've bothered Chu Xinyue even once, I will use all my connections and resources to make your family of three eternal laughingstocks in society! I'll let you know what it truly means to be detested by everyone!\"","Even without relying on the Qin family's power, he could achieve this with his own abilities. After all, this was a threat from the top celebrity Qin Zhao. Even Gao Hao couldn't help but straighten his back.","The Chu couple trembled, feeling both resentful and fearful of the threat.","\"We won't make her do the transplant, but do you have to make us cut off all family ties?\"","\"Stop talking about family ties with that shameless face. Did you ever give her any? She doesn't want anything to do with you now. Have some self-awareness and face the facts. You still think you can act like parents?\"","Qin Zhao's polite upbringing had completely crumbled in front of this couple.","\"You... you...\" Mr. Chu was so angry he couldn't even form a complete sentence.","Mrs. Chu was reduced to tears by the scolding. She turned to Qin Xian and said, \"Is this how the Qin family raises their children? Openly threatening and intimidating elders who are old family friends! Our families have been friends for four generations!\"","Qin Xian replied expressionlessly, \"I'd like to ask the same thing. Is it your family's upbringing to let your daughter with an infectious disease knock on my brother's door in the middle of the night? What was she trying to do?\"","His tone was flat, but his words pierced the couple like icy arrows.","\"How could this...\" The Chu couple suddenly realized something, their faces changing drastically. \"It must be a misunderstanding...\"","Qin Xian stood up and said, \"What you just heard was my brother's warning. Now, this is the Qin family's warning. If you go against my brother's wishes again, I will concentrate the power of the Qin Corporation to suppress all of the Chu Family's businesses until the Chu Family expels you three from the family. So... Uncle Chu, Aunt Chu, for the sake of our families' long-standing friendship, behave yourselves. We don't want things to get too ugly. I will inform the Chu Family's second uncle of our position later.\"","The Chu couple looked as if their souls had been sucked out in an instant. They looked at Qin Xian, then at Qin Zhao, with ashen faces. Under such absolute intimidation, they finally couldn't utter a single word.","Soon after, Chu Xueqi woke up from anesthesia. Unaccustomed to suffering, she began to wail, especially when she felt the deep, bone-deep scar that almost spanned half of her face.","Her love was ruined, her career was ruined, her life was ruined.","Amidst her screams, she saw her parents, but they didn't come to comfort her as they usually would.","Chu Xueqi belatedly sensed something was wrong and looked at her parents in bewilderment.","\"You contracted an infectious disease?\"","\"You still wanted to infect your sister and Qin Zhao?\"","\"Why, daughter, why have you become like this?!\"","\"Do you know what you've done?!\"","\"Ahhhh, it's all your fault! You shouldn't have given birth to Chu Xinyue after having me! I wanted to infect them! If Chu Xinyue had broken off the engagement earlier instead of holding onto Qin Zhao, I would have been with him openly long ago. If Qin Zhao wasn't so stubborn and refused to touch me, I wouldn't have gone to Wu Tian. It's all their fault! If I can't live well, I want them to die with me!\"","\"Slap!\" Mr. Chu's hand came down hard, reopening the wound on Chu Xueqi's face, making it bleed again.","\"Ah!\" Chu Xueqi looked at her father in disbelief. \"You hit me? You've never hit me before!\"","\"Husband, don't...\" Mrs. Chu wanted to stop him, but she didn't know who she should be stopping!","Mr. Chu also stared at his own palm in a daze, remembering how many times this hand had struck Chu Xinyue. He laughed weakly, a sound more painful than crying.","Soon after, they received a call from the current head of the Chu Family. His angry voice carried a warning, telling them to act as if Chu Xinyue didn't exist and not to shamelessly approach her again. Otherwise, they would be kicked out of the Chu Family.","After hanging up the phone, the Chu couple didn't speak for a long time. They just sat there with vacant eyes, accompanying their daughter. It was just like the many years they had spent abroad caring for their child, but their state of mind had been completely overturned.","From that point on, the Chu family of three disappeared completely from Chu Xinyue's world.","Not long after, when Chu Xinyue turned on her phone, she immediately contacted Qin Zhao, wanting to check on his injuries.","Qin Zhao, who was recuperating at home, immediately sprang up.","He was no longer on the blacklist, he had been unblocked!","Hurrah!","Upon confirming that Chu Xinyue would be coming to the Qin house to visit him, Qin Zhao ran downstairs, creating such a commotion that he startled Qin's Mother, Qin Yan, and Ji Fei, who were watching a TV drama together.","After inquiring, everyone became excited - there was gossip to be had!","Qin Zhao went out to meet Chu Xinyue personally.","The three waited at home, but Qin Zhao returned quickly.","And he came back furiously dragging someone with him.","Upon closer look, it was Qin Rong, who was supposed to return home today.","What happened? Why did one look so angry and the other so aggrieved?","Ji Fei couldn't help but seek out the gossip in advance.","[Oh, it turns out Qin Rong secretly got a boyfriend without telling the family.]","Qin's Mother and Qin Yan: ????","[When Qin Zhao arrived at the pickup point, he saw Qin Rong standing with a guy with dyed blonde hair. In full view of the public, the blonde guy was smoking and blowing smoke into Qin Rong's face. One of his hands was around Qin Rong's waist, while the other was sliding up her thigh under her skirt. Upon seeing this scene, Qin Zhao immediately exploded with anger.]","Qin's Mother, Qin Yan: Hold on! We're exploding with anger too!!!!!","Their well-behaved little sister has been defiled by some wild boar?!!!"]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: What's So Attractive About His Regular Job Anyway","paragraphs":["Although she had inherited memories, this was still Ji Fei's first time seeing Qin Rong in person.","Qin Rong had an adorably sweet appearance, with a delicate nose and cherry lips. Her round doe eyes held the innocence characteristic of a college student, and her fair, baby-soft skin looked irresistibly smooth.","To describe her more accurately, she was like an unworldly princess from an ivory tower, her naive and innocent nature evident at first glance.","\"Big brother, didn't you hurt your hand? Please stop pulling me,\" Qin Rong protested weakly.","Qin Zhao unceremoniously pushed Qin Rong in front of their mother. \"Mom, I just saw little sis getting too cozy with some punk. You better interrogate her properly before she gets deceived by some good-for-nothing!\"","Upon hearing this, Qin Rong immediately tried to explain, feeling both wronged and anxious. However, her voice remained soft and lacked any assertiveness.","\"Big brother! You can't talk about Yue like that. He's not a punk. How can you judge someone by their appearance? Just because he dyed his hair... wears earrings... and has tattoos, does that make him a bad person?\"","As she spoke, Qin Rong's eyes welled up with tears. She looked as devastated as if someone had dismissed her artwork as worthless. Though she didn't dare to talk back too much, she couldn't help but mutter under her breath.","\"Many celebrities in the entertainment industry look like that too. Big brother, except for not having tattoos, you've dyed your hair all sorts of crazy colors before!\"","\"Am I talking about his looks? I'm talking about his behavior, the way he...\"","Qin Rong's face immediately turned crimson. \"Big brother!\"","Qin Zhao couldn't bring himself to finish the sentence. Fuming, he turned away, saying, \"I don't have time to deal with you right now. I'm going to pick up Xinyue!\"","With that, Qin Zhao stormed out.","Qin Rong hung her head dejectedly, but didn't forget her manners. \"Mom, big sis, second sister-in-law, I'm home. Please... please don't listen to big brother's nonsense. Yue is a good person.\"","The Qin family was generally quite open-minded, as evidenced by their children's marital situations.","However, they had already heard the details from Ji Fei, and as Qin Rong's family members, they couldn't help but view the situation with some bias.","With that appearance, coupled with that behavior, he seemed like nothing but trouble!","They couldn't imagine their sweet little Qin Rong standing next to a boy like that.","Qin's Mom anxiously asked, \"When did you start dating behind our backs? Who is he? Is he a student, or is he working already? How long have you known him?\"","Qin Yan also frowned and said, \"Little sis, didn't you agree to text the driver to pick you up before you boarded the plane today? Did this man bring you home instead? Why didn't you let us know you were back? Did he tell you not to inform your family?\"","Having been deceived and hurt by men before, Qin Yan was particularly vigilant and sensitive in this regard.","Qin Rong stood in the living room, feeling as if she was facing a tribunal. Although only Qin's Mom and Qin Yan looked serious, while Ji Fei was merely enjoying the drama, Qin Rong felt immense pressure.","After all, it was her first time dating, and she was actually panicking inside.","\"He's Cheng Miao's older brother. We've known each other for quite a while,\" Qin Rong quickly explained. \"You trust Cheng Miao, right?\"","Hearing this, Qin's Mom and Qin Yan felt slightly relieved, at least he wasn't a complete stranger.","[Cheng Miao? Oh, Qin Rong's college roommate and best friend. They're very close, and she used to come to the Qin house to play often.]","Qin Rong was about to nod, surprised that even her usually aloof second sister-in-law knew who Cheng Miao was. It seemed that her second sister-in-law did pay attention to her after all. She felt a bit happy, thinking her sister-in-law had changed.","However, when Qin Rong turned to look at Ji Fei, she found that Ji Fei wasn't looking at her at all, as if she hadn't just spoken.","Qin's Mom anxiously continued, \"So when did you two start dating? Why didn't you tell anyone in the family? You know we won't interfere with your love life, but we need to know about it...\"","Qin Rong quickly answered honestly, \"I didn't mean to hide it from you. We only agreed to date during this recent field trip for inspiration.\"","As she spoke, Qin Rong began to blush. \"He had been pursuing me before, but I was hesitant. During this trip, I realized he's really a great person. He not only took good care of our entire team but also rushed to the forefront to solve problems when we encountered difficulties. He's so brave and responsible.\"","As Qin Rong spoke, her eyes sparkled with admiration, a gentle and sweet look spreading across her face. She had clearly fallen into the throes of first love.","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan were still worried, after all, love is blind. Qin Rong's words couldn't be taken at face value.","Qin's Mom asked curiously, \"Is he also an art student at your school?\"","Qin Rong answered honestly, \"No, he's not. He was temporarily hired by our professor to assist with our field trip.\"","Just as Qin Rong finished speaking and the others were about to ask more questions, they were interrupted by an abrupt voice.","[Pfft~ So all those impressive things Qin Rong mentioned were just part of his job?]","Qin Rong immediately looked at Ji Fei in shock. Qin's Mom and Qin Yan also realized what was happening and were about to intervene in this sudden development.","But then they saw Qin Rong anxiously trying to explain, \"But he's really very kind and gentle with me. Even when I'm clumsy and make mistakes, he's always super patient.\"","Uh... she didn't notice the problem?","Since she wasn't looking at Ji Fei while speaking, Qin Rong just thought she had heard Ji Fei's comment and, feeling her boyfriend was being doubted, rushed to explain.","Ji Fei found it a bit strange that Qin Rong suddenly looked at her while speaking, but didn't think much of it. She assumed Qin Rong was probably just showing off her boyfriend and seeking approval.","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan breathed sighs of relief.","Qin's Mom quickly said, \"Alright, your dad and second brother aren't here right now. We'll talk more when they get back in the evening. You've just arrived home, go rest for now.\"","Qin Rong obediently nodded, and Qin Yan hurriedly accompanied her sister upstairs, planning to find an opportunity to explain the situation with Ji Fei.","A little while later, Qin Rong sat dumbfounded on the bed, staring at Qin Yan with wide eyes. \"Big sis? You...\"","Qin Yan sighed, \"You'll understand once you experience it yourself. We just hope you won't be too shocked when it happens, so Ji Fei doesn't notice. For now, only mom, dad, and us siblings can hear it.\"","Qin Rong asked, \"If that's really the case, why not let second sister-in-law know that we can hear too?\"","Qin Yan let out another sigh and said, \"This is such an unbelievable thing, we're worried that if Ji Fei finds out, it might backfire on her. Besides, normal people wouldn't want their inner thoughts to be heard by others, right? Although we've received a lot of help from this and... well, enjoyed some gossip together, your second brother has actually been secretly looking for real masters who might have an effective solution. At the very least, we hope Ji Fei's thoughts won't leak out anymore in the future. Let her enjoy it privately if she wants.\"","Qin Rong didn't quite understand but nodded obediently.","Qin Yan patted Qin Rong's head and then said in her most serious tone, \"Remember, this is Ji Fei's secret. Never mention a word of this to outsiders. If it's not handled properly, Ji Fei could be in danger.\"","It was rare for her big sister to speak so seriously, so Qin Rong nodded earnestly, though she still had doubts about the whole situation.","Afterward, Qin Yan, still concerned, inquired about the progress of the relationship. Learning that they hadn't crossed any lines came as a relief.","Soon, Qin Rong's phone rang, and her expression made it clear it was her boyfriend calling.","Qin Rong looked at Qin Yan expectantly. Just as Qin Yan was about to leave to give her some privacy, they suddenly heard wailing from downstairs.","That was... Qin Zhao's voice?"]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Going abroad isn't like attending a funeral. Are plane tickets really that expensive","paragraphs":["As soon as Qin Rong and Qin Yan went upstairs, Qin Zhao excitedly brought Chu Xinyue inside.","After a brief exchange of greetings, following Qin Zhao's frantic eye signals, Qin's Mom pulled Ji Fei away to give the couple some space.","Once the third wheels left, Qin Zhao hurriedly placed all the fruits and snacks on the table in front of Chu Xinyue.","This behavior made Chu Xinyue feel a sense of déjà vu, as if the person sitting next to her was the young Qin Zhao who always wanted to give her the best of everything.","\"Don't trouble yourself, your injury...\"","Qin Zhao immediately switched to one-handed operation, giving Chu Xinyue a silly smile, \"I'm fine, didn't I just say? My wounds heal very quickly.\"","Chu Xinyue nodded reassuringly, then spoke up: \"Actually, there's another thing I wanted to talk to you about today.\"","\"Go ahead,\" Qin Zhao assumed a posture of attentive listening, as if all his patience at the moment could be given to Chu Xinyue.","Chu Xinyue furrowed her brow, \"I hope our group's plan to go abroad and collaborate with other research institutes won't be changed.\"","Qin Zhao's eyes flickered slightly.","Chu Xinyue said with a determined expression: \"Our research would be more convenient abroad. Because your investment proposal has made the professor hesitant, since we've cleared things up, I hope you could...\"","Qin Zhao grew anxious and quickly said: \"I never intended to use the investment as leverage to keep you by my side. How could I possibly hinder your new life path?\"","At this point, Qin Zhao lowered his eyes, his mood visibly dampened as he said: \"I admit I have selfish motives, but if it's possible to stay and research domestically without interfering with your work, even if it means additional investment, I'd like to do that.\"","Chu Xinyue's eyes wavered for a moment, but she remained firm: \"At the finer points of research, money can't solve everything. Otherwise, people wouldn't be willing to leave their homes for five years. We also can't let Qin Corporation make a losing deal. I hope you'll withdraw the additional conditions. We want to go abroad.\"","Looking at Chu Xinyue's cool expression, Qin Zhao's lips trembled slightly, \"Alright, I understand. I'll talk to my brother about it.\"","As if having completed a task, Chu Xinyue didn't want to stay a second longer, \"Thank you. I'll go back now to inform everyone to prepare for going abroad. We can't delay the research progress any further.\"","With that, she stood up.","Qin Zhao immediately stood up in panic.","\"You're injured, no need to see me out,\" Chu Xinyue smiled at Qin Zhao and said: \"I hope everything goes well for you in the future.\"","Qin Zhao suddenly spoke up: \"Do I have no chance at all? Not even a little?\"","Chu Xinyue looked at Qin Zhao and saw his eyes had reddened. She seemed at a loss on how to deal with Qin Zhao in this state, but smart people learn from their mistakes, and her wounds hadn't yet healed. How could she possibly turn back?","\"Right now, I just want to live my own life well and focus on my research. If possible... I might not even come back after five years. I plan to settle abroad long-term for study and research, so it'll be hard to meet again.\"","Because she truly didn't blame Qin Zhao, she didn't want him to wait foolishly. She wouldn't be coming back.","After saying this, Chu Xinyue turned and left without hesitation.","Qin Zhao's feet felt like they were filled with lead, unable to move a step, tears welling up in his eyes.","[Oh no, is he going to cry again? Better hurry and stop Qin's Mom, it would be so disheartening if they're caught eavesdropping while trying to comfort him.]","Qin Zhao's originally muddled brain, upon hearing this voice, suddenly collapsed onto the sofa with a loud wail, crying uncontrollably.","Since he had been seen anyway, there was no point in holding back. He might as well have a good cry.","[Come on, it's not like this is the first time Chu Xinyue has rejected him. Is it really worth being so devastated?]","Qin Zhao: Waaah!!!","You don't understand, this is a complete rejection. She's going abroad and never coming back.","[I don't get his logic. Although I think it's better for them to separate and start new lives, but... why is he acting like it's a permanent farewell?]","Qin Zhao: Losing the one you love is as painful as being separated by life and death!","[Going abroad isn't the same as going to a funeral. Are plane tickets that expensive? I thought the Qin family had a private jet?]","Qin Zhao: *sobbing* ... *hiccup*?","[They're still on the same planet... isn't this level of grief a bit ridiculous?]","Qin Zhao: !!!!","[Is he just stupid, or is he being stubborn? Can't he see it himself?]","At this moment, Qin Yan and Qin Rong, concerned about the situation, came to the corridor. Just as they were about to inquire, they saw Qin Zhao suddenly stand up and rush out, his tears flying in the air.","Soon, everyone in the mansion heard Qin Zhao's shout from outside.","\"Chu Xinyue, remember this: if one day you're hurt, if you're tired, if you want someone by your side, remember that I exist. Move forward and live your new life well.\"","Not long after, Qin Zhao returned, his tears already wiped away. He picked up his phone and made a call, \"Second Brother, remove that additional condition and let them go abroad. Yes, I'm fine, don't worry about me. If their project investment fails, I'll bear all the costs.\"","He made another call, \"Brother Gao... I think we can move my studio overseas. Do you want to come with me to explore the foreign entertainment market?\"","He understood that if he kept pestering Chu Xinyue, it would only keep reminding her of the painful past. He didn't want to be the source of her unhappiness.","He didn't know if he would ever have a chance to win back this precious girl in this lifetime, perhaps never. But he wanted to quietly stay by her side, hoping that when she needed someone, he could be the first to be there.","This was all he could do now, and all he wanted to do.","The people listening to Qin Zhao's phone calls were all stunned.","The most shocked was Ji Fei.","[Wait, isn't that my current workplace? I haven't even started working or received any pay yet, am I about to be laid off?]","Qin Zhao, who was excitedly planning his future business empire, suddenly remembered upon hearing this that the studio still had a tagalong. Brother Gao on the phone also mentioned Ji Fei.","Qin Zhao looked at the people in the distance, \"Uh... don't worry, my work transfer won't happen that quickly. We'll arrange everything for you before leaving... Brother Gao also said he'd get you more work before we go, to build up your reputation. Once that's done, everything will be easier.\"","Ji Fei: ...","[Being laid off is fine, actually. I didn't really want to work that badly.]","The others who overheard this inner thought couldn't help but chuckle.","Standing above, Qin Rong finally accidentally heard Ji Fei's inner voice. She didn't have the experience to distinguish the quality difference between spoken words and inner thoughts, and from her angle, she couldn't be sure if Ji Fei had moved her lips, especially since her brother's response wasn't out of place.","After returning to her room, Qin Rong's phone went crazy, with numerous calls coming in.","Qin Rong quickly answered.","\"Why didn't you answer my calls?\" The person on the other end started with an accusation. Then, seemingly realizing the inappropriate tone, they softened their voice and said, \"I worry when I can't reach you. Please don't do this again.\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: I suggest you break up","paragraphs":["Qin Rong was stunned for a moment. Cheng Yue had never been so harsh with her before, but knowing he was concerned, she quickly said, \"I'm sorry, Brother Cheng Yue. I was caught up with something and couldn't answer just now.\"","\"Could it be that your Third Brother is giving you a hard time because of our relationship?\" came the concerned voice.","\"Don't worry, Brother Cheng Yue. I'm fine. My Third Brother just has a quick temper. He's upset because I didn't inform the family about my relationship beforehand. It'll be fine once I officially explain it to them.\"","A scornful voice came through the phone, \"They're still controlling you at this age? Rong Rong, you need to remember that you're an adult, an independent and free soul. You can make your own decisions about anything. You don't need to inform others about everything.\"","\"I'm the youngest in the family, so everyone just cares about me,\" Qin Rong said with an innocent laugh. \"Oh, by the way, my Eldest Sister just told me...\"","Suddenly, she paused. She instinctively wanted to share the interesting news with her loved one, but remembering her Eldest Sister's warning, she immediately stopped.","\"What is it?\"","\"Uh... nothing.\"","A slightly complaining voice came from the other end, \"Are you hiding something from me? Couples shouldn't have secrets. After all, we're the ones who will spend our lives together, we're the most important people to each other. Look at me, I have no secrets from you. I tell you everything you want to know. You should be completely open with me too. You're making me sad like this. It seems I love you more deeply.\"","Qin Rong blushed and hurriedly explained, \"It's not like that.\"","Qin Rong hesitated for a moment, her innate upbringing preventing her from speaking out.","Of course, she could share her own secrets with Brother Cheng Yue without reservation, but... that was her second sister-in-law's secret.","Qin Rong's hesitation made the other side uneasy. He probed, \"I get it. Is it that your family looks down on me? They think I'm not good enough for you?\"","Qin Rong was shocked, \"How could you think that? You're so excellent!\"","\"Huh, you're the young miss of Qin Corporation. In your family's eyes, I'm just a lower-class person,\" he said sarcastically.","Qin Rong panicked instantly, as if afraid her boyfriend would misunderstand her family and get hurt. She quickly said, \"Our family doesn't care about those external things. As long as I like you, it's fine.\"","\"Is that so? Well, it doesn't matter if they don't approve. We love each other, and I've decided on you. No one can separate us,\" he said domineeringly.","Qin Rong felt very shy hearing this and softly murmured agreement a couple of times.","In the evening, the whole family gathered for dinner for the first time.","Qin Rong happily acknowledged her grand-nephew Qin Xi, and gave many gifts and snacks to the younger generation, feeling very happy that she was finally not the youngest in the family anymore.","It wasn't until Qin Yan sent the children upstairs to rest that everyone gathered on the sofa to talk.","The main topic of conversation was naturally Qin Rong's relationship.","Qin's Father and Qin Xian had heard information from various sources after returning home and had a general understanding of the situation.","Obviously, Cheng Yue had made a very bad first impression on Qin Zhao, so he had directly reported it.","The reason was: in public, those behaviors were frivolous and disrespectful to women. After all, men understand men's thoughts.","But it wasn't good to say this was problematic, as young people in love nowadays might display intimate gestures in public, which could be explained as being unable to control their emotions.","So they didn't mention this point for now.","Qin's Father thought for a moment and asked curiously, \"You said he was temporarily employed by your professor. How does he have so much free time to be with you? Doesn't he have a formal job?\"","Qin Rong said, \"He's planning to start a business and open an art gallery. He's currently self-studying related knowledge, waiting for Miao Miao and me to graduate from university. He'll specifically help us hold exhibitions and sell our paintings.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone except Ji Fei was taken aback.","Qin's Mom asked puzzled, \"Didn't you always say before that art is priceless, and that your paintings would only be exhibited for free, not sold?\"","Qin Rong was stunned for a moment, \"Haha, that was just nonsense I said when I was young and didn't know better. The more money my paintings sell for, the better they are, right? And Brother Cheng Yue said the money from sales can be used for charity, which is more meaningful.\"","The whole family fell silent. It wasn't that what he said was wrong - the world is like that - but it felt strange somehow.","While the Qin family members were pondering, Ji Fei thought of something else.","[So he's currently unemployed? Can he support himself?]","As soon as these words were spoken, Qin Rong immediately looked at Ji Fei, her eyes full of disbelief.","So it was true!","The Qin family members reacted and immediately coughed, reminding Qin Rong.","However, Ji Fei's words also reminded them.","\"So what does he live on now?\" Qin Zhao immediately questioned, \"Don't tell me he's living off his parents, or off you!\"","Qin Rong became agitated, her body tense as she sat on the sofa. She exclaimed, \"Third Brother, how can you say such unpleasant things? Besides, we've just started dating. How could I possibly ask him how he lives and earns money? That would be too strange. But I do know he's renting a place outside, and occasionally takes on short-term work at our academy. Mainly, he needs to spend time learning about and getting in touch with this industry.\"","\"Was his original major unrelated to this field?\" Qin's Father asked.","Qin Rong suddenly became a bit timid and shook her head, \"He... never went to university. He went to a vocational technical school...\"","[Not only did he not go to university, he didn't even go to high school. He's 22 now, so by this calculation, he's been out of school and in society for many years.]","Ji Fei didn't have a contemptuous attitude, she was just stating the facts that Qin Rong hadn't elaborated on.","However, Ji Fei's addition still made the Qin family members, except for Qin Xian, change their expressions.","Although the Qin family never interfered with their children's marriage and relationships, this difference was already worlds apart. Their little princess was still so innocent, it was really...","It could be said that from this moment on, everyone in the Qin family became worried.","Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, Qin Rong bit her lip and looked around with a worried expression, \"Education doesn't represent one's character. Besides, he didn't continue studying not because he was a bad student, but because his family's financial situation was limited. They had to support Miao Miao to study art, so he couldn't persist in studying! You won't look down on him and think he's a lower-class person, and then oppose our relationship, will you?\"","The Qin family members naturally couldn't speak up. Their usual principles of behavior were constantly clashing with their concerns for their youngest daughter.","Suddenly, Qin Xian spoke up, \"Why would you think that?\"","Qin Rong was taken aback, seeming not to understand why Qin Xian would ask such a question. The others hadn't reacted either.","Qin Xian's expression remained impassive, \"The Rong Rong from before wouldn't have thought our family had such a mindset. Who made you think this way?\"","Although this sentence wasn't heavy, it was like a stone dropping into water, creating ripples that caused everyone's expressions to subtly change.","\"No... no one, isn't this just common logic?\" Qin Rong panicked when she saw Qin Xian's stern face.","[Sigh, silly girl, with you looking so guilty, I don't need to check to know that it must have been your boyfriend who mentioned this to you.]","Qin Rong panicked even more upon hearing this, \"Well...\"","[It seems the little sister doesn't know how to lie, look how flustered she is.]","Qin Rong: Wuwuwu... stop talking, I'm getting more panicked.","But before the little girl could calm down, Qin Xian spoke directly, \"You two are not suitable. I suggest you break up.\""]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: I Am Not Compromising, Am I","paragraphs":["Qin Rong's eyes immediately reddened, and her nose followed suit. Apparently prone to easy tears, she couldn't even utter a word of rebuttal before her eyes started to well up, her lips quivering with grievance.","[Oh no, I really can't stand to see little sisters cry. Qin Xian was too harsh.]","Qin Xian: ... He had only calmly made a suggestion.","[I've seen two members of the Qin family cry today.]","Qin's Father and Qin Xian: ? Who else?","Qin Zhao: *cough cough cough*","[Do all the people in their family cry so easily? And all for matters of the heart.]","Qin Rong: About to cry.","Qin Zhao and Qin Yan: Guiltily looking skyward.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom: No, absolutely not, we've never... probably... maybe.","Qin's Father suddenly poked Qin's Mom with a hint of grievance, using his eyes to suggest: You made me cry when you bullied me when we were young.","Qin's Mom glared back: You made me cry first.","As the only man in the Qin family who had never cried over love, Qin Xian sat with his head held high at this moment.","[Maybe Qin Xian has cried too. Wasn't he dumped before? Haha! Oh, I missed it. I really want to see what this ice prince looks like when he cries. It must be hilarious. When will he cry again? I'll definitely take a picture!]","Ji Fei became more and more amused as she thought about it.","Beside her, Qin Xian's face grew darker. Using the topic of Qin Rong, he said, \"If you disagree, you can express your opinion. Maintain emotional stability, don't cry. I haven't cried since I was six years old. You should learn from me. Don't learn from your third brother, who cries over love at the drop of a hat.\"","Qin Zhao: Hey hey hey, what did I do? Why am I being dragged into this?","Qin Rong: Wants to cry! But her emotions are in such a jumble from her second sister-in-law's various random thoughts and her second brother's strange reprimands that she can't shed a single tear.","Ji Fei's mouth twitched as she listened: [Has he gone mad? Why should a soft and sweet girl learn from a steel-hearted man like him?]","Qin Rong: *whimper* That's right, second sister-in-law is correct.","Qin Xian: No, I just wanted to emphasize that I've never cried over other women. Listen to the main point! Also, if you want to see me cry, it's never going to happen in this lifetime.","Everyone's mood lightened a bit after this interruption.","Qin Rong sniffled, managing not to burst into tears, but said with grievance, \"If the family doesn't look down on him, what's inappropriate about it?\"","Qin Xian answered seriously, \"Your values don't align. You believe that human relationships are about getting along, without distinctions of high or low status. But he emphasized this point as soon as you started dating. Didn't he know about the differences between you before pursuing you?\"","\"Couldn't it be that he's insecure and sensitive because he likes me too much?\"","\"He can be concerned, but if he truly cherished you, he wouldn't bring it up in front of you. His behavior will only result in one thing: putting us in opposition before he's even met your family. It's like earlier when you started defending him against your family before we had even said anything.\" Qin Xian always spoke convincingly, making people listen attentively.","Perhaps it was because both his older sister and third brother had such troubled love lives.","As the only person in this family who wouldn't be swayed by emotions, he finally abandoned his principle of non-interference.","Qin Rong was stunned. She seemed to understand something, but couldn't help wanting to refute. After pondering for a while, she said:","\"Second brother, Cheng Yue isn't as excellent and smart as you. How can you judge him by your standards?\"","Qin Xian was momentarily stumped by his little bunny sister's words.","The others heard this and thought it made sense.","Actually, even if someone's background isn't great, with proper nurturing and as long as they're hardworking and eager to improve, they shouldn't be dismissed. Values can be aligned over time.","[I didn't expect her to be such a sharp-toothed little bunny. She's quite articulate. It's rare to see Qin Xian at a loss for words, haha.]","Qin Rong felt a bit proud, having been praised.","Qin Xian, however, looked helplessly at Ji Fei, wondering how she could undermine her own side.","Ji Fei blinked innocently. [Qin Xian seems to be at a loss with Qin Rong and is asking me for help? That's really a desperate measure. What can I say? Should I mention the gossip I just heard, that the guy is subconsciously trying to put the Qin family in an opposing position?]","The Qin family: !!!!","Qin Rong suddenly panicked. No, how could Cheng Yue do that?","Ji Fei naturally wouldn't speak carelessly, but she couldn't help her inner thoughts.","[I don't know if that guy did it intentionally or not. Qin Rong just said she wanted to inform her family about her relationship, and this Cheng Yue told her that the Qin family treats her like a child, that normal families aren't like that, otherwise she wouldn't have never smoked, dyed her hair, gotten into fights, hung out in internet cafes, or gone to bars...]","Qin Rong was stunned for a moment, as if just realizing that these words... could also be seen as putting her family in opposition?","But that was just Cheng Yue protecting her, and what he said wasn't wrong. She really hadn't experienced those things. Even Miao Miao said that her youth was incomplete without them.","[Hmm... is it possible that there are also many things that normal 20-year-old college girls haven't experienced?]","Qin Rong's mind jolted. Is... is that so?","[And why does Qin Rong have to experience the same things as him to be considered normal? Qin Rong went to high school, does that mean his family is abnormal for not sending him to high school?]","Qin Rong froze, her mind starting to tangle. For a moment, she was speechless.","[Could it really be that he's insecure and sensitive, trying to negate others to boost his own confidence?]","Ji Fei mumbled to herself for a while, and Qin Rong was already in a daze.","Ji Fei noticed that everyone had gone quiet, as if waiting for her to speak.","Reluctantly, she tried to smooth things over, \"Ahem, since none of us know Qin Rong's boyfriend, we shouldn't say too much. Why don't we find an opportunity for the family to meet him?\"","Qin Rong, however, stood up wavering, \"I... I'm tired. I'm going back to rest.\"","[Huh? Wasn't she bravely refuting Qin Xian just now? Why did she suddenly deflate?]","Qin Rong left in a daze.","The others naturally had to disperse as well, but before Ji Fei could get up, Qin's Father patted her shoulder with a gratified look.","Ji Fei: ?","Then came Qin's Mom, Qin Yan, and even Qin Zhao came to pat her.","Ji Fei silently looked at her shoulder, making sure there was nothing dirty on it, then looked up at Qin Xian standing nearby.","As a result, Qin Xian also patted Ji Fei's shoulder. \"Well said.\"","Ji Fei: ?","What did I say?","Wasn't I just trying to smooth things over?","Ji Fei returned with a head full of question marks. Passing by Qin Rong's room, she heard voices, apparently she was on the phone.","First love, huh.","It's not so easy to cut off.","Qin Zhao and Qin's Father went to Qin Xian's study together.","Actually, when Qin Rong first chose to live on campus for university, Qin Xian had done a simple investigation on her roommate Cheng Miao. He confirmed that her family was a normal family of four without any criminal records, which was enough. He wouldn't investigate others' privacy, after all, whether a person is good or bad, Qin Rong needed to learn to discern for herself.","But as a potential partner, of course, a thorough examination was necessary.","The Qin family men discussed and came up with a plan.","Early the next morning, Qin Zhao stopped Qin Rong, who was trying to avoid them at breakfast. \"Where are you running off to?\"","\"No... nowhere, I just wanted to eat in my room.\" Qin Rong wasn't in a daze like last night, but rather seemed to want to avoid everyone.","Qin Xian's eyes darkened slightly.","Qin's Father said, \"Ahem, if you don't want to break up, we won't force you. Since he doesn't have a job at the moment, let him come to our company. Let your second brother get to know your boyfriend up close.\"","Qin Rong looked at Qin Xian in disbelief, \"Re... really?\"","Qin Xian nodded, \"Your second sister-in-law made a good point. We should get to know him before we have the right to give you advice.\"","Qin Rong's face immediately lit up with joy, \"Okay, I'll tell him right away. If he's willing, when should he come?\"","Seeing their little sister so enthusiastic about another man, the three Qin men all felt a bit uncomfortable.","\"Today is fine. I'll inform the HR department.\" Qin Xian said and left.","Qin Rong happily went back to make a phone call.","When Ji Fei came out for brunch and heard about this, she even received a thank you from Qin Rong.","Ji Fei had really just mentioned it casually, but Qin Xian and the others' method was quite good.","However, by noon, the sound of hysterical crying came from Qin Rong's art studio.","When Qin's Mom and Ji Fei rushed over, Qin Rong threw herself into her mother's arms, crying as if the sky was falling.","\"Mom, Cheng Yue broke up with me! It's because my second brother insulted him. He said he's not good enough for me. Waaah...\" she sobbed uncontrollably."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Die Laughing What Identity Is He the Son-in-law of the Current Dynasty","paragraphs":["Qin Rong cried so hard that it broke Qin's Mom's heart. She shot a glare towards the door.","At that moment, Qin's Father, who had heard the commotion, was about to step in.","Seeing his little darling crying, his hands immediately began to tremble. \"What's going on? Your second brother definitely wouldn't insult anyone. Is there some misunderstanding?\"","Qin Rong sobbed, hiccuping as she spoke, \"Second brother asked Cheng Yue to be the company's driver.\"","Qin's Father didn't react immediately, \"So what?\"","Qin's Mom caught on quicker, \"Is it that Cheng Yue looks down on this job?\"","Qin Rong choked out, \"Dad, you said to let him go to the company. Cheng Yue prepared so seriously, but when he got there, they just asked him to be a driver. You don't know how disappointed and angry Cheng Yue was. He questioned whether I looked down on him, if I was trying to play him, using this method to insult him. He said my goal was to break up with him, and that I had succeeded. He told me not to look for him anymore, and then... then he blocked all my contact information.\"","\"I tried to contact Miao Miao, but even she's angry with me now. She said her brother has never been this angry before, that we're too good for him, and to act like we never dated.\" Qin Rong cried, \"Why? Why did you lie to me? I thought you really wanted to get to know him. Were you deliberately trying to ruin my relationship? Is what Cheng Yue said true? You just don't trust me and want to control my life?\"","Perhaps because it was her first breakup, she was so upset that her words became incoherent, only wanting to vent her emotions.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom were stunned. Qin Rong had always been an obedient and sensible child who never gave them trouble. This was the first time they had seen her explode like this, leaving the old father and mother at a loss, only able to try and comfort her.","They swore to heaven that they didn't have such intentions, nor did her other brothers and sisters. It must be a misunderstanding.","Seeing Qin Rong cry to the point of nearly passing out, Ji Fei felt quite awkward. After all, this girl had thanked her just this morning, sweetly sharing desserts with her, full of hope for the future. How had she suddenly been dumped?","This breakup was like a sudden storm, coming completely unexpectedly.","If Ji Fei hadn't seen the breakup through the Gossip System, she would have thought she was dreaming.","Cheng Yue was indeed very angry, almost cursing at Qin Rong, as if he had truly been humiliated.","Ji Fei carefully examined the situation from Qin Xian's perspective, and the more she looked, the more speechless she became.","【To be honest, I overlooked it too. I almost got led astray by Cheng Yue's anger. Is this guy joking?】","These words nearly made the crying Qin Rong jump up. Being dumped was already painful enough, and now someone was badmouthing Cheng Yue right in front of her. Even a docile rabbit would bite back in this situation.","Fortunately, Qin's Father and Qin's Mom were experienced and quickly held Qin Rong back. They knew Ji Fei must have discovered something. Perhaps they wouldn't need to wait for Qin Xian's explanation to know the truth.","【Cheng Yue did go to the interview excitedly, and Qin Xian had indeed instructed the HR department. But the HR department never imagined that the person the CEO recommended was someone without any qualifications.】","【Lack of education is one thing, but he's been in society for many years and doesn't even have one decent work experience? Does this mean he's been wasting his time all these years?】","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom were stunned, looking at Qin Rong in disbelief.","No wonder Qin's Father felt something was off at first. He had initially made a subconscious judgment about Cheng Yue's potential, so when he heard about the driver position, he didn't find it inappropriate at first.","\"Rong Rong, be honest with Dad, does he really have no work experience? Otherwise, the HR department wouldn't have only offered him a driver position.\"","Qin's Mom's head was also buzzing, \"Is that true, Rong Rong?\"","They had initially thought he was just temporarily unemployed because he was preparing to start a business, but they never imagined he hadn't had a proper job since graduating from school.","If this wasn't being a slacker, what was?","【It seems the parents have also noticed something's not right. I don't need to remind them!】","Qin Rong was stunned for a moment, then hurriedly explained, \"That's because his talent hasn't been recognized. Cheng Yue is actually very capable, but he couldn't find a good job because of his education. He was discriminated against, couldn't meet the right opportunity, and had bad luck, so...\"","Facing her parents' increasingly skeptical gazes, Qin Rong found herself losing confidence as she spoke.","【Unrecognized talent? That's laughable. Does he even have any talent? He doesn't have a single skill. If it weren't for his driver's license, even if the HR department racked their brains and relaxed all requirements, they could only have arranged a cleaning job for him. He doesn't even have the physique required for a security guard position.】","Hearing her beloved being so harshly criticized, Qin Rong suddenly felt both angry and sad. She looked at Ji Fei, \"Second sister-in-law...\"","Ji Fei thought Qin Rong was calling her for help.","【You want me to speak up for him? I really can't do that in good conscience, sister. The driver position was only offered because of the CEO's instructions and special accommodation. That's Qin Corporation we're talking about. A driver there earns tens of thousands a month with top-notch benefits. People are fighting to get in, and he has the audacity to feel insulted?】","【What's even more ridiculous is that he pulled rank with Qin Xian's name in the HR department, questioning if they knew who he was. Laughable! Who does he think he is? The Emperor's son-in-law?】","【He even had the gall to say that Qin Xian had promised him a manager position. Good heavens, is he daydreaming? What makes him think he deserves that? His thick skin? His shamelessness? Even if he were the Emperor's son-in-law, he'd have to step aside if he had no ability. If Qin Corporation practiced nepotism and let anyone with connections run wild, it would have gone bankrupt long ago. How could it have developed to its current state?】","【Suddenly, I feel so sorry for Qin Xian. In order to help his sister evaluate her boyfriend, this incident will probably damage Qin Xian's reputation in Qin Corporation. This attempt at pulling strings... tsk tsk tsk, what a shame.】","Ji Fei delivered this passionate output while maintaining a neutral expression. She was about to give a diplomatic response to this newly love-struck girl when Qin Rong suddenly burst into tears even more violently.","\"He... he just wanted to prove himself to you all, to show that he's worthy of me. Please don't think of him like that. He's not... he's not like that... wuwuwuwu\"","This time, neither Qin's Father nor Qin's Mom comforted her. Instead, they stood to the side with grim expressions.","\"Rong Rong, this man is no good,\" Qin's Father said directly. \"He's arrogant but incompetent, full of himself, unable to recognize his own limitations. His character is severely lacking.\"","Qin's Mom couldn't help but add, \"Our family had good intentions, but it was misinterpreted like this. Your second brother is right, their values are different. They're not compatible.\"","Hearing her parents speak this way, Qin Rong became even more anxious. She cried so hard that she had difficulty breathing, her face turning red from the effort.","\"Nobody understands the real Cheng Yue. He's actually a very good person. If you really got to know him, you'd definitely appreciate him. Mom, Dad, Second sister-in-law, can you please help ask second brother to give Cheng Yue a different job? Give him a chance to prove himself.\""]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Not Love-Struck, This Is a Vegetable Excavator","paragraphs":["Although they doted on their daughter, the Qin Family parents had principles when it came to crucial matters.","\"Rong Rong, Qin Corporation's hiring standards won't be lowered beyond acceptable limits just for someone's identity. Your Second Brother has already been quite accommodating regarding that boy. Even when Fei joined Qin Corporation, she only established a small studio under a subsidiary, operating independently. She wasn't given any backdoor access to major entertainment industry projects. Otherwise, with her status as the CEO's wife, would your sister-in-law still just be doing photo shoots and working as an 18th-tier small-time model?\" Qin's Father said sternly.","Ji Fei: ? That should be a compliment, right?","[Yes, that's right. She's completely relying on her looks to make a living, without any professional skills. She definitely can't participate in any serious projects, but even so, she's dedicated during photo shoots and hasn't brought shame to the company.]","\"If you can't handle it, don't take on the job. What's wrong with being a driver? How can someone who knows nothing expect to reach the top in one step? Don't you have to take things step by step in any career?\" Qin's Mom also said seriously.","[If Cheng Yue were the type to take things step by step, he would have work experience by now. Isn't it because he's always dreaming of reaching the top in one go that he's ended up like this?]","Ji Fei chimed in with her criticism. Regarding this matter, Ji Fei also felt this man wasn't suitable, so breaking up was for the best.","Hearing everyone speak this way, Qin Rong seemed unable to find any reason to salvage the current situation. Finally unable to bear it, she ran out in tears, locking herself in her bedroom.","Later, probably after hearing that Cheng Yue hadn't actually started working, Qin Xian contacted Ji Fei to inquire about Qin Rong's situation.","Ji Fei told him the truth.","Qin Xian didn't have much of a reaction, only saying, \"I see.\"","Ji Fei felt that Qin Xian was quite pitiable, having rarely involved himself in his sister's affairs, only to end up in such a mess.","\"Anyway, Mom, Dad, and I all think the problem lies with that man. You just focus on your work and don't worry about it.\"","There seemed to be a pause on the other end of the line. \"I'm not concerned. This outcome was expected.\"","Ji Fei wasn't sure if it was her imagination, but she felt Qin Xian's tone carried a hint of amusement as he said this.","Ji Fei: Could it be that he deliberately arranged this to make the other party give up? Unexpectedly, Qin Xian has such a scheming side.","In the evening, Qin Rong was still locked in her room.","Everyone gradually came home and heard about the day's events.","Qin Zhao let out a contemptuous sneer.","\"Breaking up without listening to explanations clearly shows someone who's stubborn and self-opinionated. Our little sister has been protected too well by us, she's easily swayed. Whatever others say, she takes as truth. If that guy didn't look down on being a driver, little sister wouldn't have seen any problem with it. In my opinion, breaking up is a good thing. We don't need to do anything; given time, she'll naturally come to terms with it. Later, I'll bring over some handsome guys from the entertainment industry to introduce to my sister. Whether she prefers the young and aggressive type or the cute and innocent type, she can take her pick. Surely they'd be better than some small-time hoodlum?\"","Ji Fei suddenly perked up, her radar going off. With sparkling eyes, she rattled off a list of names to Qin Zhao, \"Can we choose from these?\"","[Young and innocent, young and aggressive, oh ho!]","Qin Zhao: ? I'm choosing for my sister, not for her. Why is she so enthusiastic?","Suddenly feeling a cold aura, Qin Zhao glanced over. Good grief, Second Brother's face had turned a bit green.","\"What are you trying to do?\" Qin Zhao asked on behalf of Second Brother.","\"I've been following their dramas recently. They're quite handsome. It'd be nice to see them in person and feast my eyes,\" Ji Fei replied with a carefree smile.","Qin Yan, who had watched some of these dramas together with Ji Fei, nodded in agreement.","Qin Zhao immediately protested, \"With Second Brother's and my looks, do you really need to look at others to please your eyes?\"","\"It's a matter of novelty,\" Ji Fei said with a serious face.","[No matter how handsome you two are, it's useless. It's those unfamiliar, shy young handsome guys who turn red when teased that are interesting. These guys have all shown their upper bodies on TV, their physiques are well-trained. Who knows, there might even be a chance to touch their abs!]","The more she thought about it, the more excited Ji Fei became, her smile growing wider and wider.","Qin Yan: \"Ahem! I'm going upstairs to check on little sister.\"","Qin Zhao: \"Me too! You little brat, not even eating dinner, trying to rebel, huh?\"","Saying this, the two fled at lightning speed.","Ji Fei looked bewildered.","[Wait, we haven't decided which handsome guys to bring to comfort little sister yet!]","She turned around to see Qin Xian staring at her expressionlessly, though his eyes seemed somewhat dangerous.","Ji Fei blinked, not thinking much of it, and followed the other two to check on Qin Rong's situation.","Qin Xian let out a quiet sigh. Just as he was about to leave, he heard Qin's Father and Qin's Mom's footsteps behind him.","Qin's Father stepped forward and patted Qin Xian on the shoulder. \"Ahem, the desire for beauty is universal. Young girls, you know, they love to chase stars... As young people say, Fei just has many 'wall flowers'. However...\" Qin's Father leaned in close to Qin Xian's ear and whispered, \"If Fei continues to be this open-minded and stops caring about you, you'll end up without a wife!\"","Qin's Mom also stepped forward and gave him a sidelong glance. \"Taking a step back, are you really blameless? You can't blame Fei. What kind of husband doesn't let his wife touch him? She can only look for substitutes elsewhere.\"","Qin Xian: What did he say? He didn't say anything!","...And Ji Fei hadn't even tried! How did they know he wouldn't let her touch him?","He couldn't think about it anymore. Qin Xian felt like his head was becoming muddled.","Upstairs, Ji Fei arrived to see Qin Zhao standing at Qin Rong's door, fuming.","\"Yes, I just don't like that little hoodlum. I absolutely oppose you two being together.\"","A muffled voice came from inside the room, but one could sense the person was desperately defending something. \"You... you're just bitter about your own failed romance, so you can't stand to see others in love. I think you're not worthy of Sister Xinyue!\"","\"You!\"","Ji Fei provided an unsympathetic commentary: [Qin Rong vs Qin Zhao, Qin Rong wins.]","Qin Yan held back the enraged Qin Zhao who was about to kick down the door, and sighed, \"Rong Rong, it's big sister.\"","Qin Rong, who was upset inside the room, thought her sister would take her side.","But Qin Yan couldn't hold back either, and said, \"Actually, I didn't really approve of you and that boy either. Girls really shouldn't date down. It's not about being a snob or a gold digger, it's that in a society dominated by male rights, it's very difficult to find a man who can maintain a balanced mentality in a situation where the woman is stronger than the man.\"","Qin Yan seemed to recall someone, her eyes gradually filling with disgust as she said, \"If you two were together, he would inevitably face criticism and grievances in the future. In the end, it's highly likely that in order to repair his male ego, he would end up oppressing and bullying you elsewhere.\"","As soon as Qin Yan finished speaking, she heard Qin Rong crying out, \"Big sister, you can't assume everyone is like that just because you were betrayed!\"","Qin Yan said, \"But based on his behavior today, he's definitely not the type who can maintain a balanced mentality, nor would he be willing to compromise himself for you.\"","\"That's because you all were too harsh on him. You can't use such high standards to judge him. It's me who's with him, not you! Big sister, didn't you also try without hesitation back then? Why can't I do the same?\"","Qin Yan was left speechless.","[Qin Rong vs Qin Yan, Qin Rong wins.]","Qin Yan and Qin Zhao both looked at Ji Fei with indescribable expressions, then made a gesture inviting her to speak.","[I won't do it. First loves are the easiest to get stuck in, obsessing over details. No matter how much you say, it's a waste of breath. Besides, he's the one who proposed breaking up. With such a strong sense of self-esteem, he definitely won't come back. What's the point of comforting her? The outcome is already decided.]","\"...Wuwuwuwu!\" (crying sounds)","Qin Yan and Qin Zhao: Qin Rong vs Ji Fei, Ji Fei wins.","For the next week, Qin Rong stayed at home alone, nursing her broken heart. Although she was still very upset, she wasn't a child with a bad temper and had already reconciled with her family. However, there were no signs of getting back together with Cheng Yue. When school started, she listlessly packed her suitcase and returned to live on campus.","One afternoon a month later, during afternoon tea in the back garden, Qin's Mom suddenly received a phone call.","\"Hello, this is me... Professor Wang, it's been a long time since we've been in touch. What's the matter?\" Qin's Mom was smiling at first, but her expression suddenly changed. \"What! You say Rong Rong has given up on applying for the overseas art exchange program?! How is that possible? We haven't heard anything about this!\"","\"Alright, alright, I understand. I'll ask her about it. Thank you for your concern, Professor.\" Qin's Mom became anxious and immediately started contacting people.","Qin Yan was also anxiously waiting nearby, after all, that plan was the main reason why her sister chose to study at this school in the first place. For this, she had always worked hard to maintain her position in the professional rankings, no matter how difficult it was. How could she possibly give up the opportunity to study abroad at the temple of art?","When the phone connected, it was unexpectedly a male voice. \"What kind of contact name is this? Who are you?\"","\"Isn't... isn't this my daughter Qin Rong's phone?\"","Qin Rong had set her family members' contact names as world-famous paintings, so others couldn't really tell who was who.","As soon as Qin's Mom finished speaking, the other person hung up.","Qin's Mom immediately became anxious, thinking that something might have happened to Qin Rong.","[Oh my god! How long have I not been paying attention? I've missed out on a billion worth of information! What's going on? This is too bold!]","Due to the shock, Ji Fei didn't even notice that the two people beside her had suddenly turned to look at her.","[Qin Rong has actually learned to keep secrets from her family? Three weeks ago, she had already gotten back together with Cheng Yue. The reason she gave up the opportunity to study abroad was because Cheng Yue refused to have a long-distance relationship. He said if she went abroad, they would break up, so Qin Rong decided not to go.]","[Ah, this... This isn't just being love-struck, this is like a wild vegetable excavator.]"]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Mom, Are You Going to Hit Me","paragraphs":["Listening to Ji Fei's inner thoughts, the usually good-tempered Qin's Mother and Qin Yan were both furious.","This time, without even notifying the men in the family, they directly took Ji Fei along to storm the academy.","Just as they got out of the car at the school gate, they received a call back from Qin Rong, which saved them the trouble of looking for her.","Qin's Mother held the phone with trembling hands. After all, who could accept that such an obedient and sensible daughter suddenly changed into a completely different person one day, deceiving those above and below her?","Qin Yan took the phone and put it on speakerphone. Ji Fei immediately leaned in curiously.","\"Mom, you're looking for me?\"","[Surprisingly, Qin Rong's voice was so nonchalant. It seems she has really been deeply influenced.]","Naturally, this version of Qin Rong was even more unacceptable to her mother and sister.","\"Who just answered your phone?\" Qin's Mother questioned directly.","\"It was a male classmate.\"","\"Which male classmate!\"","\"...Mom, what are you doing?\" Qin Rong's tone carried a hint of dissatisfaction, as if complaining about her mother's excessive control, completely unaware that she had already been exposed by Ji Fei.","\"You...\" Qin's Mother was almost speechless with anger.","\"Rong Rong, where are you now?\" Qin Yan immediately interjected.","\"Big sis? I... I'm in the school's art studio.\"","[Huh? Guilty conscience? Lying? Perhaps she's on a date with Cheng Yue, let me see...]","Qin Yan directly said in a cold voice: \"We're at your school gate. Since you're in the art studio, come to Professor Wang's office within ten minutes! We'll wait for you there!\"","\"Big sis!\" Qin Rong suddenly panicked. As soon as she heard Professor Wang, she naturally knew that the situation had been exposed. \"How could you come without telling me!\"","\"Didn't you also not tell us?\" Qin Yan implied, also showing the strictness expected of an eldest sister, \"Be there in ten minutes.\"","She then hung up the phone and helped Qin's Mother walk towards the campus.","[...Ten minutes, I'm afraid she won't make it.]","Qin Yan also guessed that she was on a date, probably off-campus now. The more she thought about it, the more disappointed she felt.","But then she unexpectedly heard Ji Fei, who was following behind, say:","[She's currently cleaning in a rented apartment...]","Qin Yan and Qin's Mother stopped in their tracks, looking at each other in disbelief.","It wasn't hard to imagine that it should be Cheng Yue's rented apartment. Their precious fourth daughter of the Qin family should have been holding a brush in the art studio at this time, so focused that she wouldn't even notice if paint got on her face.","But now? What was she doing?","[Has she gone mad?!]","Qin Yan and Qin's Mother: Indeed, this love affair has practically robbed her of her senses.","But in the next second, they realized how naive they had been. The situation that could be described as \"mad\" by Ji Fei couldn't be that simple.","[It turns out it's not just getting back together, Qin Rong is no longer living on campus. She's been taken to the rented apartment to cohabit with Cheng Yue!]","It was like a bolt from the blue, a thunderbolt out of a clear sky.","Qin's Mother's legs suddenly went weak.","\"Mom!\" Qin Yan cried out in alarm, quickly supporting her mother.","Ji Fei, who had been watching the drama unfold in the system, quickly came forward to help support her.","[I didn't expect Qin Rong's private decision not to go abroad would hit Qin's Mother so hard. If she knew they got back together and are living together, all for that little hooligan, wouldn't she end up hospitalized from the shock!]","Qin's Mother really couldn't recover, her voice trembling as she said to Qin Yan: \"Go... go to Rong Rong's dormitory, help her check out immediately.\"","[Checking out is good, I guess Qin's Mother also feels that Qin Rong's education has gone wrong and needs to be brought home for proper teaching.]","Qin Yan was also furious, her face ashen. She handed Qin's Mother over to Ji Fei, then turned to call the driver, going together to Qin Rong's dormitory. They would use all connections and means necessary; today, they must bring Qin Rong home.","Afterwards, Ji Fei accompanied Qin's Mother to meet Professor Wang, a middle-aged woman.","Whether it was because of cherishing talent or because of the Qin family's status requiring special care for their little princess, Professor Wang wanted to advise against Qin Rong's irrational behavior, which was why she had contacted Qin's Mother.","Professor Wang was also shrewd. As soon as she saw Qin's Mother, she began to hint that Qin Rong might be in a relationship.","\"Ever since she returned from the field trip abroad, she's been out of sorts. Recently, she's even been distracted while painting, constantly delaying her assignments. I've occasionally seen a male student picking her up... Of course, it's normal for her to date at this age, but she can't let it interfere with her future. After all, she's a very talented artist.\"","Qin's Mother's face was ashen. \"Yes, don't worry, this child has gone astray, and we will definitely correct her.\"","They were originally waiting for Qin Rong to arrive, but Qin Yan had already finished her errand and returned before Qin Rong finally ran in, out of breath.","\"Mom, big sis, second sister-in-law, Professor Wang.\" Qin Rong's politeness was still intact, but the expressions of everyone looking at her were not good.","Especially Qin's Mother and Qin Yan.","Qin's Mother pointed at the application form on the table and said: \"You've already met all the standards required by your academy. Now fill out this application form.\"","Qin Rong's expression changed slightly, but she finally spoke up: \"Mom, I'm an adult now. I have the freedom to choose my own future path. I don't want to go.\"","Hearing such words face to face, Qin's Mother had already passed the point of anger, to an unexpectedly calm state. \"Just because of a little hooligan, you want to give up the dream you've been working towards for years?\"","Qin Rong's face paled, and she was about to speak when she heard Ji Fei comment: [It seems Qin's Mother has already guessed. As a woman herself, she naturally knows that the first thing that can destroy a woman's strong will and drastically change her personality in a short time is a man's sugar-coated bullets.]","Qin Rong swallowed the words that were about to come out.","Then she heard Qin Yan say: \"Rong Rong, I just went to your dormitory. There's dust on the desk and bed. Did you think you could hide this from your family? No wonder you haven't come home on weekends for three weeks. We really thought you were dedicating yourself to painting. Rong Rong, you've truly disappointed us.\"","Qin Rong's face instantly turned deathly pale. Living with a man was already a huge challenge for a good girl like her, and now that it had been discovered, she was truly scared to the point of trembling.","\"It's not... I didn't mean to hide it from you, it's just...\"","[It's just that when you got back together, Cheng Yue said the Qin family would do everything to separate you, so he told you to hide it from your family. You're really obedient, not even afraid of encountering bad people. I didn't expect that between family of twenty years and a boyfriend of one month, she would choose the boyfriend.]","Qin Rong was immediately rendered speechless by the sarcasm, not knowing where to put her hands and feet.","Hearing this truth, the expressions on Qin's Mother and Qin Yan's faces couldn't have been more awful.","\"So, after what happened last time, you still haven't woken up. You still think we're making things difficult for you and that little hooligan?\" Qin's Mother said, heartbroken.","\"He's not a hooligan, you've all misunderstood him.\"","As soon as Qin Rong finished speaking, Qin's Mother raised her hand. If it weren't for Qin Yan stopping her, that elegant lady would have really slapped her precious daughter this time.","\"Mom, we'll teach little sister when we get back. Let's deal with this matter first.\"","Qin Rong was also scared stiff, her eyes instantly becoming moist. \"Mom, you want to hit me?\"","From childhood to adulthood, even Qin Xian had been hit before, but never Qin Rong. This was the first time she faced such an enraged mother, and she was completely dumbfounded.","Qin's Mother's eyes also reddened. She truly wanted to slap some sense into this daughter.","How did it suddenly happen that she felt she didn't recognize this daughter she had given birth to with such difficulty?","Professor Wang spoke up at the right moment to ease the tense atmosphere: \"Why don't we let Qin Rong submit the application form first? Tomorrow is the deadline, and it will be too late if we delay any further.\"","Qin Yan quickly pushed Qin Rong, \"Go on, don't make Mom any angrier.\"","But Qin Rong only swayed slightly, as if her feet were nailed to the ground, not moving an inch."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Once Not Listened to, Never Advised Again","paragraphs":["Qin Yan couldn't believe that even now, Qin Rong was still so stubborn. She looked at her sister in disbelief, \"Do you really want to ruin your future and waste your talent for an irresponsible man who lacks commitment?\"","\"A person's talent is innate. Even if I don't go abroad, with my talent and abilities, I can achieve success in painting without leaving the country!\" Qin Rong tried to speak firmly, but tears still flowed uncontrollably down her cheeks.","Qin's Mom also looked at Qin Rong in utter shock. \"Have you been painting seriously at all during this time?\"","Guilt immediately spread across Qin Rong's face.","Even Professor Wang couldn't hold back, saying: \"Qin Rong, you are talented, but not a genius. Your talent requires a vast amount of time, money, effort, and study to accumulate before it can lead to achievement. I thought that given your previous level of dedication, you understood your situation and knew these principles.\"","With even the professor speaking this way, Qin Rong's face grew even more embarrassed, and she instinctively wanted to defend herself again.","[Sigh, the old Qin Rong definitely understood this principle. But now... those words aren't even her own, they're from her boyfriend whom she blindly trusts and depends on, and she's been convinced by him. Qin Rong has become Cheng Yue's most devout follower, believing even such irresponsible words as if they were gospel. Love really does make people foolish.]","Qin Rong immediately turned to Ji Fei in anger and embarrassment. She insisted that wasn't the case - she had her own judgment and thought Cheng Yue's words made sense.","She was making decisions based on her own will.","Ji Fei noticed Qin Rong looking at her and thought Qin Rong was expecting her to speak up in support.","Ji Fei promptly avoided eye contact.","[No way. My principle for dealing with people blinded by love is: if they don't listen once, never try to persuade them again. Only your closest family would repeatedly risk being infuriated while trying to pull you out of a deep hole. I don't want to meddle and end up pleasing no one.]","Qin Rong was shocked. She thought Ji Fei had been silently criticizing her all this time, wanting to lecture her and force her to change her mind. She never expected Ji Fei didn't want to get involved at all.","This unexpected reaction left Qin Rong's defiant attitude at a loss.","Were her family really trying to help her?","A bit of sense started to emerge in her mind, but then Cheng Yue's domineering and determined face flashed through her thoughts, and her rationality shrank away again.","Professor Wang sighed and said, \"Qin Rong, are you worried that going abroad and having a long-distance relationship will lead to a breakup?\"","Although this was indeed the case, Qin Rong felt a moment of shame when faced with the professor's questioning. It was as if using such a reason was an insult to her artistic works.","\"Mom, sis, professor, I'm sorry. I know I've disappointed you, but I don't want to give up. We've just reconciled, and this relationship didn't come easily. I must cherish it.\"","Looking at the determination in Qin Rong's eyes, she seemed like someone bravely defying the world for love.","These words nearly gave the two Qin family members a stroke.","Ji Fei was glad she had remained a bystander, otherwise she definitely wouldn't have been able to control her urge to knock some sense into this fool.","Even the outsider Professor Wang's expression almost faltered at this point.","\"Young people, it's the time when you believe love is grand. But Qin Rong, when you truly love someone, you often feel indebted to them. The right person will always hope for your bright future rather than holding you back for their own selfish desires, preventing you from moving forward.\"","\"It's not that he's holding me back. He loves me and just wants to be with me,\" Qin Rong hurriedly defended Cheng Yue.","[Pfft, there's an example right beside her. Is Qin Rong blind? Look at Qin Zhao. Because he truly fell in love, even though they're in different countries and he knows that person has chosen to devote themselves to scientific research and will never look back, he still wants to see them occasionally. He even moved his career over there for this reason. How does your true love compare? Hah, if he really liked you, how could he use this as a reason to threaten breaking up?]","Ji Fei's clear-headed commentary finally allowed the Qin family members to breathe a sigh of relief.","Qin Rong, however, felt deeply mocked, but her rebellious attitude only grew stronger. She seemed determined to find a reason to refute.","\"Love needs to be nurtured and requires mutual sacrifice. Cheng Yue and I love each other; it's not unrequited love. It's all voluntary. I'm willing to make concessions for him.\"","[Good grief, I'm utterly speechless.]","\"Then what about him? What has he given up for you?\" Qin's Mom really couldn't listen anymore.","Qin Rong said, \"If it weren't because he liked me, after being humiliated like that, he would never have put aside his pride to get back together with me!\"","At this moment, the silence from everyone was deafening.","Professor Wang, truly afraid that her office might turn into a bloodbath with people she couldn't afford to offend, could only try her best to say:","\"Now that you're giving up such a great learning opportunity, we can't say for certain that you won't succeed in the future, but... to catch up to where you would be on your current path, you might need to put in ten times the effort. I hope you'll consider it carefully for your own sake. Love yourself before loving others.\"","Ji Fei thought Qin's Mom and Qin Yan would continue, but they seemed truly disheartened and exhausted.","They just took the application form and led Qin Rong out, preparing to go home.","It wasn't until they got in the car that Qin Rong realized all her belongings from the dormitory were there.","Qin Rong's expression finally changed. \"What's the meaning of this?\"","Qin Yan said, \"We've canceled your dormitory. From now on, you'll live at home.\"","\"I...\" Qin Rong immediately became anxious, but was interrupted by Qin's Mom: \"Our Qin family has never had unmarried cohabitation.\"","\"This... this doesn't matter. You're old-fashioned. In modern times...\"","Qin Yan couldn't help but say, \"You're still a college student! No engagement, no meeting of both families, do you know what unmarried cohabitation means? Even if you really have a future together, aren't you afraid of being looked down upon by his family later, unable to gain respect? People won't think your true love is great, they'll just think you don't respect yourself!\"","Qin Yan was the most qualified to say these things. Back then, due to an accident, she became pregnant before marriage and could never hold her head high in front of her ex-husband's family. Countless times she woke up from nightmares, regretting it. She didn't want her sister to follow in her footsteps.","\"Big sis!\" Qin Rong's tears fell uncontrollably, these words exceeding her limit of endurance, her whole body shaking as she cried.","But she wanted to be strong, so she bit her lower lip hard, not making a sound, just staring at Qin Yan with wide eyes, as if silently accusing her of hurting her.","Qin Yan was too tired to say more. Qin Rong was even more obsessed than she had been back then.","The atmosphere in the car was oppressive, with complete silence all the way home.","As soon as they got out of the car, Qin's Mom thought about forcibly confiscating her phone, but because the Qin family had never done such a thing before, she felt constrained. Qin Rong rushed back to her own room and locked herself in.","Children raised in such a family environment usually turn out fine at heart, living happily and carefree. If they're not particularly shrewd, as long as life goes smoothly, they won't make any major mistakes.","It's just that the Qin family children have terribly bad luck in love, all stumbling in this aspect.","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan began contacting other family members.","Ji Fei, having nothing else to do, went back to her room. The door to the open balcony was open, and she was about to close it.","But then she saw a paper ball flying out from the direction of the neighboring balcony.","Looking at the paper ball with faint golden glitter marks, it looked exactly like that application form for the most brilliant future for an art student.","Ji Fei blinked and quietly closed the door.","Soon after, the Qin family men all rushed back, setting up for another family tribunal.","Only this time, Qin Rong seemed determined to be a brave warrior for love, resisting to the end.","Ji Fei sat in the farthest corner, minimizing her presence, very curious about how this battle against someone blinded by love would end."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: The other party simply doesn't love you, so you're just a total idiot.","paragraphs":["Qin Zhao was the first to lose his patience.","\"Damn it, I told you that little punk was no good! And you actually moved in with him! Is your head filled with shit?\" Qin Zhao was so angry that he was cursing with every sentence.","Even facing his sister whose face had turned pale from being yelled at, he showed no signs of stopping.","\"Tell me honestly, since you're living together, has he taken advantage of you?\" Qin Zhao furiously demanded.","Everyone's expressions became a bit awkward. Even though they knew about the cohabitation before, neither Qin's Mom nor Qin Yan had asked many questions.","Although as a brother he shouldn't pry into private matters, just thinking about that garbage of a man touching his sister made him want to vomit up even the New Year's Eve dinner from ten years ago.","Hearing this, Qin Rong was too ashamed to lift her head, but she still firmly replied, \"Even though we're living together, we have separate rooms. His love for me is genuine, and he said he won't do anything to me before marriage. He just wants to spend more time with me. He really is a good person!\"","She was an adult, so even if something happened with her boyfriend, it wouldn't be a problem.","Many of her classmates were already... Compared to them, she felt that Brother Cheng Yue truly cherished her, which was rare and precious.","But Qin Rong's answer stunned everyone else.","Although this answer should have been reassuring, everyone knew what normal men were thinking when they asked to live together.","So Qin Zhao's first reaction was that Qin Rong was lying.","But a second later, they heard Ji Fei's thoughts coming from afar.","[It's actually true? How strange.]","The expressions on everyone's faces were almost identical: This is unbelievable!","That punk who tried to grope a girl's thigh in public was now playing the pure love game after tricking her into living together?","Ji Fei was just as confused as everyone else and couldn't help but search for gossip to see the details.","[It doesn't make sense. Young people are in their prime, yet living together and doing nothing? Could he be impotent? Let me see...]","Everyone's expressions became subtle.","Qin Rong's face turned bright red from this interruption.","It definitely wasn't that. There was one time when Brother Cheng Yue hugged her, and she felt... but they were interrupted by Cheng Miao. Otherwise, they might have...","While Ji Fei couldn't find out if the man was impotent or not, she did discover something else.","[Oh my God!]","Everyone's hearts skipped a beat at this exclamation, and they held their breath to eavesdrop.","Qin Rong, who wasn't too familiar with Ji Fei's situation, also became a bit panicked. Remembering her second sister-in-law's attitude earlier, Qin Rong had always been quite suspicious. If her second sister-in-law really knew everything, how could she dislike someone as good as Brother Cheng Yue?","Just as she was thinking this, she heard Ji Fei say in an almost unbelievable tone: [No way, has Qin Rong been blinded by love, or does she have mud in her eyes?]","Qin Rong was stunned by this insult.","[Cheng Yue said: I'm good enough to you. Look at other girlfriends, they move in together, do laundry, cook, take care of their boyfriends, and give all their money to their boyfriends to manage. That's what good women do. But you're my baby, I don't mind that you haven't grown up and don't understand things.]","[So, feeling inadequate, Qin Rong moved in with him!]","[Cheng Yue said: When I asked you to hand-wash my jersey, you couldn't even do that right. Which girl doesn't know how to do laundry? I didn't even get angry at you or look down on you. From now on, I'll take care of washing the jerseys myself. Where else could you find a boyfriend who spoils you like this?]","[So, Qin Rong apologized and felt it was very sweet. She thinks she's being pampered by her boyfriend.]","[Yuck~ My eyes! I can't bear to look anymore. My values have been polluted. My intelligence is being ground into the dirt.]","Not just Ji Fei, but everyone else's faces were changing colors like traffic lights, their burning gazes fixed on Qin Rong.","This was no longer the way one looks at a family member, but how one looks at some strange new species.","Qin Rong was stunned. Those couple conversations that had initially only made her feel sweet, for some reason, after hearing Ji Fei's sarcastic imitation, a wave of shame washed over her.","Qin Rong felt like something wasn't right, but more than that, she felt wronged on behalf of her boyfriend who was being humiliated.","Her voice trembling, she tried to say something, \"He...\"","\"You love-addled fool!\" Qin Zhao couldn't hold back anymore and pointed directly at Qin Rong's nose as he scolded.","\"I'm not!\" Qin Rong became agitated.","\"Oh yes, yes, yes, 'love-addled' is a term for people who actually have love between them. Clearly, he doesn't love you at all, so you're just purely brain-dead,\" Qin Zhao said mercilessly. \"When Mom had a difficult labor giving birth to you, did she leave your brain behind in the womb?\"","Qin Rong was no match for Qin Zhao's combativeness. Her charge for love collapsed halfway, and she could only emphasize with teary eyes, \"It's not like that. He loves me. What about you all? Do you have any successful examples in love? You have no right to lecture me on this.\"","To prove that she was right, Qin Rong had started attacking her three siblings.","Hearing this, the three siblings had various expressions. The parents couldn't bear to listen anymore and were about to speak.","[She has a point. We really don't have the right.]","The rest of the Qin family: Hey, hey, hey, whose side are you on?","Qin Rong suddenly felt more confident.","[Come to think of it, it seems the whole family has a naturally naive personality. They're either being deceived (Qin Yan, Qin Xian, Qin Zhao) or on the way to being deceived (Qin Rong). Could it be hereditary? I wonder if Qin's Father and Qin's Mom when they were young...]","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom suddenly shuddered.","This topic was not appropriate to continue.","Qin's Mom coughed and said, \"Since we can't reason with you, Rong-er, you'll stay at home for a while.\"","Qin Rong was immediately incredulous, \"You're going to lock me up?! I'm an adult, you can't...\"","\"Would you rather we watch you continue to live with that terrible man? Unless you're no longer my child.\" This time, Qin's Mom played her trump card.","Even if she had become rebellious due to her love-addled state, her fundamental nature hadn't changed.","Qin Rong cried in disappointment and heartbreak, but she didn't dare say anything more.","Qin's Father said coldly, \"Alright, let's not discuss the rest for now. Fill out the application form and send it tonight.\"","\"I don't want to,\" Qin Rong suddenly said.","\"Say that again?\" Qin's Father's tone grew colder.","\"I don't want to go abroad,\" Qin Rong seemed to be resisting other things more strongly because of her earlier compromise with her mother. \"I've already thrown away the application form.\"","Qin's Father took a sharp breath. \"You, you...\"","Qin Zhao couldn't hold back again, \"Did that little punk perform eye removal surgery on you or brain polishing surgery?\"","Qin Rong bit her lip and refused to respond.","Qin Xian suddenly spoke up, \"Fine.\"","Ji Fei, who was hesitating whether to tell everyone where the crumpled paper was, was interrupted by this.","Everyone looked at Qin Xian, who had finally spoken.","Qin Rong said in disbelief, \"Second brother, you're willing to understand me?\"","\"No, I'm just respecting your choice for your own future,\" Qin Xian said seriously. \"Whether you want to cherish it or waste it, as long as you've thought it through, this is your choice. Don't blame your family later for not warning you.\"","Qin Rong's heart skipped a beat, as if something was slipping away, making her want to grasp it for a moment.","Except for Qin Rong who was still a bit dazed, the rest of the Qin family seemed to understand what Qin Xian meant.","People always have to pay a price for their youthful foolishness.","Because of the Qin family's existence, this price might not be too painful, but it would still leave Qin Rong with a lasting lesson.","Qin Rong was confined for three days before someone finally came looking for her."]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: He Cooked a Meal for Me","paragraphs":["They didn't actively seek out Cheng Yue, as he didn't yet have that privilege.","But what they never expected was that when the butler brought someone in, it turned out to be Cheng Miao.","Since it was evening, everyone was present. All eyes fell on the newcomer.","A girl who could be described as pretty, with a polite and proper demeanor, the type of appearance that would make parents feel at ease letting their children play with her.","In the past, the Qin family had treated her quite well, often giving her gifts, but ever since her brother got together with Qin Rong, everyone had become unfriendly towards her.","She stood in the living room, awkwardly enduring those unfriendly gazes.","Among them was one particularly piercing look; she traced it to its source and found it belonged to Qin Rong's second sister-in-law, though she hadn't met this person much before.","However, the way she looked at her was strange, as if her eyes weren't focused.","Qin's Mom was about to say something from an elder's perspective, but then came the sound of Qin Rong's hurried footsteps.","\"Miao Miao!\"","\"Rong Rong!\"","The reunion of the good friends immediately showed how close their relationship was.","Qin Zhao went straight into sarcasm mode: \"While the girlfriend is desperately fighting for their love, the boyfriend doesn't even dare to show his face, instead sending his sister. What kind of lowly, spineless man is he?\"","Qin Rong immediately said, \"I didn't want you to give Cheng Yue a hard time, so I told him not to come.\"","Cheng Miao also said apologetically, \"I just came to see Rong Rong. My brother is worried about her too, but he knew you might get angry if you saw him, so he didn't dare to come and disturb you. It was my brother's mistake to move in together without informing the Qin family first, but he really likes Rong Rong so much, that's why he did it. I apologize on behalf of my brother!\"","She then bowed to the Qin family members.","The Qin family had no intention of giving other girls a hard time, so naturally, they didn't say much.","Qin Rong immediately pulled Cheng Miao back to her room.","In the living room, Qin Zhao kept mocking the sneaky Cheng Yue. Among those present, only he had accidentally bumped into Cheng Yue once. According to him, although Cheng Yue looked presentable, he had a sleazy air about him - one look and you could tell he wasn't a good person.","But such bad boys seemed to have a fatal attraction for good girls.","The Qin family members sighed and fretted, not knowing how to handle the situation.","Since meeting Cheng Miao, Ji Fei, who was sitting on the sofa, had been quiet.","It wasn't until Qin Xian brought over some yogurt for Ji Fei and saw her frowning more and more that he couldn't help but ask, \"What's wrong?\"","Ji Fei's mouth twitched as she looked at Qin Xian, then glanced at the others. \"Nothing.\"","Although she said this, her expression was quite complex.","The Qin family members: ? Why do we have such an ominous feeling?","[How should I tell them? Maybe I should just ask the bodyguards to strengthen the security work at home, that should prevent it.]","Qin family members: Security? What's going on? Don't leave us hanging, it's making us anxious!","[I feel like I've been hit by the viciousness of human nature. The evil of human nature can truly surpass imagination.]","The Qin family members started to get nervous. Why does it sound so serious?","[I never expected this. I always thought it was just an overconfident, greasy little punk PUA-ing a rich girl. I never imagined it was a demon's lackey, an enemy's honey trap trying to climb over the corpse of a naive girl to succeed.]","Qin family members: !! Wait... isn't this description a bit too horrifying? Are you saying that the Cheng Miao girl is actually worse than Cheng Yue?","Qin Xian's eyes changed for a moment.","At this moment, there was a sound from upstairs. Qin Rong was escorting Cheng Miao down, presumably preparing to leave.","Now, everyone's gaze towards Cheng Miao became even more suspicious.","Cheng Miao felt uneasy and was about to say goodbye when Qin Xian suddenly spoke up: \"Qin Rong gave up her spot for the international exchange program. I heard it happened to be passed down to you.\"","Ji Fei immediately perked up, looking at Qin Xian with some admiration. [Impressive, he discovered the key issue so quickly.]","When the others heard this, their gazes towards Cheng Miao instantly became sharp.","Could it be because of this?","Faced with Qin Xian's inherent CEO aura, Cheng Miao almost lost control of her expression.","\"Yes, I happened to be right after Rong Rong in line, but I had tried to persuade Rong Rong before, it's just...\" Cheng Miao put on a helpless look.","In fact, she was also emphasizing on the side that she didn't steal the spot, it was Qin Rong who gave it up, and she just picked up a bargain.","Qin Zhao snorted and said, \"What a coincidence? Don't tell me you siblings planned this together, one manipulating my sister's feelings, the other scheming for my sister's spot.\"","[That's right, they planned it together, both deceiving the naive girl! Of course, their purpose isn't just this...]","The Qin family members became even more anxious. What else could there be?","Cheng Miao's eyes instantly reddened, as if she had suffered an insult. She gently tugged at Qin Rong's sleeve beside her.","But she found that Qin Rong's face had turned a bit unpleasant, her eyes wandering. After realizing this, Qin Rong quickly said, \"My choice has nothing to do with Miao Miao! Second brother, third brother, please don't give Miao Miao a hard time.\"","[This must be what they call a fool who helps count money for the con artist even after being deceived.]","Qin Rong's momentum immediately faltered at the sarcasm. She stole a glance at Ji Fei. Why did everyone think that what the second sister-in-law said must be true? Such mysterious things are hard to be certain about, right?","She still chose to believe her friend. She endured it, pretending not to have heard.","Seeing that Qin Rong was still as firm as ever, Cheng Miao knew she hadn't wavered, but there was another proposal that she hadn't agreed to yet.","Her eyes darted around, and suddenly she spoke up with a sincere face: \"The exchange student matter really was a coincidence. I know you all have issues with me because my brother is dating Rong Rong. I also know that my brother isn't good enough for Rong Rong, but he truly likes her and wants to be good to her for a lifetime. I hope you can give them a chance, don't cruelly separate them.\"","Qin Zhao was immediately provoked: \"Truly likes her? Have you shown any sincerity? You're all just a bunch of liars, stop pretending in front of us. I'll make this clear today, we, the Qin family, will absolutely not allow such a lowlife to be Qin Rong's boyfriend! Never!\"","With these words, Qin Rong froze.","Although Qin Zhao had acted on impulse, the fact that no one else objected meant that this was the stance of the entire Qin family.","Cheng Miao's eyes flickered as she looked at Qin Rong, but the corner of her mouth secretly curled up.","This should finally make her make up her mind, right?","\"Why... why are you being so absolute? Even if you don't like him, won't you give him even a slight chance?\" Qin Rong's eyes reddened.","Cheng Miao quickly supported Qin Rong, silently comforting her, as if they were two helpless people standing together against an evil force.","\"I originally didn't want to say this and make you worry, but you're being too much. Do you know that during the previous overseas trip for inspiration, if it wasn't for Cheng Yue saving me, I might have been in danger!\"","\"What!\" Qin's Father and Qin's Mom were immediately shocked and couldn't sit still. \"What happened?\"","Qin Rong then recounted the reason why she gradually opened her heart to Cheng Yue.","In the past, Qin Rong was obsessed with painting. If no one was watching her, she would often get dizzy from hunger due to painting, and in severe cases, she would even faint from low blood sugar. One night, she was the only one left in the studio. She got so absorbed in painting that she forgot to eat and eventually fainted from hunger. It was Cheng Yue who found her and carried her back to the dorm.","\"When I woke up, the room was filled with the aroma of food. It felt like an invisible hand had pulled me out of a dark and cold place. I had heard before that he never cooked, but that day, he used the kitchenware in the rental apartment to make me three dishes and a soup. After that, for the remaining time, he kept an eye on me every day. Whenever I forgot to eat again, he would definitely bring me food he made himself. He doesn't even do this for his own family members, only for me. If I miss out on such a good person, who else would treat me like this?\"","Qin Rong was immersed in self-pity.","But Qin Zhao couldn't stand it anymore, \"Is that all? Our family's housekeeper auntie can make you seven dishes and a soup!\"","Qin Rong immediately retorted, \"It's not the same. This is a kind of warmth. Those meals contain care and love. Even if they're not the most delicious, I can taste the difference. It's the first time I've eaten...\"","Qin Yan also couldn't listen anymore, \"Little sister, have you forgotten? When we were young, our mom also tried to cook for us herself, but she's a kitchen disaster. There was one time when you got food poisoning, that's why mom isn't allowed in the kitchen anymore. What do you mean 'first time'? What care and love? Has our whole family given you too little?\"","The whole family looked at Qin Rong, the accusation in their eyes made her unable to stand her ground.","Qin Rong choked up, just about to say something. Then she heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts break into an exaggerated laugh.","[Hahahahaha, I'm dying of laughter! So this is what made her heart flutter? For this, Qin Rong was even planning to elope with that narcissistic, sleazy man behind her family's back!]","[She doesn't even know that that dinner was nothing more than takeout food the scumbag had reheated and plated up!]"]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: Just Playing Quite Abnormal","paragraphs":["Silence. An eerie, deafening silence.","The Qin family nearly jumped off the sofa in unison.","What? Eloping?","Ji Fei felt a wave of movement on the shared sofa, but when she glanced over, everyone was still seated, their gazes fixed intently on Qin Rong. They were likely stunned by Qin Rong's absurd statements.","Qin Rong's face was a picture of panic. She hadn't expected her unformed plans to be known by her second sister-in-law.","She didn't really intend to elope; she lacked the courage for such an act. It was merely something Cheng Miao had been repeatedly suggesting, and she had wavered.","She had hoped to reason with her family, but their resolute attitude just now had indeed provoked her.","She thought that if she acted recklessly, her family would have no choice but to accept Cheng Yue. Once accepted, they wouldn't keep her confined or force her to go abroad. Then, both families could gradually get to know each other, and they would realize that Cheng Yue wasn't as bad as they imagined.","But in this moment, faced with her family's incredulous stares, Qin Rong felt utterly ashamed, almost overlooking Ji Fei's next statement.","The oblivious Cheng Miao nudged her, hoping this foolish girl wouldn't be swayed.","But this action caught Ji Fei's attention.","Ji Fei inwardly sneered: [The takeout was ordered by this backstabbing best friend. That good-for-nothing only knew how to reheat takeout, then pretended to have cooked it himself when Qin Rong woke up.]","Qin Rong's already confused mind received another blow. No, how could it be fake? It's impossible!","[Qin Rong actually said she tasted care and love in the food. Well, she should really thank the chef at that Chinese fast-food chain. Three dishes and a soup, all for less than thirty yuan. What a bargain.]","Qin Rong's eyes gradually widened. Even if she didn't believe it, Ji Fei's words were too detailed to ignore.","[I remember we have that chain store here too. Why don't we order from there every day while she's at home, let her really feel the care and love? I bet she'll be sick of it after a month of eating the same thing.]","Qin Rong swayed, almost losing her balance.","Cheng Miao quickly steadied Qin Rong, then said with a grief-stricken face, \"Please stop tormenting Rong Rong. Perhaps in your eyes, my brother cooking for Rong Rong doesn't mean much, but it's his way of showing he cares. My brother has never done this for anyone else.\"","[Pfft, isn't that because he simply can't cook?]","Cheng Miao continued righteously, \"Even if you don't like my brother, please don't casually trample on someone's sincere feelings.\"","This righteous, defiant speech might have fooled them if not for Ji Fei's inner thoughts. Now, hearing this girl's blatant lies, they were all nearly laughing with anger.","At this moment, Qin Xian spoke up: \"Fine, since you say so, ask your brother to come over.\"","This statement caught the emotional Cheng Miao off guard. \"Huh?\"","\"Have your brother come here and personally cook a meal for us. If we can also feel his sincerity, we won't stand in your way anymore,\" Qin Xian said, his dark eyes unfathomable.","[Hahaha, Qin Xian is brilliant too. Though I don't know what he's planning, having the guy come cook will expose the lie directly. Hahaha, they must be sweating bullets now.]","Cheng Miao's face changed dramatically. Her body stiffened, unsure how to respond. Just then, Qin Rong, as if grasping at straws, grabbed her: \"Let's have Cheng Yue come over. If he cooks just one meal, we can be together.\"","Cheng Miao's face had turned almost blue. \"Rong Rong, you know my brother's temperament. He won't agree to this.\"","\"Why not? Isn't he able to cook for me? Doesn't he want to be with me?\"","Cheng Miao's face immediately darkened. \"Because my brother knows you're just finding ways to make things difficult for him. How could agreeing to cook one meal possibly lead to your approval? My brother loves you, but he can't be humiliated like this. How can you bear to see him mocked like this? Don't you love my brother?\"","Hearing this, Qin Rong's expression changed again, as if plunged into endless confusion.","Qin Zhao coldly sneered, \"So my sister living with him and taking care of his daily needs isn't humiliating, but cooking one meal for us is? You can't be this hypocritical.\"","\"Their living together is their own business, but cooking for you is...\" Cheng Miao panicked, not knowing how to turn the situation around.","Qin's parents couldn't be bothered with this circus act.","\"Rong Rong, look at this. He won't even agree to such a small request. Is this the man you've chosen? You say he loves you, but where's the love? Just in words? Love that's all talk and no action?\"","\"He's not willing to make the slightest effort to gain our approval as parents. He only wants to deceive you into secretly dating and living together, and even... This shows a lack of responsibility and integrity. In your father's eyes, he doesn't even qualify as a decent man!\"","\"From start to finish, as your boyfriend, has he ever bravely stood up for you even once? It's always been you fighting, sacrificing, and compromising. He just wants to reap the benefits. Do you really want to choose someone like this?\"","Before Qin Rong could react, Cheng Miao became agitated. \"You can't talk about my brother like that!\"","Her genuine defense actually stunned the Qin family for a moment.","But the next second, they heard Ji Fei say: [Indeed, it's true love. She's so protective. They're quite the twisted pair.]","Wait!","What did they just hear?","True love?","Between whom?","Everyone's shocked gaze turned to Cheng Miao. Cheng Miao, enraged and flustered, seemed to have reddened eyes. This reaction could be explained as protecting a family member, or as... ahem... it couldn't be, could it? How bizarre.","Qin Rong was also shocked, her pupils dilating in disbelief as she shook her head. This seemed like an outlandish fantasy; she even thought Ji Fei had gone mad.","Suddenly, a voice broke the eerie atmosphere.","\"You two siblings, though from a blended family without blood ties, seem to have a relationship closer than actual siblings.\"","Qin Xian's casual remark fell like Thor's hammer.","Everyone silently digested this unexpected piece of information.","Qin Xian's investigated data, combined with Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","So these step-siblings with different parents had that kind of relationship!","Shocking! Absolutely shocking!","\"Rong Rong, did you know they're not blood-related?\" Qin's Mom asked Qin Rong incredulously, only to find Qin Rong in a daze, as if her soul had left her body. Clearly, she had no idea about this secret.","Moreover, Ji Fei's words had been too much of a shock for her. She was in a state of complete shutdown, unable to process any more information.","\"Why are you only mentioning this now?\" Qin's Father asked Qin Xian.","\"They were too young when their families merged, and they moved homes, so they presented themselves as a united family to others,\" Qin Xian had always thought this information was irrelevant. Who could have imagined such an extraordinary situation? He had assumed that growing up together would naturally make them like real siblings.","Now the Qin family members finally understood why Ji Fei's expression had been so complex upon seeing Cheng Miao. This relationship twist was as dramatic as a roller coaster ride.","If the siblings were a couple, where did that leave Qin Rong in this relationship?"]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: A Conspiracy Targeting Qin Rong","paragraphs":["\"You... why are you suddenly saying these things? How can you casually investigate someone else's private matters?\"","Cheng Miao's forehead was covered in fine sweat. Her reaction wasn't one of feeling offended, but of utter guilt.","\"Guess,\" Qin Zhao smiled mischievously.","Cheng Miao's face turned pale, her body trembling uncontrollably.","Ji Fei was also surprised. [Why did Qin Xian suddenly bring this up? Had he already investigated something and suspected their sibling relationship wasn't normal? But weren't they very discreet, with no one noticing? How could he have found any clues? Impressive!]","Qin Xian: ...I'm ashamed to say I didn't find anything. My fault for not thinking enough.","Qin Family: No, no, no, who could have thought of that?","[Qin Rong is truly unfortunate, encountering such an odd pair of siblings. They clearly have mutual feelings and attraction, and although their blended family relationship is an obstacle, it's not an insurmountable one. But they've lived together with their parents since childhood, appearing completely as one family, so they're afraid to face their parents and friends, and don't dare to defy social norms and gossip.]","[Sneaking around long-term isn't a solution either. Since Cheng Yue is always irresponsible, the family hopes he'll mature after marriage, so they've been frantically pushing for it. Naturally, Cheng Miao doesn't want a stranger to steal her brother away, so she came up with this vicious plan.]","Everyone felt a chill in their hearts, their gazes sweeping towards Qin Rong.","Qin Rong's expression was full of numbness and bewilderment. She felt as if she were listening to someone else's story; this couldn't possibly be happening to her.","[Qin Rong happened to become roommates with Cheng Miao, and she looked so naive and easy to fool. Plus, she knew Cheng Yue hated rich good girls the most, which is why she chose Qin Rong to be her future sister-in-law.]","[Bah! What a psycho! Did she have to drag an innocent person into their weird play?]","[According to Cheng Miao's thinking: Since I can't be with my brother, I'll find someone stupid and easy to control who can also support my brother.]","[Because she also couldn't bear to see her brother work hard outside, goodness, she's love-brained too, thinking of tricking another woman to help her take care of her brother. In one word: Unbelievable!]","The others felt shocked, and couldn't help but look at Cheng Miao. So young, yet so devious, it was truly spine-chilling. The more they looked, the more she seemed like a lunatic.","Cheng Miao, already feeling guilty, saw the increasingly strange looks in everyone's eyes and couldn't help but want to run away.","Just as she was about to step back, Qin Rong suddenly grabbed her arm.","Cheng Miao looked at Qin Rong in fright, only to find Qin Rong's eyes empty and unfocused, not looking at her at all.","Could she have sensed something was wrong? Impossible, she's too stupid!","\"Rong Rong, my brother and I grew up together. Though we're not blood-related, we're the closest of family. And you're my best friend. I just wanted to help you two, but since your family is giving us such a hard time, I should probably leave first.\"","[Heh, indeed she's been helping all along. At first, I was quite puzzled. There are plenty of young gentlemen in the same social circle, even if Qin Rong didn't like them, surely she wouldn't fall for a good-for-nothing loser, right?]","The Qin family members suddenly sat up straight. That's right, this was the most baffling part. How could such a good girl be so blind?","Surely it wasn't just for one meal? It couldn't be that simple!","They were unwilling to believe that Qin Rong was truly brainless.","[Cheng Miao is very clever, never actively promoting Cheng Yue, but because this undercover best friend was around, Cheng Yue could fake all his hobbies, habits, and style. Every smile, every move was designed to make Qin Rong fall for him.]","[Take that meal for example. Qin Rong was probably marveling at how attentive Cheng Yue was, knowing her tastes so well. He knew nothing! It was all planned and orchestrated by Cheng Miao, with Cheng Yue passively cooperating. That's why his emotions were so unstable; there were many things he had to humble himself to do that he was unwilling to.]","[Qin Rong probably never imagined that those sleepless nights, those passionate and loving text messages that kept her awake, were actually Cheng Miao chatting on Cheng Yue's phone, easily worming her way into Qin Rong's heart.]","[Living together but in separate rooms wasn't out of respect for her either. It was because Cheng Miao wouldn't allow it. Although she found this sister-in-law herself, she still couldn't bear to see them together, so she threw tantrums to make Cheng Yue promise not to touch Qin Rong until she went abroad.]","[This woman is quite formidable in a way, wanting to have both career and love. On one hand, she's tricking Qin Rong to give her the spot and sponsor her studies abroad; on the other hand, she's trying to secure Cheng Yue and Qin Rong's marriage. After all, compared to other unknown women, Qin Rong will always be too brainless to become an obstacle in her and Cheng Yue's illicit relationship.]","[In Cheng Miao's eyes, Qin Rong carries the dual buffs of 'scapegoat' and 'ticket abroad'.]","[Tsk tsk tsk, what a twisted and perverted psychology, as if getting together with her own brother behind her best friend's back was somehow thrilling.]","After hearing this, the Qin family members were beyond furious. Everything had been a scam targeting Qin Rong.","These siblings had some nerve, treating Qin Rong like a fool.","This just goes to show, be careful when choosing a boyfriend, and be even more careful when choosing friends!","Qin's Father said with a gloomy face, \"Qin Rong, your friend wants to leave. Are you going to let her go?\"","Cheng Miao was stunned. What did he mean? Surely they couldn't stop her from leaving?","But when she turned her head, she saw Qin Rong's blood-red eyes, her pupils shaking, her head shaking slightly as if unable to accept something, constantly in self-denial.","Cheng Miao inexplicably felt afraid and couldn't help but try to pull her hand away.","\"Rong Rong, my brother wouldn't cook for anyone else, he only cooks for you, so don't try to make things difficult for him... It's an insult to your relationship... I'll, I'll come see you another time.\"","With that, she actually broke free and ran.","Qin Zhao angrily jumped up but was stopped by Qin Xian. Qin Xian directly said to Qin Rong, \"We suspect you've been deceived from beginning to end. You don't want to admit it?\"","All color had drained from Qin Rong's face. Her unfocused eyes swept across everyone, then she silently walked back to her room step by step.","The other Qin family members knew what Qin Rong was struggling with.","They had initially struggled too, because all the truth just revealed was merely Ji Fei's statement, without any evidence to prove it, unless they caught them in the act or those two confessed themselves.","So it was hard for Qin Rong to accept defeat, but was she really unwavering?","At least Ji Fei couldn't resist. She deliberately ordered the three dishes and soup from the chain restaurant, had them replated, and told Auntie that she personally cooked it for her unhappy fourth sister.","Auntie praised her repeatedly, and while others who saw it would also compliment her, their expressions were quite peculiar.","Three days later, Qin Rong ran away from the estate.","It's unclear whether it was the three dishes and soup that triggered her, or if her mind still wasn't clear and she wanted to elope with someone.","But looking at the surveillance footage, with no one there to meet her, it clearly wasn't an elopement.","The Qin family quickly located Qin Rong's position but didn't immediately apprehend her.","They wanted to see exactly what Qin Rong was going to do."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Still Expecting to Fool Someone into Giving Money","paragraphs":["In a parking lot of an ordinary residential complex, Qin's Father, Qin's Mom, Qin Xian who had rushed back temporarily, and Ji Fei who wanted to witness the drama firsthand, were all sitting in a car together.","They could see Qin Rong's silhouette standing behind the entrance of a nearby building, seemingly waiting for someone.","\"Is she here to find Cheng Yue again?\" Qin's Father and Qin's Mom couldn't hide the disappointment in their eyes.","Seeing this, Qin Xian slowly said, \"Perhaps she's here to confront him, or to make a final break.\"","Indeed, Qin Rong's expression no longer seemed to be one of longing for love, but rather one of cold determination.","Between the parking lot and the residential area, a group of elderly men and women were gathered, gossiping with increasingly loud voices. True to their reputation as the neighborhood's strongest intelligence network, no family's affairs could escape their eyes.","Bored with waiting, Ji Fei started listening to their casual chatter.","But in the next moment, the atmosphere in the car became tense, as the topic of their gossip turned to Qin Rong.","Qin Rong seemed to sense something and looked up towards the gossip center.","\"What? Cheng Yue's Mother really said that?\"","\"Of course! She said earlier that marriage wasn't certain yet, and living together wasn't a big deal. Her precious son needed to find a woman to entertain himself before getting married, and she didn't care what kind of woman he brought home.\"","\"What arrogance! Any girl who ends up with her son would be truly unfortunate.\"","\"If you ask me, a girl who casually cohabits with a man is degrading herself, shameless. If she doesn't respect herself, why should others respect her?\"","\"Oh my, what times we're living in...\"","These words caused the faces of the Qin family in the car to darken. Although they knew such rumors were inevitable, actually hearing them was still deeply painful.","Ji Fei narrowed her eyes as she looked at Qin Rong, thinking that her expression now must be completely different from when she had spoken similar words to her family before.","\"But didn't Cheng Yue's Mother seem quite close with the girl when she visited last time? She treated her like a precious daughter.\"","\"Ah, that was all an act. As soon as the girl left, she started boasting to us.\" The speaker then imitated Cheng Yue's Mother in a mocking tone.","\"She's a young lady from a wealthy family, so smitten with my Cheng Yue that she chased after him and insisted on living with us. I say, so what if she's a young lady? In the future, she'll still have to serve our family. Otherwise, I wouldn't even let her through our door.\"","The others burst into laughter, unclear whether they were mocking the foolish young lady or the boastful Cheng Yue's Mother.","\"Cheng Yue's Mother even bragged to us that they would be married soon, because the girl couldn't wait and was afraid her boyfriend might be snatched away. Why else would she come to live with them and keep an eye on him?\"","\"Her son can't tell grains apart and is lazy in all respects. Apart from his good looks, he's idle all day, with unrealistic ambitions. Who would be interested in him?\"","\"Exactly! She even boasted that her son has abilities, and that when they marry that girl, they won't need to pay a single penny in bride price. She claimed the girl is the one pursuing her son, and to ensure her son treats the girl well, the girl's family might even give a substantial dowry.\"","\"Oh, I know about this. I heard from Cheng Yue's sister last time that the girl's family not only has to support his sister's studies abroad but also buy Cheng Yue a car, a house, and find him a job!\"","\"They must be dreaming. Do they think other families are fools?\"","\"It's hard to say. After all, they're already living together before marriage. She's not worth much anymore. If word gets out, it would be like a second marriage for her if she tries to find someone else. If she accidentally gets pregnant, her family might have to grit their teeth and accept this marriage.\"","Unexpectedly, after just three weeks of cohabitation, so many rumors had spread, actively propagated by Cheng Yue's Mother and Cheng Miao.","They probably wanted to ruin Qin Rong's reputation. If she were to elope as well, and if Qin Rong were any more confused, she would truly find herself in an inescapable situation.","Ji Fei turned her head to see Qin's Mom already holding back tears, with Qin's Father embracing her for comfort. \"It's all my fault for not strictly disciplining Qin Rong, allowing her to grow up so naive and innocent,\" he said.","\"No, it's my fault. I protected her too much. It's all my mistake,\" Qin's Mom said, her voice choked with emotion.","Qin Xian frowned slightly, \"This isn't your fault. People need to experience things to grow.\"","The Qin family had provided them with abundant material conditions. They hadn't experienced the hardships of life, had always been coddled by the outside world, and their family was internally harmonious. Naturally, they were prone to being taken advantage of in interpersonal relationships.","Ji Fei didn't know what to say either, so she just said, \"Fortunately, Qin Rong seems to have woken up.\"","Although in Ji Fei's view, the condition for Qin Rong's awakening was merely that the other party refused to stoop to cooking a meal at the Qin family home, or perhaps she had discovered the secret of that meal? She probably hadn't suspected anything else.","As soon as Ji Fei finished speaking, three pairs of eyes turned to look at her, their expressions noticeably softening.","\"What's wrong?\" Ji Fei asked, puzzled.","Suddenly, Qin Xian said, \"Rong Rong has left.\"","Ji Fei turned to look, and indeed saw Qin Rong answering a phone call and then running off in a hurry.","The driver quickly followed, and they soon arrived back at the school.","[Oh, so the scumbag's family is all at the school. They're accompanying Cheng Miao to handle the paperwork for her exchange student program. But they need to pay in advance, and the Cheng couple, with their ordinary jobs, can't afford it unless they sell their house. So Cheng Miao was counting on Qin Rong to swipe her card. They just didn't expect it would take until today to contact Qin Rong. Are they in a rush to get Qin Rong to pay now?]","The Qin family's faces darkened, and they silently vowed that if Qin Rong continued to be confused, they would break their daughter's legs on the spot.","Soon, Qin Rong rushed into the office, only to find a family of three.","She had personally hosted the Cheng couple before.","\"Rong Rong, you're here!\" Cheng Yue's Mother was the first to greet her.","But as Qin Rong thought about how Cheng Yue's Mother had spoken about her behind her back while pretending to be close, she felt nauseous.","She avoided Cheng Yue's Mother's attempt to hold her hand and walked towards Cheng Miao.","\"Rong Rong, I was worried you wouldn't be able to come,\" Cheng Miao said, acting as if the events of that day had never happened, and quickly tried to manipulate Qin Rong: \"Rong Rong, it's urgent. Can you help me? I've got everything ready, I just need a bit of money. Can you cover it for me first, and I'll pay you back later.\"","The staff members handling the paperwork couldn't help but exchange glances when they heard this.","After all, Qin Rong had given up her spot for love, passing it on to her boyfriend's sister, and now she was even being asked to pay the fees. They couldn't help but think this girl must be out of her mind.","That kind of look had never registered with Qin Rong before, but this time she caught it clearly, seeing the disdain and mockery in others' eyes.","Qin Rong felt like she could barely breathe.","\"Where's Cheng Yue?\" Qin Rong asked, suppressing her nausea.","Cheng Miao thought Qin Rong was acting strange, not even calling Cheng Yue 'brother' as usual.","But she still replied, \"He just heard you were coming and realized you probably haven't had lunch at this hour, so he went home to cook for you. He'll bring it over later. After all, it takes quite some time here, and brother said he couldn't let you go hungry.\"","She then lowered her voice and whispered in Qin Rong's ear, \"See? My brother is willing to cook for you anytime, but you can't be foolish and think of making him cook for your family. That would be too disrespectful to my brother.\"","As soon as Cheng Miao finished speaking, she saw Qin Rong glaring at her fiercely, with an expression that looked like she wanted to pounce and bite her to death, causing Cheng Miao to take a step back involuntarily.","Meanwhile, the Qin family group of four was walking towards the office building when they suddenly saw a man carrying something quickly enter the corridor.","Upon closer inspection, he had a decent appearance.","\"Oh?\" Ji Fei exclaimed.","\"What's wrong?\" Qin Xian asked.","[Ah, it really is Cheng Yue! The scumbag has finally shown his face.]"]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: The Water in the Brain Has Dried Up","paragraphs":["\"Rong Rong, what's wrong?\"","\"I won't lend you money. Don't even think about getting that spot,\" Qin Rong suddenly said coldly.","Cheng Miao's face changed dramatically. \"Rong Rong, what do you mean?\"","Cheng's Father and Cheng's Mother immediately became anxious.","Cheng's Father frowned and said, \"Aren't you my son's girlfriend? And my daughter's best friend? What's wrong with helping out? Why are you speaking so harshly? If we had time to gather the money ourselves, we wouldn't need to ask you. It's not like we won't pay you back!\"","He then looked at Cheng's Mother with displeasure and said, \"And she still wants to marry our son?\"","Cheng's Mother also said unhappily, \"Rong Rong, we've been treating you like family. Are you throwing a tantrum because Cheng Yue hasn't visited you lately? You should consider your family's attitude too. Your family doesn't respect us, so of course my son can't go there. Even if you want to throw a fit, you shouldn't sabotage Cheng Miao at such a crucial time. And you call yourself her best friend!\"","Cheng's Mother finished with a slight smirk, \"It's fine to make a fuss at other times, but not now when it's so urgent.\"","She thought she could easily manipulate a woman who moved in with her son after less than a week of dating.","Cheng's Mother had already started putting on airs like a domineering mother-in-law.","Qin Rong looked at Cheng's Mother with a stiff expression. Though she couldn't manage a truly fierce look, her face was somewhat contorted.","\"Your son is trash, and my family treats him accordingly. He doesn't deserve respect from my family.\"","Upon hearing this, the three members of the Cheng family were stunned.","Cheng Miao looked at Qin Rong in disbelief, trying to grab her sleeve, but she shook him off. \"I came here today to break up with Cheng Yue and take back my paintings from his rental apartment. I'm not here to be your scapegoat.\"","She almost shouted these words, loud enough for the entire office and even the corridor to hear.","The four members of the Qin family, who had just stepped out of the elevator, also heard it.","They all froze in place.","[Oh my, has the water in her brain finally drained?]","The Qin family members' faces immediately lit up. It was the first time they had heard Qin Rong shout like that.","But soon their hearts were in their throats because Cheng Yue had just stepped through the door.","They quickly followed him.","\"Rong Rong, what are you saying?\" Cheng Yue asked, suppressing his anger.","Qin Rong finally saw Cheng Yue. In the past, she thought his looks were roguishly handsome and very cool. The fact that such a free-spirited person seemed to be completely devoted to her made her feel incredibly happy.","But now, in Qin Rong's eyes, he was just an ill-mannered, rude, and arrogant little hooligan!","She knew she had been too caught up before, as if under a spell. But that night, when a series of messages shattered her world, she came to her senses and realized that everything had been predictable. She had been so stupid. All those things that had attracted her were just layers of filters she had added herself.","She had thrown away her future and ruined her prospects for this piece of trash. She was disgusted with herself for being so foolish.","Looking back now, she must have been bewitched. How could she have fallen for such a repulsive creature? The very thought made her want to vomit.","Cheng Yue saw that Qin Rong was just staring at him intently without speaking, and he didn't know what to say. After all, throughout their relationship, he had always been in a dominant position, at most just teasing Qin Rong a bit. He had never been gentle or considerate.","He glanced at Cheng Miao, who quickly gave him a meaningful look, hinting that he should try to pacify her.","Remembering what Qin Rong had said earlier, if he couldn't smooth things over now, the money for Cheng Miao's overseas trip would be a problem.","Cheng Yue felt a bit impatient but still held up the lunch box he was carrying. \"Here, don't be angry. You must be hungry. I made this for you. Eat something first, then we'll talk.\"","Every time he used this trick, it would remind Qin Rong of how he had saved her before, and she would forget all her worries and continue to stay obediently by his side.","This time, Qin Rong did take the lunch box, but before anyone could react, she opened the lid, raised her arm, and smashed the box right into Cheng Yue's face.","As the food splattered, she even ground it in a bit.","A scream of pain echoed throughout the entire floor, attracting even more onlookers eager for drama.","\"Ahh!!!\" Cheng Yue screamed, frantically trying to wipe the scalding food off his face.","The Cheng family was completely stunned, frozen in place.","Cheng Yue, unable to control his temper due to the pain, reflexively revealed his true nature and raised his hand to strike.","But just as his hand was about to come down, it was caught by an iron-like grip.","Before Cheng Yue could see who it was, he was kicked away. With a muffled groan, he fell to the ground.","When he looked up, he saw an imposing couple standing behind Qin Rong. The person who had kicked him looked familiar, as Cheng Yue had surely done some basic research on his potential backers before going to the Qin Corporation.","Now, with this backer standing before him, exuding an aura of authority, and sweeping a cold gaze over him, Cheng Yue's legs began to shake uncontrollably. He couldn't even stand up.","In an instant, all of Cheng Yue's temper vanished. He knew well enough which people he couldn't afford to offend.","The Cheng family quickly rushed over to help Cheng Yue up. Cheng's Mother, looking at her precious son with heartache, was the first to start shouting.","\"How dare you use violence! All of you are so ill-mannered! My son made that meal out of kindness...\"","\"Ahem, that plastic bag holding the lunch box seems to be from a chain restaurant,\" Ji Fei, leaning against the doorway, began to muse aloud. \"Ah, not long ago when my little sister had no appetite, I tried to cheer her up by saying I'd cook for her myself. But knowing my terrible cooking skills, I ended up ordering takeout from this very restaurant and pretended I made it. Looks like your son and I had the same idea. Though he's quite stupid, isn't he? If you're going to pretend, at least change the packaging.\"","This comment made the surrounding onlookers burst into laughter.","Cheng's Mother's face immediately turned red. Of course, she knew it was takeout, but she hadn't expected to be exposed on the spot. Still, she stubbornly insisted, \"We... we were just reusing the bag.\"","\"Your mouth is harder than a duck that's been dead for days. Should I call the restaurant right now and order something to compare?\" Ji Fei continued with a smile.","\"You... what business is it of yours?\" Cheng's Mother shouted angrily.","Cheng Miao awkwardly pulled at his mother's hand. \"Stop arguing. They're Qin Rong's family too!\"","Cheng's Mother was immediately silenced.","Cheng Miao figured that Qin Rong must have gotten angry because Ji Fei had accidentally exposed the lie about the food.","\"Rong Rong, even if my brother lied about cooking for you, his feelings for you are real. After all, you've been living together. You should be able to feel that, right?\"","Hearing this, Ji Fei quickly took out her phone and started recording.","Her action triggered a chain reaction, with many in the crowd of onlookers following suit.","Ji Fei wasn't doing this to keep any dirt on Qin Rong, but rather out of concern for potential rumors. Now that Qin Rong had come to her senses, she could clarify everything later. But without complete video evidence, given how prone Cheng Miao and his mother were to spreading rumors, who knows what trouble they might cause?","Although the Qin family wasn't afraid, it would still be unpleasant. So Ji Fei decided to harness the power of the crowd. With multiple videos, it would be difficult for the Cheng family to twist the story later.","However, Ji Fei never expected Qin Rong to start with such an explosive statement.","\"Living together? You mean tricking me into being your brother's maid, taking care of him, but not allowing us to have a romantic relationship?\"","The crowd was shocked, embarrassed, at a loss, curious, and hungry for gossip.","Cheng's parents didn't know what was going on, while Cheng Yue and Cheng Miao were dumbfounded, staring at Qin Rong. They couldn't believe that someone like Qin Rong would dare to speak so directly.","Qin Rong stepped forward, glaring fiercely at the two of them. \"And then, you two were fooling around behind my back! You're disgusting!\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Are You Ready to Pursue the Challenge to the End","paragraphs":["A sentence exploded like earth-shattering thunder, stunning everyone present. Inside and outside the office, you could hear a pin drop as all stood frozen in place.","What had they just heard?","Chaos? Disgusting? Them?","\"Them\" referred to Cheng Yue and Cheng Miao - weren't they siblings?","Everyone's skin instantly broke out in goosebumps as they all stared in disbelief at the family of four.","Faced with Qin Rong's accusation, Cheng Yue and Cheng Miao's minds first went blank. Then they felt the scorching gazes that seemed to burn like the fires of hell.","\"What nonsense are you spouting? Have you gone mad? I get it, you're insanely jealous, even of siblings. You must have some delusional disorder,\" Cheng Miao's expression was panicked yet ferocious.","Cheng Yue's face turned ashen as he immediately shouted, \"Qin Rong, if you keep this up, we're breaking up!\"","\"Hah, I was going to break up with you anyway. Just looking at you makes me sick now. Jealous? As if you're worth it. You're just sewer roaches, forever tangled together. Wait for the sun to come out and incinerate your filthy selves to ashes!\" Qin Rong roared, her eyes blazing red, as if trying to expel all her pent-up anger.","[My goodness, she really is a steel-toothed little bunny. When she loses it, she really knows how to curse. Look at that, Cheng Yue and Cheng Miao are dumbstruck. They probably never imagined that when pushed to the brink, even a nice person can go wild in a way they can't control.]","It wasn't just them who were stunned. The Qin family also looked at Qin Rong in shock, never expecting their daughter to become like this.","Cheng's Father and Cheng's Mother's expressions flickered with doubt for an instant, but they quickly united against the outsider.","\"You little girl, your mouth is spewing filth, spreading baseless rumors. How dare you make up such things? Be careful, or we'll sue you!\"","\"She's gone mad, absolutely mad. How can you throw such dirty water on our clean, upstanding family? You're trying to use rumors to destroy our children!\"","The onlookers also regained their senses.","\"If this is slander, it's going too far. How can you say such things about siblings? It's an absurd accusation no matter how you look at it.\"","\"Come to think of it, some girlfriends get jealous even if there's a female mosquito near their boyfriend. Considering the crazy things Qin Rong has done for her boyfriend before, I suspect she might get jealous over anything.\"","\"Maybe the siblings just have a good relationship, and she's making a scene out of jealousy!\"","[This is bad. If things continue like this, everyone will think Qin Rong has gone mad. Whatever she says after this will lose credibility. But how did Qin Rong find out about this?]","Qin Rong's parents grew anxious. They knew Qin Rong was saying this because she had heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts, but they couldn't reveal Ji Fei's situation in this setting.","However, if they didn't provide some explanation, everyone would think Qin Rong was mentally ill.","Just as the Cheng family seemed to be regaining confidence, Qin Xian's deep voice cut through: \"You're a blended family. They know they're not blood-related. Haven't you noticed anything strange? Why did the brother have to rent an apartment near his sister when she started university? The brother doesn't even have a proper job, so why doesn't he live with his parents to save money?\"","In one statement, he laid out the cause, the logic, the suspicious points, and guided everyone's speculation. The situation instantly reversed.","Everyone felt as if their minds had been cleaved open, suddenly clear.","If they were biological siblings, everyone would instinctively think it impossible and unacceptable. But in a blended family? There had been quite a few TV dramas with such plots. Suddenly, everyone accepted the possibility of this gossip, especially after that last question.","\"That's right, why move close to his sister? I have an older brother, and he doesn't look after me like that! Being too close actually feels restrictive!\"","\"Are they trying to do something behind their parents' backs that they can't let others see?\"","\"Come to think of it, his girlfriend has been living with him for so long and nothing's happened. No wonder she's suspicious. Maybe Qin Rong saw something, that's why she's making such a scene. Who wouldn't go crazy in that situation?\"","\"I'm in the same major as them. I've never heard that they were a blended family. Cheng Miao is Qin Rong's best friend and even set her up with her brother. If things are really like this, it's absolutely disgusting. If I were Qin Rong, I'd want to stab those two scumbags to death.\"","\"Hey, tell us straight - are you a blended family or not?\" someone in the crowd couldn't help but shout.","Inside, the Cheng family of four began to look uneasy. Cheng's Mother looked at her stepdaughter Cheng Miao, while Cheng's Father stared at his stepson Cheng Yue, their expressions changing repeatedly.","Some clues began to take shape in their minds. After all, every action leaves traces, and if you don't want others to know, it's best not to do it at all.","The ones involved feared this situation the most.","\"Qin Rong, just because I won't touch you, you spread rumors about me?\" Cheng Yue, terrified, began to frantically attack Qin Rong.","Cheng Miao also started hurling accusations, \"My brother doesn't touch you out of respect for you. I never thought you'd be so impatient that you'd suspect us and even have your brother investigate our family's privacy. You really are sick!\"","Faced with their twisted expressions, Qin Rong wanted to cry and laugh at the same time. They dared not face society's judgment, yet they dared to harm others.","\"I saw it,\" Qin Rong suddenly said in her gentle voice, delivering the coldest fact.","\"I saw with my own eyes. Do you dare say you didn't do anything in the rented room where I was staying?\"","With these words, both the Cheng and Qin families were shocked.","The Qin family couldn't believe it. How could this be possible? If she had really seen something, how could she have waited until now to explode? Even if Qin Rong was naive and easily fooled, she wouldn't have reached the point of self-deception.","[She didn't actually see anything. Oh, I get it, she's bluffing them. Look at those two guilty ones, their eyes are darting around. They must be blank with panic. It seems Qin Rong's wild guess was right - they really did do something in the room where Qin Rong was staying temporarily. This... did they want to push their thrill-seeking to the limit?]","Qin Rong's eyes welled up with tears of anger.","Actually, after Ji Fei had mentioned it, she had recalled some suspicious details.","Why did she sometimes return to find things in the room slightly off? As art students, they were more sensitive to visual composition than most people.","Especially since she had decorated and cleaned that room herself, how could there be such discrepancies in the scene?","Unless someone had used the room while she was away.","Just thinking about that possibility made her want to burn the entire room down.","Because Qin Rong spoke with such certainty, and they had indeed done something, both of them short-circuited, not knowing how to refute.","Cheng's Father and Cheng's Mother's gazes towards each other's children turned fierce.","\"No! You're spreading rumors, you're talking nonsense. My brother and I are innocent. You... do you have any evidence? If not, I'll sue you! Make you pay compensation!\" Although Cheng Miao's expression had completely betrayed her, she still adamantly denied it verbally.","But by now, few believed her.","At this point, Qin Rong took out her phone and said, \"You forgot, I have a habit of recording my painting process. So I secretly installed a camera in that room. Want to see the video? I can show it to everyone!\""]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Youth is Priceless, Slap the Mouth of Scum","paragraphs":["At this moment, everyone's eyes turned excitedly towards Qin Rong's phone.","What a bombshell!","[Wait, how can she be so certain? Could it be true? I want to see, but no, what if it taints my eyes? But... I really want to look!]","The Qin family was also stunned, looking at Qin Rong in disbelief. But Qin Rong did have this habit; there were surveillance cameras in the home studio.","Cheng Miao knew about Qin Rong's habit too, but didn't expect she'd bring it to that shabby rented apartment. Seeing her light up her phone, his mind went blank with panic and he lunged forward to snatch it.","Qin Xian stepped in front of Cheng Miao to block him, while Cheng Yue seized the opportunity to rush towards Qin Rong and grab for the phone.","In the next second, Qin Rong suddenly retracted her hand and with her other hand swung in a wide arc, delivering a resounding slap to Cheng Yue's face.","Cheng Yue, all bark and no bite, staggered from the blow. Before he could react, Qin Rong followed up with another backhand slap.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Qin Xian was so shocked he forgot to intervene, allowing Cheng Miao to lunge forward, shouting, \"How dare you hit my brother!\"","The result was two more loud slaps, one forward and one backward.","Everyone: ... Qin... Miss Qin... the campus beauty... the naive sweetheart who got deceived... the delicate flower... had just delivered four earth-shatteringly loud slaps.","Looking at the red marks on Cheng Yue and Cheng Miao's faces, everyone fell silent.","[... Being cheated on really does make people grow up. Youth has no price tag, but slapping scumbags is priceless! Thumbs up to you.]","Even Ji Fei couldn't help but applaud Qin Rong, and others soon followed suit, with some whistling and cheering, \"Well done!\"","When the two scumbags finally looked at Qin Rong in a daze,","Qin Rong smiled, a mix of sorrow and mockery: \"I was bluffing. Thank you for proving your guilt.\"","This sentence set off another round of thunderous laughter from the crowd.","The two, now looking like jumping clowns, glared at Qin Rong with venom in their eyes. They seemed ready for revenge, but before they could act, two people behind them rushed forward.","Cheng's Father landed a punch on his stepson's face, then began kicking him furiously.","\"Damn it, you dare mess with my daughter! I brought you and your mother into our home, and this is how you repay me! You ungrateful bastards!\"","Cheng's Mother had grabbed her stepdaughter's hair and was slapping her repeatedly.","\"You little slut, you must have seduced my son. Otherwise, how could he do such a thing? It's all your fault, you shameless thing, just like your birth mother! You've brought great shame to our family!\"","\"Dad, stop hitting my brother. Brother, save me.\"","\"Mom, stop hitting my woman! Let go, you old fart!\"","The four of them were almost tangled together.","In an instant, the family of four that had just been united against outsiders was now in utter chaos.","The Qin family quickly moved to protect Qin Rong, retreating to avoid getting splashed with any filth.","However, the office staff had to intervene, despite wanting to continue watching the drama unfold. If someone got seriously hurt, they would be the ones in trouble.","\"This is the office for exchange student procedures. If you don't have the money, go raise it. The deadline is 6 pm tonight. Don't cause trouble here, or I'll call security,\" the staff member sternly rebuked.","This statement brought the family back to reality.","\"I get it now, you were just using my son, making him help you scam an opportunity to study abroad and the funds for it. You can't go now, can you? Keep dreaming!\"","\"Who says she can't go? We'll sell the house when we get back! My daughter is leaving, getting far away from your son, to avoid being coveted by that little beast!\"","\"You can't! That house was promised to my son! He's supposed to take care of you in your old age! If you use it for your daughter, she'll fly away, who will you rely on then?\"","\"At least she's my own flesh and blood! Unlike your son who wants my money and won't leave my daughter alone! So greedy!\"","The parents started arguing. Cheng Yue watched with an irritated expression, not bothering to intervene even as his parents looked ready to come to blows.","Cheng Miao was the most anxious. Looking around helplessly, she finally glared viciously at Qin Rong.","Suddenly, Qin Rong took out her phone and typed a message, then signaled for Cheng Miao to look at it.","Cheng Miao frowned suspiciously, lowered her head to check, and her face changed dramatically upon reading.","\"Actually, your brother secretly met with me several times behind your back, and told me not to tell you.\"","Ji Fei happened to be standing right behind Qin Rong and saw the message content. She pondered it for a moment, then looked at Cheng Miao and Cheng Yue.","Cheng Miao, her face pale, went to pull Cheng Yue's hand and said, \"Brother, no matter what, let me go abroad first. If I stay here, we'll both be constantly pointed at and gossiped about. This opportunity is hard to come by, please stop Mom.\"","Cheng Yue snapped out of his daze, \"If you go abroad, what about me? I'll be gossiped about too, and with the house money spent on you, how will I secure my future? You're not planning to run off and leave me behind, are you?\"","\"Brother, don't you trust me? How could I possibly...\"","\"You're more cunning than anyone, how can I trust you...\"","The once loving siblings finally started arguing when faced with their own interests.","That message was the spark that made Cheng Miao doubt Cheng Yue's feelings for her, causing her to start thinking only of herself.","Ji Fei believed what Qin Rong said was true, remembering how Qin Zhao had reacted when he first saw them.","If it was just acting to help his sister, why would he behave that way when no one was watching?","This proved that Cheng Yue wasn't an honest person to begin with.","With a girlfriend like Qin Rong, whether for novelty or as a trophy, it overshadowed his feelings for Cheng Miao developed over years. He just had the desire but lacked the courage for now.","After all, how much true love could such a despicable person really have?","Finally, the staff couldn't take it anymore and called security to escort them out.","This farce finally came to an end.","Qin Rong still had paintings left in the rented apartment. At first, Cheng Yue tried to play dirty and refuse to return them, but Qin Xian immediately called the police. With the police there, there was no dispute over the ownership of the items.","In the end, Qin Rong cried all the way home in the car, holding her paintings.","Meanwhile, the Cheng family got into a physical fight. In the end, Cheng's Father, his face covered in scratches, sold the house at a loss to secure his daughter's chance to go abroad.","Cheng Miao swore that as soon as she started studying, she would begin selling paintings and definitely repay her father.","Cheng's Father was looking forward to her becoming a great artist, while Cheng's Mother and Cheng Yue became enemies with them but had to helplessly accept reality.","However, the next day, Cheng Miao received a call. The foreign school had suddenly decided to reduce the number of spots, and since she was the last one accepted, her offer was rescinded. The money would be returned.","For the Cheng family, this was like a bolt from the blue.","They couldn't buy back their house at the original price, and the remaining money could only buy a small, old apartment for a family of four.","Cheng's Mother and Cheng Yue were secretly gloating, outwardly arguing, but their joy was short-lived. Cheng Yue ran into some thugs and was beaten badly. The medical bills ate up a lot of money.","In the end, they couldn't even afford the small, old apartment. The whole family was crammed together, arguing every day.","Cheng Miao wanted to return to school, but the video of that day had already spread all over the campus forum. Everyone at school knew about her sordid affair.","Unable to bear people's strange looks, she had to drop out.","In the end, no one knew where the family moved to.","When Qin Zhao told Qin Rong about this, she was still in a daze from all the tragic experiences. After hearing it, she couldn't help but ask, \"Is this really karma?\"","Qin Zhao was about to nod when he heard Ji Fei's inner voice.","[Of course not. It was your father and brothers acting as agents of justice. Should good people like the Qin family suffer at the hands of such scoundrels? That would be too unfair. Power should be used when it's needed, to teach them a lesson about how high the sky is.]","Qin Rong paused for a moment, then finally smiled.","That evening, she went downstairs to have dinner with everyone. After the meal, facing her family, she bowed deeply to apologize, repenting for her foolishness.","Ji Fei's comment on this was: [When she was love-struck, it was truly infuriating, almost wanted to send her to dig wild vegetables. But she sobered up quickly too, I guess she can be taught after all.]","The Qin family members fake-coughed to cover their embarrassment.","Qin Rong, however, looked at her second sister-in-law, who had saved her, with stars in her eyes.","Later, she secretly asked her second brother,","\"I want to thank second sister-in-law. Do you know what she likes?\"","Qin Xian was about to say it wasn't necessary, because for saving the fourth sister, his family had already found various reasons to send red envelopes to Ji Fei. He felt that if this continued, Ji Fei would soon have enough for the two hundred million divorce settlement.","Fortunately, all the money had been transferred to him.","But then he heard Qin Rong muttering to herself: \"I know that in the past, second sister-in-law was very infatuated with you, so anything related to you would have been fine as a gift. But now it seems that's no longer the case. Second sister-in-law has changed a lot.\"","Qin Xian: ?","...It felt like an arrow to the knee.","Was she even his real sister?","\"What should I get her?\" Qin Rong hadn't realized she had inadvertently stabbed her second brother.","So when she couldn't find an answer from her second brother, she felt puzzled.","She turned to ask her eldest sister and got the correct answer: Second sister-in-law doesn't like second brother anymore, she likes money now.","Qin Rong, who had just experienced the baptism of dark love, expressed: Second sister-in-law has great wisdom.","Qin Yan, who was now doing well in her career, also nodded in agreement.","Then Ji Fei received a bank transfer.","With a message attached: Thankfully, second sister-in-law ordered takeout for me to wake me up. This is my heartfelt gesture, thank you second sister-in-law.","The amount was over two million."]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: Why shouldn't a laid-back life count as a dream","paragraphs":["At this moment, Ji Fei was in Qin Xian's study, looking at the investment returns report he had brought back. Although she didn't really understand it, she pretended to supervise anyway.","While supposedly examining the report, her gaze had already drifted elsewhere.","The white bathrobe was slightly open, and the light from the crystal chandelier spread across the clearly defined muscle lines. The chest muscles, suppressing some kind of strength, rose and fell with each breath. His brow and hair, dampened by moisture, were like ink paintings. His profile, encircled by light, seemed as if through a filter.","[Oh my, what a tempting sight! How does the CEO always have this lazy yet refined beauty when he takes off his suit? I'm less and less inclined to divorce him. It's nice just to have him here to look at!]","Qin Xian's originally contented expression suddenly froze. Why was she thinking about divorce again?","[But in two months, his First Love will be coming back. Then it'll be all kinds of push and pull, ambiguity, her feeling wronged, him misunderstanding, her suffering, him being reluctant to let go. And I'll be stuck in the middle as a prop for their drama. It's fun to watch other people's drama, but I don't want to be part of it myself.]","Qin Xian took a deep breath! He really wanted to grab Ji Fei's head and tell her: Stop your divergent thinking.","Where did she get all this from? Couldn't she just check his memories?","Yes, Yu Zhi was his first love, but she wasn't his First Love at all!","They just admired each other in college. Yu Zhi pursued him, and he didn't dislike her, so they naturally started dating.","Because he was very slow to warm up emotionally and didn't particularly like intimate behavior, during their years of dating, apart from spending every day together in class, self-study, and academic activities, they didn't even share one passionate lover's kiss.","But he had seen Yu Zhi hint to others about how sweet their relationship was.","Secretary Jin heard a lot about it at that time, and the whole school ate up their 'couple candy'. It made it seem like they were deeply in love, when in fact, they weren't at all.","Later, when Yu Zhi suddenly said she wanted to break up and go abroad, he very naturally accepted it and wished her well.","He hadn't dated anyone since then because he was too busy taking over the family business. A CEO doesn't have time for romance every day.","But everyone assumed it was because he couldn't get over his First Love, which wasn't true at all.","Strictly speaking, he didn't even know if what they had could be considered true love, especially after seeing a few of his brothers and sisters act foolishly for love. It made him even more doubtful.","Of course, given Qin Xian's personality, he couldn't bring himself to grab Ji Fei's little ears and strictly emphasize his situation to her.","He always felt that Ji Fei was so gossipy, she would discover it on her own someday. Then she would be assured that he would never divorce her for an outsider, and she would be content being Mrs. Qin. Finally, they could... seriously work on their marriage.","For instance, he was now following his parents' advice, learning to indulge Ji Fei's little hobbies when they were alone, to cultivate their relationship.","But this girl mostly just irritated him.","Actually, Ji Fei was quite wronged. She wasn't a privacy invader. Unless there was some juicy gossip, she would only pry a little. Otherwise, she wouldn't delve too deeply into anything.","After all, Qin Xian was just an acquaintance who happened to fit her aesthetic tastes. At most, he could barely be considered a friend. They were bound to divorce sooner or later.","If she understood too much, what if she actually developed feelings? That would be troublesome, after all, she did acknowledge Qin Xian's personal charm.","Ji Fei was used to living alone before. She was a person who knew how to protect herself and avoid risks. So it was hard for her to truly care for someone, otherwise she wouldn't have remained single in her past life.","Just as Ji Fei couldn't resist the urge to reach out and poke someone's abs, her phone vibrated.","\"Huh? Why does it feel like my recent financial luck is a bit unreasonable? Just because I ordered takeout, it's worth this much? Why are there even odd and even numbers?\"","Ji Fei instinctively showed the phone screen to Qin Xian.","Qin Xian raised an eyebrow slightly, \"She probably gave you all the change she had on hand. She's going to focus on painting at home to prepare for the exam during this time, so she won't need it. It's a way of eliminating her distractions, I suppose.\"","\"That's so embarrassing!\"","\"She said it's her goodwill, so just accept it.\"","Ji Fei happily replied with a 'Thank you, rich lady' sticker. Then she turned and transferred most of it to Qin Xian.","Hearing the phone notification, Qin Xian's lips curled slightly, the anger stirred up by that annoying person earlier had disappeared without a trace.","\"Qin Rong is quite principled. She could have begged you for a chance to get her spot back. But she chose to rely on her own abilities to take the exam,\" Ji Fei said.","Qin Rong felt that losing her spot meant it was really gone, that was the punishment for her foolishness. But now that she had come to her senses, she wouldn't easily give up on her dream.","Without a guaranteed spot, she chose to take the exam herself, determined to enter her dream art academy.","Even if the process was a hundred times harder, she was unwilling to give up.","\"It might not be a bad thing for her. The added difficulty will make her cherish it more, preventing her from being fooled by some punk again in the future,\" Qin Xian said, then added with a faint smile, \"I believe she has the potential, because she truly loves painting.\"","After Ji Fei went back, she couldn't help but think that everyone seemed to have their own dreams. In comparison, could her lack of dreams be related to not having money before and being too caught up in just surviving?","If she had been born rich, would she also have something she really wanted to accomplish?","Maybe she should also try to enrich herself and search for her own dream, after all, she had a bit of assets now.","A few days later.","[No, I regret it. Why can't a life of lying flat be considered a dream? I just want to strive to lie flat!]","As the studio's relocation approached, Gao Hao finally remembered Ji Fei.","So Ji Fei was dragged off by Qin Zhao and Gao Hao to the studio to arrange various courses, trying to disguise Ji Fei as a promising artist before they left, so they could trick a capable manager to come.","According to their plan, they would first trick someone into coming, then promise a high salary, and give them the authority to recruit other artists, maintaining the studio. This way, Ji Fei could continue to slack off in their own studio.","Ji Fei endured it for three hard days. On the fourth day, at 8 AM - 8 AM! Before the blissful second sleep could even begin! - she was again woken up by Qin Zhao's door-knocking.","Sitting down for breakfast, Ji Fei was already lost in thought, once again repenting for ever thinking of giving up her wonderful life of idleness.","Why couldn't she spend her whole life in debauchery and slacking off?","Now she was considering simply giving up on making money in the entertainment industry.","After finishing her self-deprecation, she looked up and realized that only Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were at the table. Qin Xian and Qin Yan seemed to have gotten up at 6 AM.","Hmm... More excellent than ordinary people and working harder than ordinary people, no wonder they're rich!","Qin Rong hurriedly finished eating, said goodbye, and ran off to seclude herself in the art studio.","\"Eat faster, we're just waiting for you,\" Qin Zhao said, exasperated at seeing her chew one bite of salad for ages, looking like she wanted to fall asleep on the table.","Ji Fei had no outlet for her frustration. Suddenly remembering something, she asked, \"Strange, why are you here today?\""]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: These melons, if not eaten on the spot, I will regret for a lifetime","paragraphs":["\"What?\" Qin Zhao seemed to be texting, answering absentmindedly.","Ji Fei asked with a sly smile, \"Isn't today the day Xinyue leaves? Didn't you go to the airport to see her off?\"","Without looking up, Qin Zhao replied, \"Their flight was at 6 AM. I came back after seeing them off and then called you.\"","Ji Fei was surprised, \"You actually went to see her off?\"","During this period, Qin Zhao hadn't openly sought out Chu Xinyue, except for adding a new moon icon after his name on his official Weibo account. He had been focusing solely on executing his plan to shift his work priorities.","But Ji Fei knew he had secretly gone to see Chu Xinyue, though he never dared to show himself.","[Oh, so he went to see her off secretly, and even cowardly used the company's name to upgrade their entire group to first class.]","Qin Zhao rolled his eyes. She already knew, so why ask? Just trying to poke at his heartstrings!","[Then he watched Chu Xinyue's cold demeanor from afar and saw her genuine smile, knowing she was truly happy to leave everything behind. His heart shattered, and he ran to the bathroom to wipe away...]","\"Ahem! Are you done yet? Don't try to weasel out of your lessons!\" Qin Zhao interrupted.","Qin Zhao: Shut up, you're going to crush my heart into pieces.","[Oh my, he's getting agitated! He must have remembered something heartbreaking. I heard he's going abroad to work behind the scenes, but it's actually because he's afraid Xinyue might see him if he's in the spotlight. He knows she'd be uncomfortable if she found out he followed her. Isn't he overestimating himself, thinking he'll definitely become famous overseas?]","Qin Zhao: ... Damn it, can't this mouth stop? Add more lessons for her!","[But he doesn't really think his silent protection is deeply romantic, does he? If Xinyue eventually discovers he's been clinging on all this time, she probably won't be moved.]","Qin Zhao: ... He's not trying to move anyone, he just... has no other choice. His heart has already left with her. He just wants to live under the same sky, occasionally steal a glance. Otherwise, he doesn't know what to do with himself.","As Qin Zhao was lost in thought, imagining Xinyue getting further and further away from him, he felt a pain in his chest and found it hard to breathe.","At some point, Ji Fei had finished eating and come to his side to call him. She glanced down at his phone screen.","Good grief, it was filled with dense green dialogue boxes.","She accidentally caught sight of a familiar avatar - it was Chu Xinyue's.","Good morning, good afternoon, good night. What did you eat? How did you rest? Is your progress going well? A string of caring messages, along with sharing of personal feelings and outpourings of love.","[This... isn't it still harassment even if they don't meet in person?]","Ji Fei asked incredulously, \"There's not a single reply. Is it possible she's blocked you?\"","Qin Zhao snapped back to reality and turned off his phone. \"It's not hers.\"","Ji Fei: [I'm not blind, it clearly was... Huh? It really isn't... Oh crap, he's not crazy after all. He created a fake account pretending to be Xinyue and keeps sending messages to himself. Self-entertainment? You're treating it like a diary or memo pad?]","Qin Zhao turned his back to Ji Fei and walked out, his pace quickening, his expression becoming unbearably embarrassed.","He had always been an emotionally exuberant person. Even if he restrained himself from bothering her, he needed an outlet, or else he'd eventually break down and rush to harass Chu Xinyue. He had sworn never to give Chu Xinyue any more uncomfortable memories, so he could only send messages to himself, pretending they were sent.","In reality, the most he dared to do was send holiday greetings in their small group chat. He didn't even dare to contact her privately.","[Sigh, he's just another lovesick fool.]","Qin Zhao: I am not! I'm very clear-headed about what I'm doing! I'm not lovesick at all.","[No, he's not.]","Qin Zhao: See, I told you.","[Lovesick refers to those who actually have a partner. He's more like a devoted admirer. The most humble, invisible kind of admirer.]","Qin Zhao: ... Fine, I'll admire her all I want!","[Maybe when Chu Xinyue gets a partner, he'll only dare to silently wish her well, then cry in secret. It's just... karma, I suppose.]","Qin Zhao: ... I'll cry for you right now if you don't believe me!","Feeling emotionally drained, Qin Zhao led Ji Fei, the walking heartbreaker, to the studio, where they were urgently summoned by Gao Hao.","\"What's wrong?\" Qin Zhao asked the grim-faced Gao Hao.","Ji Fei sensed it probably had nothing to do with her, so she took the opportunity to sit on the sofa and catch a quick nap. She had gotten up too early.","\"Didn't you say to cancel all my work?\" Qin Zhao asked.","\"Initially, it was to help pave the way for your... ahem, so we specifically asked them to reserve a spot for us. Canceling your group was already quite troublesome. Such a big variety show project wouldn't have agreed if it weren't for the face of Qin Corporation. But who knew the list would still leak? The news that you'll be participating has already spread online to some extent. I guess the Chu family was afraid you'd misunderstand and implicate them, so they've been suppressing the trending topics and emphasizing the news of Chu Xueqi's retirement due to illness, but it hasn't been very effective.\"","\"No, we need to handle this PR issue immediately!\" Qin Zhao became anxious too.","Even though he felt that Chu Xinyue, who had gone abroad, was 100% unlikely to see the news, and even if she did, she wouldn't care - he didn't need to narcissistically fantasize - he still couldn't bear the thought of any news linking him with Chu Xueqi being released. What if she saw it... She would definitely find it disgusting.","\"Direct PR control will definitely lead to investigation. At times like this, it's better to guide than to block. We should just announce that you're participating, but not with Chu Xueqi,\" Gao Hao said, his eyes drifting towards someone who was about to fall asleep.","\"This is a good opportunity. At most, it'll delay things by two months. It not only helps you say goodbye to the domestic entertainment industry but also gives her a chance to gain exposure. It couldn't be more beneficial.\"","Gao Hao nodded, satisfied with his crisis management skills.","They were taking two-thirds of the people from this studio with them. Even if they recruited new people, others would look at the future prospects of their artists. So they still needed to give Ji Fei one big exposure.","Ji Fei, half-asleep, shuddered. She had a bad feeling. When she opened her eyes, she saw the two men looking at her, which startled her.","\"What? I'm not slacking off. I'm just waiting for instructions,\" Ji Fei said immediately.","\"There's a variety show. We want Qin Zhao to take you along to participate,\" Gao Hao said, explaining the situation.","Ji Fei blinked, \"What variety show?\"","Gao Hao answered, \"My Acting, Cut!\"","\"Is that the one that combines acting lessons, popularity competitions between teams, and has a semi-live broadcast format with various task completions?\" Ji Fei summarized.","\"Yes, it always has a steep rise in popularity during each broadcast period. It could make you famous overnight,\" Gao Hao coaxed.","\"But I don't know how to act yet,\" Ji Fei said.","\"That's why you go in to learn from various seniors. Even picking up one or two points would be immensely beneficial. You'll also get to know many seniors and build a lot of connections,\" Gao Hao explained.","Gao Hao was genuinely considering Ji Fei's future. If she wanted to occasionally slack off and make some money from time to time, it would be best to enhance her advantage in looks, becoming an actress who could easily do cameos, or occasionally take on variety shows. All of these required popularity.","\"Won't I get severely criticized?\" Ji Fei asked suspiciously.","\"The first few episodes always have complete newcomers. The audience's attitude towards newcomers is generally friendly. Even a little progress will be encouraged. Those who participated in the past have all developed well afterwards. Of course, some chose to take the controversial route and enjoyed the traffic dividends,\" Gao Hao said. \"It all depends on how you choose to present yourself. After all, there's also a live broadcast segment where there's no script. It's hard to put on an act even if you wanted to.\"","Ji Fei thought for a moment, but still shook her head and refused, \"It sounds very tiring. I don't really want to go.\" Then she said to Qin Zhao, \"You made this mess, you deal with it.\"","Qin Zhao had guessed Ji Fei would refuse. After all, this show was really exhausting to film, not suitable for a laid-back person like Ji Fei.","\"I'll do all the hard work,\" Qin Zhao tried.","Ji Fei: \"Please, it's a live broadcast. If I just stand there motionless, won't your fans curse me to death?\"","\"Both our appearance fees will go to you.\"","\"Have you forgotten? This is the variety show you negotiated for Chu Xueqi, so you're appearing for free, with no appearance fee. I've seen the contract,\" Ji Fei pointed at the documents Gao Hao had just handed him.","Gao Hao gave a dry laugh.","Qin Zhao said helplessly, \"Don't you want to make money? In this industry, popularity is money.\"","Ji Fei replied, \"I do want to make money, but this show would make things escalate too quickly for me.\"","She wasn't some female protagonist who had traveled through time. How exhausting would that be? Why torture herself trying to be an attention-seeker? She'd much rather be an extra, a background character, a wealthy NPC spectator in this world, content with just watching others' drama unfold. So, staying low-key was just fine.","Qin Zhao was about to give up when suddenly, inspiration struck.","\"This show actually has some intense conflicts. The first few episodes were partially live-streamed, so viewers missed out on a lot of juicy scenes. They've missed quite a bit of gossip.\"","Hmm?","Ji Fei sat up straight, frowning at Qin Zhao. \"Really? Is that true?\"","\"This time, apart from our pair, the other four couples are extremely dramatic.\"","Ding! Ji Fei's eyes lit up, playing along perfectly, \"Oh? Is that so?\"","Gao Hao immediately caught on and chimed in, raising his voice:","\"A secretly married superstar actor and his former on-screen romantic partner that fans used to ship.\"","\"The top male lead from fantasy wuxia dramas and his ex-girlfriend's current boyfriend!\"","\"A veteran actor known for loving his wife, paired with the 'Most Beautiful Yang Guifei' who's been blacklisted by the wives of industry bigwigs.\"","\"A rising starlet who just dumped her boyfriend but is now forced to pair up with his mother.\"","Ji Fei felt a jolt of excitement and waved her hand.","\"I'm in!\"","[If I don't get to witness this drama firsthand, I'll regret it for the rest of my life!]"]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Is every group so explosive","paragraphs":["Gao Hao's actions were swift. After communicating with the program team, he used Qin Zhao Studio's account to post two consecutive messages.","The first announced that Qin Zhao Studio had signed its second artist: Ji Fei.","The second stated that Qin Zhao would bring Ji Fei to participate in \"My Acting, Cut!\".","Instantly, both Qin Zhao's studio and personal Weibo exploded with activity. Their Weibo posts also tagged Ji Fei, causing her Weibo page to experience a sudden surge in views.","\"Where did this unknown nobody come from to be personally mentored by our brother?\"","\"Wasn't our brother recently close to the newly emerging young actress Chu Xueqi? Said to be looking after a family friend's sister.\"","\"How long have you been offline? Chu Xueqi retired long ago.\"","\"I've heard rumors about an artist frequently entering and exiting Qin Zhao's studio.\"","\"The key point is how could our brother's studio possibly sign a second person! Who exactly is she? What's so special about her? Ten minutes! Give me all her information in ten minutes.\"","As Gao Hao had predicted, when such a beautiful woman suddenly appeared in the public eye as the studio's second and only other artist, people focused more on Ji Fei's relationship with Qin Zhao rather than the retired Chu Xueqi.","Ten minutes later, no one could find complete information about Ji Fei. Even her online encyclopedia entry was incomplete. There were only details about magazines and advertisements she had shot, along with some rumors suggesting Ji Fei had intricate connections with Qin Corporation.","Gao Hao wouldn't clarify Ji Fei's identity. Sometimes, the more speculation, the greater the traffic. Of course, he had already instructed Xiao Tao to monitor the situation closely. If any unfavorable rumors started to gain traction, they would be immediately squashed.","In fact, Ji Fei's official Weibo account had been completely handed over to Gao Hao for management. Ji Fei only used her alternate account to browse gossip.","After a long time, Ji Fei finally opened her official Weibo account. Apart from work-related reposts, everything else from before had been deleted. New additions included recent class video compilations and beautiful photos.","This attracted some fans who appreciated her looks, though of course, there were more bored haters.","However, the traffic on her page quickly diluted as other groups participating in the show also made official announcements. Coupled with the show's first formal promotion, the popularity exploded.","Just as Gao Hao had said, each group was extraordinary. Ji Fei happily indulged in gossip on the Weibo plaza. Although these rumors might not be entirely true, they were certainly entertaining to consume.","The first group: A cool and aloof Best Actor and his former on-screen CP actress, who were actually from the same company and had a senior-junior relationship. When their CP was at its peak popularity, the junior was arranged by the company to develop her career in the foreign entertainment industry.","It seemed she hadn't made much of a splash abroad after a few years, so she returned to the domestic entertainment scene. This was considered her first major move since her return, leveraging her former CP to join the hottest live variety show.","With a Best Actor-level performer in her group to protect her, they were undoubtedly the most popular among the five groups of guests.","Adding the \"Youth Comeback\" tag reignited the passion of their former CP fans, directly occupying half of the show's traffic.","Some paparazzi had already released photos of the two entering and leaving various public places together in recent days. There were shots of a tall man with one arm around a petite woman, avoiding cameras; the two smiling at each other in a restaurant; and the woman accidentally falling into the man's arms.","Although all were candid shots and quite blurry, they captured the ambiguous atmosphere very precisely. There was a sense of a lover's return, a sudden reunion, and a successful harbor still willing to let you dock.","It perfectly maximized the anticipation for a rekindled romance.","Ji Fei looked at the various leaked photos and laughed heartily.","\"I can't even imagine what would happen if it was revealed that the Best Actor is actually married. Having such a lack of boundaries with another woman would surely lead to a complete online backlash.\"","Although Gao Hao and Xiao Tao were both busy with their own work, and even Qin Zhao had gone to a meeting, everyone was still enthusiastic about responding to gossip.","Gao Hao pushed up his glasses and said, \"If they've managed to keep a secret marriage under wraps for years, they must have some capability. Daring to form this combination means they've accepted this kind of hype. This hype method is actually particularly beneficial for the woman and completely useless for the man. But in their company, the only one who can make decisions now is the Best Actor himself, so...\"","\"So they really have something going on?\" Xiao Tao asked. After all, sometimes misleading photos can be quite deceptive.","\"Anyway, I can't see any value in that actress that would make the Best Actor do this. Perhaps there are other reasons,\" Gao Hao shrugged.","\"The wives in the entertainment circle are so magnanimous, able to tolerate their husbands being so close to other women?\" Ji Fei marveled inwardly.","\"It's said that his wife also holds shares in the company. In the entertainment world, they might just play their own games. Divorce would be too damaging, so it's unnecessary,\" Gao Hao explained.","Ji Fei expressed her disappointment. After all, the Best Actor was quite handsome, and she had initially thought about becoming his fan. But after consuming such big gossip, she decided against it.","The second most popular group consisted of two male idols.","They were both famous in their respective fields, one dominating historical and fantasy dramas, the other ruling youth and campus dramas. They were from the same company.","As they were both approaching thirty, they wanted to transition their careers, which is why they came to participate in the variety show. Grouping together was also to attract more attention.","But many insiders knew that the campus idol's current girlfriend was the fantasy idol's underground girlfriend five years ago.","Although many years had passed, just thinking about an ex and current partner collaborating on stage made people want to dig a hole through the Mariana Trench for them.","Ji Fei said: I want to see them act one way in public and another in private. Gosh, how entertaining!","The third group's popularity was related to a recently released movie, also serving as promotion.","The TV drama told the story of Imperial Consort Yang.","A veteran actor played Emperor Xuanzong of Tang. During the film's release, audiences worried that his performance was so good, hoping he wouldn't be enchanted by the actress playing Imperial Consort Yang, as this actress was known as a notorious 'mistress'.","Her reputation preceded her, with a new scandal for every project, either with the lead actor or the director. She was known for her black material flying everywhere. She had once been ordered to be boycotted by the wives' circle in the industry, but her exotic and bewitching looks and solid acting skills meant the entertainment circle really had no substitute for her.","She was the only person who, when publicly scolded as a vixen by the original wife, responded with a smile and said \"Thank you for the compliment.\"","As if she took pride in bewitching men.","This time, she was paired with a veteran actor famous for his loving husband image, so everyone was very curious to see who would prevail in this battle between spear and shield.","Ji Fei looked at the actress's photo and was also instantly captivated by her beauty.","Gao Hao mentioned that the veteran actor's wife would come to keep an eye on things, and Ji Fei couldn't imagine what kind of bloodbath that would be.","The last group, according to original popularity, should have had the lowest heat, but people love to gossip and join in the excitement.","A former national-level TV drama actress and a newly emerging young actress in TV dramas, originally should have had a harmonious senior-junior relationship, but a man came between them, nearly turning it into a mother-in-law and daughter-in-law relationship.","Originally, because of the man, the mother wanted to assess her son's current girlfriend's character, so she requested that the girlfriend participate in the variety show together.","However, before filming even started, the couple broke up.","Internet users across the network felt embarrassed for these two actresses, but surprisingly, neither of them withdrew when the official announcement was made.","How could people not look forward to seeing how they would interact in the future?","However, judging from the trend, people seemed to prefer the newly emerging young actress. The young actress's ex-boyfriend was a mama's boy, and his mother had become synonymous with the evil mother-in-law, having driven away countless potential daughters-in-law. This time, though, it was the newly emerging young actress who actively dumped him. People speculated that the mother's refusal to withdraw from the show might be an attempt to seek revenge for her son.","After all, in this mother's eyes, her son was perfect in every way. Only her son could dump others, let alone a small-time actress with no background or influence.","Ji Fei had watched this newly emerging young actress's dramas and quite liked them. She also felt that the actress had a high output of work.","Hearing Ji Fei's evaluation, Gao Hao couldn't help but comment, \"You think everyone's like you, slacking off as soon as they enter the circle? She's working hard to make money. However... she is indeed being exploited a bit too much.\""]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: Invisible Wife and Visible CP Are At Odds","paragraphs":["Ji Fei had gossiped around but didn't get any new information, so she could only wait for further developments of the drama.","In the evening, when she returned to the Qin family home, everyone already knew about them going on the reality show together.","\"This is our Fei Fei's first time on a live reality show, I'll definitely watch the whole thing,\" Qin's Mom said excitedly.","Qin Yan and Qin Rong also held hands and enthusiastically expressed that they would watch together!","\"When I was going to be on a show before, I didn't see you all this excited,\" Qin Zhao said, exasperated.","Qin's Mom rolled her eyes, \"You're not as pretty as Fei Fei.\"","\"Don't be nervous, if anything happens, just let Qin Zhao handle it. If you're not having fun, come back anytime,\" Qin's Father said, laying down the law.","Just as Qin Zhao was about to speak, Qin's Father added: \"Third brother will pay the penalty fee for you.\"","Qin Zhao: Am I even your son?","Ji Fei smiled and agreed to everything one by one.","[I'll persevere to the end no matter how difficult it is!]","Everyone was surprised in their hearts, this didn't sound like something the current Ji Fei would say.","[There's so much drama waiting for me to witness live! A secretly married actor cheating in progress, two male gods competing as love rivals, devoted wife image versus seductress, mom and ex-girlfriend, as long as it doesn't kill me I'll eat it all up, I can't even imagine how happy I'll be these two months.]","Qin Family: !!!!!","Is there... really so much... drama?","It sounds... so tempting!","Why can't these inner thoughts be transmitted through the live broadcast? They're very curious too.","So except for Qin Xian, everyone turned to look at Qin Zhao, making him shudder.","\"Third brother! I'm almost done with my painting, I have some free time, can I go be your assistant?\" Qin Rong quickly asked.","Qin Zhao's mouth twitched, \"Uh... okay. Come when you're free.\"","\"Great!\" Qin Rong scored the first point.","\"Can we visit the set?\" Qin's Mom and Dad also responded enthusiastically.","Qin Zhao squinted at his parents, who had never visited him on set in all his years working in the entertainment industry. \"You can, but not every day.\"","Qin's Dad and Mom high-fived in celebration.","As one of the only two people in the family who had to work actively, Qin Yan really had no way out, since she still had a child to take care of. She could only hold Qin Xi and look pitifully at Qin Rong and her mother.","The two ladies gave her a reassuring look, promising to share everything.","As for Qin Xian, who hadn't spoken and was ignored by his family, he could only diligently be a money-making tool without any say.","Just like a bystander who can never squeeze into the crowd to join the excitement, how sad~","\"By the way, Brother Gao told me that no brands have offered to provide clothes for you yet, so you'll have to prepare your own outfits,\" Qin Zhao said to Ji Fei.","Ji Fei thought for a moment and said, \"I have a lot of clothes in my closet, we can just have the stylist come and see what's suitable.\"","\"That won't do, for such a big show, you definitely need this season's new items. Let's have all of Qin Corporation's partners send over clothes,\" Qin's Mom immediately said, protecting her cub.","\"I'm just about to take little Xi shopping for clothes, why don't we all go shopping together tomorrow?\" Qin Yan suggested.","Ji Fei immediately looked at Qin Zhao, smiling sweetly, \"Then I won't go to class tomorrow.\"","[Yahoo, I can finally skip class for a day with a clear conscience!]","Qin Zhao glared at her helplessly, but could only reluctantly agree. It could be considered as giving the lazy fish who had been working hard to turn things around these past few days a little sweetener.","Qin Rong immediately expressed her regret, \"I have to paint, otherwise I would have gone with you.\"","Qin's Mom patted her daughter's hand, \"We'll go together next time.\" Then she turned her eyes to Qin Xian, who was lowering his head drinking tea, and said, \"Qin Xian, can you spare some time to go shopping with us tomorrow?\"","Qin Xian was stunned.","Qin Yan also received her mother's signal, \"We're just going to the mall under Qin Corporation, it's right next to your office building.\"","Without thinking much, Qin Xian said, \"Okay. I'll deal with company matters first and then come find you.\"","Ji Fei wondered inwardly, [Why do they want a man to come along when women are shopping?]","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei and added, \"I'll come to pay for you.\"","[Hmm? What an irrefutable reason!]","The next day, Ji Fei could finally sleep in without a care. After a simple meal, she set off with Qin's Mom and Qin Yan, bringing little Xi Xi to the city's most high-end mall.","After browsing two children's clothing stores, it was almost lunchtime.","They chose a restaurant, and just as they entered, they brushed past a woman.","Qin Yan exclaimed, \"Ruan Jia, what are you doing here?\"","Ji Fei looked and saw a woman about the same age as Qin Yan. She was wearing a big red knit hat, looking a bit unwell, and seemed embarrassed facing Qin Yan. \"Qin Yan, what a coincidence.\"","\"Not a coincidence, you shouldn't be here,\" Qin Yan said, uncharacteristically stern.","\"Oh, don't be so strict,\" Ruan Jia smiled. \"I'll go back after buying some things, don't let me delay your lunch. See you.\"","With that, she ran off quickly.","\"Don't run so fast,\" Qin Yan called out, somewhat helplessly.","Qin Yan didn't have a wide social circle, so her family usually knew most of her acquaintances. Qin's Mom curiously asked, \"Who was that?\"","\"A patient from our hospital,\" Qin Yan said, her mood somewhat low. \"She was just admitted when I took over the hospital, so we've known each other for quite a while. She... never mind, let's eat.\"","The hospital Qin Yan now manages is a private hospital, and the patients admitted are all wealthy or noble. Qin Yan's low mood definitely wasn't because the patient couldn't afford treatment, it was more likely that the patient's illness was difficult to cure.","Everyone had no intention of discussing someone else's medical condition, so they changed the topic and started ordering.","Just as they finished ordering, Qin Xian arrived.","After eating, they split up.","Qin's Mom was going to accompany Qin Yan and little Xi Xi to browse children's clothing stores, letting Qin Xian accompany Ji Fei to women's clothing stores.","Qin Xian immediately understood the Qin family's intentions, his expression becoming a bit unnatural.","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment before she also understood the Qin family's intentions. She was quite happy about it though - having a handsome guy accompany her, who also had the attribute of paying, what more could she ask for?","So Ji Fei immediately led Qin Xian to start shopping.","However, as soon as they entered the VIP room of the first store, they saw Ruan Jia whom they had just met.","At this moment, Ruan Jia seemed to be arguing with someone. A troubled shop assistant stood beside her, while opposite her was a woman wearing sunglasses and a bucket hat.","\"Sister Ruan Jia, I need it for the show, can't you let me have it?\"","\"Wang Jiani, what's mine is mine. I reserved it, no one can snatch it away!\"","Ji Fei was stunned. Wait, Wang Jiani? Isn't that name...","\"Ruan Jia, Wang Jiani? Sheng Wenyue's wife and junior, what a coincidence?\" Qin Xian suddenly spoke.","[Right, that's the actress Wang Jiani who's been rumored to be in a relationship with the secretly married actor Sheng Wenyue. Wait? Wife? Ruan Jia?]","Ji Fei looked at Qin Xian in shock, \"You... how do you know them?\"","Qin Xian looked down at Ji Fei, \"You're going on the show, of course I need to check up on the people you'll be working with.\"","[No, no, no, knowing Wang Jiani is normal, but even Gao Hao might not know about Ruan Jia!]","Qin Xian uncomfortably averted his gaze, \"Ah... it looks like they're starting to argue.\"","Ji Fei's attention was immediately diverted. Argue? How?","She pulled Qin Xian closer to eavesdrop.","Gossip! Big gossip! The invisible wife and the visible rumored girlfriend are at odds!"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Unscrupulous Behavior Sparks Outrage","paragraphs":["\"This doesn't seem to be what Ruan Jia reserved, but she just happened to get her hands on it first. Maybe it doesn't even suit you, and besides, I've already decided to buy it.\" Wang Jiani spoke calmly, with a smile on her face, appearing completely at ease.","\"So that's how it is. This wasn't a chance encounter; you came here on purpose, just to snatch it from me?\" Ruan Jia's face turned ashen, clearly infuriated. \"How shameless.\"","Although she was wearing sunglasses, one could still see Wang Jiani's expression twist for a moment.","\"I'm not snatching anything. Some things are destined to belong to certain people, and forcibly trying to keep them won't do any good.\" As Wang Jiani spoke, she gently caressed the mermaid-style gown, her eyes full of affection.","Was she talking about the dress or a person?","The saleswoman holding the dress was already sweating profusely. Anyone could understand the verbal sparring between these two women, and both seemed like people she couldn't afford to offend.","[Hahaha, that saleswoman must be screaming internally: Someone save me!]","Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei, who was leaning on a nearby counter, trying to hide while watching excitedly. Then he glanced at the saleswoman who was about to come over to serve them, wearing an awkward smile.","Qin Xian could only helplessly wave off the saleswoman, indicating that she should wait to serve them and let his wife finish enjoying the drama.","The saleswoman breathed a sigh of relief and stood to the side, secretly observing the confrontation. After all, this kind of scene between a wife and a mistress was something they often witnessed in their line of work.","Just as she was thinking this, the sharp-eyed saleswoman sensed something unusual behind her. She turned around and was startled.","To her surprise, two women and a child were crouching behind a more distant counter, watching the scene unfold. They were even waving at her, as if she was blocking their view.","Since anyone who could enter the VIP room must be important, the saleswoman obediently followed their instructions and moved out of their line of sight.","Qin Xian sensed something and looked back, immediately breaking into a cold sweat. He saw his mom and older sister making shushing gestures at him, while little Xixi looked confused, not knowing what was going on.","It turned out that Qin's Mom and Qin Yan had wanted to observe how the couple interacted when alone, but as soon as they entered, they overheard the juicy gossip. Since one of the women was someone Qin Yan knew, how could they possibly not stay to watch the drama unfold?","Meanwhile, the argument continued.","Ji Fei had also drawn some conclusions from what she heard.","[It seems that Wang Jiani's online image of being beautiful, kind-hearted, intellectual, and academically brilliant is just a facade. She dares to provoke the wife right in front of her, and so aggressively too. It looks like Wang Jiani and Sheng Wenyue really do have something going on. Since I've seen her in person today, I might as well verify it.]","The Qin family members immediately perked up their ears.","[Ah, I see. This is one of those cliché stories where a childhood sweetheart can't compete with a new love. The couple had been in love for many years and married for three when Sheng Wenyue met his junior colleague who had just joined the company.]","[At first, they were just co-stars playing a couple in a drama, but as they acted, things started to feel a bit off. The elders of both families noticed Sheng Wenyue's special treatment of Wang Jiani. To maintain family harmony, they nipped the budding feelings in the bud before they could fully blossom. They made the decision to send Wang Jiani abroad to develop her career in the international entertainment industry.]","[Wang Jiani's life was put on pause. Faced with a choice between her career and her feelings, she chose her career. However, her career abroad didn't take off as expected. Instead, she ended up marrying a foreign director, only to find out he was a scumbag. After four years of torment, including being beaten so badly she miscarried, she finally divorced and returned home. She then sought out the now-influential actor who had taken control of the company's decision-making power, hoping to rebuild her career.]","[Moreover, Wang Jiani blames Ruan Jia for ruining her life. She believes that if she hadn't been sent away and had been allowed to develop her career properly, she would have become a top actress by now, instead of the awkward newcomer she is today. So she's come back not only to reclaim her career but also to steal back the man she believes should have been hers.]","[Wow! Are mistresses this brazen nowadays? Wasn't all of this her own choice?]","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan were also angered by Ji Fei's thoughts, especially Qin Yan, whose expression turned particularly grim because she knew Ruan Jia's situation best and felt especially sympathetic towards her.","At this moment, Ji Fei finally saw Ruan Jia's information, and she immediately drew in a sharp breath. Her internal monologue stopped, and she looked at Ruan Jia with a very complex expression.","[Sigh, although matters of the heart are beyond our control, how could one bear to hurt someone they've loved and been with for so many years?]","[I wonder what Sheng Wenyue is really thinking. Although he doesn't seem to have responded to Wang Jiani's romantic hints, he still protects her at every turn and works hard to advance her interests. Isn't this just a relationship hanging by a thread, with only a thin veil of propriety left? What is he waiting for? The right moment to cheat? It seems this reality show is going to have some major drama.]","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan couldn't help but feel angry. If there really was something going on, they wanted to find a way to expose it on the spot. A cheating man doesn't deserve any mercy! It was infuriating.","Qin Xian also frowned slightly.","[Tsk tsk tsk, indeed, you can't rely on men any more than you can expect a pig to climb a tree. Love is not to be trusted.]","Thinking this, Ji Fei cast a sidelong glance at Qin Xian beside her.","Qin Xian: ?","Please don't attack an entire gender!","In Qin Xian's view, once you've entered the sacred halls of marriage, there should be no place for infidelity. That would be a sign of a man with no self-control or moral compass, and such men are nothing but useless trash.","While they were relying on Ji Fei for the gossip, the argument on the other side had reached a boiling point. Finally, the saleswoman, fearing the situation might escalate further, quickly brought up store policy.","Although the situation was complex, the solution was clear: if Ruan Jia paid for the dress now, she could take it home.","Everyone thought Wang Jiani would continue to make trouble, but after hearing the price quoted by the saleswoman, she just smiled sweetly and said, \"Oh my, that's so expensive. Can you afford it, Sister Ruan Jia?\"","\"Are you joking with me?\" Ruan Jia finally seemed to gain the upper hand, triumphantly pulling out a black card and handing it to the saleswoman. The saleswoman also breathed a sigh of relief and hurried to process the transaction.","However, after a moment, the saleswoman's face froze. She awkwardly approached Ruan Jia and said, \"Ma'am, your card isn't going through. We've tried several times, it seems to have been suspended.\"","Ruan Jia's already unhealthy complexion instantly drained of what little color it had left.","The only person who could suspend her card was Sheng Wenyue.","\"Oh, Sister Ruan Jia, are you out of money?\" Wang Jiani seemed to have been waiting for this moment. Her fair face flushed with excitement, looking beautiful and radiant. \"It seems some things are just not meant to be yours.\"","\"I'm sorry, ma'am, if you can't pay...\" the saleswoman said awkwardly.","Ruan Jia looked as if she had been slapped in the face. She almost lost her balance but managed to keep her composure. Gritting her teeth, she took out all the cards and cash she had on her. She rarely used them, so there wasn't much. The dress was quite expensive, and even putting everything together, she still couldn't afford it.","The onlookers were stunned. They thought the situation had finally been resolved, but there was another unexpected twist.","[Damn! What a major plot twist! This is beyond cruel! Wang Jiani already knew Ruan Jia's card had been suspended because Sheng Wenyue had done it right in front of her, saying it was a lesson for Ruan Jia.]","The Qin family was shocked: What? How could this happen?","[I'm angry now. I want to see what made this seemingly noble and cold actor do something so stupid!]"]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: This Dress, I Snatched... Oh No... I Took It","paragraphs":["However, before Ji Fei could inquire, Wang Jiani blurted it out herself.","After enjoying Ruan Jia's embarrassment, Wang Jiani said smugly, \"Who told you to trick me into going to that kind of drinking party, making those men force alcohol on me, almost causing me trouble? Brother said that since you have money to arrange such gatherings, he'll cancel your card so you can't harm people anymore.\"","Ruan Jia's face changed dramatically. \"I didn't! That wasn't my doing!\"","But Wang Jiani sneered, \"I don't have any other enemies. You're the only one here who wants me to get in trouble. If it wasn't you, who else could it be?\"","[It was you! You designed it yourself! You arranged the whole scene, pretending to follow Ruan Jia's summons to a drinking party in front of Sheng Wenyue. Halfway through, you sent Sheng Wenyue a message saying you sensed something was wrong, asking him to come save you. It was all self-directed and self-acted!]","Ji Fei finally caught up with the situation and couldn't help but criticize.","[I didn't expect she wasn't just a simple mistress, but actually so deeply scheming, making herself look like she was almost abused, to gain Sheng Wenyue's pity and trust.]","[Sheng Wenyue is also pig-headed, questioning Ruan Jia afterwards but refusing to listen to his wife's explanation, as if he automatically assumed it was Ruan Jia's doing. Indeed, once the heart is biased, intelligence follows suit.]","[He came to question her just wanting Ruan Jia to voluntarily admit her mistake. Seeing Ruan Jia's angry and embarrassed refusal to admit it, he left disappointed and cold, then began the cold war and card cancellation.]","The Qin family, who had been listening to the conversation in a daze, felt a sense of frustration with nowhere to vent their profanities after hearing Ji Fei's criticism.","But this was someone else's private matter, and something they couldn't possibly know about, so they didn't want to meddle.","[Sigh, after such a commotion, many people in the industry know that Wang Jiani is Sheng Wenyue's woman, and dare not have any ideas about her anymore.]","[And Sheng Wenyue uses this as an excuse to more firmly escort Wang Jiani's comeback path, protecting her to atone for his guilt. No wonder rumors are flying everywhere, and their company doesn't even care.]","[Oh, what a scumbag, finding such a noble excuse to protect his little mistress. Bah!]","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan couldn't help but spit in disgust as well.","Ruan Jia probably didn't expect the card cancellation was because of this incident, after all, she had angrily said it wasn't her. Coming to question her was simply an insult.","She thought Sheng Wenyue understood her, knew she couldn't possibly be that kind of person, knew she was willing to believe that he and Wang Jiani wouldn't cross the line.","It turned out that from beginning to end, Sheng Wenyue didn't trust her, thinking she would harm Wang Jiani. The days of ignoring her were also part of the punishment.","Ruan Jia didn't care that so many years of affection couldn't earn her the simplest trust, she only knew that she didn't want to lose face in front of Wang Jiani now, not even if it killed her.","Because Ruan Jia couldn't gather enough money, she called Sheng Wenyue, but no matter how many times she called, no one answered.","So she turned to call the assistant, who did pick up, but said something that made Ruan Jia's face turn ashen gray after hanging up.","Seeing this situation, Ji Fei couldn't help but pat her chest.","[Indeed, one can't rely on a man's card. I was so foresighted. Look at what this so-called husband is doing, is he sick? Canceling his own wife's card for someone else. I'm laughing to death. It's clearly marital joint property, yet it seems only he can control it. Is that reasonable?]","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan nodded to indicate it was unreasonable. Do these CEO husbands always like to wield this kind of power to discipline their wives?","Qin Xian, the husband, felt a chill down his spine. The husband group's reputation was being damaged!","\"Since Sister Ruan Jia doesn't have money to buy it, I guess I'll have to give up on it,\" Wang Jiani said mockingly.","\"I may not have money, but do you? I remember you came back penniless after the divorce, without even a job. How could you afford a dress of this price? You just want to compete with me,\" Ruan Jia still stubbornly persisted.","Wang Jiani sneered and took out a membership card to the shop assistant.","The shop assistant recognized it as a supplementary card of their super VIP card and quickly took it to verify.","Ruan Jia's face changed in an instant.","Because she remembered that this store often provided private clothes for celebrities, and Sheng Wenyue had a super VIP card from this store.","Since Ruan Jia rarely bought this type of clothing, Sheng Wenyue had never gotten her a supplementary card. If she wanted to buy something, she could just use the black card directly.","Ruan Jia's eyes began to tremble, afraid to hear certain news.","Until the shop assistant awkwardly said, \"It's Mr. Sheng's supplementary card, you can sign for purchases directly.\"","The onlookers were shocked.","[So it's also because of participating in the show, Sheng Wenyue knew Wang Jiani had no money to buy clothes, so he got her a supplementary card for her to spend. Damn! The wife doesn't have a supplementary card, but the mistress has the husband's supplementary card. This is too insulting to the original wife!]","Ruan Jia's breath stagnated for a moment, and the next second, Wang Jiani smiled and said, \"What? Didn't Brother provide Sister Ruan Jia with a supplementary card?\"","[How despicable!]","Ji Fei was angered even as she watched the drama unfold.","Qin Yan and Qin's Mom expressed: Despicable!","But there was something even more despicable.","Wang Jiani held up the dress against herself, posed in front of the mirror to take a photo, then sent it out.","She then sent a voice message: \"Brother, how do you think this looks?\"","The phone vibrated, with an almost instant reply.","Ruan Jia, whose call couldn't get through earlier and was told by the assistant that the boss was busy, felt her pupils constrict.","Wang Jiani tapped her phone screen.","A cool, magnetic voice with a hint of tenderness came through.","\"It looks very nice, suits you.\"","Ruan Jia's body swayed a little, trembling all over with anger.","[Scum! Too damn scummy!]","Qin Yan and Qin's Mom expressed: Scum to the heavens!","But Wang Jiani replied again, \"Brother, what are you saying? I think this suits sister-in-law, I was planning to give it to her. After all, she must be very unhappy about our situation lately.\"","Soon, Sheng Wenyue replied, \"No need to give it to her, it doesn't suit her. You wear it better, and she should be the one apologizing to you.\"","[Yuck~ Whose breasts aren't breasts?!]","Qin Xian: ?","Qin's Mom and Qin Yan: Exactly!","\"Sorry, I originally wanted to give a gift on your behalf, but since Brother doesn't agree, forget it.\" Before Wang Jiani could smile smugly, Ruan Jia suddenly moved.","With a loud slap.","A palm struck Wang Jiani's cheek directly.","It knocked off her sunglasses and made her drop her phone.","Everyone was stunned for a moment, then let out a breath, feeling a sense of satisfaction watching it.","She deserved it!","\"Ah!\" Wang Jiani screamed in disbelief. \"You hit me?\"","Wang Jiani suddenly reacted and was about to raise her hand, when she heard a loud \"Hey!\"","\"Are you still doing business here or not?\" Ji Fei shouted directly, interrupting Wang Jiani's counterattack and giving the shop assistants a chance to react, quickly rushing over to mediate.","Wang Jiani only managed to glance sideways, knowing that a man and a woman were standing there, but her attention was all on Ruan Jia.","Seeing Ruan Jia so angry that tears were coming out, she immediately stopped retaliating and sneered while covering her red and swollen face, \"Since Brother thinks I look better in this dress, I'll take it.\"","Wang Jiani knew how to anger people. Every time she appeared on camera wearing this dress in the future, it would hurt Ruan Jia once.","But the next second, they heard that rude woman who had shouted loudly earlier say again, \"This dress, I'm snat... I mean, I'll take it.\"","[I heard this mall belongs to my husband, hehe~]"]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Forget it, bury it.","paragraphs":["Of course, Ji Fei wasn't going to rashly jump out and play the hero. It would be embarrassing if she ended up making a fool of herself.","So before taking action, Ji Fei quietly asked Qin Xian, \"Are you the big boss of this mall?\"","Qin Xian paused, then replied, \"...Yes.\"","\"So that means I can do whatever I want?\"","Qin Xian: \"...More or less.\"","\"What if I want to snatch that dress?\"","Qin Xian had a pretty good idea of what Ji Fei was planning to do. He immediately took out his phone and sent a message to his Special Assistant.","In fact, Qin Xian felt that if Ji Fei didn't act soon, the two people behind them wouldn't be able to hold back any longer.","After all, everyone in their family had a kind heart.","When Ji Fei jumped out and shouted, Qin Xian could even hear a big sigh of relief from behind.","Meanwhile, the people in front all turned to look at Ji Fei in disbelief.","They probably didn't expect a Cheng Yaojin to suddenly appear out of nowhere.","Ruan Jia looked at Ji Fei with suspicion, not recognizing her at first. It wasn't until she saw Qin Yan further back - the female hospital director who had come to check on her when she was hospitalized alone - now smiling and waving at her, that she remembered running into them earlier during dinner.","Although it was embarrassing to be seen in such a sorry state by acquaintances, she also understood that these people were trying to help her.","Wang Jiani, on the other hand, stared at Ji Fei in shock, not understanding what this person was trying to do. Did she know Ruan Jia? Was she helping Ruan Jia?","\"Is she a friend of yours, Sister Ruan Jia?\" Wang Jiani probed.","Ruan Jia replied, \"I don't know her.\"","Wang Jiani became even more bewildered as she looked at Ji Fei again.","As she looked closer, she suddenly felt that Ji Fei seemed familiar. Unfortunately, Ji Fei's online photos were all model shots, and there was quite a difference between her fully made-up look and her everyday appearance.","At this moment, although still beautiful, Ji Fei was bare-faced, lively and energetic. She looked much younger than in her model photos, more like a vibrant university beauty queen than a celebrity.","The man beside her surprised Wang Jiani even more. With his sharp eyebrows and bright eyes, he had an imposing air. His jet-black eyes gleamed with a cold light, like the finest ink jade, giving off an aloof and noble aura that kept people at a thousand-mile distance.","Beautiful people were common, but Wang Jiani had rarely seen a man with such outstanding bearing and looks. Even her senior, the Best Actor, would probably pale in comparison standing next to him.","Wang Jiani was observant enough to tell from their attire and demeanor that these two were either wealthy or noble.","But even so, there was no reason for them to snatch her dress.","\"Miss, I've already reserved this dress,\" Wang Jiani spoke up.","\"You haven't paid for it yet, so how can you say it's reserved? I think this dress suits me better,\" Ji Fei stepped forward with a smile.","Wang Jiani's face stiffened. She felt that what Ji Fei said was very similar to what she had said to Ruan Jia earlier.","\"I've reserved it, and I can pay for it. You're just a step too late, Miss,\" Wang Jiani said. Without waiting for Ji Fei's response, she turned to the sales assistant, \"I'll sign for it. Please wrap it up.\"","But before the sales assistant could agree, all the sales assistants in the store received an order through their earpieces.","The sales assistant who was about to process the order suddenly changed her expression and immediately returned Wang Jiani's supplementary card.","Wang Jiani's face changed instantly. \"What does this mean?\"","\"I'm sorry, ma'am, but our store manager has instructed that this dress is not for sale to the public. To express our apologies, we can offer you a 10% discount on other items,\" the sales assistant smiled.","\"You won't sell it to me? Are you going to sell it to her instead?\" Wang Jiani pointed at Ji Fei in disbelief.","As the sales assistant was struggling with how to respond, Ji Fei stepped forward and presented the membership card Qin Xian had handed over.","The sales assistant's eyes lit up at the sight, seeing this highest-level membership card for the first time. \"Miss, would you like this dress?\"","Ji Fei nodded.","The sales assistant said, \"No problem. Would you like to try it on?\"","\"Hey! Wait a minute, what's going on here...\" Wang Jiani was furious and confused.","The sales assistant explained, \"This is our store's highest-level membership card. Any items not for sale to the public are available to its holder. I'm sorry, Miss Wang, but even if Mr. Sheng's primary card were here, it wouldn't be enough, let alone a supplementary card.\"","These words made Wang Jiani's face turn red.","This was all according to the rules, so Wang Jiani knew that making a fuss wouldn't help. She could only say that she had been overpowered by someone with more influence. In the end, she could only cast an unwilling glance at Ji Fei before leaving. After all, she had already succeeded in making Ruan Jia unhappy.","Finally, Ruan Jia wanted to say thank you to Qin Yan, but when she looked up, Qin Yan had disappeared. In the end, she could only nod to the unfamiliar Ji Fei and Qin Xian as a gesture of gratitude for their kindness.","After Ruan Jia left, Ji Fei was about to go try on the dress.","Qin Xian asked, \"Do you really want this one? Do you like it?\"","Qin Xian thought Ji Fei was just helping to annoy the others. After all, based on Ji Fei's current taste, she probably wouldn't like this kind of dress. With so many straps, she would find it troublesome to put on.","\"I do like it,\" Ji Fei replied.","Qin Xian was surprised that Ji Fei's taste had changed again.","[Just thinking about the expression Wang Jiani will have when she sees me wearing this dress during the variety show recording makes me love it so much. Hehe!]","Qin Xian: ...So that's the kind of \"like\" it is.","Meanwhile, Ruan Jia left the store in a daze. As soon as she walked out of the door, her phone rang.","Ruan Jia's face turned icy cold when she saw the caller ID. She answered the phone, and a cold voice came through.","\"Did you hit Jiani?\"","\"Huh... She's already tattled on me? Sheng Wenyue, if it weren't for this incident, I probably would never receive a call from you, nor would I be able to get through to you, right?\"","\"Ruan Jia, it seems you still haven't reflected on your actions.\"","\"Reflect on what? Reflect on something I didn't do? Reflect on why you're throwing mud at me? Reflect on why my husband stopped my card based on another woman's one-sided words? Hah, maybe I should reflect - perhaps I should get a new husband.\"","\"Ruan Jia, you've really changed. I don't even recognize you anymore. Do you really not trust me at all? Things between her and me are completely innocent. We've already wronged her enough. I just want to make amends on your behalf. Can you stop targeting her? If you continue like this, we might as well get a divorce...\"","The word \"divorce\" made Ruan Jia's whole body stiffen.","\"Now, go apologize to Jiani!\"","Perhaps too shocked, Ruan Jia stood still on the spot, her face pale. After a long pause, she finally replied, \"You didn't even ask what happened?\"","\"No matter what happened, it's not a reason for you to hit someone!\"","\"I don't recognize you anymore either, Sheng Wenyue. Since you brought it up, fine then, let's get a divorce.\" Ruan Jia's voice was soft, as if she were utterly exhausted.","This time, it was the other party who paused. \"I'm serious. I'm not joking around with you.\"","\"I'm serious too.\"","The other party seemed to take a deep breath, extremely impatient.","\"How long are you going to keep acting unreasonably? Ruan Jia, you're really wearing away all the love I have for you! Forget it, I'll have to make up for your mistakes again. You cool down by yourself. After I send Jiani back to where she belongs, we'll have a good talk.\"","Ruan Jia wanted to say something more, but the other party had already hung up, not giving her any chance to explain.","Ruan Jia felt like there was a lump of blood stuck in her chest. Suddenly, her vision went black and she started to fall backward. But she didn't fall down - two people caught her.","She turned her head to see Qin Yan smiling awkwardly.","It turned out that Qin Yan and Qin's Mom had been standing in a corner outside the store, debating whether to continue following the two people inside or go shopping on their own. They ended up encountering Ruan Jia coming out and making a phone call nearby. The area was very quiet, and they could hear the conversation clearly. It really made both of them angry enough.","Seeing Ruan Jia's awful expression, Qin Yan didn't know what else to say.","\"Come on, let's take you to the hospital.\"","By the time evening came and it was time to go home, Ji Fei and Qin Xian only picked up Qin's Mom and Little Xixi. That's when they learned that Qin Yan had taken Ruan Jia to the hospital. Qin's Mom, eager to share the gossip, quickly told Ji Fei about the phone call they had overheard.","Ji Fei widened her eyes in disbelief.","[He didn't want to hear a single word about the injustice his wife suffered. He's completely looking for trouble on behalf of the mistress. How can this kind of man still righteously claim that he loves his wife and that things are innocent with the mistress? Forget it, just bury him.]"]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: That Scene... I Dare Not Imagine","paragraphs":["Qin Zhao, who was sitting at the same table, couldn't believe it even more. They had just gone out for a stroll, how did they manage to strip the first group's guest naked?","When Qin Yan returned, although everyone didn't want to pry into the patient's privacy, they were still very curious.","Qin Yan could only say, \"She's a pitiful person. She's been alone since she was admitted to the hospital. I heard her parents have passed away, and her husband... sigh.\"","\"Doesn't she tell her husband about her condition?\" Qin's Mom asked worriedly.","\"She said she did, but her husband didn't believe her. He even accused her of acting to trick him, saying he hated how she was cursing her own body out of jealousy. After that, she said a husband like that doesn't deserve to know the truth,\" Qin Yan shook her head.","[It's a terminal illness, and she doesn't know how many days she has left to live. Why does it feel like she's gambling with her own life, betting that the man will regret it deeply when he finds out? Isn't that foolish?]","Although Qin Yan didn't say anything, Ji Fei accidentally revealed it, making the Qin family feel even more uneasy as they listened.","Isn't she just playing with her own life?","Qin Yan finally couldn't help but criticize, \"She's not cooperating with the treatment at all. Although her illness, even with treatment... Anyway, it feels like she's given up hope.\"","\"There's no greater sorrow than the death of the heart,\" Qin's Mom shook her head regretfully.","Everyone started criticizing again.","A few days later, \"My Acting, Cut!\" was scheduled to shoot a promotional video ahead of time.","It was said to be the first time everyone would gather together, officially meeting each other, and there might even be a group dinner. Ji Fei excitedly brought along that mermaid dress.","When Gao Hao came to pick them up in the company car, he saw the dress Ji Fei had prepared and couldn't help but praise her taste.","\"Right? I think it looks great too,\" Ji Fei smiled even more brightly.","Qin Zhao, who was accompanying them, inexplicably shuddered and pulled Gao Hao aside, saying, \"Remember to be vigilant in social situations later.\"","Gao Hao looked confused, \"Why?\"","Qin Zhao patted Gao Hao's shoulder discreetly. He and Ji Fei didn't care about offending people, but it would be troublesome for Gao Hao's deception plan.","However, Gao Hao smiled and said, \"Are you worried that Ji Fei doesn't know how to talk and might accidentally offend others? Don't worry, I've analyzed it. Ji Fei may not be good at social niceties, but she's sincere and friendly, and she's good-looking. As the only pure newcomer among the actors, she has no conflicts of interest with anyone. She'll be someone everyone likes to get close to both on and off camera. Overall, she'll be very likable.\"","Qin Zhao chuckled twice and said no more.","Gao Hao turned back to look at Ji Fei in confusion, only to see her already excitedly sharing various gossip she saw on her phone with Xiao Tao.","Well... apart from being a gossip, there's nothing to worry about.","When they arrived at the filming building, the chief director and producer personally came to greet them.","Because they knew that Qin Zhao had already revealed his identity to these two people in advance, Ji Fei didn't feel awkward when faced with their warm reception. She acted like a well-mannered newcomer in the industry, appearing very approachable.","The two immediately felt relieved, seeing that she didn't seem like someone who would cause trouble. They were worried that someone with high status might not cooperate and create problems, which would make the show really difficult to manage.","\"Today we'll just shoot a set of photos and do some simple individual and group interviews,\" the producer explained briefly before sending everyone to the makeup room.","All five groups used the same makeup room, without any favoritism. After all, the makeup room for this show was well-equipped and spacious, with partitions. Each person had their own small area, and it could accommodate many people getting their makeup done at the same time. Even if Best Actors and Actresses came, no one would feel slighted.","The production team thought this would make it convenient to notify everyone if anything came up, and the chief director also hoped that everyone would spend more time together to get familiar with each other quickly, so they wouldn't freeze up during the live broadcast.","People arrived at different times. When Ji Fei and Qin Zhao entered, three groups were already there.","Gao Hao was like a social butterfly, immediately at ease, swimming around everywhere. Ji Fei was dragged along to greet everyone, her head spinning, barely managing to match each person with their gossip. But they didn't pay much attention to Ji Fei, after all, she was considered a pure newcomer in the industry.","Ji Fei looked around with sparkling eyes, seeing each person's head as if covered in melons, waiting for her to pick.","However, before Ji Fei could dig into their gossip, she heard someone say, \"Only Best Actor Sheng and Wang Jiani's group haven't arrived yet.\"","\"Didn't you see what the marketing accounts just posted?\"","Someone with insider information smiled and said, \"They'll probably arrive a bit later.\"","\"Young people these days...\"","\"Maybe this show will really become the work that defines their relationship,\" someone joked.","Actually, some people had heard about the Best Actor's secret marriage, but hearing about it and really knowing about it were two different things. At this moment, those who had heard the rumors were doubting whether the secret marriage was just a rumor. Otherwise, with such outrageous gossip, how could the original wife remain so quiet?","At least learn from that veteran actor over there, whose wife always sticks close by.","[Rushing to Wang Jiani's neighborhood late at night, not leaving until dawn, they're really not trying to hide it at all. Let me see what's going on... What?!]","Qin Zhao, who was sitting nearby about to finalize his hairstyle, couldn't help but sit up straight when he heard this, unable to resist the urge to gossip.","[Because of a thunderstorm and power outage in the high-end neighborhood, Wang Jiani was afraid of the dark, so she called Sheng Wenyue for help... So is Sheng Wenyue electricity or light? Does he even know that while he's accompanying someone all night because they're afraid of the dark, his wife is enduring the side effects of treatment alone?]","Qin Zhao originally thought Sheng Wenyue was a decent person, dedicated and professional, but now he just wanted to sneer.","Just as he was thinking about this, another group of people came in. It should be Best Actor Sheng's group's staff, but Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani weren't seen.","Gao Hao and the female manager of that historical drama heartthrob were the first to react, going forward to greet Sheng Wenyue's manager and expressing polite concern for the absent Best Actor.","\"Oh, we came ahead to prepare. The two of them will arrive shortly.\"","When everyone heard this, they naturally had their own thoughts. Those two were departing separately from somewhere else.","The manager didn't try to avoid the topic at all, even blatantly putting the two together like this. It seems it's not just the Best Actor's willful behavior, this manager is also clueless.","Gao Hao and the female manager both truly knew about the Best Actor's secret marriage, and their eyes flashed with expressions of looking at fools.","Even if the other party was a veteran manager who had nurtured a Best Actor, they were now acting arrogant and ignorant. They should know that it's lonely at the top, and leaving such a big weakness for others to exploit, if rivals really wanted to bring down Sheng Wenyue, they could make him fall from grace in no time.","But criticism aside, they maintained a good facade on the surface, exchanging insincere pleasantries.","Because their makeup team was right across from Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, the makeup artists' conversation could be heard even when they spoke softly.","\"Be careful with the contouring later.\"","\"Is Sister Jiani's face still swollen?\"","\"I heard there are still some marks.\"","\"No wonder Mr. Sheng apologized to Sister Jiani earlier.\"","\"After all, it was that person who hit her.\"","[Oh my, what did she hear? Still swollen? It's been so many days, even if hit with a brick, it should have gone down by now. Strange... Oh my god! It turns out that to keep Sheng Wenyue constantly concerned, she slaps herself in the same spot every morning. Ouch~]","Qin Zhao's mouth twitched: This mistress is really dedicated, she's too harsh on herself!","[Ah well, you can't blame me. It's their fault for coming late.]","Qin Zhao: ?","Then he heard Ji Fei quietly say to Xiao Tao beside her, \"Cooperate with me later.\"","Xiao Tao's wooden face showed a clever expression as she received the signal.","Qin Zhao: Why do I have a bad feeling about this?","As everyone was getting their makeup done and casually socializing, a gossip atmosphere suddenly emerged from the chaotic bustle. Human nature drove them to gradually quiet down and prick up their ears. They heard a conversation coming from Ji Fei's direction.","\"That dress was deliberately snatched.\"","Xiao Tao: \"Why?\"","\"Because initially, the two people fighting over it were the original wife and the mistress!\"","Xiao Tao: \"Really?\"","\"Actually, it was like this @#¥%amp\"","Xiao Tao: \"Ah? Oh? My goodness! Eww! Miss Ji, you're doing justice on behalf of heaven.\"","Ji Fei forgot that among their guests, there was an actress crowned with the title of the strongest mistress. When that person heard this, she thought Ji Fei also disapproved of her and was hinting at mocking her, so she turned her head to look over.","The veteran actor's wife cast an unfriendly glance from the side, which the actress ignored.","Ji Fei was seen animatedly describing the course of events, and it appeared to be a true story rather than intentional mockery.","Immediately, others became curious and started gossiping as well. Especially upon hearing about the various tactics of the mistress, they internally criticized how low-class it was. Any man with even a bit more intelligence could have instantly discovered the mistress's true nature.","Even the executive director and producer, who had come early to explain the segment details thinking everyone had arrived, silently joined the group of onlookers after they came in.","After Ji Fei finished her bout of gossip, the crowd gradually returned to their lively chatter. It was just ordinary people's drama, worth only a casual bite of interest. Even Gao Hao didn't curiously ask who the people involved were.","Just then, there was a commotion outside the door, indicating someone's arrival. Ji Fei seized the opportunity to head to the dressing room with her assistant. The celebrities' outfits had already been sent there for preparation.","As Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani walked in, narrowly missing Ji Fei, Qin Zhao was already starting to feel so awkward that he could dig his toes into the ground.","Once Ji Fei came out after changing clothes... that scene... he really didn't dare to imagine."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: Who would have thought to eat melons from their own melon patch","paragraphs":["Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were the last to arrive. As they entered, everyone greeted them warmly, introducing themselves before returning to their original positions to continue with their styling.","The director and producer approached Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani to brief them.","Meanwhile, the others couldn't resist quietly gossiping about the couple's ambiguous relationship in their own little areas. Occasionally catching sight of the two exchanging knowing smiles, they truly felt that good news was on the horizon.","Even some of the staff members who might have participated in the nationwide shipping craze in their younger days couldn't help but smile fondly at seeing the two sitting together.","Just as the atmosphere was becoming harmonious, the door of the nearby changing room suddenly opened.","Earlier, when meeting the other artists, only Qin Zhao's group was missing one person, Ji Fei, who hadn't greeted Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani.","The identity of the person emerging from the changing room was obvious.","As she made her dazzling entrance in a deep blue mermaid dress that hugged her graceful figure, all eyes were drawn to her.","Although her makeup and styling weren't complete, her tall stature, curvaceous silhouette, naturally fair skin, square shoulders, tiny waist, and long, straight legs showcased the mermaid dress to perfection.","Everyone had only one thought: as expected of someone with a modeling background. Even without acting skills, her mere presence in the frame would capture all attention.","Of course, this was the sentiment of most people.","Except for three individuals.","Namely, the nervous Qin Zhao, the frowning Sheng Wenyue, and the shocked Wang Jiani.","Before Wang Jiani could react, Sheng Wenyue, who was closest, furrowed his brows and spoke up directly.","\"Isn't this dress prepared for Jiani? Miss, have you perhaps put on someone else's clothes by mistake?\"","Everyone's outfits were sent directly to the changing room for the assistants to handle upon arrival, and people would go in to change when it was time. So all the clothes were together.","He had seen that dress before; it was the one Wang Jiani had bought for the shoot. How could it be on someone else?","Unless someone did it deliberately.","Sheng Wenyue's face darkened. Even if a newcomer had connections with Qin Corporation, they couldn't throw their weight around and bully someone under his protection.","Usually, Sheng Wenyue wouldn't fire off so directly, but Wang Jiani had played the victim in front of him too many times, making him extremely sensitive. The slightest provocation would set him off, constantly worried that Wang Jiani might suffer under his protection.","This made him feel even more guilty towards Wang Jiani, always thinking that if she hadn't been driven away because of him back then, she would have held a prestigious position in the industry by now, and who would dare bully her?","But when Sheng Wenyue finished speaking, the staff members in their group looked bewildered, and even the manager looked at him in confusion.","The others were even more perplexed. They had expected conflicts during the show's filming, given that everyone had some status and their own temperaments.","But they never imagined the first clash would be between an A-list actor and a newcomer to the industry.","Moreover, wasn't that dress brought by Ji Fei herself? She had been showing it off for half the day. How could it be Wang Jiani's?","Gao Hao reacted the quickest, being the first to speak up: \"Um, Mr. Sheng, I think there might be some misunderstanding. This is the outfit our artist bought herself. Could it be that she and Ms. Wang coincidentally chose the same style? Haha, that would be quite a fateful coincidence!\"","Only then did Wang Jiani snap out of her shock at the coincidence, realizing that the person she had encountered that day was actually Ji Fei, the newcomer filming the show with them.","Recalling the incident, Wang Jiani's face changed.","Just as she was feeling at a loss, she saw Ji Fei suddenly point at her with an expression of disbelief, exclaiming, \"It's you!\"","Then, as if suddenly realizing something, she added, \"You're Wang Jiani!\"","Her face immediately wrote: Oh my, how embarrassing, I've run into the person involved.","The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Everyone looked back and forth between them. What was going on? It seemed there was some conflict between the two, and hadn't the A-list actor just mentioned the dress?","Wait a minute...","Something didn't seem quite right.","At this moment, Wang Jiani gave Ji Fei a once-over, noticing her standing there nervously, which instantly boosted her confidence.","Ji Fei didn't even recognize her, so she probably didn't know the exact situation from that day. Her current awkwardness was likely due to feeling she had offended someone.","\"I'm sorry, there's been a misunderstanding. I did indeed have my eye on this dress before and sent a picture to my Senior Brother. I was about to pay for it when... I guess Ms. Ji must have some connections. She had the store cancel my order, and the dress ended up with her instead.\"","Wang Jiani wore a forced smile, as if she had been bullied but had no choice in the matter.","[Pfft... I'm holding it in.]","Everyone else: ???!!!!","At this moment, regardless of their mental capacity, everyone's minds began to race, almost to the point of overheating.","Gradually... gradually... everyone's mouths fell open, their pupils dilating in shock.","Their emotions were in turmoil, yet they didn't want to miss a second of this riveting drama unfolding before them, their eyes fixed on the two people who were still oblivious to the situation.","After finishing her explanation, Wang Jiani turned to Sheng Wenyue with an apologetic look. \"I'm sorry, Senior Brother, I didn't have a chance to tell you.\"","Sheng Wenyue frowned. Although he had misunderstood the situation, the dress had indeed been snatched from Wang Jiani in another context, which was certainly arrogant and overbearing behavior.","Sheng Wenyue looked at Ji Fei.","Ji Fei wore an uncomfortable expression, as if she was genuinely embarrassed about taking someone else's clothes.","However, both Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani felt that if Ji Fei knew how to behave properly, she should be apologizing by now. But she wasn't. Was she really relying on Qin Zhao as her backing?","Both of their expressions darkened, especially Sheng Wenyue's.","He spoke in an ambiguous tone: \"When Jiani sent me the photo at the time, I thought the dress was quite nice. Ms. Ji certainly has good taste, choosing the same style as Jiani. It's a pity there's only one.\"","Everyone else: ... So it's true!!!! Sheng Wenyue, you really did get married in secret!!! And Wang Jiani is the mistress.","The mistress stole the wife's dress, sent a photo of it in front of the wife, and you only replied to the mistress, not even answering your wife's calls?!","You even froze your wife's card and gave your supplementary card to the mistress...","Meanwhile, Sheng Wenyue still hadn't sensed the increasingly tense atmosphere. His words clearly hinted that he hoped Ji Fei would be sensible and apologize.","But not only did Ji Fei not react, even the usually astute Gao Hao seemed lost in thought.","Sheng Wenyue frowned in confusion. Could their emotional intelligence be that low?","Although Wang Jiani felt extremely uncomfortable seeing Ji Fei wearing the dress, as it constantly reminded her of how she had been humiliated and driven away that day, she still maintained a gracious and proper facade, not wanting Sheng Wenyue to make things difficult for her sake.","\"It's alright, I can see that Ms. Ji really likes this dress, and it looks better on her. Let's just say it was a case of 'a flood washing away the Dragon King's temple'.\"","[Pfft, don't let yourself get drowned later.]","This schadenfreude-filled voice could only be heard by Qin Zhao, who nearly burst out laughing.","The others: Oh no, my toes are itching! I'm getting second-hand embarrassment.","\"I should be the one apologizing. I jumped to conclusions earlier, thinking you had mistakenly put on Jiani's clothes,\" Sheng Wenyue continued sarcastically, unable to see the expressions of the other groups behind him.","[No, bro, you still haven't figured it out.]","Everyone else: ... What should we do? We want to laugh so badly, it's making our chests hurt from holding it in.","Seeing that Ji Fei still seemed embarrassed to the point of being at a loss, not understanding why she could be embarrassed for so long and thinking she really didn't know how to behave, Sheng Wenyue could only force a smile and say, \"Let's all look out for each other in the future.\"","Everyone else: Ahhhhh! Should we tell him or not?!","But it seemed that even the people in their team hadn't come to their senses yet.","After all, they had been happily enjoying the drama earlier too. Who could have imagined that the drama they were consuming was actually from their own backyard?"]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: A woman's voice suddenly went out of control and screamed, \"What\"","paragraphs":["As Sheng Wenyue spoke with forced politeness, Ji Fei finally couldn't help but take a closer look at what it meant to be a wolf in sheep's clothing.","[He really does have the face of a cold, aloof idol and public heartthrob. Remember to maintain that pretentious air later, won't you?]","Afraid she wouldn't be able to hold back her smirk any longer, Ji Fei quickly nodded politely and retreated to her position, putting on an innocent expression of relief.","Meanwhile, Gao Hao beside her had completely turned to stone, wondering if his artist had accidentally stirred up earth-shattering trouble.","It was... accidental, right?","Could this still be fixed?","Let me think, let me think quickly. If I can't come up with something, this will be the biggest scandal of my career as a manager!!!!","Qin Zhao cast a sympathetic glance at Gao Hao, but his heart had already started trembling. Soon... any moment now...","Everyone in their group unconsciously looked towards the mirror's reflection, not wanting to miss a single detail.","The people from other groups did the same, with some even deliberately moving the partitions.","At this moment, although Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were displeased with Ji Fei's reaction, they had decided to let the matter go and were about to continue their conversation with the director and producer in front of them.","However, they noticed that the two people before them had suddenly adopted constipated expressions, their eyes darting around nervously, avoiding eye contact.","Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani: ??","\"Um... I just remembered I have something to arrange,\" the director fled.","\"I just remembered... I haven't arranged for the director yet,\" the producer fled.","Left behind, the two wore bewildered expressions. Turning their heads, they saw that all the members of their team, except for their manager, had anxiously lowered their heads, pretending to be deaf and busying themselves with their tasks.","The manager, on the other hand, had turned pale, his mouth opening and closing, his gaze darting between Wang Jiani and Sheng Wenyue, almost sparking with intensity.","Although the manager indeed disliked the often-disagreeable Mrs. Sheng and wished to find a more commercially valuable partner for the idol, and would be happy to match Wang Jiani with Sheng Wenyue, confident in his ability to market them successfully and elevate Sheng Wenyue's career further.","But who could have imagined that the story of the mistress battling the original wife, as told by that little girl just now, was about these two!","Wasn't it always Ruan Jia being aggressive and Wang Jiani being weak and bullied?","No, now wasn't the time to worry about that. The problem was that everyone had heard it!","Moreover, Wang Jiani and Sheng Wenyue had practically confirmed it themselves just now!","Doing things behind closed doors was one thing, but openly admitting it was a completely different situation.","The manager was already drenched in sweat.","\"What's wrong?\" Wang Jiani suddenly felt a wave of unease.","The manager snapped out of his daze, realizing he couldn't continue to embarrass himself. He quickly pulled the two aside, \"There's something we need to discuss... outside...\"","As the door closed behind them, an eerie silence fell over the makeup room, until a woman's voice from outside lost control and screamed: \"What!\"","Someone inside couldn't help but exclaim \"Holy shit!\" followed by a \"Pfft!\"","Then, like a plague of locusts, the whispers turned into loud chatter, with many people casting admiring glances at Ji Fei.","They couldn't possibly think Ji Fei had done this intentionally from start to finish, but they felt that such a coincidence was terribly unlucky for Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani.","Thank goodness for Ji Fei! She had given them such juicy gossip, it couldn't be more exciting!","In all their years in the entertainment industry, they had never seen such a dramatic twist.","Many people picked up their phones. Even before the show had started filming, explosive news was already circulating within the industry.","It quickly dominated various gossip platforms, and although the idol's PR team quickly discovered and deleted the news, it had already made a significant impact.","The previously 'nostalgic' public square gradually saw different voices emerging in the CP super topics, and anti-fans began to form.","Others were simply enjoying the show.","Only Gao Hao's side looked grim, his face losing a shade of color as he pointed a trembling finger at Ji Fei.","\"I really didn't do it on purpose, look at my eyes, see how sincere they are.\"","Ji Fei blinked her large, innocent eyes.","[Sigh, if only Sheng Wenyue hadn't been so focused on Wang Jiani, rushing to her defense, and if Wang Jiani hadn't had the malicious intent of tattling on her in front of Sheng Wenyue, there might have been a way out. If they hadn't admitted it, people might not have made the connection. You reap what you sow, I suppose.]","Qin Zhao coughed, still feeling the need to protect his own.","Grabbing the trembling Gao Hao, he said, \"This can't be blamed on Ji Fei. How could she have known? They identified themselves with the story. That's called digging their own grave.\"","And he had to admit, it was damn entertaining to watch this drama unfold.","Oh right, he should share this with his family.","Ji Fei gave Qin Zhao an approving look.","The commotion in the makeup room naturally spread to the corridor.","Hearing the noise, Wang Jiani began to sob and cry.","\"It's not like that. How could Ji Fei make up such a story? It's not like that at all.\"","Sheng Wenyue recalled what had just happened, feeling a tingling sensation on his face as if it had been scraped by a steel knife. It wasn't hard to imagine how the people inside were mocking them, leaving him looking dazed and shaken.","\"Jiani, didn't you say you only met Ruan Jia later, when she discovered the stopped card and then beat you out of anger?\"","Ji Fei wasn't close to any of them and had no grudges, so how could she fabricate a story out of thin air? Even if Sheng Wenyue's head wasn't on straight, he could sense something was off.","Wang Jiani's sobs stopped for a moment, then she burst into tears again.","\"Brother, you don't believe me? How could I do such a thing? I was in a bad mood that day, my ex-husband had called to harass me again, and I was afraid I'd relapse if I stayed alone, so I went out for a walk. When I saw a pretty dress, I wanted to share it with you.\"","\"What? Your ex-husband contacted you again... why didn't you tell me!\" Upon hearing this, Sheng Wenyue remembered how battered Wang Jiani had looked when he first met her, a victim of domestic violence.","It was all their fault. Looking at the tear-stained Wang Jiani, Sheng Wenyue felt a pang of guilt and distress.","Wang Jiani shook her head vigorously, \"I've already caused so much trouble for you and your wife, making you argue constantly because of me. I didn't want to bother you. If someone had photographed us again, who knows how your wife would have reacted. I really don't understand why Ji Fei would target me like this. Could it be... does your wife know her?\"","Sheng Wenyue's brows furrowed, and he immediately took out his phone to find a number, but it took him a while to locate it.","He paused, realizing it had been a long time since Ruan Jia had called him.","It didn't occur to him that he hadn't called Ruan Jia in a long time either.","The phone rang for a long time, and Sheng Wenyue was growing impatient by the time the other party answered.","The first sound was a retching noise, but Sheng Wenyue thought it was static or that he had misheard. He immediately started questioning, \"Why did it take you so long to answer the phone?\"","The other end was quiet for a moment before a somewhat hoarse voice replied, \"What? Calling to explain that you spent last night innocently as well?\"","Sheng Wenyue choked, remembering that this issue was still unresolved.","Feeling embarrassed and angry, he said, \"Enough! How many times do I have to explain this kind of thing? I don't have time to argue with you now. I have something else to ask you. Do you know Ji Fei?\"","Ruan Jia was taken aback. She did know Ji Fei.","It was because after Qin Yan had sent her back to the hospital that day, she had inquired, and Qin Yan had introduced her as her sister-in-law, who would also be participating in the show.","Sensing the unusual pause on the other end.","\"So you do know her!\" Sheng Wenyue's voice grew deeper, as if suppressing something.","\"So what if I do?\" Ruan Jia was confused.","Meanwhile, Wang Jiani breathed a sigh of relief, but also felt very angry. They did know each other, so that day was intentionally targeting her.","\"Ruan Jia, did you not take my last warning seriously at all? You... you're beyond help.\"","Hearing the genuinely angry voice, Ruan Jia frowned, \"What are you talking about?\"","\"The dress!\" Sheng Wenyue said.","Ruan Jia was stunned, \"Huh, you know about that? And you still...\"","\"Ruan Jia, if there's a next time, we're getting a divorce. I can't communicate with you anymore.\"","Once again, it was Sheng Wenyue who hung up first.","Ruan Jia stared blankly at her phone, unable to understand what had just happened. Then she felt another wave of nausea."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: Why did he come back to court humiliation","paragraphs":["After hanging up the phone, Sheng Wenyue looked very disappointed. He hadn't expected Ruan Jia to become so unscrupulous. He said to Wang Jiani, \"I'm sorry, I apologize on behalf of Ruan Jia. She... she's gone completely mad. I'll definitely have a serious talk with her later.\"","\"It's alright, I understand she loves you. Love always makes people crazy. I... get it,\" Wang Jiani said. Hearing Sheng Wenyue mention divorce, she felt a surge of excitement. She hadn't expected this misfortune to turn into a blessing, making Sheng Wenyue lean more towards her.","She gazed at Sheng Wenyue with flirtatious eyes, but he involuntarily avoided her gaze.","Wang Jiani put on a pitiful, innocent, and wronged expression. Sheng Wenyue caught a glimpse of it, and his heart softened. In a moment of impulse, he grabbed Wang Jiani's wrist.","Wang Jiani was about to feel delighted.","\"I'll take you to clear things up!\" Sheng Wenyue declared.","Wang Jiani's face suddenly changed. How could she dare? She tried to hold Sheng Wenyue back, but it was too late.","It was because Sheng Wenyue saw her pitiful look and felt sorry for her that he was determined to stand up for her and seek justice for both of them.","Their manager was busy deleting posts and didn't stop Sheng Wenyue's impulsive act of justice in time.","The door of the makeup room was suddenly pushed open. The room, which had been as noisy as a marketplace just moments ago, instantly fell silent. No one had expected them to come back.","They had all prepared themselves mentally not to shoot with the famous actor's group. After all, publicly revealing such scandalous information was just... too embarrassing.","Oh no, now that they've returned, it's making the onlookers uncomfortable too. No one dared to make eye contact with Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani.","[Damn, they actually came back? Shouldn't they be too ashamed to show their faces, finish their work separately, and then sneak away?]","Not just Ji Fei, even Qin Zhao and Gao Hao were surprised to see the two at the door.","[I can feel the word 'awkward' floating in the air. Are they planning to use the 'as long as I'm not embarrassed, others will be' trick to deal with all this? Indeed, those who can survive in the entertainment industry rarely have thin skin.]","While Ji Fei was internally criticizing, she saw Sheng Wenyue, with an ashen face, pulling Wang Jiani towards her.","Judging by his expression, he was forcing himself to face this. However, Sheng Wenyue had transformed his embarrassment and anger into fury towards Ji Fei, and he immediately went on the offensive.","\"Miss Ji Fei, stealing Jiani's dress was one thing, but now you're making up stories and spreading rumors about my relationship with my junior without any discretion. Don't you think you've gone too far?\" Sheng Wenyue finished, his eyes sweeping over Gao Hao and Qin Zhao with a warning glance.","Wang Jiani's face paled, feeling guilty.","But suddenly, her eyes lit up as she remembered something. That kind of store would never provide surveillance footage, as it would violate customer privacy and cause brand reputation issues.","So there was basically no evidence of what happened that day. It all depended on how they told the story. With Sheng Wenyue trusting her so much, what did she have to worry about?","Wang Jiani steeled herself, deciding to carry the deception through to the end. She put on a look of someone who had suffered great injustice as she looked at Ji Fei.","Now everyone's eyes lit up again. Was there more to this drama? Was the earlier joke not an accident? Is it really this explosive?","Ji Fei was stunned.","She had originally just wanted to teach them a small lesson because she couldn't stand their behavior. They should have chosen to swallow their pride due to their guilty conscience. She hadn't expected them to confront her like this.","She had indeed stolen the dress for Ruan Jia and set them up, but...","[I'm spreading rumors? I'm not distinguishing right from wrong? How did he come to that conclusion... Damn, this is too much. The situation has reversed so fast I can't keep up. As expected, cheating men always believe their wives are lying and the other women are telling the truth. Just because Ruan Jia learned about my identity from her sister, he immediately assumed that I conspired with Ruan Jia?]","[Is he planning to stand up for Wang Jiani and settle scores with me?]","Qin Zhao frowned and immediately stood up, positioning himself in front of Ji Fei protectively. He was about to unleash his sharp tongue when Gao Hao stopped him.","Gao Hao couldn't allow the two sides to create a huge scene, but he also wouldn't let the other party walk all over them. So he smiled and said, \"Mr. Sheng, it's all a misunderstanding. Ji Fei was talking about someone else. How did you come to think it was about you?\"","Sheng Wenyue's manager had also arrived. The smart thing to do would have been to handle this quietly, but since Sheng Wenyue had already acted impulsively, they had no choice but to see it through. Otherwise, the famous actor's reputation in the industry would be at risk, and people would laugh at him.","\"We all know who Miss Ji was talking about. We don't want to cause trouble, but we're not afraid of it either. We'll be shooting the show together in the future, so it's best to clear up any misunderstandings now. We believe Miss Ji might have been taken advantage of due to her trusting nature. If Miss Ji is willing to sincerely apologize, we won't pursue this matter further,\" the manager said.","[Damn, this manager and Sheng Wenyue together don't even make up one complete brain. They actually believe Wang Jiani's words.]","With the two managers facing off, the atmosphere became tense. Other staff members wanted to find the director and producer.","But the onlookers from various groups became excited, almost wanting to gather around and shout, \"Fight! Fight!\"","\"Huh, asking our people to apologize? Are you joking?\" Qin Zhao said coldly.","The expressions of Sheng Wenyue and his two companions changed.","\"That seems to be asking too much. I believe our Miss Ji hasn't done anything wrong,\" Gao Hao's face also darkened.","Although he was initially anxious about the trouble Ji Fei had caused, he believed that Ji Fei definitely wasn't lying. So now it was Sheng Wenyue's group trying to deny everything and even attempting to turn the tables on Ji Fei. This couldn't be allowed!","\"Are you trying to cover for her?\" Sheng Wenyue's expression showed he was thoroughly angry.","Just as Qin Zhao and Gao Hao were about to speak, Ji Fei interrupted them.","\"Um, I don't understand. Mr. Sheng, you just said I was spreading rumors?\" Ji Fei suddenly asked with an innocent look.","\"Aren't you?\" Sheng Wenyue replied with a cold stare.","Ji Fei opened and closed her mouth, looking completely confused as she said, \"So, you're not married? You're single?\"","Sheng Wenyue was suddenly at a loss for words, not understanding why this question came out of nowhere.","Ji Fei curved her lips slightly, \"Or are you saying you didn't stop your wife's card because of Miss Wang? And you didn't give your VIP supplementary card to Miss Wang to use?\"","Sheng Wenyue's pupils contracted.","\"Or maybe you're saying you didn't deliberately ignore your wife's calls, couldn't be reached even when she called your assistant, but you replied to Miss Wang's messages instantly?\"","Sheng Wenyue's face gradually turned red.","\"Perhaps your wife and Miss Wang never met that day?\"","Sheng Wenyue remembered the slap and finally found it difficult to breathe.","Ji Fei said with a troubled expression, \"Mr. Sheng, exactly which part of what I said was a rumor?\"","[You want me to prove myself? Why don't I expose you as the hypocrite you are first!]","Qin Zhao immediately felt relieved. As expected, only his sister-in-law could bully others; there was no chance for others to bully her.","At first, everyone was skeptical, quietly observing and waiting for Sheng Wenyue to refute. But after waiting for a while, they found that the person who had just been accusing Ji Fei of spreading rumors couldn't utter a single word now.","Even the manager seemed choked up.","Didn't this prove that all the questions just now were true?","And they thought there would be some kind of twist!","Everyone looked at Sheng Wenyue in disbelief.","Why did he come back, only to humiliate himself?","And he came back so aggressively and self-righteously?","How did he have the confidence? He must be an idiot."]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: This group of netizens is truly the best I have ever encountered","paragraphs":["Sheng Wenyue felt he had a clear conscience about certain matters, so he didn't bother lying about them.","However, when something is repeatedly brought up, even if you feel innocent, the stares from those around you can make your face sting.","\"That's not what I'm talking about, I mean...\" Sheng Wenyue suddenly found himself at a loss for words.","Ji Fei didn't give him a chance to speak, \"Not this? So... all of this is true? Actually, I wasn't very sure if it was your wife and Teacher Wang arguing that day. But now...\"","The unfinished sentence spoke volumes.","Sheng Wenyue was completely thrown off rhythm, unsure how to react. He could only say, \"There are reasons for all of that. She made a mistake, so...\"","\"What mistake did she make?\"","Wang Jiani felt anxious, fearing Sheng Wenyue would reveal everything. She was also feeling guilty, knowing that saying too much would only make things worse. Understanding Sheng Wenyue's nature, she decided to step in herself.","\"Stop changing the subject. We're talking about you spreading rumors about me fighting over a dress with someone else. That never happened. Someone put you up to this, didn't they?\"","This statement immediately elicited several awkward coughs.","Wang Jiani was stunned, turning her head only to see a sea of hesitant glances.","It was as if everyone was silently saying: No, no, no, the gossip about the wife and the mistress fighting over a dress isn't the point anymore.","The point is, regardless of any hidden reasons, the Best Actor Sheng really did mistreat his wife and defend the other woman. And now he's here questioning others. Are you two really not feeling guilty?","Wang Jiani suddenly felt humiliated, her whole body trembling.","Even Sheng Wenyue could sense the contempt from everyone around.","But he didn't understand why. He hadn't done anything wrong...","Before they could react, Ji Fei put on an air of being insulted and frowned, \"What? You're saying it never happened and someone put me up to it? Who? That wife of yours? Did she admit to instructing me to frame you?\"","Sensing danger, the Agent quickly responded, \"Yes, she admitted to knowing you!\"","\"I'm a celebrity, and I'm on the same show as her husband. Isn't it normal for her to know me?\" Ji Fei asked incredulously. \"I'm just asking if she admitted to instructing me?\"","This question silenced the three of them again.","\"Who would admit to such a thing!\" Wang Jiani immediately retorted.","Ji Fei scoffed and looked at Wang Jiani, \"You lie so easily! Mr. Sheng, I'm not lying. Who do you believe, me or her?\"","Ji Fei's sudden outburst momentarily confused everyone.","Wang Jiani was stunned for a moment, then almost laughed out loud when she realized what was happening.","Sheng Wenyue also snapped back to reality, looking at Ji Fei in shock. He responded matter-of-factly, \"You expect me to believe you, a stranger, over my own junior? How well do I know you?\"","Everyone thought: Miss Ji Fei, regardless of the truth, why would he trust you based on your relationship? This rebuttal isn't very clever! Quick, try something else, don't lose your edge!","Unexpectedly, Ji Fei's next move was to put on a regretful face and say, \"You're right, I shouldn't have asked. Mr. Sheng doesn't even trust his own wife, so why would he trust someone he's just met?\"","This statement instantly froze Sheng Wenyue's face.","Everyone: Huh?","\"Teacher Wang is indeed impressive. She can earn Mr. Sheng's absolute trust with just a few words, without needing to provide any evidence. Unlike me, who would probably need to provide proof to be believed. It's true that comparisons are odious.\"","Wang Jiani wanted to say something but didn't know how to start. Her face gradually turned pale.","Everyone: Oh?!","\"I'm not complaining though. After all, when Mr. Sheng's wife was wrongly accused, she didn't even get a chance to provide evidence. She was casually accused of finding someone to bully Teacher Wang. It's really... well, I feel better now.\"","The Agent was dumbfounded.","Everyone: Wow! Impressive! This sarcasm is on point!","The temperature in the makeup room started to rise, making certain people feel anxious and embarrassed.","However, Wang Jiani still had an ace up her sleeve. Suddenly, with tears in her eyes, she began to sob and plead.","\"I understand now. You're standing up for my sister-in-law, that's why you're targeting me. But my relationship with my senior is truly innocent. She's wrongly accusing us. What do you want me to do for you to believe us? Do you want me to die?\"","This statement scared everyone a bit. They were just here for the drama, how did it escalate to this?","Sheng Wenyue immediately snapped back to reality. Wang Jiani had a history of self-harm and mental health issues, which she had only recently overcome through treatment. If she wasn't being wrongly accused, why would she suddenly have such impulses again?","\"Enough! You're defending Ruan Jia like this and still claim you don't know her!\" Sheng Wenyue completely ignored all the previous doubts and desperately defended Wang Jiani. \"I've already warned Ruan Jia that if she continues to make baseless accusations against Jiani, I won't side with family over justice!\"","[Side with justice over family? Come on, man, do you even know how to write those words? I've never seen someone so blatantly twist right and wrong! The problem is he still thinks he's in the right!]","Qin Zhao, knowing the whole truth thanks to Ji Fei's inner thoughts, was so shocked that he blurted out, \"Mr. Sheng, haven't you got that backwards?\"","This unintentional sarcasm hit even harder.","It made everyone cough awkwardly, secretly giving Qin Zhao a thumbs up.","Whether it was to save face or to convince himself that he was right, Sheng Wenyue decided to go all in, \"That's because you don't know what my wife has done to Wang Jiani. She's paranoid, doesn't trust me, and is always trying to get at Jiani. Jiani has never been disrespectful to her, but she won't let it go.\"","He hadn't wanted to say this originally – family shame shouldn't be aired in public, and he was willing to give Ruan Jia a chance to change. But Wang Jiani was innocent and shouldn't have to endure this anymore.","\"Ji Fei, I don't care what she told you, but I will get to the bottom of this rumor-spreading incident.\"","Ji Fei hadn't expected that even at this point, Sheng Wenyue would still unconditionally believe Wang Jiani. Indeed, childhood sweethearts couldn't compete with a sudden romance. It was truly nauseating.","She immediately thought about just calling the police. Although such stores wouldn't provide surveillance videos to protect their reputation, if Ji Fei reported it to the police, they could obtain the footage through proper channels.","At critical moments, trust in the law is key.","Just then, various phone notifications suddenly started going off throughout the makeup room.","People didn't want to pay attention at first, but the commotion became too much to ignore, and everyone glanced at their phones.","With one look, their pupils dilated in shock.","Sheng Wenyue and his Agent's phones also exploded with notifications almost simultaneously.","Sheng Wenyue could ignore it, but his Agent had to check. He picked up his phone and looked.","In an instant, his face turned pale. He swallowed hard and looked at Wang Jiani with trembling lips.","Meanwhile, Sheng Wenyue was still defending Wang Jiani, using his eyes to sternly warn Ji Fei, hoping she would know better than to add fuel to the fire. But he noticed that Ji Fei's face suddenly went blank before breaking into a strange, excited smile.","Gao Hao curiously took out his constantly vibrating phone. Qin Zhao didn't check his phone but heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[It seems even the heavens couldn't stand by anymore! Indeed, the power of netizens searching for gossip evidence is something no amount of capital can withstand.]","[Because of the earlier prank, the leaked gossip information made netizens itch for more. After a series of operations, they actually found a secretly recorded video from inside the store.]","[Oh, it turns out that an employee, seeing other customers present, boldly recorded the gossip. This way, even if investigated by higher-ups, they couldn't prove it was an employee who recorded it.]","[Then this employee habitually shared about eccentric customers online. Although faces weren't shown in the video, it matched the story reposted by marketing accounts one-to-one, with many details proving identities, instantly becoming solid evidence.]","[The mistress bullying the wife was vividly displayed, causing fans to panic.]","[Ruan Jia and Sheng Wenyue's marriage certificate was also leaked, along with various online traces of their relationship from elementary school to work, childhood sweethearts growing up together.]","[Someone even captured photos of Ruan Jia sunbathing at the hospital. People started speculating that Ruan Jia was seriously ill.]","[The 'childhood sweethearts' CP fans were stunned. The online sentiment quickly shifted, and by the time they realized it, they had been bombarded by keyboard warriors. Secret marriage, married man, CP rumors, tendency to cheat, critically ill original wife, and being bullied by the mistress - this was absolutely infuriating! The Best Actor's image was shattered!]","[Hahaha! These internet users are truly the best batch I've ever encountered.]","[Wait a minute, I need to watch Sheng Wenyue closely. I want to see how he'll steadfastly defend his 'heaven-sent' love after seeing this video.]","Before the Agent could pull Sheng Wenyue away, the Producer and Director finally stopped hiding and rushed over to find him. This was a major incident."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: Must Kick Someone When They're Down","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Sheng, Ms. Wang, you need to give us an explanation for this!\" the producer cried out anxiously.","Sheng Wenyue, who had been confronting Ji Fei with daggers drawn, and Wang Jiani, who was feigning a fragile breakdown, both froze at these words.","It seemed they had just realized that the atmosphere in the entire makeup room had become tense.","Everyone wore a dumbfounded expression, alternating between glancing at their phones and giving them strange looks.","Those gazes contained various emotions - some seemed to want to speak but held back, some concealed mockery, while others were full of disrespect and schadenfreude.","What now? Had something happened online?","Although they knew that the trouble Ji Fei had stirred up had been leaked, it should have disappeared by now due to lack of evidence, drowned out by their fans' rebuttals.","\"What's the matter?\" Sheng Wenyue asked.","The manager pulled back his shocked gaze and was about to show Sheng Wenyue his phone, but his hand couldn't help trembling. He hadn't expected that in this whole affair, the person who had been lying from start to finish was actually Wang Jiani.","Before he could act, the usually unused projector in the makeup room suddenly lit up.","As Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were still confused, a voice abruptly came through.","\"It's so expensive, can Sister Ruan Jia afford it?\"","The familiar voice and the mentioned name made Sheng Wenyue whip his head around.","On the large gray-white screen, only figures from the neck down could be seen, with two female customers standing face to face.","One of them looked very glamorous, wearing the same dress Wang Jiani had been photographed in when she sent the picture that day.","Sheng Wenyue couldn't immediately distinguish Ruan Jia's figure and clothes opposite Wang Jiani, as she was too thin and her clothes seemed very loose. He could only identify her by the black card and the voice coming from the speakers.","Listening to Ruan Jia's embarrassment, watching her frantic attempts to make a call, and finally seeing Wang Jiani take out his supplementary card... and then that slap...","\"No!\" Wang Jiani finally lost control and screamed, her mind blank, forgetting to maintain her gentle, beautiful, and pitiful image. She shouted, \"Turn it off, turn it off! Who did this? Turn it off!\"","Qin Zhao silently put away his phone, watching Wang Jiani's clownish behavior.","Just now, because Ji Fei had suddenly complained, \"If only we could publicly execute them,\" Qin Zhao had thought of using this tactic.","Who told Wang Jiani to do such despicable things and still attempt to deny it, throwing mud at Ji Fei? The Qin family was known for protecting their own.","Someone, unable to bear Wang Jiani's noise, directly quipped,","\"Oh my, Ms. Wang, there's no use panicking. This video has already spread across the entire internet, everyone has seen it.\"","These words hit like a thunderbolt, causing Wang Jiani's legs to give way, and she collapsed to the ground.","At this moment, Sheng Wenyue seemed to have lost his soul, staring blankly as the video continued to play.","Ji Fei hadn't expected there would really be a public execution, and almost couldn't hold back her laughter.","\"Now's the time to kick her while she's down, watch my performance,\" she thought.","She stepped forward and said to Wang Jiani, \"Ms. Wang, do you still need to prove your innocence with death?\"","Wang Jiani's expression froze, and she looked at Ji Fei with angry humiliation. Ji Fei blinked and said with a sigh, \"I have to say, as expected of someone with professional training. Coming here to film the show really allows one to learn things.\"","Wang Jiani's expression instantly twisted, her face radiating a kaleidoscope of emotions.","Hearing this, the others wanted to laugh but held it in, all remembering Wang Jiani's earlier breakdown performance, which had startled them.","Yes, indeed, the acting skills of a professionally trained performer are truly professional.","Who could have guessed that before the show even started filming, they'd already be getting an acting lesson?","Ji Fei turned to look at Sheng Wenyue with a smile.","\"There's one more. Catch a thief red-handed, catch an adulterer in the act, you can't escape either.\"","\"Is this what Mr. Sheng was talking about?\" she asked.","Sheng Wenyue looked over almost mechanically, only to hear Ji Fei mimicking what he had just said, getting right in his face: \"Jiani has never been disrespectful to her... hmm...\"","The color drained from Sheng Wenyue's face inch by inch.","The video happened to be playing the part where Ruan Jia passed by the two silhouettes.","Ji Fei pointed directly at one of them and said, \"That's me, see? Your wife really didn't say a word to me, so...\"","Sheng Wenyue's body swayed. So they really didn't know each other, so there really was no instigation, no orchestration. Everything was just a coincidence.","Ji Fei smiled brightly and said, \"So, regarding this matter of spreading rumors, I will still pursue it to the end. Unless you sincerely apologize to me.\"","Ji Fei had essentially returned all the accusations that Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani had thrown at her.","Finally, she added, \"I believe that Mr. Sheng, now that he's seen the truth, will surely side with justice rather than personal relationships!\"","At this, everyone finally couldn't hold back their laughter anymore.","It wasn't that they didn't know how to behave, it was truly impossible to hold it in!","Their managers' faces had turned pale. They had come in so arrogantly earlier, but now they were truly trembling with fear, wanting to step forward to ease the situation.","\"Ms. Ji, it's all a misunderstanding, we can handle this properly.\"","Gao Hao immediately raised his head and said, \"No, we need your apology. If it hadn't suddenly blown up online, our Ms. Ji would have been wrongfully accused to death.\"","The manager quickly nudged Sheng Wenyue.","But Sheng Wenyue's expression had already cracked, and he was in no state to care about anything else, not even the mockery from the crowd.","He looked down at Wang Jiani in disbelief, this time not compassionately helping her up, but asking in a trembling voice, \"What... what's going on? You lied to me?\"","Wang Jiani no longer dared to raise her head. With such iron-clad evidence, she could no longer quibble and could only cry with muffled sobs.","\"Tell me, why did you lie!\" Sheng Wenyue suddenly erupted in anger.","It was unclear whether he was regretting wrongly accusing his wife or was ashamed and angry at so righteously defending someone who had deceived him.","\"No, senior, it's not... I didn't want to, I...\"","Realizing there was no way out, Wang Jiani suddenly burst into tears and ran out, looking completely devastated.","Wang Jiani's assistant and other staff naturally awkwardly rushed out after her, while Sheng Wenyue still stood rooted to the spot, his whole body trembling with anger, yet his face full of bewilderment and helplessness, as if he still couldn't believe this reality.","The manager, however, was already as anxious as an ant on a hot pan.","Weibo's hot search had crashed due to the explosive gossip about the film emperor's household, so netizens had switched to short video platforms. Within half an hour, the news had spread like wildfire, and even the standby PR team, transforming into an octopus-like entity, couldn't intercept it in time.","He knew this was the biggest crisis in Sheng Wenyue's career. After all, the issue wasn't just about the video; it had become a matter of personal character and morality. The director and producer were also eyeing them hungrily, waiting for their solution.","The 'Youth Comeback' duo could be considered the biggest traffic draw for the \"My Acting, Cut!\" show. If something went wrong, it could indeed bring a short-term traffic explosion to the show, but it would also implicate the production team in a scandal. After all, they were essentially operating under the banner of helping the film emperor assist his former CP in making a comeback.","Online, there were already accusations of them abetting evil and helping a mistress.","That's why the director and producer were so anxious; they needed to come up with countermeasures immediately."]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Why So Polite with Your Insults Is Something on Your Mind","paragraphs":["The agent also knew that if this wasn't handled properly, the consequences would be unimaginable.","He wanted to quickly pull the dazed Sheng Wenyue back to deal with the situation. But before he could take a step, he heard Gao Hao cough, as if reminding him of something.","The agent was so anxious he could spit blood, but he truly didn't dare to offend any other powers further.","\"I'm sorry, we didn't investigate this matter clearly. We apologize to Teacher Ji,\" the agent said, finally acting professionally and showing he could be both firm and flexible.","But the other party showed no reaction, refusing to give face.","The agent could only tug hard on Sheng Wenyue, who came back to his senses and gradually felt a mix of shame and anger.","After all, he was the Best Actor, his status far higher than Ji Fei, this newcomer. Even if he had made some mistake, Ji Fei hadn't suffered any real loss. How could she be so aggressive, forcing him to apologize?","Sheng Wenyue felt he was losing face, but his dignity had already been repeatedly crushed in this room. So no matter how ugly his expression became, it held no deterrent power.","With the agent urging him intensely, Sheng Wenyue could only force out the words, \"I'm sorry, I misunderstood.\"","A Best Actor bowing his head to a newcomer - this was certainly rare news in the entertainment circle.","The other group members all looked at Ji Fei, this newcomer, with new eyes. She was truly extraordinary and mystifying.","But they also felt she was making too many enemies. At this point, shouldn't she let the matter rest, give some face? \"Leave some leeway in public, it'll be easier to meet in the future,\" wasn't that how it should go? Why was she still insisting on an apology?","However, in the next second, Ji Fei made them realize they had jumped to conclusions too early.","Ji Fei sighed and said, \"I'm also a magnanimous person. Although I've suffered an undeserved calamity, I won't nitpick. However, there's still one person who hasn't apologized, so I can't say I forgive you just yet.\"","Everyone: !!!! Not nitpicking?","The agent, director, and producer: Whose calamity is this exactly?!","Sheng Wenyue hadn't expected Ji Fei to say she couldn't forgive them. He was stunned, and in the end, was pulled away by his agent.","Naturally, the Best Actor's group didn't film their promotional video. The other groups filmed first, but everyone was distracted, splitting their attention between work and following the drama online.","Everyone was curious how the Best Actor would resolve this crisis, but even by evening, when all the filming had finished and everyone had gone home, there was still no response from the Best Actor's side.","The show's production team was anxious to distance themselves, saying they knew nothing and everything depended on the Best Actor's response.","Online, die-hard fans and CP fans were still demanding the truth, unwilling to face reality. But ordinary fans and passersby had thoroughly joined the frenzy of tearing off the mask of the scumbag Best Actor and his mistress junior.","From the marriage seven years ago, to the abnormal interactions of the CP four years ago, Wang Jiani being suddenly sent away, to now the various 'romantic in the past, eye-searing now' rumors, netizens had gone over everything again and again.","Analysis posts were emerging in droves, the criticism getting increasingly fierce. It could be said that the Best Actor and his former CP's traffic had finally backfired.","At the Qin Family home, everyone was gossiping about the entertainment industry earthquake caused by Ji Fei's first day of work over tea and dinner.","But except for Ji Fei, who was truly chatting and surfing the internet to follow the drama, the others were pretending to surf while actually focusing intently on Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","After all, the online gossip wasn't guaranteed to be true, but Ji Fei's inside scoop was definitely authentic, and even more juicy.","[Half the netizens are criticizing, it's really concerning. Did the other half get their keyboards stolen?]","[The criticism is so polite, is something wrong?]","[What? There are still people who believe they're innocent? Do they have two nostrils under their eyebrows? Can they only blink and not see?]","[Forget it, no progress. Let me see what's happening with Wang Jiani.]","Everyone immediately pricked up their ears.","[Holy crap... she attempted suicide?]","Everyone was shocked.","[Fake? Pretending to trick Sheng Wenyue.]","Everyone: ...","[Damn, that's extreme. She said it was because she had resentment over being tricked into that drinking party back then, her emotions were unstable which led to this, and after the impulse she deeply regretted it, but was afraid Sheng Wenyue would hate her so she lied... Is she pushing all the blame onto the psychiatry department? Did she ask if the doctor agreed? If Sheng Wenyue believes this, he's no different from a pig.]","Everyone couldn't help but nod. The excuse was too far-fetched, and they had all heard that the drinking party was actually orchestrated by Wang Jiani herself.","Moreover, after this lie, shouldn't Sheng Wenyue reconsider whether the drinking party incident was true or false?","[Oh my god, he didn't believe it...]","Everyone breathed a small sigh of relief, feeling there was still hope, when they heard Ji Fei curse in her mind.","[He's worse than a pig! When Sheng Wenyue expressed doubt, Wang Jiani went all out, confessing directly, saying it was because she loved him, she had been resentful about being sent away and separated years ago, so she couldn't help herself... Ah ah ah! Yuck~]","Everyone was listening in shock when they heard this reaction...","They wanted to grab Ji Fei and ask: What happened? What happened?","[She actually threw herself at him and kissed him! And he didn't dodge! He was kissed for quite a while before coming to his senses and pushing Wang Jiani away, saying he couldn't respond to her feelings because he actually loved Ruan Jia... OMG, shut up! How disgusting!]","Everyone: Yuck!!!!","[What? Just like that? A confession and a kiss, and Sheng Wenyue isn't going to pursue the matter of Wang Jiani bullying Ruan Jia? He thinks it's just a moment of passion, understandable? He's even comforting Wang Jiani, telling her not to cry, saying he'll find a way to resolve the current predicament.]","[You dare to call Ruan Jia while in Wang Jiani's room? Thank goodness Ruan Jia didn't answer!]","[Damn, Ruan Jia is in a coma due to treatment medication issues, and he actually thinks she's deliberately not answering the phone? He felt guilty at first, but after not being able to get through for a while, he thinks she's being unreasonable and throwing a tantrum?]","[Hey, bro, you know you're in the wrong! Have you forgotten how you used to often give Ruan Jia the cold shoulder and not answer her calls?]","[Indeed, the silence of the distant one can't compete with the tears of the one before your eyes!]","Although they didn't know these people at all, the Qin family members were all furious by this point. No wonder keyboard warriors liked to fire away online to maintain justice, they also wanted to fire away and curse fiercely.","[Aaaaaah!]","Suddenly, Ji Fei's inner voice screamed in shock and anger, her face changing color.","Everyone held their breath. Could there be something even worse?","[This agent is actually encouraging Sheng Wenyue to push all the blame onto Ruan Jia, then divorce her and marry Wang Jiani, saying this would cause the least harm to everyone and could salvage the situation? Do you hear yourself? Are the words 'lacking morals' tattooed on your forehead as a lamp?]","Everyone: Although we don't know how this agent would operate, he really is extremely unethical!","On the balcony of Wang Jiani's apartment.","The agent said, \"You need to make a decision. Get a divorce, let Ruan Jia issue a statement admitting her mistake, then officially get together with Jiani. That's the only way to get through this.\"","\"No!\" Sheng Wenyue said, \"Are you crazy? She's my wife! I only mentioned divorce to Ruan Jia to scare her, to stop her constant nagging. I never actually thought about...\""]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Some Poisonous Content (Sorry)","paragraphs":["The agent said, \"If it weren't for the interference four years ago, you two might have been together already. Why keep deceiving yourself?\"","A flicker of panic crossed Sheng Wenyue's eyes. \"I never thought about cheating or doing anything to hurt Ruan Jia.\"","\"But that's not how netizens see it now. We absolutely cannot let this leaked information be labeled as infidelity during marriage. Otherwise, both you and Wang Jiani will be finished.\"","Seeing that Sheng Wenyue still wouldn't budge, the agent continued his agitated analysis:","\"Even if we make Wang Jiani the villain and you and Ruan Jia play it up, saying you were just helping a junior from the same agency and didn't expect it to cause misunderstandings. But that's not enough to prove your innocence. People will say your behavior was improper, that you didn't avoid suspicion...\"","Sheng Wenyue angrily interrupted, \"My conscience is clear. I'm innocent.\"","\"But your endorsements, the company's stock price, have all been affected. It's not something you can change just by saying your conscience is clear,\" the agent said. \"You can't be the one at fault. You can only be the victim to preserve everything you have now. As long as you listen to me, divorce could...\"","\"Enough, stop talking. I won't get divorced,\" Sheng Wenyue said firmly.","\"Then how do you propose to solve this? With that video out there, Wang Jiani can't be cleared. If we try to let it blow over, the result will be the same as if she took all the blame. But can you bear that? Wang Jiani is a talented actress. If we really choose this path, she'll be completely ruined. She's already been destroyed once before. Aren't you afraid she'll attempt suicide again? Didn't you always say that you and Ruan Jia owed her?\"","Sheng Wenyue's body stiffened, his eyes becoming vacant. His lips trembled, \"I can't do this to Ruan Jia! She hasn't done anything wrong.\"","The agent's expression changed as he said, \"That may not be true.\"","Sheng Wenyue looked at the agent in shock. \"What do you mean?\"","The agent calmly analyzed, \"What about those photos of her being sick?\"","Sheng Wenyue swayed as if just remembering this detail, a flash of worry crossing his mind: Could she really be sick?","\"Didn't you say before that she pretended to be sick to stop you from helping Wang Jiani? How can there be such a coincidence in this world?\" the agent said. \"And after this happened, why isn't she answering her phone? Isn't it because she feels guilty?\"","Sheng Wenyue froze, frowning as he said, \"You mean she deliberately staged those photos to add fuel to the fire?\"","\"Isn't it just that she saw an opportunity to get revenge on you, gain sympathy from netizens, stand on the moral high ground, and force you to abandon Wang Jiani and have a change of heart?\" the agent said dismissively.","Sheng Wenyue's expression changed. That's right, Ruan Jia couldn't have suddenly fallen ill, yet there were these fake photos. It was clearly intentional.","\"She's so inconsiderate of the big picture, causing us so much trouble. Wenyue, you really should teach her a lesson. Not only can't she help your career, but she's trying to hinder it.\"","The agent knew that with Sheng Wenyue's acting skills, he was currently at the peak of his popularity. At his age, it was time to change direction and seek greater development. So his blueprint was for the leading actor and actress to advance hand in hand towards a mid-life career trajectory, rather than an ordinary wife who could only hide in the background and worry about exposure risks at any time.","But Sheng Wenyue had always adhered to his principles, making it impossible for the agent to realize his vision. However, he also felt that Sheng Wenyue would eventually follow his own heart and choose true love.","Perhaps this was the opportunity.","Seeing Sheng Wenyue's face darken, he began to angrily try to call Ruan Jia again. But still, no one answered.","The agent wanted to encourage him further, but Sheng Wenyue still wasn't willing to give in.","The agent sighed, only addressing the current situation, \"Actually, you could pacify Ruan Jia and get the divorce papers done first. You can treat it as a fake divorce, just wait for this storm to blow over before deciding what to do next.\"","Whether they would remarry or marry someone else later, the agent didn't care.","Sheng Wenyue obviously paused for a moment. A fake divorce and a sincere divorce, even if both were 'de facto divorces', seemed to represent completely different meanings in his eyes.","The agent sensed an opportunity and said directly, \"Explain the pros and cons clearly to Ruan Jia. I'm not targeting your wife, it's just that if we let Ruan Jia be the villain, the losses would be minimized. She's an ordinary person, even if she's hated by everyone online, she can go abroad to avoid it for a while. After some time, there won't be any more attention on her. She won't suffer any losses at all, which is better than ruining you, Wang Jiani, and the whole company, right? At worst, you can compensate her more afterwards. If she truly loves you, she definitely wouldn't want to really ruin you, she'll definitely cooperate with you.\"","Sheng Wenyue's eyes flickered slightly. Just then, the phone connected.","Sheng Wenyue felt a panic in his heart, but reflexively asked in his coldest tone, \"Where are you? Why didn't you answer the phone for so long? I have something to tell you. Let's meet.\"","\"...I'm in the hospital.\"","Sheng Wenyue was stunned, feeling a surge of anger rise suddenly. He was already annoyed and dizzy, yet Ruan Jia was still full of lies.","\"Enough! When will this end? Ruan Jia, the video incident was indeed unfair to you, it's my fault, but did you have to add fuel to the fire? I've already told you, there's nothing between me and Jiani, I won't betray our marriage. Why do you still have to use the trick of pretending to be sick to manipulate me?\" Sheng Wenyue instinctively retorted, as if firmly believing that Ruan Jia couldn't possibly be sick.","There was silence on Ruan Jia's end. Sheng Wenyue felt inexplicably suffocated for a moment, but still angrily ignored all the abnormalities.","\"Forget it, I won't argue with you, and I won't hold it against you for posting those photos. You must know the situation online now, it's too serious, Jiani almost died just now. We've thought of a solution here.\"","As he spoke, Sheng Wenyue quickly explained the pros and cons of who should take the blame, but when it came to mentioning the fake divorce, he seemed unable to say it, feeling strangely anxious. As the agent kept urging him, Ruan Jia suddenly exploded on the other end.","\"Sheng Wenyue, did I hear wrong? You want me to admit that I provoked her in the video, you want me to admit I'm faking illness? You want me to apologize to everyone online, are you crazy? You clearly know your wife has been bullied and wronged, yet you still want to protect Wang Jiani and make me admit to those false accusations. Is this what you mean by not betraying our marriage? Then what would count as betrayal, only after you sleep with her?\"","Ruan Jia was now sprawled awkwardly on the bed, her body drenched in sweat from pain and trembling with anger, almost shouting herself hoarse, as if on the verge of an emotional breakdown.","Sheng Wenyue was stunned by the shouting, feeling stung when he heard the words \"sleep with her\", as if his integrity had been insulted. He angrily said, \"What nonsense are you talking about! Stop arguing, Ruan Jia. You've been wronged this time, I will definitely make it up to you, listen to me...\"","\"No way! You want me to clear things up for her, pave the way for your future, no way! She loves to commit suicide so much, why can't she just die? Just die already!\"","Why wouldn't someone like that die, but instead let her...","Sheng Wenyue didn't expect Ruan Jia to say such vicious words. He was so angry that he couldn't hear Ruan Jia's crying, and said coldly in irritation, \"If you don't cooperate, then divorce!\"","As always, he felt this was enough to threaten Ruan Jia who had loved him for many years. After saying this, he hung up the phone, giving her time to reconsider.","But he only heard Ruan Jia say coldly, having lost all emotion, \"I would rather die than cooperate, don't dream! If it's divorce, then divorce.\"","It was Ruan Jia who hung up the phone first.","Sheng Wenyue stared at his phone, his expression extremely ugly. The company had already pushed the deadline to the last minute, leaving no more time for them to consider.","At the Qin family's side.","The family members, hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, were all a bit nervous, constantly refreshing the hot search on their phones, very doubtful whether Sheng Wenyue would really sacrifice his innocent wife.","They all felt that since they were childhood sweethearts who loved each other enough to get married, he wouldn't be so muddleheaded as to humiliate his original wife to this extent for the sake of a mistress.","However, thinking of the black card and supplementary card incident, the Qin family members all felt it was unlikely.","Soon, the first explosive news came out.","A medical examination report of Ruan Jia was posted on the lead actor's studio's homepage, with the word \"Healthy\" printed in large green letters.","Public opinion exploded instantly.","\"Where did this medical report come from? Do they dare to fake even this?\" Qin Yan had the most say on this, after all, the person was still receiving treatment in their hospital.","Ji Fei also saw the post and exclaimed, \"This is... utterly shameless!\"","\"This report doesn't look fake, but... the timing is off,\" Qin Xian said as he leaned in to look at Ji Fei's phone, immediately spotting the issue.","[I'll check it out. Sure enough, it's Ruan Jia's medical report from a year ago, but they've cropped out the date. They're deliberately misleading netizens, making them question those photos of her in hospital gowns. They might as well directly accuse Ruan Jia of being a fraud who staged the whole thing.]"]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Overwhelming Accusations","paragraphs":["The public relations team of the Best Actor was naturally very impressive, able to turn black and white upside down and confuse day and night.","After using the health report to shake the morale of the army of condemnation built up by netizens, they quickly followed with a statement.","First, they admitted the mistake of hiding the marriage, then gave a preview saying they would tell everyone the whole truth in a live broadcast program. They also hinted that the Best Actor and Wang Jiani were both innocent.","[Damn, they want to use the popularity of the show to vividly portray their lies, help them whitewash their image, and by not explaining now, they're also giving Ruan Jia one last chance. If Ruan Jia cooperates with their other proposals, they won't need to use this method.]","The Qin Family was shocked. Could they really play it this way?","\"That Ruan Jia will come out to prove her innocence, right?\" Qin's Mom said in bewilderment.","\"Ruan Jia has never wanted others to know about her illness,\" Qin Yan frowned.","\"Why don't you try to persuade her, big sister?\" Qin Rong asked anxiously.","Qin Yan felt that as the hospital director, she could show concern for a patient, so she inquired about the situation.","The hospital told Qin Yan that Ruan Jia had seen the news online and seemed to be devastated. She had locked herself away, and nurses and doctors were unable to communicate with her.","If Ruan Jia didn't come forward, no one else could do anything on her behalf.","The next day, promotional videos of Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were ready online, and CP fans' hopes were rekindled from the ashes.","Public opinion had been completely guided. Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were portrayed as star-crossed lovers who couldn't be together, while Ruan Jia was the evil original wife, stubbornly refusing to let go despite not being loved, and causing trouble for others.","Although it wasn't official news, it sparked widespread sharing. It wasn't hard to see whose marketing ploy this was.","The Qin Family watched these maneuvers with wide eyes.","\"Why do unfaithful people always seem to live better than faithful ones?\" Qin Rong couldn't help but ask Ji Fei.","Ji Fei replied, \"Because faithful people have more moral constraints than unfaithful ones, so they worry more. People who worry more are more likely to get sick. So this teaches us a lesson.\"","Everyone looked over curiously.","\"Vent your frustrations outwardly on others more, and reflect inwardly on yourself less. That's the secret to longevity,\" Ji Fei said with a profound look.","Just as Ji Fei was criticizing, she received a call from Gao Hao.","Gao Hao had just received the notice.","\"The first day's shooting schedule is out. I don't know if it's a coincidence or the program team stirring up drama, but we'll be competing against the Best Actor's group, performing with the theme of 'true love'. They'll perform first, and we'll follow. Although the competition system is more advantageous for us, it's clear that no one will pay attention to us. This is obviously the program team giving the Best Actor's group a chance to hold a clarification press conference. Anyone in their group is just cannon fodder. So we can only keep a level head. Let's be conservative with our script and wait until the storm of public opinion they bring has passed before saying anything, to avoid getting caught up in it.\"","Ji Fei asked curiously, \"They specifically chose our group, is it deliberate retaliation?\"","Gao Hao sneered.","Ji Fei pondered, \"True love, huh. I have some ideas for the script.\"","On the day of filming, in the waiting area.","Sheng Wenyue was staring at his phone absentmindedly. He had been waiting for Ruan Jia to contact him, thinking she would be furious and come looking for him after seeing the news, but Ruan Jia hadn't done anything, which made him uneasy.","\"Senior, why don't we just give up? It's all my fault,\" Wang Jiani said, looking pitiful.","\"Things have progressed to this point, there's no turning back now. With the broadcast of the show, there must be a divorce announcement,\" the manager reminded.","Sheng Wenyue closed his eyes briefly, \"If she still won't bow her head even now, forget it. Let the lawyers go find her directly.\"","Wang Jiani's eyes flickered, \"What if Sister Ruan Jia doesn't sign?\"","Sheng Wenyue avoided Wang Jiani's gaze and said somewhat stiffly, \"I will promise her it's a fake divorce. After I've arranged things for you, I'll never be involved in your affairs again and will stay with her forever. She should stop making a fuss then. This is the most we can do to make it up to you, Jiani. I'm sorry, this is all I can do.\"","Hatred flashed in Wang Jiani's eyes, \"I'm afraid your wife will be angry with you. What if she's too angry and won't forgive you?\"","\"That won't happen. We've been together since we can remember. She loves me very much. Even if she's angry for a while, she'll eventually forgive me,\" Sheng Wenyue said, and then smiled.","[He actually smiled, does he think he's made the most decisive choice between the two of them and the future will be bright? What kind of bizarre thinking is this?]","Ji Fei was eagerly watching the drama unfold in the waiting area, while Qin Zhao and Qin Rong, who came as an assistant, quietly eavesdropped.","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom in the audience area were too far away to hear the inner thoughts and felt frustrated.","However, the live broadcast soon began. After the Host announced the competition mode, the Best Actor's group took the stage first.","At the same time, because it was an unfamiliar number, Ruan Jia answered the call.","\"Hello, we are the legal representatives of Mr. Sheng. May we ask if Ms. Ruan is currently...\"","Waiting for the Lawyer to arrive, Ruan Jia speculated on Sheng Wenyue's intentions. Actually, she knew that every time Sheng Wenyue mentioned divorce, he was just trying to scare her. But what if this time it was real?","Was she still unwilling to let go?","Sheng Wenyue was like that dirty thing in her brain. If she didn't dig it out, she would die, but the process of digging it out was too dangerous. Without her parents, and with the dream that could support her beliefs long forgotten, she had been living her life revolving around Sheng Wenyue. The pain of such separation might be unbearable for her.","As if wanting to self-harm to alleviate the pain, she wanted to see an ending.","In the hospital room, the TV was on, and Ruan Jia stared intently at the live broadcast as Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani entered hand in hand.","A beautiful love story began.","And Ruan Jia's eyes gradually lost their light.","However, millions of netizens watching the live broadcast were about to be fooled.","Those were all brief stage plays, but they depicted snippets of a helpless love story.","\"...Childhood sweethearts, pestered since they were young, their families urged them to marry under the pretext of cooperating to start a company. The male lead was focused on his career, indifferent, and just went along with it...\"","\"...Realizing the mistake of the marriage, he wanted a divorce, but the original wife kept clinging to the Best Actor. The Best Actor, soft-hearted towards the original wife, was entangled for many years and could only numb himself through work. Otherwise, he wouldn't have kept the marriage secret for so long. Over these years, the company has grown big and strong relying on the Best Actor's commercial value. The original wife has enjoyed the benefits without effort, which is good enough. The Best Actor doesn't owe her anything...\"","\"...Four years ago, he finally met his soulmate, his true love, and wanted to start a new life. But the original wife used her power to drive away the true love, making her suffer all kinds of hardships abroad and destroying her career...\"","\"...After finally coming back, the Best Actor just wanted to make amends and take care of her, never intending to have an affair. But the original wife was suspicious, not only framing the drinking incident but also faking illness to deceive people, and designing various schemes against the true love. Seeing things develop like this, the Best Actor finally decided not to tolerate it anymore and officially announced his intention to divorce the original wife...\"","Based on their recent investigations into the real events of the three people, fans immediately understood the meaning of the stage play. This was the truth they had been waiting for.","The comment section instantly collapsed, and the internet exploded.","\"These days, is it a capital offense to divorce without love? At least the Best Actor hasn't really had an affair.\"","\"Can you please set my brother free? My brother has the right to pursue his own happiness.\"","\"In my opinion, since the rumored affair with Wang Jiani four years ago, my brother has kept himself clean in all his works over the years. You can see it's true love. It's quite pitiful that they're being kept apart by a paranoid person now.\"","\"The most pitiful is Wang Jiani, who was driven away, targeted, and framed. She only fell in love with another pitiful person, just two lonely hearts getting close to each other. It's Ruan Jia who won't let go and keeps tormenting the Best Actor.\"","There were also bystanders who held different opinions.","\"Is there a justification for changing affections now?\"","\"Am I the only one who sympathizes with the original wife? What kind of mistress logic is prevailing now?\"","But these were quickly buried by the overwhelming flood of comments. It was almost a one-sided trend.","The stage play ended with the two divorcing, true love coming together, and the evil original wife leaving their world.","Even after the stage performance ended, the comment section was still full.","It seemed that no one cared about the next performance at all.","Meanwhile, Qin Yan, watching the live broadcast, was really alarmed. Worried about Ruan Jia's condition, she hurried to the hospital room, only to see a Lawyer walking in.","\"Miss Ruan, we've been entrusted by Mr. Sheng to give you this divorce agreement. We hope you'll sign...\" The lawyer looked up at the girl on the hospital bed and suddenly broke his professional composure, blurting out, \"Um... that's just a script, you don't need to take it seriously...\"","Qin Yan, looking at Ruan Jia's condition, sharply inhaled.","It was as if her soul had been extracted from her body.","At this moment, the live broadcast screen shook as a new group of guests appeared.","The screen suddenly darkened, as if someone was plunged into darkness.","Suddenly, an ethereal voice rang out.","\"Why aren't you actively seeking treatment? Are you trying to punish those who hurt you by killing yourself? If you're not afraid of death, what are you afraid of in life?\"","In the darkness, a light shone on Ji Fei, lying on the hospital bed, all alone.","As if on the brink of death, she replied, \"I... I don't know.\"","\"If you had a chance to start over, what would you choose?\" the ethereal voice continued.","\"Choose what?\" Ji Fei remained confused.","\"Your health or him, which would you choose?\"","\"Your parents or him, which would you choose?\"","\"Being a world-renowned photographer or him, which would you choose?\"","\"You actually have many choices, don't you?\"","The light gradually brightened, and Ji Fei slowly sat up, a spark flashing in her eyes. She seemed to have suddenly understood, and the answer emerged.","In the hospital room, the dazed Ruan Jia was stunned.","Watching the performance, Sheng Wenyue's face slightly changed. Photographer?","Perhaps due to the unusual opening, the barrage of comments paused briefly before gradually resuming, though with less attention.","But in the next second, the lights dimmed and then brightened again. The sound of a slap resounded throughout the venue, startling the audience into silence and snapping Ruan Jia back to reality.","\"You scumbag! Cheating is bad enough, but you dare try to prettify it with lies? You think you're worthy of ruining my life?\"","It seemed like she was scolding someone...","The comment section exploded once again."]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Feeling Completely Like the Control Group","paragraphs":["The dialogue was so pointed that it instantly caused an uproar.","There were cameras constantly focused on the waiting area, and Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani, sitting among the other teams, looked extremely displeased.","Were they deliberately being passive-aggressive towards them?","What was wrong with Qin Zhao and Ji Fei? How was this situation even related to them? Why did they keep picking on them?","Were they really not afraid of falling out completely and making a scene?","The other teams had varied expressions, taking on the attitude of spectators enjoying the drama.","After all, everyone wasn't stupid. The Best Actor team deliberately choosing to compete against the Top Idol team was clearly meant to teach them a lesson for their previous unrestrained comments.","Currently, all the public opinion was focused on Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani's situation. The performance just now was the truth they had previously declared they would reveal.","The entire internet must be discussing this story of true love prevailing, so whoever teamed up with the Best Actor would just become cannon fodder.","This live broadcast program was originally meant to boost their own popularity, so who would want to waste an episode being a background character?","However, they also felt that Qin Zhao and Ji Fei's approach wasn't wise.","If someone encroaches an inch, you shouldn't retaliate by going a mile.","Since it was inevitable that they couldn't divert attention, they shouldn't cause trouble and should just accept their bad luck.","But instead, they had to mock them at the beginning of the performance to vent their frustrations. Even if you say this short segment was scripted for the performance, it would still be attacked by netizens and fans.","Not only did they fail to grab attention, but they would also be criticized after it ends. It was simply asking for trouble.","Both the guests in the waiting area and the audience in the spectator area felt embarrassed for them.","Everyone had lost interest in the upcoming performance, as anyone could guess that Qin Zhao and Ji Fei would at most provoke a little at the beginning, then perform steadily afterwards. They were more curious about how the two teams would face each other after coming off stage.","Only Qin Chao's Father, Qin Chao's Mother, and Qin Rong were staring at the stage with sparkling eyes, their smiles harder to suppress than an AK-47.","At this point, the style of the stage changed, resembling a youth campus short drama, with Ji Fei and Qin Zhao playing the lead roles.","...","The two families were neighbors, growing up together, always by each other's side.","In elementary school, the boy brought breakfast for the girl every day. In middle school, he rode his bike to pick her up for school. In high school, they studied together, cried together, laughed together, and ran together. Their initial carefree companionship blossomed into youthful love, and the most important melody in their lives became each other.","One liked performing and entered the entertainment industry, while the other carried a camera around taking photos to submit to magazines.","The large screen at the back of the stage was divided into two parts. The left side showed the boy working hard in acting and finally receiving awards on stage.","The right side displayed various photographs - mountain ranges, seas, lakes, snow-covered plains, all showcasing the charm and vitality of nature, along with various awards and invitation letters sent back from magazines.","...","Ji Fei's acting was quite stiff, but it couldn't detract from how eye-catching this story was.","This turned out to be another childhood sweetheart story, but unlike the Best Actor's group where the original partner was one-sidedly obsessed with the actor, in the Top Idol group, it was a true childhood friendship blossoming into love, with no one clinging to the other, both developing well in their own ways.","These different story directions felt completely like a control group.","Everyone caught the scent of drama and immediately sat up straight, unable to believe how hard-headed Ji Fei and Qin Zhao were. They had underestimated them.","Were they planning to go all out in criticizing, riding the wave of attention?","My goodness, it's so exciting to witness this drama live! It seems like they're about to start a fight!","The online comments were even more explosive. Originally not expecting much from the performance and about to organize a campaign against Qin Zhao and Ji Fei, they were suddenly told that this was just the beginning!","This was like throwing acid in the eyes of their fans!","The program team monitoring the situation was stunned. This wasn't the same as the script they had submitted, and it wasn't how they had rehearsed either!","Suddenly faced with their own guests tearing down the house, they were just about to think of a way to salvage the situation when they heard that the backstage live streaming data had actually surpassed the Best Actor group in front, and was still rising rapidly.","Program team: !!! How many passersby have come in? Does everyone really love to join in on the excitement?","Quick-witted netizens had already started searching online, after all, there was no reason to specifically include the setting of a photographer, it might not be a coincidence.","As a result of the search, the first piece of iron-clad evidence in the feud between the Best Actor group and the Top Idol group emerged.","Those who saw the truth spread it quickly.","Who would have thought that the Best Actor's original partner was indeed once a photographer, and her works could be found online. They were exactly those published on the large screen on the stage.","Because it was a stage play story, usually some details would be fabricated, but no one expected the Top Idol group to be so bold as to directly use the works of someone else's wife, even the award information was real.","Moreover, observant people would notice that the upload dates of those photos were all seven years ago.","That meant that after Ruan Jia married Sheng Wenyue, she produced nothing more.","And in the Best Actor group's performance, they didn't mention at all that the original partner was once capable of taking such excellent photos, only showing how she crazily clung to and was obsessed with the Best Actor, as if she was a person without her own life, only blindly loving her husband, a mad woman without any charm.","This comparison made those who found the photos have a sinking feeling in their hearts. Following the principle that such a big doubt shouldn't be discovered by just one person, they began to spread it rapidly.","In the hospital room, Ruan Jia's gaze wasn't focused on the performance stage, but on that large screen. The photos on it were like countless fragments of light shining into Ruan Jia's eyes.","Gradually, they lit up her eyes.","The phone beside her suddenly lit up, someone who had seen the live broadcast must have sent her a message. She only saw that the lock screen wallpaper was a photo of Sheng Wenyue.","Actually, her initial wallpaper was the first aurora she had photographed.","That was the most satisfying photo she had taken after camping in the Arctic Circle for an entire month.","She used to be so full of fighting spirit... What happened to her? How did she become like this?","Ruan Jia suddenly stiffened, feeling as if her heart was about to split open. The lines from earlier echoed in her mind.","\"A world-renowned photographer or him, which would you choose?\"","At this moment, both Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were trembling. Wang Jiani was angered by Ji Fei and Qin Zhao.","But Sheng Wenyue felt as if he had been hit hard in the chest with an iron hammer, a dull pain spreading.","Although the performance had exaggerated elements, what they portrayed was indeed his and Ruan Jia's past, especially those photos. He had an impression of them, although he couldn't remember completely, they should be Ruan Jia's.","After the dull pain came a sense of bewilderment. He suspected that Ruan Jia's refusal to back down these days was waiting for this moment. She must have been in contact with Qin Zhao and Ji Fei, otherwise there wouldn't be this stage play.","She was really planning to take revenge on him and Wang Jiani. He had been thinking of staying with her properly afterwards, indulging her whims and not seeing Wang Jiani. But she was so foolish, this would destroy him and Wang Jiani.","Faced with Ruan Jia's clear attack for the first time, Sheng Wenyue found it hard to accept that a woman who loved him so much would do this to him.","He even started to doubt himself again, thinking perhaps he had misunderstood, perhaps it was just Qin Zhao and Ji Fei being troublemakers and targeting them, and the story coincidentally overlapped.","However, regardless of which situation it was, it didn't matter. The direction of public opinion was still in the hands of those with more fans. Everyone would just think that Ji Fei and Qin Zhao were deliberately mixing truth and falsehood to create drama and criticize him and Wang Jiani."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: The Most Poisonous to the Human Heart","paragraphs":["The stage performance continued, with supporting actors coming on stage to play the roles of elders from both families, standing to the side and clapping happily.","...","The young man knelt on one knee, \"Marry me, be my wife.\"","The young woman was surprised, \"But isn't it better for an artist's career to marry later?\"","The young man replied: \"Anyway, it's definitely going to be you for this lifetime, sooner or later is the same. Besides, we can have a secret marriage, though it will be hard on you.\"","The young woman hesitated for a moment, but both families were very happy, and the young man was very sincere, so she finally nodded in agreement.","In an instant, the life images of the female lead on the right side of the large screen in the back suddenly turned into fragmented black and white pictures, then continuously shrank and moved upwards. New images began to appear below, resembling various data charts of company stocks.","The young man began performing with a group of people on one side of the stage, acting out scenes of filming, while the young woman sat in an office, making phone calls and handling documents. It gave the feeling of a couple working together to manage their careers.","But the couple's performance came to an abrupt halt. All the lights disappeared and then focused entirely on Ji Fei. Ji Fei stepped out of her original role, came forward, and slapped the face of Qin Chaoling in the darkness, the sound echoing throughout the venue.","It was as if her future self had rushed back to slap the scumbag.","\"When you proposed to me, it was only because you were worried I would pursue my dream of photography, travel the world, and never come back. You were afraid you couldn't keep me. You clipped my wings, made me live dependent on you, to be your capable assistant. I was stupid, thinking true love meant sacrifice, compromise, and giving in. But why, after sacrificing my dreams for your career, did you abandon me! Where's your conscience, did a dog eat it?\"","...","Ji Fei shouted hoarsely, delivering a cathartic tirade of accusations.","Although the performance was still awkward, the audience was completely drawn in. Even if they couldn't distinguish between truth and fiction, everyone was willing to indulge in conspiracy theories.","So it's very likely that it wasn't the parents of both sides pushing for marriage, nor was it the film star casually going through the motions of his own marriage. It was actually the film star himself who proposed, asking her to sacrifice and stay for him. Afterwards, he never wanted a divorce, and she didn't cling to him but wholeheartedly assisted him.","How could this be called reaping without sowing?","Not feeling indebted? This is a huge debt, okay?","If the top-tier group's performance is the truth.","Then the so-called clarification statement from the film star's group is too disgusting, isn't it? It's completely distorting the facts, spreading rumors and defamation.","Is it true that the most poisonous is an ungrateful heart?","She gave everything for him, but he throws her under the bus for a mistress?","Not only were the people at the scene full of shock, but even the tone of the bullet screen comments had twisted.","Half were curses, while the other half were filled with doubts, discussions, and speculations.","On Weibo, people started looking for evidence everywhere.","In the hospital room, Ruan Jia listened to Ji Fei's final monologue, as if being scolded awake, her eyes widening in disbelief.","Yes, at that time she was planning to leave, she hesitated because they were truly in love then, but why was she the one sacrificing from the beginning? If Sheng Wenyue really loved her, shouldn't he have wanted to support her in pursuing her dreams, just as she supported him?","But Sheng Wenyue never mentioned it from beginning to end, he completely ignored that her dream was also her career.","People often say that some things shouldn't be calculated too meticulously, like cold math problems, because once you start thinking from both sides of the scale, life becomes impossible to live.","But when a person gradually becomes numb to your sacrifices, ungrateful, and takes them for granted and forgets, this person is no longer worth sacrificing for.","At this moment, Sheng Wenyue in the waiting area felt as if he had been slapped countless times from afar. When the clear and explicit comparison appeared before his eyes, he almost stood up in anger and shame, losing his composure.","At this point, he gradually overlooked the anger of having the truth exposed, he just wanted to refute, he felt that he wasn't as Ji Fei described, loving and staying together always requires one person to give in, right?","How else can you become husband and wife?","He loves acting, he only wants to act, he had no choice...","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom watched as the surrounding audience began to whisper, some people were watching the live broadcast from the waiting area at the same time, able to see the cameraman very rebelliously pointing the camera directly at Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani.","Everyone analyzed their facial expressions frame by frame. Was this because they were guilty of having the truth exposed, or angry at being wrongly accused?","On stage, a special female guest was seen coming up to assist in the performance.","Everyone immediately held their breath, even the bullet screen comments paused for a moment, as if everyone realized who this person was going to play.","Everyone watched nervously.","Backstage, the staff brought by each team were all gathered here eating melon seeds and watching the drama unfold.","Qin Rong was watching with her little face flushed red, very excited, but when she saw Brother Gao beside her looking like he had given up on life, she asked Xiao Tao next to her with some concern.","\"Brother Gao, are you okay?\"","Xiao Tao glanced over, knowing that the script Ji Fei and Qin Zhao were performing actually concealed a part from Brother Gao, and felt quite sympathetic about this. After all, Brother Gao wanted to trick more staff to come over for the studio.","But now, who would dare to take on such troublemaking artists?","She could only sigh and say: \"Some people look peaceful, but they've actually been gone for a while.\"","Nearby, the female manager of the ancient costume idol looked at Gao Hao and couldn't help but mock: \"Your artists are performing so well, do they not want to live anymore?\"","Just as she was speaking, Sheng Wenyue's manager rushed over to Gao Hao, fuming with anger, \"What exactly are you trying to do! Stop it now!\"","It looks like the mistress is about to come on stage! Are they planning to act out everything?","Gao Hao came back to his senses, coughed, and although he really wanted to pull the ears of those two up there, he couldn't lose face for his own people.","\"Oh my, it's all just acting. You're cruel and disregard the law, we're shameless and lack quality. Not much difference.\"","With one sentence he insulted even himself, directly leaving the other party speechless.","Other people secretly gave Gao Hao a thumbs up.","This face-to-face confrontation was quite explosive even in the entire entertainment industry. The director and producer were almost getting Parkinson's, and the bullet screen comments were going crazy, shaking all over the place.","Gao Hao continued to rub salt in the wound: \"Fortunately we were chosen, and provided with such good material. We can only thank Mr. Sheng and Ms. Wang for sending us this heaven-sent fortune. Especially you, senior, you deserve to be enshrined in the imperial ancestral temple.\"","If someone wasn't holding him up, the manager could have fainted, but he had no right to faint because an even more explosive performance began on stage.","...","Only to see a distinctive second female lead appear on the male lead's side, the two of them filming together and interacting intimately. The female lead on the other side was still working, her back turned to everything.","Although the male and female leads would occasionally be together, they gradually lost common topics of conversation.","The male lead talked about romance and the halls of art.","The female lead discussed stocks, management, and experiences with employees.","\"I feel like you're full of the stench of money now,\" the male lead said, then turned and walked into the filming set, happily chatting with the second female lead again, even saying to her: \"You have an artistic aura, you're very talented.\"","The second female lead giggled, \"Thank you, senior.\"","Meanwhile, the female lead was still busy working, seemingly unaware of what was happening.","Suddenly, four elderly people appeared in front of the second female lead.","The male lead continued acting, seemingly not noticing anything unusual. The second female lead then left the stage. After discovering the second female lead was gone, he was distraught for a while but didn't show much reaction.","The female lead continued to work hard, but as the documents piled up on her desk more and more, she became overwhelmed. Finally, she brought in many people to share her workload. Gradually, she exited the stage, and the company chart on the big screen changed to her parents' hospital room.","The female lead appeared again, this time taking care of her parents in the hospital.","Until her parents exited the stage, the second female lead reappeared, crying as she threw herself into the male lead's arms. Then they both turned to look at the female lead who had appeared, glaring at her angrily.","At this moment, the lighting changed again, and Ji Fei jumped out of her original position, delivering another slap.","\"You heartless beast, what do you mean we have nothing in common? It's you who didn't want to have anything in common with me. I could have been an artist, it was you who made me reek of money. How dare you come and despise me, justifying your change of heart and affair? If you don't have the determination to restrain yourself, don't enter into marriage and harm others.\"","Another slap!","\"You say I used my power to drive her away? I didn't even know her back then! She keeps yelling that I owe her - I don't owe her shit! She was from our company, she knew you had a wife, and she still seduced a married man. How dare she act righteous? Can an immoral love be called true love? Soulmates? Your souls are truly filthy!\"","After berating one side, she turned and slapped the other. Another resounding smack.","\"And you, you're really something. Even the Master Sword Forger would have to admire how despicable you are. Was it really others who forced you to leave? It was the elders who saw your intention to destroy someone's family, wanting to be a mistress. They were defending their home and gave you a choice. You chose to go abroad for better opportunities. If you were truly forced, couldn't you have contacted this scumbag for help even once? Did you ever do that?!\"","Another slap.","\"You had such great resources abroad, but you couldn't make a good life for yourself. So you came back and dragged this scumbag along to blame me? What? Are you upset that I didn't make room for you, a wannabe mistress? Or that I didn't pave the way for you to become a movie star in the foreign entertainment industry? I really didn't know how I've wronged you! To think I need to be made to compensate for my husband's soulmate!\"","...","The livestream froze, Weibo servers crashed, the audience area erupted in chaos, and everyone in the waiting area turned to look at the two people in the center.","Those four slaps seemed to land on their faces too, making them alternately pale and flush.","They swayed, their pupils shaking."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: They were always wrong","paragraphs":["The live stream's comment section was flooded by mindless fans, almost freezing into a slideshow.","Perhaps they were truly brainwashed successfully, or maybe it was just a show of force, but the backlash was severe, filled with insults.","They even resorted to classic sayings like \"only the unloved ones are mistresses.\"","On Weibo, multiple trending topics exploded with criticism. Even Qin Zhao's massive fan base couldn't fully withstand it.","However, different voices soon began to dominate the screen.","People aren't stupid. When Ji Fei was calling them out, she laid out the logic clearly for everyone. Unless one was in denial, anyone could see through it.","Looking at it this way, the Best Actor's team's explanations simply couldn't hold water. They relied entirely on emotional appeal and couldn't withstand logical scrutiny.","The audience watching the backstage live stream looked at the faces of the two and couldn't help but criticize.","\"Unfaithful men are the best at making excuses for themselves. Watching their performance just now felt morally off. If you truly don't love someone, why enter into marriage?\"","\"Exactly, if you're married, control yourself and don't cheat. Using 'true love' as a shield is exhausting and disgusting.\"","\"If what's portrayed here is true, it shows that Ruan Jia wasn't just a useless rich housewife. She accompanied her husband through the hardships of starting a business, stabilized the home front, allowing the Best Actor to focus without worries. After establishing their empire, she didn't cling to power but let others develop while she went to care for her parents. This led to her gradual disappearance from the public eye, allowing the Best Actor's team to freely smear her, as it would be difficult to find evidence.\"","\"I used to be a fan of Wang Jiani. Thinking back, she left the country with everyone's well-wishes and blessings. She got a big production in the first year, but married in the second, and then disappeared from the news. You could say her initial resources were completely fine, so how can she blame others for her own incompetence and difficulties?\"","\"I'm stunned listening to this. If it's really like this, how can Sheng Wenyue make up such lies? Doesn't his conscience hurt? This is such moral depravity. I can't believe I used to like him so much.\"","\"I have to say, the top stars' team is really bold. Who gave them such courage?\"","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom, sitting among the crowd, listened to the surrounding discussions gradually leaning towards Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, and raised their heads proudly with satisfaction.","Meanwhile, in the waiting area, the gazes of everyone made the two in the center feel like they were under scrutiny.","Sheng Wenyue, bombarded with criticism, felt his head buzzing for a long time, never having felt so embarrassed before.","His mind was in complete chaos, not even bothering to dwell on whether these might be fabrications by Ji Fei and Qin Zhao.","He couldn't help but turn to Wang Jiani. \"Didn't you say Ruan Jia drove you away?\"","Because of this, Sheng Wenyue, seeing his junior who ended up in such a bad state later, always felt guilty. He always felt that it was Ruan Jia who overreacted and became jealous for no reason, ruining Wang Jiani's life, when he had never thought of cheating at that time. How could he not feel guilty towards this innocent girl?","Wang Jiani, her eyes already filled with venom, trembled uncontrollably with anger. She couldn't understand at all how Ji Fei and the others knew so much.","Some things were just what she had thought in her heart.","Could it really be a coincidence?","When she realized Sheng Wenyue was asking her, her eyes showed a flash of panic. Her lips quivered, her eyes red, as she said pitifully, \"Those elders came to me, saying it was for sister-in-law. Wasn't that sister-in-law forcing me to leave?\"","Sheng Wenyue opened his mouth but couldn't refute. He only felt his headache worsening, even breathing became difficult. \"So Ruan Jia might really not have known you?\"","Wang Jiani, however, said defiantly, \"Our CP was so popular at that time, how could sister-in-law not know? Wasn't she managing the company? Shouldn't she have known about the company's artists?\"","Wang Jiani still believed it was Ruan Jia who instructed those four elders to come.","But Sheng Wenyue choked. That period was when Ruan Jia was busiest, as she was in the process of finding someone to take over management and handing over affairs. Even he couldn't say for sure that Ruan Jia had paid attention to his matters during that time.","He couldn't help but lean towards Wang Jiani's version in his heart. Ruan Jia was his wife, she loved him so much, and it was a nationwide CP craze, she must have known, right?","\"Why doesn't he ask his own parents for the truth?\" Suddenly, a voice came from behind.","It made the sensitive Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani turn around abruptly, as if their shame had been exposed.","But they found everyone was looking at the big screen above, as if they weren't talking about the two of them at all, but discussing the stage play just now.","\"Even if his parents told him, do you think this man who's already completely biased towards his mistress would believe the truth? He might even think his parents are lying to cover for his wife.\"","Sheng Wenyue suddenly felt as if all the blood in his body had frozen.","He had indeed fleetingly thought about asking his parents just now, but the next second, he felt his parents might not tell the truth.","\"Not trusting his own parents, not trusting his own wife, but trusting an outsider, that's really... tsk tsk tsk.\"","Sheng Wenyue felt inexplicably guilty and ashamed.","\"Isn't the key point that the mistress chose to leave on her own? According to their performance, the mistress never even contacted the man.\"","Sheng Wenyue's face changed dramatically, but he remembered that he had indeed asked Wang Jiani before why she didn't contact him earlier. Wang Jiani said she didn't want to burden him.","At that time, Wang Jiani seemed to be hinting at something, reluctant to speak. They had a kind of ambiguous relationship, more than friends but not quite lovers, just that the thin paper hadn't been pierced yet.","Sheng Wenyue felt that Wang Jiani liked him but didn't want to destroy their family, so she didn't contact him. This made him even more sympathetic towards her.","But now... he began to waver.","\"She came back because her original path didn't work out, wanting to eat the old rice? Stealing someone else's husband. That's really something, clearly it's her own incompetence, but she won't admit her own failure. She came back to mislead others and pretend to be a victim because she wants someone to pay for her failed life. She probably even righteously believes she's the real victim.\"","\"Indeed, she's quite shameless.\"","\"You all!\" Wang Jiani seemed to finally not be able to bear being mocked like this. She directly spoke up, tears about to fall this time.","But the person speaking looked innocent and said, \"We're discussing this play, what's wrong?\"","\"Ji Fei acted well.\" Someone blatantly lied, praising Ji Fei's fake acting skills, which were purely based on emotion, without technique.","In their live stream area, as long as they didn't turn on the microphone, no sound would be transmitted out. The cameras were all focused on Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani, with others just in passing. So the audience could see Wang Jiani's almost out-of-control expression management and Sheng Wenyue's uncontrollable look of disappointment.","This seemed to further corroborate certain things indirectly.","The manager was anxiously trying to communicate with the director and producer backstage, wanting Wang Jiani and Sheng Wenyue to come down first. They needed to discuss how to deal with public opinion later.","But even if Ji Fei and Qin Zhao acted out the truth, so what?","Do they dare say it's the truth? Without evidence or proof, be careful of being sued.","In the hospital room, although Qin Yan, like other members of the Qin family, already knew the general truth through Ji Fei's inner voice, seeing Ji Fei and Qin Zhao act it out for real still felt extremely satisfying. Even the lawyer representing Sheng Wenyue couldn't help but stare, forgetting to complete his work.","And Ruan Jia on the hospital bed just stared at the screen with fixed eyes.","\"That's right... What did I do wrong? It was always them who were wrong, it was them... Why am I the one being punished?\"","At this moment, the final act on the stage began."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: The Slap Sister, oh no, the Chatter Sister.","paragraphs":["Just then, the second female lead was seen secretly making a phone call, pretending it was the girl contacting her. However, on the other side of the stage, the girl was at the hospital holding medical test results, consulting something with a panicked expression.","The second female lead was tearing at her own clothes while asking the male lead for help. At the same time, the girl seemed to have learned something and was crying as she tried to contact the male lead, but he had no time to answer the phone. He was on his way to rescue the second female lead.","In the end, the male lead protected the second female lead and said to the girl: \"You're so vicious, to actually scheme and frame...\"","The girl tried to explain, but the male lead didn't believe her and cancelled her credit card. The girl said she was sick, but the male lead accused her of faking it.","In the end, the girl sought treatment alone, but photos were taken and uploaded online.","The male lead brought the second female lead to confront the girl and threaten her.","\"You're just an ordinary person, we're celebrities. We can only sacrifice you to cooperate with our image cleansing. You love me so much, you'll agree, right? If you don't cooperate, I'll divorce you.\"","This time there was no change in lighting. Ji Fei, who was playing the patient, jumped right up from the wheelchair. As if a patient had suddenly regained vitality.","Using stage combat techniques, she slapped Qin Zhao to the ground, then turned and slapped the second female lead into Qin Zhao's arms.","Then she began repeatedly fake kicking the two of them.","\"You dogs, you scum, slandering me! Even the police need evidence to solve cases, but you just hear something and convict me? You're so amazing, does the Police Station know? Should I turn you over to the country? After all, you can pass judgment without any proof, just based on someone's word. No, the country doesn't take garbage.\"","...","\"Oh my god, when the Best Actor Team performed the drinking party incident before, I felt it was so dark and evil. Could it be that in a situation with absolutely no evidence, just because Wang Jiani said so, Sheng Wenyue believed his own wife did it?\"","\"Well, let's see if they dare to provide evidence later.\"","Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani, who had been called down, went backstage and overheard people whispering.","Sheng Wenyue's body stiffened, his face numb, as if struggling in the throes of death. He indeed had no evidence, but...","...","On stage, this time Qin Zhao was allowed to fight back according to the script. He angrily shouted: \"You don't have evidence to prove your innocence either!\"","Ji Fei directly kicked his face this time. Her stance made Qin Zhao, who was acting, seriously doubt whether his sister-in-law would take advantage of the situation to really kick his face.","\"Do you hear yourself? You ask your own wife for evidence, but not others? What's this? She's fragile, so you feel more protective, so she must be innocent? If she just claimed I killed someone, you'd send me to prison tomorrow, right? I'm not fragile, I don't cry, so I must be the villain!\"","...","Sheng Wenyue's whole body went numb, he could barely walk. He looked at Wang Jiani and saw her face had turned deathly pale.","The group of gossips backstage, who hadn't noticed them come down, were still actively discussing.","\"I know, I remember this time - it was one of the scandals caught by paparazzi. If we could find out where the original wife was that day, there might be evidence to prove it.\"","\"Even if we found out, maybe the Best Actor would just say it's fake like that recuperation photo used to overturn the case. After all, didn't they provide a clean bill of health? Do you think the Best Actor actually knows his wife might really be sick?\"","Sheng Wenyue swayed, and would have fallen if his manager hadn't been supporting him.","Sick... impossible... impossible that she's really sick... This absolutely can't be true! Ruan Jia must be scaring him, taking revenge on him.","As if afraid to face it, Sheng Wenyue desperately denied it. But he couldn't stop the murmuring crowd.","\"Now I'm completely convinced by the top-tier team. I feel like their version is the truth. The Best Actor really wronged his wife!\"","Sheng Wenyue couldn't even control his expression anymore. Why was everyone saying this about him? He hadn't wronged her.","Their performance was indeed fake, but he had never denied everything Ruan Jia had done for him.","Because netizens wouldn't believe a simple clarification, Sheng Wenyue had no choice but to use a fictional method to get through this crisis.","It was just inconveniencing Ruan Jia a little. Wasn't it enough that he knew the truth in his heart?","Why were Qin Zhao and Ji Fei doing this? With such detailed content, the information was probably really provided by Ruan Jia.","But Ji Fei and Qin Zhao weren't righteous avengers either. They also distorted and uglified his and Ruan Jia's past, portraying him as an ungrateful, fickle person. In fact, he... he...","Sheng Wenyue wanted to refute, but his mind went blank. He didn't know where to start explaining those accusations, only feeling extremely wronged.","Ruan Jia actually wanted to go against him because of a misunderstanding? Completely unwilling to understand the truth?","He had never thought of betraying her, and still wanted to live a good life with her. Even if his heart had strayed, he loved Ruan Jia.","Just as Sheng Wenyue was lost in thought, lines similar to his inner monologue appeared in the stage play.","...","\"I didn't betray you! I love you.\"","Ji Fei grabbed Qin Zhao's collar. Slap!","\"You're quite wronged, aren't you? You hug and kiss her, but you love me.\"","Slap!","\"You protect her everywhere, trampling my dignity underfoot to pamper and coax her, but you love me.\"","Slap!","\"To protect her, slandering and framing me, making me attract all the criticism - it's not a problem, because you love me.\"","Slap!","\"You controlled your lower half, didn't sleep with her, so you didn't wrong me, didn't cheat, you're open and aboveboard, pure and innocent.\"","Final slap!","\"And if I show any resistance, I'm being unreasonable, distrusting you, not understanding you?!\"","Qin Zhao's acting was naturally flawless, though his head was bobbing back and forth enough to give him a neck problem. But he quickly and professionally displayed an expression of shame and anger, as if still feeling he'd done nothing wrong.","\"Let me ask you one thing: if I found a man right now and did the same things with him that you did, but I love you, would you be happy with that?\"","Qin Zhao's face stiffened as he acted out shame and anger.","\"Haha, how despicable! You hypocrite, you dare to speak of love? Your love is truly nauseating and revolting. I must have murdered and committed arson in my past life to deserve your love in this one.\"","...","At this moment, Sheng Wenyue really couldn't breathe. He clutched his head, in so much pain he had to quickly sit down against the wall and gasp for air. Wang Jiani could only look at Sheng Wenyue in panic and helplessness, worried she couldn't keep up the charade anymore.","This commotion immediately caught the attention of the backstage gossips. Everyone's eyes lit up, like badgers spotting melons in a field, desperate to approach and ask the main characters a few questions.","However, seeing how one of them looked like he was about to bash his head against the wall from a headache, they held back a bit.","Everyone gradually had a feeling that the tide had turned.","Qin Rong whispered, \"He looks like he has a bit of a headache.\"","Xiao Tao analyzed, \"I guess his brain is itchy, about to grow something new.\"","The manager was also completely flustered. He couldn't help saying, \"Wenyue, don't get caught up in their narrative. How have you wronged her? You're the victim, you...\"","...","On stage, Qin Zhao coincidentally showed a wronged expression.","Ji Fei let out a mocking laugh, \"Do you think that controlling yourself not to cheat is already treating me well enough? That I should be grateful? After all, you gave up your true love just to give me a complete family. You shouldered the responsibility and made yourself live so miserably, you've already sacrificed enough, and I'm still hysterical - utterly unreasonable?\"","But Ji Fei released him, letting him slump to the ground.","Qin Zhao couldn't help saying, \"Isn't that true? I sacrificed true love for you. I'm a victim too.\"","\"Are you sick in the head? I could have had a better life. If you want to cheat, just leave! Why drag me along? Stop feeling sorry for yourself and trying to guilt-trip me. Who wants your sacrifice? You think you're air, that I can't live without you? No, you're just a pile of stinking dog shit!\"","...","At this, even the manager couldn't stand steady. Sheng Wenyue gazed blankly at the big screen, his face ashen. He no longer had the rationality to wonder how Ji Fei could guess his psychology so accurately. Those curses were like countless bolts of lightning striking him.","It made his vision go black repeatedly, and he actually tasted blood in his mouth.","The cursing continued on screen.","\"Actually, you're more despicable, more shameless, more brazen than her. You *beep* *beep* *beep*...\"","All the online and offline viewers who were listening intently: ?","The cursing got too vulgar and was censored? Huh? Wait.","\"Why are you still censoring yourself? We want to hear it! Let us hear the cursing! It's hard to censor a live broadcast in real-time.\"","But Ji Fei insisted on self-censoring, after all, her cursing was a bit dirty.","However, the Qin family members present were thoroughly enjoying it.","Finally, the lights gradually dimmed.","Only one beam of light remained, illuminating the various landscape photos that slowly reappeared on the big screen.","Ji Fei didn't show her face, but her voice slowly emerged.","\"Without you, I might meet someone who truly respects me, cares for me, supports me, and is devoted only to me. I deserve to be treated that way.\"","\"Even if I don't meet someone like that, I can reclaim all the energy I wasted on you and use it to love myself!\"","\"Loving yourself well, that's the highest form of true love!\"","All the spectators who had been excitedly following the drama were stunned by the last line.","They had originally thought it was just the Top Star Team versus the Best Actor Team, deliberately creating this kind of stage play.","But they didn't expect that you would actually tie it back to the theme in the end.","That's right, the topic of the competition was true love.","Nobody said that true love couldn't be love for oneself!","The audience felt inexplicably enlightened, and couldn't help but mentally applaud Ji Fei. You really are a clever little devil. Slap Sister, no, Banter Sister.","But when all the lights went dark, they thought the performance was over.","Ji Fei's voice appeared again, with a hint of playfulness, as if speaking to someone in particular.","\"You'll always encounter a few nutcases in life. Just step on them and move on, otherwise how can you call it an exciting life? Look forward, a new life is beginning!\""]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Meeting at a Narrow Path","paragraphs":["The first episode of \"My Acting, Cut!\" saw its live viewership numbers explode.","When Ji Fei and Qin Zhao led their performance team to take a bow, the audience erupted in thunderous applause, with Qin's Father and Qin's Mom excitedly waving their hands.","It wasn't hard to imagine the online reaction based on everyone's behavior at the venue.","The current live broadcast content showed the host interviewing other guests in the waiting area, asking for their opinions on the two groups' performances.","Most people gave perfunctory comments on the acting skills, then hurriedly made excuses to leave the waiting area. If it weren't for their excited expressions that they could barely contain, one might think they all had a sudden urge to use the bathroom.","\"Damn! They must be going backstage to get the juicy gossip!\"","\"What's there that I, a VVVVIP, can't see? I'll send rocket gifts, quick, take us backstage!\"","\"The award-winning actor group went backstage earlier, and now the top celebrity group just went down. Once they meet, I can't imagine how lively it must be backstage right now.\"","\"Let me join in, let me join in, let me be part of the excitement!\"","The host struggled to maintain the interview while reading the barrage of comments. She wanted to go too, but this damn job was keeping her from the gossip.","With all the guests gone, she could only proceed with the program by turning to the professional acting school teachers invited for this competition. But even the teachers were distracted, constantly checking their phones for Weibo updates.","The top ten trending topics were almost entirely occupied by this event. The real-time feed was constantly refreshing with new explosive news, stirring up wave after wave of discussion. It was like a domino effect that even capital couldn't suppress.","After this stage play, apart from the completely brainless die-hard fans, everyone else had pretty much figured out what was going on.","After all, if you peeled away the facade of so-called 'true love,' and thought about it logically for a moment, what remained was nothing more than a blatant story of a cheating man and his mistress working together to set up the original wife.","Just as everyone had once been obsessed with shipping the couple, now the entire internet was engaged in catching the adulterers and crucifying the scumbag man and the mistress.","Backstage, Sheng Wenyue seemed to have lost his soul, plunging into a state of intense self-doubt, while his agent was still struggling desperately, constantly issuing orders, trying to find ways to salvage the public opinion.","After all, there was still very little concrete evidence. Most of it was just the mood set by the recent stage play.","Now, the agent only needed to grasp two points: that Sheng Wenyue truly had no feelings for Ruan Jia, and it was always Ruan Jia who was obsessively pursuing him, and that Ruan Jia wasn't really sick at all, everything was just a smear campaign against Sheng Wenyue for revenge. If they could hold onto these two points, they wouldn't be easily defeated.","Even now, the agent didn't believe that what Ji Fei and Qin Zhao had performed was all true. He only felt that it was all a coordinated act, designed to frame them.","In the entertainment industry, if someone wants to bring someone down, the most common tactic is to release a mix of true and false information. He thought Ruan Jia was doing the same.","\"Ruan Jia is really vicious, she's trying to completely crush you guys!\" The agent, seeing the increasingly out-of-control situation, was so angry he disregarded the setting and said to Sheng Wenyue: \"You need to contact her quickly.\"","Wang Jiani looked at her phone with a pale face. The current situation was beyond her expectations, and she could only turn to Sheng Wenyue for help, saying, \"Senior...\"","But Sheng Wenyue seemed unable to hear the voices around him, his mind filled with Ji Fei's angry words. Had he really wronged Ruan Jia that much?","He had only been distracted for a while, cared for someone else a bit, how did it turn into this?","Just then, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao walked in. The backstage area, which had been filled with whispers, suddenly fell silent for a moment, all eyes turning towards them.","Qin Rong and Xiao Tao happily came forward to greet the two, while Gao Hao approached with a smile that barely concealed his hostility. However, when he saw Qin's Father and Qin's Mom following behind them, he quickly retracted his hostility and could only force a smile.","Although he could lecture Qin Zhao and Ji Fei a bit, when faced with the previous generation's leader of Qin Corporation, even Gao Hao knew when to be prudent.","The two elders had come, of course, to witness the drama firsthand.","At this moment, everyone's eyes were darting between the two groups.","The next second, Sheng Wenyue's agent made a move, angrily rushing up to Ji Fei and Qin Zhao. Everyone's eyes immediately lit up, quickly settling into their seats or standing positions, holding their breath, waiting for the drama to unfold.","The agent's phone kept ringing, indicating the increasingly difficult situation. He could only throw caution to the wind and start bullying, saying, \"If you release a statement now saying that your stage play has nothing to do with us, we can pretend nothing happened.\"","[Pfft, what is he saying?!] Ji Fei was instantly amused.","Qin Zhao's mouth also twitched as he looked towards Gao Hao.","In this situation, there was no need for Ji Fei and Qin Zhao to step in. Gao Hao directly stepped forward and said, \"What are you talking about, senior? This is all just a script, normal acting. How come you're taking it personally?\"","\"You can't go too far with this!\" the agent said, suppressing his anger.","Gao Hao smiled and said, \"We're just performing normally as required by the show's producers.\"","The agent finally shouted, \"Are you guys sick or something?! How much did Ruan Jia pay you to frame us like this?!\"","Qin Zhao looked at the agent with disdain and said, \"Frame you? What framing? Aren't you the ones framing others?\"","The agent suddenly looked like someone had grabbed him by the throat.","The onlookers were pinching their thighs hard, trying to hold back their laughter.","\"You think you can win like this?\" the agent said fiercely. \"You have no evidence either! Don't forget, Ruan Jia is Sheng Wenyue's wife. Couples may quarrel, but they always make up. She hasn't come forward with any evidence against Wenyue yet, which proves she can't bear to hurt him. She just wants to force Wenyue to apologize. You're being used as tools. When Wenyue wins her back, you'll be left out in the cold. Everyone will think you deliberately smeared Wenyue. Don't dig your own grave. We're giving you a chance to make amends now.\"","[What a bluff. He's clearly not confident he can control Ruan Jia anymore, especially since he can't even get through on the phone. But he can try to fool us, make us doubt and back off, giving them some wiggle room. But well... hehe, it's already started.]","The Qin family listened intently: What had started?","But when others heard this, they felt a sense of confusion.","That's right, if Qin Zhao and Ji Fei were really helping Ruan Jia, shouldn't Ruan Jia provide more damaging information?","Could it really just be a 'domestic dispute'? That would be quite disgusting.","Even Sheng Wenyue suddenly brightened up, as if he had found some confidence. His cheeks even flushed.","She loves him, resents him, but in the end, can't bear to let him go, leaving him a way out, just wanting to win back his love. He had almost thought Ruan Jia was being so harsh because she wanted to completely... He knew it, Ruan Jia was just throwing a tantrum.","She just went a bit too far. He would definitely have a good talk with Ruan Jia later.","Whether it was genuine stupidity or an unwillingness to face reality, Sheng Wenyue had somehow managed to comfort himself. He even had the energy to stand up and approach Qin Zhao and Ji Fei, saying seriously, \"Ruan Jia and I will reconcile. She will help clarify things. Please don't stir up trouble between us anymore.\"","Ji Fei looked at Sheng Wenyue's confident demeanor and really wanted to laugh.","[After doing so much to hurt her, you still have the nerve to expect her help. I hope you can still be this confident later.]"]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: All in the Head: Finished","paragraphs":["Gao Hao, however, was a bit worried and couldn't help but ask for Qin Zhao's opinion. Qin Zhao glanced at Ji Fei and said, \"Don't worry, it's fine.\"","Meanwhile, the onlookers were filled with various doubts.","If Ruan Jia could still be coaxed back by Sheng Wenyue, wouldn't that make them stepping stones? Now that would be truly exciting.","At this moment, the director and producer came over, sweating profusely. They were completely confused by what was real and what was fake, and could only let things develop naturally. After all, this wave of heaven-sent popularity was something they had to capitalize on.","It was time to proceed with the next step of the process, letting the two teams go on stage to announce the results.","The scoring would be divided into teacher scoring and audience voting.","Before the scoring, the two groups of guests would be allowed to speak for themselves. The large screen behind them had already turned into a real-time barrage of comments. At a glance, most of them were criticizing the Best Actor Team.","\"It's bad enough to change your heart and betray someone, but to then trample them to death is simply the ultimate scumbag move.\"","\"Compared to those who are openly scummy, this kind of jerk who thinks he's done nothing wrong is the most disgusting.\"","\"Still talking about divorcing your wife? Sis, divorce him quickly and be beautiful on your own!\"","\"Why is my girlfriend frantically tagging me? I would never do such a despicable thing. If I were married and did this to my wife, I'd twist my own head off!\"","However, due to the temporary damage control guidance from their agent, along with the hiring of internet trolls, the barrage of insults wasn't completely one-sided. There were still quite a few voices supporting the Best Actor Team.","\"No one has any evidence, so don't spout nonsense when you don't know the whole story! I believe the Best Actor and his junior were forced into this situation.\"","\"I think it's Ruan Jia forcing the Best Actor to love her again. Otherwise, why hasn't she shown her face? She simply can't let go.\"","\"True love is not a crime!\"","Following the procedure, it was the popular team's turn to speak.","Qin Zhao and Ji Fei both said some pleasantries absent-mindedly. In fact, Ji Fei was busy following the latest gossip, while Qin Zhao was concentrating on eavesdropping.","At this point, no one had noticed that new information was quietly appearing in the barrage of comments, gradually repeating and flooding the screen.","It was the Best Actor Team's turn.","Wang Jiani went on stage with red eyes, looking as if she had been crying from anger. Sheng Wenyue put on his cool, aloof Best Actor demeanor, as if he were a lotus rising untainted from the mud.","When the microphone was given to them, Sheng Wenyue simply said, \"The innocent will prove themselves.\"","But when he finished speaking, there was a strange silence throughout the venue. The audience kept looking up and down, alternating between their phones and the stage.","Sheng Wenyue frowned and had to pass the microphone to Wang Jiani.","Wang Jiani immediately burst into tears, choking out, \"I'm sorry for causing trouble for everyone, but I have no regrets.\" Then she bowed with an expression that said, 'I'm wronged, but I won't say it.'","The barrage of comments was briefly filled with support: You don't need to care too much about others' opinions when living your life.","Ji Fei: [Is it really about opinions? I think it's more like not caring too much about others' slaps.]","Qin Zhao beside her was puzzled, but before he could wonder further, he saw a figure rush onto the stage.","Before anyone could react, a slap landed directly on Wang Jiani's face. \"Shameless bitch!\"","Wang Jiani was struck so hard she nearly fell, but Sheng Wenyue caught her.","This could be considered a live broadcast accident, but the spectators were so stunned by the successive revelations that no one immediately moved to grab the attacker or cut the microphone.","So everyone heard Sheng Wenyue exclaim in shock to the woman who had slapped Wang Jiani: \"Mom? Why are you here?\"","Sheng's father also rushed up, kicking Sheng Wenyue twice before supporting his trembling wife. \"Sheng Wenyue, how can you face Ruan Jia's parents like this? We're truly disappointed in you. How could you destroy your wife for this mistress? How did we raise such an immoral son! We've failed Ruan Jia's parents, we've failed Ruan Jia!\"","Sheng Wenyue was dumbfounded. Why didn't his parents believe him either?","This was just a temporary measure.","Who could have imagined that the two elderly people had been on a cruise, with limited internet access, and hadn't been following the online drama? As soon as they disembarked, they were shocked by the live broadcast. Unable to contact their daughter-in-law, they rushed to the scene, hoping their son would repent.","Instead, they saw the two of them still acting even after being exposed. This angered them to the point of losing all sense of propriety and self-control.","Seeing her son still holding the crying woman, Sheng's mother's eyes turned bloodshot as she berated them: \"Back then, we sent you away politely, which was already kind enough. We never imagined you'd be so incorrigible, coming back to seduce someone else's husband!\"","Sheng's mother grabbed Wang Jiani's hair, yanking her up and slapping her twice violently.","Sheng Wenyue snapped back to reality and quickly tried to stop them. \"Mom, Dad, please stop. Did Ruan Jia send you here?\"","\"You're still protecting her?! This is a disaster, you're completely bewitched. If we hadn't helped you cover things up back then, Ruan Jia would have left you long ago.\" Sheng's mother cried in anger. \"If we had known it would come to this, if we had known you'd never change, we shouldn't have meddled.\"","Sheng Wenyue was stunned. Suddenly feeling extremely panicked, he even forgot they were live streaming and that they had fabricated public opinion. He blurted out, \"She won't leave me. I'll explain everything to her later, you don't need to—\"","\"It's too late, son. Far too late. Just look behind you!\" Sheng's father said, grief-stricken.","Sheng Wenyue was taken aback. Only then did he turn to look at the flood of comments on the screen, which had completely changed tone.","Their agent, who had just received the news, was about to handle the situation with his phone, but upon seeing the state of affairs, his hand trembled, and the phone shattered on the ground.","His mind was filled with one thought: It's over.","\"Ruan Jia has posted photos using a photographer's account from years ago, everyone go look!\"","\"Photos of childhood sweethearts, this is the evidence! What unrequited love? It was clearly the man pursuing the woman!\"","\"Work photos of Ruan Jia as a general manager, and photos of her participating in various investment project events. The evidence is irrefutable!\"","\"I'm a former employee of the company. My comments were always deleted before, but now I finally have a chance to speak. I have to say, if it weren't for Sister Ruan Jia holding down the fort for the Best Actor, he would never have achieved his current success. Now he's just burning the bridge after crossing it, completely twisting right and wrong.\"","\"Has sister finally decided to go all out? Who said earlier that sister was feeling guilty, couldn't let go, and was using the popular team to force the Best Actor to come back? Haha, laughable.\"","\"I see sister has thrown out so much evidence at once, so decisively. I love it! She should have done this earlier!\"","\"Looks like we don't need to help persuade anymore. This is clearly heading towards a complete severance of ties.\"","Wang Jiani, disregarding the live broadcast and the pain on her face, incredulously took out her phone to check the online exposé. Seeing that it was true, she was completely stunned.","After all, deep down, she had been able to bully Ruan Jia so smoothly because she relied on Sheng Wenyue's importance to Ruan Jia, knowing that Ruan Jia wouldn't bear to destroy Sheng Wenyue.","But now... it seemed that was no longer the case.","Meanwhile, Sheng Wenyue, looking at the evidence that could completely destroy him, initially thought it couldn't possibly be Ruan Jia who leaked it.","\"Haha, everyone, Ruan Jia has released the complete medical report that the Best Actor's studio published earlier. It turns out to be from a year ago. What a clever use of timing, taking things out of context!\"","\"I just want to ask the current Best Actor, does it hurt to have your lies exposed? Is it fun to fool your trusting fans like this? Are they brain-dead fans? Do they still support you?\"","That report was only in Ruan Jia's possession, so... it could only have been released by Ruan Jia.","Sheng Wenyue's face instantly turned deathly pale. All the uncertain factors in his heart came crashing down. Compared to his previous uncertain guesses, now it was Ruan Jia truly stabbing a knife into his heart.","He felt no resentment, only a fleeting moment of fear, especially when the screen was filled with comments like \"Support sister in divorcing him, leave the scumbag! Love yourself!\"","Divorce... fake divorce... wait!","Sheng Wenyue seemed to realize something was about to slip away. He quickly called Ruan Jia, but there was no answer.","\"We can't reach her either, she must be hiding. What should we do?\" Sheng's father lamented.","Sheng Wenyue immediately dialed another number, that of the lawyer.","But before Sheng Wenyue could speak, the lawyer spoke first: \"Congratulations, Mr. Sheng. Ms. Ruan has already signed the divorce papers.\"","These words were transmitted through the microphone, instantly silencing the entire venue. Even the barrage of comments paused for a moment.","\"No, no, that was fake, we weren't really divorcing. Did you tell her that?\" Sheng Wenyue lost all composure, his words slurring as he almost shouted in panic.","Lawyer: \"I have fulfilled Mr. Sheng's instructions, but Miss Ruan doesn't see it that way. She has already entrusted us to handle the division of her property entirely.\"","Sheng Wenyue's face suddenly changed. \"No, we're not divorced. Destroy the agreement, we...\"","\"I'm sorry, sir, but due to Miss Ruan's urging, legal proceedings have already begun and cannot be withdrawn,\" the lawyer said.","Sheng Wenyue's lips trembled. Fear and regret gnawed at his heart like a million ants, leaving him feeling as if his soul had been ripped away. He desperately tried to salvage the situation, constantly telling himself that it surely wasn't too late.","\"She's misunderstood me. I'll explain everything to her properly. Give her the phone.\"","The lawyer replied, \"I'm very sorry, sir, but Miss Ruan has just entered the operating room and will be unreachable for the next ten hours. When Miss Ruan comes out, you two will be in a divorced state. Also, due to the high risk of the surgery, Miss Ruan has also arranged for the handling of her estate. If it's convenient, Mr. Sheng, you can cooperate with the property division as soon as possible.\"","Sheng Wenyue froze, his pupils constricting and his hand holding the phone beginning to shake. His voice turned hoarse: \"What? What are you saying?\"","\"Oh? Sir, didn't you know Miss Ruan was ill? She's been hospitalized for several months now.\"","At this point, the silence in the room wasn't from people enjoying the drama, but from shock. It turned out that Ji Fei and Qin Zhao's performance wasn't exaggerated at all.","Was she really that seriously ill?","The barrage of comments exploded again.","\"Oh my God, what am I seeing? The diagnosis certificate and surgery consent form from XX Hospital, signed by the sister herself? It's today, she's having surgery today.\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: She Lost Her Memory","paragraphs":["\"Ruan Jia is sick, she's fallen ill, and you didn't even know? I'll beat you to death, you rascal!\" Sheng's father reacted, furious beyond measure.","Sheng's mother was also stunned into silence, \"Ruan Jia's parents are gone, you're all she has left, and you managed to let her fall ill under your care? You beast!\"","Sheng's mother also slapped Sheng Wenyue, nearly losing her balance from anger.","The illustrious Best Actor was beaten and humiliated by his parents in front of everyone. His manager rushed up anxiously to intervene, not wanting the situation to worsen, desperately asking the director and producer to cut the live stream.","But the director and producer had already given up, figuring that since things had gone this far, they might as well capitalize on the views and popularity, while also clearing themselves of any suspicion of being unwitting accomplices.","In their view, the Best Actor's career was thoroughly finished after this incident.","\"I didn't know, I really didn't know, she didn't tell me...\" Sheng Wenyue mumbled in disbelief.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, who were watching from the sidelines, were dumbfounded by these words.","[Trying to shirk responsibility at this point is just shameless.]","Qin Zhao sneered, \"Looks like our act just now was all for nothing.\"","Everyone recalled the scene, and the comments section exploded with insults.","The Best Actor's phone was still on, and suddenly Eldest Sister Qin Yan's voice could be heard on the other end.","Evidently, both the lawyer and Qin Yan were outside the operating room.","\"Is Best Actor Sheng still trying to smear the victim? When Miss Ruan Jia was hospitalized, we urged her to notify her family. She called you in front of us medical staff, have you forgotten how you responded?\"","Sheng Wenyue seemed to remember something, his breath catching.","\"You said she was acting to trick you, that you were tired of her cursing her own body out of jealousy,\" Qin Yan said coolly.","Sheng Wenyue panicked, seemingly unable to accept that he had made such a mistake, instinctively looking for excuses, \"We were arguing then, I really thought she was just saying things out of anger. Why didn't she say anything afterwards? If she had shown me the report, if...\"","\"To tell the person closest to you that you're sick, only to be repeatedly doubted, did Miss Ruan often lie to you before?\"","Hearing the questioning on the phone, Sheng's father couldn't help but cry out, \"How could that be possible? Ruan Jia was never that kind of person.\"","Sheng's mother also pounded on Sheng Wenyue's chest, saying, \"How did you become like this? Don't you know Ruan Jia anymore? No, it's we who don't know you anymore!\"","Sheng Wenyue's mind went blank.","\"Not to mention that the very next day, rumors spread of you accompanying Wang Jiani to the hospital because she twisted her ankle. Miss Ruan probably felt there was no point in telling you anymore,\" Qin Yan continued to twist the knife.","The color drained from Sheng Wenyue's face.","Wang Jiani's face also turned deathly pale.","Ji Fei couldn't help but interject with a taunt, \"Come to think of it, Ruan Jia has been sick for nearly three months. When I saw her buying a dress last time, I thought she looked unnaturally thin and sickly. How is it that Best Actor Sheng hasn't seen his wife for three months and has been accompanying someone else?\"","Qin Zhao scoffed, \"Maybe his eyesight is poor, and he can only see other women looking hurt and scared?\"","\"It might really be a vision problem. After all, he thought those leaked hospital photos were fake, unable to see that she was truly ill,\" Ji Fei pretended to whisper to Qin Zhao, but her voice was broadcast to everyone.","Sheng Wenyue almost collapsed, slumping down. His lips trembled, wanting to deny something, but he could only shake his head frantically. His expression seemed extremely pained, but it didn't evoke any sympathy.","Because of the more detailed revelations, all the audience members, both present and online, felt utterly shocked. The more they thought about it, the more disgusted they felt, as if they had eaten excrement.","\"I thought I was consuming sugar, but it turns out I was consuming shit. I want to vomit.\"","\"Where are those who loved the Best Actor, shipped the CP, and insulted the original wife? Come out and face punishment, apologize!\"","\"I'll apologize first, I'm on my knees for sister, I'm sorry, I misjudged people, actually supporting a scumbag man and a cheap woman, I don't know how much virtue I've lost, I deserve this!\"","\"Scumbag man and cheap woman, get out of the entertainment industry!\"","The lawyer coughed, maintaining professionalism, \"Well, Mr. Sheng, regarding your commission, I've completed it, so I'll hang up now...\"","But Sheng Wenyue suddenly seemed to wake up.","\"No, where are you? I want to stay with her, how can she have surgery alone? I'll go accompany her, and... we're not divorced, I don't agree, that's fake!\"","Sheng Wenyue was so anxious that tears started flowing, his whole person seeming on the verge of collapse. Some things, it seems, are only valued when they're about to be lost.","[Playing the devoted lover now? Disgusting~ He's not still thinking of entangling Ruan Jia, is he?]","\"Sir, let me emphasize once again, regardless of whether your intention was genuine or false, whether there are any other operations in the future, it is legally binding, and you were the one who signed it first and had me deliver it to Miss Ruan, so you gave the decision of divorce to Miss Ruan, and Miss Ruan decided to divorce,\" the lawyer said seriously before quickly hanging up.","\"I'm dying of laughter, was Sheng Wenyue planning to fake a divorce with his wife to help whitewash himself and Wang Jiani? Is his brain underdeveloped? What was he thinking?\"","\"The question is, how was Sheng Wenyue so confident that his wife would agree to such an absurd thing?\"","\"I think he's been so bewitched by the mistress that his intelligence has dropped.\"","The comments mocking Sheng Wenyue came in waves, making the big screen unwatchable.","In the end, it was Sheng's parents, overcome with grief, who came to their senses and angrily dragged him away.","After Sheng Wenyue left, the entire screen was filled with \"Shameless mistress!\"","Stimulated by this, Wang Jiani could no longer stay and ran off the stage crying.","In the end, before the voting even began, only the top-tier group was left on stage, securely winning the first PK.","After returning home, Ji Fei and the Qin family couldn't help but continue to follow the online gossip.","Seeing more and more improper interactions between Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani being dug up, yet they still dared to insist they hadn't had an affair, Ji Fei couldn't help but admire their audacity.","Before going to bed, she learned two pieces of news. First, Ruan Jia's surgery was over, but she hadn't woken up yet. Sheng's parents and Sheng Wenyue had found the hospital, but since they no longer had a legal relationship, the hospital wouldn't let them stay as caregivers, so they could only wait outside.","Second, the authorities had issued an announcement criticizing the Best Actor and Wang Jiani by name for this defamation incident, citing moral decay and severe negative influence. All their endorsements and collaborations were terminated overnight, posts deleted, and their once-defining work was flooded with insulting comments from netizens, forcing it to be temporarily taken down.","Now, the Best Actor and Wang Jiani were like rats in the street, everyone shouting to beat them, with no possibility of a turnaround.","Many people online prayed for Ruan Jia, hoping she would get better soon and start a new life.","Three days later, Ji Fei was sleeping in. This was a three-day break she had fought for after finishing the show recordings, allowing her not to go to the studio for classes.","Suddenly, someone knocked on her door.","She groggily opened the door to find Qin Rong and Qin's Mom standing anxiously outside.","\"Qin Yan just said in the group chat, Ruan Jia has woken up.\"","Ji Fei immediately perked up, happily saying, \"That's great, good things really do happen to good people.\"","But why were Qin's Mom and Qin Rong so excited that they worried she might miss it while sleeping and came specially to wake her up? Usually, they didn't care what time she woke up.","\"But... she's lost her memory,\" Qin's Mom said excitedly, as if holding her breath.","Ji Fei: ????","\"What?\""]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Just Forget the Dirty Stuff","paragraphs":["After delivering the bombshell news, Qin's Mom and Qin Rong anxiously watched Ji Fei.","Sure enough, the next second, Ji Fei's thoughts came rushing like a storm.","[Amnesia! Is it real or fake? Let me see! Holy crap! It's true, and it's that dramatically selective kind where she only forgets one person! She's completely forgotten Sheng Wenyue from start to finish!]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong thought: The doctors on Qin Yan's side are still investigating, but as expected, Ji Fei's gossip network is the fastest. This is too dramatic - she only forgot Sheng Wenyue?!","[How much must one hate a person for the body to choose to forget all love and hatred related to him?! But won't this make her vulnerable to Sheng Wenyue's manipulation? What if he shamelessly begs to remarry... Yikes~]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong: Yikes~","[What to do, I'm so curious how Sheng Wenyue will react to an amnesiac Ruan Jia!]","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong were also extremely curious.","So the three exchanged glances.","\"We've never visited Big Sister's workplace before,\" Ji Fei spoke up.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong nodded, indicating they hadn't either.","\"Shall we go visit Big Sister together?\" Ji Fei suggested.","Qin's Mom and Qin Rong quickly turned to prepare for the outing.","When they arrived at the hospital, Qin Yan only then received a call to come down and meet them.","The three were initially a bit nervous, but as soon as Qin Yan greeted them, she excitedly said: \"Quick, come with me. The Sheng family of three already knows about Ruan Jia's condition and they're in her room now.\"","The three: !!!!","And so the gossip quartet headed to Ruan Jia's hospital room, under the guise of visiting a patient.","Just as they reached the door, they heard Sheng Wenyue's hoarse voice, full of emotion and pain: \"Ruan Jia, do you really not remember me? I'm your husband!\"","The gossip quartet all shuddered uncomfortably, feeling somewhat concerned.","Then they heard Ruan Jia's voice, upbeat and clear like a vigilant college girl facing strangers, brimming with a certain vitality.","\"I may not remember you in my memories, but I'm not stupid. I know you're Uncle and Auntie Sheng's son, my childhood friend, and we got married. But we're divorced now. I have photos of the divorce agreement and property settlement on my phone. There's a wedding ring in the trash can, so stop trying to fool me. You can only be considered my ex-husband now.\"","\"That was an accident, we were planning a fake divorce, I never intended to...\"","\"Stop right there. I don't care what you originally planned. I know myself, and I'm not the type to play along with such silly games. I never make rash decisions about anything. Even if I've forgotten, I trust my decision at the time. It must mean I didn't want you anymore, so that's that! Don't think you can trick me, it's not happening!\"","As Ji Fei and the others entered, they saw Ruan Jia with a savvy 'don't try to fool me' expression. Though still frail with a white bandage around her head, her eyes were bright and alert.","She no longer focused solely on Sheng Wenyue as she used to. As soon as she noticed the newcomers, her attention immediately shifted to Ji Fei and the others.","\"Ah, it's you, Teacher Ji Fei. Hello, I remember you. You helped me out at the mall that time. I've also seen you online. Thank you for that scene you acted out - it was a big help to me.\" Ruan Jia smiled brightly, sincerely expressing her gratitude. That stage play had relieved her anxiety about her memory loss.","Ji Fei smiled and said, \"I heard you woke up, so I came to visit.\"","[I never imagined that without Sheng Wenyue's interference, she'd be such a vibrant person.]","The Qin family trio also felt it was unbelievable. She seemed like a completely different person.","They had all met Ruan Jia before and felt she was like a withering flower, gradually fading away. But now, she was like a seed just breaking through the soil.","Ji Fei's gaze swept the room. She saw Sheng Wenyue kneeling by the hospital bed, in a pitiful, pleading posture. Sheng's father and mother stood nearby, wiping away tears.","In the moment Ruan Jia spoke to Ji Fei, Sheng Wenyue froze. The feeling of being completely ignored by someone who once loved him wholeheartedly was terrifying.","\"Ruan Jia!\" Sheng Wenyue anxiously tried to grab Ruan Jia's hand, saying, \"Look at me. Even if you've forgotten, you should still feel something. You love me. You've loved me for so many years. I'm begging you, Ruan Jia. I'm begging you, I really can't live without you, I really...\"","Unable to continue, he broke down sobbing.","But Ruan Jia wasn't falling for it. She avoided his touch with disgust, not giving him any chance to make contact.","\"I loved you for many years? Then I must have been blind. You cheated on me four years ago, you scumbag. What's there to love about you? Your disloyalty? Your disrespect? And I even gave up my dreams for you. Did you put me under a spell or something?\" After saying this, Ruan Jia touched her head in utter disbelief.","Perhaps it was the genuinely disgusted look in her eyes that pierced Sheng Wenyue, leaving him stunned.","Sheng's father and mother couldn't help but speak up, their voices trembling and cautious.","\"This foolish boy has wronged you. He was just confused, lacking judgment and clarity. But he truly loves you. In the days waiting for you to wake up, he didn't eat or drink, like a dead man. We believe you're in his heart.\"","\"We hate this boy too, but... could you give him a chance? Since you've forgotten the bad things, why not let him take care of you for life?\"","The gossip quartet found these words quite exasperating.","Fortunately, Ruan Jia wasn't confused anymore.","\"Uncle, Auntie, since he's the one who wronged me, I won't apologize. You've watched me grow up, so you should understand my personality. I could never be with someone I don't love, let alone knowing he's done so many things to hurt me. I don't even want to see him now. If he keeps appearing in front of me, I feel like I'll need another surgery.\"","Ruan Jia held her recently operated head, looking pained.","This made the gossip quartet chuckle.","\"Sheng Wenyue, an ex should be like someone who's dead. If we part ways amicably without entanglement, I might think a bit better of you.\" With that, Ruan Jia waved her hand and said, \"Uncle, Auntie, please take him away. I don't want my recovery disturbed.\"","Sheng Wenyue's body swayed, almost unable to keep kneeling. \"Ruan Jia, Ruan Jia, I really know I was wrong. I only realize now that you're the only one in my heart. The others were just illusions, I...\"","\"Is that so?\" Ruan Jia suddenly raised an eyebrow and spoke, picking up her phone nearby and tapping something. Then she began to read seriously: \"October 10th. I finally know why Wenyue has been cold to me lately. He got drunk and hugged me, calling out 'Jiajia, don't go,' then kissed me and even tried to embrace me. I was disgusted. He never calls me Jiajia, that's not me. So I did some digging and found out that a Jiajia left a year ago.\"","At these words, Sheng Wenyue's face turned pale, his pupils trembling in disbelief.","The gossip quartet were revolted. They all looked at Sheng Wenyue with disdain.","\"And you say I'm the only one?\" Ruan Jia continued mockingly: \"October 12th. I've decided not to tell Sheng Wenyue about my pregnancy. This child can't be kept. If I decide to leave him, it would be too unfair to the child. He doesn't deserve to be the father of my child right now.\"","Upon hearing this, it was as if the air around him froze. Sheng Wenyue stared at Ruan Jia in shock, as if someone had gripped his throat, his eyes reddening. \"A child? We had a child?\"","...............","The next PK opponents are two male god groups, but the original gossip setup was a bit boring, so I changed it.","It's now: The top xianxia historical drama male god and his ex-girlfriend's current boyfriend collaborating on stage!","..............."]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Drama of Dogs Biting Dogs","paragraphs":["Sheng Wenyue could never have imagined that they were actually supposed to have had a child.","Not just Sheng Wenyue, but his parents were also unable to handle the news. His mother nearly fainted and had to be supported by his father.","The child they had longed for, if not aborted, would have been four years old by now.","The Gossip Group of Four was also stunned.","Ji Fei could hardly believe she had missed such a big piece of gossip, as her system only provided answers when she actively searched, not proactively.","[There's such a juicy story? Let me see... Oh my god, it's true! Actually, they haven't had children for years because their bodies were too exhausted and they had no time for pregnancy planning. Getting pregnant was actually an accident.]","[But with Ruan Jia's personality, if she wasn't sure about their love, she would definitely not want to have a child. She's not the type of woman who would pitifully use a child as leverage to tie down a man. She would only feel that the child was a shackle binding her.]","\"Why... why didn't you keep it, why didn't you tell me? If I had known, I would have... I just made a small mistake, you should have given me a chance to correct it!\" Sheng Wenyue cradled his head as if he was going mad.","Ruan Jia responded with exasperation: \"I didn't divorce you then, wasn't that giving you a chance? But the outcome seems to have proven that my decision back then wasn't wrong. You still disappointed me.\"","A small indiscretion in marriage might be overlooked once due to deep feelings or fear of change, but it certainly wouldn't be tolerated endlessly.","[That's right. A strong woman who once accompanied Sheng Wenyue in his entrepreneurial journey, if not for the successive blows of her husband's betrayal and her parents' deaths, would have been clearer about what she wanted, rather than dragging it out until now.]","Ji Fei inwardly criticized, and the Gossip Group of Three couldn't help but nod in agreement.","Moreover, everyone knew that Ruan Jia's revelation of such a deeply hidden secret was not only due to her memory loss but also her resolute determination to avoid being entangled again.","Sheng Wenyue naturally realized this too, his whole body beginning to tremble, his expression so pained that the veins on his forehead bulged.","\"Ruan Jia, I won't give up on you. I know it's you I love. I wronged you before, but I want to pursue you again. I'll wait for you to come back, wait for you to...\"","[These lines sound so familiar.]","The Qin family gossip group: Inexplicably reminded of a certain unfortunate fellow.","At the studio, discussing business with Gao Hao, Qin Zhao sneezed heavily.","\"Stop right there!\" Ruan Jia frowned and said, \"I don't care what you think. Everything that needed to be said has been said. If you don't leave now, I'll really call the police and report you for harassment.\"","She added coldly, \"I'm not joking.\"","Sheng Wenyue was stung by the coldness on her face.","Sheng's father, anxious to say something, was directly cut off by Ruan Jia: \"I respect my elders, but if elders want to use emotional blackmail to make me uncomfortable and unhappy, just to satisfy others, then I won't respect them either.\"","\"I've already died once, and my parents are gone. So now, I only satisfy my own emotions.\"","These words were almost identical to the theme of Ji Fei's performance.","In the end, Sheng's father couldn't say a word and could only sadly support Sheng's mother as they left.","Sheng Wenyue didn't want to leave and tried to persist, but there was no need to call the police. They were already divorced, and Qin Yan had the right to ask security to remove them.","Even as he was being forced out, Sheng Wenyue still wanted to say some self-indulgent words.","Ruan Jia disgustedly cleaned her ears, saying nothing. The Qin family members looked at Ruan Jia with some concern, worried that she might soften, after all, even a strong woman might be worn down by a persistent man.","[Laughable. If even Qin Zhao couldn't succeed, I'll do a handstand and wash my hair if Sheng Wenyue manages it.]","The Qin family: *cough cough cough*","Elsewhere, Qin Zhao's ears suddenly felt very hot.","[Before we arrived, Ruan Jia had already contacted her former freelance photographer group via phone. For someone like Ruan Jia, who has no attachments and only regrets wasting years of her life, now single-mindedly wanting to fulfill her dreams, nothing can hold her back. I bet leaving the hospital will be equivalent to leaving the country.]","[Even if Sheng Wenyue wants to pursue her, he'll have to find her first. Thanks to his previous neglect of Ruan Jia, only focusing on his own career, he never set foot in Ruan Jia's professional circle. When Ruan Jia leaves, he won't even know who to ask, haha.]","[He's still not giving up now, thinking he can win back a woman, but in the near future, he'll be left with nothing but despair.]","With the annoying people gone, everyone comforted Ruan Jia for a while. Seeing that Ruan Jia was completely fine on her own, even showing an excited impulse as if reborn, eager to recover soon and fulfill her dreams, everyone felt reassured and left, letting Ruan Jia rest and recover.","As soon as they came out, Qin Rong, excited from all the gossip, suggested that everyone go shopping together. They had missed the chance to shop with the whole family last time, and it was rare for them to be out today.","Ji Fei, thinking it was the last day of her vacation, naturally wanted to have some fun. Having just watched a good show, she was in a great mood. It felt like they should celebrate.","Qin Yan had nothing urgent to do, so she joined in as well.","However, just as they reached the main entrance, they saw that the annoying bunch hadn't left yet.","And there were two more dirty additions.","The manager and Wang Jiani.","Wang Jiani had returned relying on Sheng Wenyue's support, but now her reputation in the entertainment circle was completely ruined. With nowhere else to go, she could only desperately cling to him.","But now Sheng Wenyue seemed to have awakened, mercilessly pushing Wang Jiani away and even slapping her hard, speaking viciously.","\"It's all because of you, you slut. You ruined my family and my career. If you hadn't appeared, if you hadn't come back, Ruan Jia and I wouldn't have ended up like this. It's all your fault. How dare you show your face to me, I wish I could strangle you!\"","Being slapped by Sheng Wenyue seemed to be Wang Jiani's breaking point. She was stunned for a moment, then went into a frenzy, frantically scratching at Sheng Wenyue.","\"You think you can ease your own guilt by blaming everything on me? If you hadn't given me signals back then, making me think I had a chance, I wouldn't have ended up like this. It was you who gave me hope, and later it was you who gave me the opportunity to hurt Ruan Jia. You allowed everything to happen, and now you want to wash your hands of it? You're dreaming. You're just a fickle, disloyal scumbag! Ruan Jia must have been blind to like you, she's just a stupid woman!\"","Being cursed at by the woman he once protected as his most delicate flower nearly made Sheng Wenyue lose his mind. They started fighting right there, with Sheng's parents coldly observing, while the manager anxiously tried to break up the fight.","The gossip group watched from a distance, avoiding getting splattered with blood.","[What a show of dogs biting dogs. Oh, I think I see people outside the fence noticing this and recording with their phones. Looks like it's going to blow up on social media again.]","Just as Ji Fei finished her snarky comment, she turned to see that all three Qin family ladies were holding up their phones, excitedly recording the scene."]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Creating Hell Arena Personally","paragraphs":["Ji Fei: [When did the Qin family's noble ladies become such gossips?]","The Qin Family Gossip Group recorded while casting a helpless glance at Ji Fei, acknowledging it was her influence.","Besides, they now all have their own small groups of inner circle friends, constantly sharing gossip.","With Qin Zhao and Ji Fei causing such a stir on the variety show, even the upper-class circles couldn't resist indulging in the drama.","In the end, thankfully, Qin Yan feared someone might get hurt and quickly sent for security.","Sheng Wenyue and Wang Jiani were like mortal enemies, making each other bleed. As they walked out, they continued to curse each other with the most vicious language.","Who could have imagined that not long ago they were still displaying affection in front of the whole country's audience!","After Wang Jiani was driven away, the agent tried to reason with Sheng Wenyue, but was met with a fist to the face from the enraged Sheng Wenyue, knocking out several teeth.","\"You're also a traitor! It's all your fault for leading me to make mistakes. You were my most trusted partner, why did you betray me!\"","The agent was also furious now. Originally, he thought that although Sheng Wenyue was hated all over the internet, he hadn't crossed any red lines, so there might still be a chance for a comeback, after all, netizens have short memories.","His own reputation was also tarnished, having offended too many people and being too closely tied to Sheng Wenyue. His entire career now depended on Sheng Wenyue's resurgence.","But now, as the only person who hadn't abandoned Sheng Wenyue, he was being beaten. How could he not be angry?","\"Betray you? Get this straight, I've always been considering your future. Before, when Ruan Jia was beneficial to you, I supported Ruan Jia. Now that Wang Jiani is beneficial to you, I support Wang Jiani. Who could have known you wouldn't handle Ruan Jia properly!\"","Sheng Wenyue glared angrily, while his parents, who had been silent until now, finally couldn't help but speak up: \"Back then, we saw you as enthusiastic and honest, saying you treated Wenyue like family, that's why we always let you be Wenyue's agent. But it turns out this is how you think! Ruan Jia wasn't just anyone, she was his wife! When Wenyue did wrong, you should have advised him, not encouraged him!\"","\"I treated him too much like family. I knew he had always suppressed his feelings for Wang Jiani, bound by duty as Ruan Jia's husband, so I took a step. Love doesn't have a first come, first served rule or right and wrong,\" the agent justified righteously.","\"But I love Ruan Jia!\"","\"That's just self-deception because you've failed now,\" the agent snorted coldly.","Sheng Wenyue seemed to fall into self-contradiction and broke down crying.","The agent couldn't help but press on, \"If our plan had succeeded, you and Wang Jiani could have not only loved openly, but your career would have taken off again. So I did nothing wrong. As for Ruan Jia, when there's no love left, abandoning her isn't wrong either.\"","Sheng's parents cursed at this unrepentant fellow, \"You're fired!\" Then they pulled Sheng Wenyue away.","\"He really doesn't think he did anything wrong?\" the Gossip Group couldn't help but discuss.","Ji Fei couldn't help but laugh wildly in her heart.","[Good grief, he actually said when there's no love left, abandoning her isn't wrong. Does he know his own wife is secretly hooking up with his assistant?]","Gossip Group: !!!!","[While he's busy out there, his wife is lonely and helpless, and fell in love with the assistant. When he's not home, they're just like a married couple.]","[Hilarious, because of this incident, his wife is now planning to take all his money and elope with the assistant! He was originally supposed to be out busy all day today, but now that he's been fired, he can only go home. Wonder if he'll walk in on them.]","[But since he endorses the supremacy of true love, he should understand his wife's actions. After all, love doesn't have a first come, first served rule or right and wrong, hahaha]","Gossip Group: Pff pff pff~ Hold it in, you've taken all the bamboo shoots from the mountain.","After watching such an entertaining scene, everyone's spirits were high until they encountered a small trouble while out shopping.","Because Ji Fei had become famous, her unprofessional disguise led to her being quickly recognized.","It was Ji Fei's first time being surrounded by so many people asking for autographs and photos, she could only quickly hide in a store.","For professional problems, leave it to professionals. She called Gao Hao for help.","After listening, Gao Hao said helplessly: \"Weren't you an artist before?\"","Ji Fei used to be an unknown model, without makeup, people couldn't recognize her. She's still not used to it now.","\"I'll send Xiao Tao to pick you up. By the way, there's something I need to tell you.\" Gao Hao took the opportunity to brief Ji Fei on what he had just told Qin Zhao.","\"The actor king group has withdrawn from the competition, so five groups have become four. Therefore, the competition system has changed. Your next round will be a direct PK with the double male god group that was previously exempted.\"","\"Current boyfriend and ex-boyfriend?!\" Ji Fei's tone instantly heightened.","The three gossip girls immediately pricked up their ears.","After all, compared to the fake sugar of the despicable and disgusting actor king group, this combination was truly awkward enough to make everyone look forward to seeing them act together on the same stage.","Sun Mo, the male god of xianxia dramas, with his cold, domineering, and expressionless face, was basically consistent with the roles he usually played. He always claimed to be single, focused solely on his career, the type that continuously films at the studio, and basically doesn't hype up CP.","Yang Hong, the campus male god, had more rumors, was naturally sociable, enthusiastic and proactive, with some capital background. Although he had never officially announced his relationship with his current girlfriend, they often subtly showed affection. Some fans accepted it well, while others chose to turn a blind eye.","Netizens only thought it was a double male god combination, cheering for their own idols. How could they imagine: your sister-in-law is actually my ex-sister-in-law.","Ji Fei still remembered the last time they shot the promotional video. Although her attention was mostly on the actor king group, she also noticed the subtle atmosphere between these two.","Sun Mo completely ignored Yang Hong, but Yang Hong kept smiling and actively trying to get closer.","When it was time to take a group photo, Sun Mo stood still, and it was Yang Hong who suddenly reached out and put his arm around Sun Mo's neck for an intimate photo.","One cold, one warm, a combination of ice and fire. When the promotional video came out, it even attracted some fujoshi to ship them, creating their own fandom.","But obviously Sun Mo felt the other was disgusting him. As soon as the shooting was over, he shook off Yang Hong's arm decisively, showing no courtesy at all.","In the end, it was the other's agent who came forward to apologize with a smile.","But Yang Hong still seemed happy, as if he didn't mind the other's rudeness at all, with a bit of a cynical, deliberately mischievous feeling.","Later during the show's recording, Yang Hong often asked for leave, so the two weren't seen together much.","But since it's a PK, it will definitely be a grand spectacle.","\"Ahem, so they'll have enough trouble harmonizing their internal conflicts, and basically won't have any conflicts with us. Sun Mo's agent Pei Mingxuan is very close to me, she just contacted me, hoping we can develop peacefully, each perform well, so this time you guys just focus on honing your acting skills and showcasing your professional abilities. The most important thing is to behave! Try to salvage some of our image in the industry, help me trick more people to join.\"","Ji Fei didn't listen carefully, because while reminiscing just now, she had already scanned Sun Mo and Yang Hong with the Gossip System.","As a result, the top information directly revealed a big piece of gossip!","[Oh my god!]","The three gossip girls were startled, their hands trembling, staring at each other with wide eyes, not daring to look at Ji Fei.","They heard Ji Fei make a earth-shattering cry in her heart, like a big white goose whose neck had been stepped on.","Gossip Group: What happened? What happened! What big news?","[Yang Hong wants his girlfriend Xu Meng to be the female guest performer for the next PK!]","Gossip Group: Excuse me????","[Creating a love triangle drama himself? Damn, is it that intense... Oh... Okay, that Xu Meng didn't agree. That makes sense~]","Gossip Group: What a pity.","[Oh my god, does this Yang Hong have some weird fetish? He actually arranged to meet Sun Mo and asked Sun Mo to persuade Xu Meng!]","Gossip Group: This Yang Hong must be sick. But Sun Mo probably won't agree. According to the inside information Gao Hao mentioned earlier, back then Sun Mo was unceremoniously dumped by Xu Meng when he couldn't make it big. Logically, they should firmly refuse to appear on the same stage, wishing to never cross paths again.","[Sun Mo didn't respond...]","Gossip Group: Obviously...","[But he drove to the Starlight Club! That's where Yang Hong asked to meet! Does this count as saying no verbally but being honest with actions? Does he also want Xu Meng to guest perform???!!!]","Gossip Group: But why???!!!","Obviously Ji Fei was also confused.","[What kind of love-hate relationship are you three trying to act out?! Most importantly, who's paired with who?!]","Gossip Group: After considering all the combinations, why does it feel like they'll all end up in a bloody mess?","[Oh my god!!!]","Gossip Group: What's the matter now?","[Pei Mingxuan discovered that Sun Mo is missing and is looking everywhere for him. As a manager who's so protective of her artists' reputations, she definitely wouldn't allow this kind of situation to happen. If she finds them, she'll surely stop it. Wonder when she'll find them...]","[Ahh, I'm so curious! Even though I can find out through the Gossip System, I want to go see the drama in person! Starlight Club... should I...]","Gossip Group: Should you...","\"Hey, hey, can you hear me?\" Gao Hao was still calling out on the other end.","\"Yes, yes, I hear you. I've got something to do, I'll call you back,\" Ji Fei said, then turned to the three with a sweet smile: \"Later, I'll...\"","Seeing that they were about to be left behind, Qin's Mom was the first to object, saying: \"Why don't we go somewhere else to play later?\"","Qin Yan immediately caught on: \"Since we're out, why don't we stay up all night and have a blast?\"","Qin Rong was also excited, her little face flushed red, \"Us Qin Family women should stick together, no one can be left out!\"","Ji Fei: ...","\"I heard about this high-end club that's supposed to be pretty nice. Later, we can have Xiao Tao take us...\"","The proposal passed unanimously.","Far away at the studio, Gao Hao suddenly received a message. His face immediately changed.","\"Ji Fei took your Qin Family women to the Starlight Club?\"","Qin Zhao, sitting on the sofa, was startled, \"What place?\"","Gao Hao explained with a bewildered expression, \"It's a private, high-end club popular among industry insiders. I used to be worried about you getting into trouble, so I made connections with the staff there. They notify me if they see my artists, but you've always been well-behaved and never went there.\"","Qin Zhao raised an eyebrow: \"It shouldn't be a problem, right? Mom, big sis, and little sis are all with Ji Fei today. They're probably just going to sing karaoke and have some fun.\"","Gao Hao's expression was peculiar, \"It should be fine, I guess, although they do offer male and female companion services for singing...\"","Qin Zhao: ?","\"Male companions?\"","\"You know, the type with fair skin, red lips, and six-pack abs...\"","Qin Zhao's eyebrow twitched.","Just then, Gao Hao's phone buzzed. He looked down at it and his mouth twitched, \"Uh... it looks like your family members ordered ten handsome guys together, covering all theme styles.\"","Qin Zhao's face darkened.","Qin Family men's group chat:","Qin Zhao: Red alert! Red alert! @Second brother, stop your meeting, @Dad, stop fishing, @Big nephew, you... keep doing your homework!","Let's go go go!"]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: Firm and elastic, feels great","paragraphs":["After Ji Fei and her companions arrived at the gossip spot, they requested the private room opposite the love triangle group.","They belatedly realized it wasn't quite what they had imagined, as they couldn't exactly barge into someone else's room to eavesdrop.","But since they were already there, they decided to have some fun anyway.","So when the Manager brought out a tablet to ask if they wanted to order some male companions, Ji Fei got excited.","[Isn't this exactly what I've always wanted to do?]","The three Qin women: What thing?","It wasn't until they leaned in and saw the Manager eagerly scrolling through photos of different handsome men that the three Qin women blushed red.","Although the Qin family was considered top-tier among upper-class circles, they had always maintained good family values and avoided extravagant indulgences. So this was the first time the Qin women had come to such a place and experienced this kind of thing.","But half an hour later, four drunk women in the private room had forgotten the original purpose of their outing.","Qin's Mom was singing nostalgic golden oldies with a young handsome man while taking photos to send to her older sisters' group chat.","\"I finally understand why men like to go out for business entertainment and say it's just putting on an act for the occasion. I like this too!\"","Qin Yan was surrounded by two tall handsome men playing dice. When Qin Yan lost, she would take a sip of alcohol. When the handsome men lost, they would get pinched in various places - cheeks, arms, noses. The usually reserved Qin Yan wanted to laugh when she pinched their biceps but didn't dare act too unladylike.","She could only take photos to send to the divorced women's group chat in upper-class circles. She expressed her true feelings: \"I understand men, envy men, want to become a man.\"","Qin Rong sat on the sofa, her little face flushed red, covering her eyes with one hand while peeking through her fingers, occasionally letting out a scream.","In front of her, three men wearing only long pants were doing a sensual dance, showing off different types of muscle definition for the art student, occasionally throwing out an alluring gaze.","Qin Rong excitedly took a burst of ten photos to send to her girlfriends' group chat.","\"The boys are all so talented and sweet-talking. It's super fun here.\"","The remaining four handsome men each wore animal ear headbands and tails, circling around Ji Fei in the open space.","Ji Fei was like an ancient debauched emperor, blindfolded and trying to catch the pretty boys.","\"Sister, I'm over here.\"","\"Sister, come catch me!\"","At this point, someone who was tired walked to the door and saw Xiao Tao standing guard, constantly monitoring the situation outside. He enthusiastically invited her: \"Little sister, don't you want to join in the fun?\"","Xiao Tao refused with a serious face: \"I've sworn off men.\"","The person was taken aback and could only leave, leaving behind Xiao Tao who was single-mindedly carrying out Ji Fei's orders.","Something flashed through the crack in the door, and Xiao Tao said: \"Sister Fei, Pei Mingxuan has found us and gone inside.\"","Ji Fei was already in high spirits and not very clearheaded, so she said: \"Wait until someone comes out before we do anything.\" Then she continued trying to catch the pretty boys.","Xiao Tao commented: \"A profusion of flowers dazzles the eyes.\"","At this moment, Qin's Mom had just finished singing a song and was happily throwing cash as a tip.","When the three Qin men arrived, this was the decadent scene they witnessed.","The music was still blaring, and except for Ji Fei, the other three women saw their family's men standing at the door with ashen faces. Although drunk, they instinctively froze.","The handsome male companions were all intimidated by the aura of the three Qin men.","Just as one of the stunned handsome men was about to be caught by the blindfolded Ji Fei approaching,","Qin Xian strode in with long legs, his face so dark it could drip ink, and stood in front of Ji Fei.","Ji Fei immediately grabbed onto a solid arm and said with a giggle: \"I caught you, you have to drink!\"","As she said this, Ji Fei took off her blindfold, but she didn't look up.","She just dazedly stared at the waist that had suddenly appeared in front of her.","The black shirt wrapped around a lean waist, its folds rising and falling along the waistline, exuding a thoroughly restrained aura. Where the shirt clung tightly, one could see the outline of abdominal muscles undulating with each heavy breath.","The sight made Ji Fei unable to control her silly grin.","[What perfect proportions, what a great waist~]","Qin Xian: ...","[Ah, if only I weren't a married woman - no, a married man - I could wrap my arms around it.]","Qin Xian: You still want to wrap your arms around it?!","Then he saw Ji Fei swaying her body, reaching out a finger as if wanting to poke Qin Xian's abdomen.","A vein popped on Qin Xian's forehead as he reached out to grab Ji Fei's wrist.","Ji Fei was also tipsy from the alcohol and immediately felt dissatisfied.","[How did such a chaste man appear, so uncooperative. It's just a little touch.]","Qin Xian's eyebrows twitched furiously.","Ji Fei used all her strength, but Qin Xian's arm still didn't budge an inch.","Unexpectedly, Ji Fei lost her balance. Already leaning forward, she ended up headbutting Qin Xian's chest.","Qin Xian let out a muffled groan and staggered, but worried that Ji Fei might fall without any strength, he could only raise his hand to pull her into his embrace.","But the next second, he felt someone touching his abs. His muscles involuntarily contracted, unaccustomed to the sensation. Even though he was married, in his 20-plus years of life, he had never been taken advantage of by a woman like this.","[Firm and elastic, it feels great! It might even be on par with Qin Xian's!] Accompanied by incoherent giggles,","Qin Xian immediately became angry and embarrassed.","\"Ji Fei!\"","He wasn't angry about being taken advantage of, after all, they were married, so it didn't really count as taking advantage. But if it hadn't been him, if someone else had embraced her, would she have randomly groped them too?","Even being drunk wasn't an excuse!","The words 'female hooligan' flashed through Qin Xian's mind in bold and large font.","At this point, everyone present had their attention drawn over, wanting to laugh but not daring to.","Ji Fei was startled by the shout and finally managed to look up, immediately seeing an ice-cold face.","Her brain short-circuited on the spot.","[I see Qin Xian? Crap! It really is Qin Xian! How did he appear... I... I... feel sick!]","Qin Xian had thought Ji Fei would be panicked and regretful, but her reaction made him even more furious on the spot.","You were so happy to grope, but seeing my face makes you want to throw up?","The Qin family members were also shocked to hear these thoughts.","But the next second, they saw Ji Fei cover her mouth with a genuinely pained expression and rush out, clearly having drunk too much and really feeling sick.","Qin Xian's face went through a rainbow of colors before he could only silently chase after her to prevent any accidents.","Watching Ji Fei's figure rush into the ladies' room, they heard exaggerated vomiting sounds.","Qin Xian could only stand outside with a dark face and wait. After a while, he noticed it had gone quiet and immediately became worried.","\"Ji Fei, are you alright?\"","After calling out a few times with no response, Qin Xian immediately furrowed his brows and called out: \"Excuse me, is anyone in there?\"","\"Is anyone there? My wife needs help.\" He called out several times but still got no answer.","\"I'm sorry, I'm coming in.\"","Finally unable to wait any longer, Qin Xian picked up the 'Out of Order' sign nearby and placed it at the door before rushing in.","As soon as he entered, he saw Ji Fei sprawled by the sink, clearly having vomited until she had no strength left.","Qin Xian went over helplessly and propped her up. Ji Fei had sobered up a bit after throwing up and was now embarrassedly blinking her eyes, silently allowing Qin Xian to help her wash up.","Finally, she took the paper towel Qin Xian handed her and wiped her wet mouth and hands. \"Thank you.\"","[I didn't expect Qin Xian to be so attentive when taking care of someone. Looking at his expression, the ice mountain has melted. He probably won't pursue the matter anymore, right?]","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei. So you know I might pursue the matter, huh!","\"Let's go, time to head back.\" After this ordeal, he didn't seem as angry anymore.","[It looks like the problem isn't too serious. After all, I didn't really do anything. The only abs I accidentally touched were his...]","Qin Xian: ... The only ones?","The corners of his mouth turned up slightly.","[But come to think of it, it really felt nice!]","The tips of his ears turned red.","[I'd give him 99 points]","Qin Xian raised an eyebrow: Why not a perfect score?","[Deducting one point because there was clothing in the way! The feeling wasn't real enough!]","His ears were completely red now.","She really is a female hooligan!","Just as the two were about to exit, they suddenly heard hurried footsteps coming from afar.","\"Stop right there! Xu Meng!\"","[Xu Meng? Wait! Could it be...]","As the sound of high heels running towards them grew closer, before Qin Xian could react, Ji Fei, who had just been weak and listless, suddenly sprang up like a carp jumping out of water and excitedly pulled him into a bathroom stall."]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Toilet Eating Melon","paragraphs":["The sound of the cubicle door closing was drowned out by the club's background music. Qin Xian wore an unusually startled expression.","Ji Fei had pinned him against the door, her body pressed against his. One hand covered his mouth while the other made a shushing gesture.","Qin Xian's eyes widened, his dark lashes trembling slightly. The imposing aura of a man in a high position vanished completely. Those eyes, dark as night yet sparkling with hidden stars, stared blankly, offering no resistance as he looked at the person before him helplessly.","In that moment, Qin Xian resembled a male spirit who had just attained human form - pure yet alluring, exuding an indescribable attraction.","But this version of Qin Xian only caught Ji Fei's attention for a second. Because in the next moment, the drama unfolded right before them.","Faced with such a spectacle, who cared about admiring a handsome man?","Ji Fei excitedly peeked through the door crack, tilting her head for a better view. In her eagerness, she pressed even closer to Qin Xian, their bodies almost flush against each other.","Qin Xian's pupils constricted. He could smell the mixture of feminine perfume and alcohol emanating from Ji Fei, causing an unnatural flush to rise on his cheeks.","Ji Fei was wearing a comfortable, form-fitting athletic outfit today. Thanks to her excellent proportions, even leaning against Qin Xian's chest, her curves appeared graceful and sensual. Through just a dress shirt, he could feel the warmth radiating from her body.","That warmth made Qin Xian feel feverish.","Feeling extremely self-conscious, he realized that one of his arms had somehow ended up circling Ji Fei's waist. He stiffened even more.","Especially from Qin Xian's perspective, his gaze could trace from Ji Fei's long, fair neck down her beautiful shoulders and back, narrowing to an unseen waistline where his arm rested.","Beyond his arm was another curve.","Qin Xian awkwardly averted his gaze and lowered his arm. He tried to turn his head away from Ji Fei's hand pressed against his lips, but she was too focused on peeking and didn't loosen her grip. In the end, Qin Xian could only resign himself to Ji Fei's antics.","It wasn't until this moment that Qin Xian realized from Ji Fei's excited and chaotic thoughts why they had come here together. It wasn't really to find some young hunk with washboard abs, but to join in the excitement and hear some gossip.","Just then, a classical beauty with jet-black hair and snow-white skin, wearing a cheongsam and white high heels, rushed in.","[So this is Xu Meng? She really is beautiful. A second-tier starlet. I've seen her in dramas before. Her looks are very suitable for playing those weak, pitiful characters who get bullied and are helpless. So she has decent public support, and even when she dated Yang Hong, she wasn't attacked by his fans. I didn't expect her to look like this in real life too.]","Xu Meng's eyes were red and puffy. She looked lost and helpless, as if she might burst into tears at any moment. Her steps slowed as she began to turn in circles.","Soon, there was a loud sound of a door opening.","Xu Meng turned around in shock, like a startled little white rabbit. \"You... how can you come in here? This is the ladies' room.\"","As the other person's footsteps drew closer, Xu Meng kept backing up until she hit the wall.","[Wait a minute... Although this scene is quite entertaining, I really want to point out - if you have time to back away, if you really wanted to hide, why not rush into a toilet stall? You can lock the door there!]","Xu Meng seemed unable to think straight as a tall man cornered her.","It was none other than Sun Mo, whom fans claimed had the face of a domineering immortal lord who ruled over three realms.","Sun Mo's face was grim, his eyes slightly red as he stared at Xu Meng without saying a word.","[This atmosphere... It's so damn cliché, like a cheesy idol drama! You could set up a camera and start filming right now. When exes meet, they either go red-eyed or red-faced!]","Seeing Ji Fei's excited expression, Qin Xian wanted to show disdain but couldn't muster the appropriate expression. He could only silently grumble in his heart.","They might be acting out a cliché idol drama, but what about us hiding by the toilet, peeping and eavesdropping?","Are we in some kind of spy thriller?","[Wait, is there no one else? ]","Qin Xian: Did you expect a meeting to be held in the bathroom?","[This doesn't seem right. Where's the current boyfriend and the manager? How could they let these two come out alone? Aren't they worried something might happen? Let me see...]","Hearing this, Qin Xian also found it strange. What kind of boyfriend would be so careless?","[Huh? Yang Hong is taking care of Pei Mingxuan? What's going on?]","[I see now. Before Pei Mingxuan arrived, Sun Mo remained silent in the face of Yang Hong's enthusiasm and Xu Meng's obvious reluctance. He wouldn't even look at Xu Meng. Come on, if you're so unwilling, why did you come here in the first place?]","Qin Xian's mouth twitched, unable to resist feeling annoyed: Yes, if you're unwilling, why come? Causing their entire family to mobilize.","[Yang Hong kept trying to persuade them to collaborate. Xu Meng seemed to want to refuse in front of Yang Hong but couldn't bring herself to do it, until Pei Mingxuan arrived.]","[Damn, what was Yang Hong thinking? He was the one who sent the location information to Pei Mingxuan? Brother, are you setting up a show to watch?]","[As a result, before Pei Mingxuan could say anything, Xu Meng, with red eyes, seemed to gather her courage and expressed her unwillingness to participate in the performance.]","[Only then did Pei Mingxuan realize what an outrageous proposal Yang Hong had made, and immediately said it was inappropriate.]","[And Sun Mo, who had been silent all this time, suddenly spoke up: \"I'll listen to Mingxuan.\" He even directly humiliated Xu Meng by saying: \"She's not qualified to stand beside me.\"]","[OMG! That was the exact line Xu Meng said when she broke up with Sun Mo back then! This is explosive!]","[Xu Meng trembled all over, her eyes brimming with tears from the humiliation.]","[But Yang Hong didn't seem to care, only saying that the company was quite satisfied with this proposal. After all, as an unofficially announced couple, they naturally brought traffic. To compete with the current popularity of top celebrities, they needed to generate buzz.]","[However, Pei Mingxuan still firmly refused. Compared to the traffic it might bring, the consequences would be unpredictable if their past relationship was discovered.]","[Not to mention that over the past five years, every time Sun Mo heard news related to Xu Meng, he would become moody. While he didn't exactly lose control of his emotions, he would still use his position to secretly pressure and sabotage Xu Meng.]","[Mingxuan was helpless about his vengeful behavior, feeling it was a hidden danger, so she didn't want the two of them to interact on stage.]","As Qin Xian listened, he thought: This Pei Mingxuan is an excellent manager who can analyze pros and cons.","It's a pity that she and Sun Mo had supported each other through difficult times from the very beginning, building an uncommon bond.","Otherwise, Qin Xian would have considered poaching Pei Mingxuan to replace Gao Haozhao in looking after Ji Fei.","[Holy crap!!!! Yang Hong must be doing this on purpose, right? He actually said there was another goal in doing this - to propose to Xu Meng on stage if they win the competition. Wait, how are you so sure you'll win?]","[No, the key point is, you're talking about proposing on stage with her ex-boyfriend right there!]","[Brother, have you always been this brave?]","[I really want to see Sun Mo's frozen expression and Xu Meng's pale face right now. It must be quite a sight. So is that why they were so agitated and came out here? Let me see...]"]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: My Emotions Are Like a Pie Chart","paragraphs":["[It turns out Xu Meng had no idea Yang Hong was planning to propose. She was so shocked she didn't know what to say. Pei Mingxuan remained calm and asked if it was really a proposal. What if he lost?]","[Yang Hong actually replied that if he lost, he wouldn't propose, but if he won, he'd propose and boost his popularity, paving the way for his career transformation. He added that he really wanted to marry Xu Meng now. Hmm... my friend, you're being a bit too fake.]","Qin Xian: This is hard to judge. After all, there are many contractual marriages in the entertainment industry for the sake of benefits.","But now it's mostly trending actors who dominate. If they get married, regardless of gender, their popularity and resources will take a big hit, unless Yang Hong has already decided to give up being a trending star and truly transition to being a serious actor.","[Haha, I'm dying of laughter. Yang Hong's move is so outrageous. He actually sought his girlfriend's ex's blessing on the spot. Sun Mo and Xu Meng's expressions must have been priceless.]","[However, Sun Mo was a bit classless. He immediately mocked Xu Meng, saying she was vain and opportunistic, wondering how many sugar daddies had used her before Yang Hong picked her up. He said Yang Hong was a fool for wanting to marry such a shameless woman and that he should be worried about being cheated on after marriage.]","[He's lucky he didn't get punched.]","Qin Xian was reminded of the investigation materials as he listened.","Reportedly, Sun Mo used to work day and night to support Xu Meng, and even ended up in the hospital due to overwork. But Meng was pursued by a rich second-generation heir.","Perhaps defeated by reality, she abandoned her boyfriend of many years who was injured, leaving without hesitation.","This is what crushed Sun Mo, making him hate Xu Meng so much.","[But Yang Hong wasn't angry at all. He just said Xu Meng was great, as if he unconditionally trusted his girlfriend. This made Sun Mo even angrier.]","[He directly set a condition: if Xu Meng knelt before him, kowtowed and apologized, and drank a whole bottle of alcohol, he would agree to collaborate... He shouldn't be acting as an overbearing immortal lord, he should be playing an overbearing CEO. Doesn't he feel ashamed saying such things?]","Real CEO Qin Xian: ?","[Xu Meng couldn't stand the humiliation and ran out.]","[Afterwards, Pei Mingxuan scolded Sun Mo. Sun Mo found it annoying and used chest discomfort as an excuse to leave alone. Pei Mingxuan tried to stop him but twisted her ankle, so Yang Hong stayed behind to look after her.]","[Pei Mingxuan kindly persuaded him to go out and find people, but he ignored her. This Yang Hong is really carefree.]","Qin Xian: Strange, what is this person thinking?","Ji Fei was also wondering, when she heard commotion outside.","She saw Sun Mo questioning with a hoarse voice, as if suppressing his anger: \"Why are you running? Are you that afraid to face me?!\"","\"You... get out of my way...\"","Xu Meng pushed her delicate white wrists against Sun Mo's chest, but due to the apparent strength difference, it had no effect. This only angered Sun Mo more.","Sun Mo directly grabbed both of Xu Meng's hands with one hand, pinning them above her head. Xu Meng wanted to struggle but seemed to have no strength, like a soft beauty at his mercy. She could only look up, gazing at Sun Mo with pitiful, teary eyes.","[This scene might make you scream if you saw it on TV, but happening in reality, how to put it... As a bystander, it really makes your emotions as complex as a pie chart - one-third embarrassment, one-third shame, and one-third excitement.]","Qin Xian: ...You described it well. Next time, don't describe it.","Sun Mo stared back at her, stunned. Then he fiercely said: \"Putting on this act again to seduce who?! You think I'll still be fooled by you?\"","\"I... I'm not. Sun Mo... you're... you're being unreasonable. I'm Yang Hong's girlfriend now, please let go of me.\"","Her voice was soft and coquettish, making Ji Fei's ears tingle. She unconsciously scratched her ear against Qin Xian's chest, but the spot wasn't quite right. Now it was Qin Xian's turn to feel tingly.","Xu Meng struggled slightly, only to be violently pinned back by Sun Mo.","\"Girlfriend?!\" Sun Mo seemed to grind the three words between his teeth.","\"What? You really want to marry him? Are you willing to give up finding a better match? Don't you just want to marry up? Yang Hong doesn't have the background of your rich ex-boyfriend. Or have you gotten older and can't hook a better one, so you're settling?\"","\"Sun Mo, you bastard!\" Xu Meng's tone immediately carried a sob, as if filled with endless grievances.","Sun Mo sneered: \"Don't tell me you want to say you love Yang Hong? Does someone like you even understand love?\"","Xu Meng burst into tears, \"My business has nothing to do with you. I do love Yang Hong, I really love him...\"","Sun Mo, like an enraged lion, punched the wall beside them with a loud bang.","Ji Fei: [... Doesn't that hurt?]","\"Yang Hong is at the same level as me now, how could you possibly love him! Stop lying, Xu Meng!\"","[...Is he trying to say that since they're at the same level, if Xu Meng can love Yang Hong, she could love him too? Why not him?]","Qin Xian listened and got the same impression. It seems he's in denial, still unable to let go of the ex-girlfriend who abandoned him.","As he spoke, Sun Mo stared intently at Xu Meng. Seeing Xu Meng open and close her mouth without speaking, only shedding tears, Sun Mo's eyes flickered.","\"Xu Meng, you owe me a debt you can never repay in this lifetime. I won't let you off easy. You still want me to provide a proposal stage for you, to be your wedding dress maker? Dream on.\"","\"Sun Mo, you...\" Xu Meng stared at Sun Mo in a daze.","Sun Mo suddenly sneered: \"How about you make the wedding dress for me instead? I might consider it.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Sun Mo chuckled lightly: \"I'm planning to marry Xuan too. Why don't you give the stage to me and Xuan? If so, I might consider letting you be a supporting actor. You two can offer your blessings to me and Xuan then.\"","Xu Meng looked at Sun Mo as if suddenly struck by a huge blow, her eyes shattered, her voice hoarse, \"You... you really want to marry her? You've been single all these years, it turns out it's because you had her by your side. Those rumors were true? Sure enough... sure enough... you... don't want me anymore...\"","The last part seemed like an absent-minded murmur, but the voice was just loud enough for everyone to hear.","Ji Fei: ?","Qin Xian: ?","\"What did you say?!\" Sun Mo suddenly became agitated, glaring fiercely.","But Xu Meng seemed to come back to her senses, her face full of panic as she said: \"I didn't, I didn't say anything. You heard wrong. Let me go, I want to go back...\"","Ji Fei: [... My pie chart needs to split into another piece, which is speechlessness. No, would someone really unconsciously speak their true feelings? And then panic and deny it so obviously when discovered?]","Qin Xian: I don't believe it.","But Sun Mo believed it. As Xu Meng struggled to leave, he lost control, his eyes red, grabbing her waist and forcefully kissing her. The atmosphere was just short of him saying: \"Just say you want me, and I'll give you my life.\"","\"No, mmph...\"","Watching Xu Meng struggle, Ji Fei hesitated for a moment, wondering if she should intervene. Regardless of what she was thinking, forced kissing was still against a woman's will.","But the next second, Ji Fei's mouth twitched, because she saw Xu Meng's fists beating Sun Mo's shoulders gradually weaken until she had no strength left and wrapped her arms around his neck. As if following an instinct from memory, the two passionately devoured each other.","Ji Fei only watched for a few moments before a large hand covered her eyes.","[Well, I didn't want to watch anyway. But haven't these two forgotten that one has a boyfriend, and the other was just brazenly talking about marrying his manager? To put it nicely, this could be called rekindling old flames, unable to resist passion. To put it bluntly, it's...]","[By the way, what Sun Mo said must have been just to provoke people, right? Neither my Gossip System nor Gao Hao's gossip intelligence have heard anything about Pei Mingxuan and Sun Mo being a couple.]"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Men's mouths are really deceiving ghosts","paragraphs":["Ji Fei couldn't resist her curiosity and looked up the gossip about Sun Mo and Pei Mingxuan.","At that moment, voices came from the entrance.","Sun Mo and Xu Meng separated as if struck by lightning. Xu Meng hurriedly wiped her mouth, while Sun Mo's face turned ashen, as if he couldn't comprehend what he had just done.","\"What are you doing here? Sun Mo, this is the ladies' room!\" An obviously displeased voice rang out. It was Pei Mingxuan, who had limped over to find them.","Pei Mingxuan was dressed in a professional suit with short, neat hair. Her skin was pale, her lips light in color, and her refined features gave her the image of a capable career woman. However, as her gaze swept over the state of the two, her expression became dark and unreadable.","Sun Mo remained silent, his face sour as if he couldn't be bothered to explain.","\"Oh my, why are you two here together?\" Yang Hong's surprised voice came through as he also entered. He was tall, handsome, and sunny, like an 18-year-old college athlete. His build was even slightly larger than Sun Mo's, befitting his title as the campus heartthrob.","Yang Hong spoke in a concerned tone, \"Meng Meng, why are you crying?\"","[Now the drama is complete.] Ji Fei watched with great interest.","Qin Xian: ...So are we really having a meeting in the bathroom?","\"I... I'm fine, it's all a misunderstanding. I just accidentally fell, and I think Teacher Sun heard the commotion and came in to help me up,\" Xu Meng explained, casting a careful glance at Sun Mo.","Sun Mo stared straight at Yang Hong as he pulled Xu Meng into his arms, gently inquiring about her well-being and even affectionately kissing her forehead.","Sun Mo's eyes filled with murderous intent, but he was pulled back to reality by Pei Mingxuan, who tugged at him.","[Damn, this is intense.]","\"Alright, this isn't the place to talk. Let's go outside,\" Pei Mingxuan said, furrowing her brow as if she had a headache.","\"Right, right, let's go outside and continue discussing the performance and proposal,\" Yang Hong said, supporting Xu Meng as they walked out.","Sun Mo suddenly spoke coldly, \"Is that so? Why don't you ask Teacher Xu's opinion first? She doesn't seem very willing.\"","Xu Meng shuddered.","Pei Mingxuan was taken aback, looking at Sun Mo suspiciously. Did Sun Mo know how Xu Meng would answer?","[Well, they were just making out, after all.]","Yang Hong looked at the woman in his arms and said gently, \"Meng Meng, being a guest performer is also an opportunity for you. You should know that. Besides, didn't you say you were willing to marry me? I want to propose to you in front of the entire nation's audience. Isn't that good? Of course, if you say no now, I'll immediately drop the proposal.\"","Sun Mo's expression changed, and he glared at Xu Meng ominously.","Xu Meng kept her head down, looking as if she didn't dare to look up, appearing pitiful and unwilling to speak.","Yang Hong's eyes flickered. \"Well, if you don't...\"","\"I'm willing,\" Xu Meng quickly spoke up, though her voice lacked conviction and decisiveness, as if it were a reluctant decision. After speaking, she raised her head and cast a reproachful glance at Sun Mo.","\"That's great, I knew it,\" Yang Hong said happily. He looked up at Sun Mo, only to see Sun Mo's face ashen, his eyes fixed unblinkingly on Xu Meng like a predator eyeing its prey.","\"Brother Mo, there's no problem now, right?\"","Sun Mo coldly retorted, \"Hmph, Yang Hong, don't push your luck. This isn't your personal stage. We're a group, just partners. I'm not your stepping stone.\"","Pei Mingxuan breathed a sigh of relief. At least Sun Mo hadn't lost his head completely when it came to matters involving Xu Meng.","\"That's right, Teacher Yang. Whether it's having your girlfriend as a guest performer or proposing, it's all about your stage, your popularity. This way, our Sun Mo becomes merely your supporting act. This isn't appropriate. Even if the company demands it, we'll refuse to the end,\" Pei Mingxuan added.","Yang Hong looked helpless. \"I really don't intend to steal your spotlight. Both Mo and I are in a critical period of career transition. If we don't make good use of this opportunity, it'll be hard to develop better in the future. The top-tier group is so popular, if we don't do something noteworthy, we're afraid we'll be crushed with no chance to rise.\"","The logic made sense.","But what Pei Mingxuan worried about most was the possibility of Sun Mo's past relationship being dug up. That would mean Yang Hong reaping all the benefits while Sun Mo bore all the negative consequences.","Pei Mingxuan wasn't stupid. She naturally wanted to refuse outright to protect her artist's interests.","This was a professional matter, usually decided by Pei Mingxuan. But before she could speak, Sun Mo suddenly changed his tone, \"Letting you propose is out of the question. But I can agree to the guest performance. However, I should also do something to balance the publicity.\"","Xu Meng suddenly looked at Sun Mo, as if stung.","Sun Mo looked at Xu Meng, almost challengingly.","Yang Hong asked candidly, \"What do you want to do? We can discuss anything.\"","Sun Mo suddenly turned his head and looked tenderly at Pei Mingxuan.","Pei Mingxuan was startled and instinctively took a step back, only to be pulled into Sun Mo's embrace.","\"Actually, I've been planning to propose to Xuan soon. If we can use this stage, I'd also like to receive blessings from the entire nation's audience with Xuan,\" Sun Mo said passionately, his eyes seeming to be full of love.","But Pei Mingxuan's face darkened. She opened and closed her mouth several times, words tumbling back and forth on the tip of her tongue, but in the end, she said nothing.","[...Sister Pei must be cursing up a storm inside.]","Qin Xian: ? Doesn't Pei Mingxuan like Sun Mo?","\"You two are a couple? No wonder everyone says you're so well-behaved and never involved in publicity stunts. Perhaps you've had someone by your side all along, just completely underground,\" Yang Hong's tone finally became a bit unnatural, and he even loosened his hold on Xu Meng.","Pei Mingxuan seemed to finally be unable to hold back, \"Regarding this matter, we haven't discussed it yet. Why don't we talk about it first?\"","Yang Hong quickly regained his composure and led Xu Meng towards the exit, as if to give them space.","As the door closed, Pei Mingxuan immediately pushed Sun Mo away. \"Have you gone mad? What nonsense are you spouting?\"","Sun Mo seemed to come to his senses and suddenly said seriously to Pei Mingxuan, \"Xuan, let's be together.\"","\"What?\"","\"I said, let's be together. If Xu Meng performs on that stage, I'll propose to you and make it official publicly.\"","\"Wait, are you doing this just to spite Xu Meng? Don't tell me you still can't let go...\"","\"I can't let go, but it's not love, it's hate. I can never forgive her for the harm she caused me. I just want to find happiness before her, to prove that I'm doing better than her! Xuan, you've been by my side all these years, accompanying me through my lowest points. I know all of this. Although I've never expressed it, I care for you. I know only you can bring me happiness. Let's not waste any more time. Since we're changing our image anyway, why don't we just...\"","[Come on, your lips were just kissing someone else, and now you can say such things? Don't be too ridiculous! Men's words truly are lies?]","Qin Xian, still with his mouth covered: ...","As Sun Mo spoke, he raised his hand to embrace Pei Mingxuan, as if truly moved by emotion.","Sun Mo confessed deeply, \"Xuan, I love you.\"","Pei Mingxuan pushed Sun Mo away directly. \"Are you serious? You like me?\"","Sun Mo nodded firmly. \"I know you're a professional manager, and you're worried about ruining me, but I'm not afraid. I'm willing to face everything together with you.\"","Pei Mingxuan looked at him suspiciously for a long time before finally saying, \"You're drunk. Go back and sober up before we talk about this. As for the proposal, forget about it. Regarding the performance, I'll find a way to negotiate.\"","Still the calm and collected manager."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: That's not love, it's Sister Pei playing with chicken babies","paragraphs":["\"What do you mean? You don't believe in my sincerity?\" Sun Mo's face instantly turned cold, as if he had been insulted. \"I will only propose once. If you miss this chance, there won't be another.\"","Pei Mingxuan looked at Sun Mo in utter disbelief.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian noticed that Ji Fei, who was leaning against him, had been shaking uncontrollably since earlier, as if having a seizure.","Qin Xian glanced at her. Well, she was trying very hard to hold back her laughter. Her face was red from the effort, and if you looked closely, tears were about to fall from the corners of her eyes.","It made Qin Xian curious too. What could be so funny?","Unfortunately, the person in question was focused on laughing and didn't transmit any thoughts.","After a while, he seemed to hear Pei Mingxuan take a deep breath.","\"This transformation is crucial for us! You're causing relationship drama at a time like this—are you trying to lose a massive number of fans?\"","Hearing that Pei Mingxuan was still considering his career, Sun Mo's expression improved somewhat. He knew how much Pei Mingxuan loved him and figured she was probably too focused on his future to dare accept his proposal. This softened Sun Mo's heart, making him even more determined to marry Pei Mingxuan and give her a commitment.","After all, if Xu Meng had agreed to marry Yang Hong, why couldn't he marry Pei Mingxuan? Pei Mingxuan had sacrificed so much more for him than Xu Meng ever did.","He should marry the woman who was good to him, not that hateful woman...","Qin Xian noticed that Ji Fei in his arms was shaking even more violently now, causing both him and the door behind them to tremble slightly.","He was really worried that Ji Fei might suffocate from holding in her laughter.","\"Don't worry about that aspect. If I have to be so cautious about everything I do at my current level of fame, I might as well quit. Do you think I rely on fangirls? I rely on my work! Stop underestimating me all the time.\"","Pei Mingxuan's expression turned difficult for a moment, but she still forced herself to continue, \"Sun Mo, we've come so far with such difficulty. Give me one reason why you have to make your career more challenging.\"","But Sun Mo wouldn't listen to reason. \"What's wrong with getting married? Yang Hong can use it as a weapon, why can't I?\"","\"That's a double-edged sword. Even if they fail, he has the backing of his family's capital and can get work opportunities without relying on any fans. But we're not in that position. Even if we want to transform our image, we still need to rely on fans for support. This is the price idol-type actors have to pay for the benefits they enjoy. Moreover, their relationship is considered official, so they have some assurance. Otherwise, the company wouldn't have agreed.\"","At this point, Sun Mo couldn't bear to hear that he was inferior to Yang Hong, and his eyes instantly turned cold. But he knew that what Pei Mingxuan said made sense.","In the end, he said coldly, \"Fine, if you don't like it, I won't propose on stage. But I must beat Yang Hong.\"","Pei Mingxuan finally breathed a sigh of relief and said, \"If you want to win, then listen to my arrangements.\"","Sun Mo eventually stopped arguing, which was taken as tacit agreement. As Pei Mingxuan turned to leave, Sun Mo suddenly realized that she had twisted her ankle. Without waiting for her reaction, he stepped forward and picked her up in a princess carry.","Startled, Pei Mingxuan cried out, \"What are you doing?!\"","Sun Mo replied, \"Didn't you sprain your ankle? I'll carry you out.\"","\"Are you crazy? If someone sees...\"","It's unclear if Pei Mingxuan said anything else as the door closed, finally ending the bathroom meeting.","The black business car was filled with all seven members of the Qin family.","Having disappeared for so long, they naturally had to provide an explanation.","Ji Fei began to share the gossip she had consumed throughout the entire process. Of course, she could only share what had actually happened in reality.","So as soon as Ji Fei finished speaking, still holding back her laughter, they heard Qin Zhao say with a gloomy face, \"No wonder I saw that scene.\"","This sentence immediately piqued everyone's curiosity. \"What scene?\"","Qin Zhao's mouth twitched as he said, \"When I went to look for you guys just now, I saw Yang Hong holding Xu Meng in his arms and kissing her.\"","Although they were the official couple, somehow this sounded so awkward. Remembering what Ji Fei had just said about Xu Meng passionately kissing Sun Mo in the bathroom, and then immediately after...","[So they just went out and... used the same mouth for two people? Does Yang Hong know he's tasting Sun Mo's saliva?]","Hearing this, everyone didn't know whether to feel disgusted or sympathetic towards Yang Hong.","But Qin Zhao continued, \"And then Sun Mo walked by carrying Pei Mingxuan.\"","[Damn, the drama even had a sequel? If only I had followed them out immediately. It's all Qin Xian's fault, taking so long with his pants!]","The Qin family members who were waiting for Qin Zhao to spill the tea: !!!! What did they just hear?!!!","Blaming Qin Xian? Messing with pants?","Weren't you just eavesdropping in the bathroom?","Did you do something else?","Faced with everyone's fiery, inquisitive gazes, Qin Xian looked bewildered, as if he had been falsely accused.","[If his clothes weren't so expensive, I would have torn them off right there!]","The Qin family: Wait, stop, we don't want to hear anymore. This kind of intimate detail between you two as a couple is not something we should be privy to.","Qin Xian's face turned red.","Fortunately, in the next second, Ji Fei didn't keep them in suspense and directly revealed the truth.","[Wasted so much time untangling it, only to finally get the part caught on the doorknob free. Don't know how he managed to get it hooked there in the first place. It delayed my gossip-gathering time.]","The Qin family members withdrew their gazes: Clickbait, selling fake gossip, too much!","Qin Xian: ... It was all because she kept moving around at the time, causing him to shift as well...","Ji Fei, unaware that her momentary distraction had almost sparked an even bigger gossip frenzy, simply contained her disappointment and quickly asked Qin Zhao for more details about what happened next.","Qin Zhao coughed, \"There's not much else.\"","Just that when someone approached, Xu Meng hastily withdrew from Yang Hong's embrace, too embarrassed to look at anyone.","As for Sun Mo, he only paused briefly before resolutely carrying Pei Mingxuan past them.","Yang Hong even expressed concern.","Sun Mo just said, \"Xuan's foot hurts. I can't bear to let her walk.\" Then he was about to leave.","\"Oh, right, Pei Mingxuan seemed to want to struggle to get down, but Sun Mo just stopped for a moment, kissed her forehead, and said 'Be good, don't fuss.' Then he forcibly carried Pei Mingxuan out of the venue.\" After finishing, Qin Zhao shuddered, as if disturbed by the memory.","Everyone listening let out a sigh, lamenting what a self-destructive four-way relationship it was.","\"Yang Hong may be unlucky, but Sister Pei is even more unfortunate,\" said Qin Rong, who was quite familiar with Pei Mingxuan after becoming an assistant due to the previous gossip incident.","Recalling Ji Fei's earlier narration, everyone felt sorry for Pei Mingxuan.","\"This Sun Mo is really shameless, isn't he? He kisses his ex-girlfriend and then turns around to propose to another girl,\" Qin's Mom sighed.","\"Selfish bastard, betraying that girl's true feelings,\" Qin's Father scoffed.","\"He's just using Sister Pei as a tool,\" Qin Rong couldn't help but say. \"Sister Pei is really nice. She took good care of us assistants backstage before. Will she agree? Should we tell her the truth? I feel like she's a bit pitiful, being proposed to by someone she's been with for so many years just to provoke another woman.\"","Qin Yan frowned even more. She hated men like this the most and couldn't help but speculate, \"Maybe after marrying his manager, he'll still maintain an on-and-off relationship with his ex-girlfriend. He's just dragging an innocent woman into hell.\"","As they were talking, they noticed that Ji Fei hadn't expressed any opinion and couldn't help but look over at her. They saw that Ji Fei's expression was somewhat unnaturally stiff, as if she was holding her breath.","Soon they heard hysterical laughter.","[Hahaha, I can't hold it anymore. Why is everyone just like Sun Mo? They all think Pei Mingxuan likes him.]","The Qin family was shocked. What? She doesn't like him?","Qin Xian had pretty much guessed it earlier when he saw Ji Fei laughing like that.","[Does a manager's dedicated work for their artist, taking care of them in every aspect, treating them like an ancestor for many years, never leaving or abandoning them, automatically mean it's love?]","[If we disregard gender, then Brother Gao must be deeply in love with Qin Zhao too, hahaha.]","Qin Zhao almost choked, thoroughly frightened.","However, this shocking comparison also awakened everyone else.","Oh, right. A high-quality manager is exactly like Pei Mingxuan.","It's just because she's young, beautiful, and working with a male artist that people easily associate it with romance.","\"Ahem, I think Pei Mingxuan is just a professional manager, she probably doesn't like Sun Mo,\" Qin Zhao couldn't help but add.","Ji Fei's smiling eyes looked over. [Smart kid.]","[If Sun Mo had half your brains, I wouldn't have almost died laughing tonight.]","[He assumed Pei Mingxuan had always liked him, which is why she did so much for him. In the eyes of this narcissist, a woman who could devote herself so much to a man must be in love with him!]","[But is there a possibility that she simply loves the empire she built for herself? She doesn't see you as a man, she sees you as a son she's raising. She's just 'tiger parenting' you, okay? She just didn't expect you to turn out to be an ungrateful child!]"]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: This Rebellious Son is Quite Rebellious","paragraphs":["The words \"ungrateful son\" fell heavily.","The driver felt as if the car he was driving was shaking slightly, and for a moment, he worried if there was a safety issue with the vehicle.","Who could have imagined that it was the gossips in the back who were about to burst from holding in their laughter?","[He's a hopeless romantic himself, so he thinks everyone else is too? He actually believes that proposing marriage is a way of repaying kindness, something Pei Mingxuan has been dreaming of, which is why he's so upset when he's rejected.]","The Qin family: ... Pfft pfft pfft, hold it in, this ungrateful son is quite the rebel!","[The problem is that even when she's not responding, he still hasn't realized the issue. He still thinks Pei Mingxuan loves him too humbly, cares too much about his career, and doesn't dare to face the opportunity he's granting her to spend a lifetime together.]","The Qin family: Too humble? Puh-hahaha.","[What's even funnier is that he sincerely wants to get married. He feels he shouldn't be led around by the nose by Xu Meng anymore and should choose Pei Mingxuan, who loves him unconditionally. So even without a staged proposal, he's already assumed Pei Mingxuan is his fiancée.]","[Wait... does Pei Mingxuan know she's been forced to join their weird PLAY?]","The Qin family: Stop, stop, we're going to die laughing.","Everyone could no longer hold it in, afraid of laughing out loud, so they quickly spoke up to continue Qin Zhao's previous conversation, expressing doubts about the couple's relationship.","\"But what if Sister Pei believes it... won't she be deceived?\" Qin Rong worried, \"After all, it's a sincere confession from someone she's known for so many years.\"","\"She's so professional, maybe she can see through the problem,\" said Qin Yan.","[It's really not certain. I can only say it's a shame our Sister Pei doesn't have a god's-eye view, otherwise she would have slapped some sense into this lunatic long ago.]","[After all, seeing Sun Mo being ruthlessly betrayed and abandoned, suffering through it so painfully, then taking revenge on Xu Meng so many times, never actively contacting her for five years, constantly talking about hate - for someone as love-blind as Sister Pei, she probably wouldn't think that some people just have a masochistic nature.]","[She and Sun Mo do have deep feelings, so she's genuinely unsure if Sun Mo's confession is true or false.]","Hearing this, everyone immediately became worried for Pei Mingxuan. What if this shrewd girl softens her heart for a moment and gets tricked...","[But! She doesn't care about whether it's true or false at all. Sister Pei just wants Sun Mo to work for her obediently without causing any trouble.]","[So if he really likes her, she'd be relieved. It's within a controllable range, better than him still having lingering feelings for Xu Meng. It saves her from having to deal with troubles that could affect their future and having to think of ways to manage public relations.]","[Now is their critical period. She'd love to whip Sun Mo into properly preparing for the performance. Love or no love, marriage or no marriage, all of it needs to be put on hold. After everything is completed, then she can sort things out with him properly, to avoid stimulating him in the meantime and causing her trouble.]","Hearing this, Qin Xian suddenly spoke up, \"Pei Mingxuan is very professional, and her ambition is also very big, so she won't care about relationship issues. Moreover, this period of time is indeed the most critical moment.\"","\"Because of the transformation?\" Qin Zhao asked.","Qin Xian gave Qin Zhao a helpless look, \"Don't you pay attention to the industry news at all? Pei Mingxuan is leading Sun Mo in a bet against their company. She wants to become independent with Sun Mo. So now, she can't afford any setbacks.\"","Everyone suddenly realized why Pei Mingxuan didn't immediately clarify everything and wake Sun Mo up when he mentioned the proposal. It turns out she was using delaying tactics, afraid that the lunatic might act up and drop the ball at the crucial moment.","Everyone immediately felt relieved, but at the same time, why did they still want to laugh?","Logically speaking, Sun Mo should know what Pei Mingxuan is doing. It's clearly for the sake of his future, but now his mind is full of nothing but love.","\"Sister Pei... everything's good about her, except for her eyesight,\" Ji Fei couldn't help but quip.","Qin Zhao said, \"If we're really looking at it from a professional angle, Sun Mo is indeed a good seedling. Pei Mingxuan can indeed rely on him to take a risk. But...\"","Everyone: But who could have thought he'd be such a hopeless romantic?","Ji Fei: [Rely on a mountain and the mountain may fall, rely on a romantic and they won't last three seconds.]","After all, they were the opponents for the next PK, so Ji Fei felt it necessary to seriously gather intelligence, definitely not because she wanted to watch the drama unfold.","So for the next few days.","[Puh-hahaha, Sun Mo actually took the initiative to ask Sister Pei on a date, and Sister Pei took him to see the performance coach...]","[Sun Mo saw Yang Hong and Xu Meng going out together, so he went straight to Sister Pei's house that night, planning to stay there. As a result, Sister Pei made him drink several bottles of coffee and they spent the whole night studying script issues.]","[Even after all this, Sun Mo still thinks it's because Pei Mingxuan lacks confidence, fears that he's not sincere about her, so she doesn't dare to let herself fall for him!]","[The next morning, Sun Mo went to the company meeting with dark circles under his eyes. Someone joked about where he had been playing all night without rest. Sun Mo said he hadn't gone anywhere, he'd been at Mingxuan's house. Firstly, it was to get back at Yang Hong and Xu Meng for going out together, and secondly, it was to give Pei Mingxuan confidence. But which one is true and which is false in the depths of his heart, even the Gossip System couldn't give an answer. After all, the human heart is unfathomable.]","[However, with his antics, the previously clean and clear relationship between the two was instantly polluted. It led to the leader directly calling Sister Pei for a meeting. I guess on this day, Sister Pei's desire to beat the child reached its peak.]","[Damn! She actually held it in. My Sister Pei has stable emotions.]","And so, they swayed and stumbled along until the rehearsal day arrived.","Generally, before the live broadcast, the program team would provide a venue and performance coaches to help with rehearsals and communicate about the stage effects needed at the time.","They would also arrange some simple filming to capture the rehearsal process, which would later be broadcast as behind-the-scenes footage during the live stream transitions. However, this would all be communicated in advance, so everyone would present a purposeful side.","Whether it was working hard in rehearsals, showing group conflicts, or displaying tacit cooperation, it all depended on how they wanted to attract fans.","Under Gao Hao's pressure, Ji Fei was obediently rehearsing, unable to even spare attention for gossip.","But after a while, Qin Rong, who had come along as an assistant, ran over excitedly, \"There's a fight next door.\"","Ji Fei immediately switched from her half-dead state, \"Brother Gao, I need a break.\"","Gao Hao was about to say no, that he would go check it out, but then he saw not only Ji Fei, but even Qin Zhao casually strolling over with hands in pockets to join the commotion.","Gao Hao held his head in his hands. The group he was leading were all rebels!","Well, he might as well go take a look too.","There were long strip windows high on the walls of the rehearsal room, originally designed to facilitate filming angles, but now perfect for their gossip session.","In the identical white rehearsal room, two pairs faced off against each other.","Sun Mo and Xu Meng stood on one side, Sun Mo with a gloomy face, Xu Meng with red eyes, looking bewildered.","Pei Mingxuan's face was ashen as she glared angrily at the two. Yang Hong stood beside her, but his face was blocked, so his expression couldn't be seen.","Based on previous information, Sun Mo and Xu Meng should have been rehearsing, while Pei Mingxuan and Yang Hong were probably delayed by their own matters and had just arrived together.","Had they seen something?","As everyone was puzzling over this, they heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts directly gasp.","[Holy crap, while rehearsing the scene, they started making out, getting so lost in it that the other two walked in and saw them red-handed. This time there was no buffer, they literally saw it happening. In one word: Absolute!]","After hearing this, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong took a sharp breath. How dare they!","Only Gao Hao, who couldn't read minds, looked confusedly at the three people beside him who were suddenly shaking and holding their breath as if having a fit. He had a strange feeling of being left out, unable to make heads or tails of the situation."]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: Hugging, Kissing, and Denying It's Love but Hate","paragraphs":["When Sun Mo arrived, he found only Xu Meng there. As soon as Xu Meng saw him, she hurriedly tried to leave, as if not wanting to be alone with him in the same space.","Feeling provoked, Sun Mo grabbed Xu Meng's arm as she passed by and coldly questioned her, \"Why are you running away? Aren't you here for rehearsal?\"","\"I... I... I don't think it's appropriate for us to be alone together right now. I have a boyfriend, and don't you have a fiancée?\" Xu Meng said with downcast eyes, trying to break free, but her eyes involuntarily turned red.","She looked like she was struggling to hold back her sadness.","Sun Mo felt a wave of emotion, as if he couldn't breathe.","\"You're right, I have a fiancée, and I love her very much. She's been with me for years and is a loyal woman. We'll get married after this show is over, so don't be so full of yourself. Do you really think something would happen if we're alone together?\" Sun Mo said firmly.","Xu Meng trembled and fell silent.","\"The condition for you to assist in this performance is that I'm the male lead on stage, so you're all just supporting my act. I don't want you to interfere with my work! Or is it that you can't stand it because you abandoned me back then, but now you have to work with me?\"","Xu Meng suddenly looked up at Sun Mo, tears falling down her face.","Sun Mo's gaze darkened, but he acted as if he hadn't seen Xu Meng crying. \"Stay. Let's rehearse properly!\"","Xu Meng was forcefully made to stay by Sun Mo, compelled to start rehearsing.","Ji Fei was flipping through gossip, enjoying the drama.","[How provocative! This move is too provocative. Sun Mo, do you dare say you didn't do this on purpose? Out of so many scenes, you just happened to choose one with a kiss that needs rehearsing? And it's a scene where Xu Meng has to take the initiative to confess and ask for a kiss. Sun Mo thinks he's humiliating Xu Meng, but you're really just making excuses to seek benefits, even fooling yourself.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Haha, the real intention is not what it seems!","[I dare you not to forcefully embrace and kiss her later, just because Xu Meng's hesitation and reluctance stimulated you? Is she a walking spring, just happening to make you, an animal with an underdeveloped brain, go into heat?]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Shameless, vulgar, brazen.","[This is exactly like those toxic love dramas where the male lead has shit for brains, hugging and kissing while claiming it's not love but hate. Your hate is quite unique, insisting on making trouble when it's really just flirting. Although I don't know how these two will end up, I feel sorry for Yang Hong and Pei Mingxuan.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong nodded in agreement: Indeed, one's head is glowing green, and the other is forced to be a tool for added scenes. They really think they're the lead couple, and others are just cannon fodder on their path to love?","Inside, Pei Mingxuan was already shaking with anger, especially after hearing Sun Mo's high-sounding reasons. She was almost laughing from anger.","Even for a formal live broadcast, this kind of stage performance only needs to be simulated. Who rehearses like this seriously?","\"Rehearsal? Sun Mo, do you know where we are?\" Pei Mingxuan's bright eyes stared intently at Sun Mo.","[A public place with people coming and going, full of gossip. But for a man with his mind in the gutter, anywhere and anytime is fine. He doesn't have the extra brain capacity to think about how much trouble this could cause.]","Sure enough, Sun Mo showed impatience, \"I'll say it again, it's just a rehearsal.\"","\"But netizens won't accept such an explanation. If someone happened to film what just occurred and deliberately spread it, the headline 'Sun Mo Takes Advantage of Someone Else's Girlfriend Under the Guise of Filming' would dominate the hot search.\"","Sun Mo was instantly stung by the sarcasm and became angry from embarrassment, \"Enough! This is endless. Don't be jealous out of context, like a shrew.\"","Pei Mingxuan was stunned by his words.","The onlookers outside: !!!!","[Hahaha, what is he thinking? It's the most reasonable assumption, yet he thinks Pei is just being jealous and saying it on purpose. I bet Pei's blood pressure is skyrocketing right now, and she probably feels the humiliation of being slandered.]","Pei Mingxuan seemed to come back to her senses from the shock, pointing at herself incredulously, \"I'm jealous? Like a shrew? Sun Mo, do you dare say that again?\"","[Oh ho, Pei can't hold her temper anymore.]","Sun Mo was taken aback. It was the first time Pei Mingxuan had been so disrespectful to him in front of others. Originally feeling a bit guilty, he now became righteous, \"I've already explained. Don't make trouble out of nothing.\"","In his mind, Pei Mingxuan was only furious because he kissed Xu Meng. After all, he had already made promises to Pei Mingxuan, which in a way gave her the right to be angry.","But he didn't like Pei Mingxuan acting like she was in charge, so after speaking, he turned to leave in a huff.","\"Stop right there, Sun Mo!\" Pei Mingxuan shouted angrily. He caused trouble and was just going to walk away?","Surprisingly, the one who tried to calm her down was Yang Hong.","\"Sister Pei, don't be angry. This really is in the script. They probably just got too into character just now, so...\"","The onlookers looked at Yang Hong differently now. What kind of modern-day cuckold was this? Actually making excuses for the man who took advantage of his own girlfriend.","Even Sun Mo was a bit confused as he looked at Yang Hong.","Yang Hong smiled generously at Sun Mo and said, \"Don't worry, Brother Mo. I don't misunderstand.\"","At this point, even Xu Meng, who had been acting pitiful the whole time, forgot to manage her expression.","Pei Mingxuan looked at Yang Hong in disbelief, but as she kept looking, she suddenly had a realization. \"Wait, script? Your script doesn't have any romantic scenes.\"","[As expected of Sister Pei, even faced with such an infuriating scene, she still spotted the blind spot.]","The theme of their PK this time was faith.","Pei Mingxuan hoped for peaceful development, so she had openly communicated with Gao Hao to ensure both groups had different themes. She didn't want her group to face the embarrassment of being mocked and crushed in all aspects like the celebrity group last time.","Moreover, Pei Mingxuan had considered a lot for Sun Mo's sake. To connect with his future career transformation direction, she had chosen a patriotic theme, portraying a hero with faith in the country. Yang Hong was playing the antagonist, and Xu Meng was a related victim. There were no romantic scenes between the three of them throughout.","Pei Mingxuan had been too angry to think clearly, but now she realized - where did this kiss scene come from?","\"Added scenes?\" Qin Zhao whispered questioningly.","\"Adding this kind of scene?\" Qin Rong asked in shock.","\"Maybe it wasn't added at all, just an excuse,\" Gao Hao said disdainfully.","Ji Fei clicked her tongue twice, [It's not added scenes, the whole script has been changed.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were shocked. Changing the script wasn't a big deal, but how could the manager not know about it?","At this moment, Pei Mingxuan inside also finally realized they weren't performing the original script at all.","Even from a distance, one could feel that Pei Mingxuan was just one step away from erupting like a volcano.","\"You have the final say on the script. Did you decide to change it?\" Pei Mingxuan asked Sun Mo through gritted teeth.","Sun Mo probably finally understood what it meant to feel guilty. Avoiding Pei Mingxuan's gaze, he said, \"I thought this one was better.\"","Pei Mingxuan laughed, \"Behind my back, you discarded the script I carefully selected for you and replaced it with a celebrity love triangle. So you're not planning on transforming your career anymore?\""]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: No highest peak, only higher peaks","paragraphs":["Sun Mo, feeling a bit embarrassed by the question, said, \"I just thought we could first use my area of expertise to attract some attention, and then for the later PK...\"","\"Sun Mo, do you think I'm an idiot? All your fans know you're here to transform your image. Do you think you need to rely on this to attract attention?\" Pei Mingxuan scolded harshly. \"Everyone is waiting for this show to see your transformation, not for you to rest on your laurels!\"","Sun Mo's face immediately turned from red to pale. \"But on this kind of stage, it's very disadvantageous not to perform emotional scenes. Our script also fits the theme. Just this once...\"","Originally, Pei Mingxuan wasn't entirely sure about the situation between Sun Mo and Xu Meng, but now she was 100% certain.","This was clearly something Sun Mo had concocted out of his personal feelings for Xu Meng.","\"Every opportunity is so precious right now. Are you willing to sacrifice your future and your fans' expectations for your childishness?\" Pei Mingxuan angrily rebuked. \"Change it back!\"","Sun Mo didn't want to be scolded like a child in front of Xu Meng.","\"Enough. It's my stage, I decide. You don't need to say anything more. I won't change it.\"","It's worth noting that for Sun Mo's transformation, countless fans had been providing both spiritual and material support day and night. They were afraid that the person they supported would be mocked for having no real ability and only being able to play emotionless immortal lords. They believed in Sun Mo's abilities, thinking it was just the market that didn't allow him to show his full potential.","So Sun Mo's fans were very supportive and expectant of his transformation. They had even been laying the groundwork for him online early on. What if his performance wasn't what people were used to and he got criticized? What if the transformation failed? Everyone was racking their brains for Sun Mo, carefully protecting their shared dream.","But in the blink of an eye, what appeared on the livestream was once again an emotionless immortal lord. How were the fans supposed to feel about this?","Pei Mingxuan was almost speechless with anger. She had clearly arranged a smooth path for Sun Mo, but he insisted on diving into a ditch. Pei Mingxuan felt as if she was seeing Sun Mo for the first time.","In the past, he would fight for every role even with a high fever, seriously treat every script, saying that his work belonged to both him and his fans.","But now...","[Sun Mo is now completely a ticking time bomb, and a lovesick one at that. It must be tough for Sister Pei.]","Perhaps overwhelmed by the series of events, even the most capable manager couldn't handle it. In the end, Pei Mingxuan left with a gloomy face.","The Gossip Group immediately retreated. They didn't see what happened next.","However, with Ji Fei there, Qin Zhao and Qin Rong still knew the situation.","[Sun Mo left too? Well, he probably couldn't face Cuckold Brother Yang Hong. After all, even if it was a new script with emotional scenes, there's no reason to hug and kiss like that. Xu Meng was left alone to explain.]","[Xu Meng must be feeling guilty too. After all, in such a public place, if she wanted to avoid that kind of situation, it would have been easy. Saying she was caught up in the role simply doesn't hold water. On the surface, she acts like she's always being forced, as if she's never in control, but in reality, she's indulging in this push and pull.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong both felt that Yang Hong's earlier talk about getting caught up in the role was just giving them a way out, not wanting to make a scene on the spot and affect their cooperation.","But when alone with Xu Meng, he was probably going to confront her.","After all, who could tolerate their girlfriend being ambiguous with an ex-boyfriend? Just as they were curious about what Yang Hong would do, they heard a sharp exclamation in Ji Fei's mind.","[Oh my... He didn't even ask for an explanation, just pulled her over and started kissing her? What's going on? There's no honey in Xu Meng's mouth, just the saliva of her ex! Can a man's possessiveness really reach this level? Doesn't he find it disgusting?]","Not just Ji Fei, even Qin Zhao and Qin Rong wanted to scream.","[Does he really love Xu Meng that much? Wait! He really doesn't find it disgusting. After the kiss, he even praised her by patting her face, saying she's really sweet, no wonder Brother Mo likes her. Thanks, I'm disgusted again.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Is this guy really normal?","[Xu Meng was stunned, thinking Yang Hong was criticizing her in a roundabout way. She quickly apologized, with tears in her eyes, emphasizing her position as a victim. But Yang Hong truly wasn't angry, saying he understood Brother Mo's inability to control himself.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: Oh my god! No, is this something a boyfriend should say?","[Indeed, there's no limit to craziness. You're not just a cuckold, you're truly insane. What is this guy thinking? He must have some purpose, let me check.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong also curiously perked up their ears.","[Strange... I can't find anything... Oh my, what kind of gossip is this? Damn! I was too focused on the love triangle before and didn't notice. It turns out Yang Hong is Sun Mo's secret fan.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: What?!","[No one else knows, but he has a room in his villa filled with things endorsed by Sun Mo, collecting everything related to Sun Mo. He's a die-hard fan. No wonder he's so nice to Sun Mo despite his rude behavior.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: That's not right. Even if he's a fan, he can't let his idol cuckold him.","[Wait, something seems off here.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: It's way off. It feels like things have gone in a strange direction.","Ji Fei suddenly felt a chill, remembering the small group of CP fans that suddenly appeared online after filming the promotional video.","[No... it can't be.]","[If it is... that would be too explosive!]","Ji Fei's mischievous smile spread, enjoying the drama.","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong: It's not just explosive, it's... unimaginable.","After that, whenever Qin Zhao saw the three of them rehearsing together, he felt uncomfortable. He couldn't help but ask Gao Hao, \"Do you think Yang Hong is gay?\"","Gao Hao replied, puzzled, \"I don't think so. There are no rumors in the industry, and he's quite the playboy, always dating beautiful women. However...\"","\"However what?\" Qin Zhao immediately asked curiously.","\"I don't know if it's a coincidence, but apart from his current girlfriend being Sun Mo's ex, I've noticed an additional pattern. All his other ex-girlfriends have acted with Sun Mo before.\"","Qin Zhao was shocked. He really was collecting everything related to Sun Mo.","Was this fan behavior or did he have other motives?","Soon, because another group's PK livestream was about to start, they were gathered in the waiting area.","Ji Fei and Qin Zhao couldn't help but glance at Sun Mo and Yang Hong sitting together.","Yang Hong was whispering and laughing with Sun Mo, as if his girlfriend being kissed earlier had no impact at all.","The PK of the other group, because there wasn't much gossip, everyone performed steadily. The viewership was almost half of the previous episode. The director and producer were a bit disappointed. Although that face-to-face scene was shocking, after experiencing that kind of popularity, who would be satisfied with this mediocrity?","After the livestream, they went backstage to meet with their managers and assistants.","Ji Fei saw Pei Mingxuan chatting happily with Gao Hao. Although she lost her composure last time, a professional manager would still do professional things, like building good relationships with their group. She was inviting them to dinner.","\"I want to apologize to you two. This time it was our fault. We originally agreed to perform a modern drama, but unexpectedly, the coordination wasn't good, so we changed to a immortal-human romance, which clashed with your theme.\"","\"It's not really a clash, it's not the same style,\" Qin Zhao said indifferently.","But Pei Mingxuan smiled and said, \"Although that's true, we still feel very sorry. So please do us the honor of accepting our invitation.\"","Their script wasn't changed back in the end, but Pei Mingxuan still had to clean up the mess. She had to smile at them and also prepare the fans.","[Poor Sister Pei, she has no choice. After all, they're all in the same boat now. Even though she's discovered that the other party has started to rot and stink, she can only help mediate, trying to prop up a mud wall.]","Just as they were talking, Sun Mo and Yang Hong arrived. Yang Hong immediately said with a smile, \"Can I bring my girlfriend along?\"","Usually, when two groups have dinner together, they don't bring supporting actors, as it's social interaction between the PK groups.","Not to mention that during this period of rehearsal, Pei Mingxuan had been keeping an eye on Sun Mo, not wanting him to have private contact with Xu Meng again to avoid any more incidents. So when she heard this, her face immediately darkened.","As for Ji Fei and the others, they naturally preferred gossip to dinner and didn't mind at all. They just couldn't figure out what Yang Hong was up to."]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Do You Have to Be So Flippant","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan didn't maintain a sour face the entire time due to Xu Meng's intrusion. Once seated in the private room, she was already orchestrating a harmonious atmosphere like a master conductor.","Ji Fei and the others, however, were treated to quite a show as soon as they arrived.","When Yang Hong went to escort Xu Meng, only two seats remained in the private room, conveniently located between Yang Hong's agent and Sun Mo.","Although there was ample space between the seats, logically, Xu Meng should have sat next to Yang Hong's agent to avoid suspicion, allowing Yang Hong to sit next to Sun Mo.","But when Yang Hong brought her in, as they were circling to the empty seats, Xu Meng paused for a moment just as she was passing Sun Mo.","Sun Mo was expressionlessly playing with his phone, his brows slightly furrowed. The next second, as Xu Meng lifted her foot to walk, she stumbled over the chair leg and fell into the seat next to Sun Mo.","Xu Meng frantically tried to stand up, looking quite disheveled. In the end, it was Yang Hong who steadied her, saying, \"Just sit here. Did you hurt yourself?\"","\"I'm fine,\" Xu Meng replied gently to Yang Hong, while timidly lifting her head to quickly glance at Sun Mo. Her expression was one of great difficulty and hesitation.","Sun Mo showed no reaction throughout, but Pei Mingxuan's expression was barely holding together.","In fact, Yang Hong's agent's face was quite a sight too. Probably knowing some inside information, he looked at Xu Meng askance, seemingly very displeased with her.","As for the three spectators across from them - Ji Fei, Qin Zhao, and Gao Hao - their expressions nearly cracked.","[This works too?! It's brilliant, truly brilliant, juggling an ex and a current partner at the same time. Indeed, triangles are the most stable shape.]","Qin Zhao: What triangle? A perverted triangle?","Even Gao Hao felt that coming to eat and socialize wasn't as interesting as watching this drama up close, especially since these troublemakers were under other agents' management. Just thinking about it made him happy, hehe.","Getting to the point,","Pei Mingxuan raised her glass with a smile and began, \"For the next scene, I hope both teachers will go easy on us.\"","Everyone raised their glasses. Gao Hao fake-smiled and said, \"It's you who should go easy on us.\"","Yang Hong's agent laughed, \"Brother Gao is being overly modest. We just hope not to end up as badly as the previous group.\"","\"That was an unexpected situation. Actually, we have quite a few issues on our side. After all, we have an acting novice, a complete newcomer. We'll need everyone's guidance and care in the future,\" Gao Hao said, then elbowed Ji Fei, who was gnawing on a lamb leg.","Ji Fei finally reacted and raised her glass. No one thought her impolite, as everyone knew she had the backing of Qin Corporation.","Looking at Qin Zhao next to her, who was handing her a napkin as she had dirtied her chin, his habitual care showed Ji Fei's extraordinary status.","Pei Mingxuan smiled and said, \"Brother Gao really has a good eye, nurturing such a powerful newcomer in one go.\"","Pei Mingxuan smiled at Ji Fei and said, \"Teacher Ji not only has a good personality but also shows such potential in acting. It's just a pity you entered the circle so late, otherwise you would have been famous long ago. But even now, you've become an overnight sensation. You're probably the fastest rising newcomer since this show began airing.\"","Regardless of what Pei Mingxuan truly thought, at least when she spoke, she sounded very sincere, her praise not at all fake.","Ji Fei smiled at her, \"Thank you for your kind words, Sister Pei.\"","Pei Mingxuan breathed a sigh of relief, originally worried that Ji Fei might be difficult to get along with, but unexpectedly found her quite amiable.","At the table, the agents were chatting enthusiastically. Yang Hong could exchange a few words with Qin Zhao, and Xu Meng tried to make conversation with Ji Fei. Only Sun Mo barely spoke throughout.","He seemed uncomfortable in social situations.","Even Qin Zhao performed better than him, which seemed odd.","Then Ji Fei's inner thoughts were heard: [I see, for the past few years, Pei Mingxuan has been responsible for all social occasions. Under her mediation, Sun Mo has been able to focus entirely on filming and fan interactions, without having to worry about anything else. No wonder he looks so awkward now.]","Qin Zhao was somewhat surprised. So Pei Mingxuan was that capable. No wonder his second brother and Gao Hao were both interested in poaching her.","It's well known that in the entertainment industry, half acting skills and half interpersonal skills make a big star. Someone like him had a background, and Gao Hao never required him to socialize. For a grassroots actor like Sun Mo to be protected so well, Pei Mingxuan must have put in a lot of effort.","[It's really like a mother who works hard to raise her son, and a son who doesn't understand his mother and is always rebellious.]","Qin Zhao almost choked on his drink. Looking at Pei Mingxuan across the table, who was enthusiastically hosting, and then at Sun Mo beside her, who was absorbed in his own world with a sour face, as if everyone was causing him displeasure, it really did feel like... a mother bringing her son to an adult gathering.","[But this isn't really a social occasion, it's more like a dinner gathering, right? Is he really just pretending because of Xu Meng?]","They watched for a while and noticed that whenever Yang Hong served food to Xu Meng, Sun Mo would suddenly spring into action and serve food to Pei Mingxuan.","[Good heavens, he's using Sister Pei as a tool again, deliberately acting lovey-dovey in front of Xu Meng? Your acting is too fake, afraid Xu Meng won't realize you're deliberately performing for her to make her care?]","Qin Zhao sneered. Sure enough, it was one for Yang Hong, one for Sun Mo, a one-to-one confrontation.","And Pei Mingxuan ignored him the whole time, not eating any of the food he served her.","[Sister Pei sees through everything and has politely declined to participate in this play, haha.]","Just as they were enjoying the show, they saw Sun Mo suddenly reach out and take away the scallop that Xu Meng had picked up with her serving tongs.","\"Ah!\" Xu Meng seemed startled and let out a small cry.","This finally caught everyone's attention, with various expressions on their faces.","Pei Mingxuan wanted to pretend nothing had happened, but the suddenly quiet and strange atmosphere made it difficult to smooth over. She could only force a smile and say, \"What's wrong?\"","Sun Mo seemed dazed for a moment, then directly threw the scallop into the container for leftovers.","[He's not eating it himself but snatches it away? Wasting food is shameful!]","Yang Hong, however, smiled at the embarrassed Xu Meng and said, \"Silly girl, how did you forget again? You're allergic to scallops.\"","[Pft, is this explanation really better than no explanation?]","Xu Meng, however, seemed to suddenly remember. She glanced awkwardly at Sun Mo again and said softly, \"Thank you.\"","In the end, no one was tactless enough to pursue the matter further on the spot.","But not long after, the two of them stirred up trouble again.","It was the sharp-eyed gossip enthusiast Ji Fei who noticed.","[Hiss, hiss, one with the left hand down, one with the right hand down, and they've been like that for so long? My radar is going off.]","Qin Zhao: What, what?","Then they saw Ji Fei pretend to drop her chopsticks and bend down to pick them up.","The two across from them were each lost in their own thoughts, heads lowered and eyes downcast, completely unaware of Ji Fei's little act.","The next second, Qin Zhao saw Ji Fei's body trembling, and heard her excited inner scream.","[Hahaha, I knew it! Under the layers of tablecloth, I'm paired with her, and you're paired with him, but I'm only holding your hand. How can you two be so brazen!]","Qin Zhao: How dare they!!!","[Sun Mo is forcefully grabbing, no mistake, but Xu Meng, why aren't you struggling? Is that all the strength you can muster?]","[How come when he pries open your hand, you just let him?]","[How come your fingers are now tightly interlocked? The force of it, one might describe it as: all the powers of heaven and earth couldn't separate you.]","Qin Zhao: ...Neither of them is any good!","[Do they think this is some heart-fluttering behavior?]","[Huh? No, wait, when I used to watch TV and read novels, if the male and female leads did this... Damn! What was wrong with my values back then? Was I corrupted?]","Qin Zhao: ...Have I acted in scenes like this before? Ah, ah, ah, dark history, absolute dark history!","[If I accidentally knock over the table now, or pull off the tablecloth, letting everyone see, it would be super exciting, right?]","[What should I do? I really want to do it! But we're not that close, it seems a bit...]","Qin Zhao's lips curled into a smile. Why bother with all that trouble?"]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: Master of Verbal Combat: Pei Jie","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Qin Zhao stood up abruptly and addressed Xu Meng and her two companions, \"I'd like to propose a toast to the three of you. Here's to an exciting competition.\"","Without waiting for their response, Qin Zhao quickly downed his drink.","In this situation, the others had to react swiftly, or they'd risk appearing disrespectful to Qin Zhao.","Yang Hong immediately stood up, raising his glass.","However, the other two were still caught off guard. When they finally realized what was happening, they scrambled to their feet, almost pulling each other over in their haste. They were clearly flustered.","Already feeling guilty, they were now fumbling to disentangle their tightly interlocked fingers. Even without directly witnessing it, the awkward angle of their arms and their panicked postures made it clear to everyone, even Gao Hao across the table, what they had been up to. His lips twitched in response.","[Hahaha, Qin Zhao, you're such a timely rainmaker.]","Qin Zhao observed the chaotic atmosphere across the table, his smile widening.","[Look, even Yang Hong was taken aback for a moment. I guess even a cuckold wouldn't expect them to be so brazen right under his nose.]","Qin Zhao glanced at Yang Hong, noticing a flash of jealous hatred in his eyes, though it wasn't clear towards whom. But Yang Hong quickly composed himself.","[Poor Sister Pei is the most pitiful. Despite all her precautions, she couldn't prevent this. Having outsiders witness such a scene, her brain must be on the verge of overheating.]","Qin Zhao thought: It's hard being a person, harder being a woman, and even harder being Sun Mo's female manager.","[Gaga, Sun Mo's face has turned ashen, and Xu Meng's has gone pale. Still enjoy the thrill-seeking? Regretting it now, aren't you? Sun Mo, listen to your mother's advice: don't date unsuitable people too early, it affects your future~]","Qin Zhao: Gaga.","Gao Hao felt the two people next to him shaking with suppressed laughter. Not wanting to be too disrespectful, he forced a smile and pretended nothing had happened, saying, \"Qin Zhao, you drank too quickly. They didn't even have time to clink glasses with you. And aren't you going to include Ji Fei?\"","Qin Zhao, shoulders still trembling, picked up his glass again. \"My mistake.\"","Ji Fei also stood up, taking her glass, her voice slightly off as she said, \"Let's all... together...\"","Finally, Sun Mo and Xu Meng stood up across the table, the word 'awkward' practically written on their faces, and raised their glasses.","Not long after sitting down, Pei Mingxuan couldn't bear it anymore. She found an excuse to choose some wine and called Sun Mo to go with her.","Knowing that Pei Mingxuan was definitely going to scold Sun Mo, and although they were curious to see Sun Mo in trouble, they didn't know where the two had gone. It wouldn't be appropriate to follow, so they could only wait for the system to update later to get the gossip.","A little while later, Ji Fei went out to use the restroom. Just as she was coming out, she saw Xu Meng skulking suspiciously in the corridor.","Ji Fei immediately sensed there was gossip to be had and couldn't resist following.","Trailing Xu Meng's footsteps, she arrived near the balcony at the end of the corridor. She watched as Xu Meng hid behind a large potted plant by the balcony door.","Soon, Sun Mo and Pei Mingxuan's voices could be heard. Ji Fei decided to hide in an empty private room to eavesdrop.","\"...Sun Mo, I don't want to waste more words on you. If you want to deceive yourself, I can't be bothered to care. But if you continue to mix personal and professional matters, getting aroused all over the place, causing incidents, and generating negative publicity, ruining this transition, I'll be very disappointed in you.\"","\"What kind of talk is this?!\"","\"It's plain talk. What? Can't understand plain language now? Do we need to discuss again what you two were doing downstairs just now? Right in front of her boyfriend's face, I didn't know your morals had sunk so low!\"","\"She's my...\"","\"Ex-girlfriend! Ex-girlfriend! Is your brain filled with water?! Do you dare to post what you did online and let others judge if you're justified?!\"","\"Pei Mingxuan, that's enough. Whose side are you on anyway?! What happened just now was merely an accident.\"","\"Shut up!\"","Pei Mingxuan's tone was downright ferocious. She had clearly been provoked to the point of madness.","But Sun Mo, fearless of death, chuckled lightly and said, \"What right do you have to lecture me? When it comes to mixing personal and professional matters, aren't you just as guilty?\"","\"What did you say?!\"","\"The matter of changing the script, since it was already agreed upon, why are you still interfering? These past few days, constantly altering our scenes, what's that about? Isn't it just...\"","\"What, if we don't change the script, you get to spend half of each scene hugging and kissing Xu Meng? Have you no shame?\"","\"That's what the plot requires! Without it, there's no meaning to the idea of love being the highest faith for each other.\"","\"A professional actor can convey undying love with just a look. What, do you have to suck face until saliva is dripping to show that you love each other to the point of mutual faith?! How come I never saw you insist like this when filming TV shows before?!\"","\"Who said we needed to do that?!\"","\"Oh really? If I hadn't stopped you, isn't that exactly what you were planning to do?\"","Ji Fei almost couldn't hold back her laughter.","[Sister Pei has really tried her best, but it's hard to talk sense into someone who's beyond reason!]","[To think this guy has played so many cold, celestial lords and tragic, devoted male leads, fooling a bunch of young fangirls. If his fans knew he was using his career for personal desires, they'd probably be devastated. I really feel sorry for his fans.]","[If the live stage was suitable for such intimate scripts, those top-tier actor couples would have done it long ago.]","Sun Mo remained silent for a long time.","Ji Fei could imagine Sun Mo, speechless after being scolded, probably with a red face from frustration.","Finally, Pei Mingxuan sighed and said, \"Sun Mo, I've been managing you since your debut. We've been through the toughest times together. Can you be honest with me for once? What exactly do you want? Do you really want to be with Xu Meng?\"","Sun Mo reflexively replied, \"How is that possible? She abandoned me, I hate her. I... I like you now, I only want to have a family with you.\"","\"Heh, Sun Mo, you're really something. How can you say such...\"","[Shameless words?]","At this moment, Ji Fei suddenly saw Xu Meng, who had been eavesdropping all along, take out her phone and press a few buttons, then bump into the door. The conversation on the balcony was interrupted.","Xu Meng then appeared, feigning panic and stammering, \"I'm... I'm sorry, I didn't mean to... I just saw you here and heard you mention my name. I thought...\"","Her eyes quickly turned red, tears streaming down her face, \"I'm sorry... Sister Pei, there's really nothing between Sun Mo and me. You heard it too, he hates me and loves you. Please don't misunderstand us, and don't fight with Sun Mo. I hope you two can be happy together. If you really dislike me that much, I can withdraw from this performance.\"","Sun Mo froze instantly. \"You... I didn't ask you to withdraw.\"","He then looked at Pei Mingxuan, his face showing undisguised dissatisfaction, as if blaming her for causing such a scene.","Pei Mingxuan was so angry she laughed, \"I've been scolding Sun Mo this whole time. When did I ever say I disliked you? Please, Miss Xu, don't add your own drama to this, okay?\"","[Pfft! Sister Pei is not giving face to anyone now. The little white flower just ran straight into the line of fire.]","Probably not expecting to be rebuked like this, Xu Meng was stunned. Sun Mo immediately snapped in displeasure, \"Pei Mingxuan!\"","But Pei Mingxuan retorted, \"What, calling my soul? I can hear you just fine. It's you two whose ears are deaf, only believing what you want to hear, indulging in your own fantasies and self-pity.\"","\"I see you're getting more and more unruly, and your brain seems to have gone bad along with it. I'm tired of maintaining this facade. It can't get any worse anyway.\"","Ji Fei suddenly got excited. [Is she going to... Oh ho!]","\"Sun Mo, where on earth did you get the confidence that I like you? Have I ever told you even once that I like you? Or have I ever shown any behavior of secretly getting close to you? In my eyes, you're just an artist under my management. Not only have I never had feelings for you, if you continue being this abnormal, I'm going to lose all hope in you!\"","[Hahaha, I'd love to see Sun Mo's expression right now. It must be priceless.]","Indeed, Sun Mo's expression was quite a sight. He was completely dumbfounded.","Xu Meng, however, reacted quickly. She immediately said, \"Sister Pei, it's all my fault. Don't say such angry words because of me. You've stood by Sun Mo for so many years, always staying single. You're willing to sacrifice everything for him, everyone can see that. You're the one who deserves Sun Mo's lifelong care. How could he ever let you down?\"","Hearing this, Sun Mo seemed to catch his breath. But Pei Mingxuan was not one to be easily fooled.","\"I didn't say anything about you, yet you're so eager to react? Have you been acting so much that you need to play the role of a devoted second female lead to complement yourself? Even if I'm not that, you have to shape me into that image, then pretend to be magnanimous and push the male lead towards me. Does that give you a sense of accomplishment?\"","\"I'm just his manager, that's all. If you like him, be more straightforward about it. Why put on this act of suffering for love? Who are you performing for? There's no one here to appreciate your performance except the foolish male lead. Or is he the only audience you want?\"","\"Does it feel good to be fought over by men, to be the center of attention? Are you satisfied feeling that your ex-boyfriend can't forget you? Your heart must be swelling with pride, feeling oh so pleased with yourself.\"","\"Or is it that you're not sure who's the best choice right now? Yang Hong doesn't seem like someone to have a stable life with, while Sun Mo might have a promising future and has been pining for you for years. It is indeed a difficult choice, so you're keeping both options open?\"","[I feel like I've just had an epiphany. This is absolutely spot-on.]","[Bravo, sister Pei! What a verbal powerhouse!]"]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: Sun Mo, are you shameless or what","paragraphs":["Pei Mingxuan's barrage of words left the two of them completely stunned.","Xu Meng momentarily forgot her pitiful facade, her expression twisting. But she quickly regained her composure, whimpering, \"I know you never liked me before, Pei, but you...\"","\"Pei Mingxuan, how did you become like this? I don't even recognize you anymore,\" Sun Mo said in shock.","\"Maybe because you're blind,\" Pei Mingxuan sneered, then pointed at Xu Meng and began recounting past events to Sun Mo.","\"Have you forgotten? You once had a chance to become an overnight sensation in the film industry. I agreed to be your manager because I saw that you could be the male lead in that movie. But what did you do? For the sake of this idiot, you missed the best opportunity, making your path to fame so much harder for all those years.\"","Upon hearing this, Sun Mo's expression changed drastically.","A flicker of panic crossed Xu Meng's face.","In the distance, Ji Fei quickly added some context.","[Oh, I see. Back then, there was an award-winning film that held open auditions for new actors. Sun Mo, with his young, handsome face, natural acting skills, and tireless work ethic, successfully made it to the final round of male lead candidates, and he was the best performer at the time.]","[But just before the final audition, he suddenly left, missing the golden opportunity. The role went to a less capable new actor, who then won the Best New Actor award and quickly rose to fame in the film industry.]","[The reason he left was because of a phone call from Xu Meng. She said there was a fire at home and she was trapped, crying and begging him for help. Sun Mo, of course, left without hesitation to save his love.]","[Normally, this wouldn't be blameworthy, and Pei Mingxuan could only lament their bad luck. She couldn't possibly criticize Sun Mo for wanting to save someone. But when Pei Mingxuan learned the details of what happened, she was absolutely furious.]","[Damn... Do people like this really exist?]","The private room wasn't far away, and they were eavesdropping intently. Ji Fei kept exclaiming, leaving Qin Zhao on tenterhooks.","Qin Zhao: What exactly happened?","[When her home was on fire, Xu Meng didn't immediately call the fire department. Instead, she chose to keep calling Sun Mo until he answered.]","Qin Zhao: What kind of bizarre behavior is this?","[She seems to have some serious issues, acting like she's the damsel in distress who can only be saved by the hero.]","[Actually, if Xu Meng had called for help immediately, by the time Sun Mo got back, the firefighters would have completely handled the situation. It wouldn't have spread to the upper floor at all.]","[The couple living upstairs were elderly and light sleepers. They discovered the fire and called for help. So when Sun Mo just got back, the fire trucks were just arriving.]","[As the old man came down holding his frightened wife, they learned the situation and suddenly realized the girl downstairs wasn't unconscious or in any other danger – she just couldn't get out because her door was stuck. At that moment, she was being lectured by the firefighters. After all, if she had contacted them immediately, given the timeline, even her own living room wouldn't have been completely burned.]","[The old man was so angry he started cursing at her, questioning her ancestors back eight generations, asking if she was mentally ill and whether she needed to be sent to a psychiatric hospital.]","[Xu Meng just cried and hid in Sun Mo's arms, saying she was too scared at the time and couldn't think of anything except wanting Sun Mo to come save her.]","Qin Zhao was also stunned by what he heard and blurted out, \"Is she insane?\"","The whole table fell silent and looked at him. Qin Zhao awkwardly pointed at his phone and said, \"I... I was just reading a message.\"","Then he gave Yang Hong a strange look, wondering how he could be interested in such a mentally unhinged woman. Was it just for collecting idol merchandise?","Meanwhile, Ji Fei's inner monologue continued.","[This was when Pei came and heard the truth. She was so angry she wanted to slap Xu Meng twice right then and there.]","[Hit her! How could Pei hold back from hitting her! This... I feel my aversion to stupidity acting up.]","\"Isn't it normal for people to dislike someone like you?\" Pei Mingxuan said with disgust. \"Sometimes I really suspect you're doing this on purpose.\"","Xu Meng's eyes immediately filled with panic. She shook her head vigorously and cried even harder.","[Huh? Wait... Is there more to this fire incident?]","[Let me check... Holy crap... She wasn't really stupid, Pei was right, she did it on purpose. She was paid 500,000 yuan to exploit Sun Mo's lovesick nature, selling out his chance to change his fate as a nobody. The person who paid her was Xu Meng's later rich boyfriend, and that's how they met!]","[Wow, hidden gossip! It seems even Pei Mingxuan doesn't know about this! Sun Mo definitely doesn't know, right?]","Qin Zhao suddenly drew in a sharp breath. This unexpected piece of gossip caught him off guard.","He quickly lowered his voice to ask the well-informed person next to him, \"Brother Gao, do you remember which capital was behind XX's rise to fame?\"","Brother Gao didn't understand why Qin Zhao was suddenly asking this out of the blue, but he recalled, \"Gao Group.\"","\"Then who was Xu Meng's former rich boyfriend?\"","\"The Second Young Master Lin... Why?\"","Qin Zhao immediately sent a message to his second brother asking if there was any connection between the two families.","Qin Xian looked at the message in silence. Weren't they supposed to have a dinner gathering tonight?","Then he realized it was probably Ji Fei uncovering some gossip again.","He could only reply: There's no real connection. The younger generation used to hang out together a lot a few years ago, but later fell out due to various conflicts.","So even if Pei Mingxuan and Sun Mo had the ability now, they wouldn't be able to investigate any suspicious circumstances from back then.","Qin Zhao silently sympathized with Sun Mo, thinking about how badly he had been deceived.","\"That's enough. The fire wasn't something that could be controlled, and she was just scared out of her wits,\" Sun Mo couldn't help but interject. As a man, he wouldn't blame a woman when something went wrong. At that time, Xu Meng was so dependent on him, how could that be wrong?","\"There's no point in dredging up old issues.\"","[Pfft, he really is... impossible to sympathize with. If he ever learns the truth, let's see if he still says there's no point in dredging up old issues.]","\"Is the only thing worth bringing up how she abandoned you? How many times are you going to try to eat this leftover grass? Sun Mo, how cheap can you get?\" Pei Mingxuan mocked relentlessly, continually ripping open old wounds, probably still trying to shock Sun Mo back to his senses.","Sun Mo's face contorted. How could he admit that he just couldn't let go of this woman who had betrayed him? Wouldn't that be admitting he was a hopeless fool?","But seeing her again, interacting more and more, he really couldn't help but care about her.","He knew he both loved and hated Xu Meng, while he both respected and felt guilty towards Pei Mingxuan... So even though he had resolved to marry Pei Mingxuan, he still couldn't control his desire to be close to Xu Meng. He felt frustrated and self-loathing, yet still allowed himself to fall.","Sun Mo wore a pained expression. \"I haven't forgotten. Don't worry, I'll never forget the humiliation she brought me. Alright, Mingxuan, don't be angry anymore. Let's go home. I... I promise I won't have any contact with her in the future...\"","Sun Mo seemed to have made a choice, but when he turned and saw Xu Meng's pale little face, his heart suddenly ached violently. Seeing her about to collapse, he couldn't help but reach out to support her, only to be avoided by Xu Meng.","Xu Meng's eyes were filled with endless grievance.","Just then, a voice rang out from afar, startling Ji Fei who was hiding in the private room. She quickly closed the door, but still caught a glimpse of a young girl rushing over to support Xu Meng.","\"Sun Mo, you heartless bastard! How could you do this to Meng Meng? You jerk!\" The young girl exploded like a firecracker, cursing furiously."]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: Magic Defeats Magic","paragraphs":["Sun Mo hadn't expected that just anyone could come and scold him. He immediately became angry and said, \"You're Xu Meng's assistant. What are you saying?\"","The young girl was about to open her mouth, but Xu Meng, with tears in her eyes, desperately stopped her, saying, \"Don't say it!\"","However, the girl seemed to have lost her temper and said regardless, \"Back then, Meng Meng was threatened by Second Young Master Lin. If she didn't leave you, Second Young Master Lin would blacklist you and have people come after you. Didn't you have accidents while filming during that time, and couldn't get any good roles? It was all because Second Young Master Lin wanted to snatch Meng Meng away. Meng Meng finally chose to compromise, and because she didn't want you to risk yourself for her, she pretended to be the bad guy and abandoned you.\"","\"But what about you? After you became successful and saw that Meng Meng had been abandoned by Second Young Master Lin, not only did you not come back to find her, but you also went against her at every turn, creating obstacles for her. Meng Meng endured so much hardship without ever thinking of going back to find you, just because she was afraid you'd despise her and look down on her. And now, you even allow the woman by your side to insult her! Sun Mo, you heartless man!\"","The young assistant spoke hurriedly and confusedly. To an outsider, it might seem like she was speaking out of anger, unable to choose her words, so indignant on Xu Meng's behalf.","[Actually, those who are guilty are already trembling. Ah, I finally know what Xu Meng was doing with her phone earlier. So she was contacting her assistant to come up and act out this play with her!]","Ji Fei became more and more excited as she thought about it.","[She's afraid she can't hold onto Sun Mo, so she's pulling out all the stops. Filming so many scenes really helps with creating plot logic, huh? They can even turn this situation around. Impressive, even more exciting than a TV drama.]","At this point, Qin Zhao in the private room couldn't sit still anymore and wanted to get up to watch the drama unfold in person.","As a result, Yang Hong across from him had probably waited too long and also stood up impatiently, saying he was going to the bathroom.","With half the room already gone, only the two managers were left looking at each other. Qin Zhao could no longer leave, so he could only helplessly continue to listen to Ji Fei's mental broadcast.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei naturally heard some movement and, fortunately, she was well-hidden, so she immediately saw Yang Hong sneaking closer.","[Another one?]","Sun Mo was stunned after hearing the assistant's words, looking at Xu Meng in disbelief. \"Xu Meng! Is this true?\"","Xu Meng just cried, not even looking at him.","But while Sun Mo might be a fool, Pei Mingxuan was not.","\"You're not going to believe her just because she said so, are you?\" Pei Mingxuan frowned. Actually, Pei Mingxuan couldn't tell truth from fiction either, she could only judge based on her knowledge of Xu Meng, feeling that she wasn't the type to sacrifice herself. \"Do you have any evidence?\"","The young girl immediately glared at her and said, \"What kind of evidence could there be for something like this? Pei Mingxuan, don't you think you're being too vicious? If it wasn't for you also telling Meng Meng back then that she should break up with him, telling her not to hold Sun Mo back, Meng Meng wouldn't have made up her mind.\"","Upon hearing this, Sun Mo suddenly turned to look at Pei Mingxuan, his eyes seeming to see her as a vicious woman who had sowed discord and torn apart a loving couple.","It must be said that being looked at with such eyes by a friend who had been like a comrade-in-arms in their careers for many years, indeed hurt Pei Mingxuan.","Pei Mingxuan, however, was willing to own up to her actions. \"I did say that.\"","Sun Mo's eyes immediately filled with blood.","\"But you forgot, I said it in front of you,\" Pei Mingxuan said.","[Oh, so it was said out of anger after that fire incident. And as a manager, not wanting your artist to date a problematic woman seems completely within the scope of your responsibilities.]","Probably remembering the situation at that time, Sun Mo's expression didn't change, but he still seemed to look at Pei Mingxuan with a suspicious gaze.","\"What about other than that time?\"","Because Sun Mo still thought Pei Mingxuan liked him, he instinctively felt that Pei Mingxuan would want to drive Xu Meng away.","Even though Pei Mingxuan had just been holding onto a last shred of hope for Sun Mo, still having expectations for their future career prospects.","But now, Pei Mingxuan's heart gradually turned cold.","Pei Mingxuan looked at the suspicious Sun Mo with a cold smile, as if looking at a fool, \"There wasn't any other time. I dare to confront you about it.\"","But Xu Meng buried her head in her assistant's shoulder, sobbing, \"No, Sun Mo, don't blame Sister Pei. She really did a lot for you. What happened back then... it's been so long, so long ago. I was willing, I never thought you would find out. We've already missed our chance, let's not pursue the truth of it anymore.\"","[Wow, your explanation... very good. Next time you explain like this, I'm calling the police.]","The assistant naturally played along, saying, \"How can that be? Because of your sacrifice, he was finally able to film properly, but he gave all the credit to Pei Mingxuan, thinking it was her who accompanied him through the low point. What about your sacrifice then? He even bullied you, hurt you. This isn't fair.\"","[If it weren't for the Gossip System, I'd be swaying back and forth too. Not to mention the love-brained Sun Mo.]","Sure enough, the next second, Sun Mo's tears came down.","\"Xu Meng, tell me, is what she said true? I want to hear it from your own mouth.\"","But Xu Meng said, \"It's not true, it's all false. Don't ask anymore!\" As she spoke, she tried to leave, but Sun Mo grabbed her arm.","It looked like another scene of painful love was about to unfold.","Pei Mingxuan pressed her temples, seeming extremely tired.","She didn't care at all that her contributions had been overthrown by someone else's few words. She also didn't deign to argue about such trivial matters, after all, she understood Sun Mo well enough to know who he would believe and side with.","That was also her own career, so she never needed Sun Mo to be grateful to her. If they could work together to conquer the world, that would be good, if not, so be it.","When disappointment accumulates enough, one cuts off the diseased limb to survive and seeks other paths.","Pei Mingxuan didn't say a word, just turned and left.","But Sun Mo panicked again and called out, \"Xuan.\"","Pei Mingxuan turned back and said coldly, \"Let me emphasize once more, I'm just your manager. You're already a mature artist. I've said what I needed to say. If you don't listen, I naturally don't have the right to interfere in an artist's personal affairs. You're on your own.\"","With that, Pei Mingxuan left without any lingering attachment.","[Oh ho! This is good, I'm afraid even the betting agreement won't be able to stop Sister Pei from wanting to terminate her contract with Sun Mo now.]","Qin Zhao in the private room was startled, his eyes brightening as he turned to Gao Hao and said, \"Brother Gao, we can prepare to poach her now.\"","Gao Hao: \"Huh?\"","Although Pei Mingxuan had left, Ji Fei still couldn't leave.","The assistant tactfully left, leaving the balcony for the male and female leads to pour out their hearts to each other.","Xu Meng deceived to her heart's content, while Sun Mo was filled with remorse and touched emotions.","[Sometimes, perhaps it's not that men are easily fooled, but that they're too confident, too full of themselves, thinking that the other person should naturally be this devoted and unwavering, willing to sacrifice for them. So even if it's a scam, they can easily fall for it.]","[Tsk tsk tsk, they're hugging and kissing again, I can't bear to watch... No, wait, there's still another audience member here!]","[You're not coming out to stop them, so your intentions really aren't pure, huh!]","In the end, it was Xu Meng who pushed Sun Mo away, panting.","\"We can't. You should go find Sister Pei. Didn't you already propose to her? I... I also have a boyfriend. I can't betray Yang Hong.\"","\"What I feel for Pei Mingxuan is just... respect. Let me ask you, do you love me or him? Meng Meng, don't lie to me!\" Sun Mo had a look of painful devotion.","Xu Meng, however, looked like she didn't know how to answer.","Suddenly, a voice broke through everything.","\"What are you doing?\" Yang Hong finally made his appearance.","At this, Xu Meng genuinely panicked and pushed Sun Mo away.","[It seems Xu Meng still wants to maintain a balance between both sides. She doesn't want Yang Hong to see her undying love for Sun Mo.]","But Sun Mo spoke up, \"Yang Hong, I have something to say to you...\"","However, he was interrupted by Xu Meng. \"Sun Mo, we've finished talking about our matters. I'll help you complete this stage performance well. You should go back now.\" At the end, she said very quietly: \"Please.\"","Sun Mo looked at Xu Meng sadly, but Xu Meng looked at Sun Mo firmly, her eyes extremely pitiful, as if tears would fall the next second.","Sun Mo couldn't bear to see his beloved in difficulty, so in the end, he could only temporarily suppress these chaotic emotions and go back to calm down.","After Sun Mo left the scene, only two people were left on the balcony.","This time, before Xu Meng could speak, Yang Hong started again...","[So, your goal was indeed to enjoy what Sun Mo had used. You crazy obsessive fan!]","But Xu Meng thought that Yang Hong must have seen something, this was his possessiveness.","\"Yang Hong, I'm sorry, I... I didn't have the strength to resist. I didn't want to, he forced me because of past emotions. I... I love you, you know that,\" Xu Meng said, putting on the act of a pitiful, weak, innocent flower.","\"I know, don't be afraid,\" Yang Hong released Xu Meng, wiping saliva from the corner of his mouth. \"I'm willing to step aside and let you two get back together.\"","Xu Meng froze, looking at Yang Hong in shock. \"What... what are you saying?\"","[She's panicking, she's panicked, her tone slipped. Of course, she still wanted to play the role of passively maneuvering between two men. How could you break her balance? Plus, she's still betting on who would be most advantageous to be with. How could you push her out like this? Hahaha.]","But Yang Hong still maintained the posture of a guileless, overly kind person with no resentment or regrets. \"I know you two love each other. You don't need to worry about me. I love you, so I just want you to be happy.\"","Xu Meng's face froze. She wanted to open her mouth to explain that it wasn't like that.","But Yang Hong didn't listen at all, maintaining an attitude of 'I know, I understand everything, you don't need to explain.' He even promised, \"I'll find a way to keep you two from being cursed by the entire internet, so don't worry.\"","This rendered all of Xu Meng's skills useless. She couldn't be more confused.","[I'm dying of laughter. Sure enough, you can only defeat magic with magic.]"]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Just Like a Worker Quitting","paragraphs":["Xu Meng truly didn't want to choose Sun Mo so quickly. Originally, as long as Yang Hong didn't let go, she could continue to maneuver between them. But now that Yang Hong was acting so magnanimous, if things escalated to Sun Mo, she would really be in a difficult position.","So she could only retreat to advance, avoiding the topic.","\"Yang Hong, don't say that. If you do, I...\" Xu Meng's tears fell on command, putting on an anguished and struggling appearance.","Yang Hong: \"Xu Meng, don't be sad. In the future, whenever you need me, I'll appear by your side at any time.\"","\"Don't talk nonsense.\"","\"I'm telling the truth. Even if you're with Mo, I'll always be by your side.\" Yang Hong's words were highly suggestive.","It made Xu Meng think she had Yang Hong completely wrapped around her finger, turning him into a devoted lover with no complaints or regrets.","Xu Meng didn't know she was apparently this capable.","[Why does this sound so strange? Could it be that after Xu Meng and Sun Mo get back together, Yang Hong still plans to be Xu Meng's backup... Ugh!]","In the private room, Qin Zhao watched Pei Mingxuan and Sun Mo return one after another, falling into a cold war. Meanwhile, he continued eavesdropping on the gossip from the other side.","Just as things were getting interesting, he heard Ji Fei seemingly spitting repeatedly in her mind as if she had seen something dirty.","[Yang the Crazy, you're impressive! You actually plan to help them get together, then become Xu Meng's secret lover. As long as you keep bringing benefits to Xu Meng, you know she won't let go of you. Do you really want to get infinitely close to your idol like this?]","Qin Zhao silently retched, as if witnessing the crazy behavior of some obsessed fans.","Then he looked rather sympathetically at Sun Mo, who was lowering his head to fiddle with his phone. Although he was stupid and unfaithful, he didn't deserve this, did he?","Not long after, the remaining three people finally returned one after another, and the awkward dinner came to an end.","After watching Sun Mo and Xu Meng gaze at each other lovingly at the entrance before getting into their respective cars and leaving, a car came to pick up Qin Zhao and Ji Fei.","Upon opening the door, they found Qin Xian inside, who had come specifically to pick them up.","After Ji Fei got in the car, she heard Qin Xian ask, \"Did anything happen again today?\"","The topic was raised in a way that greatly stirred Ji Fei's desire to share. Her eyes immediately lit up with stars as she rattled off a string of words to Qin Xian.","Qin Xian's smile was faint, but he listened attentively, nodding and frowning in response from time to time.","Ji Fei's only dissatisfaction was that she couldn't share the even more explosive information she had obtained through her Gossip System.","Gao Hao's mouth twitched as he said from the side, \"Being away for so long wasn't because of a stomachache, but hiding to eavesdrop on gossip.\"","And the gossip was so explosive, it was truly juicy gossip within gossip. Even he, as a seasoned entertainment industry manager, couldn't help but marvel.","Ji Fei grinned.","Gao Hao sighed, \"Then I really can try to poach Pei Mingxuan.\"","\"Huh? Gao, you like Sister Pei? You want to pursue her?\" Ji Fei asked in shock.","Gao Hao choked on his saliva, \"What nonsense are you talking about? I meant trying to poach her, to have her come to our studio as a manager and manage you in the future.\"","Only then did Ji Fei realize they had considered Pei Mingxuan.","Ji Fei thought for a moment, then suddenly smiled.","[Sister Pei was able to take such good care of Sun Mo before, completely eliminating the need for him to do anything extra, just like a nanny. So if she becomes my manager, won't I be able to be a proper useless artist?]","Qin Xian and Qin Zhao: ... Although they hadn't poached her yet, just thinking about having such a motivated Pei Mingxuan manage an artist like this made them feel guilty.","Gao Hao, on the other hand, had already started considering the possibilities. Since the two men with absolute say in this matter were present, Gao Hao asked them directly.","Qin Zhao had no objections, but Qin Xian lowered his head in thought for a while.","\"Mr. Qin, is there something unsuitable?\" Gao Hao asked, \"Are you worried that Pei Mingxuan won't be able to let go of her feelings and won't be willing to terminate her contract with Sun Mo?\"","Ji Fei said, \"That won't happen.\"","Qin Xian nodded and said, \"Pei Mingxuan is smart and ambitious. She's also done her utmost for Sun Mo. With Sun Mo's foreseeable troubles in the future, she won't continue to stay in that pit. She'll definitely terminate their working relationship as soon as possible, but she may not be able to come out unscathed.\"","Qin Zhao said, \"Regarding the performance agreement issue, if we can poach her, we can help bear the losses first.\"","Qin Xian shook his head, \"Money isn't the problem.\"","Now even Ji Fei was curious, \"Then what could be the problem?\"","Qin Xian looked over, his jet-black eyes seeming able to see through everything.","\"You just said that Yang Hong promised to help them get back together, and guaranteed that the whole internet wouldn't criticize them. What do you think could be the method?\"","The three of them blinked, all looking clueless.","\"For an event that can stir up fan emotions, there must be a scapegoat to bear all the malicious emotions. It's not Yang Hong, who had his girlfriend stolen. It's not Sun Mo, who stole someone else's girlfriend. It's not Xu Meng, who wavered between two men. So who could it reasonably be, even with some past facts to support it?\"","After Qin Xian finished speaking, the car was quiet for a long time.","It took Ji Fei a while to react, \"No... it can't be. Even if Sun Mo isn't a good person, he wouldn't be so ungrateful, would he? If he doesn't cooperate...\"","\"Hm? Hasn't the gratitude already been taken by Xu Meng?\" Qin Zhao frowned.","Qin Xian said, \"Of course, this is just a possibility. If we want to sign her, we must consider this point.\"","Gao Hao coughed and said, \"I think we can postpone the matter of poaching Pei Mingxuan.\"","From a manager's perspective, Gao Hao wouldn't want to poach a manager full of scandals. If things really developed as Qin Xian predicted, Pei Mingxuan could only leave the entertainment industry.","But what Gao Hao didn't know was that the artist under his management wasn't a docile one.","Ji Fei clutched her phone tightly and smiled mischievously, \"Don't worry, if it really turns out that way, I have a way to deal with them.\"","Qin Zhao also spoke up, \"About the script... I suddenly want to change it.\"","Ji Fei was stunned, \"Wait, what do you mean? I just memorized all the lines.\"","Qin Zhao raised an eyebrow and smiled, \"Don't worry, improvise. You'll enjoy performing it.\"","Ji Fei: Really?","The show's director and producer were very nervous because the top-tier group had changed to a confidential script again.","The last time it was confidential was last time, and then the Best Actor Team was gone.","Thinking that the two male god teams shouldn't have conflicts with the top-tier group, so the thing they were worried about shouldn't happen, right?","The director and producer held hands to encourage each other, finally welcoming the third live broadcast.","Before the broadcast, everyone greeted each other backstage.","Ji Fei finally escaped from the intense rehearsal and could now peacefully observe the drama unfolding.","Usually, Pei Mingxuan would have come over early to inquire about the confidential script for her artist's sake, just in case. But this time, Pei Mingxuan was just routinely handling the things a manager should handle, not expending any extra effort.","[Sister Pei like this resembles an employee about to resign, unwilling to put in any extra effort beyond their salary. But she's cold on the outside and warm on the inside, still thinking about Sun Mo's fans at this time.]","Then they heard an argument break out between Pei Mingxuan and Sun Mo.","The atmosphere between the two had already been tense recently, and now it made the busy staff around them quiet down and prick up their ears to eavesdrop."]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: Two-faced or Shameless","paragraphs":["\"I told you to prepare milk tea for your fans. It's so cold outside, they're working hard to support you and have to stand there for so long. Don't you care about your fans at all?\"","When Pei Mingxuan arrived, she saw that fans of other celebrities were being taken care of in various ways, but Sun Mo's fans were shivering in the cold wind. As his manager, she couldn't stand to watch this.","Sun Mo looked displeased at being publicly reprimanded. \"Isn't that supposed to be your job as the manager?\"","\"I'm busy handling your other affairs, that's why I asked you to arrange it. Today of all days, we need their support and understanding, and you... Besides, I've told you this many times, how come you never remember!\"","\"So I forgot once, is it really that big a deal?\" Sun Mo became impatient.","\"Is it a big deal?\" Pei Mingxuan repeated in disbelief. Although she had mentally prepared herself to leave, she was still furious.","\"I'll have my assistant go buy some right away, okay? Why are you getting so worked up?\"","\"I'm worked up because you don't listen...\"","\"Enough, I'll order delivery right now, it'll be faster. Is that good enough?\"","Pei Mingxuan was thoroughly angered and said coldly, \"Don't trouble yourself.\"","\"I'm about to do it and now you won't let me. Are you just trying to pick a fight?\" Sun Mo snapped angrily.","It wasn't about picking a fight. When Pei Mingxuan discovered he hadn't done it, she immediately took action to remedy the situation and even apologized to the fans on Sun Mo's behalf, making excuses for him.","Even though she was planning to leave, she wouldn't abandon the responsibilities of a manager.","But just then, Sun Mo's assistant returned.","Pei Mingxuan immediately scolded, \"Where did you go?\"","The assistant was startled and instinctively replied, \"To... to bring milk tea to Teacher Xu.\"","For a moment, everyone fell silent and looked at Sun Mo in shock.","Although the three of them had been rehearsing together lately, they had seen Sun Mo and Xu Meng being intimate more than once. There were rumors that the two were having an affair together.","But seeing Yang Hong's calm demeanor, it didn't seem to be the case. Yet looking at Pei Mingxuan's recent cold attitude, it seemed like it might be true...","Everyone was confused by the gossip. But it was certainly dramatic.","Sun Mo's face stiffened, but he didn't speak. Instead, he looked at Pei Mingxuan, clearly at a loss for how to handle the situation, waiting for Pei Mingxuan to give him a way out.","Especially when he made mistakes, it was always Pei Mingxuan who helped him apologize.","Moreover, this incident was started by Pei Mingxuan in the first place.","But unexpectedly, Pei Mingxuan just gave a cold snort and didn't say a word, leaving Sun Mo stranded in the awkward situation.","Sun Mo abruptly stood up and grabbed Pei Mingxuan, pulling her outside. \"Come with me, I need to talk to you.\"","As soon as the two left, the backstage area erupted in gossip, with excited whispers all around.","[Tsk tsk, when Sun Mo's shameless, he's thick-skinned as can be. When he's thin-skinned, he acts like he has no shame at all.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong, who came as an assistant, immediately burst out coughing.","Upon careful consideration, they felt Ji Fei's description was extremely accurate.","Qin Rong quickly sent the latest gossip to Qin's parents in the audience and Qin Yan who had come over when she had time.","Although they could only stay in the audience seats and couldn't hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts, they had their little messenger, didn't they?","Trying not to miss a single piece of juicy gossip.","In this group chat, the only one not present was Qin Xian, who was still working in the office.","Qin Xian handled documents while glancing at the group chat, with the show's livestream playing on the computer beside him.","[Tsk tsk, shameless, truly shameless. He actually thinks Sister Pei is picking on him because she likes him.]","The Qin family: Why on earth is he so confident?","In another room.","\"Are you deaf or have you lost your memory? I'll say it one more time, I don't like you at all.\"","But Sun Mo still looked at Pei Mingxuan with an attitude of 'stop pretending'.","Sun Mo said, \"Sigh, let's stop fighting. Mingxuan, I... I have indeed wronged you. Now that I know about Xu Meng's suffering, I can't let her down anymore. I want to marry her.\"","Pei Mingxuan was so surprised she forgot to refute that ridiculous misunderstanding, and asked out of pure curiosity: \"Would Yang Hong... agree to that? Wouldn't his fans tear you apart? This is basically stealing someone's girlfriend. Even if your fans don't care about you getting married, they won't tolerate this kind of behavior. Do you want to ruin yourself?\"","But Sun Mo looked at Pei Mingxuan with deep eyes and sighed: \"Yang Hong is willing to give us his blessing, and he's also willing to help us guide public opinion and manage the backlash. The three of us have no objections, so what opinions could the fans possibly have?\"","Pei Mingxuan was utterly dumbfounded. She wanted to say something but couldn't be bothered anymore.","Sun Mo was naturally guilty, but he firmly said: \"So help me think of a way to peacefully guide the fans, okay?\"","But Pei Mingxuan's mouth twitched, \"I was planning to say this after this episode of the show, but since you're being so crazy, I'll say it now. You can think of ways with your new manager, I want to terminate our working relationship. I'll give you the contract termination agreement later.\"","Sun Mo was stunned, then immediately erupted in anger, \"Do you know that I rejected the best solution because of you! And now you want to terminate our contract?\"","Pei Mingxuan was confused and asked, \"What?\"","Sun Mo realized his slip and his eyes darted around. He quickly said, \"Is it just because I'm going to marry Xu Meng? You heard it last time too, Xu Meng has done so much for me, I can't let her down. But I have feelings for you too. Keep being my manager, and we can...\"","Passing staff in the hallway suddenly heard a loud slap, which startled them. Then they saw Pei Mingxuan walk out, seeming to be emanating a black aura all over. Her face was frighteningly cold.","[Oho, he got slapped.]","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong immediately pricked up their ears.","[Haha, serves him right. What does he think this is, ancient times? One wife and one concubine? He actually hoped everyone would accept each other's existence and work together to manage his career and family. Wife warming his bed at home, manager warming his bed outside. He's really trampled on Sister Pei's years of friendship and insulted her.]","[I bet Sister Pei probably wants to be reborn in the past and give herself a good beating for signing such a freak. How blind must she have been to sign him?]","Qin Rong listened with utter disdain, furiously typing on her phone. The group chat erupted in a chorus of condemnation.","Qin Zhao wasn't particularly surprised, as this kind of situation wasn't uncommon in the entertainment industry.","Some managers even represented both husband and wife, then got involved with one of them. Their interests were intertwined, and everyone tacitly accepted it as harmonious.","Shortly after Pei Mingxuan returned backstage, Sun Mo came back with a gloomy face. His cheek looked a bit red, but it wasn't very noticeable.","[Looks like he's thick-skinned again. A slap doesn't even show through.]","Soon after, the other two changed into their costumes and arrived. Xu Meng was still happily holding her milk tea.","Seeing there was nothing interesting left to watch, Ji Fei continued searching for more gossip.","[So... Qin Xian really guessed right. After reaching an agreement with Sun Mo, Yang Hong proposed a way to handle public opinion by using Sister Pei.]","[Pretend that it was Sister Pei who broke them up years ago, causing a misunderstanding. Now that they've met again and cleared up the misunderstanding, Yang Hong voluntarily steps aside to give them his blessing. The three of them look wonderful, with only Sister Pei as the villain.]","[But Sun Mo still had a shred of conscience left and didn't agree, planning to think of another way later. But that doesn't mean you should feel like Sister Pei owes you a favor and should back down because of it.]","Qin Rong angrily typed: That's horrible, that's too much, that's shameless, that's...","Qin Zhao: How is this any different from an attempted criminal demanding gratitude from the victim?","[So high and mighty. Why don't you three drag out Second Young Master Lin from back then to be the villain? He's the real culprit, isn't he? Don't want to?]","The Qin family: They don't dare! They're afraid of being exposed! They're all a bunch of garbage cowards!","Just as they were ranting, the livestream countdown began.","The three pieces of trash took the stage and began performing their beautiful xianxia idol drama."]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Is this really the horse-catching situation they can see","paragraphs":["In the waiting area, including Ji Fei and Qin Zhao, there were two more guest groups left. Everyone was watching the large screen in front with boredom.","It wasn't that they performed poorly, it was just too cliché. Even without them acting, everyone knew what the next plot would be.","...","The Celestial Emperor Lord (played by Sun Mo) falls in love with a mortal woman (played by Xu Meng) during his trial in the mortal realm, and the mortal woman saves the injured Demon Lord (played by Yang Hong).","The three of them go through various entanglements in the mortal world. Until the trial ends, the Emperor Lord's identity is revealed, and he has to return to the celestial realm.","...","Not only did the live audience find it boring, but even the number of online viewers in the livestream was gradually decreasing.","The barrage of comments was not as exaggerated as it was at the beginning of the broadcast. Only when the stage was first presented did the comments explode for a moment, with a flood of question marks.","Because although the two fandoms were now getting along, there was still a competitive relationship.","Your idol excels in celestial fantasy, while my idol excels in campus stories. Since they're collaborating, it shouldn't favor either side.","Moreover, they came for a transformation, and with such a good stage providing all kinds of professional support, fans thought their idols would perform something different and showcase their abilities.","But it's still celestial fantasy.","Yang Hong's fans were not happy.","\"Isn't this just making our idol a supporting role?\"","Then they started targeting Sun Mo's fans.","Sun Mo's fans were also frustrated. Sun Mo had acted in no less than five celestial fantasy dramas, with similar character settings. They really didn't need more of the same; they wanted to see more possibilities for their idol.","Although they were very confused about Sun Mo choosing celestial fantasy again, they still had to stand guard for their idol and guide public opinion among onlookers.","\"It's only the first round of the livestream competition, what's the rush? Maybe it's just to polish their chemistry.\"","\"We haven't even mentioned your idol bringing his whole family along.\"","\"Besides, your idol hasn't acted in celestial fantasy before, it's a good opportunity for him to perform. This is good for you, don't be ungrateful!\"","In short, there were few comments discussing the plot on the barrage.","Even the director and producer shook their heads in disappointment,","\"I don't know why they chose this kind of script,\"","\"There's no highlight at all, it seems this segment is a flop.\"","Just as they were saying this, suddenly there was an exclamation from the audience. The two immediately looked over, and were dumbfounded.","The guests in the waiting area also stared with wide eyes.","The barrage of comments reached a new high again, with \"WTF\" filling the entire screen.","...","Before the Emperor Lord was about to leave, he finally faced his inner love, but the mortal woman knew she wasn't worthy of the Emperor Lord, so she pretended to be with the Demon Lord.","Xu Meng was held in Yang Hong's arms, and Yang Hong kissed her in front of Sun Mo, displaying ownership. As a result, Sun Mo forcefully pulled Xu Meng out and hugged her into his arms, kissing her domineeringly.","...","Due to the angle, everyone could clearly see that it wasn't a staged kiss, but a real one.","A real kiss!","Although it's acting, and kiss scenes are not uncommon, is it necessary for a stage play?","And to kiss so passionately in front of her boyfriend.","Is this really the dramatic situation they could see?","More than the play itself, the audience was more curious about the behind-the-scenes drama.","After all, who doesn't love gossip?","The other two groups of actors in the waiting area showed contempt on their faces, assuming they were just trying to create topics and grab attention.","But such shameless behavior is only done by D-list nobodies to gain exposure. For celebrities of their status, this is not a wise move and could easily provoke a backlash from fans.","[I thought they had deleted all these kinds of plot lines, but it turns out that as soon as Sister Pei isn't in charge, they immediately unleash it.]","Qin Zhao thought they might be setting up psychological expectations for fans about changing girlfriends later.","Ji Fei, looking at the expressions of the three, felt that Yang Hong was the only one who almost broke character.","After all, he should have been furious, but a flash of excitement passed across his face. Indeed, he's Yang the Crazy.","The barrage of comments was in chaos, saying all sorts of things, but self-comforting and self-justifying fans were the majority.","The performance continued.","...","The two, having regained their identities, naturally fought fiercely over the mortal woman. All stage special effects were employed to create the appearance of a grand battle.","Surrounding buildings collapsed, the earth shook and mountains trembled.","In the end, the mortal woman was taken away by the Demon Lord, and the Emperor Lord returned to the celestial realm severely injured.","After recovering, the Emperor Lord still wanted to find the mortal woman, but was stopped by the celestial beings. They believed the Emperor Lord shouldn't pursue a woman who was entangled with the Demon Lord. Even a celestial maiden came forward, suggesting that the Emperor Lord should remove his emotional ties, forget the mortal woman, and gave a bunch of reasons about the greater good for all living beings.","At this moment, the celestial and demonic realms held peace talks, and the Demon Lord boldly brought the mortal woman to the celestial realm.","Everyone watched as the Emperor Lord and the mortal woman gazed at each other from afar, seemingly with thousands of words to say.","...","At this point, the barrage finally had some guesses about the plot.","\"Am I the only one who thinks that if this mortal woman can be with the Demon Lord, why can't she be with our Emperor Lord?\"","\"Maybe she was forced to stay by the Demon Lord's side.\"","\"Such a roundabout way...\"","\"Am I the only one who noticed something off about that celestial maiden? Talking about removing emotional ties, she just wants the Emperor Lord not to love the mortal woman, right? So she must be coveting the Emperor Lord's position.\"","\"Hmm, definitely. Using righteousness to pressure the Emperor Lord, but actually wanting to take the position herself. She must be the vicious female supporting character.\"","The audience didn't have much reaction, after all, it's a common plot.","But the members of the top-tier group who had seen their rehearsals knew that there was no plot involving this celestial maiden before.","And thinking carefully, the answer seemed obvious.","[How shameless, they said earlier they wouldn't use Sister Pei, but they've actually been laying mines. On the surface, it looks like a common trope, but it's actually hinting that Sister Pei is like this celestial maiden in their relationship.]","[No way, right? Sun Mo doesn't think that such a subtle approach doesn't count as using Sister Pei to clear his name, does he? He even had the audacity to ask Sister Pei to help think of solutions earlier? I'm also impressed by his shamelessness to the point of prostrating myself in admiration.]","Qin Zhao sneered: They understand the imagination of netizens, knowing where people will speculate once things explode. As long as they think of this stage play, there will be 'evidence' to prove their imagination is correct. Then the subsequent conflicts will be more recklessly transferred to Pei Mingxuan.","The three members of the Qin family in the audience had heard all the gossip, and when they heard everyone around discussing the celestial maiden who might become the vicious female supporting character, they also realized.","Feeling the presumptuous thinking mode of everyone around, they suddenly felt a chill.","And backstage, Pei Mingxuan watched the big screen, her face completely darkened, with disbelief flashing in her eyes. Clearly, as intelligent as she was, she had also realized some things in this moment, and her heart instantly turned cold as iron.","Qin Rong and Brother Gao and Xiao Tao whispered for a while.","Gao Hao directly stepped forward and patted Pei Mingxuan's shoulder.","Pei Mingxuan was startled, and saw that Gao Hao didn't say anything, just handed her a business card.","It was a business card customized by Qin Zhao as the owner of the studio.","\"What does this mean?\" Pei Mingxuan was stunned.","Gao Hao said, \"You're well-informed, you should have heard about Qin Zhao and I going abroad to develop, so our studio still needs a professional manager.\"","Pei Mingxuan's expression changed slightly. She hadn't even considered her own future yet, and didn't expect someone to extend an olive branch.","Pei Mingxuan, being meticulous, wouldn't agree easily, just frowned in thought.","Gao Hao smiled and said, \"No rush, I'm just expressing that we have this intention. We'll contact you later.\"","After saying this, he continued to watch the show."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Hope you won't scold us later","paragraphs":["......","The Emperor Lord and the Mortal Woman naturally encountered each other alone in the same place again, and although the Mortal Woman resisted the other's approach, she was still forcibly taken by the Emperor Lord to perform various acts of forced love.","During this time, the Fairy tried every means to prevent the two's love. Her performance was clumsy and laughable.","Until they were caught kissing by the Demon Lord. The Demon Lord was furious, so a great battle between immortals and demons ensued, shaking heaven and earth.","The Mortal Woman once again stood between the two, suffering a heavy blow, only revealing the truth before her death.","The Mortal Woman was actually already close to death, and in order to ask the Demon Lord to let her see the Emperor Lord one last time, she chose to stay by the Demon Lord's side. In fact, from beginning to end, the one she loved was the Emperor Lord.","Upon learning the truth, the Demon Lord was heartbroken and chose to disappear.","The Emperor Lord collapsed, watching helplessly as the Mortal Woman died in his arms, crying heart-wrenchingly, losing his composure and turning to the dark side.","......","Gradually, more and more viewers in the bullet comments became emotionally invested. There weren't many people discussing the dramatic love triangle anymore.","After all, the acting of the three was quite on point. Although the plot was cliché, it was performed with great emotional impact.","\"Why did they have to miss each other like this, I'm crying my eyes out.\"","\"There's no other way, the Mortal Woman did everything for the Emperor Lord's sake.\"","\"But how can the Emperor Lord be okay without her!\"","\"The Demon Lord is so pitiful too, he truly loved the Mortal Woman, why didn't she give him a chance?\"","\"Damn it, I hope the first thing the Emperor Lord does after turning evil is kill that disgusting Fairy to avenge the Mortal Woman.\"","The audience in the seats below had similar reactions.","......","The crazed Emperor Lord, dressed in black with red eye makeup, wreaked havoc in the underworld searching for the Mortal Woman's reincarnation, but couldn't find her. Thinking her soul had scattered, he planned to die with her.","But before that, he vowed to drag the celestial realm down with him, to avenge their love.","So the Emperor Lord completely became the new Demon Lord. Indeed, the first one he killed was the Fairy who came out to persuade him.","Another cosmic catastrophe ensued, and at this moment, the Mortal Woman appeared.","Only this time, she appeared as the Goddess.","It turned out that the Mortal Woman was originally a Goddess naturally born from the Heavenly Dao, with the purpose of protecting the world and maintaining peace in the three realms. Being a mortal was part of her cultivation, and after death, she could return to her true form.","The Goddess tried to persuade the Emperor Lord to let go of his obsession and surrender.","But the Emperor Lord only wanted the Goddess to be with him.","However, the Goddess was a derivative of the Heavenly Dao, meant to be without emotions or desires, always ready to sacrifice herself for all living beings. Being with the Emperor Lord would go against the Heavenly Dao, so she firmly refused. She even lied that she had lost her feelings and no longer loved the Emperor Lord.","Thus began another round of chase and escape, with nowhere to hide.","......","The bullet comments were all screaming.","\"Just agree to be with him! He's so pitiful, so humble, he loves you so much!\"","\"He's gone mad for you like this, stop restraining yourself and face your true feelings!\"","\"The way he looks at you, even we are heartbroken watching it.\"","\"Wait... where's my Demon Lord? Where's my brother? Is he not appearing in this part? Isn't that too unfair?!\"","Soon enough, Yang Hong did appear on stage, directly bringing the play to its grand finale, still with a cliché plot.","......","The Demon Lord appeared again, bringing news that an uncontrollable force had leaked out and the three realms were about to be destroyed.","The Goddess suddenly sensed the will of heaven and knew it was time for her to sacrifice herself.","At first, both the Emperor Lord and the Demon Lord refused this, but gradually the Demon Lord understood that there was no other choice, while the Emperor Lord was unwilling to lose the Goddess again. He imprisoned the Goddess, not letting her go sacrifice herself.","In the end, it was the Demon Lord who helped the Goddess escape, letting her prepare.","To force the Goddess to return, the Emperor Lord first angrily captured the Demon Lord, then threatened with the lives of all beings in the three realms. If the Goddess dared to sacrifice herself, he would destroy the three realms himself.","But the Goddess still didn't appear, until the Demon Lord was about to be killed. By then, many immortals and demons had joined forces to present divine weapons, hoping the Goddess would slay the mad Emperor Lord, as they knew he was the biggest obstacle to the Goddess saving the world.","But when the Goddess had the best opportunity as the Emperor Lord embraced her, she couldn't bring herself to do it and gave up.","The crisis also arrived at that moment, and the Goddess threatened to take her own life to make the Emperor Lord let her go.","Seeing the Goddess crying like rain, the Emperor Lord's heart ached.","\"The Goddess receives the faith and worship of all beings in the three realms, yet I made you cry. It's my fault. But remember, my love for you is a faith stronger than that of all living beings combined, an eternal faith.\"","With that, the Emperor Lord turned and left, sacrificing himself to save the world.","In the end, he fell into the Goddess's arms. The Goddess broke down crying, finally admitting her true feelings.","\"I was wrong. I love you. You're the one I love. You are my eternal faith.\"","In the end, peace was restored to the three realms.","The Goddess wandered the three realms with a wisp of soul, waiting ten thousand years for her love to return.","......","\"Ahhh, I'm crying my eyes out!\"","\"Thank goodness it's a happy ending!\"","\"I have to say, even though it's still cliché, I really cried in front of the screen.\"","\"'My love for you is absolute faith,' so romantic, so amazing!\"","The bullet comments finally reached a small peak.","Thunderous applause also erupted from the audience below. Perhaps only the Qin family of three in the audience didn't applaud, but instead began to look at each other worriedly.","\"They should be fine, right?\" said Qin's Father.","\"This seems to be very popular with everyone,\" Qin's Mom couldn't help saying.","Qin Yan encouraged her parents: \"We have to believe in Fei Fei and Ah Zhao! Didn't they create a miracle last time?\"","Backstage, Pei Mingxuan had been observing the online environment ever since then. She was really worried about being backstabbed.","She wasn't the type to sit idly by, of course, but over the years, she had arranged everything well for Sun Mo, so there really wasn't any dirt she could use as a precaution.","\"It's finally our turn!\" Qin Rong said excitedly.","\"Things are about to get interesting,\" said Xiao Tao.","Gao Hao had a complex expression, seeming a bit excited yet also worried, and he kept sighing from time to time.","This made Pei Mingxuan curious, \"What type of script does your group have exactly?\"","Gao Hao didn't need to keep it secret anymore at this point, \"It's... xianxia, I guess.\"","Pei Mingxuan: ?!","It's no wonder Pei Mingxuan didn't believe it, after all, their makeup and costumes were already prepared, and they were just ordinary mortal looks. Even the clothes for the mortal period in the previous group had an ethereal feel to them.","She had thought they were doing a historical slice-of-life type of performance.","At this moment, Sun Mo and Yang Hong had already returned to the waiting area, accepting everyone's congratulations, and passed by the two from the top-tier celebrity group.","Sun Mo was in a good mood and even took the initiative to greet them: \"Wishing you a successful performance.\"","However, Ji Fei and Qin Zhao looked at Sun Mo with unnatural expressions, their mouths twitching almost simultaneously.","[Thanks for the well-wishes, bro. We'll do our best!]","Qin Zhao: I hope you won't curse at us later!","The stage lights dimmed, and the performers gradually took the stage.","The director and producer finally smiled with satisfaction seeing the rising number of online viewers for the live broadcast. It seemed that the lingering influence from the top-tier celebrity group's last performance was still there, ensuring overall ratings for this episode.","They weren't greedy either, being able to maintain the popularity and safely get through this episode was enough. After all, no one wanted to experience a huge controversy like last time.","The two of them silently prayed in their hearts almost at the same time, hoping everything would go smoothly.","But in the next second, the appearance of a narration line shattered their dream.","On the pitch-black stage, suddenly a majestic voice like a sharp blade pierced through.","\"When immortals fall in love, the three realms are not at peace. When immortals pursue romance, all living beings suffer!\"","Director and Producer: ? Why do I smell gunpowder?","Everyone in the audience, waiting area, and backstage was stunned.","Another head-to-head with the same theme?","The bullet comments were filled with question marks.","\"Is this a xianxia theme? Isn't this putting themselves up against a tough act to follow...\"","\"Didn't the villain fairy in the last performance say something similar? Is this intentional?\"","\"Not really, it's a very common line.\"","\"Let's wait and see. Our two haven't offended them, nor have they done anything inappropriate. Aren't they supposed to be righteous? They wouldn't deliberately pick a fight, right?\"","The lights suddenly came on. Everyone's hearts instantly jumped to their throats.","On the stage was a scene of ordinary people working hard: Qin Zhao farming, Ji Fei weaving, grandparents taking care of children. The village was a picture of peace and harmony. As the sun set, everyone's face showed the purest smile as they prepared to go home hand in hand.","But suddenly, white mist rose behind their stage.","Everyone was startled. Was something about to make an appearance?","Suddenly, the large screen behind them lit up, unexpectedly playing a video. In the video, three people were wearing ethereal ancient costumes and masks, seemingly symbolizing certain character types.","The scene was familiar.","A man in white and a man in black faced off, with a helpless woman standing between them.","\"Please, stop fighting. Don't fight over me anymore.\"","Then, special effects of lightning and thunder appeared, accompanied by the stage outside the screen beginning to shake and rumble, simulating a fierce storm.","A power beyond mortal comprehension suddenly emerged, like a colossal beast devouring everything in sight.","The people on stage seemed frozen in an instant, leaving only those desperately rushing to their loved ones, fearfully embracing each other, and watching the unfolding chaos on the big screen in terror."]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Will this show shorten our lives","paragraphs":["The video on the screen continued, with the three characters immersed in their love and hatred, completely disregarding the impact on their surroundings.","Meanwhile, the helpless mortals were bewildered, crying, screaming, and shouting, but the three on the screen couldn't hear their voices. They continued their back-and-forth, each move causing people to vanish like ants. The small village, built through generations of hard work, was left in ruins, a scene of utter devastation.","The three on the screen finally ended their drama of two men fighting over one woman. They didn't even look at the destruction they had caused. The white-robed figure flew away, while the black-robed one left with the woman.","...","As the performance ended, the lights dimmed.","The venue fell silent, and even the danmu (live comments) were empty for several seconds. However, the number of online viewers skyrocketed within a few minutes, as if people had come rushing in upon hearing the news.","The director and producer were already sweating profusely.","Why did this happen again?!","This show is going to be the death of us, seriously.","If you're going to push it this far, why not just use recordings of the \"Male God Group's\" stage performance as your supporting material?","This is so difficult to handle! It's not like they've offended you or anything!","Even the backstage staff were anxious because they were responsible for the limited stage effects, using almost the same props as in the previous group's performance.","It seemed like they were helping to target the \"Male God Group.\" Would they be killed by the fans of the \"Male God Group\"?","The staff were trembling, but the audience was dumbfounded, their hearts racing.","How to put it? It was as if their perspective had been forcibly turned 180 degrees.","The love story that had just seemed so moving suddenly took on an absurd quality.","Whether in the audience, backstage, or in the waiting area, everyone was struck by a kind of shock.","At this moment, Sun Mo, Yang Hong, and Xu Meng all wore extremely unpleasant expressions. They stared at the big screen, their eyes almost on fire.","Have they gone mad? Targeting them like this? Trying to step on them to rise up? This is too despicable.","It felt like they had been set up, like they had unwittingly paved the way for others.","Finally, the danmu began to react.","The controversy began.","\"What does this mean? It's clearly targeting us, using our brothers' performance as a foil to highlight their own. How can people be so vicious?\"","\"I originally wanted to support friendly competition, and I even liked you guys before. I never thought you'd resort to such means to win.\"","\"The Top Flow Group are just contrarians, deliberately seeking out angles to mock others' performances. It's disrespectful to the other party's performance. You're trash with no artistic ethics!\"","\"Aren't the fans of the Male God Group being too sensitive? It's just using the most common tropes in xianxia. If you can use them, why can't we?\"","\"Exactly, if you've got the ability, tell your brothers not to perform such boring scripts! This kind of plot is purely coincidental if there are similarities!\"","\"I'm a neutral party... I think there is a bit of targeting, but as far as the plot goes, I'm on the Top Flow Group's side.\"","\"What they performed is correct. While you're up there talking about love, people down below are dying because of your actions.\"","\"That's right! I wanted to criticize this earlier. The Top Flow Group is killing their 'thinking of the mortal world' trend!\"","Various topics of discussion began on Weibo, and related hot searches gradually rose again, but at this point, attitudes towards the two groups were still split half and half.","Meanwhile, the performance on stage continued.","...","The lights came up, seemingly showing villagers returning from a long journey, unable to find their relatives, lovers, and friends. Their homes had been destroyed, and even those they could find were severely injured or disabled, with no hope for life.","Coffins, funerals, wailing - the entire world seemed to be filled with endless pain.","The immortal magic and demonic arts had caused rivers to dry up, the earth to collapse, and farmland to be destroyed, bringing famine. With so many deaths, plagues followed.","Countless refugees finally gathered near a temple.","\"Brother, I'm so cold and hungry. What are we doing?\" Ji Fei asked, kneeling beside Qin Zhao, her face full of confusion.","Qin Zhao, his lips trembling, said, \"We're praying to the immortals. This is our faith. As long as our hearts are sincere enough, the merciful immortals will surely come to save us from our misery.\"","\"I miss Mom and Dad so much, and Sister Erhua, and little Yellow Dog. I miss the tanghulu from East Street and the tofu pudding from West Street. I miss...\" Ji Fei said with a sob, as if thinking about these things made her less cold and hungry. These were all happiness that had been within easy reach not long ago.","\"Brother, are we sinners? Is heaven punishing us like this?\"","\"We... probably are. That's why we need to be even more devout.\"","Qin Zhao pulled Ji Fei along with the crowd to bow solemnly.","At this moment, the big screen lit up. In a place that looked like the immortal realm, no immortals were looking at the situation below. They were all watching a new round of love and hatred.","\"Let go of me.\" \"You can't go with him.\" \"Tell me you love me!\" \"I don't love you!\" \"Forget about me.\" \"Let her go!\"","Only a few voices were saying:","\"Emperor Lord, you shouldn't be obsessed with personal feelings. The prayers from the mortal world are increasing, they need protection. Emperor Lord, you are their faith, they need your response...\"","But these voices were weak and still couldn't stop the two men in conflict.","On the screen was an exciting drama of emotions.","But off-screen, on the stage, people were numbly kowtowing, then falling one by one, a scene of desolation and tragedy.","Until Qin Zhao fell, and finally Ji Fei murmured, \"Isn't it their duty to protect us? Do they really exist? If they exist, why don't they come? Aren't they our faith? Then why do we believe in them?\"","Ji Fei fell.","But this wasn't enough.","Because of the fight over a woman, a great battle between immortals and demons began. Smoke appeared again on the stage.","A series of stage scenes flashed by quickly.","There were people getting married, studying peacefully, mothers nursing babies in bed, shopkeepers who had just prepared to open their stores after working from dawn to dusk, and intense discussions in the imperial court about future national policies, how to stabilize the country, and how to make people's lives better and more peaceful.","In just an instant, there was lightning and thunder, heaven and earth in turmoil.","The sky was a battlefield, the earth a purgatory.","In the sky, they were still fighting and professing love amidst jealousy and bitterness. Some turned to evil, some became disheartened, some sacrificed themselves.","On the ground, families were torn apart, the country was in ruins. Unable to resist the power of the gods, they were affected at will, their lives turned upside down in an instant.","Even the mortal emperor could only cry out hopelessly: \"Where are the gods we believe in? Who can seek justice for us? If you can't protect us, by what right do you have the power to destroy us? You don't deserve to be above us, you don't deserve our faith, you don't deserve it! Heaven is unjust!!!\"","The stage lights dimmed, but the screen remained bright, showing the tragic figure of the white-robed man holding the woman and leaving in pain, as if he had lost the whole world."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Watching the contrast between up and down, mocking attack MAX","paragraphs":["The entire audience fell silent, even the director and producer were stunned.","This scene was like a collection of human tragedies.","Because the supporting actors were all skilled performers, even with Ji Fei among them, her role wasn't heavy, so the overall effect was actually more heart-wrenching than the previous confrontation with the top actors.","The previous performance by the male idol group had frequently broken the audience's immersion due to stage limitations.","But this time, it made people completely forget about the stage, immersing them solely in the fate of the characters in the plot.","In the audience, Qin Yan and Qin's Mom's eyes immediately turned red. They thought their tear threshold was already low, but unexpectedly, Qin's Father suddenly let out a sob beside them.","He stared intently at the emperor's back, as if empathizing with the emperor's powerless grief.","It was then that Qin Yan and Qin's Mom realized that many people around them were emotionally moved, some choking up, others angry.","Backstage, Qin Rong directly hugged Xiao Tao and cried.","Xiao Tao asked, \"Didn't you watch their rehearsal?\"","\"But... but...\"","Gao Hao, on the other hand, kept checking his phone for updates on the live stream and Weibo.","Pei Mingxuan said from the side, \"No need to look, they've definitely won.\"","Gao Hao was stunned. Pei Mingxuan smiled brightly and turned to say, \"You chose the best subject matter, and thank you...\"","Gao Hao raised an eyebrow. Indeed, it was a keen insight. Pei Mingxuan had seen through the hidden intentions in their performance.","In the waiting area, the other two groups began to look at Sun Mo and Yang Hong. Their eyes were full of mockery, especially remembering how these two had just been cheering for the top-tier group.","Although it wasn't out of goodwill, the top-tier group was really quite unfair.","Yang Hong's face darkened, and he cautiously glanced at Sun Mo.","Sun Mo's face was already flushed, his fists tightly clenched, almost gnashing his teeth in anger and embarrassment.","The contrast between the screen and the stage was silently mocking their previous performance, also negating the many works he had acted in.","It was almost like a direct slap to their faces. What a humiliation.","In another waiting area, the supporting actress Xu Meng had started crying. Some people actually sympathized with her, feeling that they were a bit pitiful to be... by the top-tier group's performance.","It couldn't be said that their acting skills were crushed, it was really the plot that crushed them.","At this moment, whether it was the barrage of comments in the live stream or the hot searches on Weibo, after a brief silence, they exploded!","\"It's really a battle of the gods, with mortals suffering the consequences!\"","\"In the past, we identified with the male and female leads, but actually, we're the suffering masses!\"","\"Damn, you're in love, why do we have to suffer? I object... sorry, I got too caught up in it.\"","\"What's this? We only lose our lives, while they lose their love, is that it?\"","\"Looking at the comparison, the sarcasm attack is at MAX. As expected of you, Qin Zhao and Ji Fei, still love to launch big moves right in our faces.\"","\"I'm so angry watching this. Suddenly feel like the dramas I watched before are so disgusting. They fuss back and forth just for love. They're supposed to be immortals, why are their minds full of romance? If you have love, why not cherish it properly, why must you torment everyone around you?\"","Most netizens resonated with this, probably wanting to vent for a long time but lacking a focused form.","Now the top-tier group gave them the opportunity, and they exploded like a hornet's nest, frantically criticizing current immortal romance dramas.","But there were also a minority who resisted.","\"It's just a TV drama setting, aren't you taking it too seriously? There are people who love to watch it. I love watching immortals in love. Do you have to criticize to show you're different?\"","\"Life is already hard enough, can't I watch sweet immortal love stories? Creating controversy to attack people is meaningless.\"","\"The top-tier group is vicious, they're deliberately targeting others, the top-tier group is bullying in the show!\"","The internet was a mix of all kinds of reactions, but let's set that aside and continue with the performance.","Originally, everyone thought it would continue to show the contrast between the two, letting the audience see what it means for immortals to fall in love and disturb the three realms. But the scene suddenly changed.","Ji Fei emerged from the human purgatory, cultivated to become an immortal, ascended to the celestial realm, coldly observing everything. Now the stage depicted the celestial realm scene. Qin Zhao played the Emperor Lord, and the supporting actress from last time played the Goddess.","...","It was almost the same as what the previous group had portrayed. The female lead's identity changed, she was resurrected, and the two could start their drama again. Then began her escape and his pursuit.","The Goddess fled into the forest, the Emperor Lord set the mountain on fire, forcing the Goddess out. The two struggled, resisted, and flirted ambiguously, but didn't look back to see the nearby villagers affected by the mountain fire, countless dead and injured.","The Goddess escaped into the sea, the Emperor Lord raised huge waves, the two shouted in the sea expressing their painful feelings for each other, but didn't look up to see countless fishing boats swallowed by the sea, coastal fishing villages wiped out without exception, even the sea creatures suffered greatly due to their weakness.","The Goddess continued to flee, the Emperor Lord continued to chase, the three realms continued to be affected, with deaths occurring everywhere at any time.","Until a force that could truly destroy the three realms appeared.","However, when the Emperor Lord began to slaughter mortals to force the Goddess to give up saving the world, they actually acted out scenes of people constantly dying at the Emperor Lord's hands.","He even shouted that line, \"If you dare to die, I'll make this world perish with you!\"","...","In the waiting area, Sun Mo finally couldn't bear it anymore. He suddenly stood up, losing his composure and said, \"Isn't the director going to do anything? This is maliciously distorting our previous performance.\"","Although Yang Hong felt Sun Mo shouldn't have stood up, at this point, he could only join in the protest.","Someone behind them couldn't help but make a sarcastic comment.","\"But in your performance just now, you did mention killing people continuously to force the Goddess to appear, you just avoided portraying these scenes.\"","\"Young man, I advise you not to care too much about their plot right now, otherwise you might end up at a logical disadvantage in the storyline.\"","\"Although we can't hear the live stream here, the audience is watching your reactions. You should have some grace, otherwise you'll become the villains.\"","With two veteran seniors saying this, Sun Mo was immediately flushed with anger, his neck turning red. In the end, Yang Hong had to pull him to sit down.","\"Don't be angry, Brother Mo. We performed openly according to the usual routine. Even if the comparison makes us less likable, we won't be implicated because of this.\"","Indeed.","The spectators were all stunned, as if seeing the plot of the previous group from another perspective. They didn't target the performers, but were shocked by the consistent tropes of immortal romance dramas.","It turned out that behind that domineering and obsessive love lay so much bloodshed.","The criticism online grew louder.","\"Damn, if you want to be together, be together. If you want to break up, break up. You two big idiots only know how to implicate innocent people! What? Are the people of the world just a part of your roleplay?\"","\"What did the world do to offend you? Do we even know you? Why should we die for your love?\"","\"How unlucky, too unlucky! You even want us to perish with you! Who gave you the right? Who's going to control these two lunatics?\"","Most netizens could no longer see that heart-stirring love, only a surge of anger remained.","The performance on stage continued.","...","Until the Emperor Lord was about to kill the Demon Lord, the Goddess appeared to stop him. Under everyone's persuasion, she prepared to kill the Emperor Lord, but couldn't bring herself to do it. She hugged the Emperor Lord and cried.","Everyone watching grew more angry, thinking it was going to be another passionate performance.","At this moment, Ji Fei, who had been an observer standing at the edge of the stage, suddenly rushed out.","She ran a sword through the Emperor Lord.","Everyone looked at Ji Fei in horror.","The Goddess held the fallen Emperor Lord in shock.","\"Who... who are you?\"","\"I am the countless wronged souls who died because of you!\"","...","The spectators were dumbfounded."]}]);
